  "chapter.0216243AA5083CE1.title": "Waking Among Ruins",
  "chapter.0216243AA5083CE1.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Empty pockets, a ruined sun patio and the light that guards Heliodor's places."
  ],
  "quest.7B2FDFC0D74F1790.title": "You Wake Among Ruins",
  "quest.7B2FDFC0D74F1790.quest_desc": [
    "Every world starts the same: you appear beside a ruined sun patio with empty pockets. The ruin, its compass and the Atlas are your only guides.",
    "",
    "No tutorial, no kit, no welcome committee. Heliodor has been busy being frozen."
  ],
  "quest.51F1081FE91AE567.title": "Empty Pockets, on Purpose",
  "quest.51F1081FE91AE567.quest_desc": [
    "The pack turns off every join gift: Ars Nouveau's notebook, the Integrated Dynamics manual, Silent Gear's blueprints, the Actually Additions booklet and more. Every one of those books is still craftable.",
    "",
    "Nothing is lost, only not gifted. Not even the plush toy."
  ],
  "quest.5DF068ECC8A3C79B.title": "Quirk: the Aether Says Hi",
  "quest.5DF068ECC8A3C79B.quest_desc": [
    "One gift survives: the first time you enter the Aether, it hands you its Book of Lore and golden parachutes. It is not a login gift, it is a safety net.",
    "",
    "Floating islands, long drops. Take the hint."
  ],
  "quest.54D8683481D00162.title": "The Start Ruin",
  "quest.54D8683481D00162.quest_desc": [
    "A new world places it once, on the flattest ground within 64 blocks of spawn: a tuff and calcite patio with an oxidized copper sun, eight quartz columns (four broken) and the &eHeliodor Pedestal&r in the middle.",
    "",
    "World spawn moves beside it, and your first login faces it."
  ],
  "quest.3A3D2F69F7A51597.title": "Take the Compass",
  "quest.3A3D2F69F7A51597.quest_desc": [
    "Use the pedestal: it gives each player one &eHeliodor Compass&r per world, ever. Its first target is the ruin itself, until you wake the Atlas with a book and a copper ingot.",
    "",
    "Everything else about it: The Heliodor Compass chapter."
  ],
  "quest.04910797C8A95EC6.title": "First Steps That Work",
  "quest.04910797C8A95EC6.quest_desc": [
    "Tree, wooden tools, crafting table, stone, coal. Then go after &ecopper&r: the Atlas and its first projects want copper ingots, paper and glass.",
    "",
    "The compass will send you to a village for bread and paper, then to trial chambers, full of copper and tuff like the ruin."
  ],
  "quest.393FB3DA62E83A3D.title": "The Light Keeps These Places",
  "quest.393FB3DA62E83A3D.quest_desc": [
    "Inside a protected ruin nobody can break or place blocks, and neither can explosions, pistons, flowing fluids, spreading fire, griefing mobs or trampling. Frames, paintings and armor stands are safe too.",
    "",
    "The server checks at the moment it happens: creative, spectator and noclip get the same polite no."
  ],
  "quest.73BFA7978DF2985A.title": "Free, Sealed and Locked",
  "quest.73BFA7978DF2985A.quest_desc": [
    "Right-clicks inside a protected place fall in three groups. &eFree&r: doors, buttons, levers, beds, simple workstations, ender chests and the pedestal. &eSealed&r: containers, lecterns and altars, which open when your team reaches that place's act. &eLocked&r: anything else that would change a block, and anvils.",
    "",
    "A frame's item can be taken once your team is unlocked; the frame stays."
  ],
  "quest.76BB64F3BA0C95E3.title": "Why Ruins Are Protected",
  "quest.76BB64F3BA0C95E3.quest_desc": [
    "Ruins are the story's levels: their lore and key pieces open when your team gets there, whatever tricks anyone tries.",
    "",
    "It also stops a friend from blowing up the exact spot the compass is pointing at. Do not ask how we know."
  ],
  "quest.0430D747262F84EB.title": "Quirk: Tools Stop at the Edge",
  "quest.0430D747262F84EB.quest_desc": [
    "Ultimine, gadgets, construction sticks, Carry On and the land-shaping altars all act as a player, so they stop at a ruin's edge; Carry On's break check before lifting is refused too.",
    "",
    "Build around a ruin, not into it."
  ],
  "quest.3C0CF3ADDFD6F214.title": "The Same Light Covers Solsticio",
  "quest.3C0CF3ADDFD6F214.quest_desc": [
    "The city at the end of the story uses the same protection, gated by act VI. The exception is the player plots: 16 by 16, one per team, where only your team builds.",
    "",
    "How to claim one: the Solsticio chapter."
  ],
  "quest.2D3295A6543F9E15.title": "Tip: Your Spawn Is the Ruin",
  "quest.2D3295A6543F9E15.quest_desc": [
    "Until you sleep in a bed, you respawn at the start ruin. Set a bed or a Comforts sleeping spot near your first base early.",
    "",
    "Tombstone keeps your items in a grave where you fall, so the walk back only costs you dignity."
  ],
  "quest.3925C4CC5C5C7AE4.title": "For Operators: Older Worlds",
  "quest.3925C4CC5C5C7AE4.quest_desc": [
    "Only brand-new worlds get the start ruin. In an older one, an operator places it with &e/entrelumen admin ruin&r (running it twice does nothing) and toggles a personal protection bypass for repairs with &e/entrelumen admin protection bypass&r."
  ],
  "quest.5BBA78C05C867FBA.title": "Quirk: Blind Spots",
  "quest.5BBA78C05C867FBA.quest_desc": [
    "A few things slip past: blocks changed by mods that skip the usual game events, projectiles breaking fragile blocks such as pots, and plot machines placing fluids or blocks right against a protected one (placed that way, they cannot spread further).",
    "",
    "Found a hole? Report it. Heliodor has enough holes already."
  ],
  "quest.0616E7C527841913.title": "Ready to Leave the Patio",
  "quest.0616E7C527841913.quest_desc": [
    "Empty pockets, a compass that knows the way and ruins that will not let you dig them up. Craft the Atlas and let it start talking.",
    "",
    "Good luck, traveller. Mind the columns: four are already broken."
  ],
  "chapter.7E9AE182E0AEBD76.title": "The Living Atlas",
  "chapter.7E9AE182E0AEBD76.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Projects, deliveries, act components and the Ark: how the story moves."
  ],
  "quest.23BA57C16A45AEBB.title": "A Book That Answers Back",
  "quest.23BA57C16A45AEBB.quest_desc": [
    "The &6Living Atlas&r moves the story. Each act is a set of projects, each project a delivery; finish them all and the next act opens. Along the way it hands out rewards and tells, in broken fragments, what happened to Heliodor.",
    "",
    "Someone is talking through it. The interference is not your fault."
  ],
  "quest.2B3B9A46DA117973.title": "Get the Atlas",
  "quest.2B3B9A46DA117973.quest_desc": [
    "Craft it from a &ebook&r and a &ecopper ingot&r; its first project, The Atlas Awakens, asks for exactly that. Open it with right-click, with &e/entrelumen&r, or by using a Survey Station with an empty hand.",
    "",
    "Waking it is also the compass's first target."
  ],
  "quest.5F6D93279A928C87.title": "Reading the Atlas",
  "quest.5F6D93279A928C87.quest_desc": [
    "Left page: the act's projects and their state. Right page: the selected project, its materials (carried and missing) and the projects it needs first. &eDeliver&r sends the materials, &eRefresh&r asks the server again and &eAdvance&r appears when the act is done.",
    "",
    "The list opens with the compass entry and its fragments."
  ],
  "quest.21132BDE339A66BD.title": "Delivery Rules",
  "quest.21132BDE339A66BD.quest_desc": [
    "Deliveries take from your &emain inventory and offhand&r only: backpacks, shulker boxes and the ender chest do not count. Only projects of your &ecurrent act&r, after their prerequisites.",
    "",
    "A delivered project cannot be delivered again, so reconnecting never duplicates a reward. Nice try."
  ],
  "quest.622A0BC02FB63453.title": "Tip: the Atlas From Chat",
  "quest.622A0BC02FB63453.quest_desc": [
    "&e/entrelumen status&r lists your act's pending projects, their prerequisites and, for each material, how many you carry and lack. &e/entrelumen deliver <project>&r delivers by name with the button's rules, and the chat suggests names as you type."
  ],
  "quest.1DBCB83716EBFCBF.title": "Act I: A Light Among Ruins",
  "quest.1DBCB83716EBFCBF.quest_desc": [
    "Five projects, ordinary materials:\n- The Atlas Awakens: a book, a copper ingot;\n- A Table for Travellers: 3 bread, 4 bowls;\n- Assemble the Lens: 4 copper ingots, 4 glass (&eRaw Lens&r);\n- Field Survey: 3 paper, a compass (&eSurvey Notes&r);\n- First Signal: lens, notes, 4 copper ingots (&eSignal Core&r).",
    "",
    "Then press Advance."
  ],
  "quest.161CC52C300C99FD.title": "Act Components",
  "quest.161CC52C300C99FD.quest_desc": [
    "From act II, projects ask for &6act components&r: prototypes crafted in an ordinary grid from two or three mods plus an earlier component. The recipes are public and never check your act.",
    "",
    "In EMI, &eR&r on a component shows its recipe and &eU&r everything it unlocks."
  ],
  "quest.097843E8ED7FB61E.title": "Act II: The Lost Crafts",
  "quest.097843E8ED7FB61E.quest_desc": [
    "Four components, then the closing project:\n- &eCalibration Frame&r: Create and Immersive Engineering, plus the raw lens;\n- &eEnergy Coupler&r: Actually Additions and Create;\n- &eLiving Matrix&r: Ars Nouveau, plus a frame;\n- &eTravel Rations&r: see the Kitchen chapter.",
    "",
    "Workshop Archive closes the act and gives &eTerra's Arm&r."
  ],
  "quest.77007F86F56D8B6C.title": "Act III: Routes of Exchange",
  "quest.77007F86F56D8B6C.quest_desc": [
    "Five components; three pay an altar:\n- &eRouting Matrix&r (AE2, PneumaticCraft, Actually Additions): &eAltar of Peace&r;\n- &ePropagation Core&r (Mystical Agriculture, bee wax): &eAltar of Growth&r;\n- &ePower Regulator&r (Mekanism, Immersive Engineering);\n- &eInventory Sensor&r (Integrated Dynamics, LaserIO);\n- &eHandling Core&r (Modular Routers, Create): &eAltar of Levelling&r.",
    "",
    "Exchange Route closes the act."
  ],
  "quest.58244B38F375C1C7.title": "Act IV: Voices of the Atlas",
  "quest.58244B38F375C1C7.quest_desc": [
    "The expedition act: the Atlas records journeys by itself when your team arrives, and asks for four components:\n- &eSpectral Lens&r (Occultism, Malum);\n- &eHorizon Chart&r (Aether, Twilight; its project needs both reached): &eAltar of Repose&r;\n- &eEcosystem Capsule&r (Bumblezone; its project needs it reached): &eAltar of Renewal&r;\n- &eContainment Seal&r (EvilCraft, Malum): &eAltar of Time&r."
  ],
  "quest.37DC25FD6EE9DEA9.title": "The Heart of Heliodor",
  "quest.37DC25FD6EE9DEA9.quest_desc": [
    "Act IV ends at the &6Sun Spirit&r, boss of the Aether's gold dungeon. It drops the &eHeart of Heliodor&r, once per campaign. Deliver it in A Clear Voice; only then can Voices of the Atlas close the act.",
    "",
    "On the ground it cannot burn, despawn or fall into the void. It has been lost once already."
  ],
  "quest.1866D1F9DD733322.title": "Act V: The Ark",
  "quest.1866D1F9DD733322.quest_desc": [
    "Knowing the truth, you build the Ark. Three components: &eArk Connection Bus&r (Mekanism, PneumaticCraft, handling cores, a sensor), &eRenewal Engine&r (Nature's Aura, Mystical Agriculture, capsules, cores) and &eHabitation Charter&r (fish stew, mixed salad, AE2, rations).",
    "",
    "World Network closes the act. On the way, the last two modules: &eLogistics&r and &eEngineering&r."
  ],
  "quest.72C3A1232F9FF6FF.title": "Build the Ark",
  "quest.72C3A1232F9FF6FF.quest_desc": [
    "An astrolabe of stone, tuff, calcite, copper and amethyst round the &eArk Controller&r. The rim's polished amethyst comes from amethyst blocks through Rechiseled's &eChisel&r (iron ingot and stick). In the Atlas, The Ark's &eShow guide&r projects a ghost of every block, on your controller or where you look.",
    "",
    "Each act gives one module: I Habitation, II Exploration, III Nature, IV Arcane, V Logistics and Engineering. A module works in its place, with the Ark whole and the controller on. One Ark per team."
  ],
  "quest.3DD568980F26C458.title": "The Activation",
  "quest.3DD568980F26C458.quest_desc": [
    "The Ark whole with its six modules and controller, World Network done and the End reached: the Atlas and the Ark's screen tick the list. Then crouch on the controller with an empty hand. The Ark forges the &6Light Key&r and the campaign enters &eact VI, Solsticio&r.",
    "",
    "The door has been waiting a long time. Knock politely."
  ],
  "quest.62CBF13A5CB4C3E5.title": "What the Ark Gives",
  "quest.62CBF13A5CB4C3E5.quest_desc": [
    "A beacon for the whole team, anywhere. &eHabitation&r: /sethome and /home. &eExploration&r: free waystones and /rtp. &eNature&r: Regeneration and half hunger, and a compass marks your garden. &eArcane&r: +50% mana and regeneration. &eLogistics&r: Solsticio's shops from the Atlas, Hero of the Village. &eEngineering&r: energy items charge themselves.",
    "",
    "A beacon on each column adds a level to the potions and the mana."
  ],
  "quest.306B717DBAA85638.title": "The Survey Station",
  "quest.306B717DBAA85638.quest_desc": [
    "Copper, glass, smooth stone and a signal core make a movable bookmark. With an empty hand it opens the Atlas; with a vanilla compass it points that compass at itself, like a lodestone, and the link survives moving the station.",
    "",
    "The Ark's Nature module uses such a compass to mark your team's garden."
  ],
  "quest.4E722FFB64F4F76D.title": "Components Unlock the World",
  "quest.4E722FFB64F4F76D.quest_desc": [
    "A component closes a few milestones, never a pile of basics: the metallurgic infuser and the mining portal (Calibration Frame), the AE2 and Refined Storage controllers (Routing Matrix), Mekanism's jetpack and Psi's CAD Assembler (Power Regulator), the Digital Miner and the Lumen Shelf (Spectral Lens). The other steps of an act take its material: an alloy of Mekanism, ironwood or zanite.",
    "",
    "&eU&r on a component in EMI shows everything it opens."
  ],
  "quest.21BEA1DA85BCD908.title": "Quirk: Psi Waits for Act III",
  "quest.21BEA1DA85BCD908.quest_desc": [
    "Psi's CAD Assembler carries a Power Regulator; its psigem cores keep their native recipes. No assembler, no CAD, no spells: plan Psi alongside your act III logistics.",
    "",
    "When in doubt, EMI shows your version's recipe."
  ],
  "quest.621B66430D137B31.title": "Tip: Automate the Components",
  "quest.621B66430D137B31.quest_desc": [
    "Components are ordinary shaped recipes, each a small drawing, so any storage network can autocraft them, and later ones eat earlier ones. Set up a pattern for each early in act III.",
    "",
    "Each module takes one of them: a propagation core, a spectral lens, a routing matrix, an Ark bus."
  ],
  "quest.4B04E34A144A490D.title": "Rewards Come From the Atlas",
  "quest.4B04E34A144A490D.quest_desc": [
    "Story rewards come from the Atlas when you deliver, never from the quest book: the Atlas, lens, notes, signal core, Terra's Arm and the six altars. Each comes once per campaign to whoever delivered, or drops at their feet if the inventory is full, and a chat line names it.",
    "",
    "The quest book only keeps score."
  ],
  "quest.2C31D583B80F31E8.title": "Why the Atlas Stutters",
  "quest.2C31D583B80F31E8.quest_desc": [
    "Until the Heart of Heliodor reaches it, the Atlas speaks in fragments: crossed-out words, gaps and short glitches, always with readable parts. From act V the text comes through clear.",
    "",
    "Do not skip them. The lore is a puzzle, and you are holding the pieces."
  ],
  "quest.45AF0BF75021DA63.title": "The Story in Your Hands",
  "quest.45AF0BF75021DA63.quest_desc": [
    "Projects, deliveries, components and the Ark: the rest is walking the road.",
    "",
    "Keep the Heliodor Compass close. It already knows where the Atlas wants you next."
  ],
  "chapter.34DC677E5D339B3F.title": "The Heliodor Compass",
  "chapter.34DC677E5D339B3F.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Where it points, what its colors mean and why it sometimes rests."
  ],
  "quest.40194B53EA674D94.title": "Never Lost",
  "quest.40194B53EA674D94.quest_desc": [
    "The Heliodor Compass always points to the next place the story needs: a structure, a dungeon, a guardian or another world. Meet the condition and it turns to the next one on its own.",
    "",
    "It never sends you thousands of blocks away and never spins for show."
  ],
  "quest.70E93F659F6828C9.title": "Take It From the Pedestal",
  "quest.70E93F659F6828C9.quest_desc": [
    "Use the &eHeliodor Pedestal&r in the start ruin, with anything in hand, to get your compass: &eone&r per player, per world, ever. A second try only reminds you. No recipe makes another.",
    "",
    "If you die, Tombstone keeps it in your grave. Otherwise, treat it like your house keys."
  ],
  "quest.6F6A288871FD98BD.title": "Carry It to Attune It",
  "quest.6F6A288871FD98BD.quest_desc": [
    "A fresh compass is not attuned yet: carry it a moment. While carried it refreshes about once a second, so it follows you as you walk.",
    "",
    "Hover it for its state; the Atlas's first entry shows the target, why it matters and the fragments you recovered."
  ],
  "quest.5B6FBD4B88937613.title": "Needle Colors",
  "quest.5B6FBD4B88937613.quest_desc": [
    "The needle's color tells you which world the target is in: &3turquoise&r Overworld, &4red&r Nether, &5violet&r End, &6gold&r Aether, &2green&r Twilight Forest, &bsky blue&r another world (Bumblezone, Solsticio) and &7grey&r no trace, locked or nothing pending.",
    "",
    "Grey is not broken. Grey is waiting."
  ],
  "quest.704E2DF71D58FC0A.title": "What the Needle Is Saying",
  "quest.704E2DF71D58FC0A.quest_desc": [
    "The tooltip shows one of five states: &ePointing&r (follow it), &eAnother dimension&r (travel there first), &eSearching&r (a short spin while the server looks), &eNo trace nearby&r (advance the Atlas or try another region) and &eLocked&r (the next act opens it).",
    "",
    "When there is nothing left for now, it says that too."
  ],
  "quest.76B34644E6DE0B02.title": "Never Thousands of Blocks",
  "quest.76B34644E6DE0B02.quest_desc": [
    "It searches at most &e1,500 blocks&r around you. Anything farther reads as no trace nearby instead of dragging you across the map; walk 512 blocks from a failed search and it looks again.",
    "",
    "The story never asks for epic treks, jetpacks or chunk-loading."
  ],
  "quest.22D3EA2BD8DBF425.title": "The Compass Follows the Team",
  "quest.22D3EA2BD8DBF425.quest_desc": [
    "It follows your team's campaign: everyone sees the same target, new destinations are announced to all, and a condition met by any online member counts for everyone. A new party inherits its founder's progress.",
    "",
    "Reached stays reached: losing an item never rewinds it."
  ],
  "quest.44DBD22DB832F5A1.title": "Quirk: Found Places Are Shared",
  "quest.44DBD22DB832F5A1.quest_desc": [
    "Every place a search finds is remembered for the whole world. If another team already found a fortress near you, your compass points there without searching.",
    "",
    "Searches run a little each tick and never wait for chunks, so they never freeze the server."
  ],
  "quest.60F361B6A2A611B1.title": "The Route: Acts I and II",
  "quest.60F361B6A2A611B1.quest_desc": [
    "Early targets, each until its condition:\n- &eThe Ruin Where You Woke&r, until the Atlas awakens;\n- &eThose Who Stayed&r, a village, until Field Survey;\n- &eThe Proving Halls&r, the trial chambers, until First Signal;\n- &eBuried Streets&r, trail ruins, until Workshop Archive closes act II."
  ],
  "quest.265E3B24DA46A5F4.title": "The Route: Acts III and IV",
  "quest.265E3B24DA46A5F4.quest_desc": [
    "Then the other worlds.\n- Act III: a &eNether fortress&r (until someone carries a blaze rod), the &eTwilight Forest&r and the &eNaga's Courtyard&r.\n- Act IV: the &eAether&r, the Slider's &eBronze Dungeon&r, the &eLich's Tower&r, the &eBumblezone&r, the &eSilver Dungeon&r and the &eGolden Dungeon&r, where the Sun Spirit keeps the Heart of Heliodor.",
    "",
    "Guardian targets advance when the boss falls."
  ],
  "quest.2F469EE97767853E.title": "The Route: Acts V and VI",
  "quest.2F469EE97767853E.quest_desc": [
    "The last stretch.\n- Act V: the &eDrowned Monument&r (until someone carries a wet sponge), the &eStronghold&r (until your team reaches the End) and &eThe End&r itself (until the dragon falls).\n- Act VI: &eSolsticio&r, until your team crosses into the city.",
    "",
    "Keep what the Wither, the dragon and the Elder Guardian drop: later recipes want it."
  ],
  "quest.251DFE202BDBF604.title": "Tip: Early Work Counts",
  "quest.251DFE202BDBF604.quest_desc": [
    "If your team already met a later condition, say it reached the Twilight Forest early, the compass skips that target the moment its act opens.",
    "",
    "Nothing done early is wasted. Curiosity is never punished here."
  ],
  "quest.301485EAA30C69E6.title": "Other Compasses",
  "quest.301485EAA30C69E6.quest_desc": [
    "Off the story path, &eNature's Compass&r finds biomes and &eExplorer's Compass&r finds structures; Solsticio's cartographer sells both, plus survey maps.",
    "",
    "The Heliodor Compass only follows the story. Do not ask it for a jungle."
  ],
  "quest.6BBD7EE9A8E018A1.title": "Fragments of Lore",
  "quest.6BBD7EE9A8E018A1.quest_desc": [
    "Many targets add a lore fragment to the Atlas's compass entry, newest first. The early ones keep the mystery; the whole truth arrives with the Heart of Heliodor.",
    "",
    "Read them in order and the static starts to make sense."
  ],
  "quest.7C5FFA4CF9C12078.title": "Follow the Light",
  "quest.7C5FFA4CF9C12078.quest_desc": [
    "When in doubt, hover the compass for its state, or open the Atlas for the target and why it matters.",
    "",
    "Heliodor's light has waited a long time. It can wait for you to read a tooltip."
  ],
  "chapter.073625DCC50D40F5.title": "World Tiers: the Story Decides",
  "chapter.073625DCC50D40F5.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Apotheosis difficulty tiers, raised by the story and never by you."
  ],
  "quest.0F7D705A8BA5E65A.title": "A World That Grows With You",
  "quest.0F7D705A8BA5E65A.quest_desc": [
    "Apotheosis has five &eWorld Tiers&r: Haven, Frontier, Ascent, Summit and Pinnacle. Each makes monsters tougher and loot better. Here the &estory&r raises them: when your team's campaign reaches a new stage, the world climbs one tier by itself.",
    "",
    "No guessing whether you are ready. The story decides; you survive it."
  ],
  "quest.5BC7B113AE36BF58.title": "The Ladder",
  "quest.5BC7B113AE36BF58.quest_desc": [
    "- &eHaven&r: from the start, through acts I and II;\n- &eFrontier&r: once act II is complete;\n- &eAscent&r: once act III is complete, as the expeditions begin;\n- &eSummit&r: once act IV is complete and the Ark begins;\n- &ePinnacle&r: when your team activates the Ark and opens act VI.",
    "",
    "Chat announces each step: \"The story sets your World Tier to...\"."
  ],
  "quest.729DB33C65E3D107.title": "It Only Goes Up",
  "quest.729DB33C65E3D107.quest_desc": [
    "Your tier is the &ehighest you ever reached&r. Dying, leaving a team or joining one that is behind never lowers it; joining one that is ahead raises you at once.",
    "",
    "It is stored on you, so it follows you across dimensions and restarts. Like prices: it only goes up."
  ],
  "quest.3E2EAA408A21FC08.title": "Pack Change: Hands Off the Dial",
  "quest.3E2EAA408A21FC08.quest_desc": [
    "&eCtrl+T&r still opens Apotheosis's World Tier screen, where you can read every tier's details, but the activate button stays disabled. If anything moves your tier outside the story, the pack puts it back within a second.",
    "",
    "You may look. You may not touch."
  ],
  "quest.2C2A73CEB13367AD.title": "Read the Details",
  "quest.2C2A73CEB13367AD.quest_desc": [
    "On the World Tier screen, the details button lists what each tier changes: buffs and debuffs for players and monsters, and the odds of each loot rarity and gem purity.",
    "",
    "Apotheosis's guidebook, the Chronicle of Shadows, explains rarities, affixes and gems."
  ],
  "quest.3EA0CA6AD9E05199.title": "Invaders From Frontier On",
  "quest.3EA0CA6AD9E05199.quest_desc": [
    "From &eFrontier&r, Apotheosis &einvaders&r can appear: tough mini-bosses in affixed gear. Haven has none, and no epic or mythic loot. The pack spaces them 10 minutes apart instead of three.",
    "",
    "They like the Twilight Forest. Dress for the occasion."
  ],
  "quest.15289447AA613BCF.title": "Loot Rarity by Tier",
  "quest.15289447AA613BCF.quest_desc": [
    "Better rarities only drop at higher tiers: in this pack &euncommon&r materials come from Haven on, &erare&r ones higher up, &eepic&r from Ascent and &emythic&r from Summit.",
    "",
    "Salvage affixed loot at a &eSalvaging Table&r for the rarity materials that reforging and gems use. That sword with the silly name is an ingredient."
  ],
  "quest.69C926655A9EDEF3.title": "Spawner Augments Follow Tiers",
  "quest.69C926655A9EDEF3.quest_desc": [
    "Apotheosis's spawner runes are replaced by ENTRELUMEN &espawner augments&r: copper medallions that tweak a spawner where it stands. Each takes an act component, from act III to act V, in place of Apotheosis's materials.",
    "",
    "Silk Touch does not pick up spawners in this pack."
  ],
  "quest.057E195FC015C164.title": "The Godforged Pearl",
  "quest.057E195FC015C164.quest_desc": [
    "The &eLuminous Ingot&r needs Apotheosis's &eGodforged Pearl&r, which only comes from salvaging mythic loot. Mythic loot starts at Summit, so the pearl arrives with the Ark act, right before Solsticio.",
    "",
    "Mythic drops go to the Salvaging Table, not to the trophy shelf."
  ],
  "quest.116957591A1DC800.title": "Enchanting Climbs in Steps",
  "quest.116957591A1DC800.quest_desc": [
    "The pack spaces Apothic Enchanting's shelves by act, and your World Tier's Eterna ceiling keeps pace: 45 in acts I and II, 75 in act III, 90 in act IV and 100 from act V. Four ENTRELUMEN shelves join the ladder: Cartographer's, Patina, Lumen and Horizon.",
    "",
    "From act V, the Atlas Library writes any eligible enchantment up to level 40."
  ],
  "quest.1EA195F042214D5C.title": "The Atlas Library",
  "quest.1EA195F042214D5C.quest_desc": [
    "An upgrade on Apothic's Ender Library: deposit enchanted books into a shared pool of &elumen&r, then write any eligible enchantment onto a book, even ones you never deposited. Its level cap follows the Eterna around it; 100 Eterna reaches level 40.",
    "",
    "A deposit is worth less than writing costs, curses are refused and breaking it keeps the pool. No infinite loops, sorry."
  ],
  "quest.18276CF7A859D7F0.title": "Tip: Gear Up Before Advancing",
  "quest.18276CF7A859D7F0.quest_desc": [
    "The world hardens the moment an act closes, so upgrade before pressing Advance on acts II and III: better armor, a few gems, food for the satiety buffs.",
    "",
    "There is no timer. The current tier will wait as long as you like."
  ],
  "quest.1988E6C9176E95D5.title": "Quirk: Items That Need a Tier",
  "quest.1988E6C9176E95D5.quest_desc": [
    "Some Apotheosis items say \"Requires World Tier\" and stay inert until your tier gets there. The story raises it, so just keep advancing the Atlas.",
    "",
    "No button to press. Well, there is one, but it is disabled."
  ],
  "quest.7D0FE71142574884.title": "For Operators",
  "quest.7D0FE71142574884.quest_desc": [
    "&e/entrelumen admin set <act>&r moves the story, and the tier with it. The tier still never drops: lowering it means clearing the player's stored story tier offline, deliberately not a command. Apotheosis's own tier command is undone at the next sync."
  ],
  "quest.373527F04C56E65F.title": "Difficulty With a Reason",
  "quest.373527F04C56E65F.quest_desc": [
    "Five tiers, raised by the story and never lowered, each with tougher monsters and better loot. Play the acts at your own pace.",
    "",
    "The world keeps time with you, not with the clock."
  ],
  "chapter.197D584486CC04B0.title": "Terra's Arm",
  "chapter.197D584486CC04B0.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Heliodor's inventor built herself a longer reach. Three more blocks, and a lot of scaffolding you will not need."
  ],
  "quest.204B7548FB3ED6C6.title": "An Arm Built to Reach",
  "quest.204B7548FB3ED6C6.quest_desc": [
    "Terra, Heliodor's inventor, built herself a cyborg arm to reach where the machine would not let her. It closes act II and does one thing: it lets you reach blocks from farther away.",
    "",
    "Small on paper. Huge the first time you roof a house without scaffolding."
  ],
  "quest.26B8D05294234A42.title": "Earn It in Act II",
  "quest.26B8D05294234A42.quest_desc": [
    "Finish act II's four prototype projects (Calibration Frame, Energy Coupler, Living Matrix and Travel Rations), then deliver &eWorkshop Archive&r: three paper and a copper ingot. The Atlas hands &eTerra's Arm&r to whoever delivers.",
    "",
    "No recipe. The sunken workshop ruin also keeps one in a chest."
  ],
  "quest.75CB722DD2FD6FE4.title": "Wear It on a Hand",
  "quest.75CB722DD2FD6FE4.quest_desc": [
    "It is a curio: press &eG&r (or use the Curios button in your inventory) and put the arm in a &ehands&r slot, which the pack guarantees every player.",
    "",
    "In a pocket it does nothing. Arms work better attached."
  ],
  "quest.2AB0505CB19719FA.title": "Three More Blocks",
  "quest.2AB0505CB19719FA.quest_desc": [
    "Worn, it adds &e+3 block reach&r: break, place and use blocks from 7.5 blocks away instead of 4.5. The tooltip shows the bonus in blue, like vanilla attribute lines.",
    "",
    "It is checked twice a second, so it switches on a moment after you put it on."
  ],
  "quest.0779CD7A84AB475B.title": "Blocks, Not Swords",
  "quest.0779CD7A84AB475B.quest_desc": [
    "Only &eblock&r reach grows. Attacking and interacting with creatures keep the normal range, so it gives no edge in combat.",
    "",
    "Terra built a tool, not a weapon."
  ],
  "quest.5385DF51A7FAC937.title": "Quirk: Two Arms, Same Reach",
  "quest.5385DF51A7FAC937.quest_desc": [
    "Players have two hands slots, but a second arm adds nothing: the bonus is one modifier, on or off, and taking off one of two keeps it. Other sources of block reach do stack with its flat +3."
  ],
  "quest.129FF0157ED39EF3.title": "Tip: Building Tall",
  "quest.129FF0157ED39EF3.quest_desc": [
    "Place the top rows of a wall, a roof ridge or a ceiling light without scaffolding, and reach across gaps. With a Construction Stick, extend faces you could not reach before.",
    "",
    "Scaffolding makers hate this one trick."
  ],
  "quest.51CF708529CE925C.title": "Tip: Machine Rooms",
  "quest.51CF708529CE925C.quest_desc": [
    "Reach the machine behind another, the lever past a pipe run or the chest at the back of a shelf without walking around. Dense rooms of LaserIO nodes and Create contraptions get much friendlier."
  ],
  "quest.25B9C7768CA15451.title": "Tip: Fields and Trees",
  "quest.25B9C7768CA15451.quest_desc": [
    "Harvest a wider strip of field from the path, reach the top logs and fruit of tall trees, and plant without stepping on farmland. With Ultimine, start a vein you would otherwise have to climb to."
  ],
  "quest.23E4CF25D0448A74.title": "Quirk: Carry On Reaches Too",
  "quest.23E4CF25D0448A74.quest_desc": [
    "The pack scales Carry On's pick-up distance with your reach, so the arm also lets you lift chests, furnaces and animals from farther away."
  ],
  "quest.3589E9C66EE3ADC7.title": "Reach Opens No Doors",
  "quest.3589E9C66EE3ADC7.quest_desc": [
    "More reach bypasses nothing: Heliodor's ruins, Solsticio outside your plot and other teams' claims refuse breaking and placing from any distance, and the server checks.",
    "",
    "The long arm of the law is still longer."
  ],
  "quest.79F61128A0C573B6.title": "One Arm per Campaign",
  "quest.79F61128A0C573B6.quest_desc": [
    "Atlas rewards come once per campaign, to whoever delivers, so the Atlas gives a team one arm: hand it to your main builder or pass it around. Replaying or reconnecting never makes a second.",
    "",
    "It survives fire and lava, and Tombstone keeps it in your grave if you die."
  ],
  "quest.2021A7FC13489E8C.title": "Terra's Story",
  "quest.2021A7FC13489E8C.quest_desc": [
    "Terra wanted technology to make life in Heliodor better, and she built the Atlas from inside the light. At the close of act II the Atlas returns her arm to you and, for the first time, half-speaks her name.",
    "",
    "Her later gifts, the Terraprism among them, come in the story's final act."
  ],
  "quest.77D6E1B05A0CB693.title": "Quirk: a Curio by Data",
  "quest.77D6E1B05A0CB693.quest_desc": [
    "Held in your hand, in armor slots or in a backpack, the arm is a trophy with a line of lore. It only works from the Curios hands slot, which the pack adds by data even if other mods stop adding it."
  ],
  "quest.35F251C084EFAC2E.title": "Three Blocks Closer",
  "quest.35F251C084EFAC2E.quest_desc": [
    "Put it on, look up at the unfinished roof, and finish it from the ground.",
    "",
    "Terra would be glad to see it working again."
  ],
  "chapter.19D7B33A90883E23.title": "The Six Altars of Heliodor",
  "chapter.19D7B33A90883E23.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Earned in the Atlas, fed with fuel and left to work. And copied, if you love them."
  ],
  "quest.3CC1A133C8AFFEA6.title": "Machines That Remember the Land",
  "quest.3CC1A133C8AFFEA6.quest_desc": [
    "Six blocks you place, feed and leave working: they grow gardens, shape the land, keep monsters away, speed up crops, slow enemies and mend gear. None is crafted from scratch: the Atlas grants one of each in acts III and IV, and an original can be copied.",
    "",
    "Heliodor's groundskeepers, still clocking in."
  ],
  "quest.4905B81B132E440D.title": "How Every Altar Works",
  "quest.4905B81B132E440D.quest_desc": [
    "&eFuel in your main hand&r feeds it; hoppers and pipes can too, but nothing comes out. An &eempty hand&r shows its status and outlines its area. &eCrouching with an empty hand&r pauses or resumes it (Levelling and Repose use it differently).",
    "",
    "Fuel burns only while it works and its area is loaded. Broken, it drops with its fuel and contents."
  ],
  "quest.1B998C29999C119B.title": "Where Each Altar Comes From",
  "quest.1B998C29999C119B.quest_desc": [
    "One per Atlas project, once per campaign, to whoever delivers:\n- act III: &ePeace&r (Routing Matrix), &eGrowth&r (Propagation Core) and &eLevelling&r (Handling Core);\n- act IV: &eRenewal&r (Ecosystem Capsule), &eRepose&r (Horizon Chart) and &eTime&r (Containment Seal)."
  ],
  "quest.1E38047DAE4742C0.title": "Copies, Like Smithing Templates",
  "quest.1E38047DAE4742C0.quest_desc": [
    "Altar in the center, its act's component in the four side slots, diamonds in the corners: two altars come out. Peace takes a Routing Matrix; Growth and Renewal a Propagation Core; Levelling a Handling Core; Repose a Horizon Chart; Time a Containment Seal.",
    "",
    "Like a smithing template: the original survives, the copy costs the act."
  ],
  "quest.25E87DD1392D07A3.title": "Altar of Peace",
  "quest.25E87DD1392D07A3.quest_desc": [
    "Burns &ecandles&r, 10 minutes each. While lit, no hostile mob spawns naturally in the &e129-block cube&r around it: 64 blocks each way, up and down included, so a deep mine below still bites. It replaces Torchmaster's Mega Torch.",
    "",
    "About six candles an hour keep a base safe; bees make the wax renewable."
  ],
  "quest.3D589D8B4BEB4346.title": "What Peace Does Not Stop",
  "quest.3D589D8B4BEB4346.quest_desc": [
    "Only &enatural&r monster spawns are refused. Spawners, trial spawners, eggs, summons, conversions, raids, patrols, zombie sieges and every boss still happen, and a modded hostile filed outside the monster category may slip through.",
    "",
    "Peace, not a force field."
  ],
  "quest.63161B4946C2017A.title": "Altar of Growth",
  "quest.63161B4946C2017A.quest_desc": [
    "Burns &ebone blocks&r, 3 minutes each. Crops and saplings in the &e33 by 33&r field around it, from four blocks below to four above, grow about &e20 times&r faster, and ripe harvests drop &edouble&r.",
    "",
    "Seeds never double and unripe crops get nothing. Melons, pumpkins, cane, cactus and bamboo only grow faster, and Mystical Agriculture essence is not multiplied."
  ],
  "quest.7B978688277626D4.title": "Altar of Time",
  "quest.7B978688277626D4.quest_desc": [
    "Burns &eamethyst shards&r, 2 minutes each. Hostile mobs in the &e33-block cube&r move and strike at a third of their strength, and their projectiles fly at a third of the speed. Monsters a player kills inside drop &etriple&r loot and experience.",
    "",
    "Bosses are never slowed or multiplied. They have a schedule to keep."
  ],
  "quest.6878AADB79EAAC41.title": "Quirk: Only Real Kills Triple",
  "quest.6878AADB79EAAC41.quest_desc": [
    "Triple loot needs a real player's kill: fake-player grinders, pets and traps get the slow motion, not the bonus. Nether stars, dragon eggs, mob heads and trial keys never multiply, and gear a mob wore drops once.",
    "",
    "Slowed mobs hit a third as hard, not a third as often: their cadence comes from behavior, not stats."
  ],
  "quest.3112575E98734D79.title": "Altar of Repose",
  "quest.3112575E98734D79.quest_desc": [
    "A four-slot coffer that slowly mends what it holds, like Mending without orbs. It burns &eBottles o' Enchanting&r, one a minute, only while something inside is damaged; every 5 seconds each item regains a point, so a bottle is 12 points for one item or 48 for four.",
    "",
    "Pipes insert only damaged items and pull only whole ones, so a pipe through it is a repair line. Crouch with an empty hand to see progress."
  ],
  "quest.2D38C4F6A4B505C4.title": "Quirk: Slow on Purpose",
  "quest.2D38C4F6A4B505C4.quest_desc": [
    "From zero, an iron chestplate takes about 20 minutes, an elytra about 36 and a diamond pickaxe over two hours. Mending with the same bottle is faster but needs you there. Energy or custom-bar durability is not mended, and unbreakable items are refused.",
    "",
    "Cheap, patient and unattended, like a good grandmother."
  ],
  "quest.57AABE5F2FCD4F97.title": "Altar of Renewal",
  "quest.57AABE5F2FCD4F97.quest_desc": [
    "Grows its biome in the &e49 by 49&r square around it: the biome's trees, giant cacti in the desert, giant spruces in old taigas, mangroves, huge fungi in the Nether, chorus in the End, and flowers. Near your team's Ark garden it grows 65 by 65.",
    "",
    "It only eats &ebone meal&r or other fertilizers: each one pays 10 seconds of work and four plants, and a whole tree takes up to four. Keep the square loaded."
  ],
  "quest.0F468D5DF1795B72.title": "Every Dye, Always",
  "quest.0F468D5DF1795B72.quest_desc": [
    "Around the altar grows a symmetric dye garden: lily of the valley, poppy, dandelion, cornflower, conebloom, swamp rose and ink mushrooms, plus four huge ink mushrooms whose caps drop ink mushrooms. Its harvest crafts all 16 dyes.",
    "",
    "On sand, stone, netherrack or end stone each bed lays its own block of grass, or podzol for mushrooms. Ores, ice, water, builds and claims keep their bed empty; wither roses and berry bushes never grow."
  ],
  "quest.531B7B268260E855.title": "Altar of Levelling",
  "quest.531B7B268260E855.quest_desc": [
    "Free terrain work with the land's own plain blocks: it asks for no materials and keeps none. Burns &ecoal, charcoal or redstone&r, a minute each.\n- Empty hand: 10-second preview; use again to start; while working, pause or resume.\n- Crouch during the preview: next setting, flat 9, 17, 25 or 33 wide with a 4-block slope, then repair 49 by 49.\n- Crouch otherwise: its status."
  ],
  "quest.5014C34B7A0D89C2.title": "Only Real Terrain",
  "quest.5014C34B7A0D89C2.quest_desc": [
    "Flatten copies the top, subsurface and deep blocks around it: what it cuts vanishes and what it fills is free. Repair rebuilds pits and bare dirt as the world generator made them, with ores turned into plain rock.",
    "",
    "It never removes or creates ores, trees, ice or builds: a column holding one, a container, a crop or a fluid is left whole. Fell the trees first.",
    "",
    "Under a roof (the Nether, caves) it works the floor, never the roof or what hangs from it."
  ],
  "quest.726D5571973055F5.title": "Quirk: Everything Is Symmetric",
  "quest.726D5571973055F5.quest_desc": [
    "Every area is a square centered on the altar, worked in rings from the center out. The Levelling slope is the same on every side, and Renewal's dye garden is a pattern of coloured rings. Put the altar at the exact center of what you want to affect.",
    "",
    "Heliodor built with symmetry. Its altars never learned any other way."
  ],
  "quest.77C6298820A4A20A.title": "Altars Act as Their Owner",
  "quest.77C6298820A4A20A.quest_desc": [
    "The owner is whoever placed the altar, or the first player who fed it. Altars that change blocks act on the owner's behalf, so claims, protected ruins and Solsticio refuse them exactly as they would refuse the owner.",
    "",
    "In a team, place them where your claims allow the work."
  ],
  "quest.6CE054C946B800A9.title": "Tip: Stack the Effects",
  "quest.6CE054C946B800A9.quest_desc": [
    "Peace over the base, Growth in the middle of the fields, Time in the mob room where you fight, Repose next to the bed where you drop damaged gear.",
    "",
    "If you copy one, copy Growth first."
  ],
  "quest.2DE34E6E418790EF.title": "Six Gifts From the Past",
  "quest.2DE34E6E418790EF.quest_desc": [
    "Peace for the base, Growth for the fields, Renewal for the gardens, Levelling for the land, Time for the fights and Repose for the gear.",
    "",
    "Heliodor could not save itself, but it left very good tools."
  ],
  "chapter.0882BD4FA4DB1326.title": "Luminosities and Luminous Gear",
  "chapter.0882BD4FA4DB1326.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Six Luminosities, one ingot, the best gear in the pack and creative items made of light."
  ],
  "quest.71E023F277E7AA8B.title": "Light, Held in Your Hand",
  "quest.71E023F277E7AA8B.quest_desc": [
    "Heliodor's light, held in six shapes, is the pack's final material. Only Solsticio's natives trade the six &6Luminosities&r, and from them come the &eLuminous Ingot&r, by far the strongest gear in the pack and the recipes for creative items.",
    "",
    "The top of the ladder, and it glows."
  ],
  "quest.3564F46BB7183E54.title": "The Six Luminosities",
  "quest.3564F46BB7183E54.quest_desc": [
    "One per discipline: &6Engineering&r copper-orange, &5Arcane&r violet, &aNature&r green, &bExploration&r sky blue, &3Logistics&r turquoise and &eHabitation&r warm gold.",
    "",
    "No recipe makes them, and the pack removes any that would. Only Solsticio's awake natives sell them."
  ],
  "quest.457C56A252E9B15D.title": "The Luminous Ingot",
  "quest.457C56A252E9B15D.quest_desc": [
    "Six Luminosities, one of each, fill the outer columns of the grid. The middle column fuses magic, the divine and the machine: a Nature's Aura &esky ingot&r, an Apotheosis &egodforged pearl&r and a Mekanism &eatomic alloy&r. One recipe, one ingot.",
    "",
    "Fireproof, faintly glowing, and it repairs any luminous piece at an anvil."
  ],
  "quest.19A3618A96EB4B87.title": "Gathering the Middle Column",
  "quest.19A3618A96EB4B87.quest_desc": [
    "The &esky ingot&r is Nature's Aura magic, from its altar and aura. The &egodforged pearl&r only comes from salvaging mythic Apotheosis loot, which drops from World Tier Summit on. The &eatomic alloy&r is Mekanism's top alloy.",
    "",
    "All three are Ark materials too, so your act V setup keeps paying off."
  ],
  "quest.7251812C8E588515.title": "Netherite, Then Luminous",
  "quest.7251812C8E588515.quest_desc": [
    "The nine luminous pieces (four armor, five tools and weapons) come from the smithing table, like netherite from diamond: a &enether star&r as the template, the matching &enetherite&r piece and a &eLuminous Ingot&r. Enchantments, affixes, gems, name and wear carry over.",
    "",
    "A full kit: 9 ingots, 9 stars, 9 netherite pieces."
  ],
  "quest.143B871581ED4583.title": "By Far the Strongest",
  "quest.143B871581ED4583.quest_desc": [
    "Armor &e60&r for the set (12, 22, 16, 10), toughness &e15&r and knockback resistance 0.25 per piece (immune with all four), enchantability &e60&r. Tools mine at speed &e60&r, harvest everything and last 32,768 uses; the sword hits for &e30&r at 1.6 per second, the axe &e32&r at 1.0.",
    "",
    "AttributeFix lifts vanilla's armor cap, so none of it is wasted."
  ],
  "quest.225BFC5F2FF7C7F4.title": "It Never Breaks",
  "quest.225BFC5F2FF7C7F4.quest_desc": [
    "At its last durability point a piece goes &edim&r: armor stops protecting, tools mine at hand speed and weapons lose their bonus, like an elytra that stops gliding. Repair it and it lights up again.",
    "",
    "Fireproof, and both Mending and the Luminous Ingot at an anvil work."
  ],
  "quest.1B716F47603A296D.title": "Repaired by Light",
  "quest.1B716F47603A296D.quest_desc": [
    "Once a second, the light at your eyes repairs every luminous piece you carry, wear or hold: brightness minus 11 points each, nothing below light 12, about 4 a second in full sun. The night sky does not count.",
    "",
    "A drained chestplate is whole in under 17 minutes of sun. Solar-powered, like Heliodor."
  ],
  "quest.4B504EF68D518396.title": "The Full Set: Flight",
  "quest.4B504EF68D518396.quest_desc": [
    "All four armor pieces, lit: &ecreative-style flight&r without energy, steady night vision and no fall damage. Take one off and only the set's flight goes; other flight sources keep working. If you were airborne, you get 8 seconds of slow falling.",
    "",
    "Losing the set never kills you. Gravity asks nicely first."
  ],
  "quest.1C42854FA3D4A9F7.title": "The Luminous Sword",
  "quest.1C42854FA3D4A9F7.quest_desc": [
    "Every hit marks the target with Glowing for 5 seconds and deals &e25% more&r damage to undead. Handy in the Twilight Forest and against the Wither's escort.",
    "",
    "The undead never liked the light."
  ],
  "quest.6EEF0D18FEFDC6B1.title": "Gear That Lights the Way",
  "quest.6EEF0D18FEFDC6B1.quest_desc": [
    "With LambDynamicLights, lit luminous armor and tools shine at full brightness around you, and the ingot and Luminosities glow a little in hand. Dim pieces give no light.",
    "",
    "Caves hate you now."
  ],
  "quest.360B04E85E0041D8.title": "Luminous in Silent Gear",
  "quest.360B04E85E0041D8.quest_desc": [
    "The ingot is also a &eSilent Gear&r material, the best of all 138, with its own trait, &eRadiant&r: radiant pieces count toward the luminous set bonus, give dynamic light and are repaired by light. The main part adds Holy V, Lustrous V, Refractive and Kitty Vision, and is fireproof.",
    "",
    "Salvaging it never returns Luminosities."
  ],
  "quest.5961E56C53335CFC.title": "Quirk: Two Rivals Remain",
  "quest.5961E56C53335CFC.quest_desc": [
    "Two powered systems still do something luminous does not: a charged MekaSuit can absorb up to all damage, and Draconic's chaotic shield grows with damage modules.",
    "",
    "They are the ceiling for players who build the infrastructure; luminous is cheaper and needs no power."
  ],
  "quest.6DF9E392A1E87CB0.title": "Creative Items From Light",
  "quest.6DF9E392A1E87CB0.quest_desc": [
    "Twelve creative items get a recipe here, never a sale: among them Mekanism's energy cube (it comes out full), Create's creative motor, Ars Nouveau's source jar and Draconic's capacitor. Each grid is symmetric: Luminosities of two disciplines in the corners, two boss drops on the axis, the mod's expensive material and its best non-creative version in the middle.",
    "",
    "48 Luminosities for all twelve."
  ],
  "quest.750242C1312F40F8.title": "The Boss Drops Matter",
  "quest.750242C1312F40F8.quest_desc": [
    "Creative recipes use a &enether star&r (Wither), a &edragon heart&r (Draconic Evolution's Ender Dragon drop) and a &ewet sponge&r (Elder Guardian), and every luminous piece takes a star as its template.",
    "",
    "Act VI wants more than one of each: farm the Wither and pay the dragon a few more visits."
  ],
  "quest.3FEFFE5C3CDE9AF1.title": "Pack Change: No Duplicators",
  "quest.3FEFFE5C3CDE9AF1.quest_desc": [
    "Creative items that copy items get no recipe: the creative crate, storage cell and bin, Functional Storage's creative vending upgrade, the creative router module and Sophisticated's infinity upgrades. They would clone Luminosities, stars and pearls.",
    "",
    "No recipe turns luminous or creative items back into their inputs either."
  ],
  "quest.592061ECDBD42A57.title": "Tip: Count Your Light",
  "quest.592061ECDBD42A57.quest_desc": [
    "A full luminous set takes 54 Luminosities (nine ingots), and all twelve creative items 48 more. Each awake native sells up to four per restock, once a game day.",
    "",
    "Wake all six early in act VI and visit often; after the liberation, prices drop further."
  ],
  "quest.45F621229EAF6C22.title": "The Brightest Things You Own",
  "quest.45F621229EAF6C22.quest_desc": [
    "Gear that never breaks and flies, and creative items forged from light: the top of ENTRELUMEN's ladder.",
    "",
    "What you do with it is yours. The city and the world stay open, and now you glow in the dark."
  ],
  "chapter.670A7FABD9529818.title": "Solsticio: the City in the Light",
  "chapter.670A7FABD9529818.chapter_subtitle": [
    "The Light Key, your plot, sixteen shops, half-price villagers and the natives who sell Luminosities."
  ],
  "quest.23154202E971D33D.title": "The Capital of Heliodor",
  "quest.23154202E971D33D.quest_desc": [
    "Heliodor's capital, frozen inside the Entrelumen: an island city of gardens, copper and glass under an eternal noon. You reach it in act VI, after activating the Ark.",
    "",
    "Everyone inside has been waiting a very long time. Try not to be late."
  ],
  "quest.5B07250B9653E98A.title": "The Light Key",
  "quest.5B07250B9653E98A.quest_desc": [
    "Activating the Ark forges the &eLight Key&r for whoever activates it; teammates craft their own from an amethyst shard, two gold ingots, a Spectral Lens and a Horizon Chart. A key works only for teams whose Ark is active.",
    "",
    "Hold use for two seconds while a ring of light closes around you. Let go early and nothing is spent."
  ],
  "quest.384435517F0C36BE.title": "Broken, and Better for It",
  "quest.384435517F0C36BE.quest_desc": [
    "The key opens the way once and breaks as you cross. The &eBroken Light Key&r is bound to you: use it the same way to go home and back, as often as you like. Only its owner can use it.",
    "",
    "Home is where you last left the Overworld, or your bed, or world spawn, always checked for a safe spot. Mounts stay behind."
  ],
  "quest.23E16658D1A73696.title": "No Night, No Monsters",
  "quest.23E16658D1A73696.quest_desc": [
    "Eternal noon: no weather, no night, no hostile spawns, and interiors are never pitch black. Fall off the edge or walk past the border and the barrier of light brings you back to the arrival point, so the void never kills you.",
    "",
    "The first visit places the whole city. If the key says try again, give it a moment."
  ],
  "quest.0EEC4C8640CDE7BA.title": "Your Team's Plot",
  "quest.0EEC4C8640CDE7BA.quest_desc": [
    "The first member of a team to stand in the city claims a 16 by 16 plot for the team's campaign: one per team, kept while the campaign exists. Inside it your team builds freely; the rest of the city is protected.",
    "",
    "When every plot is taken, newcomers can still visit, and an operator can free one."
  ],
  "quest.2A148EEE6F6F68CD.title": "The Town Hall Portal",
  "quest.2A148EEE6F6F68CD.quest_desc": [
    "The Ayuntamiento holds a dormant portal with four sockets. Set act VI's &ethree relics&r in it (Juan's Luminous Seed, Terra's Terraprism and Bodhi's Blessed Heart of Heliodor), then show it your broken key: it opens for everyone.",
    "",
    "Walking in sends anyone home. The key is only shown, never kept."
  ],
  "quest.727A4BC4EDD7F47B.title": "A Waystone for Everyone",
  "quest.727A4BC4EDD7F47B.quest_desc": [
    "When the portal opens, a global Solsticio waystone appears in the Town Hall, so every waystone in the world can reach the city. Without Waystones, a twin portal appears near world spawn instead.",
    "",
    "Arriving on the portal never bounces you back: it rests for a few seconds and while you stand in it."
  ],
  "quest.3805C8D7CD312447.title": "How the Market Works",
  "quest.3805C8D7CD312447.quest_desc": [
    "The sixteen shops sell and never buy, so no loop turns items back into emeralds. Prices are in &eemeralds&r up to 64 and &eemerald blocks&r above; some offers want a second item, like a book.",
    "",
    "Shops restock once a game day when someone opens them, popular offers get dearer for a while, and reputation and Hero of the Village still count."
  ],
  "quest.4AC078B71F8995FF.title": "The Sixteen Shops",
  "quest.4AC078B71F8995FF.quest_desc": [
    "The highlights: &eLucerna&r sells enchanted books at vanilla maximum (&eMending&r for 40 emeralds and a book); &eCenit&r, rarities like elytra, totems and shulker shells; &eBrasa&r, circuits, alloys and machine parts from many tech mods; &eFulgor&r, the netherite upgrade and every armor trim.",
    "",
    "Plus twelve more, from seeds to curiosities."
  ],
  "quest.39908CEF070C2E51.title": "Offers That Wait for Your Act",
  "quest.39908CEF070C2E51.quest_desc": [
    "Some offers carry an act: elytra wait for VI, totems and shulker shells for V, heart of the sea, trident and netherite scrap for IV, echo shards for III, plus a few books and parts. Until then they show out of stock, with a hint on the action bar.",
    "",
    "It matters when a team arrives early through another team's portal or waystone."
  ],
  "quest.79D8A04CF5081F62.title": "Pack Change: Never for Sale",
  "quest.79D8A04CF5081F62.quest_desc": [
    "No emeralds, nether stars, dragon eggs, sponges, beacons, wither skulls, spawners, spawn eggs, Luminous Ingots or their rare ingredients, Light Keys or portal relics. Luminosities come only from their own native.",
    "",
    "Some things you still earn in the world. Bosses need a reason to exist."
  ],
  "quest.56F6DFDD05003993.title": "Move Villagers In",
  "quest.56F6DFDD05003993.quest_desc": [
    "Bring any Overworld villager into the &etrading hall&r and it &esettles&r: same profession and trades, but &ehalf price&r forever, wherever it trades later, and it restocks on its own daily.",
    "",
    "Carry them with Easy Villagers (&eAlt+O&r), a minecart or Carry On. A librarian with good books is the classic move."
  ],
  "quest.11E8992E59258C44.title": "The Six Natives",
  "quest.11E8992E59258C44.quest_desc": [
    "Six natives wait around the trading hall, their &eLuminosity&r out of stock until they have stood in their Overworld biome:\n- &eIgnea&r, engineering: Badlands;\n- &eArcadio&r, arcane: Swamp or Mangrove Swamp;\n- &eSilvano&r, nature: Jungle;\n- &eBrisa&r, exploration: Jagged, Frozen or Stony Peaks;\n- &eMarea&r, logistics: Warm, Lukewarm or Deep Lukewarm Ocean;\n- &eSolana&r, habitation: Sunflower Plains.",
    "",
    "Right-click a sleeping native to hear its wish."
  ],
  "quest.1EB57C6214238492.title": "Wake a Native",
  "quest.1EB57C6214238492.quest_desc": [
    "Carry it to its biome (Easy Villagers, a minecart or Carry On) and set it down: it wakes and stays awake for good, even back in Solsticio. Awake, it sells its Luminosity for &e8 emerald blocks&r plus a catalyst from its discipline, up to 4 per restock, and its other offers at half price.",
    "",
    "None of the six biomes is rare, and Nature's Compass finds them."
  ],
  "quest.18DB6AE80E859DE8.title": "Prices After the Liberation",
  "quest.18DB6AE80E859DE8.quest_desc": [
    "When the Entrelumen is freed, every price in the city drops: shopkeepers sell at &e60%&r, stacking with native and settled-villager discounts, so an awake native's Luminosity costs 5 emerald blocks. Prices round, never go below one item and always drop by at least one.",
    "",
    "Freedom has perks. Aurelia would like you to notice."
  ],
  "quest.25906E351DD1BD36.title": "Quirk: Shopkeepers Stay Put",
  "quest.25906E351DD1BD36.quest_desc": [
    "Shopkeepers and innkeepers refuse carrying mods, cannot be hurt and never level up; if one vanishes, a new one takes the post. Natives and ordinary residents can be carried off, and only their death brings a replacement.",
    "",
    "Residents chat, and some of their lines are rumors worth hearing."
  ],
  "quest.63AD5F7059C1A754.title": "Tip: Plan Your Emeralds",
  "quest.63AD5F7059C1A754.quest_desc": [
    "Six Luminosities per ingot, nine ingots per set, eight Luminosities per creative item: it adds up. Start an emerald income before act VI with Easy Villagers traders, farms of what villagers buy or your own trading hall.",
    "",
    "Heliodor runs on light. Its shops run on emeralds."
  ],
  "quest.62F97D06472111F4.title": "Tip: Motes and Frame Rate",
  "quest.62F97D06472111F4.quest_desc": [
    "The drifting motes of light are client-side and follow your particle setting: halved on Decreased, gone on Minimal. For finer control, the ENTRELUMEN client config has &esolsticio.ambientMotes&r (on or off) and &esolsticio.moteDensity&r (0 to 8, default 2).",
    "",
    "The city is big: if frames drop, lower particles or render distance."
  ],
  "quest.3DAE84462B7F4FCF.title": "A Home Inside the Light",
  "quest.3DAE84462B7F4FCF.quest_desc": [
    "Cross and return, build on your plot, trade, move villagers in and wake the six natives. The city stays open for as long as you play.",
    "",
    "Stay for the noon. It never ends."
  ],
  "chapter.08B147AC6886788B.title": "The Pack's Controls",
  "chapter.08B147AC6886788B.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Every key the preset moved, grouped by what you are doing."
  ],
  "quest.6D8C6475ADC2E030.title": "A Keyboard for 300 Mods",
  "quest.6D8C6475ADC2E030.quest_desc": [
    "V, B, R, G, H, C, Z and the arrows were each claimed by five or six mods. The pack's key preset moves the clashing ones to free keys or to Alt, Ctrl and Shift combinations, and only fills keys you never set yourself: change one and your choice stays.",
    "",
    "Three hundred mods, one keyboard. Somebody had to negotiate."
  ],
  "quest.587CCA4077F3D371.title": "Find Any Key",
  "quest.587CCA4077F3D371.quest_desc": [
    "&eControlling&r (Options, Controls, Key Binds) adds a search box and a conflict filter; red keys are used twice, which is fine when they act in different places.",
    "",
    "Unbound on purpose: Accessories' own screen (the Aether's stays on &eI&r), Crafting on a Stick's second Curios key, Ars Nouveau's next and previous spell slot (use the F6 radial), Twilight's goggle zoom (Just Zoom covers it) and the Key Bundles radial."
  ],
  "quest.3010187592F12FD0.title": "Everyday Keys",
  "quest.3010187592F12FD0.quest_desc": [
    "- &eF8&r quest book (it used to sit on the grave key).\n- &eG&r Curios: Terra's Arm and the Ultimine curio go there.\n- &eV&r (hold) FTB Ultimine.\n- &eB&r the backpack you wear or carry.\n- &eR&r Tool Belt radial, &eShift+R&r its slot inventory.\n- &eJ&r full map, &eM&r new waypoint, &eK&r claim manager.\n- &eZ&r zoom (Just Zoom)."
  ],
  "quest.1FFF4DEA44FFBB8C.title": "Map and Waypoints",
  "quest.1FFF4DEA44FFBB8C.quest_desc": [
    "&eJourneyMap&r is the pack's map: &eJ&r opens it full-screen, &eM&r makes a waypoint where you stand and, inside the map, &eB&r one at the cursor.",
    "",
    "FTB Chunks' map key is unbound and its minimap off: it only handles teams and claims, with its claim manager on &eK&r."
  ],
  "quest.2B804294ADD68A3D.title": "R and Shift+R: the Tool Belt",
  "quest.2B804294ADD68A3D.quest_desc": [
    "With a Tool Belt in its slot, hold &eR&r for a radial menu that swaps your held item with one on the belt; &eShift+R&r opens the belt's slots.",
    "",
    "R is also the recipe key inside screens, but the belt only opens with no screen open, so they never clash. Aircraft dismount moved to &eF12&r for the same reason."
  ],
  "quest.5560B3BDAFB2503C.title": "V: Ultimine",
  "quest.5560B3BDAFB2503C.quest_desc": [
    "Hold &eV&r while breaking a block to break the whole connected vein, up to the reach of the vein resonator worn in a Curios charm slot (8, 16, 32 or 64 blocks by tier; without one there is no Ultimine), at extra hunger per block. With V held, Shift and the mouse wheel (or up and down arrows) switch shape: shapeless, tunnels or 3x3.",
    "",
    "Modern Industrialization's 3x3 tool toggle moved to &eAlt+V&r."
  ],
  "quest.6EFB8442677ABC33.title": "Mekanism Armor: Alt + Arrows",
  "quest.6EFB8442677ABC33.quest_desc": [
    "Mekanism's armor mode keys left V, G, J and B for the arrows with &eAlt&r: &eAlt+Up&r helmet, &eAlt+Left&r chestplate, &eAlt+Down&r leggings, &eAlt+Right&r boots.",
    "",
    "The MekaSuit HUD toggles with Ctrl and the module tweaker with Alt, each plus the key where US keyboards have the backslash."
  ],
  "quest.606412CA5CDED070.title": "Flight and Travel Keys",
  "quest.606412CA5CDED070.quest_desc": [
    "- &eF4&r Iron Jetpacks engine, &eAlt+H&r its hover.\n- &eShift+F4&r Modern Industrialization flight.\n- &eCtrl+F4&r Ad Astra suit flight, &eAlt+R&r Ad Astra radio.\n- &eAlt+E&r Ender IO Staff of Travelling.\n- &eF12&r get off an Immersive Aircraft plane, &eCtrl+F12&r its boost.",
    "",
    "Every way of flying got its own key. Crashing is still shared."
  ],
  "quest.48B114C209222330.title": "Magic Keys",
  "quest.48B114C209222330.quest_desc": [
    "- &eF6&r Ars Nouveau spell radial, &e0&r its crown potion radial.\n- Iron's Spells wheel on the key left of 1 (grave accent on US keyboards), &eAlt+Q&r cast from the spellbook.\n- &eAlt+F&r Psi's main key (C stays for the vanilla hotbar save and the Ars book).\n- Mahou Tsukai: &eAlt+M&r magic circle, &eShift+Y&r mystic code, &eCtrl+H&r selective displacement, &eAlt+.&r settings, &ePage Up/Down&r its guns."
  ],
  "quest.16A91FEE3BA9C17E.title": "Exploration and Armor Abilities",
  "quest.16A91FEE3BA9C17E.quest_desc": [
    "- Aether: &eHome&r invisibility cloak; Deep Aether &eShift+Home&r skyjade transparency, &eAlt+G&r stratus dash, &eShift+H&r slider eye.\n- Twilight: the US semicolon key swaps the hotbar, and Shift plus it handles item display maps.\n- Eternal Starlight: &eH&r switches crest.\n- Deeper and Darker: &eAlt+B&r boost, &eAlt+N&r transmit.\n- Cataclysm armor: &eAlt+J&r, &eAlt+K&r helmet, &eAlt+L&r chestplate, &eAlt+I&r boots."
  ],
  "quest.181BA0D5FFEF2462.title": "Utility Keys",
  "quest.181BA0D5FFEF2462.quest_desc": [
    "- &eAlt+O&r pick up a villager (Easy Villagers).\n- &eShift+M&r Simple Magnets, &eCtrl+M&r Ender IO magnet.\n- US apostrophe key: Supplementaries quiver.\n- &eO&r Occultism ender satchel, &eShift+O&r its storage remote, &eInsert&r its satchel.\n- &eF10&r clear notifications.\n- &eEnd&r Building Gadgets range, &eShift+End&r settings, &eCtrl+End&r anchor.\n- &eAlt+T&r, &eShift+T&r Just Dire Things.\n- &eAlt+P&r, &eAlt+Y&r Draconic; &eAlt+U&r Hostile Neural Networks; &eAlt+Z&r Oritech implants (hold)."
  ],
  "quest.5085B25979D0B540.title": "Ctrl+T, Ctrl+O and Shift+T",
  "quest.5085B25979D0B540.quest_desc": [
    "Three Apotheosis keys keep their native combinations: &eCtrl+T&r opens the World Tier screen (readable, but the story sets the tier), &eCtrl+O&r toggles radial mining on gear that has it, and &eShift+T&r in an inventory links the hovered item in chat for your team to admire."
  ],
  "quest.2AD44E12B13F4108.title": "LittleTiles Keys",
  "quest.2AD44E12B13F4108.quest_desc": [
    "LittleTiles, the small-block builder, has its own set: &eN&r mirror, &eU&r mark, &eCtrl+I&r configure the held tool (&eShift+I&r secondary settings), &eCtrl+Home&r building mode, &eCtrl+Z&r undo, &eCtrl+Y&r redo.",
    "",
    "How to use them: the Building Tools chapter."
  ],
  "quest.7120653E6832BDAE.title": "Tip: Keys Named by Position",
  "quest.7120653E6832BDAE.quest_desc": [
    "A few preset keys are named after US symbols, the semicolon and the apostrophe, and on a Spanish or Latin American keyboard those physical keys print something else.",
    "",
    "Do not hunt for the symbol: read the label in Controls, which shows what your layout prints, or rebind it."
  ],
  "quest.4625B97E61B1C74D.title": "Tip: Key Bundles",
  "quest.4625B97E61B1C74D.quest_desc": [
    "&eKeyBind Bundles&r gathers rarely used actions into a radial menu behind one key. It ships unbound: bind &eOpen Bundle radial menu&r in Controls and build bundles from its screen.",
    "",
    "Good candidates: armor abilities, magic toggles, every Mahou Tsukai key."
  ],
  "quest.0C7671DD3A4A0940.title": "Quirk: Alt, Ctrl and Shift Win",
  "quest.0C7671DD3A4A0940.quest_desc": [
    "When a modified combination and a plain key share a letter, the combination whose modifier you hold wins: &eAlt+Q&r casts a spell without dropping your item, and &eCtrl+O&r toggles radial mining instead of opening the ender satchel.",
    "",
    "If a combination ever fires both actions, report it."
  ],
  "quest.38BCA7D778496F93.title": "Pack Change: Client Defaults",
  "quest.38BCA7D778496F93.quest_desc": [
    "A new profile also gets the pack's performance settings (see Performance, Sound and Screen), auto-jump off and the pack's resource pack enabled.",
    "",
    "They are only defaults: if your launcher already made an options file, existing values stay and only missing ones are added."
  ],
  "quest.487DF43C29D28D87.title": "Your Keyboard, Your Rules",
  "quest.487DF43C29D28D87.quest_desc": [
    "Everything here is a suggestion: keep what feels natural, rebind the rest with Controlling and put rare actions in a bundle.",
    "",
    "When a new tool shows up, check back here: its key is probably already waiting."
  ],
  "chapter.64B80719A7DF9516.title": "Recipes and Information",
  "chapter.64B80719A7DF9516.chapter_subtitle": [
    "EMI, Jade and the tooltips: how to find out what anything does without leaving the game."
  ],
  "quest.3CF1DB3935AAE039.title": "Where Answers Live",
  "quest.3CF1DB3935AAE039.quest_desc": [
    "Three hundred mods, and nobody remembers every recipe. You do not need a wiki: the game tells you how to make an item, what it is for, what a block holds and what an enchantment or effect does.",
    "",
    "R, U and a little curiosity replace most forum threads."
  ],
  "quest.55262A03C2144680.title": "EMI: the Item List",
  "quest.55262A03C2144680.quest_desc": [
    "The item column on the right of your inventory is &eEMI&r, the recipe viewer; its search bar sits at the bottom. Names follow your game language, and untranslated mods show English. &eCtrl+F&r jumps to the search, &eCtrl+O&r hides the whole overlay, and the mouse wheel turns pages."
  ],
  "quest.61CA4F1B5C30E59D.title": "R: How Do I Make This?",
  "quest.61CA4F1B5C30E59D.quest_desc": [
    "Hover any item, in EMI or any inventory, and press &eR&r (or left-click it in the list): every recipe that makes it appears, one tab per machine or crafting type. Hover a tab's icon to see which blocks run it, and &eBackspace&r goes back.",
    "",
    "The most-pressed key in the pack, by a mile."
  ],
  "quest.31B358B0E659662B.title": "U: What Is This For?",
  "quest.31B358B0E659662B.quest_desc": [
    "&eU&r over an item (or right-click in the list) shows every recipe that uses it: the fastest way to decide whether that strange drop is worth keeping.",
    "",
    "Try U on a machine to see everything it can process."
  ],
  "quest.0E7FE69D2A058E7E.title": "Search Like a Pro",
  "quest.0E7FE69D2A058E7E.quest_desc": [
    "EMI search understands prefixes: &e@create&r filters by mod, &e#c:ingots&r by tag, &e$fortune&r searches tooltips, a leading &e-&r excludes (&edirt -@minecraft&r), &e|&r means or (&etin|lead&r), slashes make a regular expression and quotes keep spaces together.",
    "",
    "Try one and you will never scroll again."
  ],
  "quest.566F682243FD07BC.title": "A: Favorites",
  "quest.566F682243FD07BC.quest_desc": [
    "&eA&r over an item pins it to the favorites bar on the left; A on a recipe pins that exact recipe, and A again removes it. Favorites survive between sessions.",
    "",
    "Keep there what you craft often: rations, torches, the next act component."
  ],
  "quest.53291CF6E456E08B.title": "The + Button Fills the Grid",
  "quest.53291CF6E456E08B.quest_desc": [
    "The small &e+&r beside a recipe moves its ingredients from your inventory into the open grid or machine, and &eShift+click&r fills as many batches as you can afford.",
    "",
    "Open the crafting table first, then look up the recipe. The other way round, nothing happens."
  ],
  "quest.3EC6B1E3A960D9DD.title": "The Recipe Tree",
  "quest.3EC6B1E3A960D9DD.quest_desc": [
    "On a recipe, &eView Recipe Tree&r draws the whole chain down to raw materials with the total cost. Click a node to pick its recipe (Shift lets EMI choose from your inventory), right-click to fold a branch, and crafting mode adds &bsynthetic favorites&r: the steps you still have to make.",
    "",
    "Made for act components."
  ],
  "quest.406D38FB9E0D4DF3.title": "Default Recipes",
  "quest.406D38FB9E0D4DF3.quest_desc": [
    "When an item has several recipes, &eCtrl+click&r the output of the one you prefer to make it the default for the tree and synthetic favorites.",
    "",
    "Handy when the same plate comes from Create, Immersive Engineering and Mekanism and you only built one of them."
  ],
  "quest.6CE1567F3B363FF1.title": "Why JEI Is Installed Too",
  "quest.6CE1567F3B363FF1.quest_desc": [
    "EMI is the viewer you see, but JEI stays so that add-ons written for it still reach you: EMI reads JEI plugins and shows their pages inside its own interface, from Mekanism multiblocks to villager professions.",
    "",
    "A page that looks slightly different probably comes from a JEI plugin."
  ],
  "quest.4B4E944BB1EAB381.title": "Pages You Did Not Know About",
  "quest.4B4E944BB1EAB381.quest_desc": [
    "&eJust Enough Professions&r (which workstation gives which job), &eJust Enough Breeding&r (what each animal eats), &eJust Enough Archaeology&r (what each suspicious block drops), &eJust Enough Mekanism Multiblocks&r (sizes and parts) and &eSmithing Template Viewer&r (what each template makes).",
    "",
    "U over a lectern, a cow or a brush finds them fast."
  ],
  "quest.66D47A11A965B2B7.title": "Jade: What Am I Looking At?",
  "quest.66D47A11A965B2B7.quest_desc": [
    "The small panel at the top of the screen is &eJade&r: the name of the block or creature you look at, its mod and useful state such as a machine's energy, a crop's growth or a furnace's progress; Jade Addons covers more mods.",
    "",
    "The mod name alone solves half the questions in a big pack."
  ],
  "quest.674B69F2C86D4CA3.title": "Jade's Keypad Keys",
  "quest.674B69F2C86D4CA3.quest_desc": [
    "&eNumpad 0&r opens Jade's settings (hide lines you do not care about), &eNumpad 1&r hides the panel, &eNumpad 2&r toggles fluids, and &eNumpad 3&r and &eNumpad 4&r show recipes and uses of what you are looking at.",
    "",
    "No keypad? Rebind them in Controls. Laptops, we see you."
  ],
  "quest.0F7DBD2F6C93F685.title": "Tooltips That Explain",
  "quest.0F7DBD2F6C93F685.quest_desc": [
    "&eEnchantment Descriptions&r explains every enchantment; &eAppleSkin&r shows a food's hunger and saturation and previews them on the bar; &eEquipment Compare&r sets armor or weapons beside yours while you hold &eLeft Shift&r; and &eF3+H&r, extended by Better Advanced Tooltips, adds IDs, durability and technical data."
  ],
  "quest.712D684D42FF0AF7.title": "Peek Inside Containers",
  "quest.712D684D42FF0AF7.quest_desc": [
    "&eShulker Box Tooltip&r shows a shulker box's contents without placing it: &eLeft Shift&r for a compact view, &eAlt+Shift&r for the full grid, &eLeft Ctrl&r to lock the preview.",
    "",
    "Sophisticated Backpacks list their contents when you hold Shift over them."
  ],
  "quest.64CCA8C454B93ADC.title": "What Does This Effect Do?",
  "quest.64CCA8C454B93ADC.quest_desc": [
    "Search an effect's name in EMI: &eJust Enough Effect Descriptions&r adds a page per effect with an explanation and the items that cause it.",
    "",
    "Handy for the satiety system's random buffs and the potions from Solsticio's apothecary."
  ],
  "quest.2136A30BA938D958.title": "Two Recipes, One Grid",
  "quest.2136A30BA938D958.quest_desc": [
    "When two recipes share a pattern, &ePolymorph&r adds a small button beside the output slot so you can pick the result.",
    "",
    "If the table hands you the \"wrong\" item, look for that button before blaming the recipe."
  ],
  "quest.3DE198C3AFAF7F1C.title": "Guide Books Are Crafted",
  "quest.3DE198C3AFAF7F1C.quest_desc": [
    "Nobody hands you a book on login, but every manual is still craftable: Ars Nouveau's Tattered Tome, the Integrated Dynamics manual, the Actually Additions booklet, Modern Industrialization's guidebook, Silent Gear's material book, the PneumaticCraft and Psi manuals and more.",
    "",
    "EMI has each recipe, and the Akashic Tome keeps them all in one."
  ],
  "quest.4178311F064476BB.title": "Tip: Which Mod Is This?",
  "quest.4178311F064476BB.quest_desc": [
    "Item tooltips in EMI end with the mod's name in blue italics, and Jade shows it for blocks in the world.",
    "",
    "When a wiki and the game disagree, trust the game: the pack changes some recipes, and EMI always shows the version you really have."
  ],
  "quest.7C55DEA7E7A3F179.title": "Pack Change: One Slot for the Act",
  "quest.7C55DEA7E7A3F179.quest_desc": [
    "Milestones swap one slot on their drawing's axis for an &6act component&r (Calibration Frame, Routing Matrix, Spectral Lens...): the AE2 and Refined Storage controllers, the Digital Miner or the Botany Pots upgrades. Other steps take an act material: a Mekanism alloy, ironwood or zanite.",
    "",
    "Unfamiliar ENTRELUMEN item in a grid? Press &eR&r on it; the Atlas chapter has the rest."
  ],
  "quest.73F28D876C6411ED.title": "Pack Change: One Route per Recipe",
  "quest.73F28D876C6411ED.quest_desc": [
    "Where mods copy each other's recipes, the pack switches off the copies so each recipe shows once in EMI; the kitchen machines are the classic case (see The Kitchen).",
    "",
    "Apotheosis's own item comparison is off too: Equipment Compare already does it on Shift."
  ],
  "quest.43CB273891F7D134.title": "Pack Change: No Recipe on Purpose",
  "quest.43CB273891F7D134.quest_desc": [
    "The six &6Luminosities&r (only Solsticio's natives trade them), item duplicators such as the creative crate, storage cell, bin and infinity upgrades, and Torchmaster's Mega Torch (the Altar of Peace replaces it) have no recipe at all.",
    "",
    "When U shows uses but R shows nothing, read the tooltip: it usually says where the item comes from."
  ],
  "quest.180B2B2465B8EE5E.title": "F7 and F9: Light and Chunk Lines",
  "quest.180B2B2465B8EE5E.quest_desc": [
    "&eMore Overlays&r adds two world toggles: &eF7&r marks blocks where hostile mobs can spawn because the light is too low, and &eF9&r draws chunk borders, handy before claiming land or building a chunk-sized farm.",
    "",
    "Light a cave with F7 on until no marks remain."
  ],
  "quest.4221014B1F59149C.title": "You Can Look Anything Up",
  "quest.4221014B1F59149C.quest_desc": [
    "R for recipes, U for uses, A for favorites, the tree for long chains, Jade for the world and tooltips for everything else.",
    "",
    "The wiki can rest now."
  ],
  "chapter.31A61F4C1354DBD2.title": "Inventory Without Pain",
  "chapter.31A61F4C1354DBD2.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Mouse gestures, sorting, trash, portable stations and the Tool Belt."
  ],
  "quest.40752BE0BC2CF1E7.title": "Less Clicking, More Playing",
  "quest.40752BE0BC2CF1E7.quest_desc": [
    "Big pack, big inventory. A handful of small mods remove clicks: drag gestures, one-key sorting, a trash slot, crafting tables on a stick and a tool belt. None of them touches progression.",
    "",
    "Moving items should never feel like a second job.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The magnet hangs with the gadgets: \"},{\"text\":\"A magnet in your pocket\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"580411F1188ABEEA\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.43411C7BA4F791B5.title": "Mouse Tweaks",
  "quest.43411C7BA4F791B5.quest_desc": [
    "In any inventory: hold &eright click&r and drag over empty slots to drop one item in each; hold &eleft click&r with a stack and drag to gather the same kind; &eShift&r plus left-drag with an empty hand sends every slot you touch across; the &emouse wheel&r over an item moves it one at a time."
  ],
  "quest.2ED5039CAADCDB2D.title": "Sorting With Inventory Tweaks",
  "quest.2ED5039CAADCDB2D.quest_desc": [
    "&eInventory Tweaks Refoxed&r is the pack's only sorter: the &ebackslash&r key sorts your inventory and the &egrave-accent&r key the open chest (check Controls for your layout's labels).",
    "",
    "It also refills a hotbar slot from your inventory when a tool breaks or a stack runs out."
  ],
  "quest.728C08F385A0AAAB.title": "Vanilla Tricks Worth Knowing",
  "quest.728C08F385A0AAAB.quest_desc": [
    "&eDouble-click&r gathers every item of a kind onto the cursor; &eShift+double-click&r moves all those stacks across. &e1-9&r swap the hovered slot with the hotbar, &eF&r with the offhand. &eQ&r over a slot drops one, &eCtrl+Q&r the whole stack.",
    "",
    "Minecraft had these all along. Nobody told you."
  ],
  "quest.29FA4CC3289502F3.title": "Crafting Tweaks",
  "quest.29FA4CC3289502F3.quest_desc": [
    "Small buttons beside the crafting grid &erotate&r it, &ebalance&r and &espread&r ingredients, and &eclear&r it back to your inventory (force clear drops items if you are full). They show up on many modded stations too.",
    "",
    "With EMI's + button, shaped recipes become painless."
  ],
  "quest.099E800BF0796631.title": "Fuel Goes Where It Should",
  "quest.099E800BF0796631.quest_desc": [
    "&eFuel Goes Here&r sends Shift-clicked coal, charcoal or any fuel to a furnace's fuel slot first, not the input.",
    "",
    "Fast Workbench and Fast Furnace cache recipe lookups, so crafting and smelting stay quick with this many recipes."
  ],
  "quest.768C2BFC98D0D302.title": "Getting Rid of Things",
  "quest.768C2BFC98D0D302.quest_desc": [
    "&eTrashSlot&r adds a trash slot to your inventory; it keeps the last item until you trash another, so a misclick can be undone. &eTrash Cans&r are blocks that void whatever pipes send them (items, fluids, energy or everything), with a 9-entry filter on the item and fluid ones.",
    "",
    "Farm overflow goes to a can, not to the floor."
  ],
  "quest.12F24BEA959401E4.title": "Quirk: TrashSlot on Servers",
  "quest.12F24BEA959401E4.quest_desc": [
    "TrashSlot works in single player, but on a dedicated server only if the server has it too; otherwise it says so in chat and turns itself off.",
    "",
    "A Trash Can block does the same job for everyone."
  ],
  "quest.5117E4B67334A4B3.title": "Stations on a Stick",
  "quest.5117E4B67334A4B3.quest_desc": [
    "&eCrafting On A Stick&r turns the crafting table, stonecutter, loom, cartography table, smithing table, grindstone and anvil into hotbar items you right-click to open anywhere.",
    "",
    "Perfect for early expeditions, when every slot counts."
  ],
  "quest.3B11AF8418138B60.title": "The Tool Belt",
  "quest.3B11AF8418138B60.quest_desc": [
    "A &eTool Belt&r (leather, string and an iron ingot) goes in its own slot, and its tools leave your hotbar free: hold &eR&r for the radial menu, &eShift+R&r for the belt's slots.",
    "",
    "It starts small; combine it with a &eBelt Pouch&r in an anvil for more room."
  ],
  "quest.5131D32867AE6A92.title": "One Book for All Books",
  "quest.5131D32867AE6A92.quest_desc": [
    "The &eAkashic Tome&r (a book and a bookshelf) stores every guide book in one item: craft it with a book to add it, then &eShift+right-click&r to pick which one it becomes.",
    "",
    "Ars Nouveau, Integrated Dynamics, PneumaticCraft, Psi and friends, all in one pocket."
  ],
  "quest.7A572E4824CB3002.title": "Item Collectors",
  "quest.7A572E4824CB3002.quest_desc": [
    "An &eItem Collector&r (an ender pearl on obsidian) picks up dropped items around it and holds them for a hopper or pipe; the advanced one has a configurable range and a filter.",
    "",
    "Put one under a tree farm or in a mob room. Fewer loose items, less lag."
  ],
  "quest.0295F66723444CF2.title": "Tip: Experience in Clumps",
  "quest.0295F66723444CF2.quest_desc": [
    "&eClumps&r merges nearby experience orbs into one, so a mob farm or a big smelting session no longer carpets the floor with orbs, and picking them up is instant.",
    "",
    "Less disco, more XP."
  ],
  "quest.4E08471DA70A04CF.title": "A Real Backpack",
  "quest.4E08471DA70A04CF.quest_desc": [
    "Sophisticated Backpacks carry dozens of slots, open with &eB&r and take upgrades that pick up, sort, restock and feed you. Start with a basic one.",
    "",
    "Tiers and upgrades: the Storage chapter."
  ],
  "quest.1398AE437E30A689.title": "Pack Change: Nothing to Start",
  "quest.1398AE437E30A689.quest_desc": [
    "No mod puts items in your inventory when you join: books, kits and plushies are all switched off, and everything here is crafted from ordinary materials.",
    "",
    "Why: the start chapter, Waking Among Ruins."
  ],
  "chapter.3353A60ACA90F0B9.title": "Building",
  "chapter.3353A60ACA90F0B9.chapter_subtitle": [
    "A street that goes up as you learn: stone, roofs, furniture, fine detail and the props on the sidewalk."
  ],
  "quest.3FD169F826E0CEC2.title": "Mason Table",
  "quest.3FD169F826E0CEC2.quest_subtitle": "One block in, thousands of looks out.",
  "quest.3FD169F826E0CEC2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Put a stone in, get a catalogue out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Mason Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"chipped:mason_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns one block into any of its \"},{\"text\":\"3,000+\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" variants, one for one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:brick\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" bricks, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" iron ingots, \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" logs and a \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:crafting_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Takes stone, bricks, terracotta, concrete, quartz, obsidian and more.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It accepts \"},{\"text\":\"84\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" families of blocks: stone and its cousins (andesite, basalt, blackstone, calcite, deepslate, granite, sandstone, tuff), cobblestone, nether bricks, purpur, quartz, obsidian, mud bricks, all 16 terracottas, glazed terracottas and concretes.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Nothing is lost: \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" block in is \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" block out.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.12022FADB42CC540.title": "Carpenters Table",
  "quest.12022FADB42CC540.quest_subtitle": "Wood, in every grain it knows.",
  "quest.12022FADB42CC540.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Planks, logs, doors and trapdoors change grain here.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"An iron axe, an iron ingot, five planks and a \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:crafting_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Also takes barrels, bookshelves, ladders and torches: \"},{\"text\":\"1,244\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" variants in all.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Eleven woods, plain or stripped: oak, spruce, birch, jungle, acacia, dark oak, mangrove, cherry, bamboo, crimson and warped."
  ],
  "quest.1E4B873C3713A388.title": "Glassblower",
  "quest.1E4B873C3713A388.quest_subtitle": "Leaded windows without the lead.",
  "quest.1E4B873C3713A388.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Glass and panes, plain or stained, in fancy patterns.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Two iron ingots, a \"},{\"text\":\"Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", four brick blocks, a \"},{\"text\":\"Blast Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blast_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:crafting_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"34\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" families (glass and panes, all 16 stains): \"},{\"text\":\"394\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" variants.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It crafts ornate, diamond-cut and leaded panes you can set straight into a wall."
  ],
  "quest.524BEB75ADCCF8FC.title": "Loom Table",
  "quest.524BEB75ADCCF8FC.quest_subtitle": "Wool that learned to knit.",
  "quest.524BEB75ADCCF8FC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wool and carpet in \"},{\"text\":\"640\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" weaves, all sixteen colors.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:stick\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Three wool, two sticks, three logs and a \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:crafting_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Quilted, wicker, scaled or knitted: pick the texture, keep the color.\"}]",
    "",
    "Good for awnings, banners and cushions that should not all look the same."
  ],
  "task.048824276AA1DDB4.title": "Any odd bench",
  "quest.67186964A9121E15.title": "The Odd Benches",
  "quest.67186964A9121E15.quest_subtitle": "Three benches for what is not a wall.",
  "quest.67186964A9121E15.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One bench each for gardens, minerals and lights.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Botanist Workbench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"chipped:botanist_workbench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": dirt, sand, ice, snow, clay, leaves, mushrooms, pumpkins and melons (\"},{\"text\":\"1,021\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\").\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Alchemy Bench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"chipped:alchemy_bench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": mineral blocks, amethyst, sponge and waxed copper (\"},{\"text\":\"469\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\").\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Tinkering Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"chipped:tinkering_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": lanterns, lamps, iron bars and redstone blocks (\"},{\"text\":\"160\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\").\"}]",
    "",
    "Each one is a crafting table plus two or three trinkets: flower pots for the botanist, a brewing stand and an enchanting table for the alchemist, redstone and two redstone torches for the tinkerer."
  ],
  "quest.037827241AF1036A.title": "Reading the bench",
  "quest.037827241AF1036A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Click a variant to craft one; the preview shows how it tiles.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"The preview switches between single, two by two, horizontal and vertical.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Craft All converts every matching stack in your inventory, not only the input slot.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"The search box filters the variant list by name.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4499259E5C4284D8.title": "Find every variant",
  "quest.4499259E5C4284D8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hover a block and press \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.emi.view_uses\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\": every recipe that uses it shows up.\"}]",
    "",
    "That includes each Chipped, chisel and stonecutter variant.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Press \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.emi.focus_search\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and type @chipped, @mcw or @createdeco to browse a whole mod.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.16FFDBCA7DA034F1.title": "The Rechiseled Chisel",
  "quest.16FFDBCA7DA034F1.quest_subtitle": "Every block gets a second life.",
  "quest.16FFDBCA7DA034F1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One tool turns any block into its cousins.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"628\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" patterns across \"},{\"text\":\"44\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" materials.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rechiseled:chisel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"An iron ingot and a stick, set diagonally.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click, drop blocks in, pick a shape (block, stairs or slab) and a pattern.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Many patterns connect their textures across neighbors; a switch turns that on or off.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"The preview shows 1 by 1, 3 by 1 or 3 by 3, so you can judge a wall before you build it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Filters hide blocks, stairs, slabs or the non-connecting ones.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Chisel all converts the whole stack in one click; hold left shift for every shape. A slab counts as \"},{\"text\":\"half\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" a block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Machines take over from here: see the \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Chisel\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7EA423253377FE28\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.41608458ACC954B5.title": "Chipped, by chisel",
  "quest.41608458ACC954B5.quest_subtitle": "Same catalogue, no bench.",
  "quest.41608458ACC954B5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The chisel reads Chipped's catalogue too.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Rechiseled: Chipped adds \"},{\"text\":\"275\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" chiseling groups covering \"},{\"text\":\"6,879\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" Chipped blocks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Stone becomes \"},{\"text\":\"Carved Stone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"chipped:carved_stone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with the chisel, one for one, as at the bench.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Carry one tool and skip the walk to the bench.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.334286DA8C56FA14.title": "Half a block, half the price",
  "quest.334286DA8C56FA14.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chisel a stair or a slab when you only need the edge.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"A slab is worth \"},{\"text\":\"0.5\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" of a block, so two slabs cost one block.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Turn connected textures off when a wall should look like separate tiles.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Filter to blocks only and the long list gets short.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2DD56B446E130054.title": "Three materials and depth",
  "quest.2DD56B446E130054.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pick two or three main materials and one accent, then repeat them.\"}]",
    "",
    "Heliodor's own palette is tuff, calcite, quartz and waxed oxidized copper.",
    "",
    "Then add depth: windows one block back, walls framed with logs or pillars, roof overhangs.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A row of stairs or slabs at the base of a flat wall changes everything."
  ],
  "quest.3F67FB5103402B8C.title": "Building is free",
  "quest.3F67FB5103402B8C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"No block, bench or chisel here carries an act component, and no Atlas project asks for a specific decorative block.\"}]",
    "",
    "Everything in this street is open from day one, with ordinary materials.",
    "",
    "The Atlas asks for the house, not for the marble."
  ],
  "quest.7486910B168693D2.title": "Tape Measure",
  "quest.7486910B168693D2.quest_subtitle": "Measure twice, place once.",
  "quest.7486910B168693D2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mark two corners and read the distance.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Three gray wool, two yellow wool and an iron ingot.\"}]",
    "",
    "Measure the plot, the farm or the machine room before you place a block.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"LittleTiles has its own \"},{\"text\":\"Little Measure Tape\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"littletiles:measure_tape\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for tiny work.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.48FE30F982594D40.title": "Altar of Levelling",
  "quest.48FE30F982594D40.quest_subtitle": "The land, ironed.",
  "quest.48FE30F982594D40.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Flat ground with the land's own blocks, free.\"}]",
    "",
    "It levels a square with a smooth symmetric slope, or repairs dug land.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sizes, fuel and gestures are in \"},{\"text\":\"The Altar of Levelling\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"531B7B268260E855\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.50C34B4F07576EBA.title": "Heavy builders",
  "quest.50C34B4F07576EBA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The RFTools Builder needs a Handling Core from act III, because it moves huge volumes.\"}]",
    "",
    "Everything else in this street is free from day one.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Mining Gadgets\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6E90715BDE070851\"}},{\"text\":\" wait for act III too, with a reinforced alloy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6480EAD988459A99.title": "A builder's workflow",
  "quest.6480EAD988459A99.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Measure, flatten, raise, swap, detail.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Measure with the tape.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Flatten with the Altar of Levelling or a \"},{\"text\":\"Destruction Gadget\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"528B3A03659E5153\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Raise walls with a \"},{\"text\":\"Construction Stick\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"39516BD2BFA84B5C\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Swap materials with the \"},{\"text\":\"Exchanging Gadget\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0E28AE23180556A5\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Add detail with FramedBlocks, Macaw's and LittleTiles, then \"},{\"text\":\"copy and paste\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"367480B8CD33C733\"}},{\"text\":\" your best house and call it a street.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.195C0B8F12D7F1C5.title": "Look at Solsticio",
  "quest.195C0B8F12D7F1C5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The city at the end of the story is built from the same kinds of blocks you have, around a copper, glass and calcite palette.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"When you get there, look closely and steal ideas. Your \"},{\"text\":\"plot\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0EEC4C8640CDE7BA\"}},{\"text\":\" is 16 by 16 and it is yours to fill.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7E922795EC1E5F3F.title": "Doors with Character",
  "quest.7E922795EC1E5F3F.quest_subtitle": "Knock, knock. Who is it? A shoji.",
  "quest.7E922795EC1E5F3F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Barn, shoji, cottage, modern: doors with a story.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"282\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" door pieces in Macaw's.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:stick\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Barn Door\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwdoors:oak_barn_door\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four planks and two sticks make \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:paper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Shoji Door\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwdoors:oak_japanese_door\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four paper and two planks make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Modern Door\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwdoors:oak_modern_door\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four planks and two glass panes make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wooden pieces are crafted; most stone pieces come from the \"},{\"text\":\"Stonecutter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:stonecutter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Metal doors need redstone power to open.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.26637D3B86A349FD.title": "Door prints",
  "quest.26637D3B86A349FD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wrap a door in paper and you get prints, the templates of every exotic style.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:paper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Four paper around an \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Door\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:oak_door\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Classic Door Print\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwdoors:print_oak\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"A print between two planks makes that style: swamp, nether, mystic, waffle, whispering.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Trapdoors have prints of their own."
  ],
  "quest.748106368A3255E0.title": "Garage and Portcullis",
  "quest.748106368A3255E0.quest_subtitle": "For the house with a workshop.",
  "quest.748106368A3255E0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Roll-down doors and gates for the shop at street level.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"White Garage Door\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwdoors:garage_white_door\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": five iron ingots and a glass make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; dye \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" at a time to black, gray or silver.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Iron Portcullis\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwdoors:iron_portcullis\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three iron bars over three iron ingots make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; the wooden one takes fences.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Place a single garage door on the ceiling: opened, it rolls down.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1901870848FC4CA2.title": "Windows that Fit",
  "quest.1901870848FC4CA2.quest_subtitle": "Glass, but make it resizable.",
  "quest.1901870848FC4CA2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One base, four windows; then any hole you cut, it fills.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:stick\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" sticks around a glass make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Window Base\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwwindows:window_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Four bases and a log make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Resizeable Oak Window\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwwindows:oak_window\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which grows to fill a wider opening.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Half-pane and four-pane bases make eight rectangle or four-pane windows per log.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"315\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" pieces: resizable, rectangle, four-pane, pane, parapets, blinds, shutters and curtains, in every wood and stone.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Window Hammer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwwindows:hammer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": an iron ingot, a nugget and two sticks. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click a window to change its shape.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Window Key\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwwindows:key\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a window base and two iron nuggets. Right-click a window to lock it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.10D02ED3DBFB2C15.title": "Shutters, Blinds and Curtains",
  "quest.10D02ED3DBFB2C15.quest_subtitle": "The house learns to blink.",
  "quest.10D02ED3DBFB2C15.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Dress the window: it opens and closes with a click.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Shutter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwwindows:oak_shutter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three trapdoors in a column make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Blinds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwwindows:oak_blinds\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three slabs over six sticks make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Red Curtain\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwwindows:red_curtain\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two wool in a column make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; a \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Curtain Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwwindows:oak_curtain_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds them.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Louvered shutters take slabs instead of trapdoors. Every one of them is a moving part, so right-click before you decide it is decoration."
  ],
  "quest.2E270670E1203AAD.title": "Roofs",
  "quest.2E270670E1203AAD.quest_subtitle": "Seven slopes and no leaks.",
  "quest.2E270670E1203AAD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Seven roof shapes in \"},{\"text\":\"78\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" materials: the silhouette of the street.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:stick\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Roof\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwroofs:oak_roof\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two logs and a stick make \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; the steep base makes \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Attic (with a glass block for light), top, lower base, steep base, lower top and steep top complete the set.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Stone, brick and concrete roofs come from the \"},{\"text\":\"Stonecutter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:stonecutter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", one for one.\"}]",
    "",
    "Macaw's has nine families: roofs, windows, doors, trapdoors, fences and walls, bridges, stairs and balconies, paths, lights. Wooden pieces are crafted; most stone roofs, stairs, fences, bridges and nearly all paths come from the stonecutter.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mix two slopes on one house; a single pitch reads as a shed.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3D807D4A52B5C833.title": "Roofing Hammer and Gutters",
  "quest.3D807D4A52B5C833.quest_subtitle": "Tap the ridge, hang the gutter.",
  "quest.3D807D4A52B5C833.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One tap flips the top roof between its states.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Roofing Hammer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwroofs:roofing_hammer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" right-click a top roof to toggle it. An iron ingot, two nuggets and a stick.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Base Rain Gutter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwroofs:rain_gutter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the edge that finishes the eave.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Red Striped Awning\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwroofs:red_striped_awning\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two red carpets around a white one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1C68F328FCD3F711.title": "Trapdoors",
  "quest.1C68F328FCD3F711.quest_subtitle": "A floor that opens onto the cellar.",
  "quest.1C68F328FCD3F711.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hatches for cellars, lofts and service rooms, \"},{\"text\":\"199\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" styles.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Glass Trapdoor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwtrpdoors:oak_glass_trapdoor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four planks and two glass panes make \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; a plank over it makes the barn one.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Barrel Trapdoor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwtrpdoors:oak_barrel_trapdoor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four planks around a barrel make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Exotic styles need a print: paper around a trapdoor makes \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6DEE9BDF5781EE84.title": "Stairs",
  "quest.6DEE9BDF5781EE84.quest_subtitle": "Five ways to go up.",
  "quest.6DEE9BDF5781EE84.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Terrace, skyline, compact, bulk and loft: a stair for every floor plan.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Compact Stairs\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwstairs:oak_compact_stairs\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": six stripped logs make \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Terrace makes \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\", skyline \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\", bulk \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" and loft \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Stone, brick and concrete versions come from the \"},{\"text\":\"Stonecutter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:stonecutter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.308C0E9BDEBD7D84.title": "Balconies and Railings",
  "quest.308C0E9BDEBD7D84.quest_subtitle": "Shears as a design tool.",
  "quest.308C0E9BDEBD7D84.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Rails for the stair and a balcony for the wall, restyled with shears.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Balcony\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwstairs:oak_balcony\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": six sticks and two fences make \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; stack up to \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" on one block.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Stair Railing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwstairs:oak_railing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": sits on the side of stairs; six balconies make \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Platform\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwstairs:oak_platform\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the corner piece to build on, two slabs and two logs make \"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Use \"},{\"text\":\"Shears\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:shears\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a balcony or railing to change its style.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6DAB9B724E2DB7F2.title": "A Bridge over the Canal",
  "quest.6DAB9B724E2DB7F2.quest_subtitle": "The shortest line between two banks.",
  "quest.6DAB9B724E2DB7F2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Deck, rails and piers: \"},{\"text\":\"152\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" pieces to cross whatever is in the way.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Bridge\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwbridges:oak_log_bridge_middle\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two fences and three slabs make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Rope Oak Bridge\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwbridges:rope_oak_bridge\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": string instead of fences, for a rope crossing.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Bridge Support\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwbridges:oak_bridge_pier\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two logs and a fence make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" supports.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six bridge pieces make \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" bridge stairs. Stone versions take walls and slabs; iron takes nuggets and ingots. The \"},{\"text\":\"Bridge Lantern\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwbridges:bridge_lantern\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and the \"},{\"text\":\"Bridge Torch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwbridges:bridge_torch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" clip onto the handrails.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Pliers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwbridges:pliers\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three iron nuggets and two iron ingots. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click a bridge to open an entrance in its rail; it works only on bridges two or more wide.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2D5DCE570B6AAE76.title": "Fences",
  "quest.2D5DCE570B6AAE76.quest_subtitle": "Good neighbors, and good pickets.",
  "quest.2D5DCE570B6AAE76.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Picket, stockade, horse and wired: the edge of every garden.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Picket Fence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwfences:oak_picket_fence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": logs, planks and a stick make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Stockade Fence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwfences:oak_stockade_fence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" from logs and planks.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Wired Fence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwfences:oak_wired_fence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": iron bars in the middle, \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Many of them stack upward to grow taller."
  ],
  "quest.094283EC301A7FA0.title": "Gates",
  "quest.094283EC301A7FA0.quest_subtitle": "Two of them, and it is a portal.",
  "quest.094283EC301A7FA0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Curved, highley and pyramid gates for the garden path.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Curved Gate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwfences:oak_curved_gate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two logs and three planks make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Highley Gate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwfences:oak_highley_gate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Pyramid Gate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwfences:oak_pyramid_gate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" each.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Place a second curved gate on top of the first and they join into one tall gate. Each block drops its own item.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.37ED4BFEE8B72A9A.title": "Hedges and Walls",
  "quest.37ED4BFEE8B72A9A.quest_subtitle": "A wall that grows, a wall that stays.",
  "quest.37ED4BFEE8B72A9A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Leaves for a living edge, stone for a lasting one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Hedge\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwfences:oak_hedge\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four leaves make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" hedges.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Modern Stone Brick Wall\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwfences:modern_stone_brick_wall\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": five stone bricks and a cobblestone make \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Stone Brick Railing Gate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwfences:stone_brick_railing_gate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": iron bars and stone bricks, for a gate to match.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Grass-topped, pillar and railing walls come from the same stonecutter routes."
  ],
  "quest.1BD763C4EC00F8A4.title": "Paving",
  "quest.1BD763C4EC00F8A4.quest_subtitle": "The village starts at your feet.",
  "quest.1BD763C4EC00F8A4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One block of stone, many paving stones.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"4\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" paving stones from every block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Put a block in the \"},{\"text\":\"Stonecutter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:stonecutter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Cobblestone Basket Weave Paving\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwpaths:cobblestone_basket_weave_paving\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" comes out four at a time.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Diamond, basket weave, square, honeycomb, clover and dumble for stone; running bond, windmill and flagstone for brick.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"The brick patterns also come as paths, slabs and stairs.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A patterned paving beside a shovel path reads as a lived-in village.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.072F7A59A7A4E48E.title": "Engrave and flatten",
  "quest.072F7A59A7A4E48E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A pickaxe engraves a path, a shovel flattens it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click a path with a pickaxe to engrave it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click with a shovel to flatten it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"A single slab makes \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" plank paths.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.36EF9948421FF1B6.title": "Lamps for the Street",
  "quest.36EF9948421FF1B6.quest_subtitle": "The town hires a lamplighter.",
  "quest.36EF9948421FF1B6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Garden lights, tiki torches and a street lamp for every corner.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Thin Garden Light\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwlights:thin_garden_light\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": an iron ingot, a nugget and glowstone dust.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Street Lamp Post\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwlights:classic_street_lamp\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a lantern, a wooden fence and a stone brick wall make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Tiki Torch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwlights:oak_tiki_torch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a torch on a fence; it stacks taller.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"140\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" pieces in all. Many lamps take any dye with a right-click, so one design fits every color scheme.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.312AB6DAE509D979.title": "Chandeliers and Ceiling Fans",
  "quest.312AB6DAE509D979.quest_subtitle": "Light from above.",
  "quest.312AB6DAE509D979.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lights that hang: chandeliers, candle holders and fans.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Iron Chandelier\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwlights:iron_chandelier\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four iron ingots, two honeycombs and two strings; the golden one takes gold.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Ceiling Fan Light\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwlights:oak_ceiling_fan_light\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": an iron nugget, two iron ingots, a slab and glowstone dust.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"White Paper Lamp\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwlights:white_paper_lamp\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": eight paper around a torch.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0D2382C1E7856E7F.title": "Light as a Material",
  "quest.0D2382C1E7856E7F.quest_subtitle": "Hide the bulb, keep the glow.",
  "quest.0D2382C1E7856E7F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Light strips that follow the wall, so you never see a torch.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:glowstone_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Dynamic Edge Light (bottom)\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"simplylight:edge_light\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three glowstone and four stones make \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"It morphs to the blocks around it when you place it, and keeps that shape after.\"}]",
    "",
    "Run them along a hallway, a stair edge or a ceiling line.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hide light in floors and ceilings instead of dotting torches everywhere.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4FA3A308F1DA1DBA.title": "Switchable Light",
  "quest.4FA3A308F1DA1DBA.quest_subtitle": "A lamp that is also a wall.",
  "quest.4FA3A308F1DA1DBA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Flush light blocks that obey redstone.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Illuminant Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"simplylight:illuminant_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four stones, four glowstone and a redstone dust make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; redstone turns it on and off.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Illuminant Slab\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"simplylight:illuminant_slab\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three glowstone and three stones make \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\", placeable in any direction.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Illuminant Column\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"simplylight:lamp_post\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a three-block post whose top block glows.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Illuminant Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"simplylight:rodlamp\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three stones and six glowstone dust make \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" rods.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.01D40C5A681156DE.title": "Handcrafted: the Living Room",
  "quest.01D40C5A681156DE.quest_subtitle": "Now it has a place to sit.",
  "quest.01D40C5A681156DE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The classic set: a place for everything, a seat for everyone.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"15\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" kinds of furniture in \"},{\"text\":\"11\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" woods.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Chair\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"handcrafted:oak_chair\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a slab, two planks and two sticks make \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"handcrafted:oak_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three planks over two sticks make \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Couches, benches, desks, drawers, cupboards, shelves, nightstands, side tables and beds.\"}]",
    "",
    "Right-click a chair, bench or couch with an empty hand to sit; sneak to stand up.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Corner and pillar trims also come in stone: andesite, bricks, quartz and more.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6E6F0E0486D025F1.title": "The Handcrafted Hammer",
  "quest.6E6F0E0486D025F1.quest_subtitle": "Same sofa, new mood.",
  "quest.6E6F0E0486D025F1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tap a piece and it changes its look or its shape.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Hammer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"handcrafted:hammer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two iron ingots and two sticks.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click changes a piece's shape or its look, depending on the piece.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Some pieces want a sneak-right-click for the look; the tooltip says which.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.09D84CAB11ED7AFC.title": "Cushions and Sheets",
  "quest.09D84CAB11ED7AFC.quest_subtitle": "Sixteen colors of cozy.",
  "quest.09D84CAB11ED7AFC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Six wool and three feathers stuff a whole set of seats.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"16\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" cushions from one batch.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"White Sheet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"handcrafted:white_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three wool make \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" sheets.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click a bed with a cushion to change its pillow, with a sheet to change its bedding.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Couches and fancy beds are built out of cushions and wool.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.256C8232F50E468C.title": "Counters and Crockery",
  "quest.256C8232F50E468C.quest_subtitle": "Set the table before the guests arrive.",
  "quest.256C8232F50E468C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A counter that changes its top, a plate that holds any item.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Counter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"handcrafted:oak_counter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three calcite, two planks and a chest make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; right-click with wood or stone to change the surface.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Crockery combos hold any item you right-click on them, in white, blue, yellow, terracotta or wood.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oven\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"handcrafted:oven\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Kitchen Hood\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"handcrafted:kitchen_hood\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the backdrop of the kitchen wall.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5824608EC6C19D97.title": "Paintings and Trophies",
  "quest.5824608EC6C19D97.quest_subtitle": "The wall says who lives here.",
  "quest.5824608EC6C19D97.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"25\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" fancy paintings and \"},{\"text\":\"19\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" mounted trophies.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Fancy Painting\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"handcrafted:fancy_painting\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a painting and a gold ingot.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Trophies mount an animal or a monster; the creeper one takes five stone and a creeper head.\"}]",
    "",
    "Some small pieces can sit on furniture: the tooltip says which."
  ],
  "quest.41732879A0DB8E73.title": "Another Furniture: Cozy Details",
  "quest.41732879A0DB8E73.quest_subtitle": "Because a room is never done.",
  "quest.41732879A0DB8E73.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chairs that tuck in, curtains that move, sofas in 16 colors.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Hammer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"another_furniture:furniture_hammer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two planks, a slab and two sticks; it restyles some placed pieces.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"another_furniture:oak_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three planks over two sticks make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Chairs tuck in under the table and slide back out.\"}]",
    "",
    "Chairs, shelves, tables, shutters, flower boxes, benches and drawers in 11 woods; sofas, stools, curtains and lamps in all 16 colors."
  ],
  "quest.1BFD27593E16FD3D.title": "Sofas, Lamps and Drawers",
  "quest.1BFD27593E16FD3D.quest_subtitle": "Wool is the whole idea.",
  "quest.1BFD27593E16FD3D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Soft seating and a wool lamp, in every color.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"White Sofa\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"another_furniture:white_sofa\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two planks, three wool and two sticks make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"White Stool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"another_furniture:white_stool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" from two planks, a wool and two sticks; the tall stool adds three more sticks.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"White Lamp\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"another_furniture:white_lamp\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a torch wrapped in wool on a stick, \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Drawer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"another_furniture:oak_drawer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": six planks, two slabs and a stick; it opens as a real container.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Service Bell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"another_furniture:service_bell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": an iron nugget over three iron ingots make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.75AF78D2F06E9B82.title": "Curtains, Shutters and Flower Boxes",
  "quest.75AF78D2F06E9B82.quest_subtitle": "A window with something to say.",
  "quest.75AF78D2F06E9B82.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Dress the window from the inside and the outside.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"White Curtain\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"another_furniture:white_curtain\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two sticks over four wool make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; they slide with a click.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Shutter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"another_furniture:oak_shutter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": six slabs make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Flower Box\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"another_furniture:oak_flower_box\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two slabs, dirt and three planks make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.32DC6502B2C871AA.title": "Where you can sit",
  "quest.32DC6502B2C871AA.quest_subtitle": "Purely cosmetic. Entirely necessary.",
  "quest.32DC6502B2C871AA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Handcrafted and Another Furniture seats take you with an empty hand.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click a chair, bench, stool or couch to sit; sneak to stand up.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Nothing here gives a bonus. It is for co-op evenings and screenshots.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2BE277607ACAB07B.title": "One role per set",
  "quest.2BE277607ACAB07B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each furniture set has a job: Handcrafted for classics, Refurbished Furniture for working appliances, Another Furniture for cozy details and Storage Delight for kitchen storage.\"}]",
    "",
    "Macaw's Furniture stayed out: a third palette with nothing new to do."
  ],
  "quest.39FE892EFCB015B7.title": "Refurbished Furniture: Appliances",
  "quest.39FE892EFCB015B7.quest_subtitle": "Furniture with a plug.",
  "quest.39FE892EFCB015B7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Furniture built at its own powered workbench.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"471\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" pieces to build.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Workbench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:workbench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a stonecutter, a redstone block, an iron ingot, planks and slabs.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"It lists \"},{\"text\":\"444\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" constructions and pulls materials from your inventory, its own storage and the chests beside it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Tables, chairs, desks, sofas, cabinets, beds, hedges and lights, in wood and in color.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.17776D09FC64AB58.title": "Electricity for Your Home",
  "quest.17776D09FC64AB58.quest_subtitle": "Check the cable before the fuse.",
  "quest.17776D09FC64AB58.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A small grid of its own: fuel a generator and link the devices with a wrench.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Light Electricity Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:light_electricity_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": seven iron ingots, a redstone block and a blast furnace.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": link one node, then the other. Three iron ingots, two strings and leather.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Defaults: power reaches \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks around the generator; a device takes \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" links, a generator \"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" and a network \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" devices.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A screen that says missing power is not linked to a running generator.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.05064D03BCFC7E1C.title": "The Working Kitchen",
  "quest.05064D03BCFC7E1C.quest_subtitle": "Every appliance, its own recipes.",
  "quest.05064D03BCFC7E1C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fridge, freezer, stove, oven, microwave, toaster and cutting board, each with recipes of its own.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Light Fridge\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:light_fridge\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": nine iron, three copper and four redstone at the workbench.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"The freezer makes \"},{\"text\":\"Blue Ice\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blue_ice\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from packed ice in \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" minutes.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oven and microwave bake a potato in \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" seconds; toaster and pan make a cheese toastie in \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"The cutting board slices with \"},{\"text\":\"41\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" recipes and combines with \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.170032FA1FE53CE7.title": "Screens and HomeControl",
  "quest.170032FA1FE53CE7.quest_subtitle": "The smart home, minus the app store.",
  "quest.170032FA1FE53CE7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A television, a computer and lights you switch from a program.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Television\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:television\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": eight iron, two copper, a glass, sixteen redstone and two amethyst shards.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Computer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:computer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": twelve iron, three copper, a glass, twenty-four redstone and two amethyst shards.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"HomeControl turns the power of any device on the same network on and off; rename devices on an anvil first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5EA0DD3021C6C45E.title": "Mail Between Players",
  "quest.5EA0DD3021C6C45E.quest_subtitle": "The friendliest way to share.",
  "quest.5EA0DD3021C6C45E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Send a package to any mailbox on the server, no meetup needed.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Post Box\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:post_box\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": ten iron, eight planks and a blue dye at the workbench.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Mailbox\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:oak_mail_box\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": eight planks, the receiving end.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Pick a mailbox from the list (search players with @), load the slots, add a message and send.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3CBC36D83286A585.title": "The Bathroom and the Garden",
  "quest.3CBC36D83286A585.quest_subtitle": "Every house needs one. Even this one.",
  "quest.3CBC36D83286A585.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Toilet, basin and bath, in \"},{\"text\":\"26\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" materials.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Toilet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:oak_toilet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three planks, five quartz blocks, iron and copper at the workbench.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Bath\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:oak_bath\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": five planks and eight quartz blocks make the tub.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Basin\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:oak_basin\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the sink.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Out the back door: \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Hedge\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:oak_hedge\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (six leaves at the workbench), lattice fences and gates in ten woods, five kinds of stepping stones and a \"},{\"text\":\"White Trampoline\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refurbished_furniture:white_trampoline\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (four iron, eight string, a white dye and a slime ball).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.655997FD290E2F74.title": "Heavy furniture stays",
  "quest.655997FD290E2F74.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Carry On refuses kitchen blocks, Farmer's Delight blocks and Sophisticated and Functional storage, on purpose.\"}]",
    "",
    "Break and replace them, or use Packing Tape on Sophisticated chests.",
    "",
    "Plain chests, barrels and furnaces still travel."
  ],
  "quest.3289836EB14EC8B3.title": "FramedBlocks: Any Texture",
  "quest.3289836EB14EC8B3.quest_subtitle": "An empty frame with opinions.",
  "quest.3289836EB14EC8B3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every shape wears the texture of whatever block you give it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Framed Cube\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:framed_cube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four planks and four sticks make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click a placed frame with any block: a copper sloped roof, a stone door.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"200+\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" shapes: slabs, stairs, panels, slopes, corners, doors, fences and more.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blocks with block entities, and non-solid blocks, cannot be used as a camo.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.03545816791C2840.title": "The Framing Saw",
  "quest.03545816791C2840.quest_subtitle": "Every shape, one saw.",
  "quest.03545816791C2840.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lists every frame shape and cuts the one you pick from cubes.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Framing Saw\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:framing_saw\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": an iron ingot over three framed cubes.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"A cube is worth \"},{\"text\":\"6,144\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" material, a slab \"},{\"text\":\"3,072\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\", a chest \"},{\"text\":\"24,576\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Powered Framing Saw\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:powered_framing_saw\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs on energy: two redstone dust, an iron ingot and three cubes.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"When a shape needs too much at once, cut a smaller block first and use it as the intermediate step. A mode of the saw even encodes AE2 patterns.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.66D34FD3FF9FAF0A.title": "Framed Tools and Tricks",
  "quest.66D34FD3FF9FAF0A.quest_subtitle": "Wrench, hammer, axe and blueprint.",
  "quest.66D34FD3FF9FAF0A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The tools that finish a frame: rotate, toggle, keep the camo, copy.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Framed Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:framed_wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": rotates and configures (slope faces, split lines, one-way windows). Two cubes and two sticks.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Framed Hammer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:framed_hammer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": toggles waterlogging, copycat style and trapdoor texture rotation.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Framed Axe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:framed_axe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": frames it breaks keep their camo.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Framed Blueprint\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:framed_blueprint\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": copies a frame with its camo and places copies from your materials; \"},{\"text\":\"Framed Reinforcement\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:framed_reinforcement\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" marks one as reinforced.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Framed Glowing Cube\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:framed_glowing_cube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes a cube and four glowstone dust.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7BF9F24FC03E38E9.title": "One-Way Window",
  "quest.7BF9F24FC03E38E9.quest_subtitle": "You see out. They see the wall.",
  "quest.7BF9F24FC03E38E9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Glass that is see-through from one side only.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Framed One-Way Window\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:framed_one_way_window\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four tinted glass and four cubes make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Hit it with a \"},{\"text\":\"Framed Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:framed_wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to set the see-through side; crouch to clear it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2ABFC8B03407EFD0.title": "LittleTiles: Inside a Block",
  "quest.2ABFC8B03407EFD0.quest_subtitle": "The block was always too big.",
  "quest.2ABFC8B03407EFD0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Build with pieces much smaller than a block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Little Chisel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"littletiles:chisel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two iron ingots over a lapis places shapes.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Little Hammer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"littletiles:hammer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three iron ingots and two lapis; it carves shapes back out.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Little Bag\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"littletiles:bag\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": holds your materials and colors.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Press \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.little.config.item\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" with a tool in hand to set the grid size and the shape, and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.little.undo\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" to take a step back.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.76C3E5C80DCF2CDD.title": "Glove, Saw and Wrench",
  "quest.76C3E5C80DCF2CDD.quest_subtitle": "Nudge a tile. Then nudge it back.",
  "quest.76C3E5C80DCF2CDD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Move what you placed instead of breaking it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Little Glove\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"littletiles:glove\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four leather around a lapis; picks a block, selects a shape, moves corners.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Little Saw\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"littletiles:saw\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": extends or shrinks a tile.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Little Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"littletiles:wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": rebuilds the block cache and shows signals.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.740A53928698B346.title": "Paint and Bottles",
  "quest.740A53928698B346.quest_subtitle": "Each tile picks its own color.",
  "quest.740A53928698B346.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Color any tile, one at a time.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Little Paint Brush\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"littletiles:paint_brush\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three white wool over two lapis.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Dyeable blocks (clean, floor, brick, stone, sand, water and more) take the color.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Bottles of black, cyan, magenta, yellow and alpha hold a color; a glass makes an alpha bottle.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4C2F9A63176C8DFE.title": "LittleTiles Doors",
  "quest.4C2F9A63176C8DFE.quest_subtitle": "A bookshelf that is also a door.",
  "quest.4C2F9A63176C8DFE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Save a selection as a structure and some structures move.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Little Blueprint\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"littletiles:blueprint\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": seven paper around a lapis and redstone make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Doors slide or rotate by the distance and angle you choose, and can open with a right-click.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A secret bookshelf door made of tiny pieces is a rite of passage.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2771EACBE36B31C3.title": "Signals",
  "quest.2771EACBE36B31C3.quest_subtitle": "Redstone, but tiny.",
  "quest.2771EACBE36B31C3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tiny inputs, outputs and cables that carry 1, 4 or 16 signals.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Signal Converter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"littletiles:signal_converter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a redstone block over a cobblestone.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Clock and daylight sensors, displays and cables are premade structures you craft from ordinary ingredients.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"With the \"},{\"text\":\"Little Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"littletiles:wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in hand you see the signals and can edit a structure's signals.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.76FD0835952BE5CB.title": "Tiny tiles cost frames",
  "quest.76FD0835952BE5CB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every LittleTiles block can hold a lot of geometry, and your graphics card pays for it.\"}]",
    "",
    "The server cost is not distinguishable from noise; how much the client pays is not measured yet.",
    "",
    "Use it for statues, furniture and signs. For big surfaces, FramedBlocks or Copycats."
  ],
  "quest.29A2A50413524CD2.title": "Glass That Does Things",
  "quest.29A2A50413524CD2.quest_subtitle": "Walk through the shop window.",
  "quest.29A2A50413524CD2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ghostly, ethereal and reverse glass: windows you can walk through.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Ghostly Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"glassential:glass_ghostly\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four glass and an ender pearl make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; entities pass through.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Ethereal Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"glassential:glass_ethereal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": with an ender eye instead; players pass, mobs do not.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"The reverse version does the opposite: only players are stopped.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Dark ethereal glass blocks light: eight tinted glass and an ender eye make \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\". Glass doors, trapdoors and panes come in each kind.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0822A973082E8F17.title": "Glass with Light and Signal",
  "quest.0822A973082E8F17.quest_subtitle": "Windows that glow, windows that talk.",
  "quest.0822A973082E8F17.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Light glass shines, redstone glass shouts.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Luminous Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"glassential:glass_light\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": eight glass around a glowstone make \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; it emits light.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"glassential:glass_redstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": eight glass around a redstone block make \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; it emits a redstone signal.\"}]",
    "",
    "See the wiring through the wall without opening it."
  ],
  "quest.72B2E82365EEC601.title": "One-Way Glass",
  "quest.72B2E82365EEC601.quest_subtitle": "A secret window, a very polite one.",
  "quest.72B2E82365EEC601.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Transparent from one side, solid from the other.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"One Way Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"glassential:one_way_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": six glass, an observer and a black dye make \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click a face with any block to disguise that side.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3838BB4122F04642.title": "Smart Glass",
  "quest.3838BB4122F04642.quest_subtitle": "Privacy on a redstone timer.",
  "quest.3838BB4122F04642.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Frosts over while redstone powers it, and light still gets through.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Smart Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"glassential:smart_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": six glass, two redstone and an amethyst shard make \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"One signal frosts the whole connected panel.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0055ED9C44D27E9B.title": "The Glassential Brush",
  "quest.0055ED9C44D27E9B.quest_subtitle": "One pane, your rules.",
  "quest.0055ED9C44D27E9B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Choose a color and what the glass does.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Glassential Brush\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"glassential:glass_painter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": red, green and blue dye, a stick and quartz.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Set the color, whether it emits light or a signal, and whether players or all entities pass.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Sneak-right-click any block to copy its color into the brush.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6931432A738EE99F.title": "Glass with a Job",
  "quest.6931432A738EE99F.quest_subtitle": "Blast-proof, ice-cold, feather-soft.",
  "quest.6931432A738EE99F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four more glasses for four more problems.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Obsidian Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"glassential:obsidian_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four obsidian and four glass make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; resistant to explosions.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Ice Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"glassential:ice_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": eight glass around ice; the ice inside does not melt.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Gravity Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"glassential:gravity_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": eight iron glass around a cobweb; it softens a fall and has no collision.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Lava Lamp\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"glassential:glass_lava_lamp\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": eight glass around a lava bucket; a natural lantern that burns like magma.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7A6CE5FCA1EB96A0.title": "Supplementaries: Keep and Show",
  "quest.7A6CE5FCA1EB96A0.quest_subtitle": "Every shelf deserves a small mob.",
  "quest.7A6CE5FCA1EB96A0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blocks that hold things and show them off.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Jar\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:jar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": seven glass and a slab; holds bowls, bottles, buckets, cookies and small mobs.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Sack\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:sack\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": seven flax and a string; quite heavy to carry.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Item Shelf\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:item_shelf\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three slabs make \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; \"},{\"text\":\"Pedestal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:pedestal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Hat Stand\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:hat_stand\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" show items and armor.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Notice Board\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:notice_board\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": pins a book or a map for everyone.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2A79E25091CC60D7.title": "Flags, Awnings and Buntings",
  "quest.2A79E25091CC60D7.quest_subtitle": "The block party, in cloth.",
  "quest.2A79E25091CC60D7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cloth for the street: flags, awnings and buntings on ropes.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"White Flag\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:flag_white\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": six white wool and a rod; sixteen colors.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Awning\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:awning\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three flax and two rods make \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Buntings hang from \"},{\"text\":\"Rope\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:rope\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" flax make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" ropes.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Flower boxes hold any big plant; doormats take a message.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Sconce\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:sconce\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three iron nuggets and a torch.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Candle Holder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:candle_holder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a candle over an iron ingot; they stack, in sixteen dyes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.04D267CE52464475.title": "Timber Frames",
  "quest.04D267CE52464475.quest_subtitle": "Half-timbered in a hurry.",
  "quest.04D267CE52464475.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A frame that takes any full block: half-timbered walls in a click.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Timber Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:timber_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four rods make \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Add braces and cross-braces for the diagonals.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Daub\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:daub\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": clay and straw fill the gaps, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" at a time.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.20D8F1BE7C233582.title": "Blackboards and Signs",
  "quest.20D8F1BE7C233582.quest_subtitle": "Write on the walls. Legally.",
  "quest.20D8F1BE7C233582.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A wall you can draw on, and signs that point somewhere.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Blackboard\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:blackboard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": opens an editor with clear and undo.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Oak Way Sign\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:way_sign_oak\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": an oak sign makes \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"; it points to a place, with the distance.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Globe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:globe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a spinning map of the world, sold by the Wandering Trader.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.460D72D9BCBC9693.title": "Supplementaries: Gadgets",
  "quest.460D72D9BCBC9693.quest_subtitle": "Redstone with better manners.",
  "quest.460D72D9BCBC9693.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Small machines for the street: timers, weather vanes and locks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Hourglass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:hourglass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": five glass and two gold ingots; accepts any dust, sand or powder.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Wind Vane\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:wind_vane\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": reacts to the weather.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Turn Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:turn_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": turns the block on top.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Lock Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:lock_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Key\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:key\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a locked door or hatch opens only to its key.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2C5C641F7EA38538.title": "Supplementaries: Carry Tools",
  "quest.2C5C641F7EA38538.quest_subtitle": "Yes, the cannon. Almost anything.",
  "quest.2C5C641F7EA38538.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Gear for the street's less peaceful moments.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Quiver\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:quiver\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": holds arrows; open it with \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"supplementaries.keybind.quiver\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Slingshot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:slingshot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": throws blocks and items.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Cannon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:cannon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": fires almost anything.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Cage\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:cage\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": catches small or tamed animals; \"},{\"text\":\"Present\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:present\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" wraps items for a player.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Lunch Basket\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:lunch_basket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": carries food, and switches between open and closed.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3D63FBB8415A0FF7.title": "Amendments: Hung, Not Placed",
  "quest.3D63FBB8415A0FF7.quest_subtitle": "Vanilla, minus the old annoyances.",
  "quest.3D63FBB8415A0FF7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Things vanilla only lets you set on the floor now hang.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lantern\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Lanterns go on walls.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Flower pots hang from ceilings; banners hang from ceilings too.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Tools and other items hang from tripwire hooks; items can sit on hanging signs.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Amendments is the small mod Supplementaries split off: it changes vanilla instead of adding blocks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Carpets lie on stairs and slabs and follow their shape.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Skulls stack into piles and take a candle on top.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6B20CE4527623E69.title": "The Enhanced Cauldron",
  "quest.6B20CE4527623E69.quest_subtitle": "It mixes now. Keep it away from your good robe.",
  "quest.6B20CE4527623E69.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Dye water, mix potions and craft from a cauldron.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Dye the water any color, and mix dyes.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Mix potions in one cauldron, up to a limit of effects.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"Craft by clicking on it, or by throwing items in.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A potion mix that looks unstable warns you first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.132C807FE691F1ED.title": "Quirk: cake bites count",
  "quest.132C807FE691F1ED.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A bite of an Amendments cake still counts for satiety overflow.\"}]",
    "",
    "Cakes can be eaten from any side, and two stack into a double cake.",
    "",
    "Food eaten from a block, like a cake or a Farmer's Delight pie, is measured like food from your hand.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"How the surplus turns into buffs: \"},{\"text\":\"Satiety\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"795AA46FEC18B774\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.51C225BD4788BF98.title": "You spin me right round",
  "quest.51C225BD4788BF98.quest_subtitle": "The world, at ludicrous speed.",
  "quest.51C225BD4788BF98.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You spun a \"},{\"text\":\"Globe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:globe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" until it blurred.\"}]",
    "",
    "The Wandering Trader sells them, and no one is sure why the trader carries a world around."
  ],
  "reward.1E7599E9792D09F9.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.62303C029BBE85EF.title": "How the turn tables",
  "quest.62303C029BBE85EF.quest_subtitle": "Vertigo, but on purpose.",
  "quest.62303C029BBE85EF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You rode a \"},{\"text\":\"Turn Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:turn_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and turned with it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Some carousels start as a wooden block and a bad idea."
  ],
  "reward.79E98B176F65042A.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.712D4447D3730ED8.title": "Tide pod challenge",
  "quest.712D4447D3730ED8.quest_subtitle": "Squeaky clean, from the inside.",
  "quest.712D4447D3730ED8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You ate a bar of \"},{\"text\":\"Soap\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:soap\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Not a food. Six bars come from a water bucket, four ash and a porkchop, and they are meant for glass and blocks.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.3FFA4FD34EE76184.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.6A942B212ED50D01.title": "Angry birds",
  "quest.6A942B212ED50D01.quest_subtitle": "The parrot did not consent.",
  "quest.6A942B212ED50D01.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You tossed a parrot with a \"},{\"text\":\"Slingshot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:slingshot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It flew, if you call that flying."
  ],
  "reward.29DC792A4B1EEB80.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.7CA6E6BED55DCC23.title": "A wall with a secret",
  "quest.7CA6E6BED55DCC23.quest_subtitle": "It looks like a wall. It is not.",
  "quest.7CA6E6BED55DCC23.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You built a \"},{\"text\":\"Framed Secret Storage\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:framed_secret_storage\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Framed Chest\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"framedblocks:framed_chest\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in a ring of four framed cubes, dressed in the block you chose.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.772074662CEF8455.title": "Secret found",
  "task.7BBAE9A9518BACC7.title": "Any planks",
  "quest.5E37955E2D09D05E.title": "Planks for the scaffolding",
  "quest.5E37955E2D09D05E.quest_subtitle": "Somebody always needs one more board.",
  "quest.5E37955E2D09D05E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"For the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"64\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" planks of any wood.\"}]",
    "",
    "Every street starts with scaffolding, and scaffolding starts with someone else's spare boards."
  ],
  "quest.4F984983211888C2.title": "The Street Is Alive",
  "quest.4F984983211888C2.quest_subtitle": "Lights on, sign up, somebody home.",
  "quest.4F984983211888C2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four lamps and a sign: the street has a name and does not go dark.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Street Lamp Post\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mcwlights:classic_street_lamp\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", one per corner.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F0C98A\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Way Sign\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"supplementaries:way_sign_oak\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at the crossing.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Everything in this street was optional except the way from the first bench to the last lamp. Yours will not look like anyone else's."
  ],
  "quest.0473E1A8B9E6CD53.title": "Flip the switch",
  "quest.0473E1A8B9E6CD53.quest_subtitle": "Every lamp on the block.",
  "quest.0473E1A8B9E6CD53.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The lamplighter retires: one switch does the whole street.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nothing to build. Just the click."
  ],
  "quest.500370508F826412.title": "Fly the flag",
  "quest.500370508F826412.quest_subtitle": "Whose, exactly, is up to you.",
  "quest.500370508F826412.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A flag on the roof, because a finished building deserves one.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nothing to build. Just a wave."
  ],
  "image.5AA13D2DD8831208.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Building\",\"color\":\"#F2E6C4\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.58774B6A00B6B228.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The street that goes up\",\"color\":\"#9FB7C9\"}]",
  "image.46F0B3F335E97C02.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.7212BA96832718B6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Stonemason's Yard\",\"color\":\"#F2E6C4\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.6F4D5075A428B521.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The plan\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.2C06765940DDEC19.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The House\",\"color\":\"#F2E6C4\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.4BE8F76CACE7C4CD.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Canal\",\"color\":\"#F2E6C4\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.48417F6215AA4D4C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Furnished House\",\"color\":\"#F2E6C4\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.4B25E6AD9DC2A58B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Detail Workshop\",\"color\":\"#F2E6C4\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.0F90942E45A2441F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Corner\",\"color\":\"#F2E6C4\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.40F9E38DDD1DEAB4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The street is alive\",\"color\":\"#FFE9A0\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "chapter.46031A63FF5A5CFD.title": "Death without stress: Tombstone",
  "chapter.46031A63FF5A5CFD.chapter_subtitle": [
    "What happens when you die, how to get your things back and how to die less."
  ],
  "task.02C10713F1534C14.title": "Have a grave raised where you fall",
  "quest.5B2E78124626820D.title": "Your first grave",
  "quest.5B2E78124626820D.quest_subtitle": "Dying is paperwork.",
  "quest.5B2E78124626820D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Everything you carried waits in a grave, right where you fell.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"You come back with a \"},{\"text\":\"Grave Key\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:grave_key\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"On the default settings, no item is ever lost.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Experience is another story: \"},{\"text\":\"read the tip\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1737CEC68644F367\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Dying again before you reach the grave fills the same grave instead of raising a new one.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Items lying within \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" blocks of where you died go into it too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.00B31EEBD396DE86.title": "The Grave Key",
  "quest.00B31EEBD396DE86.quest_subtitle": "Your grave's own GPS.",
  "quest.00B31EEBD396DE86.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It shows your grave from afar and opens it up close.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click the grave, or \"},{\"text\":\"sneak\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" over it, and everything comes back.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"The key marks the grave from a distance, in the same dimension.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Every respawn hands you a new one.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Nobody else can open your grave, unless a player killed you: then it opens for anyone.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sneaking over it opens the grave on its own, key or no key.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.104A12BF2CCE58CC.title": "Grave Dust",
  "quest.104A12BF2CCE58CC.quest_subtitle": "Your cat is doing its best.",
  "quest.104A12BF2CCE58CC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The base of almost everything Tombstone makes.\"}]",
    "",
    "Undead drop it, cats bring it as a morning gift, and a broken Lost Tablet can leave some.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Gather \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" pinches.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It goes into marble, scrolls, tablets, books, the Ankh and a dozen small things.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Grave Guardian will swap \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" bones for one dust.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.0D1C768F445DE0B1.title": "Any grave marble",
  "quest.30CFA1170E3DD6BA.title": "Grave Marble",
  "quest.30CFA1170E3DD6BA.quest_subtitle": "Stone that went to a funeral.",
  "quest.30CFA1170E3DD6BA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Stone and dust, tinted five ways.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Dark\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:dark_marble\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": stone and dust\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"White\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:white_marble\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": plus \"},{\"text\":\"Bone Meal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:bone_meal\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Blue\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:blue_marble\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": plus \"},{\"text\":\"Lapis Lazuli\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lapis_lazuli\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Green\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:green_marble\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": plus \"},{\"text\":\"Emerald\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:emerald\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Carmin\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:carmin_marble\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": plus \"},{\"text\":\"Red Sand\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:red_sand\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Slabs, stairs and walls come from any marble: \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" marble makes \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" slabs; \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" stairs or \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" walls.\"}]",
    "",
    "Marble shrugs off explosions."
  ],
  "quest.40BA79109159DE14.title": "Essence of Undeath",
  "quest.40BA79109159DE14.quest_subtitle": "Every grave needs a little of the other side.",
  "quest.40BA79109159DE14.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Marble alone makes no graves: each one eats an essence.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"A rare drop from undead\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Fished up from deep water\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"A cat's morning gift\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The quickest first one: pick your grave style in Tombstone's in-game config. \\\"Die Classy\\\" pays one.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Some hard advancements pay one too, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Grave Guardian\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7DDE29188DC88DB0\"}},{\"text\":\" trades a mount's receptacle for one.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.19DDB757B97530D3.title": "Craft a decorative grave",
  "quest.42A106DBB5513810.title": "Decorative graves",
  "quest.42A106DBB5513810.quest_subtitle": "A small cemetery, by request.",
  "quest.42A106DBB5513810.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three to five marbles and one essence raise a grave to keep.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" shapes: simple, normal, cross, tombstone, Subaraki, original\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" marbles to colour them\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"They smoke at night, and a pickaxe or shovel takes them home\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Name one: a \"},{\"text\":\"Memorial Plaque\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:grave_plate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" stone around a \"},{\"text\":\"Grave Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:grave_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Engrave it on an \"},{\"text\":\"Anvil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:anvil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with an \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", then set it on the grave.\"}]",
    "",
    "The prayers, souls and magic of the chapter all happen here."
  ],
  "task.5DBD20C12495066F.title": "Enchant an item with a grave soul",
  "quest.3DFE9190D37AA4A8.title": "A soul on the grave",
  "quest.3DFE9190D37AA4A8.quest_subtitle": "Bring something to enchant. It brings the ghost.",
  "quest.3DFE9190D37AA4A8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Some decorative graves get haunted, and a haunted grave enchants what you hold.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click it with a key, scroll, tablet, poppet or book.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Every \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" min a grave with no soul has a \"},{\"text\":\"25%\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" chance of getting one\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"About \"},{\"text\":\"1 in 10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" souls is blue, and stronger\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Overuse builds corruption: the grave screams, throws bones and refuses rituals until it calms.\"}]",
    "",
    "Corruption grows with some enchantments, heavy use of ancient rites and a half-spent blue soul. It fades with time, faster in Spring Bloom, and with prayers."
  ],
  "quest.766C9D99AAF5C9E3.title": "The Ankh of Prayer",
  "quest.766C9D99AAF5C9E3.quest_subtitle": "Pray a little. Die a lot less.",
  "quest.766C9D99AAF5C9E3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pray at a decorative grave for a blessing and a point of knowledge.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Hold right-click near a decorative grave.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Grave Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:grave_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Sticks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:stick\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Gold Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:gold_ingot\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"One prayer per \"},{\"text\":\"60\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" min\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Away from graves the Ankh prays over villagers and undead, depending on your \"},{\"text\":\"alignment\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6600319DA3B82125\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.3FD0FDACB846120D.title": "Earn your first knowledge point",
  "quest.65A3220C074C58F9.title": "Knowledge of Death",
  "quest.65A3220C074C58F9.quest_subtitle": "Points for dying well.",
  "quest.65A3220C074C58F9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Prayers, advancements and freed souls pay points you spend on perks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Prayers\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" point each\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Tombstone's advancements\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" each\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Freeing a soul\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" from a Receptacle of Soul: \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Enchanting\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" items at haunted graves\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Open the Knowledge screen with its key in Controls, or click the message that pops up when you level.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each level delays phantoms by \"},{\"text\":\"10%\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.0BE9C0EBAE5E211B.title": "Reach level 10 in Knowledge of Death",
  "quest.20F71F03CB9DD338.title": "Ten levels of death",
  "quest.20F71F03CB9DD338.quest_subtitle": "Somebody hand this ghost a medal.",
  "quest.20F71F03CB9DD338.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ten levels in, dying is a hobby with benefits.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Reach \"},{\"text\":\"Level 10\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"The advancement pays a \"},{\"text\":\"Gemstone of Familiar\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:gemstone_of_familiar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Level 20\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" is the next stop: Mastery 2.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7BA0E55F8D146C7C.title": "Ghostly Shape",
  "quest.7BA0E55F8D146C7C.quest_subtitle": "The two minutes after you die.",
  "quest.7BA0E55F8D146C7C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Spend the ghost time walking to your grave, not fighting: creatures leave you alone and damage slides off.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It lasts \"},{\"text\":\"120 s\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Down to \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" s once you pick up the grave's items\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Capped at \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" s if you teleport with a key\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Attacking, opening a chest, breaking a block or shoving a hostile creature ends it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1737CEC68644F367.title": "Keep your experience",
  "quest.1737CEC68644F367.quest_subtitle": "Items come back. Levels mostly don't.",
  "quest.1737CEC68644F367.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The grave returns your items, but by default \"},{\"text\":\"95%\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" of your experience is gone.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Experience lost on death: \"},{\"text\":\"95%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Perk \"},{\"text\":\"Memento Mori\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"20%\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" less loss per level\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Scroll of Preservation\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_preservation\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": keeps it through a death\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Scroll of Knowledge\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_knowledge\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": stores your levels and gives them back, no loss by default\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.313E939E0182E31D.title": "Find it on the map",
  "quest.313E939E0182E31D.quest_subtitle": "A beam on the horizon.",
  "quest.313E939E0182E31D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"JourneyMap drops a Death waypoint where you fall: follow its beam.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Return Scroll\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"waystones:return_scroll\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or a waystone near the spot saves most of the walk.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "In the Aether, falling off an island drops you into the Overworld instead of killing you; a grave, if any, stays where you actually died."
  ],
  "task.02BBF68856AC521C.title": "Enchant your Grave Key",
  "task.23924CC1D5950ADA.title": "Teleport to your grave",
  "quest.3882431F9809F0FC.title": "A key that teleports",
  "quest.3882431F9809F0FC.quest_subtitle": "Walk back? Never heard of it.",
  "quest.3882431F9809F0FC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One ender pearl turns the key into a ticket straight to your grave.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Hold right-click with it to teleport.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Combine the \"},{\"text\":\"Grave Key\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:grave_key\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Pearl\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_pearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in your inventory, like filling a bundle. A haunted grave does it too.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Arrive ready: the trip caps Ghostly Shape at \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" s.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Jailer perk gives each level a \"},{\"text\":\"20%\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" chance of being born with the key already enchanted.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.133E7F3115F3B234.title": "Other ways to keep your things",
  "quest.133E7F3115F3B234.quest_subtitle": "Belt and braces.",
  "quest.133E7F3115F3B234.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tombstone is not the only net under you.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Charm of Keeping I\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:charm_of_keeping_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": returns your items after a death\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Phantom Chestplate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:phantom_chestplate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": Phantom armor is never lost\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Voodoo Poppet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:voodoo_poppet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": cancels one death\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Receptacle of Soul\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:receptacle_of_soul\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": breaks in your place\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Cursium Chestplate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"cataclysm:cursium_chestplate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": revives you at \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" health with \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" s of invincibility, then a \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" min lockout\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Totem of Undying\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:totem_of_undying\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the classic\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.69A50A20C65D42DD.title": "For the server owner",
  "quest.69A50A20C65D42DD.quest_subtitle": "Read it before the first complaint.",
  "quest.69A50A20C65D42DD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A few commands and a safety net.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"/tbshowlastgrave\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\": where a player's last grave is\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"/tbteleport death\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\": your last death spot\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"/tbrestoreinventory\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\": restores a player's last grave\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"/tbrecovery\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\": saves and restores player backups\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Backups run every \"},{\"text\":\"40\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" min and keep \"},{\"text\":\"15\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" copies per player.\"}]",
    "",
    "The pack keeps Tombstone's defaults: no random item loss, graves that fill up instead of multiplying, and a grave from a player-versus-player death opens for anyone."
  ],
  "task.1DE5C94B7A6E1A85.title": "Cancel your Ghostly Shape",
  "quest.015DF3657936A222.title": "Here they come",
  "quest.015DF3657936A222.quest_subtitle": "You woke the neighbours.",
  "quest.015DF3657936A222.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Attack, open a chest or break a block, and the ghost is gone.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The advancement pays a pinch of \"},{\"text\":\"Grave Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:grave_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.0979A40BCF4C4D75.title": "Secret found",
  "task.07608D71D765A08E.title": "Find an abandoned grave",
  "quest.061C9AE12F251550.title": "Abandoned graves",
  "quest.061C9AE12F251550.quest_subtitle": "Nobody visits. Somebody should.",
  "quest.061C9AE12F251550.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lonely graves in the Overworld, on land and on the sea floor.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click one to plunder it: loot and \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" knowledge points\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Land ones come with witches; ocean ones, a guardian\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Ten plunders earn Tomb Raider."
  ],
  "task.18B4100405C42E64.title": "Trade with a Grave Guardian",
  "quest.7DDE29188DC88DB0.title": "The Grave Guardian",
  "quest.7DDE29188DC88DB0.quest_subtitle": "Bargaining with Death, on a budget.",
  "quest.7DDE29188DC88DB0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A ghostly merchant sometimes turns up beside a haunted grave.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Tier 1: \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" bones for a dust; \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" marbles for a Lost Tablet\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Tier 3: \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" Wither skulls for a Receptacle of Soul\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Tier 4: a receptacle holding an undead mount for an essence\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It restocks every \"},{\"text\":\"60\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" min and keeps \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" blocks from other guardians.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It also sells potions of Discretion, Earthly Garden and Restoration, and Frostbite arrows."
  ],
  "task.0C3887B57188CA9A.title": "Use the magic of a blue soul",
  "quest.456930EEDA41E9F1.title": "A blue soul",
  "quest.456930EEDA41E9F1.quest_subtitle": "Ancient magic, delivered by ghost.",
  "quest.456930EEDA41E9F1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blue souls make ancient things: stronger tablets and old stories.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"About \"},{\"text\":\"1 in 10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" souls is blue; \"},{\"text\":\"3 in 10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" around Halloween\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Ancient tablets take nearby creatures along, and call other players to you\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Five stories come in four pages each. With all four in hand, a blue soul unlocks the story's boon:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Silent Bond\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": the undead ignore you unless you attack\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Elyra's Diary\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": better prayers at graves\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Coral Chant\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": breathe easy under the waves\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Erdos's Fragments\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": more experience\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Nights of Nour\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": a flying carpet\"}]"
  ],
  "task.772E715F5219F203.title": "Craft a magic scroll",
  "quest.34A8C9D3EA1C3B96.title": "Scrolls",
  "quest.34A8C9D3EA1C3B96.quest_subtitle": "Spells with a short shelf life.",
  "quest.34A8C9D3EA1C3B96.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Paper, sticks and dust make a Strange Scroll; one more thing gives it a spell.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Strange Scroll\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:strange_scroll\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Paper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:paper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Sticks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:stick\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Grave Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:grave_dust\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Combine it in your inventory with the spell's ingredient\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Enchant it at a haunted grave, then hold right-click to cast: the scroll is spent\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each spell is a scroll plus one thing.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A cast lasts \"},{\"text\":\"10 min\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Knowledge\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_knowledge\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Glowstone Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:glowstone_dust\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Preservation\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_preservation\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Rabbit's Foot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:rabbit_foot\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Feather Fall\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_feather_fall\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Feather\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:feather\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Purification\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_purification\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Lapis Lazuli\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lapis_lazuli\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"True Sight\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_true_sight\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Fermented Spider Eye\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:fermented_spider_eye\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Reach\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_reach\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Sunflower\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sunflower\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Lightning Resistance\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_lightning_resistance\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Lightning Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lightning_rod\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Frost Resistance\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_frost_resistance\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Snowball\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:snowball\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Aquatic Life\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_aquatic_life\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Nautilus Shell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:nautilus_shell\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Mercy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_mercy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Honeycomb\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:honeycomb\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Unstable Intangibility\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:scroll_of_unstable_intangibility\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Ghast Tear\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ghast_tear\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "",
    "Projectile Reflection has no recipe."
  ],
  "task.5166A817BB34ED99.title": "Craft a magic tablet",
  "quest.691F4A212F9F9496.title": "Tablets",
  "quest.691F4A212F9F9496.quest_subtitle": "Five ways to be elsewhere.",
  "quest.691F4A212F9F9496.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Marble and dust make a Strange Tablet; one more thing makes it a way out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Strange Tablet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:strange_tablet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" marbles and \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" dust\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Home\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": red mushroom, to your respawn point\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Recall\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": bone meal, to a memorized grave\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Assistance\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": gunpowder, to a player's name\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Guard\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": a bone, a spectral wolf on watch\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Cupidity\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": golden carrot, fortune or loss\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Enchant at a haunted grave, then hold right-click. After each use, \"},{\"text\":\"300\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" s of cooldown.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Lost Tablets turn up for unlucky anglers with a \"},{\"text\":\"Fishing Rod of Misadventure\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:fishing_rod_of_misadventure\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": they need time to wake up, then point to villages, structures, even other worlds.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.72FF548FC290ED9F.title": "Any magic book",
  "quest.3444BDB12BC7EEE8.title": "Magic books",
  "quest.3444BDB12BC7EEE8.quest_subtitle": "The offhand does the reading.",
  "quest.3444BDB12BC7EEE8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four dust, a book and some gems: a one-use trick for the item in your hand.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Book in the offhand, item in the main hand, right-click a haunted grave.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Repairing\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": quartz, prismarine shards. Erases wear.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Scribe\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": amethyst, gold. Copies a scroll.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Disenchantment\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": lapis. Strips enchantments back into books.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Recycling\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": warped and crimson fungus, glowstone, redstone. Returns the crafting ingredients (no containers, enchantments lost).\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Magic Impregnation\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": lapis, diamonds. Adds or upgrades \"},{\"text\":\"enchantments\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"30BDB581F7BD371C\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Oblivion\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": emeralds, amethyst. Resets your \"},{\"text\":\"perks\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"28E71B03F7CCAC1F\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Book of Soulbound\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7C5F2A452A57289E\"}},{\"text\":\" has its own page.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7C5F2A452A57289E.title": "Soulbound: keep it on death",
  "quest.7C5F2A452A57289E.quest_subtitle": "Some things you carry for life.",
  "quest.7C5F2A452A57289E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A rune that keeps one item on you through death.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" dust, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" diamonds, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" lapis and a book\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Book in the offhand, a non-stackable item in the main hand, right-click a haunted grave\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Start with your pickaxe and your \"},{\"text\":\"Heliodor Compass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:heliodor_compass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Soulbound enchantment does the same job, and it is one of the \"},{\"text\":\"grave enchantments\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"30BDB581F7BD371C\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4FB1FBF6383EEBEF.title": "Impregnate an item with magic",
  "quest.30BDB581F7BD371C.title": "Grave enchantments",
  "quest.30BDB581F7BD371C.quest_subtitle": "Twelve, and none at the table.",
  "quest.30BDB581F7BD371C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Twelve enchantments that only graves hand out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Off at the enchanting table by default\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Book of Magic Impregnation\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:book_of_magic_impregnation\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds them and upgrades them, arrows included\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Ruthless Strike: \"},{\"text\":\"+15%\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" critical damage per level\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Weapons\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": Frostbite, Magic Siphon, Plague Bringer, Incurable Wounds, Decrepitude, Sanctified, Ruthless Strike.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Armor\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": Spectral Bite (feet), Curse of Bones (chest), Blessing, Spectral Conjurer (head).\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Anything\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": Soulbound.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.382238E5B0D671DD.title": "Use a Dust of Vanishing",
  "quest.112B2AF21D270C25.title": "Easy retreat",
  "quest.112B2AF21D270C25.quest_subtitle": "Now you see me.",
  "quest.112B2AF21D270C25.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A puff, and you stand a few steps behind where you were.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Dust of Vanishing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:dust_of_vanishing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": dust and \"},{\"text\":\"Gunpowder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:gunpowder\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Dust of Frost\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:dust_of_frost\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": dust and \"},{\"text\":\"Blue Ice\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blue_ice\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a wall of snow behind you\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Smoke Ball\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:smoke_ball\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": dust and a \"},{\"text\":\"Snowball\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:snowball\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", makes \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"; only smoke\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click to use. Fifty escapes earn Master of Escape.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4F8FE857899146D4.title": "A Voodoo Poppet",
  "quest.4F8FE857899146D4.quest_subtitle": "One free death, terms apply.",
  "quest.4F8FE857899146D4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Enchanted at a haunted grave, it takes your next death for you.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" dust, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" clay balls, leather, string and a dead bush\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click a haunted grave with it to seal the magic\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Perk \"},{\"text\":\"Witch Doctor\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": a chance it survives the save\"}]"
  ],
  "task.07376CCCFF9934B5.title": "Let a Voodoo Poppet save you",
  "quest.7E4E1F729667D2EC.title": "Not today, Grim Reaper",
  "quest.7E4E1F729667D2EC.quest_subtitle": "The poppet took the hit.",
  "quest.7E4E1F729667D2EC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You died, and the doll did the paperwork.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The advancement pays \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" knowledge points.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.6D90843856D0282B.title": "Secret found",
  "task.3A2416D5E1F97C49.title": "Use the Ankh on a zombie villager",
  "quest.6600319DA3B82125.title": "Light and dark",
  "quest.6600319DA3B82125.quest_subtitle": "The Ankh prays differently on each side.",
  "quest.6600319DA3B82125.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Your deeds tilt a scale, and the Ankh follows.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Up: freeing a soul \"},{\"text\":\"+50\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"; exorcism and protecting a villager \"},{\"text\":\"+20\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"; raiders and phantoms \"},{\"text\":\"+10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Down: zombifying \"},{\"text\":\"-20\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"; killing villagers, the Tablet of Cupidity, plundering a player's grave or killing your own pet \"},{\"text\":\"-10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Neutral or better: \"},{\"text\":\"Exorcism\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" turns a zombie villager back\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"+1: \"},{\"text\":\"Prayer of Protection\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" cancels a villager's next death\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"+2: \"},{\"text\":\"Prayer of Empathy\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" rallies a tameable creature\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Negative: \"},{\"text\":\"Zombify\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Prayer of Undead\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" and the \"},{\"text\":\"Bone Scepter\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" make undead servants\"}]"
  ],
  "task.37F47C22382488EE.title": "Choose your first perk",
  "quest.28E71B03F7CCAC1F.title": "Perks",
  "quest.28E71B03F7CCAC1F.quest_subtitle": "Spend the points, pick a style.",
  "quest.28E71B03F7CCAC1F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eighteen perks in four branches, and some change how you die.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Memento Mori\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"20%\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" less experience lost per level\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Jailer\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"20%\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" per level to be born with an enchanted key\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Witch Doctor\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": a chance the poppet survives\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Thanatomancy\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": Jailer, Memento Mori, Necromancer.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Athanocracy\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": Guardian, Gladiator, Witch Doctor.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Arkanotropy\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": Shadowalker, Shadowveil, Nightveiler, Archaeologist, Treasure Seeker.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Animathurgy\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": Alchemist, Resiliomancer, Channeler, Priest, Rune Inscriber, Glyphographer, Scribe.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Book of Oblivion resets them, once per \"},{\"text\":\"120\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" min.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6175649F4EB8ECBF.title": "Bring your pet back",
  "quest.6175649F4EB8ECBF.quest_subtitle": "Nobody gets left behind.",
  "quest.6175649F4EB8ECBF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It catches a pet's soul when it dies, with what it carried.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Ghast Tears\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ghast_tear\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and an \"},{\"text\":\"Impregnated Diamond\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:impregnated_diamond\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"That diamond is a \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" ringed by \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" dust\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Carry it: the soul recovers slowly, on a little of your vital essence\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Bone Needle\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:bone_needle\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (dust and a bone) fills with a creature's essence when you right-click it. Combine needle and receptacle to choose which species the receptacle can catch.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.48DD61D88347FCD4.title": "Revive a familiar",
  "quest.491F67946643A897.title": "Bound forever",
  "quest.491F67946643A897.quest_subtitle": "Not even the parrot.",
  "quest.491F67946643A897.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One right-click at a haunted grave, and the pet is back.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Use the recovered receptacle on the grave: it breaks\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Gemstone of Familiar\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:gemstone_of_familiar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" revives your last dead familiar: hold right-click\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The gemstone comes from Mastery 1 and from a Grave Guardian (\"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" dust and a horse armor).\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The advancement pays \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\" knowledge points.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.04DF3595FF41A3FB.title": "Seasonal graves",
  "quest.04DF3595FF41A3FB.quest_subtitle": "Three times a year the graves dress up.",
  "quest.04DF3595FF41A3FB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The calendar changes the graveyard.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Halloween\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\", 20 Oct to 3 Nov: ghosts haunt anyone who doesn't pray\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Christmas\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\", from 6 Dec: gifts, hats and lollipops\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\"Spring Bloom\",\"color\":\"#F2B85C\"},{\"text\":\", 10 to 31 Mar: \"},{\"text\":\"Thorn Veil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"tombstone:thornveil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" flowers around the graves\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The Grave Guardian's stock changes: at Halloween a lollipop buys an essence, and in Spring Bloom so does a Thorn Veil.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The server can switch any event off, or keep one on all year.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.01E0DCBFFA2CE581.title": "Dust for the depot",
  "quest.01E0DCBFFA2CE581.quest_subtitle": "Somebody has to stock the shelves.",
  "quest.01E0DCBFFA2CE581.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sixteen Grave Dust for graves nobody has dug yet.\"}]",
    "",
    "Undead and cats keep it coming; a Grave Guardian sells it for bones."
  ],
  "quest.1D74DB54AC1EAEE7.title": "Light the lantern",
  "quest.1D74DB54AC1EAEE7.quest_subtitle": "Dusk is friendlier with a light on.",
  "quest.1D74DB54AC1EAEE7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Somebody has to keep the gate lit.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: fireflies, mostly."
  ],
  "quest.31ABDBF154B70AF6.title": "Say hi to the cat",
  "quest.31ABDBF154B70AF6.quest_subtitle": "It brought a gift. It always does.",
  "quest.31ABDBF154B70AF6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Morning gifts, delivered with contempt.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nothing to build. Just a scratch behind the ears."
  ],
  "image.2FEB134D86AF86DE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"TOMBSTONE\",\"color\":\"#F6D28A\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.6C8475CD500C788D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The friendly graveyard\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\"}]",
  "image.70AFA0926545CF30.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Dying, without the stress\",\"color\":\"#B9A98A\"}]",
  "image.32A2669A06F9AC56.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.21600143C3F511CA.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"THE GATE\",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.61FC0297CE1A5DF8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MAGIC\",\"color\":\"#B7A2E8\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.6A70621C53B91255.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"SOULS AND FAMILIARS\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "chapter.07F1D898223AE695.title": "Helpers in the World",
  "chapter.07F1D898223AE695.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Ultimine, Carry On, beds for the road and small fixes."
  ],
  "quest.325DD88D37F6C953.title": "Work Smarter Outside",
  "quest.325DD88D37F6C953.quest_desc": [
    "Inventory helpers save clicks; these save hours. Mining veins, moving chests and sleeping far from home, each with a limit the pack sets.",
    "",
    "Know the limit and nothing surprises you. Mostly.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pocket villagers\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"090C768610DD6B3B\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"elevators\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"400261324AFA96E7\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"lights you can't see\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"078A1C5D7D7FE457\"}},{\"text\":\" hang with the gadgets.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6F7BA1BEB737FF7F.title": "Ultimine: One Swing, One Vein",
  "quest.6F7BA1BEB737FF7F.quest_desc": [
    "Hold &eV&r and break a block: every connected block of the same kind goes with it, up to the reach of your vein resonator (&e8&r, &e16&r, &e32&r or &e64&r blocks by tier); it goes in a Curios charm slot, and without one Ultimine is off. Each extra block costs hunger and tool durability, so eat and bring a good pick; the HUD warns when you are too hungry.",
    "",
    "It respects claims and ruins."
  ],
  "quest.34D3B9788044C1CF.title": "Ultimine Shapes",
  "quest.34D3B9788044C1CF.quest_desc": [
    "With V held, &eShift&r and the wheel (or up and down) cycle shapes: &eShapeless&r follows the vein (ores, trees), &eSmall&r and &eLarge tunnel (3x3)&r dig corridors, &eSmall square (3x3)&r clears flat ground, and &eMining&r and &eEscape tunnel&r do branch mining and a staircase up.",
    "",
    "The outline shows what breaks before you swing."
  ],
  "quest.4721D87B06E32449.title": "Ultimine With Right Click",
  "quest.4721D87B06E32449.quest_desc": [
    "With V held, right-click actions multiply too: an &eaxe&r strips logs or scrapes and unwaxes copper, a &eshovel&r makes paths, a &ehoe&r tills a whole field, and on crops it harvests every ripe one in reach.",
    "",
    "Even without V, right-clicking a ripe crop harvests it."
  ],
  "quest.07E6520EC32BD592.title": "Carry On: Pick Up a Chest",
  "quest.07E6520EC32BD592.quest_desc": [
    "With an &eempty hand&r, &esneak and right-click&r a chest, furnace or barrel to lift it with everything inside, and right-click again to set it down; passive animals and villagers ride along too.",
    "",
    "You move slower, heavier blocks slow you more, and you cannot attack. Only blocks with an inventory lift."
  ],
  "quest.4A3DBA14B5939CD9.title": "What Carry On Refuses",
  "quest.4A3DBA14B5939CD9.quest_desc": [
    "A long blacklist keeps things from breaking: every ENTRELUMEN block, spawners, vaults and Lootr chests; whole mods with multiblocks or networks (Create, AE2, Refined Storage, MI, Oritech, IE, Industrial Foregoing, Powah, Functional and Sophisticated Storage, Ender Storage, Farmer's Delight, FramedBlocks, LittleTiles, Waystones); Mekanism casings and ports; Ender IO conduits; hostiles, bosses, frames and armor stands."
  ],
  "quest.706F751CEDE5DD09.title": "Quirk: Stacks, Players, Reach",
  "quest.706F751CEDE5DD09.quest_desc": [
    "Carried animals stack on top of each other, up to 10. Players can be picked up too, so behave in co-op. Pick-up distance follows your reach, so Terra's Arm stretches it as well.",
    "",
    "A tower of ten sheep is technically allowed."
  ],
  "quest.3AE12491BA59667D.title": "Beds for the Road",
  "quest.3AE12491BA59667D.quest_desc": [
    "&eComforts&r adds the &eSleeping Bag&r, for nights far from home (it can wear out), and the &eHammock&r, hung between two &eRope and Nail&r blocks, for sleeping through the day.",
    "",
    "The server decides how many players must sleep to skip time. Somebody will always be mining."
  ],
  "quest.7FF3C0D9AEEBFA79.title": "Small Fixes You Will Notice",
  "quest.7FF3C0D9AEEBFA79.quest_desc": [
    "&eClean Swing&r hits mobs through tall grass, &eHey Berry Shut Up&r lets leggings and boots shrug off berry bushes and cactus, &eAccelerated Decay&r drops leaves fast after you fell a tree, boats hop ashore or survive lava (Jump Boat, Fireproof Boats), and &eJust Zoom&r zooms on &eZ&r."
  ],
  "quest.0BFCB9842C3F988B.title": "Tip: Test Your Damage",
  "quest.0BFCB9842C3F988B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hit numbers, damage per second and a dummy that never dies: \"},{\"text\":\"the training yard\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1428DDF847B60627\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6D0284FD17470EC0.title": "Tip: Safe Zones Come Later",
  "quest.6D0284FD17470EC0.quest_desc": [
    "A whole base free of natural hostile spawns is the &eAltar of Peace&r, an act III reward (see The Six Altars of Heliodor).",
    "",
    "Until then, light is your friend: &eF7&r shows where mobs can spawn."
  ],
  "quest.147332C8C4BF6261.title": "A Lighter World",
  "quest.147332C8C4BF6261.quest_desc": [
    "Veins in one swing, chests on your back and a bed anywhere.",
    "",
    "The world is just as big. It just weighs less now.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The rest of the toolbox: \"},{\"text\":\"Gadgets and Helpers\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"70A0569F0999AF56\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "chapter.0F589FD1738516F7.title": "Moving Items, Fluids and Energy",
  "chapter.0F589FD1738516F7.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Pipes, filters, laser nodes, routers and cables: which one to use and how energy crosses between mods."
  ],
  "quest.6611059F058DEAC6.title": "Stop Carrying, Start Piping",
  "quest.6611059F058DEAC6.quest_desc": [
    "Sooner or later everything should flow on its own: ore to the crusher, ingots to chests, fuel to generators, power to machines. The pack's transport systems overlap on purpose, from the simplest to the most flexible.",
    "",
    "Pick the one whose style you like. Nobody is grading the spaghetti."
  ],
  "quest.4D925148310D452A.title": "Early: Hoppers and Create",
  "quest.4D925148310D452A.quest_desc": [
    "Before pipes, you already have vanilla hoppers and droppers, and Create's belts, chutes, funnels and mechanical arm, which move items with rotation and look great doing it.",
    "",
    "Create's logistics has its own chapter."
  ],
  "quest.5B9D62223F724826.title": "Fluids",
  "quest.5B9D62223F724826.quest_desc": [
    "Fluid pipes work like item pipes: Pipez fluid pipes, Mekanism mechanical pipes, Create fluid pipes driven by a mechanical pump, and Ender Storage tanks for long distances.",
    "",
    "A Fluid Trash Can at the end of a line voids the overflow."
  ],
  "quest.449E5E1DB3B1C498.title": "Rotation and Electricity",
  "quest.449E5E1DB3B1C498.quest_desc": [
    "&eCreate: Crafts and Additions&r has the &eAlternator&r (rotation to FE) and &eElectric Motor&r (FE to rotation), with wires. &eCreate: New Age&r, Heliodor's own technology, spins a &eGenerator Coil&r between magnets, collects it with carbon brushes and turns it back into rotation with motors.",
    "",
    "Its carbon brushes take an Energy Coupler (act II), and its better motors act materials."
  ],
  "quest.739B53602D9058E2.title": "Mekanism Transmitters",
  "quest.739B53602D9058E2.quest_desc": [
    "&eLogistical transporters&r for items, &emechanical pipes&r for fluids, &epressurized tubes&r for chemicals and &euniversal cables&r for energy, four tiers each; transporters can be color-coded and sorted with a &eLogistical Sorter&r.",
    "",
    "Machines pick what each face does in their &eside configuration&r tab, and &eMekanism Covers&r hide transmitters behind any block's look."
  ],
  "quest.1FB4FD3C079FE46A.title": "XNet: One Controller (Act III)",
  "quest.1FB4FD3C079FE46A.quest_desc": [
    "Connectors touch the machines, thin cables join them to a &eController&r, and its menu defines up to eight channels (item, fluid, energy or logic) with rules per connector: a whole logistics network, hidden.",
    "",
    "The controller takes a reinforced alloy, so it arrives in act III; routers need a controller anyway. Its manual is craftable."
  ],
  "quest.1CED0A985AB18B7C.title": "Integrated Tunnels",
  "quest.1CED0A985AB18B7C.quest_desc": [
    "For programmers: items, fluids and energy through Integrated Dynamics networks, with importers and exporters driven by variable cards and logic. The most flexible system here, and the slowest to learn.",
    "",
    "Its guide is the Integrated Dynamics manual, craftable from day one."
  ],
  "quest.1E0C97FDD675306D.title": "Which One Should I Use?",
  "quest.1E0C97FDD675306D.quest_desc": [
    "A few machines: &ePipez&r, extracting only where needed. A dense room: &eLaserIO&r. A big, tidy base: &eXNet&r from act III, or a storage network. Placing, breaking and odd jobs: &eModular Routers&r. A factory worth watching: &eCreate&r.",
    "",
    "Mixing is fine: most bases end up with three of them."
  ],
  "quest.2E5A18FC60DED15A.title": "Tip: Filter With Tags",
  "quest.2E5A18FC60DED15A.quest_desc": [
    "&e#c:ores&r catches every ore from every mod and &e#c:ingots&r every ingot: Pipez filters take a #tag, and LaserIO has a Tag Filter.",
    "",
    "F3+H shows an item's tags in its tooltip, and EMI searches them with #."
  ],
  "quest.2FA69EC10654DE68.title": "Quirk: a Full Chest Stops All",
  "quest.2FA69EC10654DE68.quest_desc": [
    "When the destination fills, the line backs up and the machine upstream stops. Plan for overflow: a Void upgrade in a drawer, a Trash Can at the end of the line, or a second destination further down.",
    "",
    "Every factory learns this once."
  ],
  "quest.6E189022971819C4.title": "Things Flow on Their Own",
  "quest.6E189022971819C4.quest_desc": [
    "Items, fluids and energy now move without you. The last step is a storage network that knows where everything is and crafts on request.",
    "",
    "The spaghetti is optional. The satisfaction is not."
  ],
  "chapter.3BF93B1AC8D3E2BD.title": "Performance, Sound and Screen",
  "chapter.3BF93B1AC8D3E2BD.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Settings that keep a 300-mod pack smooth, quiet when you want it and readable."
  ],
  "quest.31CFA01185FA98C4.title": "A Heavy Pack on a Normal PC",
  "quest.31CFA01185FA98C4.quest_desc": [
    "ENTRELUMEN is meant to run on ordinary PCs: it ships with rendering and memory optimizations and a cautious first profile, and leaves you room to tune.",
    "",
    "Three hundred mods, one potato-friendly start."
  ],
  "quest.572656FC02703CC9.title": "What Is Already Optimized",
  "quest.572656FC02703CC9.quest_desc": [
    "Already in: &eSodium&r (a faster renderer with its own video pages), &eImmediatelyFast&r (text, items and HUD), &eModernFix&r and &eFerriteCore&r (loading and memory), &eAllTheLeaks&r (leak fixes for long sessions) and &eAI Improvements&r (lighter mob thinking on the server).",
    "",
    "Another optimizer on top usually brings conflicts, not frames."
  ],
  "quest.375C479FC614F2AE.title": "The First Profile",
  "quest.375C479FC614F2AE.quest_desc": [
    "A new profile starts at render distance &e10&r, simulation &e6&r, a &e120 FPS&r cap without VSync, fast graphics, no clouds, fewer particles, no entity shadows, entity distance 75%, darkness and screen effects at half, GUI scale 3.",
    "",
    "A safe start, not a rule: raise render distance first, since simulation distance costs the server far more."
  ],
  "quest.5D3F2F532595406E.title": "Sodium's Video Settings",
  "quest.5D3F2F532595406E.quest_desc": [
    "Options, Video Settings opens Sodium's pages (General, Quality, Performance, Advanced) plus pages other mods add. Hover any option to read what it does and what it costs.",
    "",
    "On a weak PC: lower render distance, keep particles decreased and leave the performance options alone."
  ],
  "quest.5F9D459224CCEDBF.title": "Dynamic Lights",
  "quest.5F9D459224CCEDBF.quest_desc": [
    "&eLambDynamicLights&r makes held torches, lanterns and glowing items light your surroundings, and lights up burning or glowing entities. Its page sits in Sodium's video settings, where you can lower it or turn it off.",
    "",
    "Solsticio's luminous gear shines with it too. Obviously."
  ],
  "quest.39B57F7649021B1E.title": "Silence the Factory",
  "quest.39B57F7649021B1E.quest_desc": [
    "&eExtreme Sound Muffler&r adds a &eMuffler&r button to your inventory that lists nearby sounds: lower or mute any, for the whole world or only inside an &eanchor&r area around your machines. Right-drag the button if it covers something.",
    "",
    "Leave combat sounds on. They are the ones that keep you alive."
  ],
  "quest.689260C1B854A07B.title": "Fewer Pop-ups",
  "quest.689260C1B854A07B.quest_desc": [
    "&eToast Control&r handles the top-right notifications: recipe unlocks, advancements and tutorial hints. &eF10&r clears the ones on screen, and its settings block whole kinds.",
    "",
    "You miss nothing important: quests and the Atlas speak in their own screens and in chat."
  ],
  "quest.3E474B9B801F50F6.title": "A HUD That Scales",
  "quest.3E474B9B801F50F6.quest_desc": [
    "Health and armor grow far past vanilla here: Spice of Life adds hearts for food variety and late armor passes 20. &eColorful Hearts&r stacks extra hearts in colored rows and &eOverloaded Armor Bar&r does the same for armor, so the HUD never swallows the screen.",
    "",
    "&eNot Enough Animations&r adds eating and map animations; purely cosmetic."
  ],
  "quest.187F30877B47077A.title": "Protect Your Save",
  "quest.187F30877B47077A.quest_desc": [
    "&eCherished Worlds&r lets you mark a world as a favorite: it stays at the top of the list and resists accidental deletion. &eSimple Backups&r makes automatic ZIP copies and announces them in chat.",
    "",
    "Restore a backup only with the game or server closed. Future you will thank you."
  ],
  "quest.29E494460AEDC6F2.title": "Solsticio's Motes of Light",
  "quest.29E494460AEDC6F2.quest_desc": [
    "The drifting motes in Solsticio are client-side and follow your particle setting: halved on Decreased, gone on Minimal.",
    "",
    "Finer controls live in the ENTRELUMEN client config; the Solsticio chapter has them."
  ],
  "quest.00C6A92105A1B302.title": "Tip: Find the Lag",
  "quest.00C6A92105A1B302.quest_desc": [
    "When the game or server stutters, &espark&r says why: an operator runs &e/spark profiler&r, reproduces the lag and stops it to see which mod or machine eats the time; &e/spark tps&r shows server ticks per second.",
    "",
    "Check the obvious first: item piles, giant farms in loaded chunks, too many force-loaded chunks."
  ],
  "quest.53171C9A7C748B49.title": "Tip: The Floor Is Not Storage",
  "quest.53171C9A7C748B49.quest_desc": [
    "Every dropped item is an entity the server must tick, and farms that spill their output are the classic cause of lag. Collect with hoppers, Item Collectors or machine outputs, void overflow with a Trash Can, and let Clumps merge experience orbs."
  ],
  "quest.44DC2092AA284411.title": "Pack Menus and Loading Screen",
  "quest.44DC2092AA284411.quest_desc": [
    "FancyMenu and Drippy Loading Screen dress up the title and loading screens without touching your settings.",
    "",
    "At a very high GUI scale a button may fall off screen: drop the scale to 3 or 2."
  ],
  "quest.4CEFDFA59AAE55AB.title": "Quirk: GUI Scale and Big Screens",
  "quest.4CEFDFA59AAE55AB.quest_desc": [
    "Many modded screens are wider than vanilla ones (the Atlas is 300 by 210 GUI units), so at a high GUI scale in a small window they may not fit.",
    "",
    "If a screen looks cut off, lower the GUI scale in Options, Video Settings."
  ],
  "quest.02071930B3199174.title": "Smooth and Quiet",
  "quest.02071930B3199174.quest_desc": [
    "Play the way your PC likes: the story never needs a jetpack, a huge render distance or chunk-loading.",
    "",
    "A quiet factory is a happy factory. Or at least a muffled one."
  ],
  "chapter.2AEF3B16A131D400.title": "Teams and Claims",
  "chapter.2AEF3B16A131D400.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Play together with FTB Teams, protect your land with FTB Chunks, and know what the team shares."
  ],
  "quest.3C597B86B27930E7.title": "Solo First, Better Together",
  "quest.3C597B86B27930E7.quest_desc": [
    "Everything can be done alone. With friends, the campaign, the compass and the World Tier become shared, so you can split branches: one cooks, one builds machines, one explores.",
    "",
    "Someone always ends up doing the paperwork. Usually the one with the Atlas."
  ],
  "quest.58EAC9E8C5071663.title": "Create a Party",
  "quest.58EAC9E8C5071663.quest_desc": [
    "The &eMy Team&r button on the side of your inventory creates and names a party and invites online players, who accept from their own My Team screen or the chat message.",
    "",
    "Without a party you are still a team: a team of one."
  ],
  "quest.27E62163ED06BC7B.title": "What the Team Shares",
  "quest.27E62163ED06BC7B.quest_desc": [
    "Atlas projects, acts and milestones are shared and any member can deliver; the compass points everyone to the same objective; the World Tier follows the team's progress; and in Solsticio the team claims one plot.",
    "",
    "Items are not shared: each keeps their own inventory, and a reward goes to whoever delivered."
  ],
  "quest.68A95699EF8E40F9.title": "Joining and Leaving",
  "quest.68A95699EF8E40F9.quest_desc": [
    "Creating a party copies the founder's campaign once. Joining someone else's does not merge histories: you play theirs while your personal campaign waits, and leaving brings you back to it. When the last owner leaves, the party's campaign is archived; an operator can restore it with &e/entrelumen admin recover&r.",
    "",
    "Your World Tier never drops on the way out."
  ],
  "quest.28A8E9C9DECB15C7.title": "Allies",
  "quest.28A8E9C9DECB15C7.quest_desc": [
    "My Team can mark other teams as &eallies&r, who may interact with your claimed land as your settings allow, without joining your campaign.",
    "",
    "Alliances for the neighbors, parties for the people playing your story."
  ],
  "quest.7455FFA73D0FEC2E.title": "Claim Your Land",
  "quest.7455FFA73D0FEC2E.quest_desc": [
    "&eK&r opens the claim manager: &eleft-drag&r claims, &eright-drag&r unclaims, &eTab&r hides the grid and &eAlt&r shows when each claim was made. Claimed chunks keep other teams from breaking, placing or opening containers unless you allow it.",
    "",
    "Up to 500 chunks per player by default. Nobody needs 500. Somebody will try."
  ],
  "quest.0B2F97229BEF1DE1.title": "Keep Machines Running",
  "quest.0B2F97229BEF1DE1.quest_desc": [
    "In the claim manager, &eShift+left-drag&r force-loads claimed chunks so machines keep working while you are away, and &eShift+right-drag&r stops it; the mouse wheel sets when it expires. Default limit: 25 per player.",
    "",
    "Whether they stay loaded with nobody online is a server setting. Force-load only what needs it: every chunk costs server time."
  ],
  "quest.038A595B1B7200A4.title": "Team Protection Settings",
  "quest.038A595B1B7200A4.quest_desc": [
    "My Team also sets whether explosions and mobs can damage your land, who sees your claims on the map, and which fake players (machines that act as players, like Create deployers or block breakers) count as friends.",
    "",
    "If a machine suddenly refuses to work, check the fake player setting first."
  ],
  "quest.21F833844C0F26B6.title": "Quirk: Two Maps, One Visible",
  "quest.21F833844C0F26B6.quest_desc": [
    "FTB Chunks' minimap is off and its map key unbound, so JourneyMap is the map you see; FTB Chunks only handles teams and claims (&eK&r or the inventory side button).",
    "",
    "Prefer the FTB minimap? Your personal config file can turn it back on."
  ],
  "quest.79A1D0DB3C8F0B51.title": "Claims Stop Altars Too",
  "quest.79A1D0DB3C8F0B51.quest_desc": [
    "Land-shaping altars act as their owner, so another team's Altar of Renewal or Levelling skips your claimed chunks and charges nothing for them. The same goes for Ultimine and other tools wielded by outsiders.",
    "",
    "Good fences make good neighbors, even magical ones."
  ],
  "quest.27B135D314100B6A.title": "Tip: Split the Branches",
  "quest.27B135D314100B6A.quest_desc": [
    "Each act asks for several Atlas projects at once, each from a different discipline, so a team of three can take one each: engineering, nature and logistics in act III, for example.",
    "",
    "A delivery counts for the whole team the moment anyone makes it, so no need to pass items around first."
  ],
  "quest.47FFD44331256607.title": "Co-op Comforts",
  "quest.47FFD44331256607.quest_desc": [
    "&eChat Heads&r puts each player's face beside their messages, &eBetter Ping Display&r turns the Tab list bars into milliseconds, and &eNo Chat Reports&r strips signed-report data from server chat.",
    "",
    "None changes the game; they just make a shared server easier to read."
  ],
  "quest.20AD0D6306A80B83.title": "Quirk: Loot Is Per Player",
  "quest.20AD0D6306A80B83.quest_desc": [
    "&eLootr&r gives every player their own loot from dungeon and structure chests, so opening first steals nothing and exploring a ruin together is fine.",
    "",
    "A Lootr chest you already opened looks different from a fresh one."
  ],
  "quest.469B35F5128965CF.title": "Gifts Help, Progress Stays",
  "quest.469B35F5128965CF.quest_desc": [
    "Hand another team anything, even a finished prototype, and they can deliver it to their own Atlas. Progress cannot be gifted: arrivals, boss milestones and completed projects stay with the campaign that earned them.",
    "",
    "The Heart of Heliodor only counts for the team whose member took it from the Sun Spirit."
  ],
  "quest.1923090E6BED7E18.title": "Tip: a Team Frequency",
  "quest.1923090E6BED7E18.quest_desc": [
    "From act III, &eEnder Storage&r shares contents between every chest, tank and pouch with the same three colors, across dimensions. Pick a team code, keep a supply chest at home and give each explorer a pouch.",
    "",
    "How it works: the Storage chapter."
  ],
  "quest.17B1C1BCA708F7EB.title": "A Team With a Home",
  "quest.17B1C1BCA708F7EB.quest_desc": [
    "Party created, land claimed, machines loaded, allies set. From here, the story moves at the speed of the whole team.",
    "",
    "Which means at the speed of whoever is still sorting their inventory."
  ],
  "chapter.212218BAD3D67D30.title": "Resource Farming: Fishing",
  "chapter.212218BAD3D67D30.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Aquaculture: rods, hooks, fillets and treasure from the water."
  ],
  "quest.0B5BD3D3F3ED95E0.title": "Fish That Pay",
  "quest.0B5BD3D3F3ED95E0.quest_desc": [
    "Aquaculture fishes up metal, treasure and fillets: dozens of fish by biome, better rods, hooks and bait. Slow to start, endless once running, and the travel food the Atlas asks for in act II comes from here.",
    "",
    "Productive Bees has two chapters of its own; Mystical Agriculture too."
  ],
  "quest.25D22601D4E688AC.title": "Aquaculture: Better Fishing",
  "quest.25D22601D4E688AC.quest_desc": [
    "Dozens of biome fish, better rods (iron, gold, diamond, neptunium), hooks, bait like worms, lines and bobbers, a &eTackle Box&r for gear and a &eFillet Knife&r for fillets.",
    "",
    "It also fishes up treasure: &eNeptune's Bounty&r chests hold neptunium, a metal for underwater gear."
  ],
  "quest.203022B5C269A142.title": "The Tackle Box",
  "quest.203022B5C269A142.quest_desc": [
    "Five iron, an iron block, a chest and two green dyes make a &eTackle Box&r: it stores the fishing gear, and a rod set in it takes a hook, a line, a bobber and bait."
  ],
  "quest.3F5323236DF4A223.title": "Hooks",
  "quest.3F5323236DF4A223.quest_desc": [
    "Four iron nuggets make an &eIron Hook&r, which saves durability one cast in five, and two iron hooks make a &eDouble Hook&r that can land two catches at once. Gold and glowstone hooks add luck; redstone ones give you longer to reel in."
  ],
  "quest.1412E509E7C564FE.title": "The Fillet Knife",
  "quest.1412E509E7C564FE.quest_desc": [
    "Two iron ingots and a stick make an &eIron Fillet Knife&r. A fish and the knife on a crafting grid become raw fillets, and the neptunium knife cuts more of them."
  ],
  "quest.3DFCD4210E1E9F9A.title": "Fillets for the Story",
  "quest.3DFCD4210E1E9F9A.quest_desc": [
    "Two vegetable soups and two cooked Aquaculture fillets make the first &eTravel Rations&r, the travel food the Atlas asks for in act II.",
    "",
    "A &eWorm Farm&r keeps the bait coming."
  ],
  "quest.3D392448BE3407E3.title": "Neptunium Gear",
  "quest.3D392448BE3407E3.quest_desc": [
    "Built for underwater: the rod gets faster bites, the helmet clearer vision, the chestplate breath, the leggings weightlessness and the boots speed; the pickaxe and shovel lose no speed underwater, and the hoe keeps farmland moist.",
    "",
    "Ocean monuments will not know what hit them."
  ],
  "quest.3D28CDAE58037BFE.title": "Endless Supplies",
  "quest.3D28CDAE58037BFE.quest_desc": [
    "A fishing line that pays in treasure, fillets for the road and neptunium for the deep.",
    "",
    "Somewhere, a fish is swimming toward your hook right now."
  ],
  "chapter.5F5C5CDA9C2B7B1E.title": "Storage Networks: AE2 or Refined Storage",
  "chapter.5F5C5CDA9C2B7B1E.chapter_subtitle": [
    "One terminal for everything you own: how the two networks differ, where the pack gates them, and how to start."
  ],
  "quest.20934DE77061EA1E.title": "A Terminal That Knows Everything",
  "quest.20934DE77061EA1E.quest_desc": [
    "A storage network turns items into data: insert once, then search, count, pull and autocraft from one terminal. The pack offers &eApplied Energistics 2&r and &eRefined Storage&r side by side, both complete; pick one per base.",
    "",
    "The tech guides go deeper into autocrafting."
  ],
  "quest.40255AEA7E3FBC84.title": "AE2 or RS?",
  "quest.40255AEA7E3FBC84.quest_desc": [
    "&eAE2&r is deeper and more rewarding: cables carry limited &echannels&r (8 per normal cable, 32 per dense), so layout matters, and the pack has lots of add-ons for it. &eRefined Storage&r is simpler: no channels, just connect and power, faster to set up.",
    "",
    "Both store items, fluids and, with Mekanism add-ons, chemicals, and both craft on request."
  ],
  "quest.4D7E5DE146382857.title": "Pack Change: When Each Opens",
  "quest.4D7E5DE146382857.quest_desc": [
    "Both networks enter in act III: the Refined Storage &eController&r takes a &eRouting Matrix&r and its &eAutocrafter&r a &eHandling Core&r, while AE2 needs its inscriber's &eLogic Processors&r, the same ones the Routing Matrix is made from.",
    "",
    "The AE2 controller carries a Routing Matrix too, but a small AE2 network without a controller can start a little earlier."
  ],
  "quest.0D69E2FB61D264F7.title": "AE2 Step 1: a Meteorite",
  "quest.0D69E2FB61D264F7.quest_desc": [
    "AE2 starts in a crater: meteorites hold a &eMysterious Cube&r with the four &einscriber presses&r (calculation, engineering, logic, silicon) and sky stone. Presses plus an &eInscriber&r print processors.",
    "",
    "Certus quartz grows from budding certus; charge it in a &eCharger&r and drop it with redstone and nether quartz in water for fluix."
  ],
  "quest.793454F581FA5AB2.title": "AE2 Step 2: a First Network",
  "quest.793454F581FA5AB2.quest_desc": [
    "An &eME Drive&r with a &e1k storage cell&r, a &eterminal&r and power from an energy acceptor or a controller. Without a controller the network handles up to 8 channel devices; with a &eController&r and cables it grows far beyond.",
    "",
    "Your first terminal is the moment the chests start feeling old."
  ],
  "quest.26E80B5A5FA63E3D.title": "Tip: AE2 Has Its Own Guide",
  "quest.26E80B5A5FA63E3D.quest_desc": [
    "AE2 ships an in-game guide with pictures and 3D scenes of every block: craft the &eGuide&r, or bind &eOpen Guide for Items&r in Controls to jump from any AE2 item to its page.",
    "",
    "Read it once; it saves ten forum threads."
  ],
  "quest.5BE6F260A3E327EA.title": "AE2 Add-ons in the Pack",
  "quest.5BE6F260A3E327EA.quest_desc": [
    "&eMEGA Cells&r (much bigger cells), &eExtendedAE&r and &eAdvancedAE&r (better providers, interfaces and crafting), &eApplied Mekanistics&r (chemicals), &eAE2WTLib&r (a wireless universal terminal), &eME Requester&r (keeps chosen items in stock), &eAE2 Network Analyzer&r (see channels and cables) and &eArsEng&r (Ars Nouveau source on the network)."
  ],
  "quest.48E6E7A9BC97530B.title": "RS: a First Network",
  "quest.48E6E7A9BC97530B.quest_desc": [
    "A powered &eController&r, a &eDisk Drive&r with a storage disk and a &eGrid&r or &eCrafting Grid&r, joined by cables or touching. No channels: add as many devices as you like.",
    "",
    "The controller takes a Routing Matrix here, so RS starts in act III."
  ],
  "quest.7F33B19BDC69D950.title": "RS: Growing the Network",
  "quest.7F33B19BDC69D950.quest_desc": [
    "&eImporter&r and &eExporter&r move items in and out of machines, &eConstructor&r and &eDestructor&r place and break blocks, the &eDetector&r emits redstone by amount, a &eWireless Transmitter&r serves a wireless grid, &eNetwork Transmitter&r and &eReceiver&r link distant parts, and the &eAutocrafter&r runs &ePattern Grid&r patterns.",
    "",
    "RS Mekanism Integration adds chemicals."
  ],
  "quest.7E760A5EA79B9C7C.title": "Keep Your Drawers",
  "quest.7E760A5EA79B9C7C.quest_desc": [
    "No need to empty your chests: AE2's &eStorage Bus&r and RS's &eExternal Storage&r read any inventory they face, drawers and storage controllers included, and the terminal shows those items too.",
    "",
    "The drawer wall joins the network without moving a single cobblestone."
  ],
  "quest.3C697DA1AB61BAA2.title": "Autocrafting in One Paragraph",
  "quest.3C697DA1AB61BAA2.quest_desc": [
    "Encode a recipe into a &epattern&r, give the network somewhere to run it (an AE2 pattern provider with a molecular assembler or a machine, or an RS autocrafter) plus a crafting CPU in AE2, then ask the terminal for 64 of anything: it crafts the intermediate steps too.",
    "",
    "Act components are ordinary shaped recipes, so they autocraft like anything else."
  ],
  "quest.2A2C0CF0B5664397.title": "Quirk: Both Can Coexist",
  "quest.2A2C0CF0B5664397.quest_desc": [
    "AE2 in one base and Refined Storage in another is fine, but they do not share storage directly: bridge them through an inventory both can read, like a drawer or chest.",
    "",
    "For one team, one network is almost always easier."
  ],
  "quest.574E671F47BF610A.title": "Tip: Channels Without Tears",
  "quest.574E671F47BF610A.quest_desc": [
    "Each AE2 device uses one channel; normal cables carry 8, dense ones 32, and each controller face feeds 32. Run dense cable as the backbone and branch with normal cable.",
    "",
    "A powered device that stops working probably ran out of channels. The Network Analyzer shows where."
  ],
  "quest.1AE56B10894D452F.title": "The Network Feeds the Story",
  "quest.1AE56B10894D452F.quest_desc": [
    "Several act components are made from network parts: the Routing Matrix from logic processors and a circuit board, the Habitation Charter from a calculation processor, the Inventory Sensor from LaserIO logic chips.",
    "",
    "A network that autocrafts processors makes acts III and V much lighter."
  ],
  "quest.1EE0CB511BEDE3D0.title": "Everything in One Place",
  "quest.1EE0CB511BEDE3D0.quest_desc": [
    "With a network, the whole base is one searchable inventory, and logistics becomes feeding machines instead of finding items.",
    "",
    "You will never again lose a stack of iron in chest number forty."
  ],
  "chapter.7BF8A0F5CDAED7CF.title": "Create · Kinetics",
  "chapter.7BF8A0F5CDAED7CF.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Rotation does the work: from a water wheel to a wall of crafters."
  ],
  "quest.36D2DD9AC13B9B6B.title": "Andesite Alloy",
  "quest.36D2DD9AC13B9B6B.quest_subtitle": "Create's duct tape.",
  "quest.36D2DD9AC13B9B6B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Half of early Create starts right here.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_nugget\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Andesite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:andesite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"iron nuggets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_nugget\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in a 2×2 checkerboard: one alloy.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:andesite_alloy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"It builds shafts, casings, belts and most early machines.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Later a \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Mixer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_mixer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes it from one of each: half price.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2BAB95C4EE0C4C28.title": "Ponder it",
  "quest.2BAB95C4EE0C4C28.quest_subtitle": "The manual that moves.",
  "quest.2BAB95C4EE0C4C28.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hover any Create block and hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ponder.ponder\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "An animated scene shows how it works, step by step. The addons have scenes too."
  ],
  "quest.0DFA49B47F44AFC1.title": "Shafts and cogs",
  "quest.0DFA49B47F44AFC1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Rotation travels through these.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Two alloys stacked: eight \"},{\"text\":\"Shafts\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:shaft\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". They carry rotation straight.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A shaft and a plank: a \"},{\"text\":\"Cogwheel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:cogwheel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It turns its neighbour the other way.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Machine running backwards? Add or remove one cog.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.292FAA46D06198DB.title": "Shifting gears",
  "quest.292FAA46D06198DB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mesh a \"},{\"text\":\"Large Cogwheel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:large_cogwheel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" diagonally with a small one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Big to small: \"},{\"text\":\"twice\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" the speed.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Small to big: \"},{\"text\":\"half\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" the speed.\"}]",
    "",
    "Faster machines eat more stress: speed up only what needs it."
  ],
  "quest.06677D656B930724.title": "Elbow grease",
  "quest.06677D656B930724.quest_subtitle": "The first engine is you.",
  "quest.06677D656B930724.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three planks and an alloy: a \"},{\"text\":\"Hand Crank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:hand_crank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" right-click on it and the machine on the other end turns, for as long as your arm lasts.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7B2185253A34244F.title": "Let the river work",
  "quest.7B2185253A34244F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Free, steady, silent power.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Eight planks around a \"},{\"text\":\"Shaft\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:shaft\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It spins in flowing water: a river, a waterfall, a short stream.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"More water on more sides adds nothing. More wheels do.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Any plank reskins it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2EAA71F49CB4FDAC.title": "Bigger, slower, stronger",
  "quest.2EAA71F49CB4FDAC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Planks around a \"},{\"text\":\"Water Wheel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:water_wheel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the large one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Half\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" the speed.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Much more\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" stress capacity.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A large-to-small cog step wins the speed back.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3FBE996BD4292871.title": "Where the water isn't",
  "quest.3FBE996BD4292871.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Windmill Bearing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:windmill_bearing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns wind into rotation.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It spins a glued structure with at least \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" sail blocks. Sails stick without glue.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click it to start or stop.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"More sails, more speed.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6B9320A212975341.title": "Hot wheels",
  "quest.6B9320A212975341.quest_subtitle": "This shouldn't have worked.",
  "quest.6B9320A212975341.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lava turns a \"},{\"text\":\"Water Wheel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:water_wheel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" too.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nobody in Heliodor wrote that down, and there was a reason."
  ],
  "reward.55DD3FA18A257CC5.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.32437B2EDDAA6C80.title": "Dress the wood",
  "quest.32437B2EDDAA6C80.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click stripped logs or wood with \"},{\"text\":\"Andesite Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:andesite_alloy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Press, mixer, fan, millstone, drill, saw, bearing and gearbox all wear it.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Deployer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:deployer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" applies it for you later.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.192801180FAC4131.title": "Round the corner",
  "quest.192801180FAC4131.quest_subtitle": "Cleaner than cog spaghetti.",
  "quest.192801180FAC4131.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One block that turns rotation round corners.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Four cogs around an \"},{\"text\":\"Andesite Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:andesite_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Side outputs mirror each other.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The straight-through side runs \"},{\"text\":\"reversed\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.52292575E3352219.title": "Flat out",
  "quest.52292575E3352219.quest_subtitle": "Ingots in, pancakes out.",
  "quest.52292575E3352219.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Press\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_press\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" flattens what sits below it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"An item on the ground, on a \"},{\"text\":\"Depot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:depot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or riding a belt.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:iron_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Ingots come out as sheets.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Over a \"},{\"text\":\"Basin\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:basin\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" it compacts instead: \"},{\"text\":\"2×2\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"3×3\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" recipes, no hands.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2324180555060EA4.title": "Belts",
  "quest.2324180555060EA4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Six dried kelp: a \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Belt\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:belt_connector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Click two shafts to link them, \"},{\"text\":\"2 to 20\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks apart, even on a slope.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It carries items and mobs.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Machines above work on what rides past.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3D9C0C0B645B0ABC.title": "In and out",
  "quest.3D9C0C0B645B0ABC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Andesite Funnel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:andesite_funnel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" moves items in or out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Placed normally, it pulls from an inventory.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Placed while sneaking, it pushes into it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Depot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:depot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is a one-slot belt for machines and arms.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Funnels can't join two chests directly: put a chute or a belt between them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7FEAA44F45D5393B.title": "Down the chute",
  "quest.7FEAA44F45D5393B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chutes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:chute\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" drop items straight down between inventories.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Encased Fan\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:encased_fan\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at one end sends them \"},{\"text\":\"up\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" instead.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.58F59827A9B35689.title": "The big box",
  "quest.58F59827A9B35689.quest_subtitle": "No peeking.",
  "quest.58F59827A9B35689.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The perfect buffer between machines.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Item Vaults\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:item_vault\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" merge up to \"},{\"text\":\"3 wide\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" and hold a lot.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"No hand opens them: funnels, chutes and arms do.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.197D3E006CBF3A20.title": "Read the strain",
  "quest.197D3E006CBF3A20.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"See the stress, then fix it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:goggles\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Engineer's Goggles\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:goggles\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" show every machine's stress.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns parts and, sneaking, picks them up whole.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The goggles need a golden sheet: the press makes it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.774F011ABDD83F74.title": "Stress is the budget",
  "quest.774F011ABDD83F74.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sources add \"},{\"text\":\"stress capacity\",\"color\":\"#D8C8FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":\"Counted in su (stress units). Engineer's Goggles show it.\"}},{\"text\":\"; machines spend it, more the faster they spin.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Overspend\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" and the whole network stops.\"}]",
    "",
    "Any of these fixes it:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"More sources.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Slower machines.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Two networks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5D15941A9CF83546.title": "Wireless, the old way",
  "quest.5D15941A9CF83546.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two items in its slots set a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Link\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:redstone_link\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"'s frequency.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Links with the same pair talk across \"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks.\"}]",
    "",
    "Sneak-click swaps sender and receiver.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A link driving a \"},{\"text\":\"Clutch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:clutch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is the tidiest remote off switch.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.14D03D7EA54ADFD0.title": "Stir it up",
  "quest.14D03D7EA54ADFD0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Mixer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_mixer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" over a \"},{\"text\":\"Basin\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:basin\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs shapeless recipes.\"}]",
    "",
    "Create mixing too: alloys, dough, liquids.",
    "",
    "Results leave by the basin's outlet into an inventory below or beside.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two recipes match? A filter on the mixer picks one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1DC4E2140C4FC88C.title": "Hot air",
  "quest.1DC4E2140C4FC88C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Encased Fan\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:encased_fan\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pushes or pulls air by its spin.\"}]",
    "",
    "It drags items and mobs along.",
    "",
    "A catalyst block in the stream processes whatever flies through."
  ],
  "quest.77B5FE48A4FA129E.title": "Catalysts",
  "quest.77B5FE48A4FA129E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"What sits in the stream decides the job:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lava_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Lava or a lit \"},{\"translate\":\"block.create.blaze_burner\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\"},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"smelts\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:campfire\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Fire: \"},{\"text\":\"smokes\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:water_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Water: \"},{\"text\":\"washes\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:soul_campfire\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Soul fire: \"},{\"text\":\"haunts\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Food in lava burns: smoke it instead.\"}]",
    "",
    "Fan speed changes the reach, not the time."
  ],
  "quest.49913C7985EE46B8.title": "Grind, slowly",
  "quest.49913C7985EE46B8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Millstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:millstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" grinds what you feed it from the top.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:flint\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Gravel into flint.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:wheat_flour\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Wheat into flour.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:red_dye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Flowers into dye.\"}]",
    "",
    "Slow and cheap; crushing wheels do it better later."
  ],
  "quest.175083F5E8E666B3.title": "Fire in a cage",
  "quest.175083F5E8E666B3.quest_subtitle": "Blaze, meet your new job.",
  "quest.175083F5E8E666B3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Iron sheets and netherrack make an empty \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Burner\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:blaze_burner\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click a Blaze or its spawner to fill it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:coal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Fed fuel, it \"},{\"text\":\"heats\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" the basin above.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:blaze_cake\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Fed a \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Cake\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:blaze_cake\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", it \"},{\"text\":\"superheats\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.28659381D2A10DC1.title": "Pipes and pumps",
  "quest.28659381D2A10DC1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copper on stripped wood gives \"},{\"text\":\"Copper Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:copper_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A cog on a \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Pipe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:fluid_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Pump\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_pump\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Its arrow, not the rotation, sets which way the fluid goes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3DBB3FB6F656AA03.title": "Tanks",
  "quest.3DBB3FB6F656AA03.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fluid Tanks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:fluid_tank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" merge into one big tank.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Up to \"},{\"text\":\"3×3\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" wide and over \"},{\"text\":\"30\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" tall.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A comparator reads the level.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hands can't pour into them: use a basin, a spout or an item drain.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Hose Pulley\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:hose_pulley\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in a big enough lake pumps forever.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.76BB178286CE5FED.title": "Full steam",
  "quest.76BB178286CE5FED.quest_subtitle": "The whistle is optional. Mostly.",
  "quest.76BB178286CE5FED.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A boiler, in three parts:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Steam Engines\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:steam_engine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a tank.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Burners below.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Water piped in.\"}]",
    "",
    "Each boiler level runs one more engine at full power; the goggles say what's missing."
  ],
  "quest.504F53D3F800ED8B.title": "Pipe dream",
  "quest.504F53D3F800ED8B.quest_subtitle": "The neighbours have opinions.",
  "quest.504F53D3F800ED8B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Twelve \"},{\"text\":\"Steam Whistles\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:steam_whistle\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", twelve pitches, one tank.\"}]",
    "",
    "Heliodor's copper had a sound; now yours does too."
  ],
  "reward.137B52306D96A3F3.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.26297EDEF72560DF.title": "Down to brass tacks",
  "quest.26297EDEF72560DF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Brass opens the second age.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"One copper and one \"},{\"text\":\"Zinc Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:zinc_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in a heated basin give \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Brass Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:brass_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Zinc ore spawns in the Overworld.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Smart logistics, deployers, arms, crafters.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"And the \"},{\"text\":\"addons\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2FD24C6ADC23649E\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.40B30AC5E7D15961.title": "Pink and polished",
  "quest.40B30AC5E7D15961.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One quartz and eight redstone: \"},{\"text\":\"Rose Quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:rose_quartz\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sand_paper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Polish it with \"},{\"text\":\"Sand Paper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sand_paper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in one hand and the quartz in the other.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:polished_rose_quartz\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Or leave it to a deployer.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.411293F478ED352C.title": "The brass jacket",
  "quest.411293F478ED352C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The body of every smart machine.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" A \"},{\"text\":\"Brass Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:brass_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on stripped wood.\"}]",
    "",
    "Crafters, arms, tunnels and the speed controller all wear it."
  ],
  "quest.21FEAE578271FEFD.title": "Picky funnels",
  "quest.21FEAE578271FEFD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Brass Funnel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:brass_funnel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" moves:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"whole stacks,\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"exact amounts,\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"only what its filter lets through.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Brass Tunnel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:brass_tunnel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a belt filters each side: blocks what comes in, sorts what goes out.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2D7CF472187B0DCC.title": "Tunnel modes",
  "quest.2D7CF472187B0DCC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tunnels on side-by-side belts join up.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Split\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" spreads a stack evenly.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Round Robin\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" cycles whole stacks.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Prefer Nearest\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" favours the closest exit.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Synchronize\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" waits for every belt.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.25D97F2683BD89CD.title": "Filters with taste",
  "quest.25D97F2683BD89CD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Either fits any Create filter slot.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"List Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" matches a set of items.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:attribute_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Attribute Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:attribute_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" matches a property, like 'can be smelted' or a tag.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3D18D702CE0F07CE.title": "Stop when full",
  "quest.3D18D702CE0F07CE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Threshold Switch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:stockpile_switch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" watches how full a box is.\"}]",
    "",
    "It turns on above one fill level and off below another.",
    "",
    "Wire it to a clutch and the machine rests when the chest is full."
  ],
  "quest.3469F859B3B7AB74.title": "Brains in a bulb",
  "quest.3469F859B3B7AB74.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every smart block carries one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:polished_rose_quartz\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Polished Rose Quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:polished_rose_quartz\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on an \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Sheet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:iron_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Funnels, tunnels, deployers, crafters, observers.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Make a handful; they go fast.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6DCD494665B52E7A.title": "Signs of life",
  "quest.6DCD494665B52E7A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Display Link\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:display_link\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reads a source and writes it somewhere.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Reads: stock, boiler, stress, train arrivals.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Writes on: a \"},{\"text\":\"Display Board\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:display_board\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a sign or nixie tubes.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Click the display first, then place the link on the source.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7DA2CEAEEF72E8D0.title": "Launch, precisely",
  "quest.7DA2CEAEEF72E8D0.quest_subtitle": "Yeeting, but polite.",
  "quest.7DA2CEAEEF72E8D0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Anything set on a \"},{\"text\":\"Weighted Ejector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:weighted_ejector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" flies to the target.\"}]",
    "",
    "Items, mobs, you.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Sneak-click to aim it, then place it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Aimed at an inventory, it waits for room.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.66A1273DEB5E3931.title": "A second pair of hands",
  "quest.66A1273DEB5E3931.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Deployer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:deployer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is a mechanical you.\"}]",
    "",
    "It places, uses, harvests and hits two blocks ahead.",
    "",
    "With an item in hand, it works on whatever sits below on a depot or belt."
  ],
  "quest.45749A42F9EAE9F2.title": "Assembly, in order",
  "quest.45749A42F9EAE9F2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Some parts are built in steps.\"}]",
    "",
    "The base becomes an unfinished item that passes a list of machines a set number of times.",
    "",
    "A belt looping back to its start runs it hands-free."
  ],
  "quest.3BA376D13AB65787.title": "One swing only",
  "quest.3BA376D13AB65787.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With a filter, a deployer only acts while holding the matching item.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Redstone stops it after the current swing: a short pulse gives \"},{\"text\":\"exactly one\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" use.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.748EE5CD50175AA3.title": "Pound it",
  "quest.748EE5CD50175AA3.quest_subtitle": "Solidarity among machines.",
  "quest.748EE5CD50175AA3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Deployers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:deployer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" face to face, both punching.\"}]",
    "",
    "Somewhere a union is forming."
  ],
  "reward.4595F147678799D6.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.2EC497FEE0F48D91.title": "Precision work",
  "quest.2EC497FEE0F48D91.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four in five come out right; the rest is scrap.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Start from a \"},{\"text\":\"Golden Sheet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:golden_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from the \"},{\"text\":\"press\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"52292575E3352219\"}},{\"text\":\". Then \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" loops of deployers add:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"a cogwheel,\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"a large cogwheel,\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_nugget\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"an iron nugget.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The result is a \"},{\"text\":\"Precision Mechanism\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:precision_mechanism\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Arms, speed controllers, train controls and two act components need it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1900C15D452488A4.title": "Cruise control",
  "quest.1900C15D452488A4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Run a line at what the recipe needs, not a notch more.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Rotation Speed Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:rotation_speed_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (brass casing and a precision mechanism) drives a large cog on top at the exact speed on its panel.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.10FBE1404F8230D8.title": "Pick and place",
  "quest.10FBE1404F8230D8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tell the \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Arm\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_arm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" where before you place it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Click its targets with it in hand: \"},{\"text\":\"blue\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" takes.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Click again for \"},{\"text\":\"yellow\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\", which gives.\"}]",
    "",
    "Then it shuttles items between any number of them."
  ],
  "quest.55DA919A83044D72.title": "Arm etiquette",
  "quest.55DA919A83044D72.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With several outputs, pick a mode:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Round Robin\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" cycles.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Forced Round Robin\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" waits for each.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Prefer First\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" fills the first.\"}]",
    "",
    "Feeding blaze burners is the classic first job."
  ],
  "quest.109581D1AA0DA93E.title": "Kitchen shift",
  "quest.109581D1AA0DA93E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Dinner, automated.\"}]",
    "",
    "With Central Kitchen, Create runs Farmer's Delight pots, stoves and feasts.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Slicer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sliceanddice:slicer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" does the knife work.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.03BDE2ED061B5940.title": "DJ Arm",
  "quest.03BDE2ED061B5940.quest_subtitle": "Requests not accepted.",
  "quest.03BDE2ED061B5940.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Arm\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_arm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" working a jukebox.\"}]",
    "",
    "It has one song and it loves it."
  ],
  "reward.445533AD3AEB408F.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.5E11DCB2FA716F05.title": "Crafting, industrialised",
  "quest.5E11DCB2FA716F05.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A grid of them crafts any recipe, \"},{\"text\":\"5×5\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" included.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A tube, a brass casing and a crafting table make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Crafters\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_crafter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wrench their arrows so every path ends at one exit.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7E52D88B6EC82066.title": "Fill 'er up",
  "quest.7E52D88B6EC82066.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A pipe-fed \"},{\"text\":\"Spout\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:spout\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fills what sits below.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Buckets, bottles, potions, honey. An \"},{\"text\":\"Item Drain\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:item_drain\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" does the opposite.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Spout lava onto \"},{\"text\":\"Powdered Obsidian\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:powdered_obsidian\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and press it twice: \"},{\"text\":\"Sturdy Sheets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sturdy_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", where \"},{\"text\":\"trains\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"06C76EF421D48687\"}},{\"text\":\" begin.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.44862012259D890D.title": "Cake for the blaze",
  "quest.44862012259D890D.quest_subtitle": "The cake is not a lie.",
  "quest.44862012259D890D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Some recipes demand a superheated burner.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:blaze_cake_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Compact egg, sugar and \"},{\"text\":\"Cinder Flour\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:cinder_flour\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into a base.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:blaze_cake\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A spout fills it with \"},{\"text\":\"250 mB\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" of lava: a \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Cake\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:blaze_cake\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Fed one, a burner superheats."
  ],
  "quest.1CAAE66B26E73138.title": "Alloy run",
  "quest.1CAAE66B26E73138.quest_subtitle": "Same time tomorrow?",
  "quest.1CAAE66B26E73138.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"For the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"32\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Andesite Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:andesite_alloy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "A mixer on a belt makes this a coffee break."
  ],
  "quest.188EC2F2CE68070A.title": "The big grind",
  "quest.188EC2F2CE68070A.quest_subtitle": "It takes twenty-five crafters.",
  "quest.188EC2F2CE68070A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two wheels that chew whatever falls between them.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"5×5\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" mechanical recipe of \"},{\"text\":\"Andesite Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:andesite_alloy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", planks and stone makes a pair of \"},{\"text\":\"Crushing Wheels\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:crushing_wheel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Side by side, spinning into each other.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:entrelumen:textures/gui/quests/diagram_crushing.png width:96 height:48 align:center}",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:crushed_raw_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Raw ore comes out crushed, with bonus nuggets and a chance of XP.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:cinder_flour\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Netherrack becomes \"},{\"text\":\"Cinder Flour\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:cinder_flour\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Faster wheels, faster grind.\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.41BF50CEC2C30E7E.title": "Ore arithmetic",
  "quest.41BF50CEC2C30E7E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One raw iron, one crushed iron, plus \"},{\"text\":\"75%\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" of an XP nugget.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Smelt it: an ingot.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_nugget\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Or wash it with a fan: \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" nuggets and a chance of redstone.\"}]",
    "",
    "Silk-touched ore crushes into more."
  ],
  "quest.3D3DA4463A800E10.title": "Crushing it",
  "quest.3D3DA4463A800E10.quest_subtitle": "Somewhere, a mountain flinched.",
  "quest.3D3DA4463A800E10.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Crushing Wheels\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:crushing_wheel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at maximum speed.\"}]",
    "",
    "The stress bill is someone else's problem, right?"
  ],
  "reward.39F4127F304A766F.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.746839F1A3A4F3E8.title": "A note in the margin",
  "quest.746839F1A3A4F3E8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two wheels, one purpose: whatever falls between them comes out useful. We built a whole city on that idea. —T.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "quest.2BCA4E743126A82D.title": "Creative parts",
  "quest.2BCA4E743126A82D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Real power runs on water, wind and steam.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Creative Motor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:creative_motor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", tank and blaze cake cost \"},{\"text\":\"two Luminosities\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" each, from Solsticio in act VI.\"}]",
    "",
    "The Creative Crate can't be crafted."
  ],
  "quest.580233BFC09F3DB6.title": "Air on tap",
  "quest.580233BFC09F3DB6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Air for Create's equipment, carried on your back.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Copper, a copper block, alloy and a shaft make a \"},{\"text\":\"Copper Backtank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:copper_backtank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "On a spinning shaft it fills with air, faster the faster it spins.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It holds \"},{\"text\":\"900\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" air by default; each level of the Capacity enchantment adds \"},{\"text\":\"300\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7B6FA9536DD302E1.title": "Deep breath",
  "quest.7B6FA9536DD302E1.quest_subtitle": "Glub.",
  "quest.7B6FA9536DD302E1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Breathe and walk underwater while the air lasts.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:copper_diving_helmet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Copper Diving Helmet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:copper_diving_helmet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": copper around a glass block. With the backtank on, you breathe.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:copper_diving_boots\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Copper Diving Boots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:copper_diving_boots\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sink you fast; walk and jump on the seabed.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With those boots on, belts don't carry you off either.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7C90B6B91D100029.title": "Swim with the striders",
  "quest.7C90B6B91D100029.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fire and lava can't touch you while the air lasts.\"}]",
    "",
    "At a smithing table, netherite upgrades turn the copper set into:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:netherite_diving_helmet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Netherite Diving Helmet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:netherite_diving_helmet\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Netherite Backtank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:netherite_backtank\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:netherite_diving_boots\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Netherite Diving Boots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:netherite_diving_boots\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Only with netherite leggings as well.\"}]",
    "",
    "The helmet also lets you see inside lava."
  ],
  "quest.05AA974586D4598C.title": "Drink the lake",
  "quest.05AA974586D4598C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"For filling or draining a whole lake.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A copper casing, a dried kelp block and a copper sheet make a \"},{\"text\":\"Hose Pulley\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:hose_pulley\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Turned one way it lowers its hose; the other way it reels it in.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Pipes on its far side feed it to fill a pool, or pull from it to drain one.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In a big enough ocean or lava lake it never runs dry and never changes the source.\"}]",
    "",
    "How fast it moves fluid depends only on the pipes."
  ],
  "quest.586B4F391CD54421.title": "A longer arm",
  "quest.586B4F391CD54421.quest_subtitle": "Boioioing.",
  "quest.586B4F391CD54421.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three more blocks of reach for your main hand.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Mechanical crafters build it from a \"},{\"text\":\"Brass Hand\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:brass_hand\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a precision mechanism, brass and sticks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hold the \"},{\"text\":\"Extendo Grip\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:extendo_grip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the off-hand.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With a backtank on, it spends air instead of durability.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.16C5898A367F6101.title": "Both hands",
  "quest.16C5898A367F6101.quest_subtitle": "The top shelf is no longer safe.",
  "quest.16C5898A367F6101.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Extendo Grip\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:extendo_grip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in each hand.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"+5\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks of reach. Cookie jars everywhere, beware.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.4CE0F61439CFB2E7.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.1B9743748D07B4F4.title": "Hot potato",
  "quest.1B9743748D07B4F4.quest_subtitle": "Fwoomp.",
  "quest.1B9743748D07B4F4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Potato Cannon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:potato_cannon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fires food from your inventory.\"}]",
    "",
    "Each kind its own way:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:potato\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Potatoes knock back hard.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:carrot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Carrots and potatoes plant themselves where they land.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:golden_apple\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A golden apple cures a zombie villager.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With a backtank on, it spends air instead of durability.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0A05E93762155161.title": "Food fight",
  "quest.0A05E93762155161.quest_subtitle": "Nobody wins. Everyone's hungry.",
  "quest.0A05E93762155161.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two different vegetables, fired into each other in midair.\"}]",
    "",
    "It was never about the aim."
  ],
  "reward.6B05F217F9BF73FB.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.40ADDA07025F7B71.title": "Mirror, mirror",
  "quest.40ADDA07025F7B71.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Build one side and get the other free.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Anywhere in your hotbar, a \"},{\"text\":\"Wand Of Symmetry\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:wand_of_symmetry\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" mirrors every block you place.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Use it on a surface to set or move the mirror.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Sneak while using it to pick the kind of mirror.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.05E72338D4DA667D.title": "Any toolbox",
  "quest.7F3A78A2696CD6DA.title": "A place for every tool",
  "quest.7F3A78A2696CD6DA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Your tools, one key away.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A cogwheel, two golden sheets, a chest and leather make a \"},{\"text\":\"Toolbox\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:brown_toolbox\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; dye recolors it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" kinds of items, up to \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" stacks of each.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It keeps them when you pick it up.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Within \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks, hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"create.keyinfo.toolbelt\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" to take a tool straight out of it; the same menu puts it back.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5AD77CC119527E20.title": "Copy, paste",
  "quest.5AD77CC119527E20.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Settings, carried from one block to another.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Alloy, paper and planks make a \"},{\"text\":\"Clipboard\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:clipboard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for notes and checklists; sneak-click to hang it on a wall.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Right-click a block: copy its settings, like a filter.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Left-click another block: paste them.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A schematicannon prints a schematic's list of materials onto it."
  ],
  "quest.61D286FCE52F9734.title": "Save a building",
  "quest.61D286FCE52F9734.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Any build, saved to a file.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:empty_schematic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Paper and light blue dye: an \"},{\"text\":\"Empty Schematic\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:empty_schematic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:schematic_and_quill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Add a feather: a \"},{\"text\":\"Schematic And Quill\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:schematic_and_quill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Right-click two corners, stretch the faces with \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"create.keyinfo.ctrl_modifier\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and the scroll wheel, then right-click again to save it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.70E9C61DD9F565CC.title": "From file to paper",
  "quest.70E9C61DD9F565CC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wooden slabs on smooth stone make a \"},{\"text\":\"Schematic Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:schematic_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Put an empty schematic in and pick a file from your schematics folder.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:schematic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Out comes a \"},{\"text\":\"Schematic\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:schematic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a hologram to move, turn and mirror before you set it in place.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2F29287CA2D3B1E5.title": "Print it",
  "quest.2F29287CA2D3B1E5.quest_subtitle": "Aim at the plan, not the neighbours.",
  "quest.2F29287CA2D3B1E5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Schematicannon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:schematicannon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" builds a placed schematic block by block.\"}]",
    "",
    "It takes the blocks from the chests next to it.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:gunpowder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Fuel: gunpowder. One piece fires \"},{\"text\":\"400\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks by default.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Its settings choose what it may replace.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:clipboard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A clipboard or a book in its printer slot gets the list of missing materials.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7546418F3079CEC6.title": "Recipes on the wall",
  "quest.7546418F3079CEC6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A painting and a crafting table make a \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Blueprint\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:crafting_blueprint\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Hang it up and set a recipe in each slot.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Right-click a slot to craft it from what you carry.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Sneak for a whole stack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4A0BFFF481476506.title": "Tea break",
  "quest.4A0BFFF481476506.quest_subtitle": "Motivating. Also filling.",
  "quest.4A0BFFF481476506.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three minutes of Haste, even on a full stomach.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Leaves, water and milk in a heated mixer brew tea.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:builders_tea\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A spout pours \"},{\"text\":\"250 mB\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" into a glass bottle: \"},{\"text\":\"Builder's Tea\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:builders_tea\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.06545029F3897532.title": "Sweet tooth",
  "quest.06545029F3897532.quest_subtitle": "A balanced diet, technically.",
  "quest.06545029F3897532.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sugar, cocoa and milk in a heated mixer melt into chocolate.\"}]",
    "",
    "Then, from one spout:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:chocolate_glazed_berries\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Chocolate on sweet berries: \"},{\"text\":\"Chocolate Glazed Berries\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:chocolate_glazed_berries\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:honeyed_apple\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Honey on an apple: a \"},{\"text\":\"Honeyed Apple\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:honeyed_apple\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sweet_roll\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Milk on bread: a \"},{\"text\":\"Sweet Roll\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sweet_roll\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:bar_of_chocolate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A press over a basin compacts chocolate into a \"},{\"text\":\"Bar of Chocolate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:bar_of_chocolate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4910DBA213EDF501.title": "Is it time?",
  "quest.4910DBA213EDF501.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Planks, an andesite casing and a clock make a \"},{\"text\":\"Cuckoo Clock\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:cuckoo_clock\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Give it rotation and it shows the time. Its bird sings twice a day:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"at noon,\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"at dusk, once you can sleep.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Gunpowder around one makes a clock that looks the same and ends its song with a bang.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.50DFA9AA910E93C3.title": "Ring for trouble",
  "quest.50DFA9AA910E93C3.quest_subtitle": "It hears the dark.",
  "quest.50DFA9AA910E93C3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It shows the dark spots where monsters can spawn.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A block of brass on a brass sheet makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Peculiar Bell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:peculiar_bell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Set it over soul fire, or haunt it with a fan, and it wakes up as a \"},{\"text\":\"Haunted Bell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:haunted_bell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Hold it or ring it.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.7968684ACFC2A3DE.title": "Zinc from the ground",
  "quest.51319C53C1B7B9D7.title": "Where the zinc is",
  "quest.51319C53C1B7B9D7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Zinc runs through the Overworld in veins of up to a dozen blocks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"From the deepslate up to height \"},{\"text\":\"70\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:raw_zinc\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Smelt the \"},{\"text\":\"Raw Zinc\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:raw_zinc\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:crushed_raw_zinc\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Or crush it first: a crushed zinc and a chance of XP each.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:zinc_nugget\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Washed with a fan: \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" nuggets and sometimes gunpowder.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.1BF037F5B63180E7.title": "Sixteen of Create's stones",
  "quest.75FCF0FB22AFD634.title": "Stone with a streak",
  "quest.75FCF0FB22AFD634.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Striped layers underground hide Create's stones.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Asurine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:asurine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Crimsite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:crimsite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Ochrum\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:ochrum\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Veridium\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:veridium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Limestone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:limestone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"In the Nether: \"},{\"text\":\"Scoria\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:scoria\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Scorchia\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:scorchia\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Crushed, the colored ones give bits of zinc, iron, gold or copper.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "At the stonecutter each stone comes cut, polished, as bricks or as a pillar."
  ],
  "quest.7B3A88E315D4EDA2.title": "Light the workshop",
  "quest.7B3A88E315D4EDA2.quest_subtitle": "It's dark down here.",
  "quest.7B3A88E315D4EDA2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Somebody has to turn the lights on.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: just light."
  ],
  "quest.1C8DCBF111AE5165.title": "Pull the whistle",
  "quest.1C8DCBF111AE5165.quest_subtitle": "Toot.",
  "quest.1C8DCBF111AE5165.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every boiler deserves a whistle.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nothing to build. Just steam."
  ],
  "image.2A653D76CA25CD0C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"CREATE\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.74260EE316AF76DE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Kinetics\",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"}]",
  "image.1FE0475DAAB53FD5.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.3D50EBE6687BA19D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Belts\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.1F7B2790703EA969.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pipes and steam\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.641D24F8B583D741.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Diving\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.79A147A4B27B1C0B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Zinc and stone\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.3ACCBA9B359BC397.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Schematics\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.0C58D45D8B166F9A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sorting\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.5714FB7605F9D83E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tools and treats\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.3445AFFD4592C1F4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Brass\",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"}]",
  "chapter.5A7AEEAF7E51A9E7.title": "Create · Contraptions",
  "chapter.5A7AEEAF7E51A9E7.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Glue it, move it, put it to work: machines that go where the work is."
  ],
  "quest.576CE9D64BAE34C7.title": "Things that move",
  "quest.576CE9D64BAE34C7.quest_subtitle": "Every contraption starts with a turn.",
  "quest.576CE9D64BAE34C7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Bearing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_bearing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" grabs the block in front of it and everything stuck to that block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Spin the bearing and the lot turns as one.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Stop it and it settles back into blocks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Built something in front of a bearing that is already spinning? Right-click the bearing with an empty hand to take it aboard.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.01CEFE6A056B4953.title": "Stick together",
  "quest.01CEFE6A056B4953.quest_subtitle": "Not for mending vases.",
  "quest.01CEFE6A056B4953.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two slimeballs, an iron sheet and an iron nugget make \"},{\"text\":\"Super Glue\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:super_glue\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Click two corners to glue a box: the blocks inside hold on to each other and move as one.",
    "",
    "Punch a box with the glue in hand to take it off."
  ],
  "quest.0BAB084884161BB3.title": "In a straight line",
  "quest.0BAB084884161BB3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Piston\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_piston\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" slides the structure in front of it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"As far as the \"},{\"text\":\"Piston Extension Poles\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:piston_extension_pole\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" behind it allow.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Rotation sets the speed and which way it goes.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"No poles, no movement. The default limit is \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" poles.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.76212786ECF9AAA2.title": "Drill and saw",
  "quest.76212786ECF9AAA2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two tools that cut through the world, standing still or on the move.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Standing still, a \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Drill\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_drill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" breaks the block in front.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Saw\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_saw\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fells a whole tree from its bottom log.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"On a moving contraption, both work every block they pass.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A saw facing up cuts one alloy into six shafts. Crafting gives four.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.573C0C430FF452E0.title": "Put it to work",
  "quest.573C0C430FF452E0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Build a structure with drills, saws or harvesters aboard and set it moving.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"What they break goes into the chests, barrels or vaults glued to it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"With nowhere to go, it drops.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A piston full of drills bores a tunnel.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A bearing full of saws clears a grove.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.207B6029DE60C862.title": "Unload on the fly",
  "quest.207B6029DE60C862.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An andesite casing and a chute make a \"},{\"text\":\"Portable Storage Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:portable_storage_interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"One rides on the structure, another stands still one or two blocks away.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"When they meet, the still one acts as every inventory aboard, for funnels and chutes to fill or empty.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The structure waits while items move and sets off once they stop.",
    "",
    "Redstone on the still interface keeps it from connecting."
  ],
  "quest.0DDEA08A35DA640B.title": "On rails",
  "quest.0DDEA08A35DA640B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Cart Assembler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:cart_assembler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sits on a rail.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Powered, it mounts the structure attached to it on the next minecart that passes.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Unpowered, it turns passing cart structures back into blocks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A wrench on the minecart picks up the whole thing as one item, to set down on other rails.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.438DF3D8ABD46C10.title": "A cart that paves its way",
  "quest.438DF3D8ABD46C10.quest_subtitle": "It lays the track it runs on.",
  "quest.438DF3D8ABD46C10.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Build a minecart structure with a \"},{\"text\":\"Deployer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:deployer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" aimed at the ground ahead and rails in a chest aboard.\"}]",
    "",
    "As it rolls, the deployer lays the next rail and the cart keeps going.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A furnace minecart feeds itself from the chests aboard, and couplings add room.",
    "",
    "The same idea paves roads with a roller, or builds a whole schematic from a deployer's filter."
  ],
  "quest.3AD62FB30D7F2FFC.title": "Telling time",
  "quest.3AD62FB30D7F2FFC.quest_subtitle": "The hands are yours to build.",
  "quest.3AD62FB30D7F2FFC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Clockwork Bearing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:clockwork_bearing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns its structure with the time of day: an hour hand.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A slab, a brass casing and an electron tube make it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Build a second structure in front of it, not glued to the first: that one is the minute hand.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Right-click to start or stop it. Its panel swaps which hand goes first, or makes a \"},{\"text\":\"24\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"-hour dial.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.75F7746CA473FDC0.title": "Stay or settle",
  "quest.75F7746CA473FDC0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A stopped bearing sets its blocks down at the nearest right angle; pistons and pulleys, wherever they stop. Each one's panel can keep the structure assembled at rest instead, or set it down only back at the start.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.58A9E1C9958DE307.title": "Keep it level",
  "quest.58A9E1C9958DE307.quest_subtitle": "Ferris wheel rules.",
  "quest.58A9E1C9958DE307.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A bearing that rides on another moving structure keeps itself upright, and so does whatever hangs from it. Cabins on a big wheel stay level all the way round.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.55805B91CE320A6F.title": "Sail cloth",
  "quest.55805B91CE320A6F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Any structure with at least \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" sail blocks on a \"},{\"text\":\"Windmill Bearing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:windmill_bearing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is a windmill.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Windmill Sails\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:white_sail\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and their frames attach without glue.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Wool counts as sail too, glued like any block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" sails add \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" RPM, up to \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Dye paints a sail and shears turn it back into a \"},{\"text\":\"Windmill Sail Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sail_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Frames let a fan's air through.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.471C1E864A869416.title": "Gale force",
  "quest.471C1E864A869416.quest_subtitle": "Hold on to your hat.",
  "quest.471C1E864A869416.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A windmill at full strength: \"},{\"text\":\"128\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" sails, \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" RPM.\"}]",
    "",
    "Somewhere, a kite is green with envy."
  ],
  "reward.261432547F7E92BB.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.7A14A705869A2D7D.title": "How big can it get",
  "quest.7A14A705869A2D7D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Create's defaults, which this pack keeps:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Up to \"},{\"text\":\"2048\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks per structure\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Chassis reach \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" piston poles\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"384\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks of rope\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks of roller fill\"}]",
    "",
    "Bigger than that, build two."
  ],
  "quest.0001FA03256BDB03.title": "Sticky sides",
  "quest.0001FA03256BDB03.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Logs and alloy make three \"},{\"text\":\"Linear Chassis\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:linear_chassis\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click an open face with a slimeball and that face picks up the line of blocks in front of it, up to \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" long.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The wrench sets the exact reach.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Chassis of the same kind on the same axis link up and travel together.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Secondary Linear Chassis\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:secondary_linear_chassis\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" won't join the plain ones: two groups side by side.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0DEACFC34FFB0AB6.title": "Grab and let go",
  "quest.0DEACFC34FFB0AB6.quest_subtitle": "A claw machine you actually win.",
  "quest.0DEACFC34FFB0AB6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Sticker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sticker\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" flips with each redstone signal:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"On, it holds the block in front and takes it along when the structure moves\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Flipped again, it lets go\"}]",
    "",
    "Cranes and block movers start here."
  ],
  "quest.4092A16E02C683AD.title": "In the round",
  "quest.4092A16E02C683AD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Radial Chassis\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:radial_chassis\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" grabs a whole layer around it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A slimed side takes every block it can reach on that layer, within a radius set with the wrench.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Stack a column of them on one bearing and a whole wheel turns.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.50B48C71EAEBF893.title": "When glue isn't needed",
  "quest.50B48C71EAEBF893.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blocks that hang on others, like torches or ladders, come along without glue. Overlapping glue boxes move together, and so do blocks sharing one box.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0F73152348B2F958.title": "Bring it back",
  "quest.0F73152348B2F958.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A slimeball on a piston makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Sticky Mechanical Piston\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sticky_mechanical_piston\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The plain one only pushes.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The sticky one also pulls its structure back when the rotation reverses.\"}]",
    "",
    "Doors, bridges and lifts that come home."
  ],
  "quest.69E8A1D1A706CF85.title": "Straight down",
  "quest.69E8A1D1A706CF85.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Rope Pulley\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:rope_pulley\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" lowers the structure beneath it on a rope and hauls it back up.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Rotation sets the speed and the way.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Up to \"},{\"text\":\"384\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks of rope by default.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Other pulleys on the same layer hook onto the load, only for looks.",
    "",
    "A pulley carried by another structure drags its load along, but it can only be moved while it's stopped."
  ],
  "quest.28EEE016DEAF098C.title": "Going up",
  "quest.28EEE016DEAF098C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Elevator Pulley\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:elevator_pulley\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" moves a cabin between floors.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Glue a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Contact\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:redstone_contact\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to the cabin facing a fixed one, give the pulley rotation and right-click it to assemble.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every fixed contact in that column becomes an \"},{\"text\":\"Elevator Contact\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:elevator_contact\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a floor.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A redstone pulse there calls the cabin.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click the pulley again to turn the cabin back into blocks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.55A135C42438CD85.title": "All the way down",
  "quest.55A135C42438CD85.quest_subtitle": "Is it still going?",
  "quest.55A135C42438CD85.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Over \"},{\"text\":\"200\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks of rope, and the bottom is still out of sight.\"}]",
    "",
    "Tie a note to the end for whoever finds it."
  ],
  "reward.15613D29B64A2A3B.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.1F36AA47D9A7ADB7.title": "Ding, third floor",
  "quest.1F36AA47D9A7ADB7.quest_subtitle": "Mind the doors.",
  "quest.1F36AA47D9A7ADB7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Name each floor in its contact.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Contraption Controls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:contraption_controls\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the cabin pick a floor from inside.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Sliding doors on board open on arrival.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Desk Bell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:desk_bell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" rings when it gets there.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each contact gives a signal while the cabin is at its floor, and a display link on one shows the current floor."
  ],
  "quest.21B27FABDE1FB23F.title": "Along the rack",
  "quest.21B27FABDE1FB23F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Gantry Carriage\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:gantry_carriage\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" rides a shaft and carries its structure along.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Two alloys and a redstone make \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Gantry Shafts\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:gantry_shaft\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Spin the shaft and the carriage slides.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The shaft's facing and the spin decide which way.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Power a shaft with redstone and its carriages stop, while the spin passes on to the shaft sticking out of each carriage."
  ],
  "quest.094AAFE60FF3FF14.title": "Gantries on gantries",
  "quest.094AAFE60FF3FF14.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A gantry shaft sticks to a carriage without glue, and a carriage rides its shaft even while that shaft is being moved. Stack them and one machine covers two or three axes: a crane, a quarry, a 3D printer.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2F49B4B21B3181B3.title": "Harvest on the move",
  "quest.2F49B4B21B3181B3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"On a moving structure, a \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Harvester\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_harvester\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reaps every ripe crop it passes and plants it again.\"}]",
    "",
    "Unripe crops are left alone."
  ],
  "quest.2998B1ADE612ACCA.title": "Plough through",
  "quest.2998B1ADE612ACCA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A moving \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Plough\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_plough\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" tills dirt into farmland.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It breaks whatever has no solid hitbox: grass, flowers, torches.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Mobs in its way get launched, unhurt.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.43881B22666000B8.title": "Heavy delivery",
  "quest.43881B22666000B8.quest_subtitle": "Return to sender.",
  "quest.43881B22666000B8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A plough launches anvils too.\"}]",
    "",
    "Please aim away from the workshop."
  ],
  "reward.3827429B4948B776.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.36EA364D9557CAC2.title": "Farms that walk",
  "quest.36EA364D9557CAC2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Harvesters on a sticky piston that sweeps a field back and forth make a crop farm. For wood, saws on the move and \"},{\"text\":\"Tree Fertilizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:tree_fertilizer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which grows a tree even where there's no room for one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2FC39C5CD9FD451E.title": "Paving the way",
  "quest.2FC39C5CD9FD451E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An electron tube, an andesite casing and a \"},{\"text\":\"Crushing Wheel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:crushing_wheel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Roller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_roller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"With no material set it clears like a drill.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Give it a paving block, stocked in a chest aboard, and it replaces the layer below as it goes.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Its fill modes lay columns or slopes down to the ground, up to \"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" deep, without breaking anything.\"}]",
    "",
    "Blocks a roller breaks may drop nothing."
  ],
  "quest.353FA4651917FE89.title": "Hands on the move",
  "quest.353FA4651917FE89.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A deployer on a moving structure acts at every block it passes, with items from any inventory aboard; its filter picks which. Put a positioned schematic in that filter and it builds the schematic as it goes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5799D2801D01D95F.title": "Off switch",
  "quest.5799D2801D01D95F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Actors on a moving structure are always on.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A button, an andesite casing and an electron tube make \"},{\"text\":\"Contraption Controls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:contraption_controls\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which toggle them on the fly from anywhere aboard.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Set the filter before assembling to target one kind.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Powered as it assembles, that kind starts off.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.29F99EA50E783C52.title": "Any seat",
  "quest.65B5F49A8836E99B.title": "Take a seat",
  "quest.65B5F49A8836E99B.quest_subtitle": "Please keep your arms inside.",
  "quest.65B5F49A8836E99B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wool and a wooden slab make a seat, and dye recolors it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Sit on one aboard a moving structure and you ride along.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A mob that steps on one sits down and travels too, hostile ones included.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7C4834A1821EC308.title": "Tanks on the go",
  "quest.7C4834A1821EC308.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pipes can't reach tanks on a moving structure.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A copper casing and a chute make a \"},{\"text\":\"Portable Fluid Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:portable_fluid_interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": pair two, one or two blocks apart, and the still one stands in for every tank aboard.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.65D996B03A1616D6.title": "Remote control",
  "quest.65D996B03A1616D6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Link\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:redstone_link\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" ringed by six wooden buttons makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Linked Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:linked_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Right-click a receiving link with it, then press one of its six controls: that key now sends the link's frequency.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Right-click to take it in hand and your movement keys work its buttons instead of you.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"On a lectern it stays put and handy.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Sneak-click the lectern to take it back.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6716BFBE3A5D99A5.title": "Couple them up",
  "quest.6716BFBE3A5D99A5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two alloys and an iron sheet make a \"},{\"text\":\"Minecart Coupling\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:minecart_coupling\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Link two carts and they move as a group: two couplings per cart at most, and no loops.",
    "",
    "Two cart assemblers sharing one structure build a two-cart carriage by themselves."
  ],
  "task.0AC36AFE0D1E0DB2.title": "Any cart contraption",
  "quest.34848088A476953B.title": "Take it with you",
  "quest.34848088A476953B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A wrench turns a whole cart structure into one item.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click it with the wrench: it leaves the rails, blocks and all.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Set it on any rail and it's ready to roll.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It won't fit in a shulker box.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4B33D50EB9E7D80C.title": "Pocket freight",
  "quest.4B33D50EB9E7D80C.quest_subtitle": "Lift with your legs.",
  "quest.4B33D50EB9E7D80C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two hundred blocks of cart structure, in one hand.\"}]",
    "",
    "Your back will file a complaint in the morning."
  ],
  "reward.24C95D07138C72CF.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.37C23B93C9A55DE4.title": "Speed by signal",
  "quest.37C23B93C9A55DE4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Controller Rails\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:controller_rail\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" push as hard as the signal is strong.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Gold, a stick and an electron tube make \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"They are one-way powered rails.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"On one, a cart assembler holds the cart until the rail gets power.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.00BE273C9D78F2F0.title": "Which cart, which rail",
  "quest.00BE273C9D78F2F0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"On a plain rail the assembler leaves the cart's speed alone. Chest and furnace minecarts work as the base too, and a furnace one refuels itself from the inventories aboard. The assembler's panel locks the structure's facing, or turns it to follow the track.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3213AB1221B63BCA.title": "Drill order",
  "quest.3213AB1221B63BCA.quest_subtitle": "The mines never have enough.",
  "quest.3213AB1221B63BCA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Drills\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:mechanical_drill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "Tunnel crews always want spares."
  ],
  "quest.50D13918BA1C6BA7.title": "A note under the seat",
  "quest.50D13918BA1C6BA7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A cart that lays its own track needs nobody to build it a road. I meant it for the farm villages the rails never reached. —T.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "quest.0CFF1AAFD7E1EDD6.title": "Fly a kite",
  "quest.0CFF1AAFD7E1EDD6.quest_subtitle": "The mill's envy, up close.",
  "quest.0CFF1AAFD7E1EDD6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wind is wind, and some of it is just for fun.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: the kite is the reward."
  ],
  "image.0ED834614A57D1EF.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wind\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.69000833D8943058.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Bearings\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.0471CB72DF6A4D3F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Glue and chassis\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.7061E8B17E5A596A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pistons and pulleys\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.135CA4DF3D66239E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Minecart contraptions\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.6109F67FE2DA698A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Actors\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.5008C8CA54AA9BE4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Gantries\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.7DE9703127DA93EE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Aboard\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.4CEF45B8E8F16612.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"CREATE\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.156CA702E8589B05.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Contraptions\",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"}]",
  "image.4DC7C375E076A7C0.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "chapter.2F36751BF3F95B59.title": "Create · Logic and Measurement",
  "chapter.2F36751BF3F95B59.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Signals you can dial, time, sense and read: the redstone side of Create."
  ],
  "quest.1851633B4F209673.title": "Fifteen notches",
  "quest.1851633B4F209673.quest_subtitle": "On, off and thirteen opinions in between.",
  "quest.1851633B4F209673.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A stick on \"},{\"text\":\"Andesite Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:andesite_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes an \"},{\"text\":\"Analog Lever\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:analog_lever\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Right-click raises its signal one step, sneak-right-click lowers it, anywhere from \"},{\"text\":\"0\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"15\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\": a small, exact source for anything that reads strength.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wire it to a \"},{\"text\":\"Controller Rail\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:controller_rail\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and minecarts run at the speed the lever says.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2DA7E1E9651BF4E8.title": "Needle and dial",
  "quest.2DA7E1E9651BF4E8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A compass on Andesite Casing makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Speedometer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:speedometer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which shows the speed of whatever it is attached to.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Wear goggles for the exact RPM.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A comparator beside it turns that speed into a redstone signal.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1EA34274E57B45C7.title": "How close to the edge",
  "quest.1EA34274E57B45C7.quest_subtitle": "Numbers beat hunches.",
  "quest.1EA34274E57B45C7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Stressometer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:stressometer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has no recipe of its own: a Speedometer alone in the crafting grid turns into one, and back.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It shows how much of the network's stress capacity is in use.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Look at it with goggles on for the exact figure.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.64C8E0BCACFBE515.title": "Keeping time",
  "quest.64C8E0BCACFBE515.quest_subtitle": "Tick, tock, pulse.",
  "quest.64C8E0BCACFBE515.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Pulse Timer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:pulse_timer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is a clock: a short pulse at every interval you set.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Amethyst, a brass sheet and a redstone torch on stone make it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"From two ticks to an hour.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A signal on its input side pauses and resets it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0A6A4F2F26F37ACB.title": "Eyes on the line",
  "quest.0A6A4F2F26F37ACB.quest_subtitle": "It notices. It always notices.",
  "quest.0A6A4F2F26F37ACB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An electron tube, brass casing and an observer make a \"},{\"text\":\"Smart Observer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:content_observer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It sees items and fluids in containers, on belts, in chutes and pipes.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It pulses when a funnel moves something.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Its filter picks what counts.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5099FD5BADFB7520.title": "Put it on the wall",
  "quest.5099FD5BADFB7520.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Click a display, then place a \"},{\"text\":\"Display Link\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:display_link\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the block to read.\"}]",
    "",
    "Its screen picks what to send:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A stressometer: stress in su, or as a bar\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A speedometer: its RPM\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A vault: its fill level\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.44DFBA5862256DEC.title": "Flip the letters",
  "quest.44DFBA5862256DEC.quest_subtitle": "Clack-clack-clack.",
  "quest.44DFBA5862256DEC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Letters that flip, clack by clack: \"},{\"text\":\"Display Boards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:display_board\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"An electron tube between two andesite alloys makes two.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Side by side they grow into one big board, which needs rotation to flip.\"}]",
    "",
    "A written clipboard sets fixed text, a display link live text, and dye colours a line."
  ],
  "quest.256353C7F43F2E01.title": "Motion by script",
  "quest.256353C7F43F2E01.quest_subtitle": "Turn 90°. Wait. Turn back. Repeat.",
  "quest.256353C7F43F2E01.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Brass casing, a cogwheel and an electron tube make a \"},{\"text\":\"Sequenced Gearshift\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sequenced_gearshift\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "A redstone signal runs its list: turn by an angle, move a piston, pulley or gantry a set distance, wait, or await the next pulse.",
    "",
    "A comparator reads its progress.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Create: Connected adds three steps: Loop, Sustain (turn until a new pulse) and Time (turn for a set time).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.285F341D83DF1895.title": "Exact RPM",
  "quest.285F341D83DF1895.quest_subtitle": "The dial that settles arguments.",
  "quest.285F341D83DF1895.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Exact speed, set on a panel: the \"},{\"text\":\"Rotation Speed Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:rotation_speed_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Put a large cogwheel on it and feed it rotation.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The cog turns at the speed on its panel, from −\"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" RPM.\"}]",
    "",
    "Machines downstream still pay stress at the new speed."
  ],
  "quest.682E109880DA80FC.title": "The control room",
  "quest.682E109880DA80FC.quest_subtitle": "Take a seat. The factory reports to you.",
  "quest.682E109880DA80FC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A room that runs the factory and tells you how it's doing.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Sequenced Pulse Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:sequenced_pulse_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" plays redstone from a program.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Dashboard\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:dashboard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sends its four lines of live data to the HUD of whoever sits in front of it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The generator takes two electron tubes, a brass sheet, a redstone torch, stone and a \"},{\"text\":\"Control Chip\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:control_chip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "The dashboard is a display board on brass casing: feed it with display links; a wrench stops it reaching your HUD."
  ],
  "quest.0C66974A6A223991.title": "Any lever, wireless",
  "quest.0C66974A6A223991.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Craft a Redstone Link alone and it becomes a \"},{\"text\":\"Linked Transmitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:linked_transmitter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and back.\"}]",
    "",
    "Right-click a lever, button or analog lever with it: that switch now sends on the link's frequency.",
    "",
    "A wrench takes it off again.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Honeycomb waxes its frequency slots against stray clicks; an axe scrapes the wax off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6D6EF127F904332F.title": "Any frequency",
  "quest.6D6EF127F904332F.quest_subtitle": "The joker of the deck.",
  "quest.6D6EF127F904332F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A transmitter and a crafter slot cover make a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Link Wildcard\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:redstone_link_wildcard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "In a link's frequency slot it matches any item, so one receiver hears a whole family of transmitters that share the other slot."
  ],
  "quest.78266496A16097A4.title": "Frequencies go places",
  "quest.78266496A16097A4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Links reach past plain redstone: a train schedule can wait until a frequency is on or off, and a factory gauge can switch a link once its stock is met, or be paused by one.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.543B95A106E14636.title": "Either latch",
  "quest.1F60110305C9F18B.title": "One bit of memory",
  "quest.1F60110305C9F18B.quest_subtitle": "It remembers so you don't have to.",
  "quest.1F60110305C9F18B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Powered Latch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:powered_latch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is a lever redstone can move: a signal at its back turns it on, one at its side turns it off.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Powered Toggle Latch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:powered_toggle_latch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" flips on every pulse at its back. Both still work by hand.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2D91CA4F31DF04B6.title": "Pick one",
  "quest.2D91CA4F31DF04B6.quest_subtitle": "Radio buttons, in quartz.",
  "quest.2D91CA4F31DF04B6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Polished rose quartz, redstone and zinc make a \"},{\"text\":\"Rose Quartz Lamp\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:rose_quartz_lamp\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A signal lights it and it stays lit.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"In a group, lighting one turns the rest off.\"}]",
    "",
    "A comparator reads how far the lit lamp is, and a wrench flips one by hand."
  ],
  "quest.3AF7FF9B0E067069.title": "Wait for it",
  "quest.3AF7FF9B0E067069.quest_subtitle": "Delayed gratification, in ticks.",
  "quest.3AF7FF9B0E067069.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One signal in, one short pulse out, later.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Pulse Repeater\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:pulse_repeater\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" waits for the delay set on its panel: two ticks to an hour.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Chain a few and a single button press becomes a timed sequence.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.18B2A323841645ED.title": "Make it last",
  "quest.18B2A323841645ED.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Pulse Extender\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:pulse_extender\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stretches a signal.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It switches on shortly after the input does.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Once the input drops, it stays on for the time on its panel, up to an hour.\"}]",
    "",
    "One button press, a minute of light."
  ],
  "quest.6D891FB5E1983637.title": "The negative pulse",
  "quest.6D891FB5E1983637.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Redstone halts funnels, smart chutes, ejectors, deployers and arms. Deployers and arms finish their swing first, so a brief break in the signal buys exactly one cycle. Right-click a pulse timer's base to invert it and it keeps their beat.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.7E5055C249D0BAAF.title": "Look at a working threshold switch",
  "quest.2C8F569700EE6F11.title": "Two thresholds",
  "quest.2C8F569700EE6F11.quest_subtitle": "Hysteresis, but friendly.",
  "quest.2C8F569700EE6F11.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Threshold Switch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:stockpile_switch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has two levels on purpose, so nothing flickers at the edge.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"On at or above the upper one.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Off at or below the lower one.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A filter counts only some items.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It reads tanks too, and even how far a rope pulley hangs.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0D2C01E4491E8B7D.title": "Face to face",
  "quest.0D2C01E4491E8B7D.quest_subtitle": "They only light up together.",
  "quest.0D2C01E4491E8B7D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cobblestone, redstone and an iron sheet make two \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Contacts\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:redstone_contact\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Facing each other they give a signal, even when one rides a moving contraption: the tidy way to tell a piston, bearing or gantry where to stop.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An elevator pulley needs one glued to its cabin; the ones along its shaft become floors.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3EFDF858E68AB90E.title": "Computers at the controls",
  "quest.3EFDF858E68AB90E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With CC: Tweaked, a computer attached to a display link writes what the program sends, a speed controller takes its target speed, a sequenced gearshift turns on command, and gauges report their readings. The block's own screen says who's in charge.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.343E8AC2BA7EA52D.title": "Chip off the old sheet",
  "quest.343E8AC2BA7EA52D.quest_subtitle": "Some assembly required. Three times.",
  "quest.343E8AC2BA7EA52D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Control Chip\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:control_chip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" starts as a golden sheet, three loops over:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A deployer adds an electron tube\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Another adds redstone\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A press seals it\"}]",
    "",
    "About four runs in five end as a chip; the rest comes back as parts."
  ],
  "quest.5E24A92E400AEB9F.title": "Program the pulses",
  "quest.5E24A92E400AEB9F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A signal at its back starts the list; one at a side stops and resets it. Steps: output a strength for a while or until the input reaches a state, loop forever, X times or while a state holds, reshape the input with a formula, end.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3ED93A5C7DFF847B.title": "Infinite loop",
  "quest.3ED93A5C7DFF847B.quest_subtitle": "It's not a bug, it's a feature.",
  "quest.3ED93A5C7DFF847B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You overloaded a Sequenced Pulse Generator with a program that never lets go.\"}]",
    "",
    "Somewhere, a programmer sighs."
  ],
  "reward.4114923A320C98C1.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.73E592ECC81D8921.title": "Gauges speak redstone",
  "quest.73E592ECC81D8921.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A comparator reads more than chests: speedometers and stressometers give a signal that grows with their reading, sequenced gearshifts and pulse generators give their progress, and a red train signal lights one up.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6DDBA8BB7D784C98.title": "Redline",
  "quest.6DDBA8BB7D784C98.quest_subtitle": "One more cog and everything stops.",
  "quest.6DDBA8BB7D784C98.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You read a stressometer at exactly \"},{\"text\":\"100%\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Every su spoken for, none to spare: engineering, or nerve."
  ],
  "reward.099A18F2608BE4B6.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.2E0E367F4F022C3D.title": "Numbers that glow",
  "quest.2E0E367F4F022C3D.quest_subtitle": "Retro-futurism, fifteen at a time.",
  "quest.2E0E367F4F022C3D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two electron tubes make four \"},{\"text\":\"Nixie Tubes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:nixie_tube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Powered, a tube shows the signal strength as a number.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A written clipboard gives it your own text.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Dye changes its glow.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A display link can write along a row of them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1BBF8D8B20BF3EDD.title": "What a link can read",
  "quest.1BBF8D8B20BF3EDD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Beyond gauges: the time, a stopwatch, item throughput, fill levels, boiler status, train arrivals, player deaths, the top enchanting cost and package addresses. A link reaches \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks, and while powered it stops updating.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6AD91CB04D211603.title": "Tube order",
  "quest.6AD91CB04D211603.quest_subtitle": "Every smart block wants one.",
  "quest.6AD91CB04D211603.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Electron Tubes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:electron_tube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the depot, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Polished rose quartz over an iron sheet.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical crafters make it routine.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.47AD83ECA3D91139.title": "Ring for service",
  "quest.47AD83ECA3D91139.quest_subtitle": "Ding.",
  "quest.47AD83ECA3D91139.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The control room has a bell, and someone has to ring it.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: just the ding."
  ],
  "image.505202229CEE85BB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wireless\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.049264B3265B9BEF.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Memory\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.68424EEA3DDD23AE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Timing\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.709499F738A9236B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sensors\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.0E2D670356E561F7.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Create: Connected\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.00F1F6227DD1AC75.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Displays\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.6E07B096270D3103.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"15\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"}]",
  "image.6888C2FF568B30F5.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"STRESS 72% · 128 RPM\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"}]",
  "image.3A814CB894AB8F63.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"LOGIC\",\"color\":\"#4E5E55\"}]",
  "image.466DF68A8AF865FD.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MEASUREMENT\",\"color\":\"#4E5E55\"}]",
  "image.3DBC69FACBFA2F48.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ALL SYSTEMS GO\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"}]",
  "image.2F400EC2FE3E5B40.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"CREATE\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.0E5E09E28F69D0C7.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Logic and measurement\",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"}]",
  "image.350D3129C595683C.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "chapter.06C76EF421D48687.title": "Create · Rails and Power",
  "chapter.06C76EF421D48687.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Trains on your own line, parcels on chains, and Heliodor's sun turned into current."
  ],
  "quest.1054891D3522FCFA.title": "Sturdy Sheet",
  "quest.1054891D3522FCFA.quest_subtitle": "Rails start with rocks.",
  "quest.1054891D3522FCFA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every train starts as obsidian.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Crush obsidian into \"},{\"text\":\"Powdered Obsidian\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:powdered_obsidian\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Then a short sequence: a \"},{\"text\":\"spout\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7E52D88B6EC82066\"}},{\"text\":\" adds \"},{\"text\":\"500\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" mB of lava, a press stamps it twice.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"One of each over a looping belt keeps the \"},{\"text\":\"Sturdy Sheets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sturdy_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" coming.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3EDBCACC92228200.title": "Train Casing",
  "quest.3EDBCACC92228200.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Sturdy Sheet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sturdy_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on \"},{\"text\":\"Brass Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:brass_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Every railway block wears it, and used on a track it places a bogey while you build a train."
  ],
  "quest.696B32ED0CC51858.title": "No Steam 'n' Rails",
  "quest.696B32ED0CC51858.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Steam 'n' Rails stops at Minecraft \"},{\"text\":\"1.20.1\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\", so it isn't here.\"}]",
    "",
    "The railway is Create's own, and only that:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Tracks\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Stations\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Signals\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Bogeys\"}]",
    "",
    "To move people between buildings, try Create Hypertube."
  ],
  "quest.42C367280974A1FA.title": "Lay the line",
  "quest.42C367280974A1FA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A slab gets two iron or zinc nuggets, then a press: \"},{\"text\":\"Train Track\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:track\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" by sequenced assembly.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"To lay it, click a placed piece, then a second spot.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Bends and slopes fill themselves.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.497E4DA8ED2F1F47.title": "Track manners",
  "quest.497E4DA8ED2F1F47.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hold sprint while laying for the widest possible bend. Blocks in your off-hand pave under new track. Track laid into a Nether portal builds its twin on the other side.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0E63E76DEBBC6A9C.title": "Dimensional commuter",
  "quest.0E63E76DEBBC6A9C.quest_subtitle": "Mind the gap. The very big gap.",
  "quest.0E63E76DEBBC6A9C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ride a train through a Nether portal.\"}]",
    "",
    "Eight blocks of Nether rail cover sixty-four of Overworld: the fastest line you'll ever build."
  ],
  "quest.212CC36CDB8FECE1.title": "Stations",
  "quest.212CC36CDB8FECE1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Train Casing and a compass make two \"},{\"text\":\"Train Stations\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:track_station\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": select a track, place one beside it.\"}]",
    "",
    "In assembly mode, scheduled trains keep away while you build."
  ],
  "quest.0CEABA006D2B2118.title": "All aboard",
  "quest.0CEABA006D2B2118.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Build the train at a station in assembly mode, then drive it off.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Casing on the track for the bogeys.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Glue your blocks.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Train Controls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:controls\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on board.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Confirm at the station.\"}]",
    "",
    "Drive with the movement keys. A second set of controls lets it run both ways."
  ],
  "quest.2E7F74B4329FF2BD.title": "Train quirks",
  "quest.2E7F74B4329FF2BD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Trains turn back into blocks only at a station. Fuel in chests on board speeds them up; fuel in vaults never burns. Out of loaded chunks they still obey signals, but drills stop.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.377785343C1E2D9A.title": "Road kill",
  "quest.377785343C1E2D9A.quest_subtitle": "The zombie didn't have a ticket.",
  "quest.377785343C1E2D9A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A hostile mob met your train, head on.\"}]",
    "",
    "The train won."
  ],
  "reward.6AA96DAB9F7ADCEA.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.071C64C7436E52EA.title": "Timetable",
  "quest.071C64C7436E52EA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Obsidian sheet and paper make four \"},{\"text\":\"Train Schedules\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:schedule\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\":\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Stops\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Waits\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Conditions\"}]",
    "",
    "Hand one to a conductor seated at the controls, any mob or a Blaze Burner will do."
  ],
  "quest.78BDDCA133A5B020.title": "Traffic control",
  "quest.78BDDCA133A5B020.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Casing and an electron tube make four \"},{\"text\":\"Train Signals\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:track_signal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Signals cut the track into sections, one train each: no collisions.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Brass mode, set with a wrench, also holds a train that couldn't clear the next section. Use it at busy junctions.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7B46DD682DD694C6.title": "Expert driver",
  "quest.7B46DD682DD694C6.quest_subtitle": "It was more of an orange.",
  "quest.7B46DD682DD694C6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You ran a red \"},{\"text\":\"Train Signal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:track_signal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "The signal remembers. The signal always remembers."
  ],
  "reward.1E6ECEDC1198C856.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.4BD65852229A6C01.title": "Train Observer",
  "quest.4BD65852229A6C01.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Train Observer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:track_observer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pulses when a train passes.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Select a track, then place it nearby.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It can watch for certain cargo only.\"}]",
    "",
    "Doors, counters, loading triggers."
  ],
  "task.3F1C95A646D0C53B.title": "Look at a postbox beside a station",
  "quest.1A3D29FDC0AED65F.title": "Mail by rail",
  "quest.1A3D29FDC0AED65F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Postbox\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:white_postbox\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" near a station gets an address.\"}]",
    "",
    "Trains that stop there collect parcels for elsewhere and drop off the ones for here, even in unloaded chunks."
  ],
  "quest.2F45D98085540ED4.title": "Drive-by exchange",
  "quest.2F45D98085540ED4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Load a train without stopping it at a platform.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Portable Storage Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:portable_storage_interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the train, another on the ground, one or two blocks apart.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"They connect as it passes.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The train leaves once the items stop moving.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1FCA21CEB61C346B.title": "Freight contract",
  "quest.1FCA21CEB61C346B.quest_subtitle": "The depot always needs more.",
  "quest.1FCA21CEB61C346B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Sturdy Sheets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sturdy_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the depot, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "A spout, a press and a looping belt make it a formality."
  ],
  "task.6D7BC9885BFC3FB6.title": "Watch your train pull in",
  "quest.524CEFA7BBD1F988.title": "The outpost line",
  "quest.524CEFA7BBD1F988.quest_subtitle": "Next stop: everywhere.",
  "quest.524CEFA7BBD1F988.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The line that runs itself.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A scheduled train between home and an outpost.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Display Board\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:display_board\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" forecasting its arrival.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A factory board keeping key items stocked by itself.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:entrelumen:textures/gui/quests/diagram_train.png width:96 height:48 align:center}",
    "",
    "Packages move goods far without chunk loading.",
    "",
    "Storage networks can take over at home later; the line keeps running."
  ],
  "quest.517A7FAE8B813A33.title": "Cardboard",
  "quest.517A7FAE8B813A33.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pulpable stuff and water mix into \"},{\"text\":\"Pulp\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:pulp\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": bamboo, sugar cane, saplings.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A press makes \"},{\"text\":\"Cardboard\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:cardboard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". The whole package network is made of it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1E0F58C5183DBF70.title": "Post production",
  "quest.1E0F58C5183DBF70.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Packager\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:packager\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on an inventory boxes its items on a redstone pulse.\"}]",
    "",
    "Feed it a package and it unboxes, only if everything fits. Contents stay together on belts, chains and trains."
  ],
  "quest.478FB83FAE0F57D1.title": "Addresses",
  "quest.478FB83FAE0F57D1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A sign on a packager stamps its text as the address. A \"},{\"text\":\"Package Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:package_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" routes by address through funnels, tunnels and chutes. A clipboard learns frogport addresses.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.184A2AFCE40F73A6.title": "Nothing but net",
  "quest.184A2AFCE40F73A6.quest_subtitle": "Three points.",
  "quest.184A2AFCE40F73A6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You threw a package into a chute from a distance.\"}]",
    "",
    "The mail has never been so athletic."
  ],
  "reward.174E3A94E98068CD.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.49BFAD9BA3EA1AC8.title": "Chain Conveyor",
  "quest.49BFAD9BA3EA1AC8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A large cogwheel ringed by andesite casings makes two \"},{\"text\":\"Chain Conveyors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:chain_conveyor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; link them with chains.\"}]",
    "",
    "They carry rotation and packages, and you can ride one holding a wrench."
  ],
  "quest.3C2865BB6A36E878.title": "Hungry frogs",
  "quest.3C2865BB6A36E878.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Click a chain with a \"},{\"text\":\"Package Frogport\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:package_frogport\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", place it nearby and name an address.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Parcels for that address get snapped off the chain.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The rest keep riding.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.49C070B70EA98451.title": "Stock Link",
  "quest.49C070B70EA98451.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A transmitter on an item vault: a \"},{\"text\":\"Stock Link\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:stock_link\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Linked packagers show their inventory to the whole network, at any range.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The parcels still need a real route.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Full redstone power silences a link; a weaker signal lowers its priority, so other links serve first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.41C4000F78AD0C5B.title": "Order up",
  "quest.41C4000F78AD0C5B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Bind a \"},{\"text\":\"Stock Ticker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:stock_ticker\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to a link and seat a mob or a blaze burner in front: your stock keeper.\"}]",
    "",
    "Talk to it to browse the network and send anything to any address."
  ],
  "quest.42885664A4CDB7C2.title": "One button, one delivery",
  "quest.42885664A4CDB7C2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Requester\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:redstone_requester\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" orders a fixed list on every pulse.\"}]",
    "",
    "Wire it to a button by the door: building materials on demand."
  ],
  "quest.2D4095C7B60D3B42.title": "Open for business",
  "quest.2D4095C7B60D3B42.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hold a \"},{\"text\":\"Table Cloth\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:white_table_cloth\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and talk to your stock keeper to set up a trade, then place and price it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Buyers pay at the counter; goods come out boxed."
  ],
  "quest.481386E35D624FCF.title": "High logistics",
  "quest.481386E35D624FCF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A stock link and a precision mechanism make two \"},{\"text\":\"Factory Gauges\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:factory_gauge\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"On a packager, a gauge keeps one item stocked by ordering it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Chained gauges form a factory board.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.377C162FFC963F8A.title": "Re-Packager",
  "quest.377C162FFC963F8A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Big orders arrive split and can mix with other parcels. A powered \"},{\"text\":\"Re-Packager\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:repackager\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" waits for every fragment and ships them as one package, in order.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.36A7B2FC383BC500.title": "Sorting by label",
  "quest.36A7B2FC383BC500.quest_subtitle": "The mailroom's secret weapon.",
  "quest.36A7B2FC383BC500.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Zinc nuggets and wool make a \"},{\"text\":\"Package Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:package_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Give it an address and, in any filter slot, it matches the packages bound there: funnels, tunnels, smart chutes.",
    "",
    "Addresses take * as a wildcard.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A mechanical saw unpacks packages straight onto a belt.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1C3D7139EC910489.title": "Ship to",
  "quest.1C3D7139EC910489.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every stock ticker order carries the address you type, so filters, frogports and postboxes steer it home. Lines starting with # on a clipboard you hold or keep nearby autocomplete addresses, like #storage or #factory.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3782292549C451DA.title": "Restock, step by step",
  "quest.3782292549C451DA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tune the gauge to a stock link before placing it on a packager. Click it with the item to watch, type the address the refill should come to, then hold right-click to set the target. Short of it, the network ships more.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4E43A85265018E0D.title": "A factory on the wall",
  "quest.4E43A85265018E0D.quest_subtitle": "Arrows are the new conveyor belts.",
  "quest.4E43A85265018E0D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A factory gauge off a packager watches the whole network.\"}]",
    "",
    "Connect ingredient gauges to it, set the batch and the address where it gets made, and it keeps its item stocked by sending ingredients there.",
    "",
    "Green arrows: target met.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The outputs have to come back to a linked inventory.",
    "",
    "Each gauge on the board keeps its own item, so one wall of gauges can run a whole production chain."
  ],
  "quest.37C01E1A137128F5.title": "Crafting by mail",
  "quest.37C01E1A137128F5.quest_subtitle": "Unwrap, craft, ship back.",
  "quest.37C01E1A137128F5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Crafting-table recipes arrive ready to craft.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The gauge sends the ingredients already arranged.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Unwrapped into a \"},{\"text\":\"3×3\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" of connected mechanical crafters, they craft at once.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Re-Packager\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:repackager\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a packager crafted alone, keeps each order whole.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.185008C88C35EB0B.title": "At the counter",
  "quest.185008C88C35EB0B.quest_subtitle": "Items only. No haggling.",
  "quest.185008C88C35EB0B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With an empty hand, click a priced table cloth: you get a \"},{\"text\":\"Shopping List\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:shopping_list\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Add to it, then hand it to the keeper to pay.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The goods leave boxed.\"}]",
    "",
    "Payments pile up inside the stock ticker block.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lock the keeper's network and other players can only buy through lists.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1BFAB003A278D495.title": "Rolling Mill",
  "quest.1BFAB003A278D495.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Rolling Mill\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:rolling_mill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" rolls long parts: an ingot into two rods, a plate into two wires, bamboo or paper into straw.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Drop items on top.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A belt and two funnels automate it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6AAB9425E04AADB7.title": "A straw for the blaze",
  "quest.6AAB9425E04AADB7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Use \"},{\"text\":\"Straw\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:straw\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a blaze burner and it drinks liquid fuel by bucket or pipe.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Lava keeps it lit \"},{\"text\":\"20000\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks a bucket.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Biofuel superheats it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Goodbye, coal by hand."
  ],
  "quest.70608772E702AD35.title": "Fuel from the field",
  "quest.70608772E702AD35.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Compacted seeds give seed oil; crops, leaves or flowers mixed hot with plant oil give biomass; sugar, cinder flour and biomass mix into \"},{\"text\":\"Biofuel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:bioethanol_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". A wheat farm is a gas station.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.160207A457B0B0F2.title": "Wires and connectors",
  "quest.160207A457B0B0F2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Small Connectors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:connector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" link FE blocks with \"},{\"text\":\"Copper Spool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:copper_spool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" wire; large ones take gold or electrum.\"}]",
    "",
    "A wrench cycles push, pull and none: generators push, machines pull."
  ],
  "quest.40D2195EF4AA050D.title": "Rotation to current",
  "quest.40D2195EF4AA050D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Alternator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:alternator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns rotation into FE, the energy most tech mods run on.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"From \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" RPM up.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The faster it spins, the more it makes.\"}]",
    "",
    "A water wheel can now run a Mekanism machine."
  ],
  "quest.2942848DCFF562A8.title": "And back again",
  "quest.2942848DCFF562A8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Electric Motor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:electric_motor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns FE back into rotation.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Scroll its back panel to set the RPM.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"More RPM costs more energy.\"}]",
    "",
    "Silent, compact rotation wherever the wires reach."
  ],
  "quest.007932E8F2D12779.title": "Accumulator",
  "quest.007932E8F2D12779.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A stackable multiblock battery: set one connector as input and one as output.\"}]",
    "",
    "A portable energy interface pair charges one riding a train."
  ],
  "quest.5572EB452CE49149.title": "Tesla Coil",
  "quest.5572EB452CE49149.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Tesla Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:tesla_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" charges FE items below it and runs charging recipes, like electrum.\"}]",
    "",
    "Powered by redstone, it also shocks what stands nearby, you included."
  ],
  "quest.4359AD5F556388A3.title": "A switch for current",
  "quest.4359AD5F556388A3.quest_subtitle": "Redstone says when.",
  "quest.4359AD5F556388A3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two small connectors, an electron tube and redstone on stone make a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Relay\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:redstone_relay\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Power only passes from its input connector to its output while it gets a redstone signal: a breaker a lever can throw."
  ],
  "quest.2376057ED163A454.title": "Motor on a script",
  "quest.2376057ED163A454.quest_subtitle": "rotate(90), then a coffee.",
  "quest.2376057ED163A454.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A computer beside an \"},{\"text\":\"Electric Motor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:electric_motor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" drives it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"peripheral.wrap gives setSpeed and stop.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"rotate and translate return the seconds a turn of N degrees or a move of N blocks takes.\"}]",
    "",
    "Sleep that long, then stop.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Accumulators, portable interfaces and relays answer too; /cca_api opens the full list, and \"},{\"text\":\"Create and computers\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"77AB5A14AB23ED5D\"}},{\"text\":\" covers boards, gauges and pulleys.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2678AC13AF640F1E.title": "Charge on the move",
  "quest.2678AC13AF640F1E.quest_subtitle": "A pit stop without stopping.",
  "quest.2678AC13AF640F1E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Brass casing, a chute and a copper spool make a \"},{\"text\":\"Portable Energy Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:portable_energy_interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"One on a contraption and one on the ground, one or two blocks apart, couple as they pass.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The ground one speaks for every accumulator aboard.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Energy follows each connector's push or pull setting.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Once it stops flowing for a while, the contraption moves on.\"}]",
    "",
    "Redstone on the ground interface keeps it from coupling."
  ],
  "quest.55D2351D5C48CA80.title": "Magnetite and thorium",
  "quest.55D2351D5C48CA80.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Magnetite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:magnetite_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Thorium Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:thorium_ore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" spawn in the Overworld.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Magnetite makes magnets and motors.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Crushed thorium sometimes gives radioactive thorium for reactors.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Thorium has no common ore tag here, on purpose: dimensional miners skip it. Dig for it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2D13EC7992A1F5E6.title": "Sunlight as heat",
  "quest.2D13EC7992A1F5E6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"New Age has no photovoltaic panels: solar plates make heat, a boiler or a Stirling engine makes rotation, magnets and coils make current. Light, heat, motion, current: Heliodor's loop.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.41BC5584D4C11B0F.title": "Generator Coil",
  "quest.41BC5584D4C11B0F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A spinning \"},{\"text\":\"Generator Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:generator_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" ringed by magnets makes current; \"},{\"text\":\"Carbon Brushes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:carbon_brushes\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" collect it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Stronger magnets turn more stress into power.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The brushes take an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Coupler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:energy_coupler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act II) in place of an andesite alloy; the coils don't.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0CC87E8CE3690B51.title": "Magnet ladder",
  "quest.0CC87E8CE3690B51.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Magnetic force per block: magnetite \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\", redstone \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\", layered \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\", fluxuated magnetite \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\", netherite \"},{\"text\":\"24\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\". The goggles show a coil's force and efficiency. Better magnets first: efficiency is free power.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1AF466ECB9C6F7F2.title": "Copper Wire",
  "quest.1AF466ECB9C6F7F2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A saw cuts a copper sheet into four \"},{\"text\":\"Copper Wires\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:copper_wire\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for \"},{\"text\":\"Electrical Connectors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:electrical_connector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "A connector on pull draws power from other mods' blocks."
  ],
  "quest.25041E85AE09DAA7.title": "Energise it",
  "quest.25041E85AE09DAA7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With current and rotation, a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Energiser\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:basic_energiser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" charges items below it on a depot or belt.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Iron becomes \"},{\"text\":\"Overcharged Iron\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:overcharged_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for \"},{\"text\":\"1000\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" energy.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Gold, for \"},{\"text\":\"2000\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Diamond, for \"},{\"text\":\"10000\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3B52B315368D80BC.title": "Expensive miracles",
  "quest.3B52B315368D80BC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An energiser can make an Enchanted Golden Apple by sequenced assembly, at two million energy per step, and bottles o' enchanting at \"},{\"text\":\"50000\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" each. Renewable, not cheap.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.30DCDED6F3E8103A.title": "Basic Motor",
  "quest.30DCDED6F3E8103A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Current back into rotation: a wrench sets a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Motor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:basic_motor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"'s speed.\"}]",
    "",
    "Extensions behind it raise its capacity and its energy use.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The advanced motor takes a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4FD6592D778686FD.title": "Solar heating",
  "quest.4FD6592D778686FD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In daylight, a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Solar Heating Plate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:basic_solar_heating_plate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes heat; heat pipes carry it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Too much heat in one block melts it to lava: always give heat somewhere to go.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The basic plate takes an \"},{\"text\":\"Infused Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_infused\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act II) in place of one glass.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4C05F500C1209A2A.title": "A boiler that eats sunlight",
  "quest.4C05F500C1209A2A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Heater\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:heater\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" under a Create boiler burns heat instead of fuel: more heat in, more steam out.\"}]",
    "",
    "Plates, pipes and a heater make a sun-powered steam engine."
  ],
  "quest.022A04310ADE0F93.title": "Thorium reactor",
  "quest.022A04310ADE0F93.quest_subtitle": "Glow responsibly.",
  "quest.022A04310ADE0F93.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Reactor Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:reactor_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a fuel acceptor and heat vents.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Radiation kills: wear leather armour or seal it in reactor casing.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"If nothing takes its heat, it melts down.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Rods take an \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.37752415929A2864.title": "Street lights",
  "quest.37752415929A2864.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Street Lights\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:street_light\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" run on current; lamp posts hold them up.\"}]",
    "",
    "A lit road home, a small nod to the city that kept its light."
  ],
  "quest.00B8D71B50937179.title": "Heliodor's loop, closed",
  "quest.00B8D71B50937179.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Close the loop, from sunlight to motor:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Sun heats a boiler.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The boiler spins coils.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Coils feed energisers.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Energised parts build the \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Motor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:reinforced_motor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It takes an \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.222F96F4796FE56F.title": "All aboard!",
  "quest.222F96F4796FE56F.quest_subtitle": "Toot toot.",
  "quest.222F96F4796FE56F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A train leaves; someone has to blow the whistle.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: just the steam."
  ],
  "image.486FF4A1DA318DD5.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"OUTPOST · 4 MIN\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"}]",
  "image.45B444253D5ABE93.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The line\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.77D1D12B58ABB3FC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Package network\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.0E24929ECF8F2F20.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Crafts & Additions: rotation to FE and back\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.34FA98534B2FDFDC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"New Age: sun, magnets, current\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.4032F7C374F7D126.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"CREATE\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.5257D64260A47110.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Rails and power\",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"}]",
  "image.50DB3FDC0CC7AD97.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "chapter.2FD24C6ADC23649E.title": "Create · Addons",
  "chapter.2FD24C6ADC23649E.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Nine addons on one pegboard: liquid experience, smarter gearboxes, new fans, copycat blocks, tubes you ride, a kitchen, a chisel, storage on the move and stronger magnets."
  ],
  "quest.50EABAD3AA74115B.title": "Experience, bottled",
  "quest.50EABAD3AA74115B.quest_subtitle": "Levels you can pour.",
  "quest.50EABAD3AA74115B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Click an \"},{\"text\":\"Experience Hatch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_enchantment_industry:experience_hatch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to deposit your levels; sneak-click to take them back.\"}]",
    "",
    "Inside, they are Liquid Experience: pipes, spouts and drains move it like water."
  ],
  "quest.3B9A67575AD7DF9C.title": "A shower experience",
  "quest.3B9A67575AD7DF9C.quest_subtitle": "Refreshing. Educational.",
  "quest.3B9A67575AD7DF9C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You broke a pipe full of Liquid Experience and stood under it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Worth every level you soaked up."
  ],
  "reward.448C6B96F1F21F37.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.0E1E17A383C2E5C1.title": "Every experience counts",
  "quest.0E1E17A383C2E5C1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every experience fluid in the pack pours into Enchantment Industry.\"}]",
    "",
    "The pack teaches it the fluids of:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Ender IO\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Foregoing\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Just Dire Things\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"PneumaticCraft\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Reliquary and Sophisticated\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Creative Bookshelf\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_enchantment_industry:creative_bookshelf\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes four Luminosities (act VI).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.638D14DBD895685C.title": "Grind the drops",
  "quest.638D14DBD895685C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight andesite alloys around a shaft: a \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Grindstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_enchantment_industry:mechanical_grindstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Over an item drain it grinds \"},{\"text\":\"Nuggets of Experience\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:experience_nugget\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into liquid. Mob farms feed it directly.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4A7B59096069FFBB.title": "Nugget tax",
  "quest.4A7B59096069FFBB.quest_subtitle": "Paid in wisdom.",
  "quest.4A7B59096069FFBB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Thirty-two \"},{\"text\":\"Nuggets of Experience\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:experience_nugget\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "Crushing wheels and deployers that kill mobs drop them now."
  ],
  "quest.7B70C2EA603E91CF.title": "Blaze Enchanter",
  "quest.7B70C2EA603E91CF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Smith an enchanting table onto a blaze burner with the Blaze Upgrade template: a \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Enchanter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_enchantment_industry:blaze_enchanter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Feed it liquid experience, set the level, and it enchants whatever arms or belts bring."
  ],
  "quest.11F14228ED3BBB5E.title": "Brass library",
  "quest.11F14228ED3BBB5E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With Apotheosis around, a \"},{\"text\":\"Brass Bookshelf\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_enchantment_industry:brass_bookshelf\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" gives adjustable enchanting stats while it turns.\"}]",
    "",
    "A fan through infused dragon's breath salvages gear in bulk: stay out of the stream."
  ],
  "quest.5C6B37C1585CA8CE.title": "Infusion on tap",
  "quest.5C6B37C1585CA8CE.quest_subtitle": "The enchanting table's other job, minus the clicking.",
  "quest.5C6B37C1585CA8CE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A brass sheet, a spout and three nixie tubes make an \"},{\"text\":\"Infuser\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_enchantment_industry:infuser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Over a basin it runs Apothic Enchanting's infusion recipes: the bookshelves around it give the stats, and it pays in liquid experience instead of levels.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It ignores a recipe's stat maximums, so Infused Dragon's Breath no longer needs quanta kept under \"},{\"text\":\"30\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\". Flimsy Ender Leads come out as \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Leads\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apothic_enchanting:ender_lead\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the thread of the woven bag.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3CEA2B609A309611.title": "Mobs to go",
  "quest.3CEA2B609A309611.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Woven Bag\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_enchantment_industry:ender_woven_bag\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pulls nearby mobs in and keeps them.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Six Ender Leads around a rose quartz lamp, a precision mechanism and a brass casing make it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Its light comes on when it is full.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A redstone signal lets them out.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It works on a contraption too, and there it lets its mobs out when it faces a redstone block: a delivery van for your mob farm."
  ],
  "quest.1B6F6F3AE0F6A3A6.title": "An anvil that never gets tired",
  "quest.1B6F6F3AE0F6A3A6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Forger\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_enchantment_industry:blaze_forger\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" does an anvil's work with no repair cost.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It merges enchantments.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It applies templates.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It pulls an enchantment onto a blank template.\"}]",
    "",
    "Move a great enchantment from an old tool to a new one."
  ],
  "quest.0CB361E7D10525AD.title": "Copy that",
  "quest.0CB361E7D10525AD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Printer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_enchantment_industry:printer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" copies books, enchanted books, names, schedules and package addresses, paid in liquid experience.\"}]",
    "",
    "Every copy costs, so the recipe stays native."
  ],
  "quest.0FDBAEE270D46484.title": "Seething",
  "quest.0FDBAEE270D46484.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Feed an enchanter or forger a \"},{\"text\":\"Cake o' Enchanting\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_enchantment_industry:experience_cake\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and it seethes: higher caps, treasure enchantments, conflicting ones merged. It calls lightning, so keep a rod nearby.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.75546C046FB78F53.title": "Past the cap",
  "quest.75546C046FB78F53.quest_subtitle": "Level limits were more of a suggestion.",
  "quest.75546C046FB78F53.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Push an enchantment past its vanilla cap.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Strike \"},{\"text\":\"Blocks of Super Experience\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_enchantment_industry:super_experience_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with lightning.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Craft a \"},{\"text\":\"Super Enchanting Template\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_enchantment_industry:super_enchanting_template\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Run a \"},{\"text\":\"seething\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0FDBAEE270D46484\"}},{\"text\":\" enchanter by a lightning rod.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3A4EFB035F8DC1B8.title": "The missing parts",
  "quest.3A4EFB035F8DC1B8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Create: Connected adds what the base lacks:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"6-way Gearbox\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:six_way_gearbox\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A brass gearbox with wrench-set sides\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Freewheel and overstress clutches\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A brake, a crank wheel and a cross connector\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5596725A549B09EA.title": "Kinetic Battery",
  "quest.5596725A549B09EA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Kinetic Battery\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:kinetic_battery\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stores stress.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Unpowered, it charges from rotation.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"With redstone it gives it back at a fixed speed.\"}]",
    "",
    "A windmill by day, a battery by night."
  ],
  "quest.460FC472B3C569F0.title": "Snap",
  "quest.460FC472B3C569F0.quest_subtitle": "Better the pin than the factory.",
  "quest.460FC472B3C569F0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Shear Pin\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:shear_pin\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" breaks when its branch is overstressed, and only that branch stops.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Overstress Clutch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:overstress_clutch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" does the same, and resets.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2FA77368629A7144.title": "Overpowered",
  "quest.2FA77368629A7144.quest_subtitle": "The brake did its best.",
  "quest.2FA77368629A7144.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A network kept running at speed with a powered brake on it.\"}]",
    "",
    "The brake would like a word."
  ],
  "reward.7B65EF304FCE0DF1.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.0DEFF29404B28832.title": "Catalysts in a cage",
  "quest.0DEFF29404B28832.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Brass and iron bars make an \"},{\"text\":\"Empty Fan Catalyst\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:empty_fan_catalyst\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Fill it and a fan blows through it as if through the real thing, with no spills: lava, water, soul sand or netherrack, and the new fan types of the Dragons Plus panel.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Brass Chute\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:brass_chute\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" moves \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" items at a time.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.39CEA4922F07C72B.title": "One copycat family",
  "quest.39CEA4922F07C72B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Connected's own copycat blocks are off in its config: Copycats+ covers those shapes.\"}]",
    "",
    "If the recipe viewer shows two versions of a shape, the Copycats+ one is the real one."
  ],
  "quest.6882BE836ECECFFE.title": "Ports and bridges",
  "quest.6882BE836ECECFFE.quest_subtitle": "Reach in from anywhere.",
  "quest.6882BE836ECECFFE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A brass casing, a chute and an electron tube make two \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory Access Ports\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:inventory_access_port\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Stuck to a chest, a port lets the funnels and arms on it reach the chest as if they touched it.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two ports make an \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory Bridge\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:inventory_bridge\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which reaches two inventories at once.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The bridge's filter slots pick the side each item goes to, and items matching neither are refused. Neither ports nor bridges chain, and a redstone signal turns them off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.13F1D7A4E1BC3F4F.title": "Stand it up",
  "quest.13F1D7A4E1BC3F4F.quest_subtitle": "Same vault, better posture.",
  "quest.13F1D7A4E1BC3F4F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Item Silo\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_connected:item_silo\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is a vault that grows upward instead of sideways.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The vault's recipe turned on its side makes it: iron sheet, barrel, iron sheet in a row.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It rides contraptions like a vault.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A vault and a silo swap for each other in the crafting grid.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.77BCFA0009CEC5FD.title": "Dragons Plus",
  "quest.77BCFA0009CEC5FD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The base that Enchantment Industry and Central Kitchen build on.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Hatch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_dragons_plus:fluid_hatch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fills or drains a tank with buckets and bottles by hand.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.238A1E08F4CC4D13.title": "Clouds that enchant",
  "quest.238A1E08F4CC4D13.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A fan blowing through a \"},{\"text\":\"Golden Aercloud\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"aether:golden_aercloud\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from the Aether runs its altar recipes in bulk: it enchants, repairs gear and even hatches Moa eggs.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.33EF4F3EC2316620.title": "Deep freeze",
  "quest.33EF4F3EC2316620.quest_subtitle": "Even a blaze needs to chill.",
  "quest.33EF4F3EC2316620.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A fan blowing through powder snow freezes what it carries:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Ice packs down, then turns into \"},{\"text\":\"Blue Ice\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blue_ice\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Magma cream becomes slime.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A blaze rod cools into a \"},{\"text\":\"Breeze Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:breeze_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Mobs in the stream freeze and stop burning.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A powder snow bucket on an \"},{\"text\":\"Empty Fan Catalyst\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0DEFF29404B28832\"}},{\"text\":\" makes a freezing catalyst that never spills.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.7352D1BDD8E71936.title": "Look at a sanding catalyst",
  "quest.66894DA5D56965D3.title": "Polish in bulk",
  "quest.66894DA5D56965D3.quest_subtitle": "Sandpaper, but it's weather.",
  "quest.66894DA5D56965D3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Dragons Plus sands with quicksand, and no mod here has any.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Apply sand to an \"},{\"text\":\"Empty Fan Catalyst\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0DEFF29404B28832\"}},{\"text\":\" instead: a fan through it runs Create's sandpaper recipes in bulk, so rose quartz comes out as \"},{\"text\":\"Polished Rose Quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:polished_rose_quartz\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" by the beltful.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.76B29CA7B90BFBD8.title": "Any liquid dye bucket",
  "quest.32F1B321C9CE81EA.title": "Paint job",
  "quest.32F1B321C9CE81EA.quest_subtitle": "Sixteen colours, no brushes.",
  "quest.32F1B321C9CE81EA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A mixer turns a dye and \"},{\"text\":\"250\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" mB of water into \"},{\"text\":\"250\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" mB of liquid dye.\"}]",
    "",
    "A fan blowing through it dyes items in bulk (the recipe viewer lists which), recolours sheep and other mobs, and dyes the armour they wear.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A dye bucket on an \"},{\"text\":\"Empty Fan Catalyst\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0DEFF29404B28832\"}},{\"text\":\" makes a dyeing catalyst of that colour, with no puddle to step in.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3C049F5B915AE57E.title": "Dragon's breath, piped",
  "quest.3C049F5B915AE57E.quest_subtitle": "Handle with a fan.",
  "quest.3C049F5B915AE57E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Dragon's breath flows through Create like any fluid.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"An item drain turns each bottle into \"},{\"text\":\"250\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" mB of fluid and a spout bottles it back.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_dragons_plus:dragon_breath_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Four fill a \"},{\"text\":\"Dragon's Breath Bucket\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_dragons_plus:dragon_breath_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It fills cauldrons too, and where flowing breath meets lava it hardens into end stone.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A fan through the breath, or through a dragon head, runs Bulk Ending:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Cobblestone becomes end stone, stone bricks end stone bricks\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Apples become \"},{\"text\":\"Chorus Fruit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:chorus_fruit\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Leather becomes phantom membrane\"}]",
    "",
    "Mobs in the stream take instant damage. The undead enjoy it.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Infuser\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5C6B37C1585CA8CE\"}},{\"text\":\" over a basin of breath turns \"},{\"text\":\"250\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" mB into \"},{\"text\":\"750\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" mB of Infused Dragon's Breath, the fluid behind the \"},{\"text\":\"salvaging fan\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"11F14228ED3BBB5E\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.16D128C530556B90.title": "Copycats",
  "quest.16D128C530556B90.quest_subtitle": "Any block, any shape.",
  "quest.16D128C530556B90.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Click a copycat block with a material and it takes that look; a wrench removes it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Slopes, steps, beams, doors, ladders, a ghost block. Most are cut from zinc in a stonecutter."
  ],
  "quest.1089FF521C5397C8.title": "Sheet metal and friends",
  "quest.1089FF521C5397C8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Create Deco adds \"},{\"text\":\"sheet metal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createdeco:andesite_sheet_metal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", coloured bricks, lamps, decals, bars, doors and windows in Create's style.\"}]",
    "",
    "Rechiseled Create chisels the base blocks."
  ],
  "quest.660ACF6373137B51.title": "Bells and whistles",
  "quest.660ACF6373137B51.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Headlights\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"bellsandwhistles:headlight\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", cowcatchers, platforms, metro casing and grab bars: dressing for trains and stations.\"}]",
    "",
    "Glue it on like any block."
  ],
  "quest.387AED26C270661F.title": "Hypertube",
  "quest.387AED26C270661F.quest_subtitle": "Commuting, but in a tube.",
  "quest.387AED26C270661F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Glass tubes that carry players and mobs.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Hypertube Entrance\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_hypertube:hypertube_entrance\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" needs \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\" RPM or more.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"The faster it turns, the faster you fly.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.709B5FD65DF2AC6B.title": "Faster, or slower",
  "quest.709B5FD65DF2AC6B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hypertubes branch, speed up and brake.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Accelerators\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_hypertube:hypertube_accelerator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" speed a rider up or brake them.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Junctions split the line and you steer with the movement keys.\"}]",
    "",
    "Link tubes by clicking a placed one with the next."
  ],
  "quest.28984D492046759D.title": "Slicer",
  "quest.28984D492046759D.quest_subtitle": "Knife skills, outsourced.",
  "quest.28984D492046759D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A cogwheel, an andesite casing and a turntable: the \"},{\"text\":\"Slicer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sliceanddice:slicer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Right-click it with a knife and it cuts what passes beneath, on a depot, a belt or in a basin: Farmer's Delight cutting board recipes, no hands."
  ],
  "quest.7513397D32714F6A.title": "Sprinkles on top",
  "quest.7513397D32714F6A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copper plates, a fluid pipe and iron bars: a \"},{\"text\":\"Sprinkler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sliceanddice:sprinkler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Put it under a pipe and it sprays the fluid over the area.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Water, liquid fertilizer and other fluids each do something different to crops and creatures.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6070A59336C59BC8.title": "A kitchen on autopilot",
  "quest.6070A59336C59BC8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cutting boards automate too: a Mechanical Arm puts raw ingredients on a \"},{\"text\":\"Cutting Board\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"farmersdelight:cutting_board\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a deployer holding a knife in Use mode cuts them. Arms also take servings off feasts and slices off pies, and leave the last one in place.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.08668E9211F80A6E.title": "Sixteen bowls from the pot",
  "quest.103D9F34E56F2F0E.title": "Pot on the line",
  "quest.103D9F34E56F2F0E.quest_subtitle": "Nobody stirs by hand anymore.",
  "quest.103D9F34E56F2F0E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Central Kitchen hooks the \"},{\"text\":\"Cooking Pot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"farmersdelight:cooking_pot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" up to Create.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A packager unpacks the ingredients into it; factory gauges help order them.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"A mechanical arm adds the bowls.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"An arm or a funnel takes the meal out.\"}]",
    "",
    "A blaze burner underneath counts as heat."
  ],
  "quest.7EA423253377FE28.title": "Mechanical Chisel",
  "quest.7EA423253377FE28.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An andesite casing and a chisel: the \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Chisel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rechiseledcreate:mechanical_chisel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Rechiseled: Create adds cut and polished variants of Create's stones and new window styles to chisel into."
  ],
  "quest.25CB45905C2979C7.title": "Storage on rails",
  "quest.25CB45905C2979C7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sophisticated storage can ride the rails.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Craft a Sophisticated chest, barrel or shulker box with a minecart: a \"},{\"text\":\"storage minecart\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorageinmotion:storage_minecart\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"It upgrades by tier like the block.\"}]",
    "",
    "Boats and rafts work the same way."
  ],
  "quest.170FE2044196CF14.title": "Upgrades that ride along",
  "quest.170FE2044196CF14.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two small integrations make Sophisticated backpacks and storage fully featured on Create contraptions: their upgrades keep working while the contraption moves.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.391CBF85EECF8E46.title": "Eight magnets for one coil",
  "quest.66037C7B60577D4C.title": "A ring of magnets",
  "quest.66037C7B60577D4C.quest_subtitle": "Opposites attract; netherite, most of all.",
  "quest.66037C7B60577D4C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight magnets ring a \"},{\"text\":\"Generator Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:generator_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and their force adds up.\"}]",
    "",
    "Each block's tooltip shows its own:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Magnetite: \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Magnet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:redstone_magnet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Layered Magnet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:layered_magnet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Fluxuated Magnetite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:fluxuated_magnetite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"},{\"text\":\"Netherite Magnet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:netherite_magnet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"24\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "More force turns a bigger share of the coil's stress into current, but the coil also draws more stress: size the rotation for it.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A redstone magnet is a redstone block in iron nuggets; a layered one, overcharged iron and gold; fluxuated magnetite, magnetite with overcharged gold and diamond; a netherite magnet, scrap and five overcharged diamonds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6B4AFB438BD5ED82.title": "A slice for the workshop",
  "quest.6B4AFB438BD5ED82.quest_subtitle": "Wisdom, frosted.",
  "quest.6B4AFB438BD5ED82.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Somebody left a cake o' enchanting on the shelf.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: it's a lie anyway."
  ],
  "image.34D918AD9032A858.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Enchantment Industry\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.4B9065B3DB246144.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Create: Connected\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.3AC5F1907B905ACC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Dragons Plus\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.36247CE6061B2C21.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Copycats and Deco\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.22A6689B8479BEE5.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hypertube\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.4735EA56E04852D7.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Kitchen\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.4F61DE9C97184310.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Rechiseled\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.6AFAF5D5E00C9C33.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Storage in motion\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.0F24B31775374543.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"New Age\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.17A266723707C0C8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"CREATE\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.37FCDFAF0B875565.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Addons\",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"}]",
  "image.3B7E2213A4E4625F.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "chapter.05D8E54D28EA91EE.title": "Energy, Ore and Automation",
  "chapter.05D8E54D28EA91EE.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Which generator fits when, every way to double an ore, and the first line that runs alone."
  ],
  "task.3EA41E2B330B688C.title": "Any first generator",
  "quest.06BFA19A5271724A.title": "First power",
  "quest.06BFA19A5271724A.quest_subtitle": "A coal in, a machine humming.",
  "quest.06BFA19A5271724A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Seven early generators burn plain furnace fuel, and none asks the Atlas for a component.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"One coal is \"},{\"text\":\"48,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE in a \"},{\"text\":\"Furnator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:furnator_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"36,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" in an \"},{\"text\":\"RFTools Coal Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:coalgenerator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"32,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" in an \"},{\"text\":\"Actually Additions Coal Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:coal_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The other four:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Oritech Basic Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:basic_generator_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" RF/t\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism Heat Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:heat_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Pitiful Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:pitiful_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"30\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Stirling Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:stirling_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", with its chapter\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Burn time is shared: a coal is 1,600 ticks, a coal block 16,000 and a lava bucket 20,000, so a bucket in a Furnator is 600,000 FE.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3ECC537E1727CCDF.title": "Units that convert",
  "quest.3ECC537E1727CCDF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Forge Energy is the shared currency; every other unit converts at a fixed rate.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"FE, RF, CF (Actually Additions) and µI (Ender IO): the same unit\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism: \"},{\"text\":\"2.5\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" J is 1 FE\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Applied Energistics 2: \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE is 1 AE, one way\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Modern Industrialization: 1 EU is \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MI power can feed the rest of your base; the rest of your base can't feed MI. Create runs on rotation and PneumaticCraft on pressure, and both have a bridge in \"},{\"text\":\"Shafts to sockets\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"01B1492E9A898747\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Air to current\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"521A75B666C9FA3D\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.6A30E5395F6DF902.title": "Any solar panel",
  "quest.1748DDBDFC986DBF.title": "Sun on the roof",
  "quest.1748DDBDFC986DBF.quest_subtitle": "Free by day, off at night.",
  "quest.1748DDBDFC986DBF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"No fuel to haul, no farm to tend, and nothing after dusk.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Solar Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:solar_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t (50 J/t)\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Powah Solar Panel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:solar_panel_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t at Starter\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Oritech Big Solar Panel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:big_solar_panel_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" RF/t, up to 224 with better cores\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each one wants open sky above it; a roof stops all three. Oritech's is a 3×3 multiblock that folds away at night.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Put a cell beside the panels: night takes the whole array off the grid and a battery bridges it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Full numbers and upgrades live in \"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"48EF67E0E00158F4\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Powah\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"25460E08E4BE47CE\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Oritech\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"04978122063C0015\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.20EF042AD5D70B5A.title": "A wind generator or a dynamo",
  "quest.133022BA1A7BB1FD.title": "Wind and water",
  "quest.133022BA1A7BB1FD.quest_subtitle": "Height sells wind; a river sells water.",
  "quest.133022BA1A7BB1FD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Turning things make power, and the higher or wetter, the better.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Wind Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:wind_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": from \"},{\"text\":\"24\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t to \"},{\"text\":\"192\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t, rising with height\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Kinetic Dynamo\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:dynamo\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": fed by an IE windmill or water wheel, and only those\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The Mekanism generator needs sky four blocks above it and starts counting at Y 24 (60 J/t), reaching 480 J/t at the top of its range.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"IE sails triple a windmill's speed at eight; up to three water wheels share one dynamo. Create's own wheels turn shafts, not current: see \"},{\"text\":\"Shafts to sockets\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"01B1492E9A898747\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.01B1492E9A898747.title": "Shafts to sockets",
  "quest.01B1492E9A898747.quest_subtitle": "Turn it into FE, then back.",
  "quest.01B1492E9A898747.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Create's spin becomes FE, and FE becomes spin.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Alternator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:alternator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": makes FE from \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" RPM up, more with more speed\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Electric Motor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:electric_motor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": spins at the RPM you scroll in, and bills you for it\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Generator Coils\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create_new_age:generator_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", ringed by magnets, feed Carbon Brushes\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In this pack New Age's carbon brushes take an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Coupler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:energy_coupler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act II) where the andesite alloy was.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Both mods have their own nodes: \"},{\"text\":\"Rotation to current\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"40D2195EF4AA050D\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Generator Coil\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"41BC5584D4C11B0F\"}},{\"text\":\" in \"},{\"text\":\"Create · Rails and Power\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"06C76EF421D48687\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.521A75B666C9FA3D.title": "Air to current",
  "quest.521A75B666C9FA3D.quest_subtitle": "A bridge that overheats if you ignore it.",
  "quest.521A75B666C9FA3D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"PneumaticCraft turns FE into pressure and pressure back into FE.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Flux Compressor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:flux_compressor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": takes \"},{\"text\":\"40\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t bare and makes air\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Pneumatic Dynamo\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:pneumatic_dynamo\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": makes \"},{\"text\":\"40\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t from air\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Both lose efficiency as they heat, down to nothing: cool them.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Speed upgrades and cooling are in \"},{\"text\":\"Flux Compressor\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7EEAD423F8D05024\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Pneumatic Dynamo\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"50D2F8589687A786\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.35898CEF32D64B7C.title": "A lava or heat generator",
  "quest.36FC798DD6C0C68E.title": "Lava and heat",
  "quest.36FC798DD6C0C68E.quest_subtitle": "The Nether's gift, by the bucket.",
  "quest.36FC798DD6C0C68E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One lava pool can power five different generators.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Oritech Lava Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:lava_generator_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" RF/t\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Heat Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:heat_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t, plus \"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" per side touching lava\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Powah Magmator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:magmator_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"100,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE per bucket\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two burn nothing at all: \"},{\"text\":\"Powah's Thermo Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:thermo_generator_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sits on lava or magma and runs on water, and \"},{\"text\":\"IE's Thermoelectric Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:thermoelectric_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" lives on the gap between a hot block and a cold one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A lava bucket in a Powah Furnator gives 600,000 FE and returns the bucket: the same lava in a Magmator gives 100,000.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.40001C8E4B33B6BD.title": "A biofuel generator",
  "quest.1937CCC0FB71EB1E.title": "Farm to grid",
  "quest.1937CCC0FB71EB1E.quest_subtitle": "Waste in, current out.",
  "quest.1937CCC0FB71EB1E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Anything that grows can be burned, so a farm feeds a generator.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Bio-Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:bio_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"140\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t (350 J/t) on bio fuel\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Biofuel Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:biofuel_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"160\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t, 640 FE per mB\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Oritech Bio Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:bio_generator_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" RF/t on biomass\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Industrial Foregoing's Bioreactor makes 95 mB of biofuel per round from one kind of item and 3,719 mB from nine different kinds: mix the slots.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The farms that feed this line are in \"},{\"text\":\"Farms that feed the line\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"63F545CBDE937710\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.65BE6F8B728D0EC9.title": "A gas or fuel generator",
  "quest.580220EC5BF08FCE.title": "Gas, diesel and oil",
  "quest.580220EC5BF08FCE.quest_subtitle": "Refined fuel, unrefined ambitions.",
  "quest.580220EC5BF08FCE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Liquid and gas fuel make the biggest single-block generators of the mid game.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Oritech Fuel Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:fuel_generator_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" RF/t on oil or refined fuel\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Gas-Burning Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:gas_burning_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": burns hydrogen, or better, ethene\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"IE's Diesel Generator\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"693B56B9AD358543\"}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"4,096\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t, a multiblock\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Raw oil runs Oritech's generator, but refined fuels are where it pays. IE's diesel generator eats biodiesel or creosote and burns it fast: build the fuel first.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each has its chapter: \"},{\"text\":\"Oritech\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"3D6A7A0D44BFB7EB\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1AD59FD5A21F356B\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Diesel power\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6501E1AE152E3230\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4995D07EBFE9F42F.title": "A steam engine or a turbine",
  "quest.1D7A85CD9B7D2262.title": "Steam plants",
  "quest.1D7A85CD9B7D2262.quest_subtitle": "Boil water, spin a rotor, buy a bigger grid.",
  "quest.1D7A85CD9B7D2262.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Steam is where the big numbers start.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Oritech Steam Engine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:steam_engine_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": up to \"},{\"text\":\"50,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" RF/t from steam\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"MI LV Steam Turbine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:lv_steam_turbine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" mB of steam is \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" EU, up to 32 EU/t\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism Industrial Turbine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:turbine_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a multiblock from 5×3×5\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Any Oritech generator except the basic one becomes a steam maker with a Steam Boiler Addon; about a fifth of the water is lost each pass, and the engine stalls if its water tank is full.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"One MI EU is 10 FE here, so that LV turbine is up to \"},{\"text\":\"320\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t. Their own chapters: \"},{\"text\":\"Oritech\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"04978122063C0015\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"LV Steam Turbine\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"06A9F570B460CEDF\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Turbine\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"29569F80D701AD3D\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.2B2DA6D71EE882D6.title": "A reactor",
  "quest.375BA3028F782C52.title": "Atoms, on a leash",
  "quest.375BA3028F782C52.quest_subtitle": "Split anything you like; the Atlas holds the door.",
  "quest.375BA3028F782C52.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Reactors pay the most and ask the most, and the pack gates the loud ones by act.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Powah Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:reactor_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": uraninite, no gate at Starter\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Oritech Nuclear Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reactor_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": rods and heat pipes, no gate\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism Fission Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:fission_reactor_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": its port takes a Containment Seal (\"},{\"text\":\"IV\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\")\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Fusion in Mekanism and MI's nuclear reactor take an Ark Connection Bus (act V); Create New Age's reactor rod takes ironwood (act IV).",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each plant has its own chapters: \"},{\"text\":\"Powah\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5A9CC0F268D579EC\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Oritech\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"59937063F0B18650\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2C96C2EAAF41B7E4\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Draconic Evolution\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"38D5FD5FBCE2625C\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.561830E98C522185.title": "Any energy storage block",
  "quest.572C910CE861DAF6.title": "Store the surplus",
  "quest.572C910CE861DAF6.quest_subtitle": "A buffer is a generator with better manners.",
  "quest.572C910CE861DAF6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A cell between generators and machines flattens every spike.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism Basic Energy Cube\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_energy_cube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"1,600,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE (4 MJ)\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Powah Starter Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energy_cell_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"1,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"RFTools Powercell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:cell1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"500,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Ender IO's Capacitor Bank holds 500,000 µI and IE's LV Accumulator 100,000 FE, at 256 FE/t each way. Cells of one kind can share a pool: same-tier banks in Ender IO, any RFTools powercells together.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Bigger stores and the ones that hold a whole base: \"},{\"text\":\"Induction Matrix\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"19DD91D523871AD1\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Powah cells\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"16ACDFEC566167E4\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Powercell\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"190FED7518F4144F\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"AE2 energy cells\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6A516FC607869EC3\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.12AE0449F841ECD7.title": "Wire it up",
  "quest.12AE0449F841ECD7.quest_subtitle": "Thick cables, thin excuses.",
  "quest.12AE0449F841ECD7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Bare cables move from \"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"10,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t: pick by the flow, not by the mod.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Pipez Energy Pipe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:energy_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t bare\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Powah Starter Cable\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energy_cable_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"500\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism Basic Cable\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_universal_cable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"3,200\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t (8,000 J/t)\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Oritech Energy Pipe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:energy_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"10,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" RF/t\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every one connects to any mod's FE blocks. Set a Pipez generator end to extract with the wrench first: see \"},{\"text\":\"Pipe Wrench\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"4D5DE8F1242EB133\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wireless instead of wire: \"},{\"text\":\"No cable at all\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1C8DF3DFD210C7BF\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.2D1F894FC1A1A22A.title": "A wireless energy link",
  "quest.1C8DF3DFD210C7BF.title": "No cable at all",
  "quest.1C8DF3DFD210C7BF.quest_subtitle": "The best cable is the one you never dig up.",
  "quest.1C8DF3DFD210C7BF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Some links skip the wire entirely, and one skips the dimension too.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Flux Point\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:flux_point\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": up to \"},{\"text\":\"800,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t, any distance, any dimension\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"LaserIO Energy Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:card_energy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": up to \"},{\"text\":\"1,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t along a laser line\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"JDT Energy Transmitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:energytransmitter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"1,000\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t, losing 1% per block\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Flux Plug, the block that feeds a Flux network, takes a Reinforced Alloy (act III) in this pack; so does XNet's Controller.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The full ones: \"},{\"text\":\"Flux Plug\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5F37A164B3A0D59F\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Cards\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"42F00C80E7A39912\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Transmitter\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"286E9DD3A04004DF\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4C9F577BAA9D57ED.title": "Read the flow",
  "quest.4C9F577BAA9D57ED.quest_subtitle": "A speedometer for your grid.",
  "quest.4C9F577BAA9D57ED.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Drop it into a cable line to see what really flows, instant or smoothed.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Energy Meter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"energymeter:meter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" iron, a comparator, an observer, glass and two redstone\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"External Monitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"energymeter:monitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four meters and an ender pearl make four\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It also has a Limit setting that caps the flow through it, and computers can read it as a peripheral.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A meter at each end of a suspect line, then subtract: the difference is your loss or your bottleneck. More in \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Meter\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"014A8F84EBC9F691\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2C79BDE68081E6D8.title": "Charge your gear",
  "quest.2C79BDE68081E6D8.quest_subtitle": "Stand still and get topped up.",
  "quest.2C79BDE68081E6D8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three ways to fill the batteries you carry.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Chargepad\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:chargepad\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": stand on it and it charges any mod's energized item\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Player Transmitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:player_transmitter_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": charges your whole inventory anywhere in its dimension, through a Binding Card\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Flux Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:flux_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": charges the members of its network\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The Powah transmitter's Starter tier moves 500 FE/t per item; the higher tiers reach 1,000,000. Its dimensional card widens the reach.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"See \"},{\"text\":\"Player Transmitter\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"4E6361BFFEB4C669\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Charged on the go\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"48039F57E19CAEE5\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.65B736FBC35BD88E.title": "Energy and the acts",
  "quest.65B736FBC35BD88E.quest_subtitle": "Generators are free; the wireless ones are not.",
  "quest.65B736FBC35BD88E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Power Regulator (act III) is a coupler, two steel plates and two circuits.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Energy Coupler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:energy_coupler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", from act II\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"two \"},{\"text\":\"Steel Plates\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:plate_steel\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"two \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Control Circuits\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "",
    "It gates Mekanism's jetpack, Psi's CAD Assembler and the aircraft engine.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Other gates in the energy trade, by act:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"III\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" Reinforced Alloy: Flux Plug, RFTools Dimensional Cells, Iron Jetpacks straps, Mining Gadgets, Create New Age's advanced motor\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"IV\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" ironwood: Powah's Niotic tier, Oritech's Bedrock Extractor, MI's Electric Quarry\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"V\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" atomic alloy or a bus: Powah Nitro, Ender IO's Octadic Capacitor, fusion\"}]",
    "",
    "The first generators of every kind stay open."
  ],
  "quest.1D421CED31F05B4F.title": "Cells before imports",
  "quest.1D421CED31F05B4F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An AE2 network can't spend more in one tick than it has stored, so add an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:energy_cell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" before a big import or a crafting burst.\"}]",
    "",
    "AE2 turns FE into its own unit, two to one, and never gives it back."
  ],
  "quest.765A2A820F27B152.title": "Oritech pushes",
  "quest.765A2A820F27B152.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Power in Oritech is push-only: generators and storage push into pipes, and a pipe never pulls.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A wrench turns a pipe's side off. For heavier loads, \"},{\"text\":\"Superconductors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:superconductor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" replace pipes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6B3B75258BBC4AC6.title": "One voltage per wire",
  "quest.6B3B75258BBC4AC6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An IE wire carries a single voltage, and a transformer joins them.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Per connector: \"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t on LV, \"},{\"text\":\"1,024\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" on MV, \"},{\"text\":\"4,096\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" on HV. Past eight connectors' worth a wire burns out.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2FB875EDE69CD455.title": "Infinite, at a price",
  "quest.2FB875EDE69CD455.quest_subtitle": "The bill arrives in Luminosities.",
  "quest.2FB875EDE69CD455.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Five creative energy items exist, and none is free.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism Creative Energy Cube\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:creative_energy_cube\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Powah Creative Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energy_cell_creative\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Create Creative Motor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:creative_motor\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"AE2 Creative Energy Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:creative_energy_cell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and \"},{\"text\":\"Draconic's Creative Capacitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:creative_capacitor\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every recipe asks \"},{\"text\":\"four\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" Luminosities (two kinds, two of each), two dragon hearts or nether stars, two top materials of its mod and the best real device of its kind.\"}]",
    "",
    "That is act VI."
  ],
  "quest.14B80E1A7F7061F7.title": "Raw ore, or the block?",
  "quest.14B80E1A7F7061F7.quest_subtitle": "Fortune and Silk Touch disagree.",
  "quest.14B80E1A7F7061F7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fortune drops raw ore, Silk Touch drops the block, and each machine pays differently for each.\"}]",
    "",
    "Average raw iron per ore, by Fortune level:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Fortune I: \"},{\"text\":\"1.33\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Fortune II: \"},{\"text\":\"1.75\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Fortune III: \"},{\"text\":\"2.2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Silk Touch only wins where the machine wants the block: Actually Additions' Crusher, MI's Macerator and Integrated Dynamics' squeezers. Everywhere else, bring raw ore.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every number in this chapter is for iron, per ore block unless it says raw. The full table is in \"},{\"text\":\"Ingots per ore\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"3BE1CBEF0802DB1C\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.46F02F766FCF395D.title": "Any ore doubler",
  "quest.78FDA698C6E95499.title": "Your first doubler",
  "quest.78FDA698C6E95499.quest_subtitle": "Two for one is the whole trick.",
  "quest.78FDA698C6E95499.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Any machine that turns one ore into two or more.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Create's crushing wheels: \"},{\"text\":\"1.75\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"2.25\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" per ore block\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"IE's Crusher and Arc Furnace: \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism's Enrichment Chamber: \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Also: Actually Additions' Crusher and Oritech's Pulverizer give 2 raw, Ender IO's SAG Mill 2.4, MI's Macerator 4.5 and Integrated Dynamics' Squeezer 2.75.",
    "",
    "Pick the one your base already has power for; every route is on its own node below."
  ],
  "quest.7AD07B9921AA3CD8.title": "Crush it, then wash it",
  "quest.7AD07B9921AA3CD8.quest_subtitle": "Grind first, splash after.",
  "quest.7AD07B9921AA3CD8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Crushing wheels give one crushed ore per raw iron, and the wash hands out the extras.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Raw iron: \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" crushed and a 75% XP nugget\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Iron ore block: \"},{\"text\":\"1.75\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" crushed, \"},{\"text\":\"2.25\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" if deepslate\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Wash a crushed ore: \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" iron nuggets and a 75% chance of redstone\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Create shines on copper: a copper ore block crushes into 5.25 crushed ore on average, against 1.75 for iron.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The wheels are the \"},{\"text\":\"big grind\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"188EC2F2CE68070A\"}},{\"text\":\" of \"},{\"text\":\"Create · Kinetics\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7BF8A0F5CDAED7CF\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.23019D0A97A8F00C.title": "The crusher and the arc",
  "quest.23019D0A97A8F00C.quest_subtitle": "Sparks fly, slag flies, ingots stay.",
  "quest.23019D0A97A8F00C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two IE multiblocks: one grinds ore to dust, the other smelts it whole.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Crusher: ore block \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" dust, raw ore \"},{\"text\":\"1.33\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Arc Furnace: ore block \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" ingots and slag, raw ore \"},{\"text\":\"1.5\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The arc furnace spends 102,400 FE on an ore block and 25,600 FE on a raw ore: raw costs a third of the power per ingot, and with Fortune III it is 3.3 ingots per ore mined.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The crusher also drops nickel dust 10% of the time. Both are in \"},{\"text\":\"IE · Industry\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"693B56B9AD358543\"}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"The crusher\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"42E48835149F9A3C\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Lightning in a vat\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6E0D8F11804BF736\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2A4733EA6E7036DA.title": "The macerator wants blocks",
  "quest.2A4733EA6E7036DA.quest_subtitle": "Silk Touch, for once, earns its keep.",
  "quest.2A4733EA6E7036DA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"MI turns an ore block into three raw ores, and each raw into one and a half dusts.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Macerator: ore block \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" raw, raw ore \"},{\"text\":\"1.5\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" dust\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Forge Hammer: ore block \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" raw, \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" with a Hammer in its tool slot\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"That is \"},{\"text\":\"4.5\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" dust per Silk Touch block.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Fortune III gives 3.3 dust per ore mined, so here the block wins by a wide margin.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The steam-age machines are in \"},{\"text\":\"Bronze Macerator\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"69C4ED8DF233A0BE\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Forge Hammer\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0DA5E26857F9CA09\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0BDE2EBD8D54FEFD.title": "Powder with a ball",
  "quest.0BDE2EBD8D54FEFD.quest_subtitle": "A mill with a bonus round.",
  "quest.0BDE2EBD8D54FEFD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The SAG Mill hands back more than it takes, and Grinding Balls raise the bonus.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Raw ore: \"},{\"text\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" powder on average, and 5% tin dust\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Ore block: \"},{\"text\":\"1.33\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" raw ore and a 15% cobblestone\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "That is 2.4 powder per ore block and 4.0 per ore mined with Fortune III. A piece of flint in the ball slot lifts raw ore to 2.4.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A ball wears out with the energy it multiplies. See \"},{\"text\":\"Grinding Balls\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"4C653C2D2CF9FA86\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Dust math\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5E22EBC1D45D8F54\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2B97086271E1EA71.title": "The early crusher",
  "quest.2B97086271E1EA71.quest_subtitle": "Electric, cheap and blocks only.",
  "quest.2B97086271E1EA71.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Actually Additions' Crusher turns an iron ore block into two raw irons, with a 20% chance of raw gold.\"}]",
    "",
    "No recipe takes raw ore, so this is a Silk Touch machine.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The Double Crusher runs two lanes at once. Fine before Fortune III, then outgrown by every raw-ore route.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Full details in \"},{\"text\":\"Double Crusher, Powered Furnace\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7B71F85B50C2D72D\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2FC8BA3D26A234E5.title": "Mekanism's ladder",
  "quest.2FC8BA3D26A234E5.quest_subtitle": "One ore, four machines, five ingots.",
  "quest.2FC8BA3D26A234E5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each rung adds a chemical and an ingot to the same ore block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Enrichment Chamber: \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" dust\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Purification Chamber, with oxygen: \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" clumps\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Injection Chamber, with hydrogen chloride: \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" shards\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Dissolution with sulfuric acid, then washing and crystallizing: \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" crystals\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Per raw ore it is 1.33, 2, 2.67 and 3.33; with Fortune III, 2.9, 4.4, 5.9 and 7.3 per ore mined.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The whole ladder, machine by machine, is \"},{\"text\":\"Twice the iron\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"23DDAEDB68C22955\"}},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"Five per ore\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"097681B4961E86A7\"}},{\"text\":\" in \"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism · Basics\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"42B819B4DF274C89\"}},{\"text\":\"; \"},{\"text\":\"Raw or Silk Touch?\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1C262970740A5BD8\"}},{\"text\":\" has the arithmetic.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.61418A5DA4757B2D.title": "Oritech's gem route",
  "quest.61418A5DA4757B2D.quest_subtitle": "The richest road in the pack.",
  "quest.61418A5DA4757B2D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Oritech runs raw iron through three machines and lands on about six ingots.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Fragment Forge: \"},{\"text\":\"1.33\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" clumps per raw (nine small ones make a whole)\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Centrifuge: \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" gem per clump, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" with water, \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" with sulfuric acid\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Foundry: two gems make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" ingots\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A Pulverizer gives two raw first, so one ore block ends as:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"12\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" ingots with acid, or 13.2 per ore mined with Fortune III.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sheol fire in the Refinery turns a raw into two clumps instead of 1.33: 18 per ore block. Steps in \"},{\"text\":\"Pulverizer\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"04932A1C97664069\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Centrifuge\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1B28C442DA9F58D8\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Foundry\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"13FF438B9DAC8414\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.2C3F5F4EE1F0DEFE.title": "Summon a Foliot Crusher",
  "quest.28ACB4DB25663AB6.title": "Spirits at the quern",
  "quest.28ACB4DB25663AB6.quest_subtitle": "Pay in chalk, be paid in dust.",
  "quest.28ACB4DB25663AB6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A crusher spirit turns one ore into two dusts, and higher spirits into three, four or six.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Foliot: \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"   Djinni: \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Afrit: \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"   Marid: \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The same counts hold for a raw ore, so with a Marid crusher Fortune III makes 13.2 dusts per ore mined: as much as Oritech's whole chain.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The rituals are in \"},{\"text\":\"Aviar's Circle\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1CA9462AE1EC919A\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Djinni at work\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"3E436D1792543A16\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Afrit at work\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"171288938B89FB4E\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Marid at work\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"26FEE7CF2C363E14\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7F55EB83C08DA415.title": "Jump on it",
  "quest.7F55EB83C08DA415.quest_subtitle": "The cheapest doubling is a squeeze.",
  "quest.7F55EB83C08DA415.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Integrated Dynamics squeezes ore blocks into raw ore, and it takes no raw.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Squeezer: an ore block gives \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" raw and a 75% chance of a third\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Squeezer: \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" raw and two 50% extras, \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" on average\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Silk Touch again: neither squeezer accepts raw ore.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The manual one needs a jumper; the mechanical one runs on 80 FE/t. Both are in \"},{\"text\":\"The Squeezer crushes too\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0A65CC3994122798\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"No more jumping\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"3CC2D73E620A4BF9\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4E3B021E19511C86.title": "Uraninite, doubled",
  "quest.4E3B021E19511C86.quest_subtitle": "The orb pays double on raw.",
  "quest.4E3B021E19511C86.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Powah's Energizing Orb turns raw uraninite into two uraninite for 2,000 FE, where a furnace gives one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Silk-touched ore: \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" uraninite for 50,000 FE (poor 3, dense 10)\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Raw uraninite: \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" for 2,000 FE\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "An ore drops 2 raw, and 4.4 with Fortune III: energized, that is 8.8 uraninite for 8,800 FE, against 5 for the block. Fortune wins.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The orb and its rods are in \"},{\"text\":\"Energizing Orb\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"13F36FB6A1E76C79\"}},{\"text\":\"; the reactor that eats it is in \"},{\"text\":\"Powah Reactor\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5A9CC0F268D579EC\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.714000127752F16B.title": "What else falls out",
  "quest.714000127752F16B.quest_subtitle": "Ore is never just ore.",
  "quest.714000127752F16B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every route drops something on the side, and most of it is worth keeping.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Create wash: iron gives redstone (75%), gold quartz (50%), copper clay (50%)\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"IE Crusher: iron gives nickel dust (10%), copper gold dust (10%)\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Ender IO SAG, raw ore: iron gives tin dust (5%), gold copper dust (20%)\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Oritech Fragment Forge: raw iron adds 3 small nickel clumps, raw gold 3 small copper\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Actually Additions Crusher: an iron ore block adds raw gold (20%)\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Occultism, Mekanism and MI give none: all of it is main output.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.23F039D6DBAAD79F.title": "One ingot per metal",
  "quest.23F039D6DBAAD79F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Almost Unified makes every machine hand out the same ingot, dust or plate for a metal.\"}]",
    "",
    "The first mod on this list wins:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Vanilla, Create, Immersive Engineering\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism, Oritech, Ender IO, Ad Astra\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Modern Industrialization\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The recipe viewer hides the duplicates. Loot is not unified, but every copy shares its tags, so any of them still works in recipes."
  ],
  "quest.3BE1CBEF0802DB1C.title": "Ingots per ore",
  "quest.3BE1CBEF0802DB1C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Iron ingots per ore: Silk Touch block, one raw ore, and an ore mined with Fortune III (2.2 raw).\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Furnace: \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"2.2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Create: \"},{\"text\":\"1.75-2.25\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"2.2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"IE Arc Furnace: \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"1.5\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"3.3\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Ender IO SAG: \"},{\"text\":\"2.4\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"1.8\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"4.0\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"MI Macerator: \"},{\"text\":\"4.5\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"1.5\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"3.3\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Actually Additions: \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  no raw route\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Integrated Dynamics: \"},{\"text\":\"2.75\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"/\"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  no raw route\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism: \"},{\"text\":\"2 3 4 5\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"1.33 2 2.67 3.33\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"2.9 4.4 5.9 7.3\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Occultism: \"},{\"text\":\"2 3 4 6\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  same  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"4.4 6.6 8.8 13.2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Oritech, with acid: \"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"  ·  \"},{\"text\":\"13.2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3B78D5C6732777EF.title": "A mine that resets",
  "quest.3B78D5C6732777EF.quest_subtitle": "Dig anywhere; the home stays whole.",
  "quest.3B78D5C6732777EF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"JAMD portals open worlds made for digging, and each dimension has its own act.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Overworld mine: a Calibration Frame (\"},{\"text\":\"II\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\")\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Nether mine: a Containment Seal (\"},{\"text\":\"IV\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\")\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"End mine: a Horizon Chart (\"},{\"text\":\"IV\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\")\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The block is the portal: place it and use it. The Overworld one is seven obsidian around a diamond pickaxe, with the Frame in the top slot.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"More in \"},{\"text\":\"Deep Worlds\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"712FD0619F7002E8\"}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"A Mining Portal\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"706A01ED65FEE247\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.41E9F3FDC372449C.title": "Quarries and their gates",
  "quest.41E9F3FDC372449C.quest_subtitle": "Ore from power, once the story allows it.",
  "quest.41E9F3FDC372449C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Machines that mine for you are the last of the ore routes, and most wait for act IV.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism Digital Miner: a Spectral Lens (\"},{\"text\":\"IV\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\")\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Oritech Bedrock Extractor, MI Electric Quarry, IF Ore Laser: ironwood (\"},{\"text\":\"IV\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\")\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mining Gadgets: a Reinforced Alloy (\"},{\"text\":\"III\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\")\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "MI's Steam Quarry is not gated: steel casings and a bronze drill dig ores from below bedrock at 4 EU/t.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"See \"},{\"text\":\"Digital Miner\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"679EE6710CBD36EA\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Steam Quarry\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"65B2AF2AA4A5C977\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"A laser that mines\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6E90715BDE070851\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7DABF9C654292148.title": "The first circuit",
  "quest.7DABF9C654292148.quest_subtitle": "A furnace that works while you don't.",
  "quest.7DABF9C654292148.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chest, hopper, furnace, hopper, chest: every factory is this line, made longer.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"A hopper moves \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" item every 8 ticks: \"},{\"text\":\"2.5\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" a second\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"From above it feeds a furnace's input, from the side its fuel, and from below it takes the product\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A comparator on a container turns how full it is into a signal, and a signal can stop the line before it jams.\"}]",
    "",
    "When something stops, follow the items: they pile up right before the problem."
  ],
  "quest.23768FBE28F5B3EA.title": "Pipes that pull",
  "quest.23768FBE28F5B3EA.quest_subtitle": "They connect to everything and move nothing until told.",
  "quest.23768FBE28F5B3EA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A pipe only moves items once an end is set to extract, and a bare one beats a hopper.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Bare item pipe: \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" items per second\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Wrench while sneaking on the arm at a chest: it starts extracting\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Again: the arm comes off\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Upgrades raise the rate: Basic 8 items every 15 ticks, Improved 16 every 10, Advanced 32 every 5 and Ultimate 64 every tick.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The whole family is in \"},{\"text\":\"Item Pipes\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"05CCF43C232C2870\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Pipe Wrench\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"4D5DE8F1242EB133\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Pipe Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2B72673A26EA44B0\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.05B443D66D43BA72.title": "Machine sides",
  "quest.05B443D66D43BA72.quest_subtitle": "Every face of a machine has a job.",
  "quest.05B443D66D43BA72.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Most tech machines choose per side what goes in and what comes out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism: the side tab, or a \"},{\"text\":\"Configurator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:configurator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the block\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Turn on auto-eject and the product pushes itself into the next pipe\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Other mods use the same idea in their I/O tabs\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Set a machine's output side to face the input side of the next machine and there is no pipe left to build.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Mekanism's version, side by side with sorters and transporters, is in \"},{\"text\":\"Configurator\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"00A44CBA44389978\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Logistical Transporter\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"35CFDD95EF0BEBE4\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7F0C46AC3082F194.title": "Buffers and overflow",
  "quest.7F0C46AC3082F194.quest_subtitle": "The line that never jams.",
  "quest.7F0C46AC3082F194.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A chest between two machines keeps a slow step from stalling a fast one.\"}]",
    "",
    "Then decide what happens when the last chest fills:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Item Trash Can\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"trashcans:item_trash_can\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": voids what arrives, with a filter for up to \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" items\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"A Void Upgrade on a drawer: voids the excess\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Put the trash at the end of the line, never the middle: what reaches it is gone.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drawers and their upgrades are in \"},{\"text\":\"Storage and Backpacks\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"58E7DAF254E21B83\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7B4B6BFE3D5FA17A.title": "Fluids on the line",
  "quest.7B4B6BFE3D5FA17A.quest_subtitle": "Water finds its own level; pipes need instructions.",
  "quest.7B4B6BFE3D5FA17A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fluids move like items, with the same wrench and a different rate.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Pipez Fluid Pipe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:fluid_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" mB/t bare, from tanks and machines only\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Ranged Pumps' Pump drains sources within 64 blocks, \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" FE a block\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Create pipes need a Mechanical Pump; its arrow shows the flow\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Fluid pipes never drain a lake: feed them from a pump. Pipez's Universal Pipe carries items, fluids, energy and Mekanism chemicals in one line.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"More in \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Pipes\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"45164382B7C13FAD\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Pump\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"264F40F4997AB53E\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.718B726433BB5A90.title": "Belts, funnels and arms",
  "quest.718B726433BB5A90.quest_subtitle": "Create's answer to the pipe: a conveyor with opinions.",
  "quest.718B726433BB5A90.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In Create, belts carry, funnels load and unload, and an arm picks and places.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Belt: links two shafts up to 20 blocks apart, and machines above work on what rides past\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Funnel: pulls from an inventory, or pushes into one when placed while sneaking\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Arm: blue targets take, yellow give\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A Depot is a one-slot belt for machines and arms. Funnels can't join two chests: put a chute or a belt between them.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The workshops are in \"},{\"text\":\"Belts\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2324180555060EA4\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"In and out\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"3D9C0C0B645B0ABC\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Pick and place\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"10FBE1404F8230D8\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.20067837AD551995.title": "Filter at the source",
  "quest.20067837AD551995.quest_subtitle": "Sorting late is sorting twice.",
  "quest.20067837AD551995.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Almost every mover takes a filter, and the earlier it sits the cleaner the line stays.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"List Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": funnels, brass tunnels and arms\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Pipez: item IDs or #tags, once an Advanced Upgrade is in the extract menu\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"LaserIO filter cards, Modular Routers module slots and the Mekanism Logistical Sorter\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ore to the crusher and everything else to the chest, on one line: Pipez's Filter Destination Tool pins a filter to a block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"See \"},{\"text\":\"Filters with taste\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"25D97F2683BD89CD\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Pipe Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7875A03ECFC8A19D\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Filter Destination Tool\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"145C4C8C661D8832\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.53E12EA132885122.title": "Redstone control",
  "quest.53E12EA132885122.quest_subtitle": "A signal is just permission.",
  "quest.53E12EA132885122.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Run machines only when they are needed: most have a redstone mode.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Ignored, on when powered, off when powered, or always off\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Pipez unlocks the mode with the Basic Upgrade\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Clock\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"utilitarian:redstone_clock\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" with an empty hand sets the pulse rate, sneaking steps faster\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A comparator on a chest, or a Functional Storage drawer with a Redstone Upgrade, turns fill level into a signal: stop the source when the target is full.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The upgrades are in \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Pipe Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2B72673A26EA44B0\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5268F4017AEE3BBA.title": "Crafting on its own",
  "quest.5268F4017AEE3BBA.quest_subtitle": "Show it the recipe once.",
  "quest.5268F4017AEE3BBA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pick the crafter by what you already run.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Create Mechanical Crafters: big shaped recipes, one cell at a time\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"RFTools Crafter: \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" recipes at Tier 1, \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" at Tier 3, 100 FE a craft\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"MI Assembler, once you have electricity\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Storage networks craft from patterns: AE2's Pattern Provider and Refined Storage's Autocrafter, the latter behind a Handling Core (act III).",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"See \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting, industrialised\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5E11DCB2FA716F05\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Crafter\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"36B12A0BD6F53671\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Assembler\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"48D47667F4C39134\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Hands of the network\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"00455A2B03F16107\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.63F545CBDE937710.title": "Farms that feed the line",
  "quest.63F545CBDE937710.quest_subtitle": "A farm is automation with a field attached.",
  "quest.63F545CBDE937710.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Let the harvest walk into the machines by itself.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Foregoing's Plant Gatherer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:plant_gatherer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": crops and whole trees, with the Plant Sower to replant\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Create harvesters on a moving contraption\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Mekanism or Powah generators, fed by what grows\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Collect the drops: items left on the ground are lag. See \"},{\"text\":\"Items that come to you\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"3770966ECBA95B5D\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The farms are in \"},{\"text\":\"Harvest and fell\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0C88FF716F10EB13\"}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Nine colours, nine plots\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6CA1AD2BA873C2B0\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Farm to grid\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1937CCC0FB71EB1E\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.28DF7D6A7CD009DE.title": "An item collector",
  "quest.3770966ECBA95B5D.title": "Items that come to you",
  "quest.3770966ECBA95B5D.quest_subtitle": "Loose drops are lag with a price tag.",
  "quest.3770966ECBA95B5D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A collector grabs what lies on the ground and drops it into the chest it is stuck to.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Basic Item Collector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"itemcollectors:basic_collector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"7×7×7\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\", up to \"},{\"text\":\"11×11×11\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"JDT Item Collector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:itemcollector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": up to 5 blocks each way, and no power\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A collector has no inventory of its own: with no chest behind it, nothing is collected.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"See \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Item Collector\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"08F172F80A57CAE0\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Item Collector\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"4C5BFCC25ADFE7A9\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3944A93667D89759.title": "When lines become a network",
  "quest.3944A93667D89759.quest_subtitle": "Ten lines are a hobby; twenty are a database.",
  "quest.3944A93667D89759.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With many lines, a storage network feeds machines from storage and crafts the rest.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"AE2 or Refined Storage: import and export buses, then patterns\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"LaserIO and XNet: machine to machine, no central storage\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The AE2 and Refined Storage controllers take a Routing Matrix (act III); LaserIO and Pipez do not.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"AE2 has its own chapters: \"},{\"text\":\"Network\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1E24729503A1C81A\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Automation\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"369BBB754F0B5AB0\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1E354FE92CDDB0C1.title": "Keep the server happy",
  "quest.1E354FE92CDDB0C1.quest_subtitle": "Fewer entities, fewer ticks.",
  "quest.1E354FE92CDDB0C1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A line that lags is a line that gets shut down: prefer bigger stacks per move to faster ticking.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"Modular Routers' own book asks for Stack Upgrades before Speed Upgrades\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\"TPS Meter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"utilitarian:tps_meter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": outputs a redstone signal by the dimension's TPS\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Wire the meter so the line pauses itself when the server struggles, and let idle machines sleep on redstone.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The routers are in \"},{\"text\":\"Modular Routers\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"335E1EBA8FB3C477\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.65263D529EBC60BC.title": "Machines sleep when nobody is near",
  "quest.65263D529EBC60BC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blocks only work in loaded chunks. Claim your base with FTB Chunks and force-load only the machine chunks.\"}]",
    "",
    "Every loaded chunk costs the server, so keep the count small.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The controls are in \"},{\"text\":\"Teams and Claims\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2AEF3B16A131D400\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1756B7A4FD944A67.title": "Iron while you sleep",
  "quest.1756B7A4FD944A67.quest_subtitle": "Sixteen blocks, no hands.",
  "quest.1756B7A4FD944A67.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Power, an ore route and a line that runs alone, ending in a chest of iron.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Bring \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Blocks of Iron\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "That is 144 ingots: 29 ore blocks up Mekanism's ladder, or 12 through Oritech's acid line.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Leave it running for a night in-game and come back to full chests and an empty trash log.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4C28E2FF1940821B.title": "Iron for the common store",
  "quest.4C28E2FF1940821B.quest_subtitle": "Somebody is always short of iron.",
  "quest.4C28E2FF1940821B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"For the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"64\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Any route will do; a line that runs alone makes it painless."
  ],
  "quest.0CF18B0BBA1A625E.title": "Surge protector",
  "quest.0CF18B0BBA1A625E.quest_subtitle": "A villager, a storm and no fire.",
  "quest.0CF18B0BBA1A625E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You put a \"},{\"text\":\"Lightning Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lightning_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" between a villager and a strike, and nobody burned.\"}]",
    "",
    "The cheapest surge protection there is: copper on the roof of the power room."
  ],
  "reward.5B4EEF3A5530A5A9.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.014F18BF9FFBE2B6.title": "Great Scott",
  "quest.014F18BF9FFBE2B6.quest_subtitle": "Eighty-eight ticks to the hour.",
  "quest.014F18BF9FFBE2B6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fluxite is in your pocket: the crystal Oritech's lasers dig out.\"}]",
    "",
    "The Atomic Forge turns one iron gem and two fluxite into two iron dust."
  ],
  "reward.485586D207D21C6D.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.6B16BC643195E1DE.title": "Green light, red light",
  "quest.6B16BC643195E1DE.quest_subtitle": "Precise side control.",
  "quest.6B16BC643195E1DE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You crafted a \"},{\"text\":\"Diversion Transporter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:diversion_transporter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It opens or closes each side on redstone: the traffic cop of a Mekanism line."
  ],
  "reward.569257D8978647C5.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.51C83060960C8C4A.title": "The main switch",
  "quest.51C83060960C8C4A.quest_subtitle": "Click. Light. Sparks.",
  "quest.51C83060960C8C4A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pull it and the lamps of the mine come on.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nothing to build. Just the satisfaction of a big lever."
  ],
  "quest.10C1467F362C97A4.title": "A cart on the rails",
  "quest.10C1467F362C97A4.quest_subtitle": "Ore goes up, dreams go down.",
  "quest.10C1467F362C97A4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Rails, a minecart and nothing to carry yet.\"}]",
    "",
    "Click it and the tracks light up along the bottom of the mine."
  ],
  "image.116EAC8EF3C53F8D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"POWER AND ORE\",\"color\":\"#F6EBC8\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.5F9401D3E199FC75.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"the power room and the mine\",\"color\":\"#F4B942\"}]",
  "image.117B39C49DD4F22D.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.31F8450AC8580A4B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Logistics networks\",\"color\":\"#9DB4C8\"}]",
  "image.5419E68C755CC3F8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Storage and backpacks\",\"color\":\"#9DB4C8\"}]",
  "image.2FF2B494B7F3EA7B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Mekanism · Basics\",\"color\":\"#9DB4C8\"}]",
  "image.0AF48AFCC843A0E4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"POWER ROOM\",\"color\":\"#9DB4C8\"}]",
  "image.6E39B222537F19C3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"WORKSHOP\",\"color\":\"#D9B98C\"}]",
  "image.17F565D882A57204.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"I\",\"color\":\"#E8A54A\"}]",
  "image.36C4BF00FECED940.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"II\",\"color\":\"#F6E27A\"}]",
  "image.4E4693E22BA148EB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"III\",\"color\":\"#E0683A\"}]",
  "image.1E66BE21FFF93E33.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"IV\",\"color\":\"#6FD3E8\"}]",
  "image.284234279CC46C46.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×2\",\"color\":\"#E9D8A6\"}]",
  "image.03BDC2DC27CB4F83.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×2\",\"color\":\"#B7BFC9\"}]",
  "image.14352C479C53565A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×2\",\"color\":\"#E5A16A\"}]",
  "image.1C03DCDE996D8E5C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×2.4\",\"color\":\"#7DB9E8\"}]",
  "image.76B3FBF70F1CB588.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×2.75\",\"color\":\"#8FD6A0\"}]",
  "image.05CC5128FE1BD18A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×4.5\",\"color\":\"#D9A066\"}]",
  "image.0C0AA272AA36F0D1.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×5\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
  "image.7BCA0FB635E3555E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×6\",\"color\":\"#C9A0E8\"}]",
  "image.68861194A490B794.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×12\",\"color\":\"#F2C048\"}]",
  "image.6670DD445567F3D1.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×2\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.2CD5E922315793D3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×3\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.5D8ABDD9EE805B22.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×4\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.05B21D7045A59AC5.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×2\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.3A96437E36F38CA6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×3\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.230AB1D3800AE1AC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×4\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.5EE680341FD4CBAD.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×1\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.2C47535D314C06DC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×2\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.03C12C8F83B5EE66.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×3\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.6AA748B27D6884C4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×4\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.30B626AFBF3ED9F4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×5\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.4CB9B1EFB2B8ED92.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×6\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.22BDC11E49B413C8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×12\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.22DA0A789FEF7FA6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"THE MINE\",\"color\":\"#B59A7F\"}]",
  "image.03C593BD274A37F7.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ingots per ore block\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "chapter.5C9D01E144F06F5A.title": "Silent Gear",
  "chapter.5C9D01E144F06F5A.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Gear drawn up, part by part: blueprints, materials and traits, the forge, the grader and the charger, all the way to tyrian steel."
  ],
  "quest.7436213DB8D718D5.title": "Stone Anvil",
  "quest.7436213DB8D718D5.quest_subtitle": "Cobblestone, dirt and patience.",
  "quest.7436213DB8D718D5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three cobblestone around a dirt block make the \"},{\"text\":\"Stone Anvil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:stone_anvil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Set a log on it, then use a knife on the log: six \"},{\"text\":\"Template Boards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:template_board\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The first knife is a \"},{\"text\":\"Crude Knife\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:crude_knife\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": cobblestone on \"},{\"text\":\"Crude Tool Parts\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:crude_tool_parts\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (cobblestone, dirt and a stick).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3574048549EEC217.title": "Templates",
  "quest.3574048549EEC217.quest_subtitle": "Single use, like a paper plate.",
  "quest.3574048549EEC217.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Template Boards in a tool's shape, around sticks, make its \"},{\"text\":\"Template\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:pickaxe_template\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": there is one for every gear type.\"}]",
    "",
    "Crafting spends it, and its tooltip says how many main materials the part takes: three for a pickaxe."
  ],
  "quest.5B513654FB93EAAA.title": "A pickaxe of your own",
  "quest.5B513654FB93EAAA.quest_subtitle": "Every part has a say.",
  "quest.5B513654FB93EAAA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The template and three of one material make a \"},{\"text\":\"Pickaxe Head\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:pickaxe_head\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; the head and a rod make the \"},{\"text\":\"Pickaxe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:pickaxe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "The quick recipe does both at once: template, materials and rod in one grid.",
    "",
    "Stone, flint, bone blocks, copper or iron: each material brings its own stats and traits."
  ],
  "quest.6964FE44D886F549.title": "Blueprints",
  "quest.6964FE44D886F549.quest_subtitle": "Measure twice, craft forever.",
  "quest.6964FE44D886F549.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four paper and a blue dye make four \"},{\"text\":\"Blueprint Paper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:blueprint_paper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Laid out like the template, it becomes a \"},{\"text\":\"Blueprint\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:pickaxe_blueprint\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": same job, but it comes back from every craft.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nobody gets the starter package here: every blueprint is crafted."
  ],
  "quest.767797906C0DD96F.title": "Broken, not gone",
  "quest.767797906C0DD96F.quest_subtitle": "Silent Gear doesn't do funerals.",
  "quest.767797906C0DD96F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Gear never vanishes here: at its last point of durability it breaks and waits.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:crude_repair_kit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Craft a \"},{\"text\":\"Crude Repair Kit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:crude_repair_kit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with materials to fill it, then with the gear to fix it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"The kit spends only what the repair needs.\"}]",
    "",
    "A stick empties it."
  ],
  "quest.30DF358C5B7F5045.title": "Crimson Iron",
  "quest.30DF358C5B7F5045.quest_subtitle": "The Nether's own iron, redder and meaner.",
  "quest.30DF358C5B7F5045.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Crimson Iron Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:crimson_iron_ore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs all through the Nether, in netherrack and blackstone: fourteen veins a chunk.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Smelt the \"},{\"text\":\"raw ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:raw_crimson_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Armour of crimson iron takes less fire damage (Heat Resistant IV), and the ingot is the base of crimson steel."
  ],
  "quest.43D69EA32C741FCF.title": "Crimson Steel",
  "quest.43D69EA32C741FCF.quest_subtitle": "Blaze rods: not just for brewing.",
  "quest.43D69EA32C741FCF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four crimson iron, two blaze rods and a magma cream make one \"},{\"text\":\"Crimson Steel Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:crimson_steel_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at the table.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"As a head it lasts (\"},{\"text\":\"2,400\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" durability), and Flame Ward gives a full set fire resistance.\"}]",
    "",
    "Four ingots build the next machine."
  ],
  "quest.6C794340168FB182.title": "Alloy Forge",
  "quest.6C794340168FB182.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four crimson steel, three blackstone and an iron block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Alloy Forge\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:alloy_forge\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes Silent Gear's alloys for less (three crimson steel from a block of crimson iron and the same rods and cream) and is the only way to tyrian steel.\"}]",
    "",
    "Two or more different metals in it make a custom alloy."
  ],
  "quest.59F528ABB469CCA8.title": "Blaze Gold",
  "quest.59F528ABB469CCA8.quest_subtitle": "Piglins approve.",
  "quest.59F528ABB469CCA8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Gold and four blaze powder make a \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Gold Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:blaze_gold_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at the table; the forge takes two.\"}]",
    "",
    "The grader wants three, and a block of nine lights the Starlight Charger.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"As a tip it adds Fiery.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"As a head it's fragile (\"},{\"text\":\"69\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" durability), but Greedy speeds up ores.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.556CC166B490647F.title": "Material Grader",
  "quest.556CC166B490647F.quest_subtitle": "Report cards for metal.",
  "quest.556CC166B490647F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two quartz, three iron, three blaze gold and an Advanced Upgrade Base.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Feed it a stack of one material and a catalyst: every \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" seconds it spends one and rolls a grade from E to MAX, worth up to \"},{\"text\":\"30%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" more stats.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Glowing Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:glowing_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", glowstone and quartz on a stick, is tier \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5A3D56A181853420.title": "Starlight Charger",
  "quest.5A3D56A181853420.quest_subtitle": "A solar panel for the night shift.",
  "quest.5A3D56A181853420.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Quartz blocks, glass, polished blackstone and a block of blaze gold.\"}]",
    "",
    "Under open sky it banks starlight at night, and a catalyst spends it to make a material Starcharged:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"More durability\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Damage\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Speed\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Armour\"}]",
    "",
    "Pillars around it set how high it can go."
  ],
  "quest.7E79885936AA42A9.title": "Starmetal Dust",
  "quest.7E79885936AA42A9.quest_subtitle": "A pinch of Wither in every spoonful.",
  "quest.7E79885936AA42A9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The charger's tier \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" catalyst, after blaze gold dust (\"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\") and azure silver dust (\"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\").\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:nether_star_fragment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Azure electrum dust, two azure silver dust, blaze gold dust and a \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Star Fragment\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:nether_star_fragment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make three \"},{\"text\":\"Starmetal Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:starmetal_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"A Nether Star splits into nine fragments.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.39AB035699B560CB.title": "Azure Silver",
  "quest.39AB035699B560CB.quest_subtitle": "Moon boots, straight from the End.",
  "quest.39AB035699B560CB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Azure Silver Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:azure_silver_ore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sits in End stone between Y \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"92\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\", eight veins a chunk.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Smelt the \"},{\"text\":\"raw ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:raw_azure_silver\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It's a fast material (\"},{\"text\":\"19\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" harvest speed) with Moonwalker IV: on boots or a curio it cuts your gravity by \"},{\"text\":\"60%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0020DA096E6C1071.title": "Azure Electrum",
  "quest.0020DA096E6C1071.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Silver and gold, with an ender pearl to speed them up.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:azure_electrum_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Four azure silver, two gold and an ender pearl make one \"},{\"text\":\"Azure Electrum Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:azure_electrum_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at the table.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"The forge makes three from a block of azure silver.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It's the fastest material before act VI (\"},{\"text\":\"29\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" harvest speed) and Light IV on armour, at \"},{\"text\":\"1,259\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" durability.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3500CEBE4118053F.title": "Crushed Shulker Shell",
  "quest.3500CEBE4118053F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A shell, a hammer and an anvil.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Set a \"},{\"text\":\"Shulker Shell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:shulker_shell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the Stone Anvil and use a hammer on it: one \"},{\"text\":\"Crushed Shulker Shell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:crushed_shulker_shell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", for \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" points of the hammer's durability.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tyrian steel needs one per batch. Mixed into an alloy it brings \"},{\"text\":\"2,500\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" durability and Eroded: faster as it wears.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.299CDAF6D9630ABE.title": "Tyrian Steel",
  "quest.299CDAF6D9630ABE.quest_subtitle": "Crimson plus azure, and it comes out purple.",
  "quest.299CDAF6D9630ABE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The best basic material there is.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Only the Alloy Forge makes it: crimson steel, azure electrum, a crushed shulker shell and netherite scrap give four \"},{\"text\":\"Tyrian Steel Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:tyrian_steel_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"3,652\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" durability and Sturdy III\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"On armour, Void Ward throws you back up when you fall out of the world\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.33FB6C82F4B44584.title": "Almost Unbreakable",
  "quest.33FB6C82F4B44584.quest_subtitle": "Sixteen thousand swings, give or take.",
  "quest.33FB6C82F4B44584.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Craft a tool with \"},{\"text\":\"16,000\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" durability or more.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Start from tyrian steel (\"},{\"text\":\"3,652\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"): hammer, excavator, saw and mace heads double it, \"},{\"text\":\"Starcharged III\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5A3D56A181853420\"}},{\"text\":\" on tyrian roughly doubles it again, and graded ingots plus a good tip cover the rest.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The check runs when the tool is crafted: grade and charge the ingots first, then make the head.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.73608C90D2820272.title": "Crude Hammer",
  "quest.73608C90D2820272.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two cobblestone on Crude Tool Parts.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On the Stone Anvil a hammer crushes: cobblestone into nine \"},{\"text\":\"Pebbles\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:pebble\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", Silent Gear ingots into dust, a shulker shell into its crushed form.\"}]",
    "",
    "Any Silent Gear hammer works, even the prospector's."
  ],
  "quest.7BF828D333F31D0E.title": "Tool Rods",
  "quest.7BF828D333F31D0E.quest_subtitle": "A stick with ambitions.",
  "quest.7BF828D333F31D0E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sticks and bones already work as rods.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"The rod blueprint and two of a material make four \"},{\"text\":\"Tool Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Iron, blaze, breeze and end rods go in as they are.\"}]",
    "",
    "A rod adds its own traits: blaze gives Reach, an end rod Refractive, a breeze rod Wind Blast."
  ],
  "quest.6FD4D674EF9F6DB8.title": "Bindings",
  "quest.6FD4D674EF9F6DB8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The knot that keeps the head on the rod.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The binding blueprint (blueprint paper and two strings) and one fiber make a \"},{\"text\":\"Binding\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:binding\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; crafted with a tool, it ties the head on.\"}]",
    "",
    "String, flax, fluffy string, sinew, fine silk or vines: most add Flexible, which spares durability now and then."
  ],
  "quest.2DCEB7C96285E591.title": "Blueprint Book",
  "quest.2DCEB7C96285E591.quest_subtitle": "Filing cabinet for the drawing office.",
  "quest.2DCEB7C96285E591.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A book, wool, a gold ingot and three Template Boards.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Blueprint Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:blueprint_book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds up to \"},{\"text\":\"54\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" blueprints (not templates) and acts as the selected one in any recipe.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Use it to open it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"With it under the cursor, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.silentgear.cycle.next\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.silentgear.cycle.back\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" change the selection.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.76E7675B5338136B.title": "Grips",
  "quest.76E7675B5338136B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Something soft for the hand to hold.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two blueprint paper and wool make the grip blueprint; with one cloth (leather, wool, fine silk cloth or phantom membrane) it makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Grip\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:grip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the handle.\"}]",
    "",
    "Fine silk cloth gives Accelerate, phantom membrane Ancient (more XP), leather Flexible III."
  ],
  "quest.3523D49BD645B8F4.title": "Tip Upgrades",
  "quest.3523D49BD645B8F4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The tip blueprint (two blueprint paper, paper and stone) and one material make a \"},{\"text\":\"Tip Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:tip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Craft it with a tool or weapon and it fits on.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"A tip already there comes back.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron adds \"},{\"text\":\"128\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" durability, emerald \"},{\"text\":\"512\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.74D9504BBCAF7493.title": "Pick the point",
  "quest.74D9504BBCAF7493.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The best harvest tier among the parts wins: a diamond tip lets a flint pickaxe mine obsidian. Amethyst tips add Silk Touch, azure silver Fortune III, crimson steel auto-smelting and lapis Lucky IV.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6BDC2490EB1BE98C.title": "Upgrade Base",
  "quest.6BDC2490EB1BE98C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two paper, planks and stone make four \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade Bases\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:upgrade_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"One with red dye makes four \"},{\"text\":\"Red Cards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:red_card_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": gear with a Red Card breaks for good at zero, like vanilla, instead of waiting for a repair kit.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.61F0DF9FEE97B070.title": "Advanced upgrades",
  "quest.61F0DF9FEE97B070.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three diamond shards, two blue dye, three gold nuggets and an Upgrade Base make the \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Upgrade Base\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:advanced_upgrade_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:spoon_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A diamond shovel on it makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Spoon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:spoon_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (a pickaxe that digs dirt).\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:wide_plate_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Crimson iron and steel, the \"},{\"text\":\"Wide Plate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:wide_plate_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (+\"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" radius on hammers and excavators).\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:road_maker_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"An iron shovel and orange dye make the \"},{\"text\":\"Road Maker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:road_maker_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": excavators lay paths in \"},{\"text\":\"3x3\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:magnetic_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A breeze rod, crimson steel and iron make the \"},{\"text\":\"Magnetic Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:magnetic_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which pulls in nearby items.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Fit them in the grid or at a Smithing Table.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.611E446B17107852.title": "Gear Mod Kit",
  "quest.611E446B17107852.quest_subtitle": "An undo button with a handle.",
  "quest.611E446B17107852.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four Template Boards, an iron ingot and a stick.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pick a part type with \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.silentgear.cycle.next\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" over the \"},{\"text\":\"Gear Mod Kit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:mod_kit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", then craft it with gear: that part comes off and back to you.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Tips, bindings, grips, coatings, linings, settings and upgrades come off.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"The kit stays.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.30BDA35854DE34E2.title": "Paint",
  "quest.30BDA35854DE34E2.quest_subtitle": "Fashion over function, finally.",
  "quest.30BDA35854DE34E2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Dye your gear or mix your own paint.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Dyes crafted with gear repaint its coating, or the head if it has none.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"With the Mod Kit in the grid, the chosen part instead.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Paint Mixer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:paint_mixer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" blends up to eight dyes and slimeballs into \"},{\"text\":\"Paint\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:paint\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": one per input, all one mixed colour.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.054210025010EBCC.title": "Salvager",
  "quest.054210025010EBCC.quest_subtitle": "Scrap, with dignity.",
  "quest.054210025010EBCC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A piston, four crimson iron, an iron block and obsidian.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" seconds the \"},{\"text\":\"Salvager\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:salvager\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes one item apart: Silent Gear gear into its parts, parts into materials, vanilla tools and armour into ingots and gems (an iron pickaxe gives three iron and two sticks).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1290B8926952BBDA.title": "Salvage it fresh",
  "quest.1290B8926952BBDA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Salvager loses parts to wear: nothing from an item at full durability, up to half from one about to break. Take gear apart before you wear it down, and repair broken gear before you scrap it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.752465A9CBE10724.title": "Better repair kits",
  "quest.752465A9CBE10724.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Kits hold more and waste less as they climb.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Very crude: \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" materials at \"},{\"text\":\"30%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Crude: \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" at \"},{\"text\":\"35%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:sturdy_repair_kit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Sturdy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:sturdy_repair_kit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" at \"},{\"text\":\"40%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" (iron and a diamond)\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:crimson_repair_kit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Crimson\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:crimson_repair_kit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"48\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" at \"},{\"text\":\"45%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:azure_repair_kit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Azure\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:azure_repair_kit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" at \"},{\"text\":\"50%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"}]",
    "",
    "Efficiency is the share of each material's value that returns as durability."
  ],
  "quest.26AFF89609BB2D69.title": "Repair with the head",
  "quest.26AFF89609BB2D69.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Only the head's first material repairs a tool: a kit full of iron won't touch a diamond pickaxe. An anvil also repairs Silent Gear with its material, at half the value.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4415040BB26C2147.title": "Coating Smithing Template",
  "quest.4415040BB26C2147.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A netherite upgrade template, blueprint paper and bort; seven diamonds and netherrack turn one into two.\"}]",
    "",
    "At a Smithing Table: template, Silent Gear gear and a coating material.",
    "",
    "Netherite is only a coating here: on diamond gear it plays like vanilla netherite, fireproof."
  ],
  "quest.3F78E7ADC0EC3C22.title": "Coatings",
  "quest.3F78E7ADC0EC3C22.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A coat you swap when it wears out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Four blueprint paper, a diamond and an emerald make the coating blueprint.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"With a glass bottle and a material it makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Coating\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:coating\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", fitted in the grid in place of the old one.\"}]",
    "",
    "Gold on armour adds Brilliant: piglins stay calm, as with gold armour."
  ],
  "quest.59B8C8FBAA9C99F9.title": "Coat it when it's worn",
  "quest.59B8C8FBAA9C99F9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A coating applied at the Smithing Table comes out fully repaired, so coat a tool when it's worn. Upgrades fit there too, with a stick as the template. Silent Gear's own \"},{\"text\":\"Gear Smithing Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:gear_smithing_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has no recipe or use yet: the vanilla table does the job.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3DD29656FE7C8536.title": "Flax",
  "quest.3DD29656FE7C8536.quest_subtitle": "Spinning wheel not included.",
  "quest.3DD29656FE7C8536.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wild flax grows in patches across the Overworld and drops seeds.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Planted, it gives Flax Fiber, seeds and Flax Flowers: two fibers make a \"},{\"text\":\"Flax String\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:flax_string\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (bindings, cords, the Crude Mixer) and four flowers a blue dye for blueprint paper.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.524A4FC1D75A6847.title": "Fluffy plants",
  "quest.524A4FC1D75A6847.quest_subtitle": "Cotton candy you can't eat.",
  "quest.524A4FC1D75A6847.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wild fluffy plants drop seeds; the crop gives \"},{\"text\":\"Fluffy Puffs\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:fluffy_puff\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three make Fluffy String, five a feather, four Fluffy Fabric, and four fabric a Fluffy Block: each one in a stack takes \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" blocks off a fall, and it bounces.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.373BAB7C577C519F.title": "Sinew",
  "quest.373BAB7C577C519F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cows, pigs and sheep killed by a player drop \"},{\"text\":\"Sinew\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:sinew\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one time in five.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Smelt it into Dried Sinew and craft that into three \"},{\"text\":\"Sinew Fiber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:sinew_fiber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a strong binding (Flexible IV) and a cord for bows.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5518BD8C4FD11AD0.title": "Silk and scraps",
  "quest.5518BD8C4FD11AD0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Spiders rarely drop \"},{\"text\":\"Fine Silk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:fine_silk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", cave spiders twice as often: a binding with Lucky, and four make Fine Silk Cloth.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:leather_scrap\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Zombies and husks sometimes drop \"},{\"text\":\"Leather Scraps\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:leather_scrap\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and zombie villagers always do.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Nine make a leather.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.79479D32EBE80ACD.title": "Bort",
  "quest.79479D32EBE80ACD.quest_subtitle": "Diamond's scrappy cousin.",
  "quest.79479D32EBE80ACD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Bort Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:bort_ore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hides deep in the Overworld, from Y \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" down to -\"},{\"text\":\"60\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\", in small, frequent veins.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Bort\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:bort\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" seals the Coating Smithing Template, sets jewelry and builds the Refabricator.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.038CB3615E470F42.title": "Netherwood",
  "quest.038CB3615E470F42.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Nether ruins hide the saplings, and the saplings hide the bananas.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Nether fortresses, bastions and ruined portals can hide \"},{\"text\":\"Netherwood Saplings\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:netherwood_sapling\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Bananas\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:nether_banana\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The sapling grows on netherrack or dirt, and its leaves drop saplings, sticks and bananas. A banana goes into Glittery Dust, the best grading catalyst."
  ],
  "quest.0E364ED62BB2A9DA.title": "Jeweler Tools",
  "quest.0E364ED62BB2A9DA.quest_subtitle": "Tiny hammer, tiny anvil.",
  "quest.0E364ED62BB2A9DA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two planks, a diamond, blueprint paper, two sticks and iron.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Jeweler Tools\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:jeweler_tools\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" work like a blueprint that never runs out: they finish a ring shank, bracelet band or necklace chain into jewelry and set gems.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.433F1E2EF5DA5CBC.title": "Jewelry Settings",
  "quest.433F1E2EF5DA5CBC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A gem's trait, set in jewelry.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Jeweler Tools, a bort and a gem make a \"},{\"text\":\"Jewelry Setting\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:setting\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with the gem's trait:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Diamond: Bastion (armour)\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Emerald: Reach II\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Lapis: Lucky III\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Quartz: Mighty II\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Prismarine: Swift Swim III\"}]",
    "",
    "Amethyst gives Cursed IV: skip it unless you like bad luck."
  ],
  "quest.25F86B6D6D4A02EA.title": "Rings",
  "quest.25F86B6D6D4A02EA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A plain metal band first, the finished ring after.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"A ring blueprint (blueprint paper and gold, or any metal) and two of one metal make a \"},{\"text\":\"Ring Shank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:ring_shank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"The Jeweler Tools make it a \"},{\"text\":\"Ring\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:ring\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", with a setting if you add one.\"}]",
    "",
    "It goes in the ring slot with its metal's traits: azure silver brings Moonwalker."
  ],
  "quest.6E916B4535D4BAB2.title": "Bracelets and necklaces",
  "quest.6E916B4535D4BAB2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"More slots, more traits.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three of one metal make a \"},{\"text\":\"Bracelet Band\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:bracelet_band\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or a \"},{\"text\":\"Necklace Chain\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:necklace_chain\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", finished like a ring with the Jeweler Tools and an optional setting.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Silent Gear adds the bracelet slot.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Necklace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:necklace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes the necklace slot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3E8C6596D76CCEA3.title": "Material Book",
  "quest.3E8C6596D76CCEA3.quest_subtitle": "The closest thing to a manual.",
  "quest.3E8C6596D76CCEA3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A book and blueprint paper; the pack gives none at spawn.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Material Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:material_book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" lists every material, by name or sorted by any stat, with what it gives each part: head, rod, tip, coating.\"}]",
    "",
    "Read it before you pour a stack of diamonds into a sword."
  ],
  "quest.7063F12CA20D417B.title": "Read the tooltip",
  "quest.7063F12CA20D417B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Over a material or a piece of gear, hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.silentgear.displayItemProperties\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" for stats and traits, add \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.silentgear.displayTraitDescriptions\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" for what each trait does, and hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.silentgear.displayItemConstruction\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" for a tool's parts and materials.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.37B2F02FEFEAD4DB.title": "Crude Mixer",
  "quest.37B2F02FEFEAD4DB.quest_subtitle": "Mixing bowl rules: no refunds.",
  "quest.37B2F02FEFEAD4DB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Five stone, a flax string and planks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"The grid takes one material per part.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Crude Mixer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:crude_mixer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fuses up to four different ones into a Crude Alloy that blends their stats and traits, at \"},{\"text\":\"20%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" less.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"One item comes out per item in, every \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1298ADE232DF9C6D.title": "Synergy",
  "quest.1298ADE232DF9C6D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Alloys show a Synergy percentage. Two or three different materials that share a category, two metals or two gems, can push it past \"},{\"text\":\"100%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"; materials with no category in common lose \"},{\"text\":\"20%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\". Mixing drops grades and charges, so grade the alloy afterwards.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6A22B2E1977493C6.title": "Refabricator",
  "quest.6A22B2E1977493C6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two iron, two diamonds, a bort, an iron block and planks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Refabricator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:refabricator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fuses cloths, or fibers, into Mixed Fabric, up to six at once: linings, grips or bindings that carry several traits.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3D63E5D1BD153C3F.title": "Recrystallizer",
  "quest.3D63E5D1BD153C3F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four azure electrum, a diamond, an emerald, two purpur and a gold block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Recrystallizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:recrystallizer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fuses gems and gem dusts into Hybrid Gems, up to six, and a diamond with an emerald into Dimerald: \"},{\"text\":\"1,776\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" durability, and Kitty Vision as a jewelry setting.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.7FBDA6DCFF6EC82B.title": "Any Silent Gear armour piece",
  "quest.67B078299DE88913.title": "Armour",
  "quest.67B078299DE88913.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Armour is built plate by plate.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Helmet plates take five of a material, chestplate plates eight, leggings seven and boots four.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"The plates alone are the armour.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The material sets the stats: tyrian steel gives a full set \"},{\"text\":\"25\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" armour, crimson steel \"},{\"text\":\"22\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" and Flame Ward.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5B5C817F70E95ED8.title": "Linings",
  "quest.5B5C817F70E95ED8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The lining blueprint (three blueprint paper, two wool, two strings) and one cloth make a \"},{\"text\":\"Lining\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:lining\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for armour.\"}]",
    "",
    "Leather and fine silk cloth add Flexible IV, phantom membrane Light (you move faster), and a slime block Bounce, which softens falls."
  ],
  "quest.685B2A281F930398.title": "Elytra",
  "quest.685B2A281F930398.quest_subtitle": "Wings by the yard.",
  "quest.685B2A281F930398.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Six of a cloth or sheet material make \"},{\"text\":\"Elytra Wings\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:elytra_wings\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; add a binding for the \"},{\"text\":\"Elytra\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:elytra\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Phantom membrane works, and so does Sheet Metal from the Metal Press.",
    "",
    "The pack has no Caelus, so they go in the chestplate slot."
  ],
  "quest.2E3AA7C8A4C90D27.title": "Old tools, new tricks",
  "quest.2E3AA7C8A4C90D27.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A vanilla tool or armour piece alone in the crafting grid becomes its Silent Gear twin, wood to netherite: the same materials, now with parts, traits and repair kits.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5C0D46C1347E8250.title": "Sword, katana, machete",
  "quest.5C0D46C1347E8250.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One blade, three ways to swing it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Two of a material make a \"},{\"text\":\"Sword\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:sword\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" blade.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Three make a \"},{\"text\":\"Katana\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:katana\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", heavier and harder-hitting, or a \"},{\"text\":\"Machete\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:machete\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a sword that also chops and clears plants like a small sickle.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.44AE49E3AD917592.title": "Dagger, spear, mace, trident",
  "quest.44AE49E3AD917592.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Dagger\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:dagger\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hits fast and cuts the target's invulnerability time; the \"},{\"text\":\"Spear\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:spear\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reaches a block further.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Mace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:mace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" needs a Heavy Core, like vanilla's, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Trident\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:trident\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" throws. All take a rod, like any tool.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2735017C4E57C169.title": "Shield, rod and shears",
  "quest.2735017C4E57C169.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The vanilla staples, built from your own parts.\"}]",
    "",
    "Two of a material make:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"a \"},{\"text\":\"Shield\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:shield\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" plate\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"a \"},{\"text\":\"Fishing Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:fishing_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reel (plus a cord)\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Shears\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:shears\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" blades\"}]",
    "",
    "They work like their vanilla versions, with Silent Gear's materials, traits and repairs."
  ],
  "quest.2A6685D98DA1FA5D.title": "Big job tools",
  "quest.2A6685D98DA1FA5D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Bigger heads, bigger bites, slower swings.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Hammer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:hammer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": six materials, \"},{\"text\":\"3x3\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" of stone\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Excavator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:excavator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": five, \"},{\"text\":\"3x3\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" of soil\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Saw\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:saw\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": five, fells a whole tree from one log\"}]",
    "",
    "Their heads have double durability, but mine slower."
  ],
  "quest.58C1612E3BBE26A9.title": "Mattock, sickle, paxel",
  "quest.58C1612E3BBE26A9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Mattock\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:mattock\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" tills, digs and chops, a bit slower but tougher.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Sickle\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:sickle\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" clears plants around the one you break and, used on crops, harvests and replants them, spending the seeds.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Paxel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:paxel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is pickaxe, axe and shovel in one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.285CDC5F5363DDB8.title": "Prospector Hammer",
  "quest.285CDC5F5363DDB8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Aim it at a wall and it names the ore behind it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Use the \"},{\"text\":\"Prospector Hammer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:prospector_hammer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a block and it searches up to \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" blocks in that direction for ores and ancient debris, then tells you what it found.\"}]",
    "",
    "It mines like a pickaxe and counts as a hammer on the Stone Anvil."
  ],
  "quest.46AE4C7E1B95DBCC.title": "Ores stay single",
  "quest.46AE4C7E1B95DBCC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A hammer breaks ores in its \"},{\"text\":\"3x3\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" only when you aim at an ore, so it won't swallow the diamonds beside the stone you're clearing. The Wide Plate upgrade makes the square \"},{\"text\":\"5x5\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3F32FA7092CA07E4.title": "Bows and crossbows",
  "quest.3F32FA7092CA07E4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Limbs, a rod and a string make the bow.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Three of a material make \"},{\"text\":\"Bow Limbs\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:bow_limbs\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or \"},{\"text\":\"Crossbow Limbs\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:crossbow_limbs\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Add a rod and a \"},{\"text\":\"Cord\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:cord\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (three fibers on the cord blueprint).\"}]",
    "",
    "The limbs set damage and draw speed, and a sinew or silk cord adds Flexible."
  ],
  "quest.12D4563C7DD77BE8.title": "Arrows",
  "quest.12D4563C7DD77BE8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Craft arrows by the stack, from any material.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"One material on the arrow blueprint makes \"},{\"text\":\"Arrow Heads\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:arrow_heads\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"With a rod and a \"},{\"text\":\"Fletching\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:fletching\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (feather, paper or leaves) they make a stack of \"},{\"text\":\"Arrows\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:arrow\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tougher heads give bigger stacks, up to \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\", and the head's ranged damage is the arrow's.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.10F4F16B4AF01926.title": "Slingshot",
  "quest.10F4F16B4AF01926.quest_subtitle": "Small rocks, big attitude.",
  "quest.10F4F16B4AF01926.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two of a material make \"},{\"text\":\"Slingshot Limbs\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:slingshot_limbs\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; add a rod and a cord.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Slingshot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:slingshot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" draws fast, hits soft and fires \"},{\"text\":\"Pebbles\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:pebble\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a hammer on the Stone Anvil turns a cobblestone into nine.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.473C098279FF6EA1.title": "Better catalysts",
  "quest.473C098279FF6EA1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blazing Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:blazing_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", blaze gold dust and two glowstone, four at a time, is tier \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Glittery Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:glittery_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", popped chorus fruit, emerald shards, glowstone and a Nether Banana, eight at a time, is tier \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "A higher tier shifts every roll upwards."
  ],
  "quest.56C2DFC1846F5053.title": "Grading odds",
  "quest.56C2DFC1846F5053.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tier \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" rolls around C, tier \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" around B, tier \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" around A. A roll only counts if it beats the grade already there, but the catalyst is spent anyway. Bonuses: E to A +\"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" to +\"},{\"text\":\"5%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\", S +\"},{\"text\":\"10%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\", SS +\"},{\"text\":\"15%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\", SSS +\"},{\"text\":\"25%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\", MAX +\"},{\"text\":\"30%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.76ACBC47F7D467FB.title": "Pillars for the charger",
  "quest.76ACBC47F7D467FB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four corners set the charger's level, three blocks out on both axes: the block two above its own height must be crimson steel (I), azure electrum (II) or tyrian steel (III). The weakest corner counts; a catalyst above that level does nothing.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At level III each tyrian ingot drains \"},{\"text\":\"300,000\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" of the \"},{\"text\":\"1,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" the charger can bank, and it banks \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" per tick at night.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It rechecks the pillars every \"},{\"text\":\"15\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.61A6D2DE5142F53B.title": "Refined Obsidian",
  "quest.61A6D2DE5142F53B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Mekanism's \"},{\"text\":\"Refined Obsidian Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ingot_refined_obsidian\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is a Silent Gear material too, and the best armour before act VI: \"},{\"text\":\"30\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" for a full set.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"On tools it gives \"},{\"text\":\"2,500\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" durability, \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" attack damage and Hard IV.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"As a tip, \"},{\"text\":\"600\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" durability and Vulcan.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3946F41738A526C5.title": "The luminous material",
  "quest.3946F41738A526C5.quest_subtitle": "Act VI, and it shows.",
  "quest.3946F41738A526C5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The best Silent Gear material, by far.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Luminous Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:luminous_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" of act VI brings:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"32,768\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" durability\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Radiant: light repairs it, and four radiant pieces give the \"},{\"text\":\"luminous set\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0882BD4FA4DB1326\"}},{\"text\":\"'s flight\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\"Holy V and Lustrous V\"}]",
    "",
    "Salvaging never returns Luminosities."
  ],
  "quest.77DD5143D1867A4F.title": "Super Mixer",
  "quest.77DD5143D1867A4F.quest_subtitle": "Everything in, nothing lost.",
  "quest.77DD5143D1867A4F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Five blocks of tyrian steel, a Dimerald and a beacon.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Super Mixer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:super_mixer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fuses up to eight of any materials into a Super Alloy: the Crude Mixer's job, without the \"},{\"text\":\"20%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" penalty.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.602E71513A57536D.title": "Metal Press",
  "quest.602E71513A57536D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four obsidian, two tyrian steel and two iron rods.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Metal Press\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:metal_press\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" flattens a metal ingot into two \"},{\"text\":\"Sheet Metal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"silentgear:sheet_metal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": no durability for tool heads and half the armour, but Elytra Wings take it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7EFC83EBCFF24BF7.title": "Ka-chink",
  "quest.7EFC83EBCFF24BF7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Brittle item just lost an extra point of durability.\"}]",
    "",
    "Diamond heads, basalt and flint rods, among others, carry Brittle: the price of a keen edge."
  ],
  "reward.31E89E0F27C1E997.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.3B80F4A618C5D620.title": "We can rebuild it",
  "quest.3B80F4A618C5D620.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You broke a tool and brought it back with a repair kit.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nothing lost but time and a little of the head's material."
  ],
  "reward.0B85716952E46B2A.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.5CAD5240F7903E39.title": "One small step",
  "quest.5CAD5240F7903E39.quest_subtitle": "One small step for a miner.",
  "quest.5CAD5240F7903E39.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You fell with Moonwalker boots on.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each level of the trait takes \"},{\"text\":\"15%\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"},{\"text\":\" off your gravity, and azure silver brings four.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.6BAFEA4B4CDF97C8.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.12A5D396A760D7C7.title": "Crimson iron for the common store",
  "quest.12A5D396A760D7C7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sixteen crimson iron ingots for the common store: repair kits, salvagers and the next forge all start here.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1418EB9D2E9A4B32.title": "Switch on the lamp",
  "quest.1418EB9D2E9A4B32.quest_subtitle": "Drafting after dark.",
  "quest.1418EB9D2E9A4B32.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Nobody draws a good line in the dark.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: just light on the sheet."
  ],
  "quest.4AC4757309728B6C.title": "Stamp the sheet",
  "quest.4AC4757309728B6C.quest_subtitle": "Thump.",
  "quest.4AC4757309728B6C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A finished drawing gets its stamp.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nothing to craft. Just ink."
  ],
  "image.4E3DE83BC6406862.title": "The head: stone, for now",
  "image.07584440C93D4DDD.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Blueprints and upgrades\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.31363354304F8731.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Repair and salvage\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.6E2498F9F8951A1F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The smithing table\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.1331ED73D1858776.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"What the world gives\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.4AB122D7C1708B30.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Jewelry\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.64E2F8651B51DB48.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Grading and charging\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.2E62319A1DE3B8C2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Materials and traits\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.1FA0476A50145115.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Late materials\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.6D21A856DC0F5E44.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Armour\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.6759F7E3B5C2EC0B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Blades\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.6B834865BF7C7E9C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Big tools\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.1EA08C0202907F95.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Bows\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.54F73055C8D1F285.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Material samples\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.37D63286D425185B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"SILENT GEAR\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.0C0459564B1C49FE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"blueprint · part · material · masterwork\",\"color\":\"#F5A9DE\"}]",
  "image.23047D137C6B83B7.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.1FCD589CC65FB850.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"crimson · Nether\",\"color\":\"#FF8FA0\"}]",
  "image.36DFC3AA28584B98.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"azure · End\",\"color\":\"#8FCBFF\"}]",
  "image.707E47CB559C48AF.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"APPROVED\",\"color\":\"#E0454F\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "chapter.58E7DAF254E21B83.title": "Storage and Backpacks",
  "chapter.58E7DAF254E21B83.chapter_subtitle": [
    "What travels with you, what stays home and what goes in the bin."
  ],
  "quest.5B974C49A559E883.title": "Carry more",
  "quest.5B974C49A559E883.quest_subtitle": "Pockets were never enough.",
  "quest.5B974C49A559E883.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A chest you can wear.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four leather, four string and a wooden chest make a \"},{\"text\":\"Backpack\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:backpack\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"27\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" slots and one upgrade slot.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Wear it or keep it in your inventory.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sophisticatedbackpacks.open_backpack\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens it anywhere.\"}]",
    "",
    "Sneak-right-click a block to set it down, and sneak-right-click it with an empty hand to pick it up."
  ],
  "quest.34135DB9A14BC9BD.title": "The back slot",
  "quest.34135DB9A14BC9BD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A backpack fits the back slot, so the chestplate stays on. Worn and visible, another player can open it by right-clicking your back; the backpack's settings tab turns that off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6E332DA664D660DC.title": "A place for everything",
  "quest.6E332DA664D660DC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The sort button orders by name, mod, count or tags. In the settings tab, Memory keeps a slot for its item even when empty, No Sort shields slots from sorting and Item Display shows one item on the outside.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.666D61844B0BC97D.title": "Switch it off",
  "quest.666D61844B0BC97D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sophisticatedbackpacks.toggle_upgrade_1\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sophisticatedbackpacks.toggle_upgrade_2\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" switch the upgrades in the first two slots on and off without opening the backpack. A magnet you can mute is a magnet you keep.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0E7256B27FCD77F4.title": "Loot with legs",
  "quest.0E7256B27FCD77F4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"About one in a hundred zombies, skeletons, piglins or drowned spawns with a backpack full of loot, and better armor to match. Kill it and half the time the backpack drops; each level of Looting adds \"},{\"text\":\"15%\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.73BA0DCCF7B349DD.title": "Room for tricks",
  "quest.73BA0DCCF7B349DD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The backpack learns tricks one slot at a time.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four string, four iron ingots and a leather make an \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade Base\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:upgrade_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the blank every backpack upgrade starts from.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Upgrades sit in the column beside the slots.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"A basic backpack has room for one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1C61CB75574EDC3D.title": "Into the void",
  "quest.1C61CB75574EDC3D.quest_subtitle": "Gravel, begone.",
  "quest.1C61CB75574EDC3D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Whatever the filter names never fills the bag.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An ender pearl, three obsidian and two redstone on a base make a \"},{\"text\":\"Void Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:void_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It deletes what its filter names: always, or only what overflows a full slot or the whole backpack."
  ],
  "quest.4B51D4F7EE8FA710.title": "Door policy",
  "quest.4B51D4F7EE8FA710.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hoppers and pipes only get what you allow.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four redstone and four string on a base: a \"},{\"text\":\"Filter Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:filter_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"A backpack set down as a block is a chest that hoppers and pipes can reach.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"The filter decides what they may put in or take out.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.298F56701060EA3B.title": "Nothing left on the floor",
  "quest.298F56701060EA3B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The floor cleans itself as you walk.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A sticky piston, two string and three redstone on a base: a \"},{\"text\":\"Pickup Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:pickup_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "What you walk over goes straight into the backpack instead of your hotbar, and its filter says what is welcome."
  ],
  "quest.689D3B50F22D0F95.title": "Magnetic personality",
  "quest.689D3B50F22D0F95.quest_subtitle": "Now the loot comes to you.",
  "quest.689D3B50F22D0F95.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Stop bending over: items fly into the backpack on their own.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two ender pearls, three iron, a redstone and a lapis around a \"},{\"text\":\"Pickup Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:pickup_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Magnet Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:magnet_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it pulls items from \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks away, \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" when advanced.\"}]",
    "",
    "Set down, the backpack pulls around itself.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With a \"},{\"text\":\"Tank Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:tank_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the backpack, the magnet also collects experience.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.736353EECCF1E398.title": "Advanced versions",
  "quest.736353EECCF1E398.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Most upgrades have an advanced version: one diamond, two gold and three redstone around the basic one. It brings \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" filter slots instead of \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\", and filters that match by mod or by tag.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6E943037AEF674D2.title": "Crunch time",
  "quest.6E943037AEF674D2.quest_subtitle": "Nine nuggets walk into a backpack...",
  "quest.6E943037AEF674D2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The backpack does the crafting-table math for you.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two iron, four pistons and two redstone on a base: a \"},{\"text\":\"Compacting Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:compacting_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It packs items that have \"},{\"text\":\"2×2\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" recipes, like clay balls into clay.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Compacting Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:advanced_compacting_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds \"},{\"text\":\"3×3\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\": nuggets to ingots, ingots to blocks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5044BB1E74772210.title": "A chest that grows",
  "quest.5044BB1E74772210.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The chest you know, with slots to spare and upgrades of its own.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight planks around a lever, or a plain chest with a lever, make a \"},{\"text\":\"Sophisticated chest\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:chest\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"27\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" slots, an upgrade slot and its own versions of most backpack upgrades.\"}]",
    "",
    "Two matching chests side by side join into a double chest."
  ],
  "quest.5B18FDC304BD1F69.title": "Barrels in a row",
  "quest.5B18FDC304BD1F69.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chest tech, in barrel form.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Planks, slabs and a lever make a \"},{\"text\":\"Sophisticated barrel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:barrel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and so do a plain barrel and a lever.\"}]",
    "",
    "Same slots, tiers and upgrades as the chest, in a full block that builds walls."
  ],
  "quest.0CCBDEAD564B0BAC.title": "Moving day",
  "quest.0CCBDEAD564B0BAC.quest_subtitle": "Nobody likes moving. Tape helps.",
  "quest.0CCBDEAD564B0BAC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pick a chest up, contents and all.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A slime ball and paper make \"},{\"text\":\"Packing Tape\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:packing_tape\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Tape a chest or barrel, break it, and it drops as one item with everything inside.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four tapes make \"},{\"text\":\"Super Packing Tape\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:super_packing_tape\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", with more uses.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Breaking a chest that would spill more than \"},{\"text\":\"200\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" items is refused unless you sneak: that is the tape's cue. Carry On can't lift these blocks in this pack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6FD5FB0A38761410.title": "Shell on the outside",
  "quest.6FD5FB0A38761410.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Carry a whole chest in one item.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Two shulker shells, a chest and a lever make a Sophisticated \"},{\"text\":\"Shulker Box\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:shulker_box\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Two shells on a tiered chest keep the tier.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Broken, it keeps what's inside, with up to \"},{\"text\":\"132\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" slots at netherite.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.644FA66A32840A03.title": "One item, lots of it",
  "quest.644FA66A32840A03.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A barrel that only cares about one thing.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Planks, a slab and a lever make a \"},{\"text\":\"Limited Barrel I\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:limited_barrel_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\":\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"One slot for \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" stacks\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"With the item\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"The count on its face\"}]",
    "",
    "Types II, III and IV split that into two to four slots. Click the front to put in and take out."
  ],
  "quest.073F17E1495FD033.title": "Nuggets, ingots, blocks",
  "quest.073F17E1495FD033.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Storage that compacts on its own.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two iron, two pistons and two redstone on a Sophisticated Storage base make a \"},{\"text\":\"Compression Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:compression_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It chains neighbouring slots: nuggets, ingots and blocks in order convert up and down on their own.",
    "",
    "A limited barrel III fits it like a glove."
  ],
  "quest.6C132B0F92E78D11.title": "Keep the old chests",
  "quest.6C132B0F92E78D11.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Turn old chests into Sophisticated ones without moving a thing.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four sticks and a lever make a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Tier Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:basic_tier_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Right-click a plain chest, barrel or shulker box with it and it turns into the Sophisticated version on the spot, contents and all."
  ],
  "quest.4899F04D7F3F1898.title": "Don't craft it twice",
  "quest.4899F04D7F3F1898.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Backpack and chest upgrades are separate items that convert: a backpack upgrade with five planks becomes the chest version, and a chest upgrade with four string and a leather becomes the backpack one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.76BEC68B0BE8084E.title": "Copper step",
  "quest.76BEC68B0BE8084E.quest_subtitle": "Cheaper than it looks.",
  "quest.76BEC68B0BE8084E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The first rung of the ladder is the cheap one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Eight copper around a backpack make a \"},{\"text\":\"Copper Backpack\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:copper_backpack\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:basic_to_copper_tier_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Eight around a lever make a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic to Copper Tier Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:basic_to_copper_tier_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for any placed chest or barrel.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Both go to \"},{\"text\":\"45\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" slots, keeping contents and upgrades.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copper first saves iron: the next step asks for four.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.393CF1C2E82B4CEB.title": "Iron step",
  "quest.393CF1C2E82B4CEB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Iron finishes what copper started.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four iron finish the step from copper: an \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Backpack\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:iron_backpack\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Copper to Iron Tier Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:copper_to_iron_tier_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"54\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" slots and a second upgrade slot on both.\"}]",
    "",
    "Skipped copper? Eight iron around the basic backpack also jump straight here."
  ],
  "quest.664677B8E02FDB8C.title": "Gold step",
  "quest.664677B8E02FDB8C.quest_subtitle": "Shiny, and a bit heavy.",
  "quest.664677B8E02FDB8C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"More room, and three upgrades at once.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight gold ingots each: a \"},{\"text\":\"Gold Backpack\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:gold_backpack\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and an \"},{\"text\":\"Iron to Gold Tier Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:iron_to_gold_tier_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"81\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" slots and three upgrade slots: a magnet, a feeder and a tool swapper at once.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.13E81BA9F60E00F5.title": "Diamond step",
  "quest.13E81BA9F60E00F5.quest_subtitle": "Now we're talking.",
  "quest.13E81BA9F60E00F5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A proper storeroom starts here.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight diamonds each: a \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Backpack\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:diamond_backpack\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Gold to Diamond Tier Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:gold_to_diamond_tier_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"108\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" slots on both.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Five upgrade slots on the backpack, four on the chest.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5FF3A3B257FA29AC.title": "Netherite, top to bottom",
  "quest.5FF3A3B257FA29AC.quest_subtitle": "Fireproof luggage.",
  "quest.5FF3A3B257FA29AC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The last rung of the ladder, and it doesn't burn.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A diamond backpack, a netherite ingot and a smithing template at a smithing table make the \"},{\"text\":\"Netherite Backpack\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:netherite_backpack\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"120\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" slots, seven upgrade slots, and lava can't burn it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A lever and an ingot make the \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond to Netherite Tier Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:diamond_to_netherite_tier_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"132\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" slots.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lava can't touch it, but the void still can: that's the job of the \"},{\"text\":\"Everlasting Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:everlasting_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6C55F3222E7BCBC8.title": "Mara's margin",
  "quest.6C55F3222E7BCBC8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Heliodor packed for journeys, never for returns. Every bag in the ruins is still full. Carry what one day asks for, and leave the rest where someone can find it. —M.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "quest.6646D3E1F66DEA4B.title": "The right tool, always",
  "quest.6646D3E1F66DEA4B.quest_subtitle": "Your pickaxe finds itself.",
  "quest.6646D3E1F66DEA4B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Stop scrolling the hotbar.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A wooden sword, pickaxe, axe and shovel, two iron and two redstone on a base: a \"},{\"text\":\"Tool Swapper Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:tool_swapper_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Left-click a block or a mob and the right tool from the backpack jumps into your hand."
  ],
  "quest.74BC5EF7BFD7954D.title": "Wrench on demand",
  "quest.74BC5EF7BFD7954D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wrenches get a swapper of their own.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Tool Swapper Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:advanced_tool_swapper_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds filters and a key of its own, unbound until you set it in Controls: look at a machine, press \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sophisticatedbackpacks.tool_swap\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and the wrench that fits it is in your hand.\"}]",
    "",
    "One wrench per mod, zero digging."
  ],
  "quest.5D9D8387912C5D40.title": "Lunch is packed",
  "quest.5D9D8387912C5D40.quest_subtitle": "Mom packed it.",
  "quest.5D9D8387912C5D40.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eat without opening the bag.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A golden carrot, a golden apple, a glistering melon slice and an ender pearl on a base: a \"},{\"text\":\"Feeding Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:feeding_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "You eat from the backpack when hungry, and its tab sets how hungry so no food goes to waste."
  ],
  "quest.7AB955768B696852.title": "Self-service potions",
  "quest.7AB955768B696852.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Potions drink themselves when the moment comes.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A ghast tear, a glass bottle, a fermented spider eye, two blaze rods, two iron and an ender pearl make an \"},{\"text\":\"Alchemy Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:alchemy_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It drinks potions, eats effect food or milk from the backpack when you say: on fire, underwater, falling, hurt.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fire Resistance set to 'On Fire' is a lava swim you walk out of.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3F8E6EEF8C9BAAA7.title": "Never the last torch",
  "quest.3F8E6EEF8C9BAAA7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The stack you're using doesn't run out mid-swing.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An ender pearl, two iron, two redstone and a chest on a base: a \"},{\"text\":\"Refill Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:refill_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It keeps the stacks you pick topped up in your inventory from the backpack.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Refill Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:advanced_refill_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" picks the slot, and middle-click pulls blocks out of the backpack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2C9867271C931906.title": "The trip home, one click",
  "quest.2C9867271C931906.quest_subtitle": "Unpacking is for other people.",
  "quest.2C9867271C931906.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Unload and reload with a single click.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A piston or a sticky piston with iron, redstone and a chest: \"},{\"text\":\"Deposit Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:deposit_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Restock Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:restock_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sneak-right-click a chest with the backpack in hand, or look at it and press \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sophisticatedbackpacks.inventory_interaction\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\": one unloads, the other fills the backpack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.71A1D342D8870E09.title": "Pocket pets",
  "quest.71A1D342D8870E09.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Take a cow to the mine.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An ender pearl, two iron and two leads on a base: a \"},{\"text\":\"Mob Catcher Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:mob_catcher_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Sneak-right-click a passive mob to stow it in the backpack, where it takes slots by size.",
    "",
    "The advanced one, made with a wither skeleton skull, takes hostile mobs too."
  ],
  "quest.2789AFDD6A9EC444.title": "A table in a tab",
  "quest.2789AFDD6A9EC444.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two workstations that live in a tab.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:crafting_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A crafting table, two iron and a chest on a base give the \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:crafting_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:stonecutter_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A stonecutter, two iron and a redstone give the \"},{\"text\":\"Stonecutter Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:stonecutter_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Each opens as a tab and works straight from the backpack."
  ],
  "quest.28E3058FA7EF46FD.title": "Workshop radio",
  "quest.28E3058FA7EF46FD.quest_subtitle": "Aux cable not included.",
  "quest.28E3058FA7EF46FD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A jukebox, two iron and a redstone on a base: the \"},{\"text\":\"Jukebox Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:jukebox_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" plays a disc wherever you go.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Jukebox Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:advanced_jukebox_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds \"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" discs and plays them in order, shuffled or on repeat.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5ADC597B6647DF0E.title": "Forge on the go",
  "quest.5ADC597B6647DF0E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The forge fits in the bag.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:anvil_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Two anvils, a diamond, two iron and a chest make the \"},{\"text\":\"Anvil Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:anvil_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:smithing_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A smithing table, two iron and a chest make the \"},{\"text\":\"Smithing Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:smithing_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Repairs, names and netherite work, far from home."
  ],
  "quest.57C73008F5D924B2.title": "Chisel in the pocket",
  "quest.57C73008F5D924B2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The mason's chisel goes where you go.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every Chipped workbench, with two iron and a redstone on a base, becomes an upgrade: the \"},{\"text\":\"Chipped: Mason Table Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:chipped/mason_table_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns stone into its variants from a tab.\"}]",
    "",
    "Seven tables, seven upgrades."
  ],
  "quest.47B1F8F28F1C8F86.title": "Pocket furnace",
  "quest.47B1F8F28F1C8F86.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A furnace in a tab, and two cousins.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A furnace, two iron and four redstone on a base: a \"},{\"text\":\"Smelting Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:smelting_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a furnace in a tab.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:smoking_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Four logs around it make the \"},{\"text\":\"Smoking Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:smoking_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:blasting_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Five iron and three smooth stone, the \"},{\"text\":\"Blasting Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:blasting_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.25032CE2BB19689F.title": "It cooks while you walk",
  "quest.25032CE2BB19689F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Load ore and fuel, walk away, come back to ingots.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two diamonds, three hoppers, a redstone and two gold around a smelting upgrade: an \"},{\"text\":\"Auto-smelting Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:auto_smelting_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It takes ore and fuel from the backpack by its filters and puts the ingots back in."
  ],
  "quest.4C743BC0B3EFF3A8.title": "One door for every chest",
  "quest.4C743BC0B3EFF3A8.quest_subtitle": "Sorting, solved. Mostly.",
  "quest.4C743BC0B3EFF3A8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chests stop being a scavenger hunt.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Stone, two comparators, two planks and a wooden chest or barrel make a \"},{\"text\":\"Storage Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every Sophisticated storage touching it, or touching one that does, up to \"},{\"text\":\"15\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks away, becomes one inventory for you and for pipes.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click it with a stack and the stack goes where that item already lives. Click twice fast and everything you carry that has a home goes in.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.12D8EBA833E0B586.title": "Far-flung shelves",
  "quest.12D8EBA833E0B586.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Shelves in two places, one controller.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Storage Link\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:storage_link\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds a separate cluster of storage to the controller.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:storage_tool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Bind it with the \"},{\"text\":\"Storage Tool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:storage_tool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "The tool also locks storage and hides the counts, tiers and upgrades shown on its face.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A controller and an ender pearl make three links at once.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6F931B1EDAEE841B.title": "A port for pipes",
  "quest.6F931B1EDAEE841B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Give the pipes a door.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Stone, planks, a repeater, gold and a wooden storage make \"},{\"text\":\"Storage I/O\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:storage_io\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": set in the multiblock, it gives pipes one face to push into and pull from.\"}]",
    "",
    "Crafted alone it turns into Input and Output, which only take or only give."
  ],
  "quest.24B436B63D38F3BC.title": "Hopper built in",
  "quest.24B436B63D38F3BC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The chest brings its own hopper.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A hopper, two iron and three redstone on a Sophisticated Storage base: a \"},{\"text\":\"Hopper Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:hopper_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "The storage pulls from the block above and pushes into the one below.",
    "",
    "The advanced one is faster and works through any side."
  ],
  "quest.02E23FB0BE8B714A.title": "The chest that collects",
  "quest.02E23FB0BE8B714A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A chest with a magnet upgrade pulls items from \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks around it, \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" advanced. Next to the kill floor of a mob farm, nothing is left on the ground.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7C70F44455221695.title": "The same chest everywhere",
  "quest.7C70F44455221695.quest_subtitle": "Teleportation, for socks.",
  "quest.7C70F44455221695.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Open a chest here, find the same stuff there.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Blaze rods, wool, obsidian, a wooden chest and a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Storage chest\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderstorage:ender_chest\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"27\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" slots shared with every chest of the same three colors, in any dimension.\"}]",
    "",
    "In this pack the alloy takes the ender pearl's place (act III).",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Dye the three buttons on the lid to set the colors. A diamond on the latch makes it yours alone.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.57312756653E2471.title": "Shared tank",
  "quest.57312756653E2471.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The same trick, with liquids.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The same frame around a cauldron makes an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Storage tank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderstorage:ender_tank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" buckets of fluid shared with every tank of its colors.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"With a redstone signal it pushes fluid into the blocks around it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"A click on the valve inverts that.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7C430F071F537F08.title": "A chest in your pocket",
  "quest.7C430F071F537F08.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Open an Ender chest from wherever you stand.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Blaze powder, leather, wool, an ender pearl and a reinforced alloy make an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Storage pouch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderstorage:ender_pouch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Sneak-right-click an Ender Storage chest to copy its colors.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"From then on the pouch opens that chest wherever you are.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3CD9F01DEB4EFCC2.title": "Pick a team code",
  "quest.3CD9F01DEB4EFCC2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three colors out of sixteen give \"},{\"text\":\"4,096\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" frequencies. Agree on one with the team: a supply chest at home, a pouch for each explorer and a tank at the far base for lava.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2165179220C8395C.title": "More per slot",
  "quest.2165179220C8395C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight copper blocks around a base make a \"},{\"text\":\"Stack Upgrade Starter Tier\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:stack_upgrade_starter_tier\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": each slot holds one and a half stacks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron, gold, diamond and netherite blocks climb to \"},{\"text\":\"×2\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"×4\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"×8\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"×16\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\". Up to three per backpack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.041A907A91FB513B.title": "Chests stack for cheap",
  "quest.041A907A91FB513B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Bigger stacks in the same slots.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Chests have their own ladder, and it starts with eight logs around a Sophisticated Storage base: \"},{\"text\":\"Stack Upgrade Tier 1\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:stack_upgrade_tier_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"×2\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\". Copper, iron, gold, diamond and netherite go up to \"},{\"text\":\"×32\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\". Two per chest, barrel or shulker box.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.249A414C200406B9.title": "A backpack in a backpack",
  "quest.249A414C200406B9.quest_subtitle": "We need to go deeper.",
  "quest.249A414C200406B9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pack your packs.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four eyes of ender, a nether star and three diamonds on a base: an \"},{\"text\":\"Inception Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:inception_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Backpacks fit inside the backpack, and their upgrades keep working from in there."
  ],
  "quest.67F8DF112006E85F.title": "Built to outlast you",
  "quest.67F8DF112006E85F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The void can't have it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four end crystals and four nether stars on a base: an \"},{\"text\":\"Everlasting Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:everlasting_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Die in the void and it waits for you.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The backpack can't be destroyed, never despawns and doesn't fall out of the world.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.247E02B8BEE99820.title": "Omega",
  "quest.247E02B8BEE99820.quest_subtitle": "Somebody had to.",
  "quest.247E02B8BEE99820.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"There is a stack upgrade above the top one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Nine times the \"},{\"text\":\"Stack Upgrade Tier 4\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:stack_upgrade_tier_4\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", each built on eight netherite blocks, make the \"},{\"text\":\"Stack Upgrade Omega Tier\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:stack_upgrade_omega_tier\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": every slot times \"},{\"text\":\"33,554,431\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Seventy-two netherite blocks for a very tidy backpack."
  ],
  "reward.0F1E6A3C690F6503.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.14EF23378364326D.title": "Less is less",
  "quest.14EF23378364326D.quest_subtitle": "Two cobblestones per slot. On purpose.",
  "quest.14EF23378364326D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Flint and sticks on a base make a \"},{\"text\":\"Stack Downgrade Tier 3\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:stack_downgrade_tier_3\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": every slot now holds a stack divided by \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Somewhere, a sorting machine needed exactly that."
  ],
  "reward.5C32C38EBB212869.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.0C9552E3AC39EE25.title": "No infinity here",
  "quest.0C9552E3AC39EE25.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Infinity is off the menu.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The infinity upgrades of both Sophisticated mods and the \"},{\"text\":\"Creative Vending Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:creative_vending_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" have no recipe in this pack, on purpose: they copy any item, and that would break Solsticio's trade and the Luminosities.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.68556759C44943D7.title": "Water to go",
  "quest.68556759C44943D7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A canteen that trades slots for buckets.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight glass around a base: a \"},{\"text\":\"Tank Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:tank_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It trades some slots for a fluid tank of \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" buckets per row of the backpack, and stack upgrades grow it too.\"}]",
    "",
    "Fill and empty it with buckets in its slots."
  ],
  "quest.702BAF75086AEB1C.title": "Charged up",
  "quest.702BAF75086AEB1C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four gold and four redstone blocks on a base: a \"},{\"text\":\"Battery Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:battery_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"10,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE per row of the backpack.\"}]",
    "",
    "Charge it through its slots or, with the backpack set down, from a cable."
  ],
  "quest.3E95CF62E84785AA.title": "Pump it",
  "quest.3E95CF62E84785AA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fluids go in and out of the tank on their own.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four glass, two buckets, a piston and a sticky piston on a base: the \"},{\"text\":\"Pump Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:pump_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" moves fluid between the tank and the blocks around a backpack set down.\"}]",
    "",
    "The advanced one also drinks from the world and from buckets in your hand."
  ],
  "quest.59E5ED4EFBBD116C.title": "Bank your levels",
  "quest.59E5ED4EFBBD116C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Your levels, safe in a tank.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two bottles o' enchanting, two eyes of ender and four redstone around an advanced pump: an \"},{\"text\":\"Experience Pump Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedbackpacks:xp_pump_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It stores your levels in the tank, hands them back or keeps you at a set level, and feeds Mending tools."
  ],
  "quest.4EF5D55CA3A51F5A.title": "Interior design",
  "quest.4EF5D55CA3A51F5A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Same chest, another look.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Logs, planks and a Sophisticated Storage base make a \"},{\"text\":\"Decoration Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:decoration_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": new materials, colors and accents for Sophisticated storage.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Paintbrush\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:paintbrush\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" set at the table applies that look to storage already in place.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.730D9F45B252B76A.title": "Storage that looks like furniture",
  "quest.730D9F45B252B76A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Your pantry can pass for kitchen furniture.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Storage Delight turns slabs and trapdoors into kitchen furniture that holds \"},{\"text\":\"27\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" slots: an \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Drawer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"storagedelight:oak_drawer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", an \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Cabinet with Polished Andesite Countertop\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"storagedelight:oak_cabinet_with_polished_andesite_countertop\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", glass cabinets and bookshelves with doors, in every wood.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"They burn like planks, so a wrong craft still heats the furnace.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7B041D0F6A415B3F.title": "Take out the trash",
  "quest.7B041D0F6A415B3F.quest_subtitle": "Don't forget to recycle. It won't.",
  "quest.7B041D0F6A415B3F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A bin that empties itself.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three stone, five cobblestone and a chest: an \"},{\"text\":\"Item Trash Can\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"trashcans:item_trash_can\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It deletes whatever pipes or hands put in, with a nine-item filter that allows or blocks.",
    "",
    "Its screen can hand back the last few items, for misclicks."
  ],
  "quest.62B0FE2281172662.title": "Down the drain",
  "quest.62B0FE2281172662.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Liquids and gases go down the drain too.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A bucket in place of the chest: a \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Trash Can\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"trashcans:liquid_trash_can\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It voids liquids and gases, with a nine-fluid filter.",
    "",
    "It refuses Mekanism's radioactive waste: that gets dealt with, not hidden."
  ],
  "quest.18D6A20476704DC7.title": "Burn off the surplus",
  "quest.18D6A20476704DC7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A bottomless socket for surplus power.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Redstone in place of the chest: an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Trash Can\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"trashcans:energy_trash_can\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It swallows energy, all of it or up to a limit you set in FE per tick, which makes it a handy dummy load for testing generators."
  ],
  "quest.4637164EC0DE5FA4.title": "One bin for everything",
  "quest.4637164EC0DE5FA4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One bin instead of three.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The three cans together in the crafting grid make an \"},{\"text\":\"Ultimate Trash Can\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"trashcans:ultimate_trash_can\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": items, fluids and energy, each with its own filter or limit.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.00E5D95C0155A1B1.title": "A lot of one thing",
  "quest.00E5D95C0155A1B1.quest_subtitle": "Marie Kondo approves.",
  "quest.00E5D95C0155A1B1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight planks around a chest: an \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Drawer (1x1)\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:oak_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" stacks of one item, shown on its face.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click to put in, double right-click to put in every matching stack you carry.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Left-click takes one, sneak-left-click a stack.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sneak-right-click opens its upgrade slots.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2FBFCD89DA3CCDF8.title": "Split drawers",
  "quest.2FBFCD89DA3CCDF8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One drawer block, two or four kinds of item.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Two chests make a pair of the \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Drawer (1x2)\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:oak_2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" stacks per compartment.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Four chests make four of the \"},{\"text\":\"Oak Drawer (2x2)\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:oak_4\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" stacks each.\"}]",
    "",
    "Same space, more kinds of item."
  ],
  "quest.549845D2797BA5B0.title": "Liquid assets",
  "quest.549845D2797BA5B0.quest_subtitle": "Buckets not included. Well, one is.",
  "quest.549845D2797BA5B0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A drawer for a single liquid.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight planks around an empty bucket: a \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Drawer (1x1)\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:fluid_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"It keeps one fluid the way a drawer keeps an item.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Fill and drain it with buckets or pipes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.32B8755F62256BB1.title": "Nine in, one out",
  "quest.32B8755F62256BB1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Nine nuggets, one ingot, nine ingots, one block: it does the math.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Stone, two pistons, a drawer and an iron ingot make a \"},{\"text\":\"Compacting Drawer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:compacting_drawer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": one material in three forms that convert by themselves. Put in iron ingots and it also offers nuggets and blocks. The \"},{\"text\":\"Simple Compacting Drawer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:simple_compacting_drawer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" handles two forms.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6497C389DD3537F4.title": "Not just metals",
  "quest.6497C389DD3537F4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Compacting drawers also know melon slices and melons, ice to packed ice to blue ice, quartz, amethyst shards and glowstone dust. The end of a melon farm deserves one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3F2AB889FCBD78E5.title": "Hidden in plain sight",
  "quest.3F2AB889FCBD78E5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A drawer that dresses like its surroundings.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron nuggets around a chest make a \"},{\"text\":\"Framed Drawer (1x1)\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:framed_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "In the crafting grid, give it one block for the outside, one for the inside and one for the divider, and it wears their textures."
  ],
  "quest.11771CC46C1158B2.title": "The armory",
  "quest.11771CC46C1158B2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A drawer for whatever won't stack.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Stone, three drawers, a comparator and a netherite ingot make an \"},{\"text\":\"Armory Cabinet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:armory_cabinet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"4,096\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" slots for what doesn't stack, like tools, armor and enchanted books, one item per slot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.33DD3545E3DC75C6.title": "The drawer wall",
  "quest.33DD3545E3DC75C6.quest_subtitle": "It knows where everything is.",
  "quest.33DD3545E3DC75C6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One face for the whole drawer wall.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Stone, two quartz blocks, two drawers and a comparator make a \"},{\"text\":\"Storage Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:storage_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drawers linked to it within \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks become one inventory: right-click it with anything to file it in the right drawer, and pipe into it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Storage upgrades in the controller's own slots widen its reach.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0AA9FE2BC08B2311.title": "Link them up",
  "quest.0AA9FE2BC08B2311.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tell the controller which drawers are its own.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five paper, two gold, a drawer and a diamond make a \"},{\"text\":\"Linking Tool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:linking_tool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click the controller, then the drawers to link.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Sneak-right-click the air for multiple mode, which links everything between two corners.\"}]",
    "",
    "Holding it shows what's linked."
  ],
  "quest.5BC2EE2B5C484C5F.title": "Another door",
  "quest.5BC2EE2B5C484C5F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A second door to the same wall.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The controller's recipe with a repeater in the middle makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Controller Access Point\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:controller_extension\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": another face of the same wall, somewhere else, for hands or pipes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7396A619FAECDE1A.title": "A drawer with a twin",
  "quest.7396A619FAECDE1A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One shared slot, wherever the drawer stands.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Planks, two drawers and an ender chest make an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Drawer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:ender_drawer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": every ender drawer on the same frequency shares one slot.\"}]",
    "",
    "Left-click one with the linking tool to copy its frequency, right-click another to paste it."
  ],
  "quest.72E3F9606C4E812E.title": "Label it",
  "quest.72E3F9606C4E812E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A drawer with a name tag.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Paper, gold, a drawer and an emerald make a \"},{\"text\":\"Configuration Tool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:configuration_tool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Lock a drawer to its item so the place stays when it empties, or hide counts, icons and upgrades.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Sneak-right-click the air to change what it toggles.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.799B566A885ECFC8.title": "Sort once, then automate",
  "quest.799B566A885ECFC8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Drawers for the few items you have thousands of, chests for everything else, a backpack with Deposit for the trip home and a void upgrade on the cobblestone drawer. Future you finds everything on the first try.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0B98E9CC224A0976.title": "Bigger drawers",
  "quest.0B98E9CC224A0976.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"More room in the same drawer.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Copper ingots and blocks, two chests and a drawer make a \"},{\"text\":\"Copper Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:copper_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"×8\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" capacity in a drawer's storage slots.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Built one on the other, the \"},{\"text\":\"Gold Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:gold_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" gives \"},{\"text\":\"×16\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" and the \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:diamond_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"×24\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5B2BCD66CABD0839.title": "Top drawer",
  "quest.5B2BCD66CABD0839.quest_subtitle": "Literally.",
  "quest.5B2BCD66CABD0839.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The end of the drawer ladder.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:diamond_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"First a \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:diamond_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:netherite_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Then, with a netherite ingot and a smithing template at a smithing table, the \"},{\"text\":\"Netherite Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:netherite_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"×32\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An oak drawer with it holds \"},{\"text\":\"1,024\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" stacks of one item.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.52487C7FD4D9671E.title": "No pipes needed",
  "quest.52487C7FD4D9671E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Push or pull from the drawer itself.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:puller_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Stone, a hopper, redstone and a drawer make a \"},{\"text\":\"Puller Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:puller_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:pusher_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Crafted alone it turns into a \"},{\"text\":\"Pusher Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:pusher_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and back.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks they move \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" items or \"},{\"text\":\"500\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB through the side you pick in the drawer's screen.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.645F5B27D508A238.title": "Never full",
  "quest.645F5B27D508A238.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A full drawer stops being a problem.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight obsidian around a drawer: a \"},{\"text\":\"Void Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:void_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "When the drawer is full, the excess vanishes instead of backing up the machine that feeds it.",
    "",
    "A cobblestone generator's best friend."
  ],
  "quest.7F095E769E5FE2FD.title": "Floor sweeper",
  "quest.7F095E769E5FE2FD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The drawer sweeps its own floor.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two hoppers, two redstone, stone and a drawer make a \"},{\"text\":\"Collector Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:collector_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the drawer picks up the items lying on the side you choose, and a fluid drawer picks up fluid blocks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.34B97CF9A4063608.title": "How full is it?",
  "quest.34B97CF9A4063608.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Make a drawer talk to redstone.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Redstone, two comparators, two redstone blocks and a drawer make a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:redstone_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the drawer gives off a signal by how full the slot you choose is.\"}]",
    "",
    "Wire it to stop a farm before the shelf overflows."
  ],
  "quest.161FE65B90F335F3.title": "Drawers that make things",
  "quest.161FE65B90F335F3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Drawers that refill themselves.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Stone, two water buckets and a bucket make a \"},{\"text\":\"Water Generator Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:water_generator_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a fluid drawer with it never runs out of water.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Dripping Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:dripping_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" drips a little lava.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four dripping upgrades and a water generator make the \"},{\"text\":\"Obsidian Generator Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:obsidian_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": one obsidian every \"},{\"text\":\"15\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" seconds, in an item drawer.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4E9F2C9D2528EBC8.title": "Tools on the hip",
  "quest.4E9F2C9D2528EBC8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Your hip has room for tools.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five leather, two string and an iron ingot make a \"},{\"text\":\"Tool Belt\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"toolbelt:belt\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with two pockets.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wear it in the belt slot, which \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.toolbelt.slot\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens, and hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.toolbelt.open\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" for a wheel that swaps your hand with a belt tool.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5BC7A61EE2344022.title": "One more pocket",
  "quest.5BC7A61EE2344022.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every extra pocket is one trip less to the chest.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four string, three leather and a gold ingot make a \"},{\"text\":\"Belt Pouch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"toolbelt:pouch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A belt and a pouch in an anvil add one pocket, up to nine. Each step costs more levels, from \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"30\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.386A4771C4C3A58C.title": "A Tool Belt with nine pockets",
  "quest.7E6689470068C322.title": "Nine pockets",
  "quest.7E6689470068C322.quest_subtitle": "Ninety-three levels well spent.",
  "quest.7E6689470068C322.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Tool Belt\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"toolbelt:belt\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with all nine pockets.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The anvil's bill came to \"},{\"text\":\"93\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" levels, and not one was wasted.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.45CB5DFCDA3F36AF.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.5244F747EC00E74D.title": "Barrels for the common store",
  "quest.5244F747EC00E74D.quest_subtitle": "There's always room for more room.",
  "quest.5244F747EC00E74D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight \"},{\"text\":\"Sophisticated barrels\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"sophisticatedstorage:barrel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "With a tree farm, it's a short errand."
  ],
  "quest.784E50C18918D17E.title": "When a network pays off",
  "quest.784E50C18918D17E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Drawers and chests stop scaling when finding things takes longer than using them.\"}]",
    "",
    "Then comes a network:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"One terminal that searches everything\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Crafts on request\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Feeds machines\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Applied Energistics \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" and Refined Storage have their own chapters.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.19927DDA658F9151.title": "Light the cellar",
  "quest.19927DDA658F9151.quest_subtitle": "It's dark down here.",
  "quest.19927DDA658F9151.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hang a lantern and the cellar wakes up.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: just light."
  ],
  "image.62F1D2C11BB527D7.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.14519ACAEB308140.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"STORAGE\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.1763418F9FDDACCD.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The cellar that grows\",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"}]",
  "image.122A0EC4BACA954A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On the road\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.3388B1CEF0E02159.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Workbench\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.5E4C17F7E1C717FC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Chests at work\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.6D764D1DE15D037D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Across dimensions\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.125D719F8EA2139F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Bigger inside\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.6972247EC7949C6F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tanks\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.511C8DD97D082729.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Good looks\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.6FF0E0D6B2A7D16D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Overflow\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.0791D637B9AB16AA.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drawers\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.7505871A2832F3F9.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On the hip\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.676A855429194B4E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hands-free\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.2B65CD0307C0C75B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Chests and barrels\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "chapter.2F4D57204C0D4367.title": "Actually Additions",
  "chapter.2F4D57204C0D4367.chapter_subtitle": [
    "The Atomic Reconstructor's beam, six crystals and the Empowerer; laser relays, phantomfaces, farms, drills and coffee."
  ],
  "quest.0329621E779C4D03.title": "Black Quartz",
  "quest.0329621E779C4D03.quest_subtitle": "Nether quartz, dressed for a funeral.",
  "quest.0329621E779C4D03.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Black Quartz Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:black_quartz_ore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hides in stone and deepslate between Y -25 and 45, eight veins to a chunk. Smelt or blast it; Fortune adds more.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Almost every Actually Additions recipe starts here: casings, coils, lenses, lamps. A \"},{\"text\":\"Crusher\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2B97086271E1EA71\"}},{\"text\":\" gets two out of each ore.\"}]",
    "",
    "Old chests in dungeons, mineshafts, stronghold libraries, fortresses, end cities and a few more sometimes hold black quartz, crystals or a drill core."
  ],
  "quest.44119EC6EE0DCD9A.title": "Iron Casing",
  "quest.44119EC6EE0DCD9A.quest_desc": [
    "Four iron ingots at the corners, four sticks on the sides, a black quartz in the middle: the frame of most machines here. Make four; the coal generator takes two and the reconstructor one."
  ],
  "quest.0A875C7364794AE3.title": "Coal Generator",
  "quest.0A875C7364794AE3.quest_subtitle": "Whatever a furnace eats, it eats.",
  "quest.0A875C7364794AE3.quest_desc": [
    "Six cobblestone, two iron casings and a coal. It burns furnace fuel for 20 CF/t, stores 60,000 CF and only lights new fuel when it isn't full; a redstone signal stops it.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"CF (Crystal Flux) is ordinary Forge Energy: cables and machines from other mods take it as it is.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1B0EC5EE12C42EFA.title": "Atomic Reconstructor",
  "quest.1B0EC5EE12C42EFA.quest_subtitle": "Point, shoot, transmute.",
  "quest.1B0EC5EE12C42EFA.quest_desc": [
    "Four iron, four redstone and a casing. Every five seconds it fires up to 10 blocks for 1,000 CF plus the recipe: the first block it hits changes, with the 3×3 around it facing the beam, and so do items dropped along the way.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A redstone signal switches it off; right-click it with a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Torch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone_torch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and it fires only on pulses instead. It holds 300,000 CF, so one coal generator keeps it busy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.451A755C39750036.title": "Four everyday crystals",
  "quest.451A755C39750036.quest_subtitle": "Redstone, lapis, iron and coal, now shiny.",
  "quest.451A755C39750036.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drop the material in the beam: redstone turns into \"},{\"text\":\"Restonia\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:restonia_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", lapis into \"},{\"text\":\"Palis\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:palis_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", iron ingots into \"},{\"text\":\"Enori\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:enori_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", coal or charcoal into \"},{\"text\":\"Void\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:void_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". On top of the shot: 40, 40, 80 and 60 CF each.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Storage blocks convert too, nine crystals at once: a block of redstone becomes a \"},{\"text\":\"Restonia Crystal Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:restonia_crystal_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for 400 CF.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6A633E45285E72C9.title": "The precious two",
  "quest.6A633E45285E72C9.quest_subtitle": "Same beam, pricier lunch.",
  "quest.6A633E45285E72C9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Diamonds turn into \"},{\"text\":\"Diamatine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:diamatine_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for 60 CF and emeralds into \"},{\"text\":\"Emeradic\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:emeradic_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for 100. Diamatine goes into area augments, the Range Booster and the Handheld Filler; Emeradic, into the silk touch augment and little else.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1704D4962502E95E.title": "Basic and Advanced Coils",
  "quest.1704D4962502E95E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Restonia around a black quartz make a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:basic_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; eight gold nuggets around one of those make an \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:advanced_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Nearly every machine from here on asks for one or the other.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5DDFAEAB5D453C56.title": "Four Display Stands",
  "quest.5DDFAEAB5D453C56.quest_subtitle": "Pedestals first, altar second.",
  "quest.5DDFAEAB5D453C56.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The beam turns a quartz block into \"},{\"text\":\"Ethetic Quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:ethetic_white_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a chiseled one into \"},{\"text\":\"Ethetic Green Quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:ethetic_green_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", 10 CF each. Three of each under an advanced coil make a \"},{\"text\":\"Display Stand\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:display_stand\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; the Empowerer wants four.\"}]",
    "",
    "On its own, a stand shows off whatever you right-click onto it."
  ],
  "quest.521902565B5E1FF5.title": "Single and Double Batteries",
  "quest.521902565B5E1FF5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Restonia over an advanced coil and five Enori makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Single Battery\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:single_battery\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (200,000 CF); a single battery in the Restonia's place makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Double Battery\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:double_battery\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (350,000), charge kept. The Empowerer is built on a double.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hold one, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click: in discharge mode it charges the other items in your inventory.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1E645F439719399C.title": "Empowerer",
  "quest.1E645F439719399C.quest_subtitle": "An altar with four assistants.",
  "quest.1E645F439719399C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Restonia, a double battery, two iron casings and a display stand. Place it, then a \"},{\"text\":\"Display Stand\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:display_stand\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" three blocks away in each of the four directions: the crystal goes on the Empowerer, one modifier on each stand.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each stand holds 80,000 CF, takes 1,000 CF/t and pays its share while it works: 5,000 over two and a half seconds for a crystal. No power in the stands, no deal."
  ],
  "quest.16AB01C7FF8B59A8.title": "First empowered crystal",
  "quest.16AB01C7FF8B59A8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Restonia on the Empowerer; red dye, a nether brick, redstone and a brick on the four stands; power in. Two and a half seconds later: \"},{\"text\":\"Empowered Restonia\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:empowered_restonia_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.59822045237A8D4D.title": "Empower whole blocks",
  "quest.59822045237A8D4D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A crystal block takes the same four modifiers as a single crystal: nine crystals for four modifiers and 200,000 CF, against 36 modifiers and 180,000 CF one by one. Each stand pays 50,000 of it and holds 80,000, so it fits.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.51416817D54FBE2D.title": "Six crystals, empowered",
  "quest.51416817D54FBE2D.quest_subtitle": "The emerald one is just for show.",
  "quest.51416817D54FBE2D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Empower all six; each takes its own four modifiers. \"},{\"text\":\"Palis\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:empowered_palis_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": cyan dye and three prismarine shards. \"},{\"text\":\"Diamatine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:empowered_diamatine_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": light blue dye, two clay balls and a clay block. \"},{\"text\":\"Void\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:empowered_void_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": black dye, coal, flint and stone.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Emeradic\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:empowered_emeradic_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": lime dye, short grass, a sapling and a slimeball. \"},{\"text\":\"Enori\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:empowered_enori_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": gray dye, a snowball, a stone button and cobblestone.\"}]",
    "",
    "Item laser relays can load the stands for you. No recipe asks for Empowered Emeradic: that one is for the shelf."
  ],
  "quest.73AC1DB6491C9600.title": "A crate of crystals",
  "quest.73AC1DB6491C9600.quest_subtitle": "Red and blue, by the dozen.",
  "quest.73AC1DB6491C9600.quest_desc": [
    "Thirty-two Restonia and thirty-two Palis for the common store, once a day. A 3×3 wall of redstone blocks where the beam stops, then one of lapis blocks, covers an order in two shots."
  ],
  "task.4E3B5F862EA00590.title": "Open the Actually Additions Manual",
  "quest.54BCE8D235829045.title": "A manual under construction",
  "quest.54BCE8D235829045.quest_subtitle": "Five entries and a lot of goodwill.",
  "quest.54BCE8D235829045.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Paper and \"},{\"text\":\"Canola Seeds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:canola_seeds\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Actually Additions Manual\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:booklet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; right-click opens it. This version has five entries, crystals and the Engineers' house among them, so EMI carries the rest.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Canola grows wild in hot or sparse biomes and in some village fields; the \"},{\"text\":\"Market\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"50A6912B6169501B\"}},{\"text\":\" sells its seeds.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Villages can build the Engineers' house: its chests hold casings, black quartz and crystals, now and then a drill core, and its garden grows canola, coffee, flax and rice.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.356CFF06141D0852.title": "What the pack adds",
  "quest.356CFF06141D0852.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Actually Additions keeps its own recipes here. Two of its crystals feed the Atlas: two Restonia go into the \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Coupler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:energy_coupler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for \"},{\"text\":\"A Crystal Connection\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5281CA2BAADED9DF\"}},{\"text\":\" (act II), two Palis into the \"},{\"text\":\"Routing Matrix\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:routing_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for \"},{\"text\":\"A Shared Language\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"17BBD680007901AB\"}},{\"text\":\" (act III).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4AFC77B063DB1B2F.title": "Lamps and a controller",
  "quest.4AFC77B063DB1B2F.quest_subtitle": "One switch, a whole ceiling.",
  "quest.4AFC77B063DB1B2F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four glowstone, two Palis, two dyes and a black quartz make six lamps; dye one in place to recolour it, right-click to switch it. A \"},{\"text\":\"Lamp Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:lamp_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" facing a lamp switches it, and every lamp touching it, with one redstone signal.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Black quartz also comes as blocks, pillars, chiseled, smooth and bricks, each with stairs, slabs and walls. Paper with a drill core, a leaf blower, a phantom connector or the Manual gives a banner pattern."
  ],
  "quest.00BB4463AE6EC36A.title": "Batting practice",
  "quest.00BB4463AE6EC36A.quest_subtitle": "Sorry, little guy.",
  "quest.00BB4463AE6EC36A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Bat's Wing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:bats_wing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": bats killed by a player drop them, and old chests hide a few. Its one recipe is the Wings of the Bats, still marked unfinished in this version, with an Ender Star in the middle.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.1121685799177631.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.0A8C6CDCDF2E1458.title": "Two bosses in one star",
  "quest.0A8C6CDCDF2E1458.quest_subtitle": "Leftovers from the Wither and the Dragon.",
  "quest.0A8C6CDCDF2E1458.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Nether Star, Dragon's Breath, a black quartz and a prismarine shard: an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Star\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:ender_star\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It goes into the Wings of the Bats, which this version still marks as unfinished, so for now it mostly sparkles.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.6926B2C4EDFFDAF6.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.271551CB4A93BB2E.title": "A blank lens",
  "quest.271551CB4A93BB2E.quest_subtitle": "Glass, with ambitions.",
  "quest.271551CB4A93BB2E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight glass around a black quartz make a \"},{\"text\":\"Lens\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:lens\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the blank every other lens starts from. Right-click the reconstructor with a finished lens to fit it; an empty hand takes it back. A fitted lens replaces the plain conversion.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7D8B4263D0CEB0EB.title": "One lens, three lenses",
  "quest.7D8B4263D0CEB0EB.quest_subtitle": "Colour, boom, doom.",
  "quest.7D8B4263D0CEB0EB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drop a lens in the beam: each hit turns it into the next, 5,000 CF a step. \"},{\"text\":\"Color\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:lens_of_color\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" recolours wool, glass, terracotta and lamps; \"},{\"text\":\"Detonation\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:lens_of_detonation\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sets off a big blast that breaks no blocks; \"},{\"text\":\"Certain Death\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:lens_of_certain_death\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" deals 20 damage through armour.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Certain Death kills an unprotected player in one shot.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" Detonation pays 250,000 CF a blast and reaches 30 blocks; Certain Death, 350 CF per victim and 15 blocks. One more hit turns it back into a blank lens.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A diamond sword and a Sharpness V book turn Certain Death into the unfinished \"},{\"text\":\"Lens of the Killer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:lens_of_the_killer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which also drops loot and experience, for 2,500 CF a victim.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.176D11288A522F84.title": "Lens of the Miner",
  "quest.176D11288A522F84.quest_subtitle": "Stone in, ore out, CF gone.",
  "quest.176D11288A522F84.quest_desc": [
    "A lens ringed by a diamond, gold, iron, coal, black quartz, quartz, lapis and an emerald. Fitted, each shot turns the stone, granite, diorite or andesite it hits into a random ore for 60,000 CF: coal and copper often, diamonds and emeralds rarely.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Deepslate and tuff give deepslate ores. Netherrack gives nether quartz, nether gold and, very rarely, \"},{\"text\":\"Ancient Debris\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ancient_debris\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". The stone list also has black quartz and ores from Mekanism, Powah, Immersive Engineering and Modern Industrialization.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2C7F9AFA32E04AE3.title": "Lens of Disenchanting",
  "quest.2C7F9AFA32E04AE3.quest_subtitle": "Give it back, politely.",
  "quest.2C7F9AFA32E04AE3.quest_desc": [
    "A lens, an enchanting table and seven Empowered Diamatine. Drop one enchanted item and one book, plain or enchanted, into the same block in the beam: the item's top enchantment moves onto the book, for 250,000 CF. It reaches 5 blocks."
  ],
  "quest.43689517C893C3AD.title": "Hands-free crystals",
  "quest.43689517C893C3AD.quest_subtitle": "Drop, zap, collect, repeat.",
  "quest.43689517C893C3AD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Aim an \"},{\"text\":\"Automatic Precision Dropper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:dropper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into the beam's path: it drops one item every quarter second, straight ahead, no redstone needed. A \"},{\"text\":\"Ranged Collector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:ranged_collector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" within 6 blocks, set to take only crystals, gathers the results.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0083A93C97189499.title": "Whole stacks, whole walls",
  "quest.0083A93C97189499.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A dropped stack converts in a single shot, as many items as the stored CF pays for. Where the beam stops, the 3×3 facing it converts too: a wall of nine redstone blocks becomes nine Restonia blocks at once.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.21BF555D1E2AFCF1.title": "Not only crystals",
  "quest.21BF555D1E2AFCF1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The bare beam also turns rotten flesh into leather and sand into soul sand (20,000 CF each), nether quartz into prismarine shards (30,000) and a red mushroom into nether wart (150,000).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.13CFB7AFD9D8245C.title": "Coffee beans",
  "quest.13CFB7AFD9D8245C.quest_subtitle": "Grown in the heat.",
  "quest.13CFB7AFD9D8245C.quest_desc": [
    "Coffee grows wild in hot biomes and in some village fields, and the beans are also its seeds. The Coffee Maker turns each bean into two portions and a cup takes 35, so eighteen beans make the first cup."
  ],
  "quest.72A03400402FAEE6.title": "Coffee Maker",
  "quest.72A03400402FAEE6.quest_subtitle": "Brewed on CF.",
  "quest.72A03400402FAEE6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Coffee beans, an iron casing, two basic coils and a Void crystal. It takes beans, water and an \"},{\"text\":\"Empty Cup\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:empty_cup\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (six stone around a bean); each cup costs 500 mB of water and 150 CF/t for 25 seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.277920AB9FEE6CFC.title": "A cup of coffee",
  "quest.277920AB9FEE6CFC.quest_subtitle": "Three sips, then the cup comes back.",
  "quest.277920AB9FEE6CFC.quest_desc": [
    "Items in the eight ingredient slots add effects: sugar gives Speed, blaze powder Strength, magma cream Fire Resistance, a golden carrot Night Vision. The same item twice raises the level. Each cup is three sips worth 8 hunger points each, and the cup comes back."
  ],
  "quest.39029CCCCD6FBA79.title": "The full menu",
  "quest.39029CCCCD6FBA79.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Also: a pufferfish gives Water Breathing, a ghast tear Regeneration, a fermented spider eye Invisibility. Sugar and blaze powder stack four times, ghast tears three, the rest twice. Each effect lasts 5 to 30 seconds a sip: coffee is a sprint, not a potion.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.52F988DC169DB793.title": "Energy Laser Relays",
  "quest.52F988DC169DB793.quest_subtitle": "Cables are so last century.",
  "quest.52F988DC169DB793.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Obsidian, redstone blocks, Restonia and an advanced coil make four \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Laser Relays\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:laser_relay\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Right-click one with the \"},{\"text\":\"Laser Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:laser_wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", then another up to 15 blocks away: every relay in the network moves CF between the blocks beside it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Linking two linked relays again unlinks them. The loss is taken once per transfer, not per hop, so a long chain costs the same as a short one. Four stands around an Empowerer, one relay each, is the classic."
  ],
  "quest.236E9217D8E7805C.title": "Advanced and Extreme relays",
  "quest.236E9217D8E7805C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An energy relay with two Enori and two Restonia becomes \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:laser_relay_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", 10,000 CF/t; that one with two Empowered Diamatine and two Restonia becomes \"},{\"text\":\"Extreme\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:laser_relay_extreme\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", 100,000 CF/t. A basic relay carries 1,000.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4D4E416AAC996B4C.title": "Bigger relays leak more",
  "quest.4D4E416AAC996B4C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Loss per transfer is 5% on basic relays, 8% on advanced and 10% on extreme; between two tiers the lower cap and the higher loss win. Right-click a relay with a \"},{\"text\":\"Compass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:compass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to make it only feed, or only drain, the block beside it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7AE90843B7666FD0.title": "Fluid Laser Relays",
  "quest.7AE90843B7666FD0.quest_subtitle": "Same beam, wetter.",
  "quest.7AE90843B7666FD0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Beam an energy relay and it becomes a \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Laser Relay\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:laser_relay_fluids\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (2,000 CF); beam that one for an item relay, and that one again for an energy relay. Fluid relays move up to 10,000 mB/t between tanks; set to drain only, they pull by themselves.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.14FA2F8C469F7112.title": "Item relays and the interface",
  "quest.14FA2F8C469F7112.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Item Laser Relay\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:laser_relay_item\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" beside each chest joins their slots; an \"},{\"text\":\"Item Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:item_interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" next to any relay of the network acts as one big chest holding all of them. Pipe into it, pull out of it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Hopping Item Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:hopping_item_interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", crafted from a plain one, pushes and pulls like a hopper on its own.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A compass sets an item relay's priority: right-click raises it, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click lowers it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.737922A7C214A880.title": "Advanced Item Laser Relay",
  "quest.737922A7C214A880.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An item relay, an advanced coil and a black quartz. Its window keeps an allow or block list for what goes into its container and another for what comes out; an \"},{\"text\":\"Item Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (iron bars around a black quartz) widens one list slot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.30630C6BDF12D03A.title": "Engineer's Goggles",
  "quest.30630C6BDF12D03A.quest_subtitle": "See the beams nobody else sees.",
  "quest.30630C6BDF12D03A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Restonia over glass between two iron bars. Worn, they show relay modifiers and the beams the Invisibility modifier hides; the \"},{\"text\":\"Infrared\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:engineers_goggles_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" version, with Empowered Restonia, also outlines nearby creatures through walls.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.339806A25E363ED1.title": "Longer and invisible links",
  "quest.339806A25E363ED1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Range modifier\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:laser_upgrade_range\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on each end stretches a link from 15 to 35 blocks; \"},{\"text\":\"Invisibility modifiers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:laser_upgrade_invisibility\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on both ends hide the beam. Right-click a relay to fit one, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click to take it off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4458CD1CE2D02A2F.title": "Ender Casing and Connector",
  "quest.4458CD1CE2D02A2F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four ender pearls, four Empowered Diamatine and a black quartz block make the \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:ender_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" every phantom block is built on. Two eyes of ender, two pearls and a stick make the \"},{\"text\":\"Phantom Connector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:phantom_connector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.59C0B0D723A37D0A.title": "Phantom Itemface",
  "quest.59C0B0D723A37D0A.quest_subtitle": "It isn't there. It's there.",
  "quest.59C0B0D723A37D0A.quest_desc": [
    "A chest, two phantom membranes, an Ender Casing and an advanced coil. Right-click a container with the connector, then the face: from up to 16 blocks away, the face now is that inventory. Pipe into a machine with no free sides.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It mirrors one block; it isn't a wireless pipe. Laser relays can't be reached through it."
  ],
  "quest.762848100B32F5F6.title": "Liquid, energy, redstone",
  "quest.762848100B32F5F6.quest_subtitle": "Three more faces.",
  "quest.762848100B32F5F6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two buckets beside an itemface make a \"},{\"text\":\"Phantom Liquiface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:phantom_liquiface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; four Empowered Restonia around one, a \"},{\"text\":\"Phantom Energyface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:phantom_energyface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; add four redstone for a \"},{\"text\":\"Phantom Redstoneface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:phantom_redstoneface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which repeats its block's signal one way only.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.15210413AF5A5B71.title": "Range Booster",
  "quest.15210413AF5A5B71.quest_subtitle": "Stack them. Up to three.",
  "quest.15210413AF5A5B71.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Restonia, four Diamatine and an Ender Casing. Each \"},{\"text\":\"Range Booster\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:phantom_booster\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stacked straight on top of a phantom block doubles its reach, up to three: a face goes from 16 to 128 blocks.\"}]",
    "",
    "The Vertical Digger and the Player Interface read boosters the same way."
  ],
  "quest.083C6ED31A1FFA4B.title": "Phantom Breaker and Placer",
  "quest.083C6ED31A1FFA4B.quest_desc": [
    "An Auto-Breaker or Auto-Placer crafted with an itemface. Bind them with the connector to a spot up to 3 blocks away (boosters double it) and they break or place there instead of in front; for an empty spot, place a block, bind it, break it."
  ],
  "quest.389BD9D0DC2C95F8.title": "Player Interface",
  "quest.389BD9D0DC2C95F8.quest_subtitle": "Your inventory, as a block.",
  "quest.389BD9D0DC2C95F8.quest_desc": [
    "Five Ender Casings, a wither skeleton skull, two Empowered Diamatine and an advanced coil. It binds to whoever places it: items piped in land in that player's inventory, and CF fed in charges their items, within 32 blocks.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Player Probe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:player_probe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" right-clicked on another player, then on the interface, hands it to them; they get a warning and can break the link by sneaking.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.69AA923D35150556.title": "Canola oil",
  "quest.69AA923D35150556.quest_subtitle": "Salad dressing, but it runs machines.",
  "quest.69AA923D35150556.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Canola Press\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:canola_press\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" squeezes 80 mB of oil from each \"},{\"text\":\"Canola\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:canola\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for 35 CF/t; an \"},{\"text\":\"Oil Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:oil_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" burns it at 40 CF/t, 50 mB every five seconds.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Four oils, one generator: canola 40 CF/t, refined 80, crystallized 100, empowered 120. The better the oil, the longer each 50 mB lasts."
  ],
  "quest.55F0CBD17B8F593E.title": "Refined canola oil",
  "quest.55F0CBD17B8F593E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Fermenting Barrel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:fermenting_barrel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (logs, a canola, an Enori and a wood casing) turns 80 mB of canola oil into 80 mB of refined oil in five seconds, with no power. The Oil Generator gets 80 CF/t out of it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.617DBDDA4B399332.title": "Crystallized oil",
  "quest.617DBDDA4B399332.quest_subtitle": "Seeds in, power up.",
  "quest.617DBDDA4B399332.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The beam turns \"},{\"text\":\"Canola Seeds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:canola_seeds\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into \"},{\"text\":\"Crystallized Canola Seeds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:crystallized_canola_seed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for 2,000 CF. Toss one into a source block of refined oil in the world and the whole block turns into crystallized oil: 100 CF/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.703106A349BB3AEC.title": "Empowered oil",
  "quest.703106A349BB3AEC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On the Empowerer, a crystallized seed with four canola seeds on the stands becomes an \"},{\"text\":\"Empowered Canola Seed\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:empowered_canola_seed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", 1,000 CF per stand. Dropped into a source of crystallized oil, it makes empowered oil: 120 CF/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.125C1EA47BE1591B.title": "Heat Collector",
  "quest.125C1EA47BE1591B.quest_subtitle": "Lava, the patient kind.",
  "quest.125C1EA47BE1591B.quest_desc": [
    "Iron bars, a repeater, two advanced coils, an Enori and a casing. With four or more lava blocks touching it on any side but the top, it makes 40 CF/t with no fuel. Now and then it swallows one of them, so keep the pool topped up."
  ],
  "quest.07D8640C01E4D11B.title": "Lava Factory",
  "quest.07D8640C01E4D11B.quest_subtitle": "Lava, bought with CF.",
  "quest.07D8640C01E4D11B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The controller (three advanced coils, a casing, two Empowered Enori blocks and three lava buckets) makes a lava source in the block above it for 150,000 CF, once four \"},{\"text\":\"Lava Factory Casings\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:lava_factory_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" surround that spot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6B284FCC993DA54B.title": "Leaf-Eating Generator",
  "quest.6B284FCC993DA54B.quest_subtitle": "Munch, munch, 300 CF.",
  "quest.6B284FCC993DA54B.quest_desc": [
    "Four Enori, a casing, two Empowered Restonia blocks, an advanced coil and leaves. It eats a leaf block every quarter second in the 7×7×7 around it, 300 CF each: up to 60 CF/t out of a forest."
  ],
  "quest.5E33AEF7C4464417.title": "Bio Reactor",
  "quest.5E33AEF7C4464417.quest_subtitle": "Variety is the spice of power.",
  "quest.5E33AEF7C4464417.quest_desc": [
    "Six Empowered Enori, two iron casings and a sapling. It burns seeds, crops and food from its eight slots, and the more different kinds it holds at once, the more CF it makes."
  ],
  "quest.28E5525DD1530141.title": "Coal in bite sizes",
  "quest.28E5525DD1530141.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A coal splits into eight \"},{\"text\":\"Tiny Coal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:tiny_coal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (charcoal into Tiny Charcoal), each burning just long enough to smelt one item. A tiny coal on a stick makes two \"},{\"text\":\"Tiny Torches\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:tiny_torch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2F0A53A8F1D988B3.title": "Farmer",
  "quest.2F0A53A8F1D988B3.quest_subtitle": "Tills, plants, harvests, repeats.",
  "quest.2F0A53A8F1D988B3.quest_desc": [
    "Four Enori crystal blocks, four seeds and an iron casing. It farms a 9×9 in front of it: tills, plants from its left slots and harvests into its right ones, 350 CF to plant and 250 to harvest a crop. Cactus and cane want sand, nether wart soul sand.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Melons and pumpkins get a checkerboard of empty spaces to grow into."
  ],
  "quest.3D0F5CD17730685D.title": "Shrink the field",
  "quest.3D0F5CD17730685D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click the Farmer with a \"},{\"text\":\"Compass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:compass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to cycle its area: 1×1, 3×3, 5×5, 7×7, 9×9. Handy for a single row or a small bed.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.41A47CA16AEAAB6D.title": "Greenhouse Glass",
  "quest.41A47CA16AEAAB6D.quest_subtitle": "Sunlight, concentrated.",
  "quest.41A47CA16AEAAB6D.quest_desc": [
    "Four glass, four saplings and an Empowered Palis make two. In daylight, with open sky above it, each one now and then bonemeals the first growing plant below."
  ],
  "quest.7F50C8FB252ED9C6.title": "Automatic Feeder",
  "quest.7F50C8FB252ED9C6.quest_subtitle": "Room service for cows.",
  "quest.7F50C8FB252ED9C6.quest_desc": [
    "Planks, two golden carrots, two basic coils and a wood casing. Set in a pen with wheat, seeds or carrots inside, it feeds the animals every five seconds and stops by itself once 30 are around."
  ],
  "quest.46684B1D0B9DBF53.title": "Worms",
  "quest.46684B1D0B9DBF53.quest_subtitle": "Early birds, look away.",
  "quest.46684B1D0B9DBF53.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tilling a grass block with a hoe turns up a \"},{\"text\":\"Worm\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:worm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one time in twenty. Set on dirt or grass, it tills and waters the 3×3 around it and makes what grows there grow faster.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click water with a bowl for a \"},{\"text\":\"Bowl of Water\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:water_bowl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it places water like a bucket, but move carelessly and it spills; sneaking keeps it steady.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2EDEBCAFB2808A31.title": "Flax and rice",
  "quest.2EDEBCAFB2808A31.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Ripe \"},{\"text\":\"Flax\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:flax_seeds\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" gives two to six string: a renewable bowstring patch. Wild rice grows beside water; this pack unifies its rice into Farmer's Delight's.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Garden Cloche\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"29ABDA7768135140\"}},{\"text\":\" grows canola, coffee, flax and rice as well.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1A238FF74011D248.title": "Auto-Breaker and Auto-Placer",
  "quest.1A238FF74011D248.quest_subtitle": "One takes, one gives.",
  "quest.1A238FF74011D248.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Seven cobblestone and a basic coil, plus a Void crystal for the \"},{\"text\":\"Auto-Breaker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:breaker\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or a Palis for the \"},{\"text\":\"Auto-Placer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:placer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". No power: every 15 ticks one breaks the block in front, the other places one from its nine slots.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A redstone signal pauses them; a redstone torch switches them to pulse mode. Three breakers and a Void make a \"},{\"text\":\"Long-Range Breaker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:long_range_breaker\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which clears up to 8 blocks ahead at 5 CF a block.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.33A7667DD917B412.title": "Fluid Collector and Placer",
  "quest.33A7667DD917B412.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A breaker between two buckets makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Collector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:fluid_collector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which drinks the source block in front of it, a bucket at a time; a placer between two buckets makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Placer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:fluid_placer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which spends 1,000 mB to set one down.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.25E50789A57729E7.title": "Energizer",
  "quest.25E50789A57729E7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Restonia, two advanced coils and an iron casing. A drill, ring or battery put in it charges at up to 1,000 CF/t; the \"},{\"text\":\"Enervator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:enervator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", with two Restonia instead of four, drains them back out.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.63A3335C52F9C291.title": "Drill",
  "quest.63A3335C52F9C291.quest_subtitle": "Pickaxe and shovel, on a battery.",
  "quest.63A3335C52F9C291.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Drill Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:drill_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (four Enori, four basic coils and a Restonia) under three diamonds, between two advanced coils, over three Enori. It never breaks and digs like a netherite pickaxe and shovel, for 100 CF a block out of 250,000.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hold it, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click to open its augment slots. Any dye beside it in the grid recolours it, charge and augments kept.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2BBF987BE9CC486B.title": "Speed augments I to III",
  "quest.2BBF987BE9CC486B.quest_subtitle": "Sugar rush.",
  "quest.2BBF987BE9CC486B.quest_desc": [
    "Sugar around Enori and a Restonia, then around Enori and a cake, then around Empowered Enori and Empowered Diamatine. Each needs the ones below installed; together they lift mining speed from 8 to 45 and the cost per block from 100 to 400 CF."
  ],
  "quest.680E815295C05D91.title": "Area augments",
  "quest.680E815295C05D91.quest_subtitle": "Why mine one block when you can mine 25?",
  "quest.680E815295C05D91.quest_desc": [
    "Diamatine and Enori around a basic coil dig 3×3; Diamatine and Empowered Enori around an advanced coil, 5×5, with the 3×3 still installed. Every block of the hole costs CF, and area slows the swing: half speed at 3×3, about a sixth at 5×5."
  ],
  "quest.0F0FCF873A7D2F3B.title": "Fortune augments",
  "quest.0F0FCF873A7D2F3B.quest_subtitle": "The second one says III. It means it.",
  "quest.0F0FCF873A7D2F3B.quest_desc": [
    "Glowstone and redstone around an Empowered Diamatine block give Fortune I. Glowstone and Empowered Restonia around an Ender Casing, installed with the first, give Fortune III, as the name promises. Each adds to the CF a block costs."
  ],
  "quest.7C844BF362F5C8D6.title": "Silk touch and placing",
  "quest.7C844BF362F5C8D6.quest_desc": [
    "Emeradic and Diamatine around an advanced coil give silk touch, which beats Fortune. Right-click the placing augment (cobblestone, paper, Enori, a basic coil) in a hotbar slot to bind it; the drill then places that slot's block on right-click.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With an area augment in, sneak to mine a single block.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.39A7562BE7ABC1C2.title": "Vertical Digger",
  "quest.39A7562BE7ABC1C2.quest_subtitle": "Digs straight down, politely.",
  "quest.39A7562BE7ABC1C2.quest_desc": [
    "Four iron casings, three redstone blocks, an Empowered Void and a whole drill. It mines down a 5×5 column into a nine-slot buffer, 650 CF a block; in ores-only mode it skips the rest, at 1,950 CF per ore.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Up to three Range Boosters on top double its radius each: 5×5, 9×9, 17×17, 33×33."
  ],
  "quest.7B71F85B50C2D72D.title": "Double Crusher, Powered Furnace",
  "quest.7B71F85B50C2D72D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two Crushers, an iron casing, two advanced coils and cobblestone make a \"},{\"text\":\"Double Crusher\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:crusher_double\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two lanes at 40 CF/t, each ore into two raw pieces in five seconds. The \"},{\"text\":\"Powered Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:powered_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" smelts two stacks side by side at 25 CF/t.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The single Crusher is in the \"},{\"text\":\"ore processing guide\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2B97086271E1EA71\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0CCA0F0E65869349.title": "Triple to Quintuple batteries",
  "quest.0CCA0F0E65869349.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each battery sits on top of the next one's recipe, charge kept: the triple and quadruple take Empowered Enori, the quintuple Empowered Diamatine. They hold 600,000, 1,000,000 and 2,000,000 CF. A \"},{\"text\":\"Battery Box\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:battery_box\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns one into a placed storage block.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.40A913BCC86919E0.title": "Rings and a staff",
  "quest.40A913BCC86919E0.quest_subtitle": "Charge them first.",
  "quest.40A913BCC86919E0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"All three run on CF from the Energizer. The \"},{\"text\":\"Ring of Magnetizing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:ring_of_magnetizing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in your inventory pulls items from 5 blocks, 50 CF each; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click toggles it. The \"},{\"text\":\"Ring of Growth\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:ring_of_growth\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", in your main hand, speeds up plants around you.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Teleport Staff\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:teleport_staff\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" jumps you up to 100 blocks where you look, costing more the farther you go, then rests for two and a half seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5359B925628A19B9.title": "Handheld Filler",
  "quest.5359B925628A19B9.quest_subtitle": "A builder's shortcut.",
  "quest.5359B925628A19B9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two Empowered Enori, a Palis, two Diamatine, an advanced coil and a triple battery. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click a block to choose it; then hold right-click from one corner to the other and it fills that plane or box from your inventory, for CF.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0DAF18BFF9502E9D.title": "Experience Solidifier",
  "quest.0DAF18BFF9502E9D.quest_subtitle": "Levels that fit in a chest.",
  "quest.0DAF18BFF9502E9D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six bottles o' enchanting, two Empowered Diamatine blocks and an advanced coil. Its buttons turn your levels into \"},{\"text\":\"Solidified Experience\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:solidified_experience\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", 8 points each; right-click one to take it back, sneaking for the whole stack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.62B9120AFADC9F6A.title": "Shock Absorber",
  "quest.62B9120AFADC9F6A.quest_subtitle": "Creepers hate this one trick.",
  "quest.62B9120AFADC9F6A.quest_desc": [
    "Four obsidian, four Empowered Void and an advanced coil. Powered, it keeps explosions from breaking blocks or hitting anything within 5 blocks of it, paying 300 CF for each thing it spares."
  ],
  "quest.3E59CE30AE2CC842.title": "All-in-one tools",
  "quest.3E59CE30AE2CC842.quest_subtitle": "Five tools, one slot.",
  "quest.3E59CE30AE2CC842.quest_desc": [
    "The five tools of one material, shapeless, make an AIOT: pickaxe, axe, shovel, sword and hoe in one, from wood to netherite. Right-click strips logs or tills dirt; crouching, it makes paths."
  ],
  "quest.367A492EF422B3F9.title": "Firework Box",
  "quest.367A492EF422B3F9.quest_subtitle": "Every night is New Year's.",
  "quest.367A492EF422B3F9.quest_desc": [
    "An iron casing, a firework rocket, gunpowder, sticks and three Enori. With CF it launches random fireworks around itself, 500 CF a rocket; its window sets colours, shapes and how often."
  ],
  "quest.601ABC2C2406FAD7.title": "A crafting table on a stick",
  "quest.601ABC2C2406FAD7.quest_subtitle": "Portable, and a little silly.",
  "quest.601ABC2C2406FAD7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A crafting table and any sign. Right-click it for a 3×3 grid anywhere; give «Open the Crafting Stick» a key in Controls and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.actualladditions.crafting_stick_open.desc\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens it straight from your inventory.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0CFD2366D954E4A4.title": "Traveler's Sack",
  "quest.0CFD2366D954E4A4.quest_subtitle": "Pockets with opinions.",
  "quest.0CFD2366D954E4A4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"String, leather, a chest and a Void Crystal block. Carried with auto-insert on, it catches what you pick up, filtered from its window. The \"},{\"text\":\"Void Sack\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:void_sack\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (a sack, an ender pearl, obsidian and another Void block) catches the same way and deletes it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.560F1A511C9049FF.title": "Leaf Blower",
  "quest.560F1A511C9049FF.quest_subtitle": "Autumn, automated.",
  "quest.560F1A511C9049FF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Flint, a piston, two Enori and an advanced coil. Hold right-click to blow away the grass and flowers around you; the \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"actuallyadditions:advanced_leaf_blower\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one, made with Diamatine, works faster and clears leaves too.\"}]"
  ],
  "image.47D1D422C673B4B6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The beam and its lenses\",\"color\":\"#8CB8FF\"}]",
  "image.6DE6DDD4F00A1D74.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Coffee\",\"color\":\"#8CB8FF\"}]",
  "image.142B0590D43CF28E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Laser relays\",\"color\":\"#8CB8FF\"}]",
  "image.493F6E1B05D1B802.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Phantomfaces\",\"color\":\"#8CB8FF\"}]",
  "image.2F0A1A5D6E38E0B4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Power\",\"color\":\"#8CB8FF\"}]",
  "image.6752EEA516EC45CE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Farmers and breakers\",\"color\":\"#8CB8FF\"}]",
  "image.46D4C9897157903D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drills and upgrades\",\"color\":\"#8CB8FF\"}]",
  "image.32DA17B1B8CC3E1F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Gadgets\",\"color\":\"#8CB8FF\"}]",
  "image.46BBE5E5436F5C10.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Actually Additions\",\"color\":\"#EAF2FF\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.4CF0F0949366D6A1.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"beam · crystal · empower\",\"color\":\"#8CB8FF\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.2B55D7F72FD032F6.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "chapter.2ABB1BEF574D3E85.title": "Ender IO",
  "chapter.2ABB1BEF574D3E85.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Alloys and binder, conduits nine to a block, the SAG mill, capacitors, soul binding, travel anchors and dark steel."
  ],
  "quest.7DA214A4F9BC59FA.title": "Grains of Infinity",
  "quest.7DA214A4F9BC59FA.quest_subtitle": "Bedrock burns, if you're patient.",
  "quest.7DA214A4F9BC59FA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Light a fire on \"},{\"text\":\"Bedrock\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:bedrock\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the Overworld and let it go out on its own: if it burned 13 seconds, 80% of the time it drops one to three \"},{\"text\":\"Grains of Infinity\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:grains_of_infinity\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and 30% of the time a \"},{\"text\":\"Suspicious Seed\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:suspicious_seed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Deepslate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:deepslate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" works too: one grain 40% of the time, and the block turns to cobblestone. Light the fire in a pit, away from anything that burns.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7E0D175CBBC7CDD3.title": "Void Chassis",
  "quest.7E0D175CBBC7CDD3.quest_subtitle": "Every machine starts hollow.",
  "quest.7E0D175CBBC7CDD3.quest_desc": [
    "Four iron ingots and four Grains of Infinity. The alloy smelter, the SAG mill, the Stirling generator and most basic Ender IO machines are built around one."
  ],
  "quest.1BD93E18D312F8BF.title": "Infinity Bimetal Gear",
  "quest.1BD93E18D312F8BF.quest_subtitle": "One gear to rule the iron ones.",
  "quest.1BD93E18D312F8BF.quest_desc": [
    "Four iron ingots, four iron nuggets and a grain in the middle. Each of the first machines takes two.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The pack unifies iron gears into this one: Industrial Foregoing's recipe, four iron ingots around an empty middle, hands it out too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0E115DD749F11524.title": "Basic Capacitor",
  "quest.0E115DD749F11524.quest_subtitle": "No capacitor, no work.",
  "quest.0E115DD749F11524.quest_desc": [
    "Two grains, a copper ingot and four gold nuggets. Machines with a capacitor slot don't run without one, and its level sets how fast they work and how much they buffer."
  ],
  "quest.6676A6EF8CFE49DE.title": "Stirling Generator",
  "quest.6676A6EF8CFE49DE.quest_subtitle": "Coal in, micro infinity out.",
  "quest.6676A6EF8CFE49DE.quest_desc": [
    "Furnace fuel in, 40 µI per tick out; µI is plain FE. With a basic capacitor a piece of coal lasts 30 seconds, 24,000 µI, and it only lights new fuel while its buffer has room.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A double-layer capacitor doubles the output and stretches each fuel 20%; an octadic triples it and stretches it 40%.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.64098CFB83DA95CD.title": "Alloy Smelter",
  "quest.64098CFB83DA95CD.quest_subtitle": "Three slots, one ingot.",
  "quest.64098CFB83DA95CD.quest_desc": [
    "Three furnaces, two gears, iron and obsidian around a void chassis. Up to three ingredients melt into an alloy, and it runs furnace recipes too: its mode switches between alloys, smelting or both.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"At 20 µI per tick a basic smelter makes two conductive alloy ingots in 8 seconds; with a double-layer capacitor, in 2.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.33ED3C018BECFAAB.title": "Conductive Alloy",
  "quest.33ED3C018BECFAAB.quest_subtitle": "Iron and copper, finally together.",
  "quest.33ED3C018BECFAAB.quest_desc": [
    "An iron ingot and a copper ingot make two. It goes into every energy, item and fluid conduit, the painting machine, the chargers and the advanced capacitor banks."
  ],
  "quest.309EAE8E4ACFFE7B.title": "Energetic Alloy",
  "quest.309EAE8E4ACFFE7B.quest_subtitle": "Gold with a spark in it.",
  "quest.309EAE8E4ACFFE7B.quest_desc": [
    "Conductive alloy, a gold ingot and redstone make two. The double-layer capacitor, the energized gear of the soul machines and the second tier of conduits are built on it."
  ],
  "quest.7413DB129100FEFE.title": "Double-Layer Capacitor",
  "quest.7413DB129100FEFE.quest_subtitle": "Twice the level, four times the pace.",
  "quest.7413DB129100FEFE.quest_desc": [
    "Two basic capacitors, two energetic alloy ingots and coal dust. A machine's draw and buffer grow with the square of its capacitor's level while each job costs the same energy: at level 2 it works four times as fast.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Coal dust comes from the SAG mill: one piece of coal gives one, and a second 10% of the time.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0232182B4E70EC0E.title": "Vibrant Alloy",
  "quest.0232182B4E70EC0E.quest_subtitle": "It hums if you listen closely.",
  "quest.0232182B4E70EC0E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Energetic alloy, an ender pearl and glowstone dust make two. Its nuggets around an emerald give the \"},{\"text\":\"Vibrant Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:vibrant_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; the top conduits and the octadic capacitor need the ingot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.76EAC1BDC93AA5BB.title": "Octadic Capacitor",
  "quest.76EAC1BDC93AA5BB.quest_subtitle": "Eight layers, nine times the work.",
  "quest.76EAC1BDC93AA5BB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two double-layer capacitors, glowstone, a vibrant alloy ingot and, in this pack, an \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act V, where the second vibrant ingot was). Level 3: a machine runs nine times as fast as on a basic one, with nine times the buffer.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:enderio:textures/item/octadic_capacitor.png width:48 height:48 align:center}",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Octadics also build the \"},{\"text\":\"Vibrant Capacitor Bank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:vibrant_capacitor_bank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", 4,000,000 µI, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Vibrant Photovoltaic Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:vibrant_photovoltaic_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", 64 µI per tick at noon.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.70FFC2D8E5E40B15.title": "Place a Capacitor Bank",
  "quest.34C474CC7A477F8B.title": "Capacitor Bank",
  "quest.34C474CC7A477F8B.quest_subtitle": "Stack them: they share.",
  "quest.34C474CC7A477F8B.quest_desc": [
    "Four basic capacitors, four iron ingots and a block of redstone: 500,000 µI. Banks of the same tier set side by side share one pool, and each face can show a gauge or push power out."
  ],
  "quest.78145E2B45A44B6F.title": "Advanced Capacitor Bank",
  "quest.78145E2B45A44B6F.quest_subtitle": "Four times the room.",
  "quest.78145E2B45A44B6F.quest_desc": [
    "Four double-layer capacitors, four conductive alloy and a block of redstone: 2,000,000 µI. Two basic banks, a double-layer capacitor and six energetic alloy make one too."
  ],
  "quest.78DA0040032ADA50.title": "Liquid Sunshine",
  "quest.78DA0040032ADA50.quest_subtitle": "Noon, bottled. Well, bucketed.",
  "quest.78DA0040032ADA50.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In the \"},{\"text\":\"VAT\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"121C58CC59F088F1\"}},{\"text\":\", water with glowstone and a sunflower ferments into Liquid Sunshine. A source block of it touching a photovoltaic module runs that module at full output: any hour, any weather, underground, even in the Nether.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A module bound with a phantom's soul wants Liquid Darkness instead: Liquid Sunshine fermented with amethyst and obsidian dust. Each module checks its own six sides."
  ],
  "quest.019C6B4F05FF7D12.title": "Photovoltaic Module",
  "quest.019C6B4F05FF7D12.quest_subtitle": "Free power, weather permitting.",
  "quest.019C6B4F05FF7D12.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Silicon\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6FFD74DD4F169CB5\"}},{\"text\":\", lapis dust and coal dust make the composite; two composites in the smelter give a \"},{\"text\":\"Photovoltaic Plate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:photovoltaic_plate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; three plates, gold, glass, redstone and two basic capacitors make the module: 4 µI per tick at noon under open sky.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Rain and thunder cut it, and modules side by side join into one panel with one output. The \"},{\"text\":\"Pulsating\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:pulsating_photovoltaic_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" module makes 16 µI per tick.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.25C8FD789B52567E.title": "Wired Charger",
  "quest.25C8FD789B52567E.quest_subtitle": "Juice for your gear.",
  "quest.25C8FD789B52567E.quest_desc": [
    "Eight conductive alloy around a void chassis. Any item that stores FE charges in its slot, the staff of travelling and the electromagnet included."
  ],
  "quest.175EF0469BEB8905.title": "SAG Mill",
  "quest.175EF0469BEB8905.quest_subtitle": "Semi-autogenous, fully grinding.",
  "quest.175EF0469BEB8905.quest_desc": [
    "Flint, a piston, two gears, iron and obsidian around a void chassis. Raw iron gives one dust and a second 80% of the time; iron, copper and gold ores give their raw ore and a third more on average; flowers, cobblestone and bones become dyes, gravel and bone meal."
  ],
  "quest.4C653C2D2CF9FA86.title": "Grinding Balls",
  "quest.4C653C2D2CF9FA86.quest_subtitle": "Ball bearings for a better grind.",
  "quest.4C653C2D2CF9FA86.quest_desc": [
    "Five ingots in a plus make 24 balls. One in the mill's ball slot multiplies the main output, raises every bonus chance and changes the power draw, until it has worn through its share of energy.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Recipes that turn ingots into dust ignore the ball and don't wear it."
  ],
  "quest.5E22EBC1D45D8F54.title": "Dust math",
  "quest.5E22EBC1D45D8F54.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Per raw iron: 1.8 dust bare, 2.4 with flint (it works as a ball), 2.7 with dark steel at 70% power, 3.0 with energetic alloy and 3.5 with vibrant alloy, which draws 13% more.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6FFD74DD4F169CB5.title": "Silicon",
  "quest.6FFD74DD4F169CB5.quest_subtitle": "Sand, but smarter.",
  "quest.6FFD74DD4F169CB5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The SAG mill turns sand into \"},{\"text\":\"Silicon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:silicon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" half the time, a clay block into two 80% of the time, and redstone ore adds one to its redstone. The crafter, the solar composite and most Slice'N'Splice parts need it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Any silicon works: Applied Energistics, Oritech and Refined Storage silicon share the tag these recipes ask for.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6E4F85226F32DCAD.title": "Grains without fire",
  "quest.6E4F85226F32DCAD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The SAG mill turns \"},{\"text\":\"Cobbled Deepslate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:cobbled_deepslate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into cobblestone with a 12% chance of a grain of infinity, and a ball's bonus raises it: 24% with dark steel. A deepslate quarry becomes a grain farm.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.51D746C0363F1B17.title": "Crafter",
  "quest.51D746C0363F1B17.quest_subtitle": "The crafting table that works nights.",
  "quest.51D746C0363F1B17.quest_desc": [
    "Three silicon, iron, two gears and a crafting table on a void chassis. Show it a recipe in its grid and keep it fed: it crafts on its own, 3,200 µI a craft with a basic capacitor."
  ],
  "quest.2D284D567AB1DD2C.title": "Part of a balanced breakfast",
  "quest.2D284D567AB1DD2C.quest_subtitle": "Snap, crackle, teleport.",
  "quest.2D284D567AB1DD2C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A bowl, milk, wheat and powdered ender pearl make \"},{\"text\":\"\\\"Enderios\\\"\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:enderios\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Each serving has a 30% chance to teleport you up to 16 blocks away. Eat them near a wall, not a cliff.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.1B49F82FB37AA2F0.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.72370EF5D8B4B9E2.title": "Fused Quartz and Clear Glass",
  "quest.72370EF5D8B4B9E2.quest_subtitle": "Glass you can hide behind.",
  "quest.72370EF5D8B4B9E2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four nether quartz, or a quartz block, melt into \"},{\"text\":\"Fused Quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:fused_quartz\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": glass that shrugs off explosions. Plain glass through the smelter comes out as \"},{\"text\":\"Clear Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:clear_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Glowstone makes either one glow and amethyst makes it block light; eight blocks around a dye tint them."
  ],
  "quest.1A93F83E09C77EC2.title": "Painting Machine",
  "quest.1A93F83E09C77EC2.quest_subtitle": "Every block a disguise.",
  "quest.1A93F83E09C77EC2.quest_desc": [
    "Red, green and blue dye, conductive and redstone alloy, two gears and a void chassis. It takes a block to paint and a block to copy, and returns the first wearing the second's look: stairs, slabs, fences, walls, facades, even a travel anchor."
  ],
  "quest.258C299283890FE1.title": "Conduit Facades",
  "quest.258C299283890FE1.quest_subtitle": "Out of sight, still in the circuit.",
  "quest.258C299283890FE1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight conduit binder around nothing make a \"},{\"text\":\"Conduit Facade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:conduit_facade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Paint it, then use it on a conduit bundle: the bundle hides behind the block you painted it with.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Obsidian dust around a facade hardens it against explosions; clear glass makes it transparent, so even a glassy paint keeps the conduits out of sight."
  ],
  "quest.5D78D666B40ED14D.title": "Disguised machinery",
  "quest.5D78D666B40ED14D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Paint changes the look, not the job: a painted block of redstone still powers, painted glowstone still lights up, a painted crafting table still crafts and painted sand still falls.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3B1B081436182957.title": "Faux diamonds",
  "quest.3B1B081436182957.quest_subtitle": "Diamonds on the outside.",
  "quest.3B1B081436182957.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"You painted a block to look like a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Diamond\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Nobody has to know what's underneath.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.14AF16B81693E52C.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.60147EF5F6F9EE48.title": "Netherite, allegedly",
  "quest.60147EF5F6F9EE48.quest_subtitle": "Richer than rich, on paper.",
  "quest.60147EF5F6F9EE48.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"This time the paint came from a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Netherite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:netherite_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Same block underneath, twice the swagger.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.040D1F33B176CF08.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.467FB019AFE5FA43.title": "Conduit Binder",
  "quest.467FB019AFE5FA43.quest_subtitle": "The glue of every pipe.",
  "quest.467FB019AFE5FA43.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five gravel, two sand and two clay balls make eight \"},{\"text\":\"Conduit Binder Composite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:conduit_binder_composite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; each smelts into two \"},{\"text\":\"Conduit Binder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:conduit_binder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Every conduit is six binder around its core.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.06BDBF18B0055322.title": "Energy Conduit",
  "quest.5D34C9D6A9BFD890.title": "Energy Conduit",
  "quest.5D34C9D6A9BFD890.quest_subtitle": "Nine lines, one block.",
  "quest.5D34C9D6A9BFD890.quest_desc": [
    "Three conductive alloy ingots between six binder make eight. It carries 8,000 µI per tick, and one block holds up to nine conduits of different kinds, each connection with its own screen."
  ],
  "quest.5EC07ABB15BBC805.title": "Pulsating Alloy",
  "quest.5EC07ABB15BBC805.quest_subtitle": "An ender pearl with a heartbeat.",
  "quest.5EC07ABB15BBC805.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An iron ingot and an ender pearl make two. The item conduit takes one per eight, and eight of its nuggets around a diamond make the \"},{\"text\":\"Pulsating Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:pulsating_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" that anchors and vacuums run on.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.125E2AF024654E35.title": "Item Conduit",
  "quest.4CAD7C2A3A85D688.title": "Item Conduit",
  "quest.4CAD7C2A3A85D688.quest_subtitle": "Hoppers, but with ambition.",
  "quest.4CAD7C2A3A85D688.quest_desc": [
    "Two conductive alloy and a pulsating alloy between six binder. Set a connection to extract and it pulls from that inventory, 32 items a second, into every connection set to insert.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Round robin takes turns among the inserts, priority fills the highest first, and self feed lets a machine take back what it gave."
  ],
  "task.06041C3E91B37C5F.title": "Fluid Conduit",
  "quest.3FD5746CCA83F27A.title": "Fluid Conduit",
  "quest.3FD5746CCA83F27A.quest_subtitle": "One fluid at a time, please.",
  "quest.3FD5746CCA83F27A.quest_desc": [
    "Two conductive alloy and a clear glass between six binder. A network locks to the first fluid it carries; to switch fluids, reset it in the connection's screen."
  ],
  "task.06DACD0C2BF4332A.title": "Redstone Conduit",
  "quest.27DD38D5B417A9E9.title": "Redstone Conduit",
  "quest.27DD38D5B417A9E9.quest_subtitle": "Sixteen wires in one.",
  "quest.27DD38D5B417A9E9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Redstone and a copper ingot make \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:redstone_alloy_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; three between six binder make eight conduits. Signals ride on sixteen colour channels, so one line carries many signals.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Paper, redstone alloy and iron make the \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Filter Base\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:redstone_filter_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the start of every \"},{\"text\":\"logic\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7F12844DDDB0A550\"}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"signal\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"417D82DCD738CAB4\"}},{\"text\":\" filter a connection can hold.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.131FA09A79EDDAF0.title": "Any logic filter",
  "quest.7F12844DDDB0A550.title": "Logic Filters",
  "quest.7F12844DDDB0A550.quest_subtitle": "Boolean algebra, one colour at a time.",
  "quest.7F12844DDDB0A550.quest_desc": [
    "A redstone conduit connection has two filter slots: one for what it reads, one for what it outputs. AND, OR and XOR go in the output slot and combine two colour channels you pick; a redstone torch turns them into NAND, NOR and XNOR. NOT inverts, in either slot.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "From the filter base: two redstone torches make AND, two redstone alloy make OR, all four make XOR, and a torch with one alloy makes NOT."
  ],
  "task.382985DAF33C046B.title": "Any timer, sensor, toggle or counter",
  "quest.417D82DCD738CAB4.title": "Timers, Sensors and Counters",
  "quest.417D82DCD738CAB4.quest_subtitle": "A clock, an eye and an abacus.",
  "quest.417D82DCD738CAB4.quest_desc": [
    "In the input slot, a timer filter sends a pulse every so many ticks you type (20 make a second), and a sensor filter reads what a comparator would: a chest's fill level becomes the channel's strength.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "In the output slot, a toggle filter flips with each pulse, and a count filter switches on at the pulse number you set and off at the next.",
    "",
    "A clock, a comparator or a lever next to the filter base and a redstone alloy make the timer, sensor and toggle; four redstone alloy make the counter."
  ],
  "quest.5DD4477B3B2385DE.title": "Conduit Probe and Yeta Wrench",
  "quest.5DD4477B3B2385DE.quest_subtitle": "Copy, paste, switch.",
  "quest.5DD4477B3B2385DE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Conduit Probe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:conduit_probe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" copies a connection's settings and pastes them onto another. The \"},{\"text\":\"Yeta Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:yeta_wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", three copper and a grain, cycles a machine face through its push and pull modes.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Crafting a configured machine, bank or filter alone in the grid resets it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1A8066C2C936454C.title": "Channels by colour",
  "quest.1A8066C2C936454C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each connection has an insert colour and an extract colour, and items only flow between matching ones: two item lines share one bundle without mixing. An extract can also wait for a redstone conduit signal on a colour you pick.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7C1DD4EA390A0EC6.title": "Filters",
  "quest.7C1DD4EA390A0EC6.quest_subtitle": "Bouncers for your pipes.",
  "quest.7C1DD4EA390A0EC6.quest_desc": [
    "Paper around a hopper, or around a bucket. Slot one into a connection and only what it lists gets through; use it while sneaking to set it up as an allow or a deny list.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"advanced and big\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"10D4E2BDD7F0631E\"}},{\"text\":\" filters and the \"},{\"text\":\"limited\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0DD11BACC0E7C89D\"}},{\"text\":\" one come later, from a Z-Logic Controller, comparators and a skeletal contractor or shulker shells.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.10D4E2BDD7F0631E.title": "Advanced and Big Filters",
  "quest.10D4E2BDD7F0631E.quest_subtitle": "For when 'iron pickaxe' isn't specific enough.",
  "quest.10D4E2BDD7F0631E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Z-Logic Controller in paper and redstone makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Item Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:advanced_item_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": 18 slots that can match components, so an enchanted book isn't just any book, and sort tools by wear, from untouched to nearly broken.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Big Item Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:big_item_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" trades both for 36 slots (a skeletal contractor and obsidian dust); two shulker shells around an advanced filter make the \"},{\"text\":\"Big Advanced Item Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:big_advanced_item_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", with both.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0DD11BACC0E7C89D.title": "Limited Item Filter",
  "quest.0DD11BACC0E7C89D.quest_subtitle": "Enough is enough. Exactly sixteen is enough.",
  "quest.0DD11BACC0E7C89D.quest_desc": [
    "An advanced filter between two comparators. Each of its 18 slots holds a stack whose size is a cap: on an insert connection it lets that item in only while the target holds fewer. A furnace keeps sixteen coal and the rest waits in the chest."
  ],
  "task.4DF9D12A6CB6D1B3.title": "Energetic Energy Conduit",
  "task.038F37708A8B5BC0.title": "Energetic Item Conduit",
  "task.68180F6F9B6BDDF5.title": "Energetic Fluid Conduit",
  "quest.70D0180A79EF9172.title": "Energetic Conduits",
  "quest.70D0180A79EF9172.quest_subtitle": "Same pipes, more pressure.",
  "quest.70D0180A79EF9172.quest_desc": [
    "Energetic alloy where the conductive went: 48,000 µI per tick, 64 items a second, and fluid conduits five times as fast (they take fused quartz). A conduit of the tier below can stand in for one of the ingots."
  ],
  "task.73F2B36824C2D65D.title": "Vibrant Energy Conduit",
  "task.73628E5C52F6B911.title": "Vibrant Item Conduit",
  "task.26CF773CEB018726.title": "Vibrant Fluid Conduit",
  "quest.4EFCF3329275B3FC.title": "Vibrant Conduits",
  "quest.4EFCF3329275B3FC.quest_subtitle": "Top of the line.",
  "quest.4EFCF3329275B3FC.quest_desc": [
    "Vibrant alloy: 192,000 µI per tick, 128 items a second, and fluid conduits forty times as fast as the first ones."
  ],
  "task.38DC1709DC204873.title": "ME Conduit",
  "quest.3594C116B270FB8C.title": "ME in the bundle",
  "quest.3594C116B270FB8C.quest_subtitle": "Applied Energistics, tucked away.",
  "quest.3594C116B270FB8C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three Applied Energistics \"},{\"text\":\"covered\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:fluix_covered_cable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or glass cables between six binder make three ME conduits; dense covered cables make dense ones. Refined Storage cables go in the same way, as Refined Storage conduits.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.133BEB322344FFE4.title": "Chemical Conduit",
  "quest.524499B40B4627BF.title": "Chemicals in the bundle",
  "quest.524499B40B4627BF.quest_subtitle": "Mekanism's gases ride along.",
  "quest.524499B40B4627BF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three Mekanism \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Pressurized Tubes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_pressurized_tube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" between six binder make three chemical conduits. Eight of them around an infused alloy become pressurized ones, and eight of those around a reinforced alloy, ender chemical conduits.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Advanced thermodynamic conductors make heat conduits the same way."
  ],
  "quest.773510A63E2A5AC8.title": "Impulse Hopper",
  "quest.773510A63E2A5AC8.quest_subtitle": "It waits for the whole order.",
  "quest.773510A63E2A5AC8.quest_desc": [
    "Conductive and redstone alloy, a hopper and two gears on a void chassis. Its six ghost slots set exact amounts, and once a second it moves those amounts from its input to its output, 10 µI per item."
  ],
  "quest.4419E9DC3558865A.title": "Tanks and the Drain",
  "quest.4419E9DC3558865A.quest_subtitle": "Buckets, industrialised.",
  "quest.4419E9DC3558865A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron, iron bars and glass make a \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Tank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:fluid_tank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" of 16,000 mB; dark steel and fused quartz, one of 32,000 mB. Its slots fill items too: a glass bottle takes 250 mB of XP Juice and comes out as a Bottle o' Enchanting.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Drain\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:drain\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sucks the fluid source blocks under it into its tank, at 10 µI per tick.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4C38BF6AE75BD3CD.title": "Industrial Insulation",
  "quest.4C38BF6AE75BD3CD.quest_subtitle": "A sponge that isn't afraid of lava.",
  "quest.4C38BF6AE75BD3CD.quest_desc": [
    "Lapis dust, wool and iron or tin dust in the smelter. Placed, it clears the fluids around it as far as a sponge reaches, lava and modded ones included, and drains waterlogged blocks. It never gets wet: break it and place it again."
  ],
  "quest.60F9F4CA4CAA8196.title": "Dark Steel",
  "quest.60F9F4CA4CAA8196.quest_subtitle": "Iron that went through something.",
  "quest.60F9F4CA4CAA8196.quest_desc": [
    "An iron ingot, coal dust and obsidian make two in the smelter; two pieces of coal can replace the dust. The sword, the glider, the VAT, the enchanter and the staff of travelling are built on it."
  ],
  "quest.0C06EBFD1EF57C04.title": "The Ender",
  "quest.0C06EBFD1EF57C04.quest_subtitle": "Heads will roll. Seven percent of them.",
  "quest.0C06EBFD1EF57C04.quest_desc": [
    "Two dark steel ingots on a stick: a diamond sword's damage, 2,000 durability and enchantability 25. A killing blow with it has a 7% chance to drop the victim's head, and it's the only way to an Enderman Head."
  ],
  "quest.640920E2BC9B8022.title": "Trophy wall",
  "quest.640920E2BC9B8022.quest_subtitle": "Zombies first, endermen later.",
  "quest.640920E2BC9B8022.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Under The Ender, zombies, husks and drowned drop zombie heads, which the Slice'N'Splice needs; skeletons, creepers, wither skeletons and piglins drop theirs. The \"},{\"text\":\"Enderman Head\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:enderman_head\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" goes into the aversion obelisk and the Ender Resonator.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.055FE15368665A76.title": "Glider",
  "quest.055FE15368665A76.quest_subtitle": "Leather wings, steel nerves.",
  "quest.055FE15368665A76.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three dark steel and three leather make a \"},{\"text\":\"Glider Wing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:glider_wing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; two wings and two dark steel ingots make the \"},{\"text\":\"Glider\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:glider\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Wear it in the chest slot: after half a second of falling you glide, and sneaking lets go.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.614FDF9DEE894FE3.title": "Dark steel blocks",
  "quest.614FDF9DEE894FE3.quest_subtitle": "Tougher than they look. They look tough.",
  "quest.614FDF9DEE894FE3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three ingots make twelve ladders that climb faster than wooden ones, and dark steel bars, obsidian and grains make \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Obsidian\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:reinforced_obsidian_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the Wither can't break it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Dark steel doors and trapdoors open only with redstone, like iron ones, but shrug off explosions."
  ],
  "task.491B4B77A0B66D5F.title": "Any silent pressure plate",
  "quest.01E0AD2C3FF10A52.title": "Silent Pressure Plates",
  "quest.01E0AD2C3FF10A52.quest_subtitle": "Sneaking, now with hardware support.",
  "quest.01E0AD2C3FF10A52.quest_desc": [
    "Wool on top of most pressure plates, Ender IO's own included, silences them. Two dark steel ingots make a plate that only notices players; two soularium, one that only notices monsters. A trap that lets you walk by.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A silent stone or blackstone plate reacts to dropped items too\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\", like a wooden one.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.3636211248CDB818.title": "Any resetting lever",
  "quest.0F323C914FA33BE3.title": "Resetting Levers",
  "quest.0F323C914FA33BE3.quest_subtitle": "Flip it and walk away.",
  "quest.0F323C914FA33BE3.quest_desc": [
    "A lever with redstone springs back by itself after 5 seconds; two, three, four or five redstone make it 10, 30, 60 or 300. A redstone torch inverts it: on until you pull it, off for the delay. A door that shuts behind you, no clock needed."
  ],
  "quest.5129ED4E41F37A2B.title": "End Steel",
  "quest.5129ED4E41F37A2B.quest_subtitle": "Dark steel that went further.",
  "quest.5129ED4E41F37A2B.quest_desc": [
    "End stone, dark steel and obsidian make two, at 6,400 µI. Five in a plus make 24 End Steel grinding balls: ×2.4 on every bonus chance and ×1.4 main output, at 70% of the power."
  ],
  "quest.121C58CC59F088F1.title": "The VAT",
  "quest.121C58CC59F088F1.quest_subtitle": "Home brewing, industrial scale.",
  "quest.121C58CC59F088F1.quest_desc": [
    "Dark steel, conductive and redstone alloy, a barrel and two gears on a void chassis; it needs no power. It ferments a fluid with a reagent on each side: water with meat and crops makes Nutrient Distillation, with seeds and crops Hootch, and Hootch with gunpowder and redstone becomes Rocket Fuel.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Liquid Sunshine clears the sky in a \"},{\"text\":\"weather obelisk\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2C00D6FBBDF5EDB7\"}},{\"text\":\" and Cloud Seed brings rain; Nutrient Distillation and Rocket Fuel feed the \"},{\"text\":\"soul engine\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"730DF7082497C5E9\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7659E93C20581BC2.title": "Fire Water",
  "quest.7659E93C20581BC2.quest_subtitle": "Pour it on bedrock, not on your house.",
  "quest.7659E93C20581BC2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hootch with blaze powder and redstone ferments into Fire Water. Poured on bedrock in the Overworld, now and then it does what a bedrock fire does, no flint and steel needed: one to three \"},{\"text\":\"Grains of Infinity\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:grains_of_infinity\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", sometimes a suspicious seed.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It sets fire to anything flammable around it, like lava.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" On deepslate it drops a grain 40% of the time and turns the block into cobblestone.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3369900C1032C87F.title": "Enchanter",
  "quest.3369900C1032C87F.quest_subtitle": "Pick your enchantment, pay in lapis.",
  "quest.3369900C1032C87F.quest_desc": [
    "Dark steel, two diamonds, a book and a lectern. A book, lapis and an ingredient give the enchanted book it stands for: a slimeball for Silk Touch, an emerald for Fortune, a Vial of the Void for Mending. More ingredient, higher level.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each level costs three lapis and some experience levels: twelve redstone per level of Efficiency, one skeleton skull per level of Looting."
  ],
  "quest.3F95DB3D7CFA5EE1.title": "Soularium",
  "quest.3F95DB3D7CFA5EE1.quest_subtitle": "Gold that remembers something.",
  "quest.3F95DB3D7CFA5EE1.quest_desc": [
    "Soul sand or soul soil with a gold ingot, one per run. Every soul machine is framed in it: the vial, the soul chain, the ensouled chassis and the obelisks."
  ],
  "quest.576BD65CB87BF19A.title": "Soul Vial",
  "quest.576BD65CB87BF19A.quest_subtitle": "Bosses don't like bottles.",
  "quest.576BD65CB87BF19A.quest_desc": [
    "A soularium ingot over three fused quartz. Use it on a mob to bottle its soul and on a block to let it out; bosses and the Warden refuse. Filled vials are what the soul binder works with."
  ],
  "quest.36D3D56CD6539A3D.title": "Ensouled Chassis",
  "quest.36D3D56CD6539A3D.quest_subtitle": "A machine frame with a pulse.",
  "quest.36D3D56CD6539A3D.quest_desc": [
    "Four soul chains, four soularium and a nether quartz; a soularium ingot, two nuggets and two quartz dust make two chains. The Slice'N'Splice, the soul binder, the soul engine, the obelisks and the powered spawner are built on it."
  ],
  "quest.10AD70D063F194D4.title": "Slice'N'Splice",
  "quest.10AD70D063F194D4.quest_subtitle": "Six slots of mad science.",
  "quest.10AD70D063F194D4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Soularium, iron bars, two energized gears and any mob head from \"},{\"text\":\"The Ender\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0C06EBFD1EF57C04\"}},{\"text\":\" on an ensouled chassis. Six ingredients in, one part out, 20,000 µI each: zombie heads give the \"},{\"text\":\"Z-Logic Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:z_logic_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and the \"},{\"text\":\"Zombie Electrode\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:zombie_electrode\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Enderman Head gives the \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Resonator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:ender_resonator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" of the wireless charger; a skeleton skull and rotten flesh, the skeletal contractor of the big filter. Energized gears are energetic alloy around an iron gear.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2623C38525221AD5.title": "Z-Logic Controller",
  "quest.2623C38525221AD5.quest_subtitle": "Brains, repurposed.",
  "quest.2623C38525221AD5.quest_desc": [
    "A zombie head, two soularium, two silicon and redstone in the Slice'N'Splice. The soul binder and the advanced item filter need one; in this pack the powered spawner takes an Ecosystem Capsule instead."
  ],
  "quest.5A78DF7A13BA1B0E.title": "Soul Binder",
  "quest.5A78DF7A13BA1B0E.quest_subtitle": "Put a little soul into it.",
  "quest.5A78DF7A13BA1B0E.quest_desc": [
    "Soularium, two energized gears, a soul vial and a Z-Logic Controller on an ensouled chassis. It pours a vial's soul into an item, and each binding also costs experience levels: that's how you get crystals, tokens, bound modules and spawners with a new mob."
  ],
  "quest.730DF7082497C5E9.title": "Soul Engine",
  "quest.730DF7082497C5E9.quest_subtitle": "Runs on spirit. And lava.",
  "quest.730DF7082497C5E9.quest_desc": [
    "Soularium, fused quartz, two buckets and a zombie electrode on an ensouled chassis. Bind a soul to it and it burns that mob's fuel: a blaze's burns lava at 800 µI per mB, a zombie's or husk's Nutrient Distillation at 1,000, a creeper's Rocket Fuel at 800."
  ],
  "quest.0BCADE43AF94113C.title": "Powered Spawner",
  "quest.0BCADE43AF94113C.quest_subtitle": "A spawner that takes requests.",
  "quest.0BCADE43AF94113C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Breaking a monster spawner drops a \"},{\"text\":\"Broken Spawner\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:broken_spawner\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" that keeps its mob. With soularium, an ensouled chassis, two vibrant crystals and, in this pack, an \"},{\"text\":\"Ecosystem Capsule\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:ecosystem_capsule\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV, where the Z-Logic Controller was), it becomes the \"},{\"text\":\"Powered Spawner\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:powered_spawner\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It spawns four at a time and waits while two of its mob are near. The soul binder changes its mob, and a \"},{\"text\":\"Mind Killer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:mind_killer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on top leaves its spawns standing still, without a thought in their heads.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4BB79B63B2F0F186.title": "Bound crystals",
  "quest.4BB79B63B2F0F186.quest_subtitle": "Minerals with a mind of their own.",
  "quest.4BB79B63B2F0F186.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In the soul binder, an enderman's soul turns a vibrant crystal into an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:ender_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and a villager's turns an emerald into an \"},{\"text\":\"Enticing Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:enticing_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The ender crystal goes into the staff of travelling, the inhibitor obelisk and the weather crystal; the enticing crystal into the attractor obelisk."
  ],
  "quest.02E5F91D7575EC21.title": "Obelisks",
  "quest.02E5F91D7575EC21.quest_subtitle": "Crowd control, soul by soul.",
  "quest.02E5F91D7575EC21.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A soul filter, paper around a soul vial, tells an obelisk which mobs it acts on: up to nine souls, as an allow or a deny list. The \"},{\"text\":\"Aversion Obelisk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:aversion_obelisk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", an enderman head over energetic alloy and soularium, stops them spawning up to 16 blocks away.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It only stops natural spawns, so spawners keep working. It needs a capacitor and power, like the attractor, relocator and inhibitor: a double-layer capacitor doubles their reach, an octadic triples it, and a smaller range in the screen draws less power. The screen can also show the range."
  ],
  "quest.10EAA924300B41A4.title": "Attractor Obelisk",
  "quest.10EAA924300B41A4.quest_subtitle": "Come closer. I don't bite. The grinder does.",
  "quest.10EAA924300B41A4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Enticing Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:enticing_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on top, energetic alloy, soularium and an energized gear around an ensouled chassis. The mobs its soul filter lists walk to it from up to 8 blocks away; slimes and phantoms chase it, ghasts get dragged in, bosses stay put.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7374C26E9ECA287A.title": "Relocator Obelisk",
  "quest.7374C26E9ECA287A.quest_subtitle": "Spawn wherever you like, as long as it's here.",
  "quest.7374C26E9ECA287A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Prismarine on top of an \"},{\"text\":\"Aversion Obelisk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:aversion_obelisk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It doesn't cancel spawns, it moves them: a listed mob that spawns naturally up to 16 blocks away appears within 5 blocks of the obelisk instead. Build the killing floor around it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.40D1D0464F984914.title": "Inhibitor Obelisk",
  "quest.40D1D0464F984914.quest_subtitle": "Stay put. Yes, you too, enderman.",
  "quest.40D1D0464F984914.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:ender_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on top and an infinity bimetal gear in the middle; it needs no filter. Any teleport that starts or ends up to 16 blocks away fails: endermen, shulkers, ender pearls, chorus fruit.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Your own staff of travelling and anchors fail too\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\", so keep it away from your travel network. Only commands get through.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7FA0FE7B6CF3E4F6.title": "Glass with a guest list",
  "quest.7FA0FE7B6CF3E4F6.quest_subtitle": "Monsters only. Dress code enforced.",
  "quest.7FA0FE7B6CF3E4F6.quest_desc": [
    "The soul binder puts a creature's, a monster's or a villager's soul into a soularium or dark steel grinding ball: an animal, a monster or a player token. Eight clear glass around a token let only that kind walk through; a redstone torch inverts it."
  ],
  "quest.053B1DD6C44B6BBD.title": "Night shift",
  "quest.053B1DD6C44B6BBD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A photovoltaic module bound with a phantom's soul works at night instead of by day. Set one beside a regular module and the sun never sets on your power.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.145E2008DDBD786D.title": "Wireless Charger",
  "quest.145E2008DDBD786D.quest_subtitle": "Charging at a distance.",
  "quest.145E2008DDBD786D.quest_desc": [
    "Seven conductive alloy, an Ender Resonator and a void chassis. It charges the gear of every player within 16 blocks; a pulsating antenna on top adds 16 more, a vibrant one 32."
  ],
  "quest.6D2602E31E10A196.title": "XP Obelisk",
  "quest.6D2602E31E10A196.quest_subtitle": "A bank for your levels.",
  "quest.6D2602E31E10A196.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Suspicious Seeds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:suspicious_seed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from the bedrock fire, two soularium and a vibrant alloy make the \"},{\"text\":\"Experience Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:experience_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; on an ensouled chassis it becomes the \"},{\"text\":\"XP Obelisk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:xp_obelisk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It stores your levels, one, ten or all at a time, as XP Juice.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The same seeds, fused quartz, soularium and grains make the \"},{\"text\":\"Vial of the Void\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:void_vial\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it gathers experience orbs for you and pours them into tanks. XP Juice is 20 mB per point, and Create Enchantment Industry takes it too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2C00D6FBBDF5EDB7.title": "Weather Obelisk",
  "quest.2C00D6FBBDF5EDB7.quest_subtitle": "Rain dance, automated.",
  "quest.2C00D6FBBDF5EDB7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two pulsating and two vibrant crystals around an ender crystal make the \"},{\"text\":\"Weather Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:weather_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; with energetic alloy and soularium on a void chassis it becomes the obelisk. A bucket of Liquid Sunshine clears the sky, Cloud Seed brings rain, Concentrated Cloud Seed a thunderstorm.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3048B9DA65FC70F9.title": "Scratched on a soul vial",
  "quest.3048B9DA65FC70F9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The binder never asked whose soul it held. A zombie's hunger turned our gears, a villager's want filled the square. Then Aurelia asked if the light could be bound the same way. —T.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "quest.1406691E2833E3E1.title": "Pulsating Crystal",
  "quest.1406691E2833E3E1.quest_subtitle": "A diamond, wrapped in a heartbeat.",
  "quest.1406691E2833E3E1.quest_desc": [
    "Eight pulsating alloy nuggets around a diamond. Travel anchors, the vacuum chest, the XP vacuum and the weather crystal run on it."
  ],
  "quest.1D4A911B1A08FD3B.title": "Travel Anchor",
  "quest.1D4A911B1A08FD3B.quest_subtitle": "Jump here, land there.",
  "quest.1D4A911B1A08FD3B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron, conduit binder, a pulsating crystal and, in this pack, a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III, where the top binder was). Stand on one, look at another within 96 blocks and jump: you're on top of it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "An anchor you aim at has to be more than 5 blocks away, with nothing solid on top. Its screen gives it a name and an icon, and can hide it: a hidden anchor still works as an elevator stop, but you can't aim at it."
  ],
  "quest.1CBC5CD12D589E2C.title": "Coordinate Selector",
  "quest.1CBC5CD12D589E2C.quest_subtitle": "X marks the spot. So do Y and Z.",
  "quest.1CBC5CD12D589E2C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four conductive alloy, an ender pearl and a compass. Aim it at a block up to 64 blocks away, or use it on one, with paper in your inventory: name the spot and it prints a \"},{\"text\":\"Location Printout\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:location_printout\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with its coordinates and dimension.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Nothing in this version reads printouts: they're notes. Hand one to a teammate to find your anchors; sneak and use it to look at it again."
  ],
  "quest.4C0960D2B324605B.title": "Anchor elevator",
  "quest.4C0960D2B324605B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Stack anchors in a shaft: jump on one to rise to the next anchor above, sneak to drop to the one below. Painted in the painting machine, an anchor passes for any block.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1C31B9A349119E42.title": "Staff of Travelling",
  "quest.1C31B9A349119E42.quest_subtitle": "Blink and you'll miss it.",
  "quest.1C31B9A349119E42.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two dark steel ingots, an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Crystal\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"4BB79B63B2F0F186\"}},{\"text\":\" and, in this pack, a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III). Aimed at an anchor up to 192 blocks away it takes you there; aimed at nothing it blinks you up to 24 blocks ahead.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each jump costs 1,000 µI of the 100,000 it holds: a \"},{\"text\":\"wired charger\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"25C8FD789B52567E\"}},{\"text\":\" tops it up.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.464B32F40AA64FFF.title": "Hands-free travel",
  "quest.464B32F40AA64FFF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The staff and the electromagnet fit the two charm slots. Worn there, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.enderio.travel_staff\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" fires the staff without holding it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.21A75B7236607A5D.title": "Electromagnet",
  "quest.21A75B7236607A5D.quest_subtitle": "Loot comes to you.",
  "quest.21A75B7236607A5D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four energetic alloy, two conductive and a vibrant crystal. Charged, it pulls up to 20 items at a time within 5 blocks; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.enderio.toggle_magnet\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" switches it on and off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.227CE8A025FDAF03.title": "Vacuums",
  "quest.227CE8A025FDAF03.quest_subtitle": "Nature abhors a loose item.",
  "quest.227CE8A025FDAF03.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A chest or a Vial of the Void, iron and a pulsating crystal. The \"},{\"text\":\"Vacuum Chest\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:vacuum_chest\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pulls in dropped items and the \"},{\"text\":\"XP Vacuum\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:xp_vacuum\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" experience orbs, up to 6 blocks away and with no power; a filter picks what they take.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.135564FDD80E7A6E.title": "What the pack changes",
  "quest.135564FDD80E7A6E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Ender IO recipes wait on the Atlas: the travel anchor and the staff take a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (III), the powered spawner an \"},{\"text\":\"Ecosystem Capsule\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:ecosystem_capsule\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (IV), the octadic capacitor an \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (V).\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Three parts Ender IO marks as unfinished stay off: the Farming Station, the Niard and the Ender IO block. The Staff of Levity and the Cold Fire Igniter burn Vapor of Levity, which nothing makes in this version."
  ],
  "quest.06AB35A28BAEDC31.title": "Found in the rubble",
  "quest.06AB35A28BAEDC31.quest_subtitle": "Some capacitors age like wine.",
  "quest.06AB35A28BAEDC31.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Dungeon, mineshaft, temple and stronghold chests hide \"},{\"text\":\"Loot Capacitors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:loot_capacitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Each rolls a base level from 1 to 4, past an octadic's 3, and one random bonus, sometimes two or three: Hot, Efficient, Hungry or Insatiable.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.1993F4C76B5CF7D1.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.56225D9E8536B681.title": "Energetic by the batch",
  "quest.56225D9E8536B681.quest_subtitle": "The smelter's favourite shift.",
  "quest.56225D9E8536B681.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Thirty-two \"},{\"text\":\"Energetic Alloy Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:energetic_alloy_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day. Two smelters in a row, one making conductive alloy for the other, keep up with ease.\"}]"
  ],
  "image.729879EF23EBF09F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Power\",\"color\":\"#D6E0E4\"}]",
  "image.11D6A9D6BE1B0BF2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Paint and glass\",\"color\":\"#D6E0E4\"}]",
  "image.7BC359FAFE617584.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Conduits\",\"color\":\"#D6E0E4\"}]",
  "image.7748E93585D6CA22.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Crystals and travel\",\"color\":\"#D6E0E4\"}]",
  "image.262F4BA66D9BAB68.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"SAG mill\",\"color\":\"#D6E0E4\"}]",
  "image.78CAB25F9B37A342.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Dark steel\",\"color\":\"#D6E0E4\"}]",
  "image.1EA83E1FF23CEAED.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Souls\",\"color\":\"#D6E0E4\"}]",
  "image.51291033B7BAC1F4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Ender IO\",\"color\":\"#EFFFF8\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.2A8451DF0763E978.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"alloy · grind · bind · travel\",\"color\":\"#D6E0E4\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.1C1528B3CF103AFD.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "chapter.70A0569F0999AF56.title": "Gadgets and Helpers",
  "chapter.70A0569F0999AF56.chapter_subtitle": [
    "A workshop pegboard: furnaces, sticks, gadgets, jetpacks, lasers, magnets, elevators, torches, pocket rooms and villagers, each in its painted outline."
  ],
  "task.73C8D577CB72CAB8.title": "A Copper or Iron Furnace",
  "quest.07AD9C459241C07E.title": "A furnace in a hurry",
  "quest.07AD9C459241C07E.quest_subtitle": "Two hundred ticks is a long time.",
  "quest.07AD9C459241C07E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight ingots around a \"},{\"text\":\"Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a quicker one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Copper Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:copper_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"180\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" ticks an item.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Iron Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:iron_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"160\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\". The vanilla one takes \"},{\"text\":\"200\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every tier has an upgrade kit for the next one, like the \"},{\"text\":\"Copper to Iron Furnace Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:upgrade_iron2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Kit in hand, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click the placed furnace: it upgrades in place.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"It keeps its items and settings.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A vanilla furnace drops what it held first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3B5FFFE461585A6E.title": "What the pack changes",
  "quest.3B5FFFE461585A6E.quest_subtitle": "Read it before blaming the recipe.",
  "quest.3B5FFFE461585A6E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Some helpers wait for the story.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III): the Mining Gadgets, the \"},{\"text\":\"Leather Strap\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironjetpacks:strap\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and the \"},{\"text\":\"Personal Shrinking Device\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"compactmachines:personal_shrinking_device\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Zanite Gemstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"aether:zanite_gemstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (IV) and \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (V): the two top jetpack coils.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:living_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Living Matrix\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:living_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (II): the Iron Farm. \"},{\"text\":\"Handling Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:handling_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (III): the Auto Trader.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"No \"},{\"text\":\"Mega Torch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"torchmaster:megatorch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the \"},{\"text\":\"Altar of Peace\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"25E87DD1392D07A3\"}},{\"text\":\" does its job.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Every jetpack burns \"},{\"text\":\"2.5 times\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" its native energy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.39516BD2BFA84B5C.title": "A stick that builds",
  "quest.39516BD2BFA84B5C.quest_subtitle": "A paint roller, but for walls.",
  "quest.39516BD2BFA84B5C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An iron ingot on two sticks: right-click a face and it grows another layer of that block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Wood \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks a click, copper \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", iron \"},{\"text\":\"27\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", diamond \"},{\"text\":\"128\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", netherite \"},{\"text\":\"1,024\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Blocks in your offhand go down instead of the one you look at.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The blocks come from your inventory, shulker boxes and bundles included.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each block costs a point of durability: \"},{\"text\":\"250\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" on the iron stick.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.27D44B4CD8346A17.title": "Building Gadget",
  "quest.27D44B4CD8346A17.quest_subtitle": "Ghost blocks first, real ones after.",
  "quest.27D44B4CD8346A17.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Aim, check the ghost preview, right-click: rows, walls and floors from your inventory.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click a block to choose what it builds.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.buildinggadgets2.settings_menu\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" for modes: wall, column, stairs, grid, surface.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.buildinggadgets2.range\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" sets the size; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.buildinggadgets2.undo\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" takes back one of the last \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" jobs.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It runs on FE: \"},{\"text\":\"500,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" stored, \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" a block. Any charger that fills items works.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.buildinggadgets2.anchor\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" pins the preview so you can walk around it before building.\"}]",
    "",
    "Red ghost blocks are the ones you lack items or power for."
  ],
  "quest.144026C64EC13947.title": "The strap comes first",
  "quest.144026C64EC13947.quest_subtitle": "Every flight starts with a belt.",
  "quest.144026C64EC13947.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Only the first jetpack uses a \"},{\"text\":\"Leather Strap\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironjetpacks:strap\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; every later one upgrades from the tier below.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Here the strap takes a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III), two leather and two iron nuggets.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Every jetpack burns \"},{\"text\":\"2.5 times\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" its native energy per tick.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Each tier crafts a cell, a thruster and a capacitor from its material.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The recipe viewer lists them.\"}]",
    "",
    "The pack's jetpack files carry that cost, so the tooltip shows the real number."
  ],
  "quest.656441966D4972F1.title": "First flight",
  "quest.656441966D4972F1.quest_subtitle": "Made of wood. It flies. Don't ask.",
  "quest.656441966D4972F1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wear it on your chest, charge it and hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.jump\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"keybind.ironjetpacks.engine\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" starts the engine; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"keybind.ironjetpacks.hover\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" holds your height.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"keybind.ironjetpacks.increment_throttle\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"keybind.ironjetpacks.decrement_throttle\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" set the throttle.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" takes you down; sprinting flies faster and burns more.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wood holds \"},{\"text\":\"20,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE at \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t: about \"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" seconds of thrust. It's for learning.\"}]",
    "",
    "It also fits the back slot, so your chestplate stays on."
  ],
  "task.034E41735056E515.title": "Any Mining Gadget",
  "quest.6E90715BDE070851.title": "A laser that mines",
  "quest.6E90715BDE070851.quest_subtitle": "MK1, MK2, MK3: same laser, new paint.",
  "quest.6E90715BDE070851.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hold right-click and the beam eats through blocks: \"},{\"text\":\"200\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE each, from a \"},{\"text\":\"1,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE battery.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Here every model takes a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III).\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click for its settings: size, range, filters, beam colors.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"MK1, MK2 and MK3 only look different.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The beam reaches \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Claims and protected ruins stop it, like your own pickaxe.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Name it «mongo» on an anvil and it starts with a thud of stone instead of the laser.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.41F61EBCEC886584.title": "The upgrade bench",
  "quest.41F61EBCEC886584.quest_subtitle": "Where lasers go to the gym.",
  "quest.41F61EBCEC886584.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Upgrades are cards made on a \"},{\"text\":\"Blank Upgrade Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_empty\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Put the gadget in the \"},{\"text\":\"Modification Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:modificationtable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and drop cards on its screen; click one to pull it out.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"One card of each kind: a better one replaces the old.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Every active card raises the FE cost per block.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Efficiency cards, five tiers of redstone, mine faster for \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE more a block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"To start a swing the gadget needs the cost of every block in it: a \"},{\"text\":\"7×7\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" face asks for \"},{\"text\":\"49\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" at once.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.43242F93257E8715.title": "Three by three",
  "quest.43242F93257E8715.quest_subtitle": "The whole tunnel, one pull.",
  "quest.43242F93257E8715.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade: 3x3\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_size_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns the beam into a tunnel borer.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A diamond block and pickaxe, four redstone blocks, two ender pearls and a blank module.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Each swing takes nine blocks, at nine times the cost.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Bigger cards grow from this one: \"},{\"text\":\"5×5, then 7×7\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"566EE8BD37A3F3E0\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.14F93D02B33DB840.title": "A Silver or Golden Furnace",
  "quest.13B9E9A40B7B4C87.title": "Silver or gold",
  "quest.13B9E9A40B7B4C87.quest_subtitle": "Shinier, and faster for it.",
  "quest.13B9E9A40B7B4C87.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The next step cooks in \"},{\"text\":\"140\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" ticks with silver, \"},{\"text\":\"120\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" with gold.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Silver Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:silver_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": eight silver on a copper one, or silver and glass on an iron one.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Golden Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:gold_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": seven gold and a gold block on an iron one.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"From here a Generator or Factory augment gets a \"},{\"text\":\"200,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE buffer instead of \"},{\"text\":\"80,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.2EDDD265ACF24D3F.title": "A Diamond, Emerald or Crystal Furnace",
  "quest.3A72662D1BCE6619.title": "Diamond, then a fork",
  "quest.3A72662D1BCE6619.quest_subtitle": "Emeralds or glass: same speed, different wallet.",
  "quest.3A72662D1BCE6619.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Diamond halves the wait again: \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" ticks an item.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Emerald Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:emerald_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": eight emeralds on a diamond one, \"},{\"text\":\"40\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" ticks.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Crystal Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:crystal_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": seven glass and an eye of ender instead, also \"},{\"text\":\"40\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Both roads lead to obsidian: pick by what you have more of.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"From diamond up every furnace stores \"},{\"text\":\"1,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE for its augments.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.23C731621B169E15.title": "An Obsidian or Netherite Furnace",
  "quest.0EA155881E0E6922.title": "Obsidian and netherite",
  "quest.0EA155881E0E6922.quest_subtitle": "Faster than the hopper feeding it.",
  "quest.0EA155881E0E6922.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The top of the ladder: \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" ticks in obsidian, \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" in netherite.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Obsidian Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:obsidian_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four obsidian and four blaze rods on an emerald or crystal one.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Netherite Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:netherite_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four netherite ingots, magma cream and soul sand on an obsidian one.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Netherite smelts \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" items a second and a hopper moves \"},{\"text\":\"2.5\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\": feed it with pipes.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.66EAE4270BBF1EBF.title": "A Speed or Fuel Efficiency Augment",
  "quest.5913F7843E872144.title": "Fast or thrifty",
  "quest.5913F7843E872144.quest_subtitle": "The green slot is a trade-off.",
  "quest.5913F7843E872144.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Augments sit in three colored slots; green trades time for fuel.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:augment_speed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Augment: Speed\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:augment_speed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"half\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" the cook time, \"},{\"text\":\"twice\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" the fuel.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:augment_fuel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Augment: Fuel Efficiency\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:augment_fuel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": fuel lasts \"},{\"text\":\"twice\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" as long, cooking is \"},{\"text\":\"25%\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" slower.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Right-click a placed furnace with an augment and it goes into its slot.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Red takes \"},{\"text\":\"Augment: Blasting\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:augment_blasting\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or \"},{\"text\":\"Augment: Smoking\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:augment_smoking\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": only those recipes run.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.0C93B7F2E4E66448.title": "A Generator or Factory Augment",
  "quest.3E540D6EE95C6A3A.title": "The blue slot",
  "quest.3E540D6EE95C6A3A.quest_subtitle": "A furnace that pays the power bill.",
  "quest.3E540D6EE95C6A3A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blue changes what the furnace is.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:augment_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Augment: Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:augment_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": fuel becomes FE, \"},{\"text\":\"40\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"1,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t by tier. No more smelting.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:augment_factory\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Augment: Factory\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:augment_factory\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": six items at once, heated with FE instead of fuel.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A generator with Blasting burns gems and ingots (a diamond is \"},{\"text\":\"500,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE).\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"With Smoking, food.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Heat Transmitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:heater\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes FE and heats every \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Heat Receiver\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:item_heater\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" bound to it.\"}]",
    "",
    "The receiver sits in the fuel slot of an iron-tier furnace or better."
  ],
  "quest.353C13B38B172835.title": "Every furnace at once",
  "quest.353C13B38B172835.quest_subtitle": "One of each, and it means it.",
  "quest.353C13B38B172835.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Rainbow Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:million_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is built from a full set of furnaces.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:rainbow_plating\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Rainbow Plating\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:rainbow_plating\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": one furnace of each of eight tiers makes eight.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Rainbow Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:rainbow_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two netherite furnaces and seven colors of stained glass.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"As a generator it makes \"},{\"text\":\"50,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t, only while its owner is online.\"}]",
    "",
    "It also needs a running generator of every other furnace type, none of them full.",
    "",
    "You can only have one. Its tooltip suggests blowing it up."
  ],
  "quest.6347C8AB1A2CA323.title": "Taste the rainbow",
  "quest.6347C8AB1A2CA323.quest_subtitle": "The tooltip asked nicely.",
  "quest.6347C8AB1A2CA323.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Catch the Rainbow Furnace in an explosion and it leaves \"},{\"text\":\"Rainbow Coal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironfurnaces:rainbow_coal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", thrown six blocks up.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"It burns \"},{\"text\":\"5,120\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" times and returns to the fuel slot after each one.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.72515F4E3EB28687.title": "Secret found",
  "task.433AE471696A083C.title": "Any stick template",
  "quest.47F76B1DDED4A67B.title": "Smithing a better stick",
  "quest.47F76B1DDED4A67B.quest_subtitle": "One of them is a potato battery.",
  "quest.47F76B1DDED4A67B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four glass make each template; a smithing table fits it with one extra item.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"constructionstick:template_angel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Angel Stick Template\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"constructionstick:template_angel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": builds past the face, or in mid-air. Feather.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"constructionstick:template_replacement\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Replacement Stick Template\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"constructionstick:template_replacement\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": swaps a face for your offhand block. Ender pearl.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"constructionstick:template_destruction\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Destruction Stick Template\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"constructionstick:template_destruction\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": voids blocks, \"},{\"text\":\"81\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" with netherite. Redstone block.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"constructionstick:template_battery\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Battery Template\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"constructionstick:template_battery\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": FE instead of durability. A potato in the template, a copper block on the stick.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"constructionstick:template_unbreakable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Unbreakable Template\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"constructionstick:template_unbreakable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": never wears out. A nether star in it, crying obsidian on the stick.\"}]",
    "",
    "Pick among installed upgrades in the stick's options."
  ],
  "task.11BB0CB3B0A9A3E4.title": "A Diamond or Netherite Stick",
  "quest.48A3C0841BD983AB.title": "Walls in one click",
  "quest.48A3C0841BD983AB.quest_subtitle": "A thousand blocks, zero scaffolding.",
  "quest.48A3C0841BD983AB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The big sticks lay \"},{\"text\":\"128\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"1,024\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks per click.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Diamond lasts \"},{\"text\":\"1,561\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks, netherite \"},{\"text\":\"2,031\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Nothing lands farther than \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks from you, whatever the stick.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Like any tool they obey claims: another team's land refuses them."
  ],
  "quest.74D71001879B728E.title": "Bind the stick's keys",
  "quest.74D71001879B728E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every Construction Sticks key starts unbound: set them in Controls.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Show Previous\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\", now \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.constructionstick.show_previous\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\": outlines your last placements in green.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Undo\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\", now \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.constructionstick.undo\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\": while you look at them, takes that job back.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Options\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\", now \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.constructionstick.open_gui\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\": direction lock, matching, replacement, random.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Undo keeps your last \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" jobs and returns the items.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"After Destruction it puts the blocks back.\"}]",
    "",
    "Random mixes the blocks of your hotbar: an instant cobblestone-and-andesite floor."
  ],
  "quest.0E28AE23180556A5.title": "Swap, don't rebuild",
  "quest.0E28AE23180556A5.quest_subtitle": "Renovation without a hammer.",
  "quest.0E28AE23180556A5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Exchanging Gadget\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"buildinggadgets2:gadget_exchanging\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" swaps standing blocks for the one you chose.\"}]",
    "",
    "Air stays air.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The blocks it removes come back to you.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE a block, \"},{\"text\":\"500,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" stored.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Enchant it with Silk Touch, or grass comes back as dirt.",
    "",
    "Undo needs the old blocks in your inventory: swap grass for bricks and you need that grass to go back."
  ],
  "quest.367480B8CD33C733.title": "Copy a house",
  "quest.367480B8CD33C733.quest_subtitle": "The same house, twice.",
  "quest.367480B8CD33C733.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In copy mode, right-click one corner, then \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click the opposite one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"In paste mode a ghost of the copy follows your aim; right-click builds it from your inventory.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The materials list in its menu shows what you have and what's missing.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Copying is free.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Pasting costs \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE a block, from \"},{\"text\":\"1,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" stored.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Replace mode also overwrites what's in the way, and those blocks are voided.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1815847FD7276ACD.title": "Save it on paper",
  "quest.1815847FD7276ACD.quest_subtitle": "Blueprints you can email.",
  "quest.1815847FD7276ACD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Template Manager\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"buildinggadgets2:template_manager\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" saves a Copy Paste Gadget's copy onto paper, as a named template.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Load puts a template back on the gadget.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Its preview spins in 3D, or lists the materials.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Copy sends the template to your clipboard as text and Paste reads one back: houses can travel between worlds."
  ],
  "quest.5B74361A3FD8E860.title": "Move a building",
  "quest.5B74361A3FD8E860.quest_subtitle": "Moving day, minus the boxes.",
  "quest.5B74361A3FD8E860.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Cut Paste Gadget\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"buildinggadgets2:gadget_cut_paste\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" moves a whole structure, chests and machines with their contents.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Mark it like a copy; nothing moves until you press Cut in its menu.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"It carries one cut at a time and has \"},{\"text\":\"no undo\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"5,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE stored, \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" a block: checked when you cut, paid when you paste.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Cutting again over a stored cut asks first.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Confirm and the first one is gone for good.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.528B3A03659E5153.title": "Clear the lot",
  "quest.528B3A03659E5153.quest_subtitle": "A bulldozer that fits in a pocket.",
  "quest.528B3A03659E5153.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Destruction Gadget\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"buildinggadgets2:gadget_destruction\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" erases a box you size in its menu, measured from the face you look at.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The blocks are \"},{\"text\":\"voided\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\": no drops.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Undo puts them all back, free.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"2,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE stored, \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" a block.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5E8ECEB07E12638F.title": "Where gadgets stop",
  "quest.5E8ECEB07E12638F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Gadgets act as you: where you can't break or place, neither can they.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"That goes for building gadgets, sticks and the Mining Gadget.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Other teams' claims refuse them.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"So do Heliodor's ruins, and Solsticio outside your team's plot.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4B9A233F8902A3E1.title": "A Copper Jetpack",
  "quest.14F709EB3AD13C5F.title": "Tier 1: stone or copper",
  "quest.14F709EB3AD13C5F.quest_subtitle": "A stone jetpack. Yes, stone.",
  "quest.14F709EB3AD13C5F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tier \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" upgrades the wooden jetpack: the recipe puts it in the middle and keeps its charge.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Stone\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"100,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE, \"},{\"text\":\"175\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Copper\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"250,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE, \"},{\"text\":\"213\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t, and a faster climb.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Both are tier \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", and either one upgrades into tier \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.74EC13BCAEE7639F.title": "An Iron Jetpack",
  "quest.3EF09F7D14B03B68.title": "Tier 2: iron, bronze, silver",
  "quest.3EF09F7D14B03B68.quest_subtitle": "Gold goes into the coils now.",
  "quest.3EF09F7D14B03B68.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"From tier \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" the parts want an \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironjetpacks:advanced_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": gold, redstone and a stick.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Iron or bronze\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"800,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE, \"},{\"text\":\"300\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Silver\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"1,200,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE, \"},{\"text\":\"375\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.38AD941B1F6CA665.title": "A Gold Jetpack",
  "quest.62146C1414AEBD71.title": "Tier 3: gold and alloys",
  "quest.62146C1414AEBD71.quest_subtitle": "Millions of FE, same coils.",
  "quest.62146C1414AEBD71.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tier \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" reaches millions: gold, electrum, invar or steel, still on advanced coils.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Gold or electrum\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"10,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE, \"},{\"text\":\"750\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" or \"},{\"text\":\"775\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Invar or steel\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"12,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE, \"},{\"text\":\"875\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Steel comes from Mekanism or Immersive Engineering, among others.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Invar only from Modern Industrialization.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4C16A231E5615FEB.title": "A Diamond Jetpack",
  "quest.1D92B4FDC73E4492.title": "Tier 4: diamond or platinum",
  "quest.1D92B4FDC73E4492.quest_subtitle": "The Aether pays for this one.",
  "quest.1D92B4FDC73E4492.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tier \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" needs the \"},{\"text\":\"Elite Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironjetpacks:elite_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which here takes a \"},{\"text\":\"Zanite Gemstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"aether:zanite_gemstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV) with its diamonds.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Diamond\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"30,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE, \"},{\"text\":\"1,625\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Platinum\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"36,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE, \"},{\"text\":\"1,800\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Platinum comes from Modern Industrialization or Oritech."
  ],
  "task.6D75F5E4A3D3BAB8.title": "An Emerald Jetpack",
  "quest.59C28409ECA46D8A.title": "Tier 5: emerald",
  "quest.59C28409ECA46D8A.quest_subtitle": "Six times the wooden climb.",
  "quest.59C28409ECA46D8A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Ultimate Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ironjetpacks:ultimate_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act V) to its emeralds.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Emerald\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"48,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE at \"},{\"text\":\"2,200\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The fastest climb in the mod, almost six times the wooden one.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Sprinting doubles its forward speed and quadruples the burn."
  ],
  "quest.01F03FFDEEA4A0CD.title": "Reach and reserve",
  "quest.01F03FFDEEA4A0CD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two cards for long shifts.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_range_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade: Range, Tier 1\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_range_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks of beam, then \"},{\"text\":\"15\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_battery_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade: Battery, Tier 1\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_battery_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"2,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE, then \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" million.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Batteries are quartz.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Range cards are lapis and glass with diamonds, then emeralds.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.663FCEC15083227A.title": "A Fortune or Silk Touch card",
  "quest.548882DDB93EA24E.title": "Fortune or silk",
  "quest.548882DDB93EA24E.quest_subtitle": "One enchantment per swing.",
  "quest.548882DDB93EA24E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The beam can enchant what it mines, one way at a time.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_fortune_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade: Fortune, Tier 1\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_fortune_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three tiers of lapis blocks with iron, gold, then diamonds.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_silk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade: Silk touch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_silk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": slime and a golden apple.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Install both and the second one arrives switched off.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Swap them in the settings.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fortune adds \"},{\"text\":\"30\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE a block; silk, \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.5260EEAB627C193E.title": "A Magnet, Void Junk, Freezing or Light Placer card",
  "quest.4814701AE8CF7159.title": "Tricks of the trade",
  "quest.4814701AE8CF7159.quest_subtitle": "A tidy mine is a happy mine.",
  "quest.4814701AE8CF7159.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four cards that keep a mine tidy.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_magnet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade: Magnet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_magnet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": drops go straight into your inventory.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_void_junk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade: Void Junk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_void_junk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": what you list never drops.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_freezing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade: Freezing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_freezing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": water freezes and lava stops, \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE a block.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Upgrade: Light Placer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_light_placer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a light wherever it gets darker than \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE each.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.566EE8BD37A3F3E0.title": "Bigger holes",
  "quest.566EE8BD37A3F3E0.quest_subtitle": "Netherite, meet laser.",
  "quest.566EE8BD37A3F3E0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Size cards chain: the \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade: 5x5\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mininggadgets:upgrade_size_2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is built around the \"},{\"text\":\"3x3\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"5×5\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": a netherite block and pickaxe, two diamond blocks, four ender pearls.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"7×7\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": another netherite block and pickaxe, two pearls and four nether stars.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"7×7\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" swing is \"},{\"text\":\"49\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks: check the battery first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.580411F1188ABEEA.title": "A magnet in your pocket",
  "quest.580411F1188ABEEA.quest_subtitle": "Loot comes to you now.",
  "quest.580411F1188ABEEA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Magnet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"simplemagnets:basicmagnet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pulls items and experience from \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks while it's on.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click it or press \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"simplemagnets.keys.toggle\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" to switch it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"It works from anywhere in your inventory.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Five iron, lapis, redstone and an ender pearl."
  ],
  "quest.2BEB63FBC835D9C1.title": "A picky magnet",
  "quest.2BEB63FBC835D9C1.quest_subtitle": "Cobblestone? No, thanks.",
  "quest.2BEB63FBC835D9C1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Magnet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"simplemagnets:advancedmagnet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reaches \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks, adjustable from \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"11\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click opens it: a whitelist or blacklist of items.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Items and experience switch on and off separately.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It's the Magnet with gold, a diamond, lapis, redstone and an eye of ender around it."
  ],
  "task.37375D0FFB69B6AD.title": "A Demagnetization Coil",
  "quest.6FBEE3052D438B95.title": "Hands off the farm",
  "quest.6FBEE3052D438B95.quest_subtitle": "A no-magnet zone.",
  "quest.6FBEE3052D438B95.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Demagnetization Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"simplemagnets:basic_demagnetization_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stops magnets from pulling items near it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Basic\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks, adjustable to \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Demagnetization Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"simplemagnets:advanced_demagnetization_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": up to \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", with an item filter.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Put one by a farm's drop point and your magnet stops stealing its harvest."
  ],
  "quest.2B856A81E120ECF9.title": "A bridge of light",
  "quest.2B856A81E120ECF9.quest_subtitle": "Sci-fi hum included.",
  "quest.2B856A81E120ECF9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A powered \"},{\"text\":\"Laser Source\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserbridges:laser_source_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" projects a solid beam; cut the signal and it goes out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"On a wall it makes a floor you can walk on.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Signal strength sets the length: a full signal reaches \"},{\"text\":\"14\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Right-click it with a dye to color the beam.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"It cuts through grass and ferns.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Anything else stops it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Seven iron, glass and an end crystal make two."
  ],
  "quest.3EF6B487B1DC98A9.title": "A wall of light",
  "quest.3EF6B487B1DC98A9.quest_subtitle": "Doors that hum.",
  "quest.3EF6B487B1DC98A9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Craft a Laser Source alone and it becomes a \"},{\"text\":\"Laser Fence Source\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserbridges:laser_fence_source_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and back again.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Its beam stands upright: a door or gate nobody walks through.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Redstone switches it: a lever, a plate, a clock that makes it blink.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Laser blocks can't be broken or blown up: switch the source off instead."
  ],
  "task.05818675D3313C21.title": "Any elevator",
  "quest.400261324AFA96E7.title": "Up in one jump",
  "quest.400261324AFA96E7.quest_subtitle": "No stairs were harmed.",
  "quest.400261324AFA96E7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two elevators in the same column: \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.jump\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" on one to rise, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" to drop.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Eight wool of a color around an ender pearl; the colors don't need to match.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Up to \"},{\"text\":\"384\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks apart.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Nothing spawns on them, and you arrive centered on the next one."
  ],
  "quest.113F9BBAEBDCF9D3.title": "A hidden elevator",
  "quest.113F9BBAEBDCF9D3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click an elevator with a block and it dresses as that block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click with an empty hand takes the disguise off.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"With an empty hand it opens its options: face a direction on arrival, hide the arrow.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.63EE3F4EAFDF1CE9.title": "Four elevators, any color",
  "quest.4A1EC74F5013A892.title": "Elevators for the common store",
  "quest.4A1EC74F5013A892.quest_subtitle": "Every tower wants a shortcut.",
  "quest.4A1EC74F5013A892.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four elevators for towers nobody has built yet.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.078A1C5D7D7FE457.title": "Lights you can't see",
  "quest.078A1C5D7D7FE457.quest_subtitle": "A lit cave without a single torch.",
  "quest.078A1C5D7D7FE457.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Feral Flare Lantern\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"torchmaster:feral_flare_lantern\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" places invisible lights in the dark around it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Within \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks, wherever light is below \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"It stops at \"},{\"text\":\"255\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" lights.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Moved it? The \"},{\"text\":\"Frozen Pearl\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"torchmaster:frozen_pearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" clears the old lights: \"},{\"text\":\"1,024\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" uses.\"}]",
    "",
    "Two gold ingots, two glass and glowstone dust."
  ],
  "quest.37C4EEBFD2D7AE04.title": "No bats, please",
  "quest.37C4EEBFD2D7AE04.quest_subtitle": "And no squid in the pool.",
  "quest.37C4EEBFD2D7AE04.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Dread Lamp\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"torchmaster:dreadlamp\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stops passive mobs from spawning naturally near it: bats, squid, ocelots.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"It covers \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks each way, a cube.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Spawners and spawn eggs still work.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Obsidian, glass panes, glowstone and black dye."
  ],
  "quest.520BE2F1996F2E48.title": "Where's the Mega Torch?",
  "quest.520BE2F1996F2E48.quest_subtitle": "Its hook is empty on purpose.",
  "quest.520BE2F1996F2E48.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Mega Torch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"torchmaster:megatorch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has no recipe in this pack.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Altar of Peace\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"25E87DD1392D07A3\"}},{\"text\":\" took its job: no natural hostile spawns in a \"},{\"text\":\"129\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"-block cube while it burns candles.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Sieges, raids and spawners still happen near it.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.0F4C56F5D87D32B7.title": "Tiny Coal or Tiny Charcoal",
  "quest.6F016DE6DB2AFE1E.title": "Coal in small change",
  "quest.6F016DE6DB2AFE1E.quest_subtitle": "Exact change for the furnace.",
  "quest.6F016DE6DB2AFE1E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One coal splits into eight \"},{\"text\":\"Tiny Coal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"utilitarian:tiny_coal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", one smelt each.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"No half-burnt coal for a single item.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Charcoal splits the same way, and eight tiny ones make the big one back.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.026F9EBCE8735E47.title": "Random paving",
  "quest.026F9EBCE8735E47.quest_subtitle": "Taste optional, variety guaranteed.",
  "quest.026F9EBCE8735E47.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Trowel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"utilitarian:trowel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" places a random block from your hotbar with each click.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click switches between hotbar and whole inventory.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Cobblestone, andesite and gravel in the hotbar: a path that looks walked on.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Angel Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"utilitarian:angel_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" goes down where there's nothing below: the first step of any sky build.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.62212F259E7DBAFF.title": "A No Soliciting Banner or a Trader Carpet",
  "quest.362949453C1A0EFE.title": "No soliciting",
  "quest.362949453C1A0EFE.quest_subtitle": "A welcome mat with conditions.",
  "quest.362949453C1A0EFE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wandering traders, on your terms.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"No Soliciting Banner\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"utilitarian:no_soliciting_banner\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" keeps them from spawning within \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" chunks.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"White Trader Carpet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"utilitarian:white_soliciting_carpet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a flower on a carpet, is where they arrive instead of in your face.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A tripwire hook traps the carpet, and the trader dies on arrival. The mod calls you a monster.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Restraining Order\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"utilitarian:restraining_order\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", paper and a lead, keeps them away from you once stamped with \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.434A1097FEB758D6.title": "Any snad",
  "quest.0DD1080DABB46A57.title": "Snad and drit",
  "quest.0DD1080DABB46A57.quest_subtitle": "Typos that grow things.",
  "quest.0DD1080DABB46A57.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two sand make \"},{\"text\":\"Snad\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"utilitarian:snad\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": cactus, sugar cane, kelp and bamboo on it grow faster and \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks taller.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Red sand makes Red Snad; soul sand makes Soul Snad, for nether wart.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Drit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"utilitarian:drit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", eight dirt and a bone, lets grass spread and hurts to stand on.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.021455FE0098BABC.title": "Utilitarian's shortcuts",
  "quest.021455FE0098BABC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Utilitarian adds bulk recipes for vanilla things.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Eight logs make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" chests; five iron and two logs, a hopper.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A block of raw ore smelts straight into a metal block.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Glass, concrete, terracotta and candles can be dyed again.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Logs also turn into sticks, ladders, slabs, stairs, doors and trapdoors in bulk."
  ],
  "quest.03FE117C8AF5AE9F.title": "A slime to go",
  "quest.03FE117C8AF5AE9F.quest_subtitle": "It gets excited in the right chunks.",
  "quest.03FE117C8AF5AE9F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click the smallest slime with an empty bucket and it's yours.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Slime Bucket\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"utilitarian:slime_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" bounces when you stand in a slime chunk.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.0FEBFE5A36AC111B.title": "Secret found",
  "task.485D6DDDA7EA4585.title": "Look at Cursed Grrass",
  "quest.37C6C1D91F8357EE.title": "Angry grass, now cursed",
  "quest.37C6C1D91F8357EE.quest_subtitle": "Don't let lightning hit it. Or do.",
  "quest.37C6C1D91F8357EE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Grass that spreads onto Drit turns into Grrass; lightning on Grrass curses it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Cursed Grrass Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"utilitarian:cursed_grrass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" spawns extra monsters in the dark.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Daylight sets it on fire; Silk Touch takes it home.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.6556A452791B036A.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.5BA77EC956046C58.title": "Walls and atoms",
  "quest.5BA77EC956046C58.quest_subtitle": "Smaller on the outside.",
  "quest.5BA77EC956046C58.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Compact Machine is a block with a room inside; these are its parts.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Eight polished deepslate make eight \"},{\"text\":\"Compact Machine Walls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"compactmachines:wall\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A sticky piston makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Atom Shrinking Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"compactmachines:shrinking_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a plain one the \"},{\"text\":\"Atom Enlarging Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"compactmachines:enlarging_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Both modules also take an eye of ender, six stone buttons and a light weighted pressure plate.",
    "",
    "Placed outside, the walls are a building block you can break and reuse."
  ],
  "quest.0A2BE52F61AC0594.title": "Room sizes",
  "quest.0A2BE52F61AC0594.quest_subtitle": "The core decides the room.",
  "quest.0A2BE52F61AC0594.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Six walls, both modules and one core item make a machine; the core sets the room.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Copper \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", iron \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", gold \"},{\"text\":\"7\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", diamond \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", obsidian \"},{\"text\":\"11\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", netherite \"},{\"text\":\"13\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks a side.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A nether star gives \"},{\"text\":\"45\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"; a diamond hoe, a \"},{\"text\":\"21\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"×\"},{\"text\":\"21\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" field on grass.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.501D0C8BABBCF128.title": "Step into a room",
  "quest.378FA233E5C9F039.title": "Shrink and step in",
  "quest.378FA233E5C9F039.quest_subtitle": "Mind the walls: they don't break.",
  "quest.378FA233E5C9F039.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Use the \"},{\"text\":\"Personal Shrinking Device\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"compactmachines:personal_shrinking_device\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a machine to walk into its room.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Here it takes a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III).\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Inside, the walls can't be broken and beds don't work.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Use it inside to leave.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and use sets your spawn point in that room.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The quick-exit key reads \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mapping.compactmachines.exit_room\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" until you bind it in Controls.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.078A57D9C7E6D9AD.title": "Working inside a room",
  "quest.078A57D9C7E6D9AD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A room is only loaded while its machine's chunk is.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Nothing crosses on its own: use a \"},{\"text\":\"Flux Plug\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5F37A164B3A0D59F\"}},{\"text\":\", LaserIO's Advanced Connectors or an ender chest.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Jade shows a machine's owner and the room it opens.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.090C768610DD6B3B.title": "Villagers in your pocket",
  "quest.090C768610DD6B3B.quest_subtitle": "They complain the whole way.",
  "quest.090C768610DD6B3B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click a villager, or press \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.easy_villagers.pick_up\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\", and it becomes an item.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Placed in a \"},{\"text\":\"Trader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"easy_villagers:trader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", it trades through the glass: no pen needed.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"In its trade screen, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.easy_villagers.cycle_trades\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" rerolls the offers of a villager that has never traded.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Trader restocks every \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" minutes.\"}]",
    "",
    "Villagers in your inventory keep talking."
  ],
  "quest.03FC043325F8BDF8.title": "More villagers",
  "quest.03FC043325F8BDF8.quest_subtitle": "Beds included, privacy not.",
  "quest.03FC043325F8BDF8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two villagers and food in a \"},{\"text\":\"Breeder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"easy_villagers:breeder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a baby every \"},{\"text\":\"60\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" seconds.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The baby comes out as an item.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Incubator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"easy_villagers:incubator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" grows babies twice as fast.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.129F7052FDA2F8EE.title": "A farmer in a box",
  "quest.129F7052FDA2F8EE.quest_subtitle": "Everyone else just watches.",
  "quest.129F7052FDA2F8EE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An adult farmer villager in a \"},{\"text\":\"Farmer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"easy_villagers:farmer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" tends the crop you give it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The harvest piles up in its output slots; a hopper or a pipe takes it out.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Other professions watch it grow and harvest nothing.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.188DE034C5DFBBE2.title": "Cure for discounts",
  "quest.188DE034C5DFBBE2.quest_subtitle": "Zombify, cure, profit.",
  "quest.188DE034C5DFBBE2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Converter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"easy_villagers:converter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" zombifies a villager and cures it: the vanilla discount trick, in a box.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Each cure takes a golden apple and a potion of weakness.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A round lasts about \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" minutes plus the cure.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Reputation is shared, so the discount counts for every player."
  ],
  "quest.3F054CDC9A7334E5.title": "Iron by the villager",
  "quest.3F054CDC9A7334E5.quest_subtitle": "The golem never saw it coming.",
  "quest.3F054CDC9A7334E5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A villager in the \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Farm\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"easy_villagers:iron_farm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" calls a golem every \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" minutes, and the lava below takes care of it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Iron ingots and poppies pile up in its output.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:living_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Here it takes a \"},{\"text\":\"Living Matrix\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:living_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act II).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5D3FA46224B03D71.title": "Trading on autopilot",
  "quest.5D3FA46224B03D71.quest_subtitle": "It never sleeps. Neither do the prices.",
  "quest.5D3FA46224B03D71.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Auto Trader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"easy_villagers:auto_trader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" trades by itself every second, from its input slots to its output.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:handling_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Here it takes a \"},{\"text\":\"Handling Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:handling_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III) and a netherite ingot.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Its prices follow the villager's reputation, cures included.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Carry a villager into Solsticio's trading hall and it settles in: \"},{\"text\":\"half price, for good\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"56F6DFDD05003993\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3F6036E9A5E0AF90.title": "Hang the work lamp",
  "quest.3F6036E9A5E0AF90.quest_subtitle": "Every pegboard needs one.",
  "quest.3F6036E9A5E0AF90.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Somebody has to turn the lights on.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: just a warm glow on the board."
  ],
  "quest.7F191EBA06A8D924.title": "Ring for the lift",
  "quest.7F191EBA06A8D924.quest_subtitle": "Ding.",
  "quest.7F191EBA06A8D924.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every elevator shaft deserves a bell.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nothing to build. Just a ding."
  ],
  "image.4AD7330C2C5D44EF.title": "An empty hook, on purpose",
  "image.21B9B7D772D176FE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"GADGETS AND HELPERS\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.341A9C51A5AEA035.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.3481819F17CAC042.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron Furnaces\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.57077E8DFE1647E2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Construction Sticks\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.717EAEB3007C290D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Building Gadgets\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.722BC657BB91E482.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron Jetpacks\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.742783CF132702BB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Mining Gadgets\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.3670DEF00EF6EC2E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Torchmaster\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.0EDBF1C2C9C34969.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Simple Magnets\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.265FDCD79863B647.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Laser Bridges\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.17A25C8394DCA4EE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Elevators\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.1935835F575BFDAD.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Compact Machines\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.027F9476DCF4B83A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Easy Villagers\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.28EE60DCE61B8C55.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Utilitarian\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "chapter.1D73780D03CDB8CA.title": "Immersive Engineering · Workshop",
  "chapter.1D73780D03CDB8CA.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Coke, steel and a workbench; then one power line, from copper to high voltage."
  ],
  "quest.2B1BA98A994FB367.title": "Engineer's Hammer",
  "quest.2B1BA98A994FB367.quest_subtitle": "Everything looks like a multiblock now.",
  "quest.2B1BA98A994FB367.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two iron ingots, a string and two sticks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Hit the right block of a finished structure and it becomes a machine.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Put the hammer in the grid with an ingot and a plate comes out.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.16C6724941C8D5A0.title": "Plates and wire",
  "quest.16C6724941C8D5A0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two sticks and an iron ingot make the \"},{\"text\":\"Wire Cutters\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:wirecutter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which cut a plate into \"},{\"text\":\"Copper Wire\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:wire_copper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copper, iron and gold plates come out as Create's sheets here: the pack unifies them, and every IE recipe takes them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.62E79350144A921A.title": "Coke bricks",
  "quest.62E79350144A921A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four clay balls, four bricks and a sandstone make three \"},{\"text\":\"Coke Bricks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:cokebrick\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The oven takes \"},{\"text\":\"27\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\": nine crafts.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.16BB750E0B5100BC.title": "Form the Coke Oven",
  "quest.6342BA3BE73211E7.title": "Coke Oven",
  "quest.6342BA3BE73211E7.quest_subtitle": "Slow cooking, industrial edition.",
  "quest.6342BA3BE73211E7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A 3×3×3 cube of coke bricks, hammered on the middle of one side.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Coal becomes \"},{\"text\":\"Coal Coke\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:coal_coke\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", logs become charcoal, and \"},{\"text\":\"Creosote Oil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:creosote_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pools inside: the oven never pushes it out.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.198DDD6970B0D71E.title": "Black gold, the cheap kind",
  "quest.198DDD6970B0D71E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Put an empty bucket in the oven's container slot, or pump the oil out: the oven keeps it but never pushes it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Creosote treats wood, burns in a diesel generator and bakes graphite later on."
  ],
  "quest.1045167B3B74EF65.title": "Treated wood",
  "quest.1045167B3B74EF65.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight planks around a bucket of creosote make eight \"},{\"text\":\"Treated Wood Planks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:treated_wood_horizontal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and the bucket comes back empty.\"}]",
    "",
    "Posts, crates, barrels, the workbench and the windmill blades are made of it."
  ],
  "quest.7F780E719DB499E8.title": "A table that remembers",
  "quest.7F780E719DB499E8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A crafting table under three treated slabs, on four treated sticks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Engineer's Crafting Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:craftingtable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" keeps the ingredients in its grid when you close it, has a drawer for parts, and goes into the workbench.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7FB271D328A5C07B.title": "Engineer's Workbench",
  "quest.7FB271D328A5C07B.quest_subtitle": "Measure twice, craft once.",
  "quest.7FB271D328A5C07B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two treated slabs, an iron ingot, the engineer's crafting table and a treated fence.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"With a blueprint in the left slot it builds what the drawing describes.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"With a tool in the middle it opens that tool's upgrade slots.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.61CECFCE3044B172.title": "Drawing the parts",
  "quest.61CECFCE3044B172.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copper, lead and iron ingots over three blue dyes and three paper: the components \"},{\"text\":\"Engineer's Blueprint\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:blueprint\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "At the workbench it makes mechanical parts from half the plates, plus electronic parts, vacuum tubes and light bulbs, which have no other recipe."
  ],
  "quest.6C49A30A43C4333B.title": "Blast bricks",
  "quest.6C49A30A43C4333B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The price of steel is a trip to the Nether.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four nether bricks, four bricks and a magma block make three \"},{\"text\":\"Blast Bricks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:blastbrick\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Twenty-seven again."
  ],
  "task.112F07CF5A566D95.title": "Form the Crude Blast Furnace",
  "quest.06A796A61550B901.title": "Steel, the slow way",
  "quest.06A796A61550B901.quest_subtitle": "Iron in, patience out.",
  "quest.06A796A61550B901.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blast bricks in a 3×3×3, hammered on the middle of a side.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Iron and coke become \"},{\"text\":\"Steel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:ingot_steel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Slag\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:slag\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", one minute per ingot.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Empty the slag or it stops.\"}]",
    "",
    "It can't be automated: the improved furnace can."
  ],
  "quest.2BE2EAD98ED9C297.title": "Moving parts",
  "quest.2BE2EAD98ED9C297.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The parts that move, in iron and in steel.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Four plates around a copper ingot make an \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Mechanical Component\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:component_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Steel plates make the \"},{\"text\":\"Steel Mechanical Component\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:component_steel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "The components blueprint builds either from two plates.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Iron plates here are Create's iron sheets: a Mechanical Press makes them by the stack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.793BFE553E1E2058.title": "From turning to current",
  "quest.793BFE553E1E2058.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The first electrons of the pack come out of a dynamo.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Redstone, iron, an iron component and a \"},{\"text\":\"Copper Coil Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:coil_lv\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (eight LV wire coils around iron) make the \"},{\"text\":\"Kinetic Dynamo\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:dynamo\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"It turns IE windmills and water wheels into power.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Other mods' rotation doesn't count.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.666D53F2AC1B9BF1.title": "Catch the wind",
  "quest.666D53F2AC1B9BF1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight treated \"},{\"text\":\"Windmill Blades\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:windmill_blade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around an iron ingot.\"}]",
    "",
    "Place it after the dynamo, facing open air: the more clear space, the faster it turns.",
    "",
    "Rain speeds it up and a thunderstorm doubles it."
  ],
  "quest.06A06670E2922640.title": "Power in a box",
  "quest.06A06670E2922640.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A battery you can build at the workshop bench.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four redstone and a water bucket make \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Acid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:redstone_acid_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; with copper, lead plates and a basic engineering block it fills an \"},{\"text\":\"LV Accumulator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:capacitor_lv\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"100,000 FE\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t each way.\"}]",
    "",
    "The hammer sets each side: blue takes, orange gives."
  ],
  "task.6BB67CF5FEF2DD49.title": "String a wire",
  "quest.05A81D1DB02F0938.title": "Low voltage",
  "quest.05A81D1DB02F0938.quest_subtitle": "Birds sold separately.",
  "quest.05A81D1DB02F0938.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copper wire around a stick makes \"},{\"text\":\"LV Wire Coils\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:wirecoil_copper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Click a coil on one \"},{\"text\":\"LV Wire Connector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:connector_lv\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", then on another up to \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks away.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A block in the way breaks it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Connectors feed in or out, \"},{\"text\":\"relays\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:connector_lv_relay\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" only join.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0168B4C9C96BFEAC.title": "Mixing metals",
  "quest.0168B4C9C96BFEAC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two metals in, one alloy out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Two sandstone and two bricks make two \"},{\"text\":\"Kiln Bricks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:alloybrick\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Eight form a 2×2×2 kiln with the hammer.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On ordinary fuel it melts gold and silver into \"},{\"text\":\"Electrum\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:ingot_electrum\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and copper and nickel into \"},{\"text\":\"Constantan\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:ingot_constantan\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two ingots from two.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.75BC7C36CE640594.title": "Medium voltage",
  "quest.75BC7C36CE640594.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Electrum wire makes \"},{\"text\":\"MV Wire Coils\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:wirecoil_electrum\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and electrum ingots make \"},{\"text\":\"MV Wire Connectors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:connector_mv\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four times the LV rate: \"},{\"text\":\"1,024\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t per connector, over the same \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"-block spans.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1FFE721A59721D92.title": "A brain for the grid",
  "quest.1FFE721A59721D92.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One chip, and half the grid depends on it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The components blueprint turns a treated slab, quartz, redstone and \"},{\"text\":\"Electrum Wire\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:wire_electrum\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into an \"},{\"text\":\"Electronic Component\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:component_electronic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Transformers, the item batcher, the current transformer and the redstone breaker all need one."
  ],
  "quest.0570C07787BD0498.title": "Stepping up",
  "quest.0570C07787BD0498.quest_subtitle": "Two voltages, one handshake.",
  "quest.0570C07787BD0498.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A wire only takes its own voltage, so this box translates.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"LV and MV connectors, an electronic component, an \"},{\"text\":\"Electrum Coil Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:coil_mv\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and iron make the \"},{\"text\":\"Transformer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:transformer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it joins an LV line to an MV one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Standard transformers sit on posts. The HV one doesn't.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.20953157B0C5536F.title": "Light metal",
  "quest.20953157B0C5536F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Bauxite sits high, between heights \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"112\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", and its raw ore smelts into \"},{\"text\":\"Aluminium Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:ingot_aluminum\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "HV connectors and relays, and the HV wire itself, need it."
  ],
  "quest.3CE2C97FBB40FB47.title": "Steel wire",
  "quest.3CE2C97FBB40FB47.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One span reaches \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks: the long-haul wire.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Cut steel and aluminium plates into wire; two of each around a stick make four \"},{\"text\":\"HV Wire Coils\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:wirecoil_steel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A span carries up to \"},{\"text\":\"32,768\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"HV can't be insulated. Keep it high and out of reach.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.66E20CE4690CCA57.title": "Insulators",
  "quest.66E20CE4690CCA57.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Aluminium and terracotta make \"},{\"text\":\"HV Wire Connectors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:connector_hv\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"HV Wire Relay\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:connector_hv_relay\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" needs glass that insulates: \"},{\"text\":\"Insulating Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:insulating_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from the kiln (glass and iron grit) or \"},{\"text\":\"Slag Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:slag_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from smelting slag.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.074506465E69FF91.title": "High voltage",
  "quest.074506465E69FF91.quest_subtitle": "Mind the gap. And the wire.",
  "quest.074506465E69FF91.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The last step up: from here the line can carry a factory.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MV and HV connectors, an electronic component, a \"},{\"text\":\"High-Voltage Coil Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:coil_hv\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and iron make the \"},{\"text\":\"HV Transformer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:transformer_hv\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It steps MV up to HV, or LV straight to HV.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"One HV connector moves \"},{\"text\":\"4,096\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t, exactly what a \"},{\"text\":\"diesel generator\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6501E1AE152E3230\"}},{\"text\":\" puts out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The line is ready for \"},{\"text\":\"industry\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"693B56B9AD358543\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.56C0E235A8D6BCD8.title": "Read the manual",
  "quest.56C0E235A8D6BCD8.quest_subtitle": "The first advancement literally says RTFM.",
  "quest.56C0E235A8D6BCD8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A book and a lever make the \"},{\"text\":\"Engineer's Manual\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:manual\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": every multiblock in 3D, layer by layer, with its recipes and the real numbers of this pack's config.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.63232AC715A83A6E.title": "The hammer's side job",
  "quest.63232AC715A83A6E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Raw ore and the hammer in the grid make one grit. Gold and silver grit mix into electrum grit, copper and nickel into constantan: smelt it and you have alloys before any kiln.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.1A89B417D00E8D72.title": "Lead: y -32 to 80",
  "task.374CA01752C6C34B.title": "Silver: y -48 to 32",
  "task.3F845230662ED85B.title": "Nickel: y -64 to 24",
  "task.2C7F71ACAE780D4E.title": "Bauxite: y 32 to 112",
  "task.4BE7C9ADCF866D89.title": "Uranium: y -64 to -16",
  "quest.47A1ECFDC78DB908.title": "Five new ores",
  "quest.47A1ECFDC78DB908.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lead, silver, nickel, bauxite and uranium, each at its own depth: the task titles say where.\"}]",
    "",
    "Bauxite needs a stone pickaxe, the rest iron.",
    "",
    "Almost Unified ranks IE right after Create, so other mods' lead and uranium come out as IE's."
  ],
  "quest.370620B2987FD43B.title": "Industrial hemp",
  "quest.370620B2987FD43B.quest_subtitle": "Strictly for rope.",
  "quest.370620B2987FD43B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Breaking grass drops \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Hemp Seeds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:seed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one time in ten, never with shears.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Planted, it grows two blocks tall, and the grown plant drops \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Hemp Fiber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:hemp_fiber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4195B6C62C7700B6.title": "Tough fabric",
  "quest.4195B6C62C7700B6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hemp fibre, woven into everything that has to hold.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight fibres around a stick make \"},{\"text\":\"Tough Fabric\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:hemp_fabric\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": windmill sails, insulated wire, survey tools, the maintenance kit and balloons.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight around a honeycomb become \"},{\"text\":\"Ersatz Leather\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:ersatz_leather\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which conveyors take as leather.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.782D87D166D2FD93.title": "Soft landings",
  "quest.782D87D166D2FD93.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Land on a cushion and it costs no health.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight tough fabric make three \"},{\"text\":\"Jump Cushions\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:cushion\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; they won't bounce you like slime.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fabric, aluminium rods and a leather chestplate make a \"},{\"text\":\"Collapsible Glider\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:glider\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", an elytra for engineers: frailer, and mended with fabric.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7A427A01ECF4C8A0.title": "Batches",
  "quest.7A427A01ECF4C8A0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The oven cooks in batches: up to \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" coal or \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" logs at once, five minutes for coal, and \"},{\"text\":\"500\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" mB of creosote per coal. Build a second oven before you start waiting on the first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.69019B46EA324FC8.title": "Coke run",
  "quest.69019B46EA324FC8.quest_subtitle": "Fresh from the oven.",
  "quest.69019B46EA324FC8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Thirty-two \"},{\"text\":\"Coal Coke\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:coal_coke\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "Two ovens fed and emptied by hoppers, and you'll forget it's a chore."
  ],
  "quest.42CCE14A2EC05A80.title": "Fuel for steel",
  "quest.42CCE14A2EC05A80.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In the blast furnace a coke burns \"},{\"text\":\"1,200\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" ticks, exactly one steel ingot; charcoal lasts a quarter of that. A block of coke feeds ten ingots.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.43F1084DA3F23C1A.title": "Form the Improved Blast Furnace",
  "quest.0F81B6C555554DD9.title": "Hands-free steel",
  "quest.0F81B6C555554DD9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fix a hopper on top and forget the furnace.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A steel plate on a blast brick reinforces it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Twenty-seven plus a hopper on top form the \"},{\"text\":\"Improved Blast Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:advanced_blast_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Iron and coke go in the hopper, steel leaves by the front and slag by the back, on its own."
  ],
  "quest.333B532EFD4B639C.title": "Hot air",
  "quest.333B532EFD4B639C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Iron sheetmetal, a fluid pipe and an \"},{\"text\":\"External Heater\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:furnace_heater\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Blast Furnace Preheater\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:blastfurnace_preheater\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Up to two per improved furnace, one on each side port, \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t each: they speed up the refining.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.19EF7BC578945909.title": "Nothing wasted",
  "quest.19EF7BC578945909.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Smelt \"},{\"text\":\"Slag\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:slag\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into \"},{\"text\":\"Slag Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:slag_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", an HV relay insulator; four slag make four slag bricks.\"}]",
    "",
    "Crushed, it becomes a gravel that waterlogged plants grow faster on."
  ],
  "quest.7ECE80B5C64FDB89.title": "Concrete",
  "quest.7ECE80B5C64FDB89.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sand, gravel, clay and a water bucket make eight \"},{\"text\":\"Concrete\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:concrete\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A lead plate turns one into \"},{\"text\":\"Leaded Concrete\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:concrete_leaded\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": endermen, ender pearls and chorus fruit can't teleport through it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6FC66E15CFE88934.title": "River power",
  "quest.6FC66E15CFE88934.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four treated \"},{\"text\":\"Waterwheel Segments\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:waterwheel_segment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a steel ingot make the \"},{\"text\":\"Water Wheel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:watermill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It spins in flowing water, faster with more water around it, and up to three wheels share one dynamo's shaft."
  ],
  "quest.622EE9D4CE4B401E.title": "Cloth on the blades",
  "quest.622EE9D4CE4B401E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Six tough fabric make a \"},{\"text\":\"Windmill Sail\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:windmill_sail\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; right-click the windmill to fit one, up to eight.\"}]",
    "",
    "With all eight it turns three times as fast as bare."
  ],
  "quest.030B03014D4055F2.title": "Hot and cold",
  "quest.030B03014D4055F2.quest_subtitle": "No moving parts, no excuses.",
  "quest.030B03014D4055F2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Steel, constantan plates and a copper coil block make the \"},{\"text\":\"Thermoelectric Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:thermoelectric_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Something hot on one side, something cold on the opposite one: the bigger the gap, the more power.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blocks count too: magma is \"},{\"text\":\"1,300\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" K, blue ice \"},{\"text\":\"200\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" K and a block of uranium \"},{\"text\":\"2,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" K.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.50B780D40275F29E.title": "A bigger battery",
  "quest.50B780D40275F29E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ten times the storage of the first one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Electrum, a nickel plate, an iron plate and redstone acid on a basic engineering block make the \"},{\"text\":\"MV Accumulator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:capacitor_mv\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"1,000,000\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE, \"},{\"text\":\"1,024\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t each way.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.331AA361ACB8B24F.title": "Know your limits",
  "quest.331AA361ACB8B24F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Per connector: LV \"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", MV \"},{\"text\":\"1,024\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", HV \"},{\"text\":\"4,096\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t. A wire burns out past eight connectors' worth: \"},{\"text\":\"2,048\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"8,192\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"32,768\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t. Loss grows with length, least on HV.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5FDB4A08FB06C113.title": "Switches and meters",
  "quest.5FDB4A08FB06C113.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cut a line by hand, or read what runs through it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Breaker Switch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:breaker_switch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" cuts an LV or MV line by hand.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Breaker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:redstone_breaker\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" also handles HV, but only redstone flips it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Current Transformer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:current_transformer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in a line reports the average FE/t through it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5C95176D4AF2CDAF.title": "The frame of small machines",
  "quest.5C95176D4AF2CDAF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The core of every single-block machine.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four iron ingots and four treated planks make four \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Engineering Blocks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:basic_engineering\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". They go into:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Accumulators\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Routers\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Batchers\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The cloche\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The logic unit\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6FF1D244B797D182.title": "Crates that travel",
  "quest.6FF1D244B797D182.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight treated planks make a \"},{\"text\":\"Wooden Storage Crate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:crate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"27\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" slots, a comparator reading and a name you can edit.\"}]",
    "",
    "Hold the hammer on it to seal it, and it keeps its contents when broken.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Storage Crate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:reinforced_crate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shrugs off explosions.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.1DEB4688502D6A1C.title": "Any IE storage minecart",
  "quest.7F04D1787B1D35A5.title": "Freight on rails",
  "quest.7F04D1787B1D35A5.quest_subtitle": "Choo-choo, with inventory.",
  "quest.7F04D1787B1D35A5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A crate or a barrel over a minecart in the crafting grid puts it on rails.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Minecart with Wooden Storage Crate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:minecart_woodencrate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" keeps its items when broken, which a chest cart never did, and a barrel cart still fills and empties with buckets.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2A77986568EE89F3.title": "Everything in one box",
  "quest.2A77986568EE89F3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three aluminium plates, red dye and a crate make the \"},{\"text\":\"Engineer's Toolbox\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:toolbox\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It holds:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Slots for tools\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Wiring\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Food\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Anything else\"}]",
    "",
    "Sneak-click to set it down as a block, and again to pick it up."
  ],
  "quest.6416A424C49357EB.title": "Barrels",
  "quest.6416A424C49357EB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One holds twelve buckets; the other doesn't mind the heat.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Wooden Barrel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:wooden_barrel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds \"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" buckets of anything cool.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Metal Barrel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:metal_barrel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" also takes hot fluids and gases, and redstone stops its output.\"}]",
    "",
    "The hammer picks which side pushes."
  ],
  "quest.1EEC49E6F49D96A4.title": "Repairs on the road",
  "quest.1EEC49E6F49D96A4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A screwdriver, wire cutters and three tough fabric roll up into a \"},{\"text\":\"Maintenance Kit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:maintenance_kit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It does the workbench's tool job anywhere: swap the drill head in the mine, retune the ear defenders on the spot."
  ],
  "task.2545037B03BBB219.title": "Buy a shader grabbag",
  "quest.31470A3BB9E83CF8.title": "Paint jobs",
  "quest.31470A3BB9E83CF8.quest_subtitle": "Form follows function. Then it gets a paint job.",
  "quest.31470A3BB9E83CF8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pure style, but it shows from across the yard.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Outfitter sells \"},{\"text\":\"Shader Grabbags\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:shader_bag_common\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": each holds a random shader at least as rare as the bag, likelier one you don't own.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"At the workbench a shader restyles the revolver, drill, railgun, shield or backpack.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click one onto a minecart, banner or balloon.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.54369146F83D7220.title": "Look at a banner wearing a shader",
  "quest.622E64F2F4C6925A.title": "The Outfitter's banner",
  "quest.622E64F2F4C6925A.quest_subtitle": "Now hiring: one villager with taste.",
  "quest.622E64F2F4C6925A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click a placed banner with a \"},{\"text\":\"Shader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:shader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and it takes the design.\"}]",
    "",
    "That banner is the Outfitter's job site, so a villager without a trade nearby can claim it.",
    "",
    "The same click dresses a minecart or a balloon."
  ],
  "task.5F486649A635DFBA.title": "Meet an IE villager",
  "quest.5DCC6AFF9F914661.title": "Colleagues in the village",
  "quest.5DCC6AFF9F914661.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Five IE trades take an IE workstation:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Structural Engineer\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Machinist\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Electrician\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Gunsmith\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Outfitter\"}]",
    "",
    "They sell parts, wire and blueprints, and even maps to mineral veins. Talk to one.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Job sites: a \"},{\"text\":\"Turntable\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:turntable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the Structural Engineer, the \"},{\"text\":\"Engineer's Crafting Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:craftingtable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the Machinist, the \"},{\"text\":\"Engineer's Circuit Workbench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:circuit_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the Electrician, the \"},{\"text\":\"Engineer's Workbench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:workbench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the Gunsmith and a banner wearing a shader for the Outfitter.\"}]",
    "",
    "Villages can generate a house for each."
  ],
  "task.5811F3A9CA334254.title": "Win a raid",
  "quest.5E8E96C4F7D55EF1.title": "Hero of the engineers",
  "quest.5E8E96C4F7D55EF1.quest_subtitle": "Paid in steel.",
  "quest.5E8E96C4F7D55EF1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Win a raid and the village's engineers pay in kind.\"}]",
    "",
    "They throw gifts like any villager:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Structural Engineer: rods\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Machinist: components\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Electrician: a piece of Faraday armour\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Gunsmith: special cartridges or an extended magazine\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Outfitter: a banner or a rare or epic shader grabbag\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0C07FF6EDA513F23.title": "Things that roll",
  "quest.0C07FF6EDA513F23.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three leather, two iron and redstone make eight \"},{\"text\":\"Conveyor Belts\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:conveyor_basic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "No power needed: they carry items and mobs and push into inventories.",
    "",
    "The hammer turns a belt, and sneaking with it tilts it up or down."
  ],
  "task.38CE2338F5B226F8.title": "Extracting",
  "task.1AEAA982AB7A6EB9.title": "Dropping",
  "task.652C3BE1B222E3E0.title": "Vertical",
  "task.2F5AB70CF4014B4B.title": "Splitting",
  "quest.0984C08286279208.title": "Belt family",
  "quest.0984C08286279208.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The basic belt has four cousins.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Extracting\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:conveyor_extract\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": pulls from the inventory behind it\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Dropping\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:conveyor_dropper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": opens a hatch downward\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Vertical\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:conveyor_vertical\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": lifts items straight up\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Splitting\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:conveyor_splitter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": alternates left and right\"}]",
    "",
    "Dye paints the side walls."
  ],
  "quest.77BABC19265883F0.title": "Sorting",
  "quest.77BABC19265883F0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Send each item where it belongs.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Item Router\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:sorter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sends each item out the side whose filter matches, else any open side.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Filters can match a tag.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Item Batcher\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:item_batcher\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds items until a whole batch is ready, then lets it go.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0803D2E2006743A4.title": "Sheetmetal chutes",
  "quest.0803D2E2006743A4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Six iron sheetmetal make twelve \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Sheetmetal Chutes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:chute_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Items and creatures inside drop straight into whatever is below, safe from magnets and players.",
    "",
    "Sneak with the hammer to make a corner."
  ],
  "quest.46C91BF04182491E.title": "Express delivery",
  "quest.46C91BF04182491E.quest_subtitle": "You are the item now.",
  "quest.46C91BF04182491E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You bounced all the way down a run of chutes.\"}]",
    "",
    "The chutes didn't enjoy it either."
  ],
  "reward.167FBE3CE91CE51B.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.727F196F0EA8255E.title": "Plumbing",
  "quest.727F196F0EA8255E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Six iron plates make eight \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Pipes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:fluid_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which split flow evenly between outputs.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Pump\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:fluid_pump\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pressurizes them, far faster with FE.\"}]",
    "",
    "It also pumps pools dry and leaves cobblestone behind, unless you sneak-hammer its top."
  ],
  "quest.7EE646AA35F4958C.title": "Valves and routers",
  "quest.7EE646AA35F4958C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three parts decide where a fluid goes, and whether it goes.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Router\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:fluid_sorter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sends each fluid to its filtered side.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Pipe Valve\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:pipe_valve\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shuts the flow on a redstone signal.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Outlet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:fluid_placer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pours it into the world.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.54D72408B635D191.title": "Form the silo",
  "task.689C6D35DD323AA5.title": "Form the tank",
  "quest.5FFC0B0935C3D644.title": "Bulk storage",
  "quest.5FFC0B0935C3D644.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two tall multiblocks for what won't fit in a chest.\"}]",
    "",
    "Sheetmetal and four treated fences form both:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Item Silo\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:silo\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"41,472\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" of one item (\"},{\"text\":\"24\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" chests)\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Tank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:tank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"512\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" buckets\"}]",
    "",
    "Both empty through the bottom centre."
  ],
  "quest.6A3B8706127D108C.title": "Furnaces on the grid",
  "quest.6A3B8706127D108C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Smelting on the grid: the coal can stay in the chest.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"External Heater\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:furnace_heater\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" against a vanilla furnace heats it with \"},{\"text\":\"no fuel\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t per furnace, up to \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t once hot, for faster smelting.\"}]",
    "",
    "Redstone turns the boost off."
  ],
  "quest.29ABDA7768135140.title": "A greenhouse in a jar",
  "quest.29ABDA7768135140.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Glass, a light bulb, an iron component and a basic engineering block make the \"},{\"text\":\"Garden Cloche\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:cloche\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Soil and a seed in the middle, water and \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t, and it harvests by itself through the front hatch.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.644CEC7C251D8ABD.title": "Plant food",
  "quest.644CEC7C251D8ABD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One fertilizer at a time dissolves in the cloche's water: bone meal \"},{\"text\":\"×1.3\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", slag \"},{\"text\":\"×1.3\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Fertilizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:fertilizer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"×1.6\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\". The industrial one is nitrate, slag, sulfur and water.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5A755D7FE3D7DB5D.title": "Out of this world",
  "quest.5A755D7FE3D7DB5D.quest_subtitle": "It came from the End. Now it lives in a jar.",
  "quest.5A755D7FE3D7DB5D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chorus fruit growing under glass, in a cloche.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nobody asked the fruit."
  ],
  "reward.3600D33DE1C2CC9C.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.185DBC6D711573E8.title": "Lights on",
  "quest.185DBC6D711573E8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Light that also keeps the hostile mobs away.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A light bulb, glass, an iron plate and copper wire make a \"},{\"text\":\"Powered Lantern\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:electric_lantern\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": on LV wire it stops hostile mobs spawning within \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Floodlight\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:floodlight\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" throws a \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"-block cone, aimed with the hammer.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2BE9D215D68B9AB0.title": "Screwdriver and meter",
  "quest.2BE9D215D68B9AB0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Engineer's Screwdriver\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:screwdriver\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" inverts a machine's redstone control.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Engineer's Multimeter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:voltmeter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reads any energy storage, and sneak-clicking two connectors measures the loss between them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.540D9CBDBE24FB57.title": "Up on the posts",
  "quest.540D9CBDBE24FB57.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Get the connectors off the ground and into the air.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Two treated fences on stone bricks make a four-block \"},{\"text\":\"Wooden Post\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:treated_post\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The hammer on its top adds arms for connectors.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wooden Wallmounts\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:treated_wallmount\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hold connectors on a wall, facing up or down.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4DA2C7B835071026.title": "Insulated LV",
  "quest.4DA2C7B835071026.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copper wire in a jacket: safe to walk beside.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four LV coils wrapped in five tough fabric make four \"},{\"text\":\"Insulated LV Wire Coils\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:wirecoil_copper_ins\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": safe along paths and inside the base.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Live bare wire hurts whoever touches it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.284DB7D565E0DB16.title": "Through the wall",
  "quest.284DB7D565E0DB16.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Put a connector on each side of a one-block wall and hammer one: they fuse into a \"},{\"text\":\"Feedthrough Insulator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:feedthrough\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around the block. Wires can't cross blocks; this can.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.7286625CCE3813BF.title": "1 km on the wire",
  "quest.333A89813E96B76F.title": "Ride the line",
  "quest.333A89813E96B76F.quest_subtitle": "Zip-lining, but it's work.",
  "quest.333A89813E96B76F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Steel, an iron component and two wooden grips make the \"},{\"text\":\"Engineer's Skyhook\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:skyhook\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Hold right-click near a wire to hook on: downhill is free, uphill takes walking, sneaking lets go.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A live wire shocks you unless the grip is insulated.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2D5E5C23E88FD31C.title": "Short circuit",
  "quest.2D5E5C23E88FD31C.quest_subtitle": "Birds sit on wires. They don't fly into them.",
  "quest.2D5E5C23E88FD31C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You glided into a live wire and the wire won.\"}]",
    "",
    "Insulation exists for a reason."
  ],
  "reward.1B3FC844C785FCF6.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.7ADE1D1A20F941FF.title": "A line on the drawing",
  "quest.7ADE1D1A20F941FF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"We strung copper first, because copper forgives. Steel came later, when we stopped asking whether we should. —T.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "quest.1601834A62BB3C15.title": "Throw the yard switch",
  "quest.1601834A62BB3C15.quest_subtitle": "Let there be light.",
  "quest.1601834A62BB3C15.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A line this long should show it has power.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: every lamp on the yard comes on."
  ],
  "image.2401E735452FAF33.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.318D056326AB345A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"IMMERSIVE ENGINEERING\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.2B7D1342A082B4E8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Workshop\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"}]",
  "image.69687D67381F1446.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Industry\",\"color\":\"#9DBAE0\"}]",
  "image.46B2B36CDA4E19E4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Workshop · sheet 1 of 2 · drawn: T.\",\"color\":\"#B6A67C\"}]",
  "image.736E424CBBE98458.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"rope · no power yet\",\"color\":\"#C9B48A\"}]",
  "image.0A7260FB95E7EAC2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"LV · 256 FE/t\",\"color\":\"#D9894A\"}]",
  "image.4053BA1EA46032EC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MV · 1,024 FE/t\",\"color\":\"#E8CF5A\"}]",
  "image.13EB9A37E59F896C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"HV · 4,096 FE/t\",\"color\":\"#BAC6D2\"}]",
  "image.1143A038E8319E3C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drafting table\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.663C0E6B37844046.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Belts and pipes\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.0B4A11A6C5DBBA95.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On the grid\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.0CE317CD884C739A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wiring kit\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.3FBD87104C4A5ACA.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Ores and hemp\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\"}]",
  "image.3884E926CA36788D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Coke\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\"}]",
  "image.7CC50B2FBA56D59A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Furnaces and slag\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\"}]",
  "image.28FFD4731B0A902E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Power sources\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\"}]",
  "image.6902DFBEA0E9128C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MV and HV\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\"}]",
  "chapter.27A03545380FC2EA.title": "Industrial Foregoing",
  "chapter.27A03545380FC2EA.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Machines for every chore: latex to plastic, four frames, farms, mobs, lasers and the Infinity tools."
  ],
  "quest.6E84BC104C71370E.title": "A frame to start",
  "quest.6E84BC104C71370E.quest_subtitle": "Pity is its real name. Honest.",
  "quest.6E84BC104C71370E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four logs at the corners, four iron ingots and a block of redstone in the middle make the \"},{\"text\":\"Pity Machine Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:machine_frame_pity\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". The first IF machines are built around one: the extractor, the latex unit, the Dissolution Chamber.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.39204F03E7858E49.title": "Tapping trees",
  "quest.39204F03E7858E49.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Aim a \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Extractor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:fluid_extractor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at a log and it drips latex: 2 mB per operation from a vanilla log, 1 mB from any other, three times as much with power. Now and then the log gets stripped, and a stripped log ends up gone.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Several extractors can drain the same log at once. A tree ringed with them is a latex farm, and power makes each one faster.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2A513DF079BC7D4D.title": "Latex into rubber",
  "quest.2A513DF079BC7D4D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Latex Processing Unit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:latex_processing_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns 750 mB of latex and 500 mB of water into one \"},{\"text\":\"Dry Rubber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:dryrubber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", at 20 FE per tick. Pipe both fluids in and let it run.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.727410A74B375E43.title": "Everything is plastic",
  "quest.727410A74B375E43.quest_subtitle": "The currency of the mod.",
  "quest.727410A74B375E43.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Smelt \"},{\"text\":\"Dry Rubber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:dryrubber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into \"},{\"text\":\"Plastic\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:plastic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Almost every IF machine asks for some, and belts, the straw and the Mob Imprisonment Tool are made of it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4D1BE172ABD25E27.title": "Dissolve and rebuild",
  "quest.4D1BE172ABD25E27.quest_subtitle": "Eight items, one fluid, no pattern.",
  "quest.4D1BE172ABD25E27.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two plastic, a chest, two buckets, two gold ingots, a \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Gear\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:diamond_gear\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a pity frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Dissolution Chamber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:dissolution_chamber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": up to eight items and one fluid in, in any order, at 90 FE per tick.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Frames, addons, lenses and the Infinity tools all come out of it. With a recipe inside it locks its slots, so pipes can't jam it with the wrong items."
  ],
  "quest.5D0DB71E2671162C.title": "Simple, not easy",
  "quest.5D0DB71E2671162C.quest_subtitle": "Held together with latex.",
  "quest.5D0DB71E2671162C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In the chamber, a pity frame, two plastic, two nether bricks, two iron ingots, a gold gear and 250 mB of latex make the \"},{\"text\":\"Simple Machine Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:machine_frame_simple\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It opens the laser drill, the hydroponic bed, the fertilizer and the marine fisher.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.45C461F92D8E0EA0.title": "Advanced, and pink",
  "quest.45C461F92D8E0EA0.quest_subtitle": "Nobody asks what's in the slime.",
  "quest.45C461F92D8E0EA0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A simple frame, two plastic, two netherite scrap, two gold ingots, a diamond gear and 500 mB of pink slime make the \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Machine Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:machine_frame_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". The Mob Crusher, the laser bases, the enchanting machines and the StoneWork Factory sit on it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1AA1CF8C56E02537.title": "Top of the ladder",
  "quest.1AA1CF8C56E02537.quest_subtitle": "Sealed with a Wither's breath.",
  "quest.1AA1CF8C56E02537.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An advanced frame, two plastic, two netherite ingots, two diamonds, a diamond gear and 135 mB of \"},{\"text\":\"ether gas\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0863D9EFF6720E00\"}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Supreme Machine Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:machine_frame_supreme\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Only the Wither Builder and three mycelial generators need it, and the Mycelial Reactor starts from one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.611CC8944281877D.title": "Mining without a pickaxe",
  "quest.611CC8944281877D.quest_subtitle": "Foregoing the pickaxe, industrially.",
  "quest.611CC8944281877D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two plastic, a diamond pickaxe, two iron ores, two diamond gears, an advanced frame and, here, an \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Ore Laser Base\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:ore_laser_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Laser Drills around it charge it, and each full bar is one ore, picked by biome, depth and \"},{\"text\":\"lenses\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"632876665F709C4E\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:industrialforegoing:textures/block/laser_base_top.png width:48 height:48 align:center}",
    "",
    "Act IV: the ironwood takes the place of the redstone dust. Each drill adds to the bar, so more drills mean more ore."
  ],
  "quest.55438056C6AFB0DB.title": "Three gears",
  "quest.55438056C6AFB0DB.quest_subtitle": "Unified, with a surprise.",
  "quest.55438056C6AFB0DB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four ingots or diamonds around an empty middle make a gear. Iron ones go into sowers, sewers and collectors, gold ones into most machines, the \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Gear\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:diamond_gear\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into the chamber and the lasers.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The pack unifies gears: IF's iron one comes out as Ender IO's \"},{\"text\":\"Infinity Bimetal Gear\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"enderio:iron_gear\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the gold one as Modern Industrialization's \"},{\"text\":\"Gold Gear\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:gold_gear\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". IF machines take them all the same.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.31FFECC7D1A49201.title": "Pity power",
  "quest.31FFECC7D1A49201.quest_subtitle": "It burns even when nobody asked.",
  "quest.31FFECC7D1A49201.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Cobblestone, iron bars, a gold ingot, a furnace and a pity frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Pitiful Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:pitiful_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": 30 FE per tick from anything a furnace burns. It keeps burning with its 100,000 FE buffer full, so feed it slowly.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6844F2CA96FB85E6.title": "Any plastic will do",
  "quest.6844F2CA96FB85E6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"IF recipes ask for the plastics tag, so Oritech's \"},{\"text\":\"Plastic Sheet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:plastic_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" works too. Only the Meat Feeder insists on IF's own \"},{\"text\":\"Plastic\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:plastic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7121709373E2741C.title": "Plastic by the stack",
  "quest.7121709373E2741C.quest_subtitle": "Recycling can wait.",
  "quest.7121709373E2741C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sixty-four \"},{\"text\":\"Plastic\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:plastic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day. A ring of extractors around a few trees keeps the latex unit busy.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.013D285F0A870979.title": "Industrial Foregoing's Manual",
  "quest.741230D6934E57D0.title": "Read the manual",
  "quest.741230D6934E57D0.quest_subtitle": "Dirt included.",
  "quest.741230D6934E57D0.quest_desc": [
    "A book, a redstone dust and a block of dirt make Industrial Foregoing's manual: every machine with its recipe and what it does. The rates it leaves out are in EMI."
  ],
  "quest.71A29C6CA68EFB8B.title": "What the pack changes",
  "quest.71A29C6CA68EFB8B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five IF recipes wait for later acts: the Fluid Laser Base and the Infinity Drill take \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (III); the Ore Laser Base and the Infinity Nuke an \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (IV); the Mob Duplicator an \"},{\"text\":\"Ecosystem Capsule\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:ecosystem_capsule\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (IV).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0605447BDA58AC2E.title": "Pipes without pipes",
  "quest.0605447BDA58AC2E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A pity frame, an ender pearl, four redstone, two gold ingots and a piston make two \"},{\"text\":\"Item Transporters\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:item_transporter_type\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; lapis makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:fluid_transporter_type\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" kind, hoppers and a dropper the \"},{\"text\":\"World\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:world_transporter_type\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" kind. The first two move things between inventories one block apart; the World kind picks items up and drops them.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Several kinds fit in one block. Right-click the middle to switch between extract and insert; Speed and Efficiency addons go on the outer ring.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.281A71D50447ACE1.title": "No black holes here",
  "quest.281A71D50447ACE1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"This version of IF has no Black Hole Units or Tanks. For a lot of one item, Functional Storage drawers do the job: \"},{\"text\":\"with a Netherite Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5B2BCD66CABD0839\"}},{\"text\":\" one oak drawer holds 1,024 stacks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3BE2635A2FFC7363.title": "Copy, paste",
  "quest.3BE2635A2FFC7363.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four paper, three plastic and two redstone make the \"},{\"text\":\"Machine Settings Copier\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:machine_settings_copier\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Sneak-right-click a machine you've set up to store its settings, then right-click another to paste them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2B9039FB10DBFAD5.title": "Don't drink the lava",
  "quest.2B9039FB10DBFAD5.quest_subtitle": "Obsidian-flavoured.",
  "quest.2B9039FB10DBFAD5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four plastic make a \"},{\"text\":\"Straw\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:straw\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" that drinks a whole bucket from the world or a tank. Lava hurts and sets you on fire; drink water within six seconds and it puts you out, and you burp up obsidian.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.4D0E7491EE1571ED.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.7BCF4869E3A03331.title": "Belts",
  "quest.7BCF4869E3A03331.quest_subtitle": "Items, mobs, and fluids on the flat.",
  "quest.7BCF4869E3A03331.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six plastic, two iron ingots and a redstone make six \"},{\"text\":\"Conveyor Belts\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:conveyor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". They carry items and mobs up and down slopes, and fluids only on the flat. Right-click one with a dye to recolour it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click a belt with glowstone dust and it runs fast; with plastic, nobody can pick up what it carries.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.79139B0E82106705.title": "In and out of chests",
  "quest.79139B0E82106705.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A belt, six iron ingots, plastic and a dispenser or a hopper make the \"},{\"text\":\"Extraction\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:conveyor_extraction_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Insertion\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:conveyor_insertion_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" upgrades. One pulls from the inventory it touches, the other fills it, both with a filter.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2FBF2B9A2926D2A6.title": "Belt tricks",
  "quest.2FBF2B9A2926D2A6.quest_subtitle": "A theme park for zombies.",
  "quest.2FBF2B9A2926D2A6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"More upgrades from a belt and iron: \"},{\"text\":\"Bouncing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:conveyor_bouncing_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" launches, \"},{\"text\":\"Dropping\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:conveyor_dropping_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" drops through, \"},{\"text\":\"Blinking\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:conveyor_blinking_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" teleports, \"},{\"text\":\"Splitting\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:conveyor_splitting_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" divides by ratio and \"},{\"text\":\"Detection\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:conveyor_detection_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" gives a redstone signal.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Mob Imprisonment Tool with a mob inside works as a mob filter on any of them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7B14B966A928BC45.title": "Tier 1 addons",
  "quest.7B14B966A928BC45.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In the chamber, redstone, glass panes, two gold gears and 1,000 mB of latex make the first addons: sugar for \"},{\"text\":\"Speed\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:speed_addon_tier_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", blaze rods for \"},{\"text\":\"Efficiency\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:efficiency_addon_tier_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a furnace and a crafting table for \"},{\"text\":\"Processing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:processing_addon_tier_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Speed adds 1 to the work bar each tick, Efficiency cuts the ticks per job by 10%, Processing runs one extra job per cycle and pays its power. A machine takes one addon of each kind.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5E1C5DE805D66E3F.title": "Tier 2 addons",
  "quest.5E1C5DE805D66E3F.quest_subtitle": "Swap the gold for diamond.",
  "quest.5E1C5DE805D66E3F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The same recipes with two \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Gears\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:diamond_gear\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" instead of gold ones: +2 speed, 20% fewer ticks, two extra jobs. Take the tier 1 out first; a machine holds one addon of each kind.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7D6DC05D3B134301.title": "Twelve steps of range",
  "quest.7D6DC05D3B134301.quest_subtitle": "From cobblestone to emeralds.",
  "quest.7D6DC05D3B134301.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each range addon adds a block of reach and takes four of something: cobblestone, lapis, bone meal, iron nuggets, copper, gold nuggets, iron, gold, quartz, diamonds, popped chorus, emeralds. The \"},{\"text\":\"emerald one\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:range_addon_tier_11\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" goes into every Infinity tool but the backpack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.77015897792B3AC2.title": "Pink metal",
  "quest.77015897792B3AC2.quest_subtitle": "Two metals and a mystery.",
  "quest.77015897792B3AC2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two iron ingots, two gold ingots and 1,000 mB of pink slime make a \"},{\"text\":\"Pink Slime Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:pink_slime_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; the \"},{\"text\":\"Washing Factory\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"23F45EA54BF826E0\"}},{\"text\":\" takes two. A glass pane and 300 mB make a \"},{\"text\":\"Pink Slime\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:pink_slime\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" ball, which counts as a slimeball.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3476A97FD3FC45EC.title": "A drill that levels up",
  "quest.3476A97FD3FC45EC.quest_subtitle": "Power is its only upgrade.",
  "quest.3476A97FD3FC45EC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two diamond blocks, a diamond shovel, the emerald range addon, three gold gears, \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III, where a third diamond block was) and 2,000 mB of pink slime make the \"},{\"text\":\"Infinity Drill\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:infinity_drill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the chamber. The more power it holds, the wider it digs.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Common digs a 3×3 face and each tier after it two blocks more, up to 11×11 at Legendary. Sneak-right-click opens its screen, to pick a smaller area or stop charging."
  ],
  "quest.02C93942F0E8B904.title": "Timber, industrially",
  "quest.02C93942F0E8B904.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A diamond block, a diamond pickaxe, two diamond axes, the emerald range addon, three gold gears and 2,000 mB of pink slime make the \"},{\"text\":\"Infinity Saw\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:infinity_saw\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It fells as many blocks at once as its tier allows; keep hitting the same block on big trees.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7F551C310CD4A8A6.title": "Heads will roll",
  "quest.7F551C310CD4A8A6.quest_subtitle": "Literally. That's the enchantment.",
  "quest.7F551C310CD4A8A6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two diamond blocks, a diamond sword, a diamond axe, the emerald range addon, three gold gears and pink slime make the \"},{\"text\":\"Infinity Hammer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:infinity_hammer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it hits everything in an area, and higher tiers unlock Beheading for skeleton, wither skeleton, zombie, creeper and dragon heads.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.31B2951BF71E60D8.title": "A crater to go",
  "quest.31B2951BF71E60D8.quest_subtitle": "Please don't.",
  "quest.31B2951BF71E60D8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three TNT, a diamond block, two nether stars, the emerald range addon, 2,000 mB of ether gas and, here, an \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV, in a fourth TNT's place) make the \"},{\"text\":\"Infinity Nuke\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:infinity_nuke\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Place it, right-click to arm it, then light it with flint and steel.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The blast grows with its tier and the biofuel inside.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" Claimed chunks are left standing.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.235F809DCFFB1CA7.title": "Look at a placed Infinity Nuke",
  "quest.5587DF239F9F01E4.title": "Don't touch the red button",
  "quest.5587DF239F9F01E4.quest_subtitle": "Is it armed? Better not check.",
  "quest.5587DF239F9F01E4.quest_desc": [
    "You spent two seconds staring at a placed Infinity Nuke. It only goes off armed and lit, and it spares claimed chunks, but nobody wants one in the living room."
  ],
  "reward.02F59332A4BC4859.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.4B20D01A143C418B.title": "Filling the bar",
  "quest.4B20D01A143C418B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three plastic, two repeaters, a diamond gear, two blocks of redstone and an advanced frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Infinity Charger\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:infinity_charger\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it charges anything that holds power, and Infinity tools very fast.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.43CE3178E86B5162.title": "Seven tiers of power",
  "quest.43CE3178E86B5162.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Infinity tools rank up by stored power: Common at 4 million FE, then 16 M, 80 M, 480 M and Legendary at 3,360 M. With biofuel inside they burn that instead, Unbreaking cuts both costs, and everything they break comes straight to you.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1290C16D3201A7C6.title": "A trident with ambitions",
  "quest.1290C16D3201A7C6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two diamond blocks, a trident, a diamond hoe, the emerald range addon, three gold gears and pink slime make the \"},{\"text\":\"Infinity Trident\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:infinity_trident\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Its tiers unlock Loyalty and Riptide up to VII and Channeling, and its hits and lightning land in an area.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.027716F892ACE71C.title": "Plunger delivery",
  "quest.027716F892ACE71C.quest_subtitle": "Moving mobs, from a distance.",
  "quest.027716F892ACE71C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A bow, a Mob Imprisonment Tool, two diamond blocks, the emerald range addon, three gold gears and pink slime make the \"},{\"text\":\"Infinity Launcher\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:infinity_launcher\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It fires a plunger that catches a mob into a tool in your inventory, or lets one out, from afar.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5F30D31A2B1DF946.title": "A backpack with a magnet",
  "quest.5F30D31A2B1DF946.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two chests, two buckets, an ender pearl, a diamond gear and three gold gears make the \"},{\"text\":\"Infinity Backpack\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:infinity_backpack\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Its magnet pulls nearby items; it holds biofuel, Essence from the experience you pick up and liquid meat that feeds you.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.industrialforegoing.backpack.desc\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens it once you give that key a binding; it also fits the Curios back slot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4478747B4E03DE0C.title": "Biofuel",
  "quest.4478747B4E03DE0C.quest_subtitle": "Variety is the spice of fuel.",
  "quest.4478747B4E03DE0C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Water plus seeds, saplings, crops, dyes, mushrooms, sweet berries or skulls become biofuel in the \"},{\"text\":\"Bioreactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:bioreactor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It eats one of each kind per round, and nine kinds make far more per item than one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3F405B0FE49051D6.title": "Nine slots, nine kinds",
  "quest.3F405B0FE49051D6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One kind alone makes 95 mB of biofuel per round; nine different kinds in the nine slots make 3,719 mB, and drink as much water. Each slot keeps to one kind.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0F1FF4F3DFBC1348.title": "Burning purple",
  "quest.0F1FF4F3DFBC1348.quest_subtitle": "It stops when full. Unlike some.",
  "quest.0F1FF4F3DFBC1348.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two plastic, two pistons, a furnace, two gold gears and a pity frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Biofuel Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:biofuel_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": 160 FE per tick, 640 FE per mB, into a 1,000,000 FE buffer. It stops burning when the buffer is full.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.02B9CCE34B2AF277.title": "Mycelial, simple frame",
  "quest.02B9CCE34B2AF277.quest_subtitle": "Sixteen appetites, four to start.",
  "quest.02B9CCE34B2AF277.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each mycelial generator burns one thing: the \"},{\"text\":\"Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mycelial_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one anything a furnace takes, at 80 FE per tick, the \"},{\"text\":\"Culinary\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mycelial_culinary\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one food, the \"},{\"text\":\"Frosty\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mycelial_frosty\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one snow and ice, the \"},{\"text\":\"Pink\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mycelial_pink\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one pink dye. These four sit on simple frames.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7EA5838AE36FBEDA.title": "Mycelial, advanced frame",
  "quest.7EA5838AE36FBEDA.quest_subtitle": "Nine more mouths to feed.",
  "quest.7EA5838AE36FBEDA.quest_desc": [
    "Nine more on advanced frames: Nether fungi, bones and rotten flesh, enchanted items, ender pearls, TNT, lava, potions, firework rockets and slime. The reactor needs every kind running."
  ],
  "quest.4B98D05D95DAF7BD.title": "Mycelial, supreme frame",
  "quest.4B98D05D95DAF7BD.quest_subtitle": "One of them eats nether stars.",
  "quest.4B98D05D95DAF7BD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The last three want supreme frames and rare food: the \"},{\"text\":\"Halitosis\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mycelial_halitosis\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one dragon's breath, the \"},{\"text\":\"Meatallurgic\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mycelial_meatallurgic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one liquid meat with ingots, the \"},{\"text\":\"Netherstar\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mycelial_netherstar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one nether stars.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5CAD2D20DC616CED.title": "Sixteen at once",
  "quest.5CAD2D20DC616CED.quest_subtitle": "Twenty-five million per tick. Yes, million.",
  "quest.5CAD2D20DC616CED.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In the chamber, a supreme frame, two plastic, two netherite ingots, two diamond gears, a nether star and 500 mB of ether gas make the \"},{\"text\":\"Mycelial Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mycelial_reactor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". While one of each of the sixteen mycelial generators you placed runs, it makes 25,000,000 FE per tick.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0C88FF716F10EB13.title": "Harvest and fell",
  "quest.0C88FF716F10EB13.quest_subtitle": "Not even the stump survives.",
  "quest.0C88FF716F10EB13.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two plastic, an iron hoe, two iron axes, two gold gears, redstone and a pity frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Plant Gatherer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:plant_gatherer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It harvests crops and fells whole trees, logs and leaves, and leaves a little sludge each time.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It breaks crops it could have right-clicked; a trickle of ether gas makes it replant them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6CA1AD2BA873C2B0.title": "Nine colours, nine plots",
  "quest.6CA1AD2BA873C2B0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Plant Sower\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:plant_sower\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" plants seeds and saplings above it. Its nine slots are colour-coded like the marks on its top, and each slot only sows its own ninth of the area.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.44BBC0478DB10FAE.title": "Bone meal on a schedule",
  "quest.44BBC0478DB10FAE.quest_subtitle": "Allergic to sunflowers.",
  "quest.44BBC0478DB10FAE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On a simple frame, the \"},{\"text\":\"Plant Fertilizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:plant_fertilizer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" feeds bone meal or \"},{\"text\":\"Fertilizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:fertilizer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to each plant until it can't grow any more. A plant that always takes bone meal, like a sunflower, jams it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.067CDFCE48864834.title": "Soil in a box",
  "quest.067CDFCE48864834.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two plastic, dirt, two iron hoes, \"},{\"text\":\"Fertilizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:fertilizer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two gold gears and a simple frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Hydroponic Bed\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:hydroponic_bed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". With power and water, or lava for Nether crops, the crop on it grows faster; a little ether also replants it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.19565FB4AAB180DF.title": "A farm on a chip",
  "quest.19565FB4AAB180DF.quest_subtitle": "It learned from the real one.",
  "quest.19565FB4AAB180DF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Put a \"},{\"text\":\"Hydroponic Simulation Processor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:hydroponic_simulation_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in a working Hydroponic Bed and it records every harvest. Moved to a \"},{\"text\":\"Simulated Hydroponic Bed\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:simulated_hydroponic_bed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", it grows that crop's drops with no plant at all.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The more harvests it has recorded, the better it simulates, and the simulated bed keeps adding to them now and then."
  ],
  "quest.6F4237A8DB791E0C.title": "Mud, refined",
  "quest.6F4237A8DB791E0C.quest_subtitle": "What the gatherer leaves behind.",
  "quest.6F4237A8DB791E0C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Sludge Refiner\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:sludge_refiner\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns the gatherer's sludge into dirt, clay, gravel, sand, red sand or soul sand, at 40 FE per tick.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2D3F4D934B3ACB03.title": "Mushroom copier",
  "quest.2D3F4D934B3ACB03.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Spores Recreator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:spores_recreator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" duplicates mushrooms with 100 mB of water per round, and crimson or warped fungi with lava instead, at 40 FE per tick.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.00B938A21172F035.title": "See the area",
  "quest.00B938A21172F035.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Machines that work an area have a button in their screen that draws it in the world. Range addons grow it a block per step; the tooltip says which machines take them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5589CAA70DF2FAA4.title": "Water from water",
  "quest.5589CAA70DF2FAA4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Touching two or more water sources, the \"},{\"text\":\"Water Condensator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:water_condensator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fills its tank; more sources and power make it faster. Latex units and hydroponic beds drink a lot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5265C284C3646F9D.title": "Gone fishing",
  "quest.5265C284C3646F9D.quest_subtitle": "A cat's best friend.",
  "quest.5265C284C3646F9D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Over a pool at least 3×3 and one block deep, the \"},{\"text\":\"Marine Fisher\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:marine_fisher\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fishes with the vanilla fishing loot, treasure included, at 5,000 FE per catch.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.29AFDBA1ED9999CA.title": "A ranch with no rancher",
  "quest.29AFDBA1ED9999CA.quest_subtitle": "The cows don't miss you.",
  "quest.29AFDBA1ED9999CA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Animal Feeder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:animal_feeder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" breeds animals with their food, the \"},{\"text\":\"Animal Rancher\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:animal_rancher\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shears and milks, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Baby Separator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:animal_baby_separator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" moves the young behind it. The Feeder stops at 35 animals in its area.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3AAA7344BD88DDC6.title": "What animals leave behind",
  "quest.3AAA7344BD88DDC6.quest_subtitle": "You don't want to know.",
  "quest.3AAA7344BD88DDC6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Sewer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:sewer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" collects 50 mB of sewage per animal each round and turns loose experience orbs into Essence. The \"},{\"text\":\"Sewage Composter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:sewage_composter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes one \"},{\"text\":\"Fertilizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:fertilizer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from 1,000 mB of sewage.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fertilizer works like bone meal, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Hydroponic Bed\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"067CDFCE48864834\"}},{\"text\":\" is made with it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5C7DAD790FAABD23.title": "A drill that never touches stone",
  "quest.5C7DAD790FAABD23.quest_subtitle": "Mining by proxy.",
  "quest.5C7DAD790FAABD23.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two plastic, two pistons, a diamond gear, two gold gears, redstone and a simple frame make a \"},{\"text\":\"Laser Drill\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:laser_drill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Set one block away from a laser base, it charges the base with power; a misplaced drill shows a tag above it saying so.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.632876665F709C4E.title": "Tinted odds",
  "quest.632876665F709C4E.quest_subtitle": "Sixteen colours, one lens each.",
  "quest.632876665F709C4E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four glass panes, a dye and 250 mB of latex make a laser lens in the chamber. Each colour favours its ores: \"},{\"text\":\"brown\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:brown_laser_lens\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" iron, \"},{\"text\":\"yellow\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:yellow_laser_lens\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" gold, \"},{\"text\":\"light blue\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:light_blue_laser_lens\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" diamonds, \"},{\"text\":\"red\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:red_laser_lens\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" redstone. EMI lists them all.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5ACB71930E5D3EBB.title": "Six lenses, one depth",
  "quest.5ACB71930E5D3EBB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The ore base holds six lenses, and each one matching an ore adds 8 to its weight. Mining depth starts at the base's own height and changes in its screen: diamonds and redstone peak between 5 and 16.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3DE6BB618580D394.title": "Fluids from the deep",
  "quest.3DE6BB618580D394.quest_subtitle": "Alloy in, redstone out.",
  "quest.3DE6BB618580D394.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Here the \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Laser Base\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:fluid_laser_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III) where its redstone was. With a lens it pumps lava in the Nether, oil under oceans and deserts, or ether gas from a Wither right below it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6576F9CFC91A67CC.title": "Hold still",
  "quest.6576F9CFC91A67CC.quest_subtitle": "Even the Wither.",
  "quest.6576F9CFC91A67CC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three soul sand, two ghast tears, a piston, two gold gears and an advanced frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Stasis Chamber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:stasis_chamber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": mobs in its area freeze in place and heal a little every round, and their boss bars stay hidden.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The fluid laser only hurts a Wither above 5 health, so it never kills it. Frozen by the chamber, the Wither stays put under the base and heals back: an ether farm that can't escape.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0863D9EFF6720E00.title": "A Wither's breath",
  "quest.0863D9EFF6720E00.quest_subtitle": "The Wither doesn't enjoy it either.",
  "quest.0863D9EFF6720E00.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"purple lens\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:purple_laser_lens\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the fluid base and a Wither under it give 10 mB of ether gas per round; each round costs the Wither 5 health. Supreme frames, replanting farms and the Mycelial Reactor run on it.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.6DC0E02DA8906619.title": "Look at a Wither for five seconds",
  "quest.7D0C6612EF943596.title": "Staring contest",
  "quest.7D0C6612EF943596.quest_subtitle": "You blinked first. It can't.",
  "quest.7D0C6612EF943596.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"You held a Wither's gaze for five seconds. With a \"},{\"text\":\"Stasis Chamber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:stasis_chamber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" under it, it can't even turn its heads, and a fluid laser base above keeps the ether coming.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.24432EE7BB1095E2.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.57E19EBEDE586B06.title": "Meat and pink slime",
  "quest.57E19EBEDE586B06.quest_subtitle": "No drops, no questions.",
  "quest.57E19EBEDE586B06.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Mob Slaughter Factory\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mob_slaughter_factory\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" grinds mobs into liquid meat and pink slime, with no drops or experience. Animals give 20 mB of pink slime per point of health; monsters give that much meat instead.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pink slime goes into the \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Machine Frame\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"45C461F92D8E0EA0\"}},{\"text\":\"; liquid meat feeds Mechanical Dirt and the Meat Feeder.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7A8D2E737EEFDBF0.title": "Dirt that spawns",
  "quest.7A8D2E737EEFDBF0.quest_subtitle": "Fertilized with meat.",
  "quest.7A8D2E737EEFDBF0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In the chamber, two dirt, two rotten flesh, a pity frame and 1,000 mB of liquid meat make \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Dirt\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mechanical_dirt\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". In the dark, at light 7 or less, it spawns mobs for 1,000 FE and 20 mB of meat each, and shares both with the blocks it touches.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.72C5245C8ADF8D10.title": "It fights like you do",
  "quest.72C5245C8ADF8D10.quest_subtitle": "Looting sold separately.",
  "quest.72C5245C8ADF8D10.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two plastic, an iron sword, two books, two gold gears, redstone and an advanced frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Mob Crusher\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mob_crusher\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it kills like a player, so mobs drop their loot, and it turns their experience into Essence, 20 mB per point.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In Looting mode it trades the Essence for a random Looting level, up to III, on every kill. Babies and bosses still invulnerable are left alone.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3C76D7BD925363A6.title": "A mob in your pocket",
  "quest.3C76D7BD925363A6.quest_subtitle": "It's roomy in there. Probably.",
  "quest.3C76D7BD925363A6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four plastic around a ghast tear make the \"},{\"text\":\"Mob Imprisonment Tool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mob_imprisonment_tool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Right-click a mob to store it inside; right-click the ground to let it out.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5E5E2E7977702FF5.title": "Copy, paste, mob",
  "quest.5E5E2E7977702FF5.quest_subtitle": "Nether wart out, ecosystem in.",
  "quest.5E5E2E7977702FF5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Here the \"},{\"text\":\"Mob Duplicator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:mob_duplicator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes an \"},{\"text\":\"Ecosystem Capsule\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:ecosystem_capsule\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV) where its nether wart was. Give it a tool with a mob, Essence and 5,000 FE a round: it spawns one to four copies, at 12 mB of Essence per point of health.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It pauses when more than 32 of that mob stand in its area, and it copies the kind, not the individual. The Atlas also asks for a capsule in \"},{\"text\":\"A small agreement\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"780224C0B0190A32\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.54F34F4D22EB3F58.title": "Unenchanting",
  "quest.54F34F4D22EB3F58.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two plastic, nether bricks, two books, two diamonds, a gold gear and an advanced frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Enchantment Extractor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:enchantment_extractor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". With a book it moves an item's enchantments onto the book; in its other mode it turns them into Essence, no book needed.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.486A9D7E79A68ED7.title": "An anvil that takes Essence",
  "quest.486A9D7E79A68ED7.quest_subtitle": "Sharpness VI? Why not.",
  "quest.486A9D7E79A68ED7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three plastic, three anvils, two gold gears and an advanced frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Enchantment Applicator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:enchantment_applicator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": an anvil paid in Essence. It ignores maximum levels, so two Sharpness V books make Sharpness VI.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5119EF173B540A28.title": "An enchanting line",
  "quest.5119EF173B540A28.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Enchantment Factory\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:enchantment_factory\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" enchants items like a table at the level you set, 30 unless you change it, paid in Essence, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Enchantment Sorter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:enchantment_sorter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" splits enchanted items from plain ones.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Enchantment Industry drinks IF Essence too: \"},{\"text\":\"Every experience counts\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0E1E17A383C2E5C1\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3EFB9EEFA889AE37.title": "Essence to go",
  "quest.3EFB9EEFA889AE37.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With no items inside, the Dissolution Chamber turns 250 mB of Essence, or any other experience fluid, into a \"},{\"text\":\"Bottle o' Enchanting\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:experience_bottle\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" every 5 ticks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.647E43894EA48211.title": "Cobblestone, next generation",
  "quest.647E43894EA48211.quest_subtitle": "Sand in, silicon out.",
  "quest.647E43894EA48211.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"With water and lava in its tanks, the \"},{\"text\":\"Material StoneWork Factory\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:material_stonework_factory\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes cobblestone, andesite, diorite, granite, netherrack or obsidian, then smelts, crushes or crafts it. Crushing goes cobblestone, gravel, sand, silicon.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.38ACD536AE50E0E8.title": "Hands on the world",
  "quest.38ACD536AE50E0E8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Block Breaker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:block_breaker\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Block Placer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:block_placer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" mine blocks and place them from their inventory; the \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Collector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:fluid_collector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Placer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:fluid_placer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" take and pour source blocks. 1,000 FE per operation each.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.25B824475C529D64.title": "Three furnaces in one",
  "quest.25B824475C529D64.quest_subtitle": "Smelting, with a side of Essence.",
  "quest.25B824475C529D64.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Resourceful Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:resourceful_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" smelts three items at once for 40 FE per tick, and keeps the smelting experience as Essence: 20 mB per point.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.71653FA4168970C6.title": "An alchemist on a frame",
  "quest.71653FA4168970C6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Potion Brewer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:potion_brewer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" brews vanilla potions from the ingredients you give it and fills bottles from its water tank. Set the potion you want in its green filter, or nothing comes out.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.23F45EA54BF826E0.title": "Meat that remembers ore",
  "quest.23F45EA54BF826E0.quest_subtitle": "Metallurgy, but make it gross.",
  "quest.23F45EA54BF826E0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two Pink Slime Ingots, a Meat Feeder, two plastic, two diamond gears, a furnace and an advanced frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Washing Factory\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:washing_factory\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It washes a raw ore in 100 mB of liquid meat into 100 mB of raw ore meat of that metal.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3740F1DE055A4866.title": "Let it ferment",
  "quest.3740F1DE055A4866.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Fermentation Station\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:fermentation_station\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" seals raw ore meat and ferments it: twice the amount after 100 ticks, three times after 900, four times with pink slime after 2,400, five times with ether gas after 6,000.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.17CEF172D96A89CF.title": "Back from meat to metal",
  "quest.17CEF172D96A89CF.quest_subtitle": "Five dusts from one raw ore.",
  "quest.17CEF172D96A89CF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Sieving Machine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:fluid_sieving_machine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs 100 mB of fermented ore meat through sand and leaves one dust of that metal. Washed, fermented to five times and sieved, one raw ore ends up as five dusts.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.38C99897062F30FE.title": "Withers to order",
  "quest.38C99897062F30FE.quest_subtitle": "What could possibly go wrong?",
  "quest.38C99897062F30FE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three soul sand, two wither skeleton skulls, a nether star, two plastic and a supreme frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Wither Builder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:wither_builder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". With 3 skulls, 4 soul sand and 20,000 FE it builds a whole Wither in its area.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.500C1D45CD955623.title": "Tag on a sower",
  "quest.500C1D45CD955623.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The farms kept going for a year after the city emptied: sowing, harvesting, bottling what nobody would drink. We automated the chores so well that we forgot who they were for. —J.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "image.76C556BEC01A9FB9.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Latex and plastic\",\"color\":\"#93D9F3\"}]",
  "image.73B413DBEA4517C5.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Belts and transporters\",\"color\":\"#93D9F3\"}]",
  "image.2BC7EB34DAA42CD2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In the chamber\",\"color\":\"#93D9F3\"}]",
  "image.68D4D34E6F0C3E15.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Infinity tools\",\"color\":\"#93D9F3\"}]",
  "image.52D03AB392226568.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Power\",\"color\":\"#93D9F3\"}]",
  "image.5E6D98F462341FD5.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fields and pens\",\"color\":\"#93D9F3\"}]",
  "image.25C562DC92DD395C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Lasers and lenses\",\"color\":\"#93D9F3\"}]",
  "image.0B726B6719CBFF0A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Mobs and Essence\",\"color\":\"#93D9F3\"}]",
  "image.2B87C0EB323FB97A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Resources\",\"color\":\"#93D9F3\"}]",
  "image.25F9819D76620FCC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Industrial Foregoing\",\"color\":\"#F4F9FF\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.128D3E45400B46FC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"tap · melt · dissolve · drill\",\"color\":\"#93D9F3\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.0772FC6DF28E3436.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "chapter.57D95FCA49DD6FFA.title": "Logistics Networks",
  "chapter.57D95FCA49DD6FFA.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Pipes, lasers and wireless power: everything moves on its own."
  ],
  "quest.05CCF43C232C2870.title": "Item Pipes",
  "quest.05CCF43C232C2870.quest_subtitle": "Plumbing for things that don't get wet.",
  "quest.05CCF43C232C2870.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pipes that hook onto any inventory.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six iron ingots, two \"},{\"text\":\"Droppers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:dropper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a redstone make sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Item Pipes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:item_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"They hook onto every inventory they touch, but move nothing until an end is set to extract.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Bare, that end sends \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" items a second.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4D5DE8F1242EB133.title": "Pipe Wrench",
  "quest.4D5DE8F1242EB133.quest_subtitle": "The only tool a plumber needs.",
  "quest.4D5DE8F1242EB133.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Set which end pulls and which end waits.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two flint and two sticks make the \"},{\"text\":\"Pipe Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"With \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" held, use it on a pipe's arm at a chest and that end starts extracting.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Do it again and the arm comes off.\"}]",
    "",
    "Use it on the bare pipe to hook it back.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Right-click an extracting end to open its menu: the upgrade slot and how much it moves."
  ],
  "quest.45164382B7C13FAD.title": "Fluid Pipes",
  "quest.45164382B7C13FAD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The same pipe, for liquids.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Swap the droppers for two \"},{\"text\":\"Buckets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and you get sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Pipes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:fluid_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"They drain tanks and machines, never lakes, and a bare extracting end moves \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB a tick.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"To empty a lake, the \"},{\"text\":\"Pump\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"264F40F4997AB53E\"}},{\"text\":\" feeds straight into them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6FBC8B5A92839CF1.title": "Energy Pipes",
  "quest.6FBC8B5A92839CF1.quest_subtitle": "Watts in a tube. Well, FE.",
  "quest.6FBC8B5A92839CF1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The same pipe, for power.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Blocks of Redstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in place of the droppers make sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Pipes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:energy_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Set the generator's end to extract: bare, it pushes \"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE a tick. Energy takes no filters.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3E142C40C47A6741.title": "Gas Pipes",
  "quest.3E142C40C47A6741.quest_subtitle": "Mekanism's chemicals, by pipe.",
  "quest.3E142C40C47A6741.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chemicals get a pipe of their own.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Infused Alloys\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_infused\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the middle row make sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Gas Pipes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:gas_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a recipe that exists only because Mekanism is here.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"They carry its chemicals, hydrogen, oxygen and the rest: \"},{\"text\":\"200\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB a tick bare.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0B4639123B636864.title": "Universal Pipes",
  "quest.0B4639123B636864.quest_subtitle": "One pipe to carry them all.",
  "quest.0B4639123B636864.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One line for everything.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two each of item, energy and fluid pipes, two iron and a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Redstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make six \"},{\"text\":\"Universal Pipes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:universal_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "One line carries items, fluids, energy and Mekanism's chemicals at once, each at its own rate.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One upgrade in a universal pipe keeps separate settings per kind: the menu has a tab for items, fluids, energy and gas, and the upgrade's tooltip lists the kinds it's set up for.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2B72673A26EA44B0.title": "Basic Pipe Upgrade",
  "quest.2B72673A26EA44B0.quest_subtitle": "Speed, and a say in the matter.",
  "quest.2B72673A26EA44B0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The first upgrade unlocks redstone control.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four iron ingots, four iron nuggets and a redstone make the \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Pipe Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:basic_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In an extracting end's menu it moves \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" items every \"},{\"text\":\"15\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks and unlocks the redstone mode:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Ignored\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Off when powered\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"On when powered\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Always off\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An upgrade serves one extracting end, not the whole line: upgrade only where things go in.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3172DB3AF7591A90.title": "Improved Pipe Upgrade",
  "quest.3172DB3AF7591A90.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The basic one in gold and redstone:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" items every \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"500\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"8,192\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE a tick\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Improved Pipe Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:improved_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" also picks where things go:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Nearest first\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Furthest first\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Round robin\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Random\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Item pipes start on nearest first; fluid, energy and gas pipes on round robin.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7875A03ECFC8A19D.title": "Advanced Pipe Upgrade",
  "quest.7875A03ECFC8A19D.quest_subtitle": "Now it gets picky.",
  "quest.7875A03ECFC8A19D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Diamonds and redstone blocks around the improved one:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" items every \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"2,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"32,768\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"8,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB of gas a tick\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Pipe Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:advanced_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" unlocks filters: an item ID or a #tag, exact data or not, as allow or deny list.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.34212E794968133A.title": "Ultimate Pipe Upgrade",
  "quest.34212E794968133A.quest_subtitle": "Netherite plumbing. As one does.",
  "quest.34212E794968133A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The top of the pipe upgrades.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Netherite Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:netherite_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and four redstone blocks around the advanced one:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"A stack of \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" every tick\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"10,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"131,072\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"40,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB of gas\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Infinity Pipe Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:infinity_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" above it has no recipe.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.145C4C8C661D8832.title": "Filter Destination Tool",
  "quest.145C4C8C661D8832.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Send each item to its own address.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five iron, two redstone, a glass pane and a button make the \"},{\"text\":\"Filter Destination Tool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:filter_destination_tool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Click a block with it, then add it to a filter: matching items go to that block only.",
    "",
    "Ore to the crusher and the rest to the chest, on one line."
  ],
  "quest.017A24D7E626BCAE.title": "One kind per line",
  "quest.017A24D7E626BCAE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A pipe only joins pipes of its own kind. An item line and a fluid line can run side by side, touching, and never mix; a universal pipe only joins other universal ones.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.021B5B090C544FE2.title": "Slot it in",
  "quest.021B5B090C544FE2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hold an upgrade, keep \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" down and use it on an extracting end: the upgrade goes straight in, no menu needed. The one that was there comes back to you.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2C9BE8AC9F32F520.title": "Copy the settings",
  "quest.2C9BE8AC9F32F520.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A configured upgrade next to an empty one in the crafting grid: the new one copies its filters and modes, and the original stays in the grid. An upgrade alone in the grid comes out wiped.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.748A35F0C0CFD79B.title": "Logic Chips",
  "quest.748A35F0C0CFD79B.quest_subtitle": "Baked, not fried.",
  "quest.748A35F0C0CFD79B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The brain of every LaserIO part is baked in a furnace.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:clay_ball\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Four redstone, two gold nuggets, two \"},{\"text\":\"Clay Balls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:clay_ball\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:quartz_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make four \"},{\"text\":\"Raw Logic Chips\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:logic_chip_raw\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"The furnace finishes them.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every LaserIO part starts from a \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Chip\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:logic_chip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In this pack, two of them also go into each \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory Sensor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:inventory_sensor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.09B9595F1F9E8370.title": "The LaserIO guide",
  "quest.7C0D33EF6E50BCD7.title": "The LaserIO guide",
  "quest.7C0D33EF6E50BCD7.quest_subtitle": "Reading is a mechanic too.",
  "quest.7C0D33EF6E50BCD7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Stuck on a card? The guide has a picture.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Chip\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:logic_chip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", shapeless, make LaserIO's guide: every card, filter and setting, with a picture of each menu.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.002FECF554B908EC.title": "Laser Connector",
  "quest.002FECF554B908EC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A cheap hop of eight blocks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Glass, two redstone, a \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Chip\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:logic_chip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and three iron make a \"},{\"text\":\"Laser Connector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:laser_connector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a cheap relay that bridges the gap between nodes, \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks per jump.\"}]",
    "",
    "It is also the heart of every node."
  ],
  "quest.193756AA70D33B62.title": "Laser Node",
  "quest.193756AA70D33B62.quest_subtitle": "Beams, not pipes.",
  "quest.193756AA70D33B62.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Machines talk through cards, not pipes.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron, glass panes and a connector make a \"},{\"text\":\"Laser Node\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:laser_node\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Put it beside your machines: each of its six sides holds a \"},{\"text\":\"3×3\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" grid of cards for the neighbour it faces.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click a side to open it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"The buttons on top reach the sides you can't see.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "One node serves up to six neighbours at once."
  ],
  "quest.51B53009F045057E.title": "Laser Wrench",
  "quest.51B53009F045057E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Join nodes with a beam.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three iron and a chip make the \"},{\"text\":\"Laser Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:laser_wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"With \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" held, right-click one node or connector, then right-click another: a beam joins them, up to \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks apart.\"}]",
    "",
    "Everything hanging from the beams is one network."
  ],
  "quest.65059B594388E787.title": "Advanced Laser Connector",
  "quest.65059B594388E787.quest_subtitle": "Long distance, no roaming charges.",
  "quest.65059B594388E787.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A beam that ignores distance.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two ender pearls, a diamond, three gold and a connector make an \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Laser Connector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:laser_connector_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Two of them pair up at any distance, even across dimensions.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"The wrench shows the partner's coordinates.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Neither end loads its chunk: keep both loaded yourself, or the nodes on the far side stop.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2B8419E5F3058AE3.title": "Item Cards",
  "quest.2B8419E5F3058AE3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One card, one job.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Redstone, lapis, quartz, a chip and gold nuggets make an \"},{\"text\":\"Item Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:card_item\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Right-click it in hand to pick its mode:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Insert, the default, receives\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Extract pulls from its neighbour\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Stock keeps an amount topped up\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Sensor only watches\"}]"
  ],
  "task.6EB1996533456031.title": "An Item Card set to Extract",
  "quest.48CABBDBCA26A940.title": "The first route",
  "quest.48CABBDBCA26A940.quest_subtitle": "From A to B, no pipes attached.",
  "quest.48CABBDBCA26A940.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One card pulls, one card pushes: that is a route.\"}]",
    "",
    "Set an Item Card to Extract and slot it into the node side facing a chest, and an Insert card into the side facing where things should go.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Same channel on both, and items flow: \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" every \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks at first, up to \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" per trip by raising the Extract Amount.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3BECEEB8A907FED2.title": "Fluid Cards",
  "quest.3BECEEB8A907FED2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fluids over the beams.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A bucket in place of the lapis makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:card_fluid\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tanks and machines trade fluids over the beams: \"},{\"text\":\"5,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB every \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks bare, and up to \"},{\"text\":\"40,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB every tick with four Card Overclockers.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.42F00C80E7A39912.title": "Energy Cards",
  "quest.42F00C80E7A39912.quest_subtitle": "A million per tick. Per card.",
  "quest.42F00C80E7A39912.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Power over the beams.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Redstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in place of the lapis makes an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:card_energy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It works every tick with no overclockers, up to \"},{\"text\":\"1,000,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE a tick.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Its Limit % sets how full to fill a target on Insert or Stock, or how much to leave behind on Extract: keep a battery half full for emergencies.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4E2331417D3C4BEF.title": "Chemical Cards",
  "quest.4E2331417D3C4BEF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chemicals over the beams.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Control Circuit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in place of the lapis makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Chemical Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:card_chemical\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", because Mekanism is here.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Its chemicals ride the same beams: \"},{\"text\":\"15,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB every \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks, up to \"},{\"text\":\"240,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB a tick with overclockers.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4BC75B98C5222905.title": "Redstone over lasers",
  "quest.4BC75B98C5222905.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Redstone signals travel by beam too.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three redstone on top make a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:card_redstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Input reads a lever or dust beside its node.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Output emits there, weak or strong.\"}]",
    "",
    "Signals travel on their own redstone channels, and any card can obey one: run only while it's low, or only while it's high."
  ],
  "task.6FFA385F77788489.title": "An Item Card set to Sensor",
  "quest.67ED8C68842E47D9.title": "A chest that talks",
  "quest.67ED8C68842E47D9.quest_subtitle": "It says 15. It always says 15.",
  "quest.67ED8C68842E47D9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An Item Card in Sensor mode moves nothing.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Give it a filter and it watches its neighbour, lighting a redstone channel at strength \"},{\"text\":\"15\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" while the filter matches.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"With several entries, And needs all of them and Or any one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Counting Filter turns it into «at least N», and Exact into «exactly N».\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6AD65369CE259224.title": "Card Overclockers",
  "quest.6AD65369CE259224.quest_subtitle": "Four is the magic number.",
  "quest.6AD65369CE259224.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Stack overclockers to make a card work harder.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four gold, two redstone and a chip make a \"},{\"text\":\"Card Overclocker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:overclocker_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each one in a card raises its limits: \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" items every \"},{\"text\":\"15\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks, then \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" every \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"48\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" every \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" and, with four, \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" every tick.\"}]",
    "",
    "Set the Extract Amount and Tick Speed to match."
  ],
  "quest.38B28FAD603C8E3A.title": "Node Overclocker",
  "quest.38B28FAD603C8E3A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A node side runs one card per tick: if the first does nothing, the next one tries.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:overclocker_node\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Diamonds in place of gold make a \"},{\"text\":\"Node Overclocker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:overclocker_node\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Each one lets a side run one more card per tick, up to eight for all nine.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Only Extract and Stock cards need them: Insert cards never wait.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7388BA469C7D8C8C.title": "Basic Filter",
  "quest.7388BA469C7D8C8C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tell a card which items to touch.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron bars, glass panes and a chip make four \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Filters\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:filter_basic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Put one in a card and fill its ghost slots: Allow passes only those items, Deny everything but them.",
    "",
    "Compare NBT tells a worn sword from a new one."
  ],
  "quest.0A991223C6FB52A7.title": "Counting Filter",
  "quest.0A991223C6FB52A7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Filters that count.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Basic Filter and an \"},{\"text\":\"Observer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:observer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Counting Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:filter_count\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", with counts from \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"4096\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"On an Extract card it leaves that many behind.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"On Insert, it caps what the target receives.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"On Stock, it is the amount to keep.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.44730D60B861E2EE.title": "An Item Card set to Stock",
  "quest.1A22FC3CCB620016.title": "The quiet factory",
  "quest.1A22FC3CCB620016.quest_subtitle": "Every furnace fed, nobody hauling coal.",
  "quest.1A22FC3CCB620016.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Furnaces that feed themselves.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Set an Item Card to Stock, give it a Counting Filter of \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" coal and slot one on every furnace's side: each pulls what it's missing from the network's Insert cards.\"}]",
    "",
    "With Regulate on, extras go back out too.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Stock cards need a filter set to Allow; without one they do nothing.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6B640C2594311E78.title": "Tag Filter",
  "quest.6B640C2594311E78.quest_subtitle": "All ingots, one entry.",
  "quest.6B640C2594311E78.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Match a whole family with one entry.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Basic Filter and \"},{\"text\":\"Paper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:paper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Tag Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:filter_tag\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Put an item in its top slot, pick one of its tags and press +: everything carrying that tag matches.",
    "",
    "The list means «any of these»."
  ],
  "quest.79D777F5BE49833B.title": "Mod Filter",
  "quest.79D777F5BE49833B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Match everything from a mod.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Basic Filter and a \"},{\"text\":\"Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Mod Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:filter_mod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": an item inside it matches everything from the same mod.\"}]",
    "",
    "Drop the Laser Wrench in and all of LaserIO matches."
  ],
  "quest.1BB1B1C6263B45A8.title": "Data Filter",
  "quest.1BB1B1C6263B45A8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Match by what an item carries, not by what it is.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Basic Filter and \"},{\"text\":\"White Wool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:white_wool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Data Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:filter_nbt\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It lists the data labels an item carries, like its enchantments, and matches anything that has them, whatever the values: enchanted gear one way, plain gear the other."
  ],
  "quest.3F94E29FF26E96C2.title": "Card Holder",
  "quest.3F94E29FF26E96C2.quest_subtitle": "A deck for your cards.",
  "quest.3F94E29FF26E96C2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Stack cards like cards.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron, two chests and a chip make a \"},{\"text\":\"Card Holder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:card_holder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": cards with the same settings stack to \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" inside, filters and overclockers too.\"}]",
    "",
    "Sneak and use it to toggle auto-pickup: it glows, pulls cards from your inventory and shows them whenever you open a node.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A card crafted on its own comes out reset, ready to stack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7795C8EF5A6B8D63.title": "Card Cloner",
  "quest.7795C8EF5A6B8D63.quest_subtitle": "Copy, paste, repeat.",
  "quest.7795C8EF5A6B8D63.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copy a card once, paste it everywhere.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Paper around a chip, iron in the corners: the \"},{\"text\":\"Card Cloner\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:card_cloner\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "In a node's screen, pick it up on the cursor, left-click a card to copy it and right-click others to paste.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Filters and overclockers come from your Card Holder.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"If one is missing, nothing is pasted.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.022660B580FAC0BE.title": "Channels by colour",
  "quest.022660B580FAC0BE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cards only talk to cards on the same channel colour. Extract cobblestone on orange and coal on black from one chest's node; an orange Insert card above a furnace and a black one below it split them up. One network, many routes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.310F29B32CC27EAD.title": "Sneaky sides",
  "quest.310F29B32CC27EAD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A card's Sneaky setting picks which face of the neighbour it works on. One node beside a furnace can feed ore into its top and fuel into its bottom: two cards, Sneaky Up and Sneaky Down.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6BD1123215004209.title": "Fair shares",
  "quest.6BD1123215004209.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Inserters fill by Priority, highest first, then nearest. An Extract card with Round Robin deals items out in turns instead; Enforced waits while one target is full, so a row of furnaces stays even. Exact only moves full batches.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4424B98D90ACB643.title": "Now you see them",
  "quest.4424B98D90ACB643.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The settings button in any node changes the whole network's beam colour and opacity. Set Alpha to \"},{\"text\":\"0\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" and Wrench Alpha to \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\", and the lasers only show while you hold the Laser Wrench.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7681C3B3F5C1B7D3.title": "Flux Dust",
  "quest.7681C3B3F5C1B7D3.quest_subtitle": "Redstone, under pressure.",
  "quest.7681C3B3F5C1B7D3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Flux starts with redstone and a lot of patience.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Put obsidian two blocks above bedrock with an air gap between, drop redstone into the gap and left-click the obsidian: each redstone turns into one \"},{\"text\":\"Flux Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:flux_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", up to \"},{\"text\":\"512\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" at a time.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The obsidian drops into the gap, and in big batches it may turn to cobblestone instead: with a stack of \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" it does more often than not.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.44CCDE8B259FA12F.title": "Flux Cores",
  "quest.44CCDE8B259FA12F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The heart of every Flux device.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Flux Dust, four obsidian and an \"},{\"text\":\"Eye of Ender\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_eye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make four \"},{\"text\":\"Flux Cores\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:flux_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Every Flux device is built around them."
  ],
  "quest.4A00514510C87A7B.title": "Flux Block",
  "quest.4A00514510C87A7B.quest_subtitle": "Bedrock, to go.",
  "quest.4A00514510C87A7B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A pocket-sized bedrock.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five Flux Dust and four cores make a \"},{\"text\":\"Flux Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:flux_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the base of storage and plugs.\"}]",
    "",
    "It also stands in for bedrock under the obsidian, so the next batch of dust can be made anywhere."
  ],
  "quest.5F37A164B3A0D59F.title": "Flux Plug",
  "quest.5F37A164B3A0D59F.quest_subtitle": "It takes. The network gives.",
  "quest.5F37A164B3A0D59F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The gate to every Flux network.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In this pack the \"},{\"text\":\"Flux Plug\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:flux_plug\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" trades one of its four cores for a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": act III.\"}]",
    "",
    "It pulls energy from the blocks it touches into a network. Right-click it to create a network or join one.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "No plug, no energy in the network: that is the whole gate. Points, storage and the controller keep their own recipes."
  ],
  "quest.27801123FEE6C86A.title": "Flux Point",
  "quest.27801123FEE6C86A.quest_subtitle": "Energy wherever the network reaches.",
  "quest.27801123FEE6C86A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Energy out, wherever the network reaches.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four cores around a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Redstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Flux Point\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:flux_point\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It pushes network energy into the blocks it touches, at any distance and in any dimension, up to \"},{\"text\":\"800,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE a tick by default.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each player can own up to five networks, and the Statistics tab graphs what flows through each one."
  ],
  "quest.0745E3328F6CFACD.title": "Flux Configurator",
  "quest.0745E3328F6CFACD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copy a device's settings and paste them on the rest.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two obsidian, two Flux Dust and an Eye of Ender make the \"},{\"text\":\"Flux Configurator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:flux_configurator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Sneak-use it on a device to copy its settings, then use it on others to paste them: priority, transfer limit or Bypass Limit, Power Surge to jump the queue, and chunk loading.",
    "",
    "Its sibling, the Admin Configurator, has no recipe: it is the server operators' tool."
  ],
  "quest.5305E83D3AC47468.title": "Basic Flux Storage",
  "quest.5305E83D3AC47468.quest_subtitle": "A battery with a membership card.",
  "quest.5305E83D3AC47468.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A tank for the energy nobody has asked for yet.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six Flux Blocks and two glass panes make a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Flux Storage\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:basic_flux_storage\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"2,000,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE inside the network, \"},{\"text\":\"20,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE a tick in or out.\"}]",
    "",
    "It keeps what the plugs bring and the points don't want, and pays it back when they do."
  ],
  "quest.6514BCC7DE926E05.title": "Herculean Flux Storage",
  "quest.6514BCC7DE926E05.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight times the battery.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six Basic Flux Storages and two panes make a \"},{\"text\":\"Herculean Flux Storage\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:herculean_flux_storage\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"16,000,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE and \"},{\"text\":\"120,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE a tick.\"}]",
    "",
    "The energy the six already held carries over into the new one."
  ],
  "quest.2E6B2F7C80184079.title": "The far end stays on",
  "quest.2E6B2F7C80184079.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A plug or a point can keep its own chunk loaded: switch on Chunk Loading in its settings. A generator room at the other end of the world keeps running while you're at home.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3ED26AD930E4E001.title": "A clean slate",
  "quest.3ED26AD930E4E001.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A device you break keeps its network and settings, so it rejoins wherever you place it. Craft it on its own to wipe them; a storage keeps its energy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.400CC8C3E82C8338.title": "Members only",
  "quest.400CC8C3E82C8338.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A network is Public, Private or Encrypted with a password, and its Members tab sets who is owner, admin or user; strangers can't touch it. The Connections tab edits many devices at once.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1FEBB12F4C968D10.title": "Gargantuan",
  "quest.1FEBB12F4C968D10.quest_subtitle": "Two hundred and sixteen Flux Blocks, give or take none.",
  "quest.1FEBB12F4C968D10.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight times again, and then some.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six herculean storages make a \"},{\"text\":\"Gargantuan Flux Storage\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:gargantuan_flux_storage\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"128,000,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE and \"},{\"text\":\"720,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE a tick, the largest battery Flux has.\"}]",
    "",
    "Inside it sit two hundred and sixteen Flux Blocks' worth of work."
  ],
  "reward.27B0324660ED6CA9.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.3F1F2E0C732124B8.title": "Five hundred and twelve",
  "quest.3F1F2E0C732124B8.quest_subtitle": "The most a single click will take.",
  "quest.3F1F2E0C732124B8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Five hundred and twelve \"},{\"text\":\"Flux Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:flux_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": exactly the most one left-click can press.\"}]",
    "",
    "If it went in one batch, that obsidian almost surely came out as cobblestone."
  ],
  "reward.18A9D4F0E058AC84.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.264F40F4997AB53E.title": "Pump",
  "quest.264F40F4997AB53E.quest_subtitle": "Drink the ocean. Politely.",
  "quest.264F40F4997AB53E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Drain a lake without carrying a bucket.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Obsidian, two iron pickaxes, a lava and a water bucket around a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Diamond\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Pump\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rangedpumps:pump\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It drains every fluid source up to \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks around and all the way down, one block every \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks, into a \"},{\"text\":\"32,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB tank.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each drained block costs \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE, so a Flux Point beside it powers it anywhere.\"}]",
    "",
    "It pushes what it holds into every tank or pipe it touches.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It leaves stone where the fluid was.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3B885EC6399E58F0.title": "Ask the pump",
  "quest.3B885EC6399E58F0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click the Pump for its status: the block it's scanning, the range it has reached, its tank and its energy. A redstone signal pauses it, and it says «Done.» when nothing is left. Mekanism's \"},{\"text\":\"Electric Pump\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:electric_pump\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" follows one lake instead of sweeping a square.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.08F172F80A57CAE0.title": "Basic Item Collector",
  "quest.08F172F80A57CAE0.quest_subtitle": "A hopper with ambition.",
  "quest.08F172F80A57CAE0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A hopper that reaches the floor around it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An ender pearl over four obsidian makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Item Collector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"itemcollectors:basic_collector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Stick it to a chest and it grabs items off the ground around it: 7×7×7 at first and up to 11×11×11, each axis set on its own in the menu."
  ],
  "quest.789EC5609BA1C0AA.title": "Advanced Item Collector",
  "quest.789EC5609BA1C0AA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A bigger cube, and it can say no.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Eye of Ender\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_eye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" over a basic collector and three obsidian: the \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Item Collector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"itemcollectors:advanced_collector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reaches 15×15×15 and filters.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nine slots, whitelist or blacklist, and whether the item data must match too."
  ],
  "quest.07D887054758DE58.title": "Straight into the chest",
  "quest.07D887054758DE58.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A collector has no inventory of its own: what it picks up goes straight into the block it's stuck to. No chest behind it, nothing collected. The show-area button draws the box it covers.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.014A8F84EBC9F691.title": "Energy Meter",
  "quest.014A8F84EBC9F691.quest_subtitle": "Numbers for your power lines.",
  "quest.014A8F84EBC9F691.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Read the flow of any power line.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron, a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Comparator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:comparator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", an \"},{\"text\":\"Observer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:observer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", redstone and glass make an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Meter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"energymeter:meter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Put it in a power line like a cable: its front screen shows the flow, its menu the total, the status and a graph of the last ten readings.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The other five sides are inputs, outputs or off, in its I/O grid.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Split, the default, shares energy evenly between outputs.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Transfer fills them by priority.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It measures every \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks, Instant or Smoothed, and Tolerance ends a reading early when the flow stops.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.536708F45C27D271.title": "Test bench",
  "quest.536708F45C27D271.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Consume mode deletes every FE that comes in and allows no outputs: put a meter on a generator in this mode and you read its true maximum. \"},{\"text\":\"Don't leave it like that.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.39B52DB018FA73DA.title": "A meter as a throttle",
  "quest.39B52DB018FA73DA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Limit caps what passes per tick, all inputs together, and the rest stays with the sender. Put one between a huge battery and a fussy machine. Its text fields even take math, like \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"*\"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.336A0FDDE44FA90F.title": "Read it from a computer",
  "quest.336A0FDDE44FA90F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Next to a ComputerCraft computer the meter becomes an «energymeter» peripheral: getEnergyRate() and getTotalEnergy() return its numbers, and it fires an energymeter_changed event whenever they move.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.547643738565E9CE.title": "Not yet",
  "quest.547643738565E9CE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four meters around an ender pearl make four External Monitors, which join into bigger screens.\"}]",
    "",
    "In this version their own tooltip reads «Work in progress!»: keep the meters for your lines."
  ],
  "quest.3A13853061DAA755.title": "Chips for the common store",
  "quest.3A13853061DAA755.quest_subtitle": "Fresh from the oven.",
  "quest.3A13853061DAA755.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Thirty-two \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Chips\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:logic_chip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "That is eight blocks of quartz: a furnace line pays for itself."
  ],
  "quest.1AC267ABDA85EAC5.title": "All nine at once",
  "quest.1AC267ABDA85EAC5.quest_subtitle": "Thirty-two diamonds of pure impatience.",
  "quest.1AC267ABDA85EAC5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight \"},{\"text\":\"Node Overclockers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:overclocker_node\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": enough for one node side to run all nine of its cards in the same tick.\"}]",
    "",
    "Thirty-two diamonds so that nothing ever waits its turn."
  ],
  "reward.1720F5CBE9E22DA5.title": "Secret found",
  "task.5828B96AC70E1B53.title": "Look at an Item Pipe under water",
  "quest.3014F6E8C84B80C2.title": "Plumbing, literally",
  "quest.3014F6E8C84B80C2.quest_subtitle": "The pipe doesn't mind. The fish might.",
  "quest.3014F6E8C84B80C2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You found an \"},{\"text\":\"Item Pipe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pipez:item_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" under water.\"}]",
    "",
    "Pipez pipes waterlog like a slab: they keep working, and the water stays put around them."
  ],
  "reward.3F476E793EF67F8D.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.7E7602760B6FAD57.title": "Inventory Sensor",
  "quest.7E7602760B6FAD57.quest_subtitle": "It knows when the shelf is full.",
  "quest.7E7602760B6FAD57.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A part the pack asks for, built from LaserIO chips.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Crystallized Menril Chunks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:crystalized_menril_chunk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Chips\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:logic_chip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Routing Matrix\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:routing_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make an \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory Sensor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:inventory_sensor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"The first goes to \"},{\"text\":\"When the Shelf is Full\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"27A67154B0D96862\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"QIO drive arrays and the Ark's bus want more.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.48039F57E19CAEE5.title": "Charged on the go",
  "quest.48039F57E19CAEE5.quest_subtitle": "The cable finally lost.",
  "quest.48039F57E19CAEE5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Charge everything you carry, wherever you stand.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five Flux Blocks, a core and two dust make the \"},{\"text\":\"Flux Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"fluxnetworks:flux_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", one per network.\"}]",
    "",
    "In its Wireless Charging tab the network charges what you carry, hotbar, hands, armour and Curios slots, wherever you stand.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:fluxnetworks:textures/block/flux_controller.png width:48 height:48 align:center}",
    "",
    "Items by pipe and by beam, fluids from the pump, power by flux: the base now runs without you, and follows you around."
  ],
  "quest.22FA7C44E9520C91.title": "Route ledger",
  "quest.22FA7C44E9520C91.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every route in Heliodor had a meter on it. We knew to the joule what each district drew, and to the day when the light would be ready. Nobody measured what it would cost. —J.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "quest.7B54EE98812CCA92.title": "Throw the lever",
  "quest.7B54EE98812CCA92.quest_subtitle": "Clunk.",
  "quest.7B54EE98812CCA92.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Someone has to power the tunnel up.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: just lights."
  ],
  "image.2BA627D58647ED27.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.1EECB7FFA3E2395E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"LOGISTICS\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.05FB8C26C8DFAE16.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The freight tunnel\",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"}]",
  "image.4058AB1ACAFDB93F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pipe upgrades\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.1F1B96AAC80604D6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pipes by kind\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.1AB1FCA8F36D2821.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Cards\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.62EF63AA0D837BE7.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Card kit\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.46E3886E3D1B1121.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Collectors\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.2DCC90B8C87D1CAA.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Overclock\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.3D09D8231DCD0DC3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Filters\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.4F897FDDEF92F02F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Flux storage\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.49B04BA279AFC35E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pump and meter\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "chapter.42B819B4DF274C89.title": "Mekanism · Basics",
  "chapter.42B819B4DF274C89.chapter_subtitle": [
    "From the infuser to five ingots per ore: alloys, circuits, the ore ladder, chemistry and factories."
  ],
  "quest.19CB5696848FEBD9.title": "Metallurgic Infuser",
  "quest.19CB5696848FEBD9.quest_subtitle": "Mekanism's front door, and every alloy's.",
  "quest.19CB5696848FEBD9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Material on the left, item in the middle.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron, redstone and two furnaces around a \"},{\"text\":\"Calibration Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:calibration_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The pack puts the Frame from \"},{\"text\":\"First Signal\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"762B0B9FB46F552F\"}},{\"text\":\" where Mekanism wanted an osmium ingot.\"}]",
    "",
    "It spends the stored infusion.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It copies Frames too: a \"},{\"text\":\"Raw Lens\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:raw_lens\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with \"},{\"text\":\"40\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" redstone (four dust) makes one.\"}]",
    "",
    "Keep the infuser running and you never run short."
  ],
  "quest.453870346F22C04D.title": "Osmium",
  "quest.453870346F22C04D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Dig a lot of it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:raw_osmium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Osmium Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:osmium_ore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns up at almost any height.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ingot_osmium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Circuits, casings, tanks and upgrades all eat \"},{\"text\":\"Osmium Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ingot_osmium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.632A4DCDEDCA47B9.title": "Basic Control Circuit",
  "quest.632A4DCDEDCA47B9.quest_subtitle": "A rock that learned to count.",
  "quest.632A4DCDEDCA47B9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Almost every Mekanism machine takes one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ingot_osmium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"One osmium ingot and \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" redstone in the infuser.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Out comes a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Control Circuit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Power Regulator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:power_regulator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" of act III takes two.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.091376A558055EC0.title": "Steel",
  "quest.091376A558055EC0.quest_subtitle": "Carbon, twice. Then heat.",
  "quest.091376A558055EC0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three steps from iron to steel.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:enriched_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Iron and \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" carbon: \"},{\"text\":\"Enriched Iron\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:enriched_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" more: \"},{\"text\":\"Steel Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:dust_steel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Smelt it: a \"},{\"text\":\"Steel Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:ingot_steel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "One coal is 10 carbon. Almost Unified keeps a single steel for the whole pack."
  ],
  "quest.49BE73F80D49E351.title": "Steel Casing",
  "quest.49BE73F80D49E351.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Nearly every Mekanism machine is built around one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four steel, four glass and an osmium ingot: one \"},{\"text\":\"Steel Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:steel_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Make a stack while the infuser is warm.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4F591F844FDAF9EA.title": "Enrichment Chamber",
  "quest.4F591F844FDAF9EA.quest_subtitle": "Two for one, forever.",
  "quest.4F591F844FDAF9EA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The first rung of the ore ladder.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An ore block becomes \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" dusts; three raw ores become four.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Point its output at an \"},{\"text\":\"Energized Smelter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:energized_smelter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with auto-eject and every ore doubles on its own.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It also enriches coal, redstone and diamonds for the infuser, turns fluorite ore into six gems and scrubs the green off old copper."
  ],
  "quest.7654D937DFCAE528.title": "The other four ores",
  "quest.7654D937DFCAE528.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mekanism also buries tin, lead, uranium and fluorite.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ingot_tin\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Tin\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ingot_tin\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": bronze and heaters.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Lead\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:ingot_lead\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": reactors and radiation gear.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:fluorite_gem\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Fluorite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:fluorite_gem\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the ×5 crystallizer.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ingot_uranium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Uranium waits for the reactor chapter.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fluorite sits deep. Enriched, one ore gives six gems.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6F8B736B8BD5A211.title": "Bronze by infusion",
  "quest.6F8B736B8BD5A211.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three copper ingots and \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" tin infusion: four \"},{\"text\":\"Bronze Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ingot_bronze\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "The flamethrower, the Solar Neutron Activator, armored jetpacks and a whole Mekanism Tools set ask for it."
  ],
  "quest.49145D699B5F7037.title": "Dictionary",
  "quest.49145D699B5F7037.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A machine refusing an ingot? Ask the \"},{\"text\":\"Dictionary\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dictionary\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" first.\"}]",
    "",
    "A book and a basic circuit.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Right-click an item, block or fluid and it lists its tags: what most pack recipes actually check.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5452400605B2E16E.title": "Infuser party tricks",
  "quest.5452400605B2E16E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cheap decoration, zero farming.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:bio_fuel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Bio fuel: dirt into podzol, cobblestone into mossy, clay into slime balls.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Mushrooms: dirt into mycelium, netherrack into nylium.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dust_gold\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Gold dust gilds blackstone.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.54780C8D09E34E22.title": "Smelter and crusher",
  "quest.54780C8D09E34E22.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The ore lines need both.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Energized Smelter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:energized_smelter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a furnace that runs on power and takes upgrades.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Crusher\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:crusher\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": ingots into dust, obsidian into four dusts, crops into bio fuel.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.14E5910A3E3F2429.title": "Precision Sawmill",
  "quest.14E5910A3E3F2429.quest_subtitle": "Measure once, cut six.",
  "quest.14E5910A3E3F2429.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A log becomes \"},{\"text\":\"six\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" planks instead of four.\"}]",
    "",
    "Plus a sawdust one time in four.",
    "",
    "It also takes apart chests, doors, beds and boats for their wood.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:sawdust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Sawdust makes the Cardboard Box.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.60B4DC47E9B5A19E.title": "Redstone in a pinch",
  "quest.60B4DC47E9B5A19E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A machine with no generator still runs.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone dust in its energy slot: \"},{\"text\":\"10,000\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" joules.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A block: \"},{\"text\":\"90,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Fine for a first test, not for a factory."
  ],
  "quest.28555724F48F4C98.title": "Woop woop",
  "quest.28555724F48F4C98.quest_subtitle": "Your neighbours have questions.",
  "quest.28555724F48F4C98.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You built an \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Alarm\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:industrial_alarm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Lead, two circuits and a lamp that screams on redstone.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wire it to a reactor, not to the doorbell.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.3D64BD97EF4159F6.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.23DDAEDB68C22955.title": "Twice the iron",
  "quest.23DDAEDB68C22955.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ore in, grit out, smelter behind.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×2\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" ingots per ore block, as \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Grit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:dust_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" first.\"}]",
    "",
    "A raw iron block gives twelve grit, where a furnace gives nine ingots."
  ],
  "quest.1C262970740A5BD8.title": "Raw or Silk Touch?",
  "quest.1C262970740A5BD8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Raw wins at every rung.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Per ore block: \"},{\"text\":\"2, 3, 4 or 5\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" ingots.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Per raw ore: about \"},{\"text\":\"1.3, 2, 2.7 or 3.3\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fortune III averages \"},{\"text\":\"2.2\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" raw per iron or gold ore.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Never combine raw back into ore: it costs eight.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0DEC133F39D372BF.title": "Every ore counts",
  "quest.0DEC133F39D372BF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The ore lines read common tags.\"}]",
    "",
    "Any mod's copper, tin, lead or uranium ore runs the same chain, and Almost Unified hands you the pack's ingot at the end."
  ],
  "quest.3C5B69282B68529E.title": "Enrich before you infuse",
  "quest.3C5B69282B68529E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight times less mining for every alloy.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:coal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"One coal: \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" carbon.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:enriched_carbon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Enriched first, \"},{\"text\":\"Enriched Carbon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:enriched_carbon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Redstone, diamond, gold, tin and refined obsidian work the same way."
  ],
  "quest.5FFBDA5C1966E63E.title": "Three scraps per debris",
  "quest.5FFBDA5C1966E63E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Debris is worth triple here.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Crush \"},{\"text\":\"Ancient Debris\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ancient_debris\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into three \"},{\"text\":\"Dirty Netherite Scrap\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dirty_netherite_scrap\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Enrich each into a scrap.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dust_netherite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Four scraps and \"},{\"text\":\"40\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" gold infusion: \"},{\"text\":\"Netherite Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dust_netherite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.638F7FA395E0DF69.title": "More than ore",
  "quest.638F7FA395E0DF69.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The chamber also doubles diamond, emerald and coal ores.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:string\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A cobweb: \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" string.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:clay_ball\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A clay block: \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" clay balls.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:salt\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A salt block: \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" salt.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4B74368CFAAEB506.title": "Advanced tier",
  "quest.4B74368CFAAEB506.quest_subtitle": "Red: copper learns redstone.",
  "quest.4B74368CFAAEB506.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three things, in order:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Copper and \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" redstone: \"},{\"text\":\"Infused Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_infused\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:advanced_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A basic circuit between two alloys: an \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Control Circuit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:advanced_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:advanced_tier_installer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Both make the \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Tier Installer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:advanced_tier_installer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Infused alloy is the pack's act II material.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click a placed factory with the installer: it becomes an advanced factory, \"},{\"text\":\"five\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" jobs at once, with everything inside kept.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.442828417CA8E4B1.title": "Elite tier",
  "quest.442828417CA8E4B1.quest_subtitle": "Cyan: diamonds make everything better.",
  "quest.442828417CA8E4B1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Seven jobs per factory.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Infused alloy and \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" diamond infusion: \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:elite_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"With an advanced circuit it gives the \"},{\"text\":\"Elite Control Circuit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:elite_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and the \"},{\"text\":\"Elite Tier Installer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:elite_tier_installer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Reinforced alloy is the act III material of the pack.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Enrich diamonds before infusing: one diamond becomes \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" units, four alloys. Crushed, it gives 10.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0D42E7962747E44D.title": "Ultimate tier",
  "quest.0D42E7962747E44D.quest_subtitle": "Purple: the top of the ladder, for now.",
  "quest.0D42E7962747E44D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Nine jobs per factory.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced alloy and \"},{\"text\":\"40\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" refined obsidian infusion: \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ultimate_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Then the \"},{\"text\":\"Ultimate Control Circuit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ultimate_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and the \"},{\"text\":\"Ultimate Tier Installer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ultimate_tier_installer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Atomic alloy is the act V material: the Ark bus and the NASA workbench take it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.68A3BD4A0922BE6C.title": "Creative, at a price",
  "quest.68A3BD4A0922BE6C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Nothing else in Mekanism is creative here.\"}]",
    "",
    "The creative energy cube, fluid tank and chemical tank each cost:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"two Luminosities,\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"two antimatter pellets,\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"an ultimate block of the same kind.\"}]",
    "",
    "That's act VI."
  ],
  "quest.03EDC15E24003218.title": "Purification Chamber",
  "quest.03EDC15E24003218.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With oxygen piped in, an ore block becomes \"},{\"text\":\"three\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Clumps\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:clump_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "A raw ore, two. Then down the line:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dirty_dust_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Crusher\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:crusher\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns clumps into dirty dust.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dust_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"The Enrichment Chamber cleans it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"The smelter finishes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3E8848EBCF6C0F99.title": "Dirty work",
  "quest.3E8848EBCF6C0F99.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Once wired, the ×3 line runs alone.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Clumps leave the \"},{\"text\":\"Crusher\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:crusher\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" as \"},{\"text\":\"Dirty Iron Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dirty_dust_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and go back into the Enrichment Chamber.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Auto-eject each machine into the next.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1542F3F004374F41.title": "Laying out the line",
  "quest.1542F3F004374F41.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Build backwards from the smelter and auto-eject each machine into the next.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Items ride Logistical Transporters.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Chemicals, Pressurized Tubes.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Water, Mechanical Pipes.\"}]",
    "",
    "When one stage backs up, turn it into a factory right there."
  ],
  "quest.69531B1053799E84.title": "Chemical Injection Chamber",
  "quest.69531B1053799E84.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hydrogen chloride turns an ore block into \"},{\"text\":\"four\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:shard_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Three raw ores, eight.",
    "",
    "Shards go into the Purification Chamber as if they were ore and follow the ×3 line from there."
  ],
  "quest.629779C586663C42.title": "Injected",
  "quest.629779C586663C42.quest_subtitle": "Hold the chloride.",
  "quest.629779C586663C42.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Iron Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:shard_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" by the stack: the injector never runs dry.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It burns hydrogen chloride every tick it works: keep a full tank beside it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4BF21CA6DB94B673.title": "Dissolve, wash, crystallize",
  "quest.4BF21CA6DB94B673.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Five per ore, in three machines:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Chemical Dissolution Chamber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:chemical_dissolution_chamber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": sulfuric acid turns an ore block into \"},{\"text\":\"1000 mB\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" of dirty slurry.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Chemical Washer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:chemical_washer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" cleans it with water.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:crystal_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Chemical Crystallizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:chemical_crystallizer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes a crystal every \"},{\"text\":\"200 mB\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Crystals enter the Injection Chamber and ride the rest of the ladder down."
  ],
  "quest.097681B4961E86A7.title": "Five per ore",
  "quest.097681B4961E86A7.quest_subtitle": "Every ore, all five rungs.",
  "quest.097681B4961E86A7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Automate the whole ladder, dissolution to smelter.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Bring \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Crystals\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:crystal_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"One ore block: \"},{\"text\":\"five\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" ingots.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"One raw iron block: \"},{\"text\":\"thirty\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dust_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"×2\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" dust\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:clump_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"×3\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" clumps\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:shard_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"×4\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" shards\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:crystal_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"×5\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" crystals\"}]",
    "",
    "Each rung is one machine in front of the last, and nothing from a lower rung is wasted."
  ],
  "quest.2F668AA8CC2CD507.title": "Tanks and tubes",
  "quest.2F668AA8CC2CD507.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Gases never share a pipe with fluids.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Redstone and osmium: a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Chemical Tank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_chemical_tank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Steel and glass: eight \"},{\"text\":\"Pressurized Tubes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_pressurized_tube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.665DAC3A063D6BCE.title": "Electrolytic Separator",
  "quest.665DAC3A063D6BCE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two parts water: two of hydrogen, one of oxygen.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Oxygen: to the Purification Chamber.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Hydrogen: jetpacks and gas generators, or dump it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In a hurry? Flint in a machine's chemical slot counts as \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" oxygen.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7AAD6A41961878DE.title": "Thermal Evaporation Plant",
  "quest.7AAD6A41961878DE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A hollow \"},{\"text\":\"4×4\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" tower, \"},{\"text\":\"3 to 18\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" blocks high.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Thermal Evaporation Blocks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:thermal_evaporation_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", one \"},{\"text\":\"Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:thermal_evaporation_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and valves.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Ten water: one brine.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Ten brine: one lithium.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Taller and hotter runs faster.\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7AD47E00FF7F365B.title": "Salt shortcuts",
  "quest.7AD47E00FF7F365B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Enough to test the injector.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:salt\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Salt\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:salt\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in a chemical slot becomes hydrogen chloride on the spot, \"},{\"text\":\"two\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" units each.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"An oxidizer turns it into brine; brine crystallizes back into salt.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.22349F7776839BAD.title": "Chemical Infuser",
  "quest.22349F7776839BAD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chlorine and hydrogen, one to one: hydrogen chloride.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Brine through the separator gives sodium and chlorine. The \"},{\"text\":\"Chemical Infuser\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:chemical_infuser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" joins the chlorine with hydrogen.\"}]",
    "",
    "Later it makes sulfur trioxide, sulfuric acid and fusion fuel."
  ],
  "quest.2C7583D99D19BD77.title": "Rotary Condensentrator",
  "quest.2C7583D99D19BD77.quest_subtitle": "It condenses and it concentrates. Pick one.",
  "quest.2C7583D99D19BD77.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A gas into its liquid, and back.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Water into water vapor, for sulfuric acid.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Hydrogen or ethene into buckets you can store anywhere.\"}]",
    "",
    "Toggle the direction in its screen."
  ],
  "quest.3152C87C85D96BA6.title": "Chemical Oxidizer",
  "quest.3152C87C85D96BA6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Solids into gas.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Sulfur Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:dust_sulfur\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" sulfur dioxide.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:yellow_cake_uranium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Yellow cake: uranium oxide.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dust_lithium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Lithium dust: lithium.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Its recipe wants a Dynamic Tank block and a personal chest or barrel.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.23C2CF85615E3DD8.title": "Pressurized Reaction Chamber",
  "quest.23C2CF85615E3DD8.quest_subtitle": "Solid, liquid and gas walk into a chamber.",
  "quest.23C2CF85615E3DD8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The sulfur mine you never dig.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:coal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"One coal, \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" water and \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" oxygen: \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" hydrogen and a \"},{\"text\":\"Sulfur Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:dust_sulfur\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:bio_fuel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Bio fuel, water and hydrogen: ethene and substrate, the road to plastic.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.79384642C4B83DC2.title": "Sulfuric acid",
  "quest.79384642C4B83DC2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three steps to the acid:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Oxidize \"},{\"text\":\"Sulfur Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:dust_sulfur\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into sulfur dioxide.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Infuse it with oxygen into sulfur trioxide.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Then with water vapor into sulfuric acid.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Dissolution Chamber drinks it every tick it works.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0B32EB1212C72099.title": "Plastic",
  "quest.0B32EB1212C72099.quest_subtitle": "Future MekaSuit, currently a pellet.",
  "quest.0B32EB1212C72099.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The MekaSuit, the SPS casing and most MekaSuit modules are made of it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:hdpe_pellet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Substrate, \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" ethene and \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" oxygen in the reaction chamber: an HDPE pellet.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:hdpe_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Three pellets enriched: an \"},{\"text\":\"HDPE Sheet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:hdpe_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5BC3AE9B229AF367.title": "Spring cleaning",
  "quest.5BC3AE9B229AF367.quest_subtitle": "Not a drop wasted. Well, one.",
  "quest.5BC3AE9B229AF367.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wrong gas in the wrong tank? That's the undo button.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Gauge Dropper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:gauge_dropper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a tank gauge in a machine screen empties it.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.1DCA66A8D4BF2B9B.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.571E4609C7DBE405.title": "Osmium Compressor",
  "quest.571E4609C7DBE405.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It burns osmium like fuel, \"},{\"text\":\"200\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" units per ingot.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:glowstone_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Glowstone dust: \"},{\"text\":\"Refined Glowstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ingot_refined_glowstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dust_refined_obsidian\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Refined obsidian dust: ingots.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Built from an advanced circuit and infused alloy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3F0A3D4BD7CD7DC3.title": "Refined Glowstone",
  "quest.3F0A3D4BD7CD7DC3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two uses, both worth it:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"the \"},{\"text\":\"Teleporter Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:teleporter_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\",\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"the refined glowstone set of Mekanism Tools, bright enough to light your way.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5ADD5F6244D85EAA.title": "Refined Obsidian",
  "quest.5ADD5F6244D85EAA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The infusion behind atomic alloy.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dust_obsidian\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Crush obsidian into dust and infuse it with \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" diamond: \"},{\"text\":\"Refined Obsidian Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dust_refined_obsidian\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ingot_refined_obsidian\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Osmium Compressor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:osmium_compressor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" presses it into \"},{\"text\":\"Refined Obsidian Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ingot_refined_obsidian\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the ×5 machines.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6F5634156B7CBD6D.title": "Sides and colors",
  "quest.6F5634156B7CBD6D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Most \\\"my machine does nothing\\\" is a side set wrong.\"}]",
    "",
    "Every machine face has a color: input, output, energy or off.",
    "",
    "Turn on auto-eject and results leave by themselves."
  ],
  "quest.00A44CBA44389978.title": "Configurator",
  "quest.00A44CBA44389978.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two iron, an osmium ingot and a steel ingot.\"}]",
    "",
    "Shift-right-click cycles its modes:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"configure a face in the world,\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"empty a machine,\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"rotate it,\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"use it as a wrench.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.mode\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" switches mode too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6E47A63690BB78E6.title": "Copy, paste",
  "quest.6E47A63690BB78E6.quest_subtitle": "Twenty machines, one click each.",
  "quest.6E47A63690BB78E6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Set one up right, then stamp it on the rest.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Configuration Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:configuration_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" copied one machine's sides and pasted them onto another.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.26855CCD17F36AC7.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.661FA7821F2D1A57.title": "Speed and energy",
  "quest.661FA7821F2D1A57.quest_subtitle": "Go faster. Pay for it.",
  "quest.661FA7821F2D1A57.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Speed alone drinks power: pair them.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_speed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Infused alloy and glass around osmium dust: a \"},{\"text\":\"Speed Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_speed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_energy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Around gold dust: an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_energy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Up to \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" of each per machine.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3ABD5123B10FB27B.title": "The rest of the drawer",
  "quest.3ABD5123B10FB27B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Five more upgrades, one job each.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_muffling\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Muffling\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_muffling\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" quiets a machine.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_chemical\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Chemical\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_chemical\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": chemical-hungry machines use less, up to eight.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Filter pulls heavy water.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_anchor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Anchor keeps a chunk loaded.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_stone_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Stone Generator refills what a miner digs.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.21FFB243EABD11B6.title": "Upgrades travel",
  "quest.21FFB243EABD11B6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Move upgrades to where the bottleneck is.\"}]",
    "",
    "Pull them out in the machine's upgrade tab.",
    "",
    "Upgrading a machine to a factory with an installer keeps them in."
  ],
  "task.1C7BED26A40D73D6.title": "Make a factory or use an installer",
  "quest.44FCC2FE085BE2FB.title": "The factory must grow",
  "quest.44FCC2FE085BE2FB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Several jobs at once, from one power and gas supply.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A machine, basic circuits, iron and redstone make its factory; a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Tier Installer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_tier_installer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" does it in place.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Basic: \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" jobs.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:advanced_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced: \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:elite_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Elite: \"},{\"text\":\"7\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ultimate_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Ultimate: \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6EFE26582A231FEF.title": "Factories for the ladder",
  "quest.6EFE26582A231FEF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Enriching, purifying and injecting all have factories.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An ultimate \"},{\"text\":\"Purifying Factory\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_purifying_factory\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" ores on one oxygen supply.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Speed and an Energy upgrade per stage, then raise the tier where the queue grows.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.66246893B6524D29.title": "Formulaic Assemblicator",
  "quest.66246893B6524D29.quest_subtitle": "A crafting table that never blinks.",
  "quest.66246893B6524D29.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Small automation, before AE2 or Refined Storage.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:crafting_formula\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Write a recipe onto a \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Formula\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:crafting_formula\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the \"},{\"text\":\"Formulaic Assemblicator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:formulaic_assemblicator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It crafts it from whatever you pipe in.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0D9972EE20897060.title": "Paint by machine",
  "quest.0D9972EE20897060.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three machines, one paint shop:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:red_dye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Pigment Extractor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:pigment_extractor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pulls pigment out of dyes and flowers.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The Pigment Mixer blends two.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Painting Machine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:painting_machine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" recolors blocks and items from the pigment tank.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7B469A385C394E88.title": "Osmium for the common store",
  "quest.7B469A385C394E88.quest_subtitle": "Somebody always needs another casing.",
  "quest.7B469A385C394E88.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"For the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"32\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Osmium Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:ingot_osmium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "An enrichment line makes it painless."
  ],
  "quest.2E9CD35014A85B5B.title": "Absolute tier",
  "quest.2E9CD35014A85B5B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The first tier past ultimate, from Mekanism Extras.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Compress glowstone dust with uranium oxide for radiance.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Infuse atomic alloy with it: \"},{\"text\":\"Radiance Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:alloy_radiance\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:absolute_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"It makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Absolute Control Circuit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:absolute_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and the \"},{\"text\":\"Absolute Tier Installer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:absolute_tier_installer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4C3CB7574EACF7B7.title": "Supreme tier",
  "quest.4C3CB7574EACF7B7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Molten thermonuclear, and what it makes:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A netherite ingot, superheated sodium and lava in the reaction chamber: molten thermonuclear.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It turns enriched radiance into thermonuclear, and that into \"},{\"text\":\"Thermonuclear Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:alloy_thermonuclear\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:supreme_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"For the \"},{\"text\":\"Supreme Control Circuit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:supreme_control_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and its \"},{\"text\":\"installer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:supreme_tier_installer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0DE663CD7C4E675B.title": "Cosmic tier",
  "quest.0DE663CD7C4E675B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Antimatter enters the recipe.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"One antimatter unit in the Nucleosynthesizer turns enriched thermonuclear into enriched shining.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Infused into thermonuclear alloy: \"},{\"text\":\"Shining Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:alloy_shining\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Cosmic circuits and \"},{\"text\":\"installers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:cosmic_tier_installer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" follow, and the Naquadah reactor needs both.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.236F32D4B9AEB4F9.title": "Infinite tier",
  "quest.236F32D4B9AEB4F9.quest_subtitle": "Can it run Minecraft yet? Yes.",
  "quest.236F32D4B9AEB4F9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The top of the Extras ladder.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The Osmium Compressor, fed antimatter instead of osmium, turns enriched shining into spectrum.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Infused into shining alloy: \"},{\"text\":\"Spectrum Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:alloy_spectrum\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Infinite Tier Installer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:infinite_tier_installer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" also wants a plutonium and a polonium pellet.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5511D399DC176949.title": "Stack Upgrade",
  "quest.5511D399DC176949.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Several operations in parallel, on top of Speed.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Thermonuclear alloy around a chest: the \"},{\"text\":\"Stack Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:upgrade_stack\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6F0050EE9FA20B34.title": "Naquadah",
  "quest.6F0050EE9FA20B34.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It climbs the same five rungs.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Mekanism Extras hides \"},{\"text\":\"Naquadah Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:naquadah_ore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" near the Overworld's bedrock and, more often, near the void in the End.\"}]",
    "",
    "Its ingots fuel the Extras reactor."
  ],
  "quest.2116AE17C6925F49.title": "Planting Station",
  "quest.2116AE17C6925F49.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A sapling or crop grows into its harvest on nutrient solution.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"That's the \"},{\"text\":\"Planting Station\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekmm:planting_station\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In this pack Mystical Agriculture seeds are left out and the replicators are gone: nothing copies items from thin air.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.10FBA27EFA91E675.title": "Stamper and presser",
  "quest.10FBA27EFA91E675.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An inscriber that takes Speed upgrades.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"CNC Stamper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekmm:cnc_stamper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" uses AE2 presses as molds to print circuits.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Presser\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekmm:presser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds redstone and printed silicon to finish the processor.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6C7BA901E570CBE7.title": "Rods and wires",
  "quest.6C7BA901E570CBE7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Immersive Engineering parts, made by Mekanism.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"CNC Rolling Mill\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekmm:cnc_rolling_mill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" bends an ingot into two wires.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"CNC Lathe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekmm:cnc_lathe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns one into two rods.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The lathe is built around a Robit: plan the atomic alloy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3E15AFD47884626A.title": "Large machines",
  "quest.3E15AFD47884626A.quest_subtitle": "Each one eats a Robit. Sorry, buddy.",
  "quest.3E15AFD47884626A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The work of many, in one block.\"}]",
    "",
    "MoreMachine's big chemical infuser, separator and condensentrator.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each recipe has a Robit at its heart, steel blocks and ultimate chemical tanks around it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.63823B8696EDD879.title": "More factories",
  "quest.63823B8696EDD879.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Factories for the machines Mekanism left alone.\"}]",
    "",
    "Oxidizing, dissolving, washing, crystallizing, centrifuging, reacting and more.",
    "",
    "In the same four tiers, and the four of Extras."
  ],
  "quest.4336AA8A316A2D87.title": "Bio fuel",
  "quest.4336AA8A316A2D87.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Crusher\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:crusher\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns crops, seeds, saplings and food into \"},{\"text\":\"Bio Fuel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:bio_fuel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:apple\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"An apple: \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:bread\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Bread: \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:cake\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A cake: \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It runs the bio generator, becomes ethene in the reaction chamber and feeds the Planting Station."
  ],
  "quest.59093824C14EB8E1.title": "What to do with hydrogen",
  "quest.59093824C14EB8E1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The separator makes twice as much hydrogen as oxygen.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Burn it in a gas generator.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Fill jetpacks.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Or set that output to dump.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With the hydrogen tank full, the oxygen stops too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6B6B9198208253F1.title": "Crusher bonuses",
  "quest.6B6B9198208253F1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Better than by hand:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:bone_meal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A bone: \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" bone meal.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_powder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A blaze rod: \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" blaze powder.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:wind_charge\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A breeze rod: \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" wind charges.\"}]",
    "",
    "Cobblestone becomes gravel."
  ],
  "quest.6D6440D5A185969C.title": "Combiner",
  "quest.6D6440D5A185969C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It presses two items into one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:flint\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Flint and cobblestone: gravel.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:glowstone_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Glowstone dust: glow berries, glow ink and glow frames.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dust_obsidian\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Four obsidian dusts and cobbled deepslate: obsidian.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:raw_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Raw ore and cobble: ore blocks, at eight raw a block.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6BAE50C1E5FB03AC.title": "Energy Tablet",
  "quest.6BAE50C1E5FB03AC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A battery that fits in a pocket.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Infused alloy, gold and redstone make an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Tablet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:energy_tablet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Energy cubes, solar and wind generators, induction cells, heaters and the Robit are all built around one."
  ],
  "quest.2160F64C571685B7.title": "Cheaper compressor fuel",
  "quest.2160F64C571685B7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With Extras, crush an osmium ingot and enrich the dust.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Enriched Osmium\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:enriched_osmium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is \"},{\"text\":\"1600\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" units of compressor fuel: eight ingots' worth.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1F0B0B49C7994474.title": "Injector side jobs",
  "quest.1F0B0B49C7994474.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Gunpowder with hydrogen chloride becomes sulfur dust.\"}]",
    "",
    "With water vapor instead, the injector:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"revives dead coral,\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"hardens concrete powder,\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"turns terracotta back into clay.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3A6DA1E7B25184C6.title": "Moving day",
  "quest.3A6DA1E7B25184C6.quest_subtitle": "Some assembly required. None allowed.",
  "quest.3A6DA1E7B25184C6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chests travel full.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four sawdust make a \"},{\"text\":\"Cardboard Box\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:cardboard_box\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; you boxed up a block with everything inside and unpacked it somewhere else.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.46161886BA3D605A.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.6DFE9939CBC327C5.title": "Say hi to the Robit",
  "quest.6DFE9939CBC327C5.quest_subtitle": "Beep.",
  "quest.6DFE9939CBC327C5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It follows you, smelts for you and never asks for a raise.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nothing to build here. Just a wave."
  ],
  "image.390BC3883D96F4AC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"BASIC\",\"color\":\"#1EA05C\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.3FC73809C24B388B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ADVANCED\",\"color\":\"#CF443F\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.7F2DFA8D7851CBC3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ELITE\",\"color\":\"#269BA1\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.3281C1A1AE69CC71.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ULTIMATE\",\"color\":\"#AB5AAF\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.513C7B1C694B4627.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×2\",\"color\":\"#E8C890\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.1C20605443200A26.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×3\",\"color\":\"#E8C890\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.086E23451A6290EB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×4\",\"color\":\"#E8C890\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.1CE234B8271C2639.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"×5\",\"color\":\"#E8C890\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.793AC1A58FFE97C2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Ores\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.7EEFE5A2FF0B5AD5.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MoreMachine\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\"}]",
  "image.3942FB73EA92910E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Mekanism Extras\",\"color\":\"#E09030\"}]",
  "image.1A18AFDE818EDACF.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MEKANISM\",\"color\":\"#E6EEF2\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.5E4214FFB3E8FA62.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Basics\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
  "image.5FD52CCEE86703C8.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.5F01512E7032CF02.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Energy and reactors\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
  "image.1C2B9183503F7D4E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Logistics and gear\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
  "image.2E8A459C56FF48A9.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"infuse enrich repeat\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "chapter.335E1EBA8FB3C477.title": "Modular Routers",
  "chapter.335E1EBA8FB3C477.chapter_subtitle": [
    "One block, nine modules: it sends, pulls, breaks, places and throws whatever you tell it to."
  ],
  "quest.0736402840CEA2F5.title": "Blank Modules",
  "quest.0736402840CEA2F5.quest_subtitle": "Every job starts on paper.",
  "quest.0736402840CEA2F5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The blank every module, and the router itself, is cut from.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three \"},{\"text\":\"Paper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:paper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", three gold nuggets and a redstone make six \"},{\"text\":\"Blank Modules\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:blank_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Every module starts as one, and so does the router itself.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In this pack, two of them also go into each \"},{\"text\":\"Handling Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:handling_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.058BE65D29FE0DB7.title": "Modular Router",
  "quest.058BE65D29FE0DB7.quest_subtitle": "One slot, nine jobs.",
  "quest.058BE65D29FE0DB7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A chest with a to-do list.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four iron, four iron bars and a Blank Module make four \"},{\"text\":\"Modular Routers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:modular_router\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Alone it's a one-stack chest that pipes and hoppers can fill.",
    "",
    "With modules, up to nine, it does their jobs left to right, once a second."
  ],
  "task.17F3126FB82FF091.title": "The Modular Routers manual",
  "quest.35C219094495CADB.title": "The router manual",
  "quest.35C219094495CADB.quest_subtitle": "Twenty modules, one index.",
  "quest.35C219094495CADB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"When a module's quirks slip your mind, the book has them.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a Blank Module, shapeless, make the Modular Routers manual: a page for every module, upgrade, augment and filter, with ranges and quirks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.47055EB557E19626.title": "It's also a chest",
  "quest.47055EB557E19626.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The buffer is an ordinary inventory: pipes and hoppers fill and empty it, and a comparator reads how full it is. With a tank item inside, fluid pipes can pump in and out of the router, no Fluid Module needed.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.639F2B09CF28C648.title": "Tune it in place",
  "quest.639F2B09CF28C648.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In the router's screen, hover a module and press \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.modularrouters.configure\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\", or middle-click it, to open its settings without taking it out. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.modularrouters.moduleInfo\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" shows its extra info.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.600E4C311B03D4A3.title": "When it runs",
  "quest.600E4C311B03D4A3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The router's top-right button sets when it runs: always, only without a signal, only with one, never, or once per pulse. Eco Mode slows an idle router to one run every \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" seconds until it has work again.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.00424957C313275B.title": "Front is relative",
  "quest.00424957C313275B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A module's direction counts from the router's front, not the compass. Turn the router and every module turns with it, so one tested setup can be copied facing any way.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.59CE29FBA0E14B10.title": "Who gets through",
  "quest.59CE29FBA0E14B10.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A module's nine filter slots take ghost copies, so nothing is used up. A new module is a blacklist: empty, it lets everything through. Switch it to a whitelist and, empty, it never runs.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The buttons beside the slots decide whether damage, components like enchantments and shared tags count, and whether one entry is enough or all of them must match."
  ],
  "quest.0A923CBC44ADDA88.title": "Stop right there",
  "quest.0A923CBC44ADDA88.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A module's T button ends the router's run whenever that module did some work. A Void Module on cobblestone with T on, then a Sender: the cobblestone never leaks into your storage.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.290163B23A0B2F75.title": "Clean slate",
  "quest.290163B23A0B2F75.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A module crafted on its own comes out as new: filter and settings wiped, and a breaker keeps its pickaxe. \"},{\"text\":\"Take its augments out first:\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" they don't come back.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.12009C89323A4C1B.title": "Sender Module Mk1",
  "quest.12009C89323A4C1B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The router's first job: push items along a straight line.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Module with a bow and an arrow, or with a piston, makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Sender Module Mk1\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:sender_module_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"It pushes the buffer into an inventory straight along its direction, up to \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks away with clear sight.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Glass and fences don't block it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0DF16B8B6D8DC75E.title": "Sender Module Mk2",
  "quest.0DF16B8B6D8DC75E.quest_subtitle": "Aim, click, deliver.",
  "quest.0DF16B8B6D8DC75E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Aim once, deliver forever.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Sender Mk1 and an ender pearl make a \"},{\"text\":\"Sender Module Mk2\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:sender_module_2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; four Mk1s and one pearl make four.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sneak-use it on an inventory to target it: up to \"},{\"text\":\"24\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks away, \"},{\"text\":\"48\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" with augments, no line of sight needed.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0CBD0FC2D59E003A.title": "Puller Module Mk1",
  "quest.0CBD0FC2D59E003A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The router reaches out and grabs.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Module and a \"},{\"text\":\"Sticky Piston\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sticky_piston\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Puller Module Mk1\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:puller_module_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it pulls the first matching item from the inventory next to it into the buffer.\"}]",
    "",
    "A router with a puller and a sender is already a filtered hopper."
  ],
  "quest.5A37E5452F496508.title": "Puller Module Mk2",
  "quest.5A37E5452F496508.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It pulls from the far side of a wall.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Puller Mk1 and an ender pearl make a \"},{\"text\":\"Puller Module Mk2\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:puller_module_2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sneak-use it on an inventory to target it: it pulls from up to \"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks away, \"},{\"text\":\"24\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" with augments, through walls.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.15372149A2940BF5.title": "Sender Module Mk3",
  "quest.15372149A2940BF5.quest_subtitle": "Any inventory, any dimension.",
  "quest.15372149A2940BF5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Distance stops mattering.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Sender Mk2, \"},{\"text\":\"End Stone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:end_stone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Chest\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_chest\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Sender Module Mk3\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:sender_module_3\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it delivers to its target at any distance, in any dimension.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The target's chunk must be loaded; the router won't load it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6881A47FBF06BE77.title": "Distributor Module",
  "quest.6881A47FBF06BE77.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One buffer, many destinations.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three Sender Mk2s around a Blank Module make a \"},{\"text\":\"Distributor Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:distributor_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Sneak-use it on up to eight inventories to add them, again to drop one: it deals the buffer out round robin, at random, nearest first or furthest first."
  ],
  "quest.1C002A613C85D948.title": "Void Module",
  "quest.1C002A613C85D948.quest_subtitle": "A trash can with a filter.",
  "quest.1C002A613C85D948.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A trash can for the buffer: what it takes is gone for good.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Module and a \"},{\"text\":\"Lava Bucket\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lava_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Void Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:void_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Give it a whitelist before you plug it in.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5FAA9B8ADDEBCC18.title": "Detector Module",
  "quest.5FAA9B8ADDEBCC18.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Redstone that reads the buffer.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Module and a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Comparator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:comparator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Detector Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:detector_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It moves nothing: when the buffer matches its filter, the router emits redstone in the module's direction, level \"},{\"text\":\"15\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" by default, weak or strong.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.062014D5E8DC4A34.title": "Breaker Module",
  "quest.062014D5E8DC4A34.quest_subtitle": "It mines like the pickaxe you gave it.",
  "quest.062014D5E8DC4A34.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A pickaxe that works on its own, enchantments included.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Module and any pickaxe make a \"},{\"text\":\"Breaker Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:breaker_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" that keeps the pickaxe's tier and enchantments: Silk Touch and Fortune work.\"}]",
    "",
    "It breaks the block in its direction and pulls the drops into the buffer.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It filters on the drops: to break stone, filter cobblestone, unless it has Silk Touch. Its settings can switch it to match the block itself.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.047A8907AA7D2A00.title": "Placer Module",
  "quest.047A8907AA7D2A00.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blocks appear where the router points.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Module, a \"},{\"text\":\"Dispenser\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:dispenser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Dirt\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:dirt\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Placer Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:placer_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it places the buffer item as a block in its direction, by the usual rules.\"}]",
    "",
    "It plants seeds on farmland too."
  ],
  "quest.2A1381800A39DDE5.title": "Dropper Module",
  "quest.2A1381800A39DDE5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A dropper that drops politely.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Module and a \"},{\"text\":\"Dropper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:dropper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Dropper Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:dropper_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it drops buffer items in its direction with no velocity at all, none of a vanilla dropper's random spit.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.64C39BFA006BAC0E.title": "Flinger Module",
  "quest.64C39BFA006BAC0E.quest_subtitle": "Yeet, but configurable.",
  "quest.64C39BFA006BAC0E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Aim, set the speed, throw.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Dropper Module and \"},{\"text\":\"Gunpowder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:gunpowder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Flinger Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:flinger_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it throws items with the speed, pitch and yaw you set.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Speed \"},{\"text\":\"1.0\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" on the level throws an item about \"},{\"text\":\"7\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3DB8A14253AD451C.title": "Vacuum Module",
  "quest.3DB8A14253AD451C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One module cleans up a whole room.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Module, a \"},{\"text\":\"Hopper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:hopper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and an \"},{\"text\":\"Eye of Ender\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_eye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Vacuum Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:vacuum_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it sucks dropped items into the buffer from a 13×13×13 cube, up to \"},{\"text\":\"25\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" wide with Range Up.\"}]",
    "",
    "Give it a direction and the cube shifts that way."
  ],
  "quest.2F370A8E9F45CC02.title": "Activator Module",
  "quest.2F370A8E9F45CC02.quest_subtitle": "A fake player with a real job.",
  "quest.2F370A8E9F45CC02.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Anything you'd do with a right-click, the router can do.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two dispensers, a lever, redstone and quartz around a Blank Module make an \"},{\"text\":\"Activator Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:activator_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a fake player using the buffer item.\"}]",
    "",
    "It right-clicks blocks, right-clicks animals for milk and wool, or attacks.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Attacking costs \"},{\"text\":\"150\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE per hit by default, so it wants an Energy Upgrade.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It reaches about \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks and can look above, below or level.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.10A239B4537B4512.title": "Extruder Module Mk1",
  "quest.10A239B4537B4512.quest_subtitle": "Drawbridges, on demand.",
  "quest.10A239B4537B4512.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Bridges that appear on a redstone signal.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Module, a Placer Module and a Breaker Module make an \"},{\"text\":\"Extruder Module Mk1\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:extruder_module_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", with the breaker's pickaxe.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"With redstone it pushes a row of buffer blocks out in its direction; without, it pulls them back: bridges and hidden doors, \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" blocks long, \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" with augments.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Break the router while the blocks are out and they stay out.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The manual still says \"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"; in this version the base range is \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.63DFBAEFF20FF40D.title": "Extruder Module Mk2",
  "quest.63DFBAEFF20FF40D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Build from a blueprint of ghost blocks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Module and a wooden chest make an \"},{\"text\":\"Extruder Module Mk2\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:extruder_module_2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It builds from a \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"-slot template of ghost blocks instead of the buffer: what it puts out are fakes that drop nothing, \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" long by default, \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" with augments.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.18145D5B11B6BD18.title": "Mimic Augment",
  "quest.18145D5B11B6BD18.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fake blocks that behave like the real ones.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Augment Core, obsidian, redstone and glowstone make a \"},{\"text\":\"Mimic Augment\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:mimic_augment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", for the Extruder Mk2 only: its fakes take the real block's light, redstone, hardness and blast resistance.\"}]",
    "",
    "Fake obsidian stops creepers for real."
  ],
  "quest.4010D7C602744018.title": "Pushing Augment",
  "quest.4010D7C602744018.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Whoever is in the way gets shoved.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two pistons around an Augment Core make a \"},{\"text\":\"Pushing Augment\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:pushing_augment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for either extruder.\"}]",
    "",
    "Every one you stack shoves whoever stands in the way harder when the blocks come out."
  ],
  "quest.1DF940B5A333083D.title": "Fluid Module Mk1",
  "quest.1DF940B5A333083D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Buckets and tanks, filled and emptied by the router.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Cauldron\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:cauldron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two glass over a Blank Module make a \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Module Mk1\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:fluid_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"With a bucket or tank item in the buffer, it fills it from the block in front or pours it out, into a tank or the world, \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB a tick: a bucket a second.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2F8F69E80A1891A6.title": "Fluid Module Mk2",
  "quest.2F8F69E80A1891A6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Aim the fluid at a block far away.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Fluid Mk1 and a \"},{\"text\":\"Prismarine Shard\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:prismarine_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Module Mk2\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:fluid_module_2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": sneak-use it on any block up to \"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" away, \"},{\"text\":\"24\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" with augments, to target it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Break that block and it pours into the world right there."
  ],
  "quest.7E575940DB3FE88A.title": "Fluid Transfer Upgrade",
  "quest.7E575940DB3FE88A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A faster fluid tap.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A bucket and two glass over a Blank Upgrade make three \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Transfer Upgrades\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:fluid_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each adds \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB a tick to the router's fluid rate, from \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" up to \"},{\"text\":\"400\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\": thirty-five of them.\"}]",
    "",
    "Speed Upgrades only make transfers more frequent, not bigger."
  ],
  "quest.6D81B84C59869072.title": "Energy Output Module",
  "quest.6D81B84C59869072.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Let the router hand out power.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Module with a block of redstone, two gold and quartz makes an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Output Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:energy_output_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it pushes FE from the router's energy buffer, or from a charged item in its item buffer, into the block in its direction.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.295DD2E5745455FA.title": "Energy Distributor Module",
  "quest.295DD2E5745455FA.quest_subtitle": "Wireless power, router style.",
  "quest.295DD2E5745455FA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight machines, no cables.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Energy Output Module and a Distributor Module make an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Distributor Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:energy_distributor_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": sneak-use it on up to eight energy blocks nearby and the router feeds them all, no cables.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1DBBC4B6A66A6B13.title": "Blank Upgrades",
  "quest.1DBBC4B6A66A6B13.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blank upgrades are cheap; the slots are what you budget.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Paper, lapis and gold nuggets make four \"},{\"text\":\"Blank Upgrades\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:blank_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the base of every router upgrade.\"}]",
    "",
    "A router has five upgrade slots, and each one holds several of a kind, up to that upgrade's limit."
  ],
  "quest.54C9A1DC5FD165C8.title": "Stack Upgrade",
  "quest.54C9A1DC5FD165C8.quest_subtitle": "Kinder to your server than speed.",
  "quest.54C9A1DC5FD165C8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Move more per run, kindly.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Upgrade, stone bricks and bricks make a \"},{\"text\":\"Stack Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:stack_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"A module moves one item per run.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Each Stack Upgrade doubles that, up to a full stack with six.\"}]",
    "",
    "Prefer them to Speed Upgrades: the same throughput in fewer runs."
  ],
  "quest.0018BDEEF2C2E4E5.title": "Speed Upgrade",
  "quest.0018BDEEF2C2E4E5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Faster runs, at the server's expense.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Gold, redstone, gunpowder and a blaze rod around a Blank Upgrade make three \"},{\"text\":\"Speed Upgrades\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:speed_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Each cuts \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks off the router's \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"-tick cycle.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Nine bring it to \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" runs a second, as fast as it goes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0A3052BF756CB330.title": "Energy Upgrade",
  "quest.0A3052BF756CB330.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Power for the modules that ask for it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Quartz, a block of redstone and gold around a Blank Upgrade make an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:energy_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"50,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE of buffer and \"},{\"text\":\"1,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" FE per run, each, up to \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" of them.\"}]",
    "",
    "It charges or drains powered items in the buffer and feeds the energy modules.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Those rates are per router run, not per tick: with no Speed Upgrades, a run comes every \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7988B7B4D2D667BD.title": "Security Upgrade",
  "quest.7988B7B4D2D667BD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lock the router to you and your friends.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Quartz, gold nuggets and redstone around a Blank Upgrade make a \"},{\"text\":\"Security Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:security_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": only you and up to six players you right-click with it can open the router.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Placers, breakers and activators then act as you, which land claims prefer.",
    "",
    "An attacking Activator spares the players on the list.",
    "",
    "The Security Override Card, creative only, opens any router."
  ],
  "quest.7B503AA0EF338341.title": "Camouflage Upgrade",
  "quest.7B503AA0EF338341.quest_subtitle": "Nothing to see here. Literally.",
  "quest.7B503AA0EF338341.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The router disguises itself as a block.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Upgrade with red, green and blue dye makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Camouflage Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:camouflage_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Sneak-use it on a block to copy its look, and the router wears it.",
    "",
    "Holding a router shows the camouflaged ones nearby."
  ],
  "quest.1C1CD517D17895B0.title": "Muffler Upgrade",
  "quest.1C1CD517D17895B0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A quiet router.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wool around a Blank Upgrade makes four \"},{\"text\":\"Muffler Upgrades\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:muffler_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "One silences the router, two also hide its beams and flying items, and three stop its front from pulsing."
  ],
  "quest.440F3E247F87DB19.title": "Sync Upgrade",
  "quest.440F3E247F87DB19.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Many routers, one heartbeat.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Redstone, stone and a redstone torch with a Blank Upgrade make sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Sync Upgrades\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:sync_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Routers with the same tuning, \"},{\"text\":\"0\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"19\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\", and the same number of Speed Upgrades always run on the same tick: a wide drawbridge moves as one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4DD482359E9A52C5.title": "Blast Upgrade",
  "quest.4DD482359E9A52C5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Your Wither farm's router will thank you.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Iron bars and obsidian around a Blank Upgrade make a \"},{\"text\":\"Blast Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:blast_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the router shrugs off explosions and bosses can't destroy it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1EADF9B87E560C87.title": "Augment Cores",
  "quest.1EADF9B87E560C87.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The blank for augments, the upgrades of a single module.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blank Module and a Blank Upgrade make four \"},{\"text\":\"Augment Cores\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:augment_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Augments are upgrades for a single module: each module has four augment slots, and not every augment fits every module."
  ],
  "quest.48633B7996879137.title": "Regulator Augment",
  "quest.48633B7996879137.quest_subtitle": "Enough is a number.",
  "quest.48633B7996879137.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tell a module when to stop.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Augment Core, two comparators and quartz make a \"},{\"text\":\"Regulator Augment\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:regulator_augment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It gives the module a count: a sender stops once the target holds that many, a puller leaves that many behind, a breaker stops when the buffer has that many.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Fluid modules take it in mB or as a percentage of the tank."
  ],
  "quest.53F40BAFEBE07057.title": "Range Augments",
  "quest.53F40BAFEBE07057.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A little further, or a little less.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Quartz, a stick and an Augment Core make four \"},{\"text\":\"Range Up Augments\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:range_up_augment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", each +\"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" block for a ranged module up to its limit.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Range Down Augment\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:range_down_augment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes one off.\"}]",
    "",
    "Craft either one alone to flip it into the other."
  ],
  "quest.267A0F561CDA0EE3.title": "Redstone Augment",
  "quest.267A0F561CDA0EE3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each module keeps its own redstone rule.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Redstone and two redstone torches around an Augment Core make a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Augment\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:redstone_augment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": that module follows its own redstone rule, apart from the router's.\"}]",
    "",
    "One router can run its sender only while powered and its vacuum always."
  ],
  "quest.47A06CF4E6214F0B.title": "Stack Augment",
  "quest.47A06CF4E6214F0B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tune how many items one module moves.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Stack Upgrade and an Augment Core make a \"},{\"text\":\"Stack Augment\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:stack_augment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": each doubles the items that one module handles, and it overrides the router's Stack Upgrades for that module, up or down.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.79D22D75BC4F1458.title": "Pickup Delay Augment",
  "quest.79D22D75BC4F1458.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Thrown items stay out of reach a bit longer.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A slimeball and an Augment Core make a \"},{\"text\":\"Pickup Delay Augment\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:pickup_delay_augment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for droppers and flingers: each one, up to twenty, keeps what they throw out of reach for half a second more.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.53A4F34EC5996A82.title": "Fast Pickup Augment",
  "quest.53A4F34EC5996A82.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The vacuum stops waiting for the pickup delay.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A fishing rod and an Augment Core make a \"},{\"text\":\"Fast Pickup Augment\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:fast_pickup_augment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the vacuum: it skips the pickup delay, \"},{\"text\":\"40\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks on a player's drops and \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" on the rest, and grabs items the moment they land.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.081DD6650554363D.title": "XP Vacuum Augment",
  "quest.081DD6650554363D.quest_subtitle": "Bottled experience, 7 at a time.",
  "quest.081DD6650554363D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Free XP, without standing in the orb cloud.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Soul sand and an Augment Core make an \"},{\"text\":\"XP Vacuum Augment\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:xp_vacuum_augment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the vacuum takes experience orbs instead of items and bottles them as \"},{\"text\":\"Bottles o' Enchanting\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:experience_bottle\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"7\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" XP each.\"}]",
    "",
    "With a tank in the buffer or beside the router, it can fill it with liquid XP instead."
  ],
  "quest.1ED00A2E70DA5FCA.title": "Filter Round Robin Augment",
  "quest.1ED00A2E70DA5FCA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Send things in order, not all at once.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A clock and an Augment Core make a \"},{\"text\":\"Filter Round Robin Augment\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:filter_round_robin_augment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": instead of matching any filter entry, the module takes one entry per run, in order.\"}]",
    "",
    "Things that must go in a set sequence stop being a puzzle."
  ],
  "quest.2BCD75739D1FCDA6.title": "Bulk Item Filter",
  "quest.2BCD75739D1FCDA6.quest_subtitle": "It remembers what belongs where.",
  "quest.2BCD75739D1FCDA6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sort by example: show the filter a chest and it copies it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron, glass, a diamond and two Blank Modules make a \"},{\"text\":\"Bulk Item Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:bulk_item_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": up to \"},{\"text\":\"54\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" items in one filter slot.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Sneak-use it on a chest to copy what's inside.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"On a Sender Mk2 aimed at that chest, it keeps sorting there even after the chest is emptied.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.331CE58858E405F5.title": "Tag Filter",
  "quest.331CE58858E405F5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One filter for a whole family of items.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Bulk Item Filter, paper and black dye make a \"},{\"text\":\"Tag Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:tag_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it matches items by the tags they belong to, like every ingot at once.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7FDFC242DDD5A265.title": "Mod Filter",
  "quest.7FDFC242DDD5A265.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Everything from one mod, in a single slot.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Bulk Item Filter, a repeater and a redstone torch make a \"},{\"text\":\"Mod Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:mod_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": drop any item in its slot, press + and everything from that mod matches, up to six mods per filter.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1468FFEF3E8A23EC.title": "Regex Filter",
  "quest.1468FFEF3E8A23EC.quest_subtitle": "For people who enjoy backslashes.",
  "quest.1468FFEF3E8A23EC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"When neither tags nor mods are precise enough.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Bulk Item Filter and a comparator make a \"},{\"text\":\"Regex Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:regex_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": up to six regular expressions, matched against the registry name after the colon, case-insensitive. _ore$ catches every ore and skips drill_core.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.13BA92EF743C36BE.title": "Inspection Filter",
  "quest.13BA92EF743C36BE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Filter by how worn or how charged.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Bulk Item Filter, two spider eyes and paper make an \"},{\"text\":\"Inspection Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:inspection_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It checks a number on the item: durability, energy or fluid as a percentage, top enchantment level, or food value.",
    "",
    "Pull worn tools out for repair, or charged batteries off the line."
  ],
  "quest.70CD44EBFAC144C4.title": "Chemical Transfer Upgrade",
  "quest.70CD44EBFAC144C4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chemicals flow faster.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Osmium and glass around a Blank Upgrade make a \"},{\"text\":\"Chemical Transfer Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanisticrouters:chemical_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", from Mekanistic Routers: each adds \"},{\"text\":\"200\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" mB a tick to the router's chemical rate, which starts at \"},{\"text\":\"1,000\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The chemical modules are in \"},{\"text\":\"Mekanistic Routers\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"69FAA53443B0B9B7\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.59B9705F321CB1CE.title": "Chemical Refill Module",
  "quest.59B9705F321CB1CE.quest_subtitle": "Never land on an empty jetpack again.",
  "quest.59B9705F321CB1CE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Jetpacks refuel by themselves.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A diamond helmet over a \"},{\"text\":\"Chemical Module Mk2\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanisticrouters:chemical_module_mk2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" over a wither skeleton skull make a \"},{\"text\":\"Chemical Refill Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanisticrouters:chemical_refill_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": from the router, it refills jetpacks and other chemical items in a player's inventory, wirelessly.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.253A1B7E8ED6EC04.title": "Handling Core",
  "quest.253A1B7E8ED6EC04.quest_subtitle": "Small hands for large workshops.",
  "quest.253A1B7E8ED6EC04.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A part the pack asks for later, made from router parts.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Precision Mechanism\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:precision_mechanism\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two Blank Modules and a \"},{\"text\":\"Power Regulator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:power_regulator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Handling Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:handling_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"The first goes to \"},{\"text\":\"Small Hands, Large Workshops\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6C696AA48D00D512\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\"Refined Storage's autocrafter, the auto trader and the Ark's bus want more.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3811C10E5B930174.title": "Creative only",
  "quest.3811C10E5B930174.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two items you will never craft.\"}]",
    "",
    "Two router items have no recipe: the Creative Module, which conjures the items in its filter into the buffer in turn, and the Security Override Card, which opens any secured router while held."
  ],
  "task.11CC52A390629D05.title": "Look at a block an Extruder Mk2 built",
  "quest.1B140231A4A7908D.title": "Nothing there",
  "quest.1B140231A4A7908D.quest_subtitle": "Knock knock. Who's there? Nobody.",
  "quest.1B140231A4A7908D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You're looking at a template frame, the fake block an Extruder Mk2 builds.\"}]",
    "",
    "It drops nothing when broken, and without a Mimic Augment it is only a picture of the real thing."
  ],
  "reward.3E5D1EE017B8FCEA.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.484452C15D2487BC.title": "Be kind to your server",
  "quest.484452C15D2487BC.quest_subtitle": "Ten runs a second. The server noticed.",
  "quest.484452C15D2487BC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Nine \"},{\"text\":\"Speed Upgrades\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:speed_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a router at its hard limit, one run every \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#E8C48A\"},{\"text\":\" ticks.\"}]",
    "",
    "Its own manual pleads for Stack Upgrades instead, and it has a point."
  ],
  "reward.6D854AA4F49E7F6C.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.14AB0C29C147264E.title": "Modules for the common store",
  "quest.14AB0C29C147264E.quest_subtitle": "Paperwork, literally.",
  "quest.14AB0C29C147264E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Thirty-two \"},{\"text\":\"Blank Modules\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:blank_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day: six batches of paper, gold and redstone.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2F65F08A98EB7F04.title": "Player Module",
  "quest.2F65F08A98EB7F04.quest_subtitle": "Your inventory, on the network.",
  "quest.2F65F08A98EB7F04.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Your inventory becomes a router destination.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A diamond helmet and chestplate, a wither skeleton skull, a Sender Mk3 and a Puller Mk2 make the \"},{\"text\":\"Player Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modularrouters:player_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It moves items between the router and its owner's inventory, armour, offhand or ender chest, wherever they are, in any dimension.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:modularrouters:textures/item/module/player_module.png width:48 height:48 align:center}",
    "",
    "Mine far from home and let the ores leave your pockets for the base on their own, or swap armour sets with a lever.",
    "",
    "It belongs to whoever crafted it: sneak-use it to claim one, and add a Security Upgrade on a server."
  ],
  "quest.4538DEA7854D8F7A.title": "Instruction card",
  "quest.4538DEA7854D8F7A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In Heliodor we wrote every job down before we handed it to a machine. The machines followed the cards perfectly. The cards were the problem. —T.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "quest.3C30F6A42F07F9A7.title": "Ring for service",
  "quest.3C30F6A42F07F9A7.quest_subtitle": "Ding.",
  "quest.3C30F6A42F07F9A7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every counter deserves a bell.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nothing to build. Just noise."
  ],
  "image.249FBD053552F64F.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.0B9D4B517E75D6A8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ROUTERS\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.652D18BFA4F676A3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The sorting office\",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"}]",
  "image.33BCA27DA4187168.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Filters\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.1B275FBC9951E06D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Augments\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.3E39C41DF5B73348.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fluids and chemicals\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.32085A4A2DA6C54E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"More upgrades\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.141D898F5ABCE8E3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Router power\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.69B9C09A489AE0BA.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Modules\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "chapter.75EF5037C77E6FF2.title": "PneumaticCraft · Pressure",
  "chapter.75EF5037C77E6FF2.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Compressed air as power: tubes and compressors, the Pressure Chamber, heat, oil and plastic, and the PCB line up to twenty bar."
  ],
  "quest.3150D58D03E04401.title": "Compressed Iron",
  "quest.3150D58D03E04401.quest_subtitle": "Step back. No, further.",
  "quest.3150D58D03E04401.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"PneumaticCraft adds no ores: its metal is iron that went through an explosion. Drop iron ingots and set off TNT next to them; they come back as \"},{\"text\":\"Compressed Iron Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:ingot_iron_compressed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", about a fifth fewer.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blocks of iron blow up into Blocks of Compressed Iron the same way. Once the Pressure Chamber runs, it compresses iron at 2 bar with nothing lost.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.074A05CBCE944BF5.title": "Pressure Tubes",
  "quest.074A05CBCE944BF5.quest_desc": [
    "Two compressed iron and a glass block make eight. They carry air between compressors and machines, up to 5 bar, and any open end leaks with a hiss."
  ],
  "quest.48778579BF06AFAE.title": "Reinforced Stone",
  "quest.48778579BF06AFAE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight stone around one compressed iron make eight \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Stone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:reinforced_stone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; four of those make four \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Bricks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:reinforced_bricks\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Compressors, chamber walls and half the machines of the mod are built from them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.406D06BE3F1FCDC1.title": "Air Compressor",
  "quest.406D06BE3F1FCDC1.quest_subtitle": "Coal in, air out.",
  "quest.406D06BE3F1FCDC1.quest_desc": [
    "Six reinforced bricks, a furnace and a pressure tube. It burns anything a furnace takes and makes 10 mL of air per tick; lava and other liquid fuels go to the Liquid Compressor instead.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each Speed Upgrade makes a compressor 1.5 times faster and 1.65 times hungrier: quicker, never cheaper.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.47774B423F345834.title": "Charging Station",
  "quest.47774B423F345834.quest_desc": [
    "A pressure tube, three bricks and three reinforced slabs. Tools, armor and drones fill up to the station's own pressure, 10 bar at most, and the arrow above the slot opens their upgrade screen.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Dispenser Upgrade turns it into a charge pad: it fills items lying on top, players standing on it and drones hovering over it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.40A8D9DB32CEC57F.title": "Walls, a valve, two interfaces",
  "quest.40A8D9DB32CEC57F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight reinforced bricks in a ring make sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Pressure Chamber Walls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:pressure_chamber_wall\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". A wall and a tube make a \"},{\"text\":\"Valve\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:pressure_chamber_valve\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; two walls and a hopper, two \"},{\"text\":\"Interfaces\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:pressure_chamber_interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Chamber glass can stand in for any wall.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.1AD5B1F89248ED68.title": "Assemble a Pressure Chamber",
  "quest.34253C1A53D95911.title": "Pressure Chamber",
  "quest.34253C1A53D95911.quest_subtitle": "Squeeze, don't smelt.",
  "quest.34253C1A53D95911.quest_desc": [
    "A hollow box, 3×3×3 to 5×5×5: walls or glass on edges and corners, at least one valve fed with air, one interface with its I outward and one with its O outward. It runs recipes up to 5 bar and stores so much air it doubles as a battery."
  ],
  "quest.721672145B1351AF.title": "Seismic Sensor",
  "quest.721672145B1351AF.quest_subtitle": "Listening for black gold.",
  "quest.721672145B1351AF.quest_desc": [
    "Oil lakes are the only thing the mod adds to the world, and most sit deep underground. Right-click the ground with the sensor: it tells you whether oil lies straight below, how far down and roughly how many buckets."
  ],
  "task.709858A5BFA6351B.title": "Fill a bucket with crude oil",
  "quest.4377F5F9BF65B36C.title": "Gas Lift",
  "quest.4377F5F9BF65B36C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Place it where the sensor found oil and load it with \"},{\"text\":\"Drill Pipes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:drill_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; three tubes make three. With air it pushes them down, breaks whatever is in the way and pumps the first fluid it meets. Deeper oil needs more pressure, up to 4.9 bar.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/patchouli/oil_pumping.png width:96 height:96 align:center}",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Gas Lift and a Small Tank keep their fluid when broken: carry the oil home in them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5FA15976B9F5A7BA.title": "Refinery",
  "quest.5FA15976B9F5A7BA.quest_subtitle": "Crude in, four fuels out.",
  "quest.5FA15976B9F5A7BA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Refinery Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:refinery\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with two to four \"},{\"text\":\"Refinery Outputs\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:refinery_output\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stacked on or beside it; each output costs a diamond. It refines from 100 °C, faster the hotter it runs, and the lightest fuel always ends up in the top output.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3044AE58B94956B0.title": "Thermopneumatic Processing Plant",
  "quest.3044AE58B94956B0.quest_subtitle": "Everyone calls it the TPP.",
  "quest.3044AE58B94956B0.quest_desc": [
    "A pressure tube and two small tanks between reinforced slabs. It mixes a fluid and an item with heat, pressure or both: LPG and coal become plastic, diesel and redstone become lubricant, heavy fuels crack into lighter ones."
  ],
  "quest.37D34AE0D251FE6E.title": "Plastic",
  "quest.37D34AE0D251FE6E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"100 mB of LPG and one coal at 100 °C make a bucket of molten plastic; charcoal and biodiesel work too. Pour it into the world and it sets into a \"},{\"text\":\"Plastic Sheet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:plastic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in about half a second.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Liquid Hopper with a Dispenser Upgrade does the pouring, and an Omnidirectional Hopper picks up the sheets.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4B1FD4C2C0FF7ED9.title": "Amadron Tablet",
  "quest.4B1FD4C2C0FF7ED9.quest_subtitle": "Drone delivery is free. The rest isn't.",
  "quest.4B1FD4C2C0FF7ED9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Seven plastic, a \"},{\"text\":\"GPS Tool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:gps_tool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and an air canister. Right-click a chest or tank to bind it: Amadron takes payment from there and a drone drops the order in the same spot. It sells what no bench makes, like the PCB Blueprint and the Assembly Programs.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.051F01FCC5CA2C8A.title": "PCB Blueprint",
  "quest.051F01FCC5CA2C8A.quest_desc": [
    "Eight emeralds on Amadron, or a trade with a Pressure Mechanic: the villager who keeps his own house in some villages and works at a Charging Station. Each UV Light Box eats one blueprint."
  ],
  "quest.0A71335508C3D6D5.title": "UV Light Box",
  "quest.0A71335508C3D6D5.quest_subtitle": "Ten minutes of tanning.",
  "quest.0A71335508C3D6D5.quest_desc": [
    "Three redstone lamps over the blueprint, a tube and compressed iron. An Empty PCB left inside gets better odds in the acid the longer it stays, up to ten minutes; fully exposed, it never fails.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Speed Upgrades shorten the ten minutes, and a redstone signal can set the target exposure: 25% plus 5% per signal level.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2B5DB291FDF7CF71.title": "Empty PCB",
  "quest.2B5DB291FDF7CF71.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two redstone torches, three gold or copper nuggets and a plastic sheet at 1.5 bar in the chamber give three \"},{\"text\":\"Empty PCBs\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:empty_pcb\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Expose them in the UV box before they touch any acid.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.11F56BAF7AA9DC33.title": "Etching Acid and Tank",
  "quest.11F56BAF7AA9DC33.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Molten plastic, two rotten flesh, two spider eyes and two gunpowder at 1 bar make a bucket of \"},{\"text\":\"Etching Acid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:etching_acid_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". The \"},{\"text\":\"Etching Tank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:etching_tank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" develops up to 25 exposed boards at once: 150 seconds cold, down to 30 hot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6804AEDD26BCDA14.title": "Capacitors and Transistors",
  "quest.6804AEDD26BCDA14.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Both come from the chamber at 1 bar with a plastic sheet and gold or copper nuggets: two nuggets and a slimeball make a \"},{\"text\":\"Capacitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:capacitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", three nuggets and redstone a \"},{\"text\":\"Transistor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:transistor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Every board takes two of each.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.31AD4839D991F0C3.title": "Printed Circuit Board",
  "quest.31AD4839D991F0C3.quest_subtitle": "Where the mod gets clever.",
  "quest.31AD4839D991F0C3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Unassembled PCB\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:unassembled_pcb\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from the tank, two capacitors and two transistors make a \"},{\"text\":\"Finished PCB\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:printed_circuit_board\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Drones, the programmer, pneumatic armor and the assembly line all start here.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3ADE220C3D504D30.title": "Assembly Line",
  "quest.3ADE220C3D504D30.quest_subtitle": "Six machines, one program.",
  "quest.3ADE220C3D504D30.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Platform\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:assembly_platform\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the middle, the \"},{\"text\":\"Drill\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:assembly_drill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Laser\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:assembly_laser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" touching it, an import and an export IO Unit, which reach diagonally, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:assembly_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" beside them, all on one level. Only the Controller needs air.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.51849B762880FA95.title": "Assembly Programs",
  "quest.51849B762880FA95.quest_desc": [
    "Eight emeralds each on Amadron. With Laser in the Controller, Empty PCBs become Unassembled ones directly: no UV box, no acid. Drill turns a Block of Compressed Iron into twenty chamber valves.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Laser and a Drill program crafted together become Drill & Laser, which runs two-step recipes such as Advanced Pressure Tubes in one go.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7F4E94EA0CDB0D0C.title": "Advanced Pressure Tubes",
  "quest.7F4E94EA0CDB0D0C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The drill turns a Block of Compressed Iron into twenty valves, the laser turns twenty valves into eight \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Pressure Tubes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:advanced_pressure_tube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". They hold 20 bar and four times the air of a basic tube: tier two starts here.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7D3828A28FF6D5C5.title": "Twenty Bar",
  "quest.7D3828A28FF6D5C5.quest_subtitle": "Needle in the red, on purpose.",
  "quest.7D3828A28FF6D5C5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A valve and a Reinforced Air Canister Array, lasered, make the \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Pressure Chamber Valve\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:reinforced_pressure_chamber_valve\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the same chamber then holds 20 bar and four times the air, no other block changed. Add sixteen PCBs from a line that runs by itself.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.60CEC3F961A89DE3.title": "Iron for the common store",
  "quest.60CEC3F961A89DE3.quest_subtitle": "Blow some up for the neighbours.",
  "quest.60CEC3F961A89DE3.quest_desc": [
    "Thirty-two Compressed Iron Ingots, pressed or blown up. Every tube, wall and wrench on the server starts with them."
  ],
  "quest.053308E13DBBF678.title": "Air, not pressure",
  "quest.053308E13DBBF678.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pressure is air divided by volume, minus one: 20,000 mL in a 5,000 mL machine reads 3 bar. Machines need a minimum pressure to run, but what they spend is air, and air always flows toward lower pressure.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Tier-one tubes and machines take 5 bar, tier one and a half 10, tier two 20. Past that begins the red zone of the gauge, and somewhere in it the explosion."
  ],
  "quest.3978C0CF3796A832.title": "Compress blocks, not ingots",
  "quest.3978C0CF3796A832.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An interface spends 1,000 mL of air on every item it moves, so a stack costs 64,000 mL, 4 bar of a 3×3×3 chamber. Feed it Blocks of Iron and the same iron moves for a ninth of the air.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.59EA5DB0BB6BD00B.title": "Pressure makes diamonds",
  "quest.59EA5DB0BB6BD00B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight blocks of coal at 4 bar make a diamond. The chamber also turns four snow blocks into ice at 1.5 bar, four ice into packed ice at 2 and four packed ice into blue ice at 2.5: cold sources for the heat work to come.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5326DE3052C2CB47.title": "Heat takes the short way",
  "quest.5326DE3052C2CB47.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Heat flows from hot to cold, faster across a big gap and through conductors such as Blocks of Compressed Iron. Every face open to air leaks it: cover a heated machine with any non-conducting block, even slabs or trapdoors.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3E6344FA58ECF3D8.title": "Two, three or four outputs",
  "quest.3E6344FA58ECF3D8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"From 10 mB of oil, two outputs give 2 LPG and 4 diesel; three give 2 LPG, 3 kerosene and 2 diesel; four add 3 gasoline on top. More outputs, more fuel per bucket, and adding one later rearranges the stack by itself.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.738124A8BAD04AC0.title": "Amadron buys fuel",
  "quest.738124A8BAD04AC0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Amadron pays an emerald for 1,000 mB of LPG, 2,000 of gasoline, 3,000 of kerosene or 4,000 of diesel, and sells crude oil at one emerald a bucket. A spare refinery pays for every blueprint and program.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.088ACAD691D08F43.title": "Failed boards come back",
  "quest.088ACAD691D08F43.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A board taken out of the UV box before full exposure may fail in the acid. Failed PCBs are not waste: a blast furnace turns each one back into an Empty PCB for another try.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.096DC7A2B6B67B2F.title": "PCBs for the Atlas",
  "quest.096DC7A2B6B67B2F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"One PCB goes into the \"},{\"text\":\"routing matrix\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"17BBD680007901AB\"}},{\"text\":\" of act III and two into each \"},{\"text\":\"Ark Connection Bus\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"765DEE642FC97F72\"}},{\"text\":\" of act V. No PneumaticCraft recipe asks for a pack component, so a steady line pays off early.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4E115C131D552D52.title": "Pickaxe diplomacy",
  "quest.4E115C131D552D52.quest_subtitle": "The wrench was right there.",
  "quest.4E115C131D552D52.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"You broke a PneumaticCraft machine by force. Next time, sneak and right-click it with a charged \"},{\"text\":\"Pneumatic Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:pneumatic_wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it comes off whole, with its air and upgrades inside.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.754686460B3C53AC.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.6BBB0DED2A3A92C2.title": "Fish supper",
  "quest.6BBB0DED2A3A92C2.quest_subtitle": "Wrapped in yesterday's paper.",
  "quest.6BBB0DED2A3A92C2.quest_desc": [
    "Potatoes fried in vegetable oil at 150 °C in the processing plant make chips; add cooked cod and a sheet of paper. The best by-product of an oil industry, arguably."
  ],
  "reward.2CF0E8264D3CCDB1.title": "Secret found",
  "task.5871EDC94E74B9BD.title": "The PneumaticCraft manual",
  "quest.51D2947340B730B4.title": "The manual",
  "quest.51D2947340B730B4.quest_subtitle": "Read it under pressure.",
  "quest.51D2947340B730B4.quest_desc": [
    "A book and one Compressed Iron Ingot. Its pages open as you earn the mod's advancements, so it grows with you, and every machine has a page with its numbers."
  ],
  "quest.25C690D3A3687FE0.title": "Omnidirectional Hopper",
  "quest.25C690D3A3687FE0.quest_desc": [
    "Five compressed iron and a chest. Its input faces you when placed and its output the block you clicked; a wrench turns either end. It needs no air, takes Speed Upgrades, and with a Dispenser Upgrade it drops items into the world."
  ],
  "quest.4EF4B21550AC08D1.title": "Liquid Hopper",
  "quest.4EF4B21550AC08D1.quest_desc": [
    "A small tank on a hopper. It moves fluids in any direction and fills or drains buckets lying in front of it; with a Dispenser Upgrade it also pumps whole fluid blocks and turns XP orbs into Memory Essence."
  ],
  "quest.2D248A72E865B0BE.title": "Pressure Gauge Module",
  "quest.2D248A72E865B0BE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Pressure Gauge\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:pressure_gauge\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", compressed iron ringed with copper, over a tube and two redstone. Fixed on a tube, it shows the pressure and emits twice that as redstone: 3.5 bar gives a signal of 7.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1EE5CB4B39A2B5F0.title": "Safety Module",
  "quest.1EE5CB4B39A2B5F0.quest_subtitle": "Better a hiss than a bang.",
  "quest.1EE5CB4B39A2B5F0.quest_desc": [
    "A gauge, a tube and two levers. It vents anything above 4.9 bar on basic tubes, or 19.9 on advanced ones, so nothing explodes. The air it dumps is lost: let a gauge module switch the compressors off first."
  ],
  "quest.6DDB996A03821727.title": "Regulator Module",
  "quest.6DDB996A03821727.quest_desc": [
    "A tube between two safety modules, fitted inline on a tube's open end. It lets no more than 4.9 bar through to its narrow side, so a tier-two line can feed tier-one machines; under a full redstone signal it becomes a one-way valve."
  ],
  "quest.699CF2DD4F51E8C6.title": "Air Grate Module",
  "quest.699CF2DD4F51E8C6.quest_desc": [
    "A tube in iron bars. With pressure it pushes entities away, 4 blocks per bar; under vacuum it pulls them in, 16 blocks per bar below zero, and drops items into the inventory behind it. From 0.75 bar it also cools heat sinks in front."
  ],
  "quest.4ECDA7D45DD0BB49.title": "Manual Compressor",
  "quest.4ECDA7D45DD0BB49.quest_subtitle": "Leg day, but for arms.",
  "quest.4ECDA7D45DD0BB49.quest_desc": [
    "Hold right-click on it to pump air, paid in hunger; the higher the pressure, the slower each stroke, until nothing more goes in. Enough to try a machine before the coal arrives."
  ],
  "quest.1E016F08FE4534B0.title": "Reinforced Chest",
  "quest.1E016F08FE4534B0.quest_subtitle": "Creeper-rated.",
  "quest.1E016F08FE4534B0.quest_desc": [
    "A chest wrapped in compressed iron, reinforced brick walls, obsidian and a gold nugget. Thirty-six slots, obsidian-grade blast resistance, and it keeps its contents when broken: a backpack you can't wear."
  ],
  "task.169EFE7290B4C0C4.title": "Charge a Pneumatic Wrench to 3 bar",
  "quest.6E014E99794C727D.title": "Pneumatic Wrench",
  "quest.6E014E99794C727D.quest_desc": [
    "Compressed iron, an air canister, a lever and orange dye, charged in the station. It shuts and opens tube sides, turns blocks, and a sneaking right-click picks a machine up with its air and upgrades inside."
  ],
  "quest.3E7CA8E1D46D0EB4.title": "Turbine Rotors",
  "quest.3E7CA8E1D46D0EB4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A gold ingot and two redstone at 1 bar make a \"},{\"text\":\"Turbine Blade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:turbine_blade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; three blades around compressed iron make a \"},{\"text\":\"Turbine Rotor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:turbine_rotor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Vacuum pumps, fluid mixers, the programmer and every drone spin on them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.75346175EA271AE5.title": "Vacuum Pump",
  "quest.75346175EA271AE5.quest_subtitle": "Negative about everything.",
  "quest.75346175EA271AE5.quest_desc": [
    "Two turbine rotors, two gauges, two tubes and reinforced slabs. Air into the + side pulls the − side down to −1 bar. A chamber under vacuum moves one random enchantment from an item that has several onto a plain book."
  ],
  "quest.673F414D370B954F.title": "Vortex Tube",
  "quest.673F414D370B954F.quest_desc": [
    "Air goes in, one end heats and the other cools; the hot end faces you when you place it. Set it against the refinery and put a heat sink on the cold end: the two ends are linked, so the one you don't use needs venting."
  ],
  "quest.339060EEC077FE20.title": "Lagging and Heat Pipes",
  "quest.339060EEC077FE20.quest_subtitle": "A sweater for the refinery.",
  "quest.339060EEC077FE20.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wool and glass make six \"},{\"text\":\"Thermal Lagging\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:thermal_lagging\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it insulates, and clicks go through it to the machine behind. Lagging around Blocks of Compressed Iron or copper makes six \"},{\"text\":\"Heat Pipes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:heat_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which carry heat without losing it to air.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.25A96BD9C6127454.title": "Heat Sink",
  "quest.25A96BD9C6127454.quest_desc": [
    "Iron bars over compressed iron and copper. It sheds the heat or cold of the block it touches into the air, and burns you above 60 °C or below −60 °C. Heat Pipes give it more faces; an Air Grate Module in front cools it harder."
  ],
  "quest.1082DE08943B6012.title": "Heat Frame",
  "quest.1082DE08943B6012.quest_desc": [
    "Eight compressed iron around a furnace, stuck on any inventory. Hot, it smelts what's inside, up to one item a second; cold, it freezes water into ice, lava into obsidian and molten plastic into sheets, with a chance of a bonus sheet."
  ],
  "quest.49771D5A9A6CB349.title": "Thermal Compressor",
  "quest.49771D5A9A6CB349.quest_desc": [
    "An air compressor between compressed iron, tubes and two heavy pressure plates. It makes air from the temperature gap between opposite sides, north-south and east-west apart: lava against packed ice, or the spare end of a Vortex Tube."
  ],
  "quest.1D21178E43A3A35C.title": "Furnaces without fuel",
  "quest.1D21178E43A3A35C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A furnace, blast furnace or smoker next to a dynamic heat source, such as a Vortex Tube or an Advanced Air Compressor, runs on heat alone from 100 °C, faster the hotter it gets.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5E5AAA4730BAAB7B.title": "Four fuels",
  "quest.5E5AAA4730BAAB7B.quest_desc": [
    "A four-output refinery yields all four at once. Otherwise crack them in the processing plant: 100 mB of diesel becomes 80 of kerosene, kerosene becomes gasoline and gasoline becomes LPG, each step at 300 °C and 2 bar."
  ],
  "quest.75209C11B9C910B8.title": "Kerosene Lamp",
  "quest.75209C11B9C910B8.quest_desc": [
    "A small tank, glass panes and compressed iron. It lights everything within 10 blocks, up to 30 if you raise it in its screen, but fuel use grows with the square of the range. A bucket of kerosene lasts about forty real minutes at 10."
  ],
  "quest.466404FA3EB2A816.title": "Liquid Compressor",
  "quest.466404FA3EB2A816.quest_desc": [
    "An air compressor with a small tank, two tubes and leather. It burns liquid fuels, hot fluids such as lava included; its fuel tab lists them all. LPG is the best, 1,800,000 mL of air per bucket, then gasoline at 1,500,000."
  ],
  "quest.0C76C7E984EAAAF9.title": "Lubricant and Speed Upgrades",
  "quest.0C76C7E984EAAAF9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A bucket of diesel and one redstone at 100 °C in the plant make a bucket of \"},{\"text\":\"Lubricant\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:lubricant_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Ring it with four sugar and four lapis for a \"},{\"text\":\"Speed Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:speed_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; four Glycerol instead of the sugar make two.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4AB997B4BA6CA43A.title": "Upgrade Matrix",
  "quest.4AB997B4BA6CA43A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"One lapis lazuli and a bucket of water at 2 bar in the plant make four \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade Matrices\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:upgrade_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Every upgrade recipe takes them in place of lapis, so each lapis now covers four slots.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6A544912C5A076BD.title": "Reinforced Pressure Tubes",
  "quest.6A544912C5A076BD.quest_desc": [
    "A pressure tube dipped in 50 mB of molten plastic at 1.5 bar in the processing plant. Reinforced tubes take 10 bar with the same 1,000 mL of air: the half tier between basic and advanced."
  ],
  "quest.197F67066B08564D.title": "Yeast Culture",
  "quest.197F67066B08564D.quest_subtitle": "It's alive. It likes it warm.",
  "quest.197F67066B08564D.quest_desc": [
    "Mushrooms and water in the processing plant, held between 30 and 60 °C: warm biomes do it alone, and it gets warmer the deeper you go. With one bucket made, pour it in a pool, drop sugar in and pour water beside it: the culture spreads into the water."
  ],
  "quest.6FECF8D27B98B37F.title": "Sourdough",
  "quest.6FECF8D27B98B37F.quest_subtitle": "It rises to the occasion.",
  "quest.6FECF8D27B98B37F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wheat at 1.5 bar in the chamber becomes three \"},{\"text\":\"Wheat Flour\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:wheat_flour\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; eight flour around a bucket of yeast culture make eight \"},{\"text\":\"Sourdough\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:sourdough\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Baked, it beats the plain loaf.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4B1BE5F103A97811.title": "Ethanol",
  "quest.4B1BE5F103A97811.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Yeast culture and sugar in the plant, again between 30 and 60 °C, give \"},{\"text\":\"Ethanol\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:ethanol_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": 50 mB per sugar or apple, less from potatoes, melon or berries. It burns in the Liquid Compressor too, weakly.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.698932AB8D2FBF85.title": "Biodiesel",
  "quest.698932AB8D2FBF85.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Seeds squeezed at 2 bar in the plant give 50 mB of \"},{\"text\":\"Vegetable Oil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:vegetable_oil_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" each. A \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Mixer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:fluid_mixer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at 2 bar turns equal parts oil and ethanol into \"},{\"text\":\"Biodiesel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:biodiesel_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and Glycerol: diesel's twin for fuel, plastic and lubricant.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.54E679499F54C684.title": "Module Expansion Card",
  "quest.54E679499F54C684.quest_desc": [
    "A PCB, four plastic and four redstone make four cards. Right-click one onto a tube module: gauges get thresholds, safety and regulator modules a precise setting, air grates an entity filter and charging modules ten times the speed."
  ],
  "quest.65345EFB4CA13BBE.title": "Smart Chest",
  "quest.65345EFB4CA13BBE.quest_subtitle": "Seventy-two slots, with opinions.",
  "quest.65345EFB4CA13BBE.quest_desc": [
    "Two reinforced chests, a PCB, an omnidirectional hopper and two diamonds. Each face can push or pull items, any slot can be kept for a single item, and a Magnet Upgrade pulls in what lies nearby."
  ],
  "quest.7C3BB7D02F471ABC.title": "Aphorism Tiles",
  "quest.7C3BB7D02F471ABC.quest_desc": [
    "The laser cuts a quartz block into four. A tile shows as much text as you type, scaled to fit, plus items from its Insert Item button; made invisible, it labels a chest and lets clicks through."
  ],
  "quest.50D6F9ACF9E4CF69.title": "Advanced Compressors",
  "quest.50D6F9ACF9E4CF69.quest_desc": [
    "Each wraps its basic compressor in compressed iron and advanced tubes. They reach 20 bar and make a base 50 mL per tick, five times the Air Compressor, but heat up as they work and slow down until they stop: give them heat sinks."
  ],
  "quest.0D9563D12CA17408.title": "Electrostatic Compressor",
  "quest.0D9563D12CA17408.quest_subtitle": "Waiting for a storm.",
  "quest.0D9563D12CA17408.quest_desc": [
    "An advanced air compressor caged in iron bars, plastic and a rotor. When lightning strikes it, rare under clear skies and common in thunderstorms, it takes 200,000 mL of air at once. A grid of iron bars or lightning rods up to 5 blocks around raises the odds.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each iron bar straight below it bleeds off 10,000 mL once it reaches danger pressure, so a strike never blows it up.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7EEAD423F8D05024.title": "Flux Compressor",
  "quest.7EEAD423F8D05024.quest_desc": [
    "It turns Forge Energy into air: a base 40 FE per tick, more with Speed Upgrades, drawn from a 100,000 FE buffer that fills at twice that rate. It needs cooling, like every tier-two compressor."
  ],
  "quest.39187F5A437A8570.title": "Solar Compressor",
  "quest.39187F5A437A8570.quest_subtitle": "Sunbathing, professionally.",
  "quest.39187F5A437A8570.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An upgrade matrix and an amethyst shard at 2.5 bar make a Solar Wafer; the assembly drill finishes it into a \"},{\"text\":\"Solar Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:solar_cell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". The compressor needs open sky, works best at 350 °C and breaks past 425 °C until you mend it with a cell.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.50D2F8589687A786.title": "Pneumatic Dynamo",
  "quest.50D2F8589687A786.quest_desc": [
    "Air back into Forge Energy: 40 FE per tick by default, more with Speed Upgrades, at the cost of heat, so keep it cool or its output falls. Handy where tubes reach and cables don't."
  ],
  "image.3C55017C208B3F5D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tube modules\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.756C4B7F1BF9DE3E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hoppers\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.65F1A3627A2D108C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Rotors and vacuum\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.00B969D27CF8C61C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Heat\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.1B6E202E045A417C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fuels and upgrades\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.427B603D925F7891.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Renewables\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.03D165BE462B7B21.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Twenty bar\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.37963DA3000C0500.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On the board\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.15A6759C1E21EA49.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"PneumaticCraft\\nPressure\",\"color\":\"#FFF3D6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.2ED2893759B78B53.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.2020AE0D1A551592.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Drones and armor\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.5B4E0A895DA6AB40.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"compress · heat · refine · etch\",\"color\":\"#B9A27A\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.21A6CACD6761D879.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"-1\",\"color\":\"#E6E1D3\"}]",
  "image.4CBE54644B369C53.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"0\",\"color\":\"#E6E1D3\"}]",
  "image.7EB41511F99F0B4C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#E6E1D3\"}]",
  "image.161D6C087FD80C61.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#E6E1D3\"}]",
  "image.1E9098720106D17E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"15\",\"color\":\"#E6E1D3\"}]",
  "image.426E09765FB2DE80.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#E6E1D3\"}]",
  "image.72776BF51839C0F8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"bar\",\"color\":\"#E6E1D3\"}]",
  "image.7D51E9F9656C0613.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"tier 1 · 1.5 · 2\",\"color\":\"#B9A27A\"}]",
  "chapter.1C99C6436BCDCC3D.title": "Powah!",
  "chapter.1C99C6436BCDCC3D.chapter_subtitle": [
    "The Energizing Orb, seven tiers from Starter to Nitro, a self-building reactor and a wireless grid."
  ],
  "quest.1F371F6CAEB5D31A.title": "Dielectric Paste",
  "quest.1F371F6CAEB5D31A.quest_subtitle": "Every Powah block starts as black goo.",
  "quest.1F371F6CAEB5D31A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three coal or charcoal, two \"},{\"text\":\"Clay Balls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:clay_ball\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Lava Bucket\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lava_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make 24 \"},{\"text\":\"Dielectric Paste\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:dielectric_paste\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", shapeless; two coal, a clay ball and a \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Powder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_powder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make 16.\"}]",
    "",
    "Rods, casings, capacitors and almost every Powah machine are built on it. The bucket comes back empty."
  ],
  "quest.37110416738B3D43.title": "Rods and casing",
  "quest.37110416738B3D43.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six paste around three \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Bars\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_bars\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make eight \"},{\"text\":\"Dielectric Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:dielectric_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", upright or \"},{\"text\":\"horizontal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:dielectric_rod_horizontal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and either turns into the other in the grid. Four iron and two of each make a \"},{\"text\":\"Dielectric Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:dielectric_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the frame inside every machine.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.07F0640B56165C7F.title": "Three-mode wrench",
  "quest.07F0640B56165C7F.quest_subtitle": "Righty-tighty, lefty-linky.",
  "quest.07F0640B56165C7F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two iron and three paste make the \"},{\"text\":\"Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click the air to switch modes: Config sets each side of a cable to in, out, both or off; Link pairs a rod with an orb; Rotate turns Powah blocks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2FCC93B4D6121196.title": "Read the manual",
  "quest.2FCC93B4D6121196.quest_subtitle": "Nobody does. You should.",
  "quest.2FCC93B4D6121196.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Paste on a \"},{\"text\":\"Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Powah manual\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Its pages list capacity, output and transfer for every tier of every machine, filled in from the game's own config.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.129F1FE153F2D864.title": "Starter tier",
  "quest.129F1FE153F2D864.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four iron, two paste and a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Redstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make four \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Capacitors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:capacitor_basic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; one splits into two \"},{\"text\":\"Tiny Capacitors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:capacitor_basic_tiny\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Most Starter generators are two tiny ones and a casing, wrapped in paste around their own part: a furnace, a bucket, thermo plates or photoelectric panes.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At Starter: \"},{\"text\":\"Furnator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:furnator_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Magmator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:magmator_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 20 FE/t, \"},{\"text\":\"Thermo Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:thermo_generator_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Solar Panel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:solar_panel_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 20, \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:reactor_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" up to 250. \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Cells\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energy_cell_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hold 1,000,000 FE; the \"},{\"text\":\"Energizing Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energizing_rod_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pours 100 FE/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.10F4C13DAD0CEEEF.title": "Basic tier",
  "quest.10F4C13DAD0CEEEF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Furnators, Magmators and Thermo Generators climb alike: the one a tier down, two capacitors of the new tier, a casing and the tier's material, plus two plates for a Thermo. Basic takes two \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Capacitors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:capacitor_basic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and iron. Two basics also make a \"},{\"text\":\"Large\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:capacitor_basic_large\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one, the core of every capacitor above.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The others go their own way: \"},{\"text\":\"Solar Panels\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:solar_panel_basic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" merge three of the tier below, \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:reactor_basic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" blocks go four at a time with four large capacitors, \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Cells\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energy_cell_basic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" can merge two.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At Basic: \"},{\"text\":\"Furnator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:furnator_basic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Magmator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:magmator_basic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 80 FE/t, \"},{\"text\":\"Thermo Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:thermo_generator_basic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and Solar Panel 60, Reactor up to 1,000; cells hold 4,000,000 FE.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0B8FAFE3ED58698A.title": "Energized Steel",
  "quest.0B8FAFE3ED58698A.quest_subtitle": "Iron and gold, but make it electric.",
  "quest.0B8FAFE3ED58698A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Put an \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Gold Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:gold_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the orb: 10,000 FE later they are two \"},{\"text\":\"Energized Steel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:steel_energized\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It is the Hardened tier's material and the orb's first everyday job.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3BE186E4B0C3A349.title": "Hardened tier",
  "quest.3BE186E4B0C3A349.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Energized Steel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:steel_energized\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", four paste and a large capacitor make two \"},{\"text\":\"Hardened Capacitors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:capacitor_hardened\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Hardened blocks take steel as their material: five for a Furnator or a Magmator, one for a Thermo Generator, three for a Solar Panel.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At Hardened: \"},{\"text\":\"Furnator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:furnator_hardened\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Magmator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:magmator_hardened\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 200 FE/t, \"},{\"text\":\"Thermo Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:thermo_generator_hardened\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Solar Panel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:solar_panel_hardened\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 100, \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:reactor_hardened\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" up to 2,500; the \"},{\"text\":\"rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energizing_rod_hardened\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pours 1,000 FE/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.238EF8CD0FFD0F3B.title": "Blazing tier",
  "quest.238EF8CD0FFD0F3B.quest_subtitle": "Hot stuff.",
  "quest.238EF8CD0FFD0F3B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes 120,000 FE in the orb to become a \"},{\"text\":\"Blazing Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:crystal_blazing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; four \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Powder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_powder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" cost the same. Four crystals, four paste and a large capacitor make two \"},{\"text\":\"Blazing Capacitors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:capacitor_blazing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Energize the rods, not the powder: one rod grinds into two powder, half a crystal.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At Blazing: \"},{\"text\":\"Furnator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:furnator_blazing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Magmator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:magmator_blazing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 800 FE/t, \"},{\"text\":\"Thermo Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:thermo_generator_blazing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Solar Panel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:solar_panel_blazing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 200, \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:reactor_blazing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" up to 10,000; the \"},{\"text\":\"rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energizing_rod_blazing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pours 4,000 FE/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0CF0FB72E18ED249.title": "Tier gates in this pack",
  "quest.0CF0FB72E18ED249.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three capacitors take an act material in place of one of their four crystals: Niotic an \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV), Spirited an \"},{\"text\":\"Ingot of the Skies\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"naturesaura:sky_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and Nitro an \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act V). Starter to Blazing are native.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2D61C38C13C97286.title": "Niotic tier",
  "quest.2D61C38C13C97286.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes 300,000 FE to become a \"},{\"text\":\"Niotic Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:crystal_niotic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Three crystals, an \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", four paste and a large capacitor make one \"},{\"text\":\"Niotic Capacitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:capacitor_niotic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At Niotic: \"},{\"text\":\"Furnator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:furnator_niotic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Magmator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:magmator_niotic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 2,000 FE/t, \"},{\"text\":\"Thermo Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:thermo_generator_niotic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Solar Panel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:solar_panel_niotic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 400, \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:reactor_niotic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" up to 25,000; the \"},{\"text\":\"rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energizing_rod_niotic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pours 10,000 FE/t.\"}]",
    "",
    "A Niotic reactor is nine crafts of four capacitors: 36 ironwood."
  ],
  "quest.367B407202BB9240.title": "Spirited tier",
  "quest.367B407202BB9240.quest_subtitle": "Emeralds, finally good for something.",
  "quest.367B407202BB9240.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Emerald\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:emerald\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes 1,000,000 FE to become a \"},{\"text\":\"Spirited Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:crystal_spirited\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Three crystals, an \"},{\"text\":\"Ingot of the Skies\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"naturesaura:sky_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", four paste and a large capacitor make one \"},{\"text\":\"Spirited Capacitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:capacitor_spirited\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At Spirited: \"},{\"text\":\"Furnator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:furnator_spirited\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 8,000 FE/t, \"},{\"text\":\"Magmator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:magmator_spirited\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 8,000 on paper but 5,000 on lava, \"},{\"text\":\"Thermo Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:thermo_generator_spirited\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Solar Panel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:solar_panel_spirited\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 800, \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:reactor_spirited\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" up to 100,000; the \"},{\"text\":\"rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energizing_rod_spirited\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pours 40,000 FE/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.19C1BD8B46C7ED1D.title": "Nitro",
  "quest.19C1BD8B46C7ED1D.quest_subtitle": "Twenty million FE and a star.",
  "quest.19C1BD8B46C7ED1D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Star\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:nether_star\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Blocks of Redstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Blazing Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:blazing_crystal_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" take 20,000,000 FE to become sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Nitro Crystals\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:crystal_nitro\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Three of them and an \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Nitro Capacitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:capacitor_nitro\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At Nitro: \"},{\"text\":\"Furnator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:furnator_nitro\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 40,000 FE/t on coal blocks (one coal lasts two ticks), \"},{\"text\":\"Magmator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:magmator_nitro\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 10,000 on lava, \"},{\"text\":\"Thermo Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:thermo_generator_nitro\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Solar Panel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:solar_panel_nitro\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 2,000, \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:reactor_nitro\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" up to 500,000; the \"},{\"text\":\"rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energizing_rod_nitro\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pours 200,000 FE/t.\"}]",
    "",
    "{image:powah:textures/item/capacitor_nitro.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
  ],
  "quest.13F36FB6A1E76C79.title": "Energizing Orb",
  "quest.13F36FB6A1E76C79.quest_subtitle": "Charge it, and it becomes something else.",
  "quest.13F36FB6A1E76C79.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five glass, a casing and three horizontal rods make the \"},{\"text\":\"Energizing Orb\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energizing_orb\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It holds up to six ingredients and needs no power itself: \"},{\"text\":\"Energizing Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energizing_rod_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the 9×9×9 cube around it pour FE in until the recipe is paid.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A rod is a \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:quartz\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two tiny capacitors, a casing and a dielectric rod. It drinks only from the block it is mounted on, so mount it on a cable, a cell or a generator.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.369EE899CDF799C4.title": "Rods find their orb",
  "quest.369EE899CDF799C4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A rod links itself to an orb within four blocks when either one is placed. With two orbs close together, set the wrench to Link and click the orb, then the rod.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.50705D23CF139DAB.title": "Hands-free orb",
  "quest.50705D23CF139DAB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pipes and hoppers can fill the orb, one item per input slot, but only while the output slot is empty; pull the results out of it. A comparator reads how many slots hold something.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2FB0C5B2B7D35910.title": "More rods",
  "quest.2FB0C5B2B7D35910.quest_subtitle": "Many hands make light work.",
  "quest.2FB0C5B2B7D35910.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Rods add up: four \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energizing_rod_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pour 400 FE/t, four times one. Each tier's rod is faster, from 100 FE/t at Starter to 200,000 at Nitro. A batch of Nitro Crystals costs 20,000,000 FE: almost three hours on one Starter rod.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.37CFA4BF8EA40332.title": "Charged Snowball",
  "quest.37CFA4BF8EA40332.quest_subtitle": "Snow chance of a quiet night.",
  "quest.37CFA4BF8EA40332.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Snowball\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:snowball\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" soaks up 500,000 FE and comes out as a \"},{\"text\":\"Charged Snowball\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:charged_snowball\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Throw it: lightning strikes where it lands, charging creepers and turning pigs and villagers into something worse.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.39FA5D7BD99D1B10.title": "Witch craft",
  "quest.39FA5D7BD99D1B10.quest_subtitle": "The villager is not taking questions.",
  "quest.39FA5D7BD99D1B10.quest_desc": [
    "Your charged snowball's lightning struck a villager, and on any difficulty but Peaceful that makes a witch. Minecraft counts it as Very Very Frightening, the trident's advancement: the bolt carries your name."
  ],
  "reward.2DD0F0B035D18AC8.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.051906D533BE18A8.title": "Not just Powah",
  "quest.051906D533BE18A8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Other mods write recipes for the orb too. Oritech's \"},{\"text\":\"Fluxite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:fluxite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" comes from an \"},{\"text\":\"Amethyst Shard\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:amethyst_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for 12,000 FE, and fluxite with a nickel ingot becomes an \"},{\"text\":\"Energite Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:energite_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for 20,000.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.03588046E50281CD.title": "The fastest rod",
  "quest.03588046E50281CD.quest_subtitle": "Twenty million FE in a hundred ticks.",
  "quest.03588046E50281CD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six upgrades from a Starter rod, the \"},{\"text\":\"Nitro Energizing Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energizing_rod_nitro\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pours 200,000 FE/t: a whole batch of Nitro Crystals in 100 ticks. Each step takes a block of quartz, two capacitors of its tier, a casing and the rod before it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.11C240121981F86F.title": "Which generator?",
  "quest.11C240121981F86F.quest_desc": [
    "Furnator: anything a furnace burns. Magmator: lava. Thermo Generator: a heat source below and water, nothing burned. Solar Panel: free by day under open sky. Reactor: uraninite, and the biggest numbers of all. They mix freely on one grid."
  ],
  "quest.3C5CE7153B94BB30.title": "Furnator",
  "quest.3C5CE7153B94BB30.quest_subtitle": "A furnace that forgot how to cook.",
  "quest.3C5CE7153B94BB30.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five paste, two tiny capacitors, a casing and a \"},{\"text\":\"Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Furnator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:furnator_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It burns anything a furnace does at 30 FE per burn tick: a coal is 48,000 FE in every tier, and higher tiers only burn it faster.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.476F2319E65D8D73.title": "Lava goes further in a Furnator",
  "quest.476F2319E65D8D73.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A lava bucket in a Furnator gives 600,000 FE and the empty bucket back; the same lava in a Magmator gives 100,000. The Magmator wins on pipes and pumps, not on energy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.04AF1F9556CFEA5B.title": "Magmator",
  "quest.04AF1F9556CFEA5B.quest_subtitle": "Drinks lava, burps FE.",
  "quest.04AF1F9556CFEA5B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Furnator recipe with a \"},{\"text\":\"Bucket\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in place of the furnace makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Magmator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:magmator_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Right-click it with lava or pipe some in: four buckets of tank, 10,000 FE per 100 mB. Broken, it keeps its lava and its charge.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It drains at most 100 mB per tick, so on lava a Magmator tops out at 10,000 FE/t whatever its tier says.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5FCC81AD493C0E00.title": "Thermo Generator",
  "quest.5FCC81AD493C0E00.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four blaze powder, four redstone and a tiny capacitor make a \"},{\"text\":\"Thermo Plate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:thermoelectric_plate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; three, with three paste, two tiny capacitors and a casing, make the \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Thermo Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:thermo_generator_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Set it on lava or a \"},{\"text\":\"Magma Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:magma_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", fill it with water and it runs on heat alone.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Output follows the heat under it: a lava source counts 1,000, a magma block 800. The water drains 1 mB every two seconds, so a bucket lasts over half an hour."
  ],
  "quest.49FA3B4E66F57263.title": "Hotter than lava",
  "quest.49FA3B4E66F57263.quest_subtitle": "2,800 degrees of pure showing off.",
  "quest.49FA3B4E66F57263.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Nine Blazing Crystals make a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Blazing Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:blazing_crystal_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and a Thermo Generator on top counts it as 2,800 heat: 2.8 times lava. It is also what a batch of Nitro Crystals eats.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.25460E08E4BE47CE.title": "Solar Panel",
  "quest.25460E08E4BE47CE.quest_subtitle": "Free power, weather permitting.",
  "quest.25460E08E4BE47CE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four paste and four \"},{\"text\":\"Lapis Lazuli\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lapis_lazuli\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a \"},{\"text\":\"Glass Pane\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:glass_pane\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Photoelectric Pane\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:photoelectric_pane\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; three, with three paste, two tiny capacitors and a casing, make the \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Solar Panel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:solar_panel_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It works by day with open sky above, never in the Nether or the End.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5ABE8859841EB06A.title": "Solar through the roof",
  "quest.5ABE8859841EB06A.quest_subtitle": "A window for your panel. Sort of.",
  "quest.5ABE8859841EB06A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Right-click a plain Enderman or an Endermite with a \"},{\"text\":\"Photoelectric Pane\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:photoelectric_pane\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the mob is gone and you hold a \"},{\"text\":\"Lens of Ender\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:lens_of_ender\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Used on a Solar Panel, it lets the panel see through blocks, and it drops back if you break the panel.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Enderman Overhaul's biome endermen don't count: it has to be the plain one.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6579E585156B0CEE.title": "Solar merges three for one",
  "quest.6579E585156B0CEE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every solar upgrade eats three panels of the tier below. Basic makes exactly what three Starters did (60 FE/t); past Basic the new panel makes less than the three it ate. Upgrade solar for space, not for power.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6F04A087B6A5D44E.title": "Uraninite",
  "quest.6F04A087B6A5D44E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Uraninite ore hides below Y 64 (poor), Y 20 and Y 0 (dense) and needs an iron pickaxe. It drops 1, 2 or 4 \"},{\"text\":\"Raw Uraninite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:uraninite_raw\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a furnace makes one \"},{\"text\":\"Uraninite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:uraninite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" of each, the orb makes two for 2,000 FE.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Any mod's uranium ingot also energizes into one uraninite, for 30,000 FE."
  ],
  "quest.5FE85F3814ED74AA.title": "Fortune beats Silk Touch",
  "quest.5FE85F3814ED74AA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Silk-touched ore energizes into 3, 5 or 10 uraninite. Fortune III averages 2.2 times the raw drop, and each raw makes two in the orb: about 4.4, 8.8 and 17.6. Mine with Fortune, then energize.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.1D21F141EED4A9B5.title": "Look at Dense Deepslate Uraninite Ore",
  "quest.1BE5A94192E020A0.title": "Rich vein",
  "quest.1BE5A94192E020A0.quest_subtitle": "Glowing? No. Promising? Very.",
  "quest.1BE5A94192E020A0.quest_desc": [
    "You spotted dense uraninite. It only forms below Y 0, in small veins; mined, it drops four raw uraninite before Fortune, and silk-touched and energized it gives ten."
  ],
  "reward.3497C0D8656AB275.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.15318E1EC838402F.title": "Dry Ice",
  "quest.15318E1EC838402F.quest_subtitle": "Cooler than cool.",
  "quest.15318E1EC838402F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Blue Ice\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blue_ice\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" become one \"},{\"text\":\"Dry Ice\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:dry_ice\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for 10,000 FE, or mine it in veins under icy biomes, below Y 64. It is the coldest solid coolant: one block keeps a working reactor cold for about 24 minutes.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.14D998DFD0F054B0.title": "Look at your reactor, built",
  "quest.5A9CC0F268D579EC.title": "Powah Reactor",
  "quest.5A9CC0F268D579EC.quest_subtitle": "Some assembly required. By itself.",
  "quest.5A9CC0F268D579EC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Uraninite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:uraninite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", four tiny capacitors and a casing make four \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:reactor_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" blocks. With 36 in your inventory, place one where a 3×3 space four blocks tall is free, with nobody inside: the reactor builds itself.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It burns uraninite, holds a bucket of water and takes carbon, redstone and a solid coolant in its slots. Auto mode stops it when its buffer is full and restarts it at 70%. Break any block and the whole reactor falls back into 36 blocks."
  ],
  "quest.030FC7BDDF4253CE.title": "A cold reactor pays",
  "quest.030FC7BDDF4253CE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Heat eats output and fuel. With water in its tank, a solid coolant divides the temperature: dry ice by 33. A cold reactor burns about a thirtieth of the uraninite, and with boosts it runs near its full rating. The water is never used up.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.79730F38F37F94C5.title": "Boost only when cold",
  "quest.79730F38F37F94C5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Coal or another furnace fuel in the carbon slot adds 20% output and 180 heat; redstone adds 40% and 120 heat. On a hot reactor that heat costs more than the boost gives: coolant first, boosts after.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0C17E3CDD19DDAE5.title": "Where the power comes out",
  "quest.0C17E3CDD19DDAE5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pipes can feed fuel, coolant and water through any block of the reactor, but power only leaves through the middle block of each side's bottom row, the top center and the floor under the core.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.13A2D2674EA6FFD8.title": "Rebuild at Basic",
  "quest.13A2D2674EA6FFD8.quest_subtitle": "Nine crafts, one very big upgrade.",
  "quest.13A2D2674EA6FFD8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Break your reactor to get its 36 blocks back. Four of them, four \"},{\"text\":\"Large Basic Capacitors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:capacitor_basic_large\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a uraninite make four \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:reactor_basic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" blocks: nine crafts for a reactor rated 1,000 FE/t, four times the Starter.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.08AFF80CF831A282.title": "Half a million per tick",
  "quest.08AFF80CF831A282.quest_subtitle": "Bring coolant. Bring a lot.",
  "quest.08AFF80CF831A282.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Climb the reactor through every tier, four blocks at a time, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Nitro Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:reactor_nitro\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is rated 500,000 FE/t. On the way it eats 36 capacitors a tier: 36 ironwood, 36 sky ingots and 36 atomic alloys.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1F1CD222C834645E.title": "Energy Cables",
  "quest.1F1CD222C834645E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six horizontal dielectric rods, two iron nuggets and a tiny capacitor make twelve \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Energy Cables\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energy_cable_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": 500 FE/t. They connect to any mod's FE block, and the wrench in Config mode sets each side to in, out, both or off.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each tier's cable carries more, up to 1,000,000 FE/t at Nitro: six rods, two of the tier's material and one capacitor make twelve."
  ],
  "quest.16ACDFEC566167E4.title": "Energy Cell",
  "quest.16ACDFEC566167E4.quest_subtitle": "A battery you can stand on.",
  "quest.16ACDFEC566167E4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four iron, two tiny capacitors and a casing make a \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Energy Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energy_cell_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": 1,000,000 FE, 1,000 FE/t in and out. Put it between generators and machines to smooth the peaks; its two slots charge tools.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1EC6E4B809E11FA6.title": "Cells keep their charge",
  "quest.1EC6E4B809E11FA6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A broken cell keeps its energy, so moving one costs nothing. From Hardened up, each upgrade merges two cells of the tier below: 1 million FE at Starter, 2 billion at Nitro.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4E9DEEF6B7228661.title": "Battery",
  "quest.4E9DEEF6B7228661.quest_subtitle": "Charge on the go.",
  "quest.4E9DEEF6B7228661.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Basic Capacitors, four paste and a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Redstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Battery\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:battery_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": 1,000,000 FE in your pocket. Hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click to switch charging on, and it tops up your other items.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.202763CA4CCA4E60.title": "Energy Hopper",
  "quest.202763CA4CCA4E60.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five paste, two tiny capacitors, a casing and a \"},{\"text\":\"Hopper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:hopper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Energy Hopper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energy_hopper_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Point it at a chest and it charges every tool inside: a charging station for the whole team.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2C609AF96798E72A.title": "Energy Discharger",
  "quest.2C609AF96798E72A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six paste, two tiny capacitors and a casing make the \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Energy Discharger\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energy_discharger_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Its seven slots drain charged items back into the grid: batteries from another base, tools you no longer use.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.67B57EF11DC9C268.title": "A pearl with a face",
  "quest.67B57EF11DC9C268.quest_subtitle": "The zombie volunteered. More or less.",
  "quest.67B57EF11DC9C268.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four paste and four iron bars around an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Pearl\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_pearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make an \"},{\"text\":\"Aerial Pearl\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:aerial_pearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Right-click a Zombie, a Husk or a Zombie Villager with it: the zombie is gone and you hold a \"},{\"text\":\"Player Aerial Pearl\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:player_aerial_pearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4E6361BFFEB4C669.title": "Player Transmitter",
  "quest.4E6361BFFEB4C669.quest_subtitle": "Charging cables are so last tier.",
  "quest.4E6361BFFEB4C669.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The pearl, two tiny capacitors, a casing and a dielectric rod make the \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Player Transmitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:player_transmitter_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Right-click with a \"},{\"text\":\"Binding Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:binding_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to bind it to you, then slot it in: it charges your inventory, armor and off-hand anywhere in its dimension.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Blank Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:blank_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is two dielectric rods; with two redstone and a rotten flesh it becomes a Binding Card. The Starter transmitter charges 500 FE/t per item, the Nitro one 1,000,000, and Curios slots count too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.480D0D25E99C8830.title": "Across dimensions",
  "quest.480D0D25E99C8830.quest_subtitle": "Enderman-approved. Posthumously.",
  "quest.480D0D25E99C8830.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"No recipe makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Dimensional Binding Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:binding_card_dim\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": right-click a plain Enderman or an Endermite with a Binding Card, bound or not. The mob vanishes, the card keeps its owner, and the transmitter reaches you in any dimension.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Enderman Overhaul's biome endermen don't count: it has to be the plain one.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.578F34D069A2AD44.title": "Ender Core",
  "quest.578F34D069A2AD44.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Eye of Ender\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_eye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a casing and a tiny capacitor take 50,000 FE in the orb to become an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:ender_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the heart of every Ender Cell and Ender Gate.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5BE24994F4FBEE4D.title": "Ender Cell",
  "quest.5BE24994F4FBEE4D.quest_subtitle": "Your energy, on speed dial.",
  "quest.5BE24994F4FBEE4D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four obsidian, four iron nuggets and a core make a \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Ender Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:ender_cell_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It stores into a channel of its owner's network: every cell on the same channel, in any dimension, shares one pool. Higher tiers open more channels, up to twelve.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Channels by tier: 1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 9 and 12. Transfer goes from 1,000 FE/t at Starter to 2,000,000 at Nitro."
  ],
  "quest.4788B27FF9395F24.title": "An empty channel holds nothing",
  "quest.4788B27FF9395F24.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A new channel has no capacity at all. Shift-click an Energy Cell or a Battery into the Ender Cell's screen: its capacity and its charge join the channel for good, and the item is used up.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7ADD644FC1D2480D.title": "Ender Gate",
  "quest.7ADD644FC1D2480D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four obsidian, four Starter cables and a core make four \"},{\"text\":\"Starter Ender Gates\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:ender_gate_starter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". A gate moves energy between the block it faces and a channel at cable speed, but it cannot add capacity: that is the cell's job.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.13DB6D5ADC0BCBF5.title": "One network per player",
  "quest.13DB6D5ADC0BCBF5.quest_desc": [
    "The network belongs to whoever placed the cell. Teammates each get twelve channels of their own; to share one pool, let one player place every cell."
  ],
  "quest.453C8E2B6048152C.title": "Bottomless",
  "quest.453C8E2B6048152C.quest_subtitle": "The last cell you will ever need.",
  "quest.453C8E2B6048152C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Engineering\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:luminosity_engineering\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Habitation Luminosities\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:luminosity_habitation\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Dragon Hearts\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:dragon_heart\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Blocks of Nitro Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:nitro_crystal_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a Nitro cell made a \"},{\"text\":\"Creative Energy Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:energy_cell_creative\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It never runs dry.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.420C8A1788FF12DA.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.5EC5E5C247F2E86B.title": "Steel for the common store",
  "quest.5EC5E5C247F2E86B.quest_subtitle": "Charged, stacked, delivered.",
  "quest.5EC5E5C247F2E86B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Thirty-two \"},{\"text\":\"Energized Steel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"powah:steel_energized\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day. Sixteen iron and sixteen gold through the orb: 160,000 FE, a short break for four Starter rods.\"}]"
  ],
  "image.3B692AE6B6ACCDCD.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Generators\",\"color\":\"#46E0C8\"}]",
  "image.17631C116C69B3EC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Reactor\",\"color\":\"#46E0C8\"}]",
  "image.07EB07FE1ABA4CA3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Cells and cables\",\"color\":\"#46E0C8\"}]",
  "image.3220A2F395196E55.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wireless charging\",\"color\":\"#46E0C8\"}]",
  "image.2B3607317A39C68D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Ender network\",\"color\":\"#46E0C8\"}]",
  "image.0A1F3A825FF749E8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Powah!\",\"color\":\"#E9FFFB\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.5F3E35F38B152AE3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"charge it and it changes\",\"color\":\"#7FE9D8\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.43F1C98451EDD071.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.6D8B3DE584A7F0DD.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Starter\",\"color\":\"#A7A7A7\"}]",
  "image.765A38A533A62F45.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Basic\",\"color\":\"#A3AB9F\"}]",
  "image.583D33F518828337.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hardened\",\"color\":\"#BBA993\"}]",
  "image.346477BC2327F9F1.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Blazing\",\"color\":\"#E4B040\"}]",
  "image.4D34D9656FE75476.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Niotic\",\"color\":\"#13EED2\"}]",
  "image.1494C53C57830ED9.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Spirited\",\"color\":\"#AFE241\"}]",
  "image.547C7804EA5AA9FF.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Nitro\",\"color\":\"#D7746C\"}]",
  "chapter.369BBB754F0B5AB0.title": "AE2 · Automation",
  "chapter.369BBB754F0B5AB0.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Patterns, providers, assemblers and CPUs, then the classic setups: pipes made of network, autostock, certus farms, press lines and crafts that copy themselves."
  ],
  "quest.1B1E6D801ECE853D.title": "Write it down",
  "quest.1B1E6D801ECE853D.quest_subtitle": "Recipes, but on paper.",
  "quest.1B1E6D801ECE853D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Crafting Terminal and an Engineering Processor make the \"},{\"text\":\"ME Pattern Encoding Terminal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:pattern_encoding_terminal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It turns \"},{\"text\":\"Blank Patterns\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:blank_pattern\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into recipes the network can follow: crafting, smithing, stonecutting or processing.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.00455A2B03F16107.title": "Hands of the network",
  "quest.00455A2B03F16107.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"ME Pattern Provider\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:pattern_provider\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds nine patterns and pushes each recipe's ingredients into the block beside it, a whole batch at once. Results can come back in through it, no import bus needed.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blocking mode waits for the machine to empty before the next batch. A wrench makes it push to one face only.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.07B9805451689768.title": "An assembly line of one",
  "quest.07B9805451689768.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Molecular Assembler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:molecular_assembler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" beside a provider crafts any crafting, smithing or stonecutting pattern the provider sends, then pushes the result back. One provider feeds an assembler on every free face.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.138B171B22C0BA4F.title": "A brain per job",
  "quest.138B171B22C0BA4F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Crafting CPUs are solid boxes of \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Storage\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:1k_crafting_storage\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Co-Processing Units\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:crafting_accelerator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", monitors and filler units. Storage holds a job's ingredients along the way. One CPU runs one job at a time, so build a second for two.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1809FBBFB9306A3C.title": "Any machine will do",
  "quest.1809FBBFB9306A3C.quest_desc": [
    "A processing pattern says: push these ingredients out and this result will come back, sooner or later. A provider on a furnace, a charger or a whole factory turns it into an autocraft. The result must enter the network; a chest a storage bus watches doesn't count."
  ],
  "quest.76C671D5C71577CE.title": "Keep it topped up",
  "quest.76C671D5C71577CE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An export bus with a \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:crafting_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a redstone card, driven by a \"},{\"text\":\"Level Emitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:level_emitter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", orders a craft whenever an item drops below your number. An interface with a crafting card does the same for a little of many things.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.72D6F95CFE0EF98A.title": "All patterns, one screen",
  "quest.72D6F95CFE0EF98A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Pattern Access Terminal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:pattern_access_terminal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reaches every provider on the network, so a buried wall of providers stays editable. Rows group by the block each provider faces, or by the name you gave it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4244C76541202F57.title": "Ask for it",
  "quest.4244C76541202F57.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In a terminal, your Pick Block key on an item you can craft opens the order screen. Type a sum like 3*64, or =32 to craft just what brings the stock up to 32.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0A6B4C1993AB1855.title": "Smith and stonecutter",
  "quest.0A6B4C1993AB1855.quest_desc": [
    "The encoding terminal also has smithing and stonecutting tabs. Those patterns run in molecular assemblers exactly like crafting ones, so upgrades and stairs join the same queue."
  ],
  "quest.2B4DA79644B9D3BA.title": "One wood for everything",
  "quest.2B4DA79644B9D3BA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pick one plank type and use it in every pattern. Substitutions sometimes work, but one wood avoids jams, and spreading patterns across providers lets recipes run side by side.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.52DF8AD0C5D66DE3.title": "Pour, don't bucket",
  "quest.52DF8AD0C5D66DE3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With fluid substitution on in the encoding terminal, a crafting pattern uses stored fluid where the recipe asks for a bucket. In processing mode, right-click a slot with a bucket or tank to put in the fluid, not the container.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.763DE2302EE8A82C.title": "What it can't do",
  "quest.763DE2302EE8A82C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Autocrafting won't follow a recipe whose output feeds its own input, like duplicating a smithing template. A level emitter set to emit redstone to craft stands in: the network switches a machine on and waits for the item.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.14E3B17DFA82645B.title": "Three shapes of provider",
  "quest.14E3B17DFA82645B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A wrench makes a provider push to one face and not connect there; the flat one sits on a cable, several per block, and swaps back in a crafting grid. Lock crafting waits on redstone or on the last result; higher-priority patterns go first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0EFA354C7281EA05.title": "One face, many machines",
  "quest.0EFA354C7281EA05.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Put a flat \"},{\"text\":\"ME Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:cable_interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a provider's face and run storage buses from its cable to several machines. The provider pushes straight through an untouched interface into those machines, one channel for all, and blocking mode watches their slots.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4747AD8A1C57C19F.title": "Charge on order",
  "quest.4747AD8A1C57C19F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A provider with a processing pattern pushes certus into a charger and powers it, since providers act like cable. An import bus and a storage bus on a \"},{\"text\":\"tiny subnet\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"744A5BF677ACDD7B\"}},{\"text\":\" pull the charged crystal back into the provider. Charged certus becomes one click.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.71265F1AF9C313ED.title": "A furnace on one channel",
  "quest.71265F1AF9C313ED.quest_subtitle": "Three jobs, one channel.",
  "quest.71265F1AF9C313ED.quest_desc": [
    "A wrenched provider pushes into an interface; behind it, two storage buses face the furnace: one filtered to coal on its side, one with an inverter card blacklisting coal on its top. A hopper underneath hands the results back to the provider."
  ],
  "quest.47C9318B67DD9160.title": "Bucket duty",
  "quest.47C9318B67DD9160.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A dispenser can fill or empty buckets for the network: the provider sends a bucket through an interface and storage bus, a comparator fires the dispenser and locks the provider, and an import bus returns the result. Often \"},{\"text\":\"fluid substitution\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"52DF8AD0C5D66DE3\"}},{\"text\":\" saves the trouble.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.251ED30DEC762DF0.title": "Into the water, automatically",
  "quest.251ED30DEC762DF0.quest_desc": [
    "An interface on the provider feeds a formation plane that drops items into water. An annihilation plane on another subnet can pick up only what a storage bus on the provider accepts, filtered to the results: fluix, or budding certus made from a quartz block."
  ],
  "quest.11850AB76CFBF829.title": "A press line",
  "quest.11850AB76CFBF829.quest_desc": [
    "Five inscribers: silicon, logic, calculation and engineering presses, and a fifth with none for the assembly, each with four acceleration cards. One processing pattern goes from raw materials to the finished processor, press left out; pipe subnets move the prints."
  ],
  "quest.4E7446E938F0E5C6.title": "Sides and buffers",
  "quest.4E7446E938F0E5C6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An inscriber can be sided, top, bottom and middle slots by face, or take anything from anywhere. It can push results out on its own, and a small input buffer spreads material across a row of inscribers instead of filling the first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.578DA8C68BB02757.title": "Checkerboard",
  "quest.578DA8C68BB02757.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Alternate pattern providers and molecular assemblers like a checkerboard, in groups of eight per cable, so each provider has several assemblers to fill. One energy cell handles the spikes; giant controller rings are only for the photo.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1CF304655DF2AE5D.title": "Copies of copies",
  "quest.1CF304655DF2AE5D.quest_subtitle": "Autocrafting can't read this recipe. Redstone can.",
  "quest.1CF304655DF2AE5D.quest_desc": [
    "A level emitter with a crafting card, set to emit redstone to craft, offers what autocrafting can't plan, like a template that copies itself. Its signal starts an import bus feeding an assembler that holds the pattern and one template; storage bus priorities send one copy back in."
  ],
  "quest.014961A14E511EE1.title": "Photocopier",
  "quest.014961A14E511EE1.quest_subtitle": "Nobody asked for eight.",
  "quest.014961A14E511EE1.quest_desc": [
    "Eight netherite upgrade templates. Either the loop works, or you raided a lot of bastions."
  ],
  "reward.74764C5761B95E78.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.7842C3280751AB4B.title": "More hands in the brain",
  "quest.7842C3280751AB4B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each \"},{\"text\":\"Co-Processing Unit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:crafting_accelerator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" lets a CPU hand out batches faster and run one more step in parallel, so a provider ringed with assemblers keeps them all busy. A \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Monitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:crafting_monitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shows the job.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.466544EB73FE8D1A.title": "Big brain, small brains",
  "quest.466544EB73FE8D1A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Build one or two big CPUs for long jobs and a few small ones for the rest. Each CPU can take orders from players, from automation or both, so a busy export bus never blocks your own request.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4DBFF0B5E4244D7A.title": "Bigger jobs",
  "quest.4DBFF0B5E4244D7A.quest_desc": [
    "A crafting unit plus a storage component makes crafting storage of that size. More storage holds jobs with more ingredients and steps; a second CPU lets two orders run at once."
  ],
  "quest.744A5BF677ACDD7B.title": "Pipes made of network",
  "quest.744A5BF677ACDD7B.quest_desc": [
    "On a subnet whose only storage is a storage bus, an import bus becomes a pipe: what it pulls lands in the bus's inventory. A filtered export bus pulls the other way. Fluids work alike; import straight to export does nothing, with no storage in between."
  ],
  "quest.7D75834F527E28A2.title": "Pipes that place and break",
  "quest.7D75834F527E28A2.quest_desc": [
    "An interface on a subnet whose only storage is a formation plane places or drops whatever you push in. An annihilation plane on a subnet whose only storage is a filtered storage bus breaks only what that bus accepts. Every plane farm is built from these two."
  ],
  "quest.74E322D8EEB3C491.title": "Ores, twice broken",
  "quest.74E322D8EEB3C491.quest_subtitle": "Fortune favours the plane.",
  "quest.74E322D8EEB3C491.quest_desc": [
    "An import bus with acceleration cards feeds silk-touched ore blocks to formation planes on one subnet; Fortune annihilation planes on another break them straight into a storage bus. Import buses spin up, so the array starts slow."
  ],
  "quest.00C127BFB9D02E5D.title": "Cobble on a leash",
  "quest.00C127BFB9D02E5D.quest_desc": [
    "Annihilation planes on a cobble generator store into an interface on the main network. A level emitter set below your limit drives a toggle bus on the subnet side of the quartz fiber: full stock cuts the planes' power, and only the subnet reboots."
  ],
  "quest.0943FBB7AA060C12.title": "Replace the budding block",
  "quest.0943FBB7AA060C12.quest_desc": [
    "A semi-auto farm is three subnets: a plane that harvests clusters, a Silk Touch plane that breaks the spent budding block once it's plain quartz, and an import bus with a formation plane that sets a fresh flawed one. You keep the input barrel stocked."
  ],
  "quest.1838603AE8DB6CC2.title": "Amethyst needs silk",
  "quest.1838603AE8DB6CC2.quest_desc": [
    "Unripe amethyst buds drop nothing, so a plain annihilation plane breaks them. With Silk Touch they drop themselves and can be filtered out; a formation plane sets the ripe clusters again, and a second plane breaks those into shards."
  ],
  "quest.758E076C087191A4.title": "The farm that feeds itself",
  "quest.758E076C087191A4.quest_subtitle": "Certus in, more certus out.",
  "quest.758E076C087191A4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Swap the input barrel for an interface that keeps one flawed budding block, with a crafting card. The spent blocks go back through it to \"},{\"text\":\"water automation\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"251ED30DEC762DF0\"}},{\"text\":\", which rebuilds budding blocks from charged certus. Nothing left to refill.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5C7574B554959492.title": "One item, a big number",
  "quest.5C7574B554959492.quest_desc": [
    "Filter an export bus to the item, give it a crafting card and a redstone card, set it active with signal and told not to use stocked items. A level emitter below your amount drives it, and an interface behind it sends each craft home."
  ],
  "task.56107C96C24089CF.title": "Four interfaces, block or flat",
  "quest.31B3EBAC5A3A6049.title": "A little of many things",
  "quest.31B3EBAC5A3A6049.quest_desc": [
    "Interfaces with crafting cards keep a set amount of each item inside and order more when short. Storage buses on them, set to extract only, let the network use that stock. Four of each fill the eight channels of one cable."
  ],
  "quest.7D2E1BA757617390.title": "Craft on the move",
  "quest.7D2E1BA757617390.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A crafting table and a calculation processor turn a wireless terminal into a \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Crafting Terminal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:wireless_crafting_terminal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". AE2WTLib adds restocking: the stack in your hand refills from the network as you use it, and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ae2.ae2wtlib_restock\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" toggles it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1500666091F8CEB4.title": "Two crafting modes",
  "quest.1500666091F8CEB4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With a crafting card, a level emitter can emit while its item is being crafted, to wake a hungry machine only then, or emit to craft: a pattern with no ingredients that runs an infinite farm until the item arrives. Keep no real pattern for it.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.69B44B4E78956332.title": "Four 4k or 16k item cells",
  "quest.57FE3FAF8DF1578B.title": "Three kinds of storage",
  "quest.57FE3FAF8DF1578B.quest_desc": [
    "General: a few drives of 4k or 16k cells at priority 0. Bulk: big cells partitioned to cobble or iron, with equal distribution, in higher-priority drives. Local: a farm's own subnet. Items drift to their place as they come and go; an IO port shuffles the rest."
  ],
  "quest.0D289F0A1283706E.title": "A farm's own storage",
  "quest.0D289F0A1283706E.quest_desc": [
    "Give a farm a subnet with its own drive of partitioned cells and an interface. A storage bus on that interface from the main network, at high priority, reads the drive through one channel, and nothing spills into your main cells."
  ],
  "quest.7C53A1CA301454B8.title": "Empty a cell into a chest",
  "quest.7C53A1CA301454B8.quest_desc": [
    "An IO port with three acceleration cards and a storage bus on a subnet: sending to the network, it dumps a cell into the chest, drawers or backpack the bus faces; flipped, it fills the cell from them. An energy cell covers the power spikes."
  ],
  "quest.36A1DD7F3539AEA8.title": "The base builds itself",
  "quest.36A1DD7F3539AEA8.quest_subtitle": "You just point.",
  "quest.36A1DD7F3539AEA8.quest_desc": [
    "Eight pattern providers and sixteen co-processors on one network: enough hands and brains that every order finishes while you do something else.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:ae2:textures/block/pattern_provider.png width:48 height:48 align:center}",
    "",
    "Keep providers in groups of eight per cable, spread patterns so recipes run side by side, and let crafting cards top up the basics. From here the network works, and you choose what it works on."
  ],
  "quest.19D0DEF2F939DB6A.title": "Every light on",
  "quest.19D0DEF2F939DB6A.quest_subtitle": "The smart cables have never been this bright.",
  "quest.19D0DEF2F939DB6A.quest_desc": [
    "You ran 2048 channels on one network. At this size the network is the base, and the base is one machine."
  ],
  "reward.6828076062258DEF.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.606BCC0D4F37EDF5.title": "Kept in stock",
  "quest.606BCC0D4F37EDF5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The requesters kept the pantry full long after the cooks stopped coming. Machines remember what people forget. —T.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "quest.72088CBB6598A2BA.title": "Chip order",
  "quest.72088CBB6598A2BA.quest_subtitle": "Sixteen of each, please.",
  "quest.72088CBB6598A2BA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Calculation Processors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:calculation_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Engineering Processors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:engineering_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day. With a processing pattern per chip, this is one click.\"}]"
  ],
  "image.6156FC19D21F7405.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pattern craft\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.2952B7F3AF6B6D03.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Provider setups\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.209FDB8945F8A7BE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Assemblers at scale\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.37D6B8876E354000.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Crafting CPUs\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.0BA8F35C8FA288BF.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pipes and planes\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.6D33168F87432F03.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Stock and storage\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.570042D98880376A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"AE2 · Automation\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.6B39453F70354E2F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"six faces, one provider\",\"color\":\"#7DA9D2\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.509AC6DD59D34CB6.title": "Back to AE2 · Network",
  "image.0585BA9EBFD8536E.title": "On to AE2 · Addons",
  "chapter.1E24729503A1C81A.title": "Applied Energistics 2 · Network",
  "chapter.1E24729503A1C81A.chapter_subtitle": [
    "From a crater to a network that thinks in channels: certus, processors, cells, the controller and the quantum bridge."
  ],
  "task.7DB42B1FB53B2C4D.title": "Stand in a meteorite crater",
  "quest.1E4E23988E9781B3.title": "Fallen sky",
  "quest.1E4E23988E9781B3.quest_subtitle": "Special delivery from nowhere.",
  "quest.1E4E23988E9781B3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Meteorites leave big craters of \"},{\"text\":\"Sky Stone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:sky_stone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Dig to the centre: \"},{\"text\":\"Certus Quartz Clusters\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:quartz_cluster\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and budding certus line the way, and a \"},{\"text\":\"Mysterious Cube\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:mysterious_cube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" waits at the core.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"No crater in sight? The \"},{\"text\":\"Charger\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2452FCA6FC4CFE2D\"}},{\"text\":\" makes a compass that points at the nearest cube.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0D426B64A4DECFB2.title": "Certus by the handful",
  "quest.0D426B64A4DECFB2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A grown \"},{\"text\":\"Certus Quartz Cluster\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:quartz_cluster\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" drops four \"},{\"text\":\"Certus Quartz Crystals\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:certus_quartz_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", more with Fortune; a bud still growing drops a single dust. Take every cluster on the way down.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2452FCA6FC4CFE2D.title": "Crank it up",
  "quest.2452FCA6FC4CFE2D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron and copper make a \"},{\"text\":\"Charger\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:charger\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". With no power yet, put a \"},{\"text\":\"Wooden Crank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:crank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on its top or bottom and turn it. It charges \"},{\"text\":\"Certus Quartz Crystals\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:certus_quartz_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and turns a compass into a \"},{\"text\":\"Meteorite Compass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:meteorite_compass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.553205EE6C9D1141.title": "Into the water",
  "quest.553205EE6C9D1141.quest_subtitle": "Alchemy, AE2 style.",
  "quest.553205EE6C9D1141.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drop a \"},{\"text\":\"Charged Certus Quartz Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:charged_certus_quartz_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a redstone dust and a nether quartz into water: two \"},{\"text\":\"Fluix Crystals\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:fluix_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Cables, energy cells and half the network run on fluix.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.25592EB7781F3A38.title": "The four presses",
  "quest.25592EB7781F3A38.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Break the \"},{\"text\":\"Mysterious Cube\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:mysterious_cube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" without Silk Touch: out come the Silicon, Logic, Calculation and Engineering presses. Printing \"},{\"text\":\"never uses them up\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\", so one set lasts a lifetime.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.678B55C9B3908621.title": "Print shop",
  "quest.678B55C9B3908621.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron, copper and a piston make the \"},{\"text\":\"Inscriber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:inscriber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". A press goes in the top slot and the material in the middle; with no press, a crystal is ground into dust.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It's sided: items fed from the top or bottom land in those slots, from the sides in the middle. A wrench turns it to face your pipes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7E9BCB0C47A31EDC.title": "Silicon, then print",
  "quest.7E9BCB0C47A31EDC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Grind certus into \"},{\"text\":\"Certus Quartz Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:certus_quartz_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and smelt it: \"},{\"text\":\"Silicon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:silicon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". With the Silicon Press on top, the inscriber prints it into \"},{\"text\":\"Printed Silicon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:printed_silicon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the base of every processor.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4F1E7EE66CB33834.title": "Three kinds of brain",
  "quest.4F1E7EE66CB33834.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Print gold with the Logic press, a certus crystal with Calculation, a diamond with Engineering. Press each print with redstone and \"},{\"text\":\"Printed Silicon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:printed_silicon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Logic\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:logic_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Calculation\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:calculation_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Engineering Processors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:engineering_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.41D20416314D72EE.title": "Items become data",
  "quest.41D20416314D72EE.quest_subtitle": "ME: Matter Energy.",
  "quest.41D20416314D72EE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"ME Drive\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:drive\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds ten storage cells, an \"},{\"text\":\"ME Terminal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:terminal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" searches them all at once and an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Acceptor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:energy_acceptor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns 2 FE into 1 \"},{\"text\":\"AE\",\"color\":\"#D8C8FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":\"AE2's own energy. It never converts back.\"}},{\"text\":\". Join them with cable and the wall of chests is history.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Terminals are cable parts: put the cable down first, then the terminal on it, facing you.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1A01B2BACCF19D90.title": "Craft from storage",
  "quest.1A01B2BACCF19D90.quest_subtitle": "A bigger table. Much bigger.",
  "quest.1A01B2BACCF19D90.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A terminal, a crafting table and a \"},{\"text\":\"Calculation Processor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:calculation_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the \"},{\"text\":\"ME Crafting Terminal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:crafting_terminal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Its grid refills itself from the network, so shift-click the result with care.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5A24342389F499DB.title": "Storage cells",
  "quest.5A24342389F499DB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The component sets the size: a \"},{\"text\":\"1k Component\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:cell_component_1k\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes a Logic Processor, and each tier after it takes three of the one before and a Calculation Processor. In an \"},{\"text\":\"ME Item Cell Housing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:item_cell_housing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" it becomes a cell; 4k is the sweet spot to start.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7D1165B36B6C5780.title": "Smooth sky",
  "quest.7D1165B36B6C5780.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Crater \"},{\"text\":\"Sky Stone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:sky_stone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" smelts into \"},{\"text\":\"Sky Stone Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:smooth_sky_stone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; the controller takes four. Ground in the inscriber, sky stone becomes the dust that 256k cells need.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2325AF6584F70E3F.title": "The controller's core",
  "quest.2325AF6584F70E3F.quest_subtitle": "Made in Heliodor.",
  "quest.2325AF6584F70E3F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Here the controller's heart is a \"},{\"text\":\"Routing Matrix\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:routing_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Processors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:logic_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a PneumaticCraft circuit board, two Palis crystals and a calibration frame. The first one belongs to \"},{\"text\":\"A Shared Language\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"17BBD680007901AB\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.00CC66AACA668D42.title": "Switchboard",
  "quest.00CC66AACA668D42.quest_subtitle": "Now it thinks in channels.",
  "quest.00CC66AACA668D42.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Sky Stone Blocks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:smooth_sky_stone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", four \"},{\"text\":\"Fluix Crystals\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:fluix_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and the matrix make an \"},{\"text\":\"ME Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Without one, a network runs eight channel-using devices at most; with it, every face gives out \"},{\"text\":\"32 channels\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0274EB35E79D9821.title": "Trunk line",
  "quest.0274EB35E79D9821.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Covered Cables\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:fluix_covered_cable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make one dense cable; redstone and glowstone make it smart: \"},{\"text\":\"ME Dense Smart Cable\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:fluix_smart_dense_cable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It carries 32 channels, but buses and terminals won't mount on it: step down to normal cable first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.561A39CD67283B8C.title": "Point to point",
  "quest.561A39CD67283B8C.quest_subtitle": "A portal for channels.",
  "quest.561A39CD67283B8C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Link two \"},{\"text\":\"ME P2P Tunnels\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:me_p2p_tunnel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with a Memory Card: sneak-click the input, click the output. Each end takes one channel and the pair carries up to 32 through one thin cable; on a subnet of their own, the main network doesn't even pay those two.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.506E30514D0C27C8.title": "Crush it down",
  "quest.506E30514D0C27C8.quest_subtitle": "Everything, but smaller.",
  "quest.506E30514D0C27C8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Matter Condenser\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:condenser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" deletes whatever enters, or with a storage component inside packs it: 256 items into a \"},{\"text\":\"Matter Ball\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:matter_ball\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", 256,000 into a \"},{\"text\":\"Singularity\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:singularity\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Cobblestone works fine.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.654DF546A8DF23AC.title": "Spooky pair",
  "quest.654DF546A8DF23AC.quest_subtitle": "Action at a distance, sold in pairs.",
  "quest.654DF546A8DF23AC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Blow up a \"},{\"text\":\"Singularity\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:singularity\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" next to \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:ender_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or an ender pearl: two \"},{\"text\":\"Quantum Entangled Singularities\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:quantum_entangled_singularity\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", linked for good. A \"},{\"text\":\"Tiny TNT\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:tiny_tnt\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or even a creeper does the job.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pairs look identical: name them in an anvil.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.03DD4E526E89D121.title": "Across any distance",
  "quest.03DD4E526E89D121.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight \"},{\"text\":\"ME Quantum Rings\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:quantum_ring\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around an \"},{\"text\":\"ME Quantum Link Chamber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:quantum_link\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", one singularity of the pair in each bridge: a wireless dense cable of 32 channels, across any distance and between dimensions. Both ends must stay chunkloaded.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Only the four rings beside the chamber take cables.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.25950187AE46C6D2.title": "Use 128 channels on one network",
  "quest.42DAD943EBAF99A3.title": "A real network",
  "quest.42DAD943EBAF99A3.quest_subtitle": "Tree-shaped, loop-free, lit up.",
  "quest.42DAD943EBAF99A3.quest_desc": [
    "One hundred and twenty-eight channel-using devices on a single network. Grow it like a tree: dense cable out of the controller, normal cable off the dense, devices in groups of eight or fewer.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:ae2:textures/block/controller_powered.png width:48 height:48 align:center}",
    "",
    "Smart cables light every channel along its path; a device left dark has none. Loops and ambiguous routes are what break big networks, so give every channel exactly one way home."
  ],
  "quest.781A245B828BE5F8.title": "Wrench and knife",
  "quest.781A245B828BE5F8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Certus Quartz Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:certus_quartz_wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" rotates AE2 machines and, sneaking, takes them apart or pulls one part off a cable. The \"},{\"text\":\"Certus Quartz Cutting Knife\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:certus_quartz_cutting_knife\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" carves cable anchors and name presses out of metal.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.266156A67AA30F44.title": "Look at a Flawless Budding Certus",
  "quest.2BF325869777C6A1.title": "Look, don't mine",
  "quest.2BF325869777C6A1.quest_subtitle": "The goose with the golden eggs.",
  "quest.2BF325869777C6A1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Flawless Budding Certus Quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:flawless_budding_quartz\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" grows certus forever and never wears out. A pickaxe knocks it down a tier \"},{\"text\":\"even with Silk Touch\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\", and only a lucky \"},{\"text\":\"Crystal Fixer\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"31EE3A93EA52F51E\"}},{\"text\":\" undoes that. Build the farm around it, right where it is.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3CCEDB12D4CFF6FC.title": "A villager for certus",
  "quest.3CCEDB12D4CFF6FC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A villager can take a \"},{\"text\":\"Charger\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:charger\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" as its workstation and become a Fluix Researcher: certus, fluix, sky stone and, at Expert level, any processor press for ten emeralds. Lost presses aren't lost.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.62D0DD312E062AAB.title": "Budding by hand",
  "quest.62D0DD312E062AAB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Certus Quartz Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:quartz_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a charged crystal thrown in water make a \"},{\"translate\":\"block.ae2.damaged_budding_quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\"},{\"text\":\"; the same trick lifts it to chipped, then flawed. These wear out as they grow, and no water trick makes a flawless one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.750B81F61BFEFF77.title": "Grow faster",
  "quest.750B81F61BFEFF77.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Growth Accelerator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:growth_accelerator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" beside a budding block adds random ticks: in theory about ninety times the growth, and they stack. Power it through its top or bottom, by cable or with a crank.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4BFC33B61517567A.title": "Lucky tools",
  "quest.4BFC33B61517567A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Paper and a fluix crystal make a \"},{\"text\":\"Fluix Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:fluix_upgrade_smithing_template\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; with a Fluix Block, a smithing table turns quartz tools into fluix. Three times iron's durability, and every one works as if it had Fortune or Looting I.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0A68196F99C6CA85.title": "Harvest on its own",
  "quest.0A68196F99C6CA85.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Put an \"},{\"text\":\"ME Annihilation Plane\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:annihilation_plane\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a subnet whose only storage is a Storage Bus filtered to certus crystals. It breaks only grown clusters: a bud still growing would drop dust, and the subnet has nowhere to keep it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4F0420DF05040B01.title": "A spare press",
  "quest.4F0420DF05040B01.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A press on top and an iron block in the middle of the \"},{\"text\":\"Inscriber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:inscriber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": out comes a copy. Make spares before an addon recipe eats one, and a second production line needs its own set.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6A3D854777CEC40E.title": "Labels, printed",
  "quest.6A3D854777CEC40E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Right-click a cutting knife, put in an ingot and type a name: an \"},{\"text\":\"Inscriber Name Press\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:name_press\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". In the inscriber it names items like an anvil, which tells pattern providers apart at a glance.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7B5BC57E27EAC057.title": "Glass with a spine",
  "quest.7B5BC57E27EAC057.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five quartz dusts and four glass make four \"},{\"text\":\"Quartz Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:quartz_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Energy acceptors, cells, patterns and panels all ask for it, so grind a stack of certus early.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.366FDC5BA5970A75.title": "Presses on autopilot",
  "quest.366FDC5BA5970A75.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With the presses already inside a row of inscribers, one processing pattern can go straight from gold, silicon and redstone to a finished processor. Leave the press out of the pattern: it never moves.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4534F4AB8BC41656.title": "Glass, covered, smart",
  "quest.4534F4AB8BC41656.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Quartz Fiber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:quartz_fiber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two fluix make four \"},{\"text\":\"ME Glass Cables\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:fluix_glass_cable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; wool covers them. Redstone and glowstone make \"},{\"text\":\"ME Smart Cable\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:fluix_smart_cable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which lights up every channel it carries.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.30F0572B87CBE80E.title": "Eight and thirty-two",
  "quest.30F0572B87CBE80E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Normal cable and most full blocks carry \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" channels; dense cable carries \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\". Channels take the shortest path to the controller, and a network without one is capped at 8 devices in all. Cable colour only keeps neighbours apart.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6A516FC607869EC3.title": "Buffer the surges",
  "quest.6A516FC607869EC3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Dump a full inventory into a small network and it browns out: in one tick it can't spend more AE than it holds. An \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:energy_cell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stores 200k AE and ends that for most bases.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6EA8BE74D14DF3F0.title": "Deep reserves",
  "quest.6EA8BE74D14DF3F0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight Energy Cells around a Calculation Processor: a \"},{\"text\":\"Dense Energy Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:dense_energy_cell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", 1.6M AE. Every wireless terminal carries one, and spatial storage can drain several in a single tick.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.295BD482DA159A89.title": "Low battery",
  "quest.295BD482DA159A89.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A redstone torch, a charged certus crystal and a calculation processor make an \"},{\"text\":\"ME Energy Level Emitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:energy_level_emitter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It reads the energy stored in the network, not items: start a generator when the cells run low and stop it when they're full.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.28206E7B1C55EE71.title": "Burn it",
  "quest.28206E7B1C55EE71.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Vibration Chamber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:vibration_chamber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" burns furnace fuel into 40 AE/t. It slows down when the network is full but never quite stops; acceleration and energy cards push it harder.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.052B0394B6FD133F.title": "Free hum",
  "quest.052B0394B6FD133F.quest_subtitle": "Crystals that won't stop singing.",
  "quest.052B0394B6FD133F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Crystal Resonance Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:crystal_resonance_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes 20 AE/t from nothing, forever. Its vibrations clash: only one works per network, and they even travel through quartz fiber.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3A3EA4FC7C2D730A.title": "A network in a box",
  "quest.3A3EA4FC7C2D730A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"ME Chest\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:chest\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is a drive, a terminal and an acceptor for a single cell. Its screen sees only that cell, which makes it handy for checking one cell or filling it by hand.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6C6B2132C25EF1C1.title": "Partition",
  "quest.6C6B2132C25EF1C1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Cell Workbench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:cell_workbench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" filters a cell to chosen items and fits its cards: inverter, fuzzy, equal distribution, overflow destruction. It also sets up \"},{\"text\":\"View Cells\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:view_cell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which make a terminal show only what they list.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7DB4E2ABA3A97772.title": "Bigger, not wider",
  "quest.7DB4E2ABA3A97772.quest_desc": [
    "16k, 64k and 256k components each hold four times the last and cost three of it. Types stay at 63, so big cells suit bulk; the 256k needs sky stone dust. A cell crafted with a bigger component upgrades in place, contents and all."
  ],
  "quest.0CCB1D1149EDA3AF.title": "Pocket network",
  "quest.0CCB1D1149EDA3AF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A chest, a 1k component, an energy cell and a housing: a \"},{\"text\":\"1k Portable Item Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:portable_item_cell_1k\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a tiny ME chest you carry. Half the bytes of a normal cell; recharge it in a Charger.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ae2.portable_item_cell\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens it from anywhere in your inventory.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0619ED8CAF98334B.title": "Cell shuffle",
  "quest.0619ED8CAF98334B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"ME IO Port\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:io_port\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" empties a cell into the network or fills it from the network, fast, then moves it to the output slots. Acceleration cards speed it up; a redstone card decides when it runs.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5C492F73DAFDF9BB.title": "Who fills first",
  "quest.5C492F73DAFDF9BB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Items enter the highest-priority storage first and leave from the lowest. A partitioned cell counts as already holding its items, so at equal priority it catches them before a general one does.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3A0E08425838B993.title": "Liquid assets",
  "quest.3A0E08425838B993.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fluid cells use their own copper housing and the same components, like the \"},{\"text\":\"4k ME Fluid Storage Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:fluid_storage_cell_4k\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Each holds only five fluids, eight buckets to the byte, and the terminal fills and empties buckets for you.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.08DC49D03272CE88.title": "Bytes and types",
  "quest.08DC49D03272CE88.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A cell holds 63 types and counts items in bits: eight to the byte, however they stack. Each type costs bytes up front, so one type fills a cell twice as far as 63. Keep mob loot out: every enchant and scratch is a new type.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.20839BBDFD7238C6.title": "Controller shapes",
  "quest.20839BBDFD7238C6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Controller blocks join into one controller up to 7×7×7, and a network holds only one. Each block may touch others along a single axis; break a rule and the blocks turn red. More blocks, more faces, 32 channels each.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.15E05A2C62807849.title": "Diagnose",
  "quest.15E05A2C62807849.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Right-click any part of a network with a \"},{\"text\":\"Network Tool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:network_tool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": channels in use, energy stored and flowing, every device on it. It also keeps nine upgrade cards at hand for any AE2 screen.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5C0794823234A9A0.title": "Copy, paste",
  "quest.5C0794823234A9A0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sneak-click a device with a \"},{\"text\":\"Memory Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:memory_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to copy its settings, then click others to paste them, upgrade cards included. P2P tunnels are linked the same way.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7D2AC8CDC5583A36.title": "Tidy cables",
  "quest.7D2AC8CDC5583A36.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The cutting knife turns metal into \"},{\"text\":\"Cable Anchors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:cable_anchor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which block connections on their side and double as ladders. Four around a block make a \"},{\"text\":\"Cable Facade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:facade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" of it; holding a Network Tool hides facades.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.28DD1C4B9E6AE285.title": "Flat parts",
  "quest.28DD1C4B9E6AE285.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Interfaces and pattern providers turn flat in a crafting grid and back. Flat ones sit on a cable, several per block, and don't connect networks through their face: the easy border for a subnet. Sneak-use a wrench to pull off a single part.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2B3B676137DDEE49.title": "In and out",
  "quest.2B3B676137DDEE49.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"ME Import Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:import_bus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pulls from the inventory it faces into the network; an \"},{\"text\":\"ME Export Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:export_bus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pushes out only what its filter names. One on top of a furnace and one below is the classic first job.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.68FFB486CB3B69CD.title": "Keep some handy",
  "quest.68FFB486CB3B69CD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"ME Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is a chest and multi-tank that keeps itself stocked from the network with whatever you set, up to nine stacks a tick, and sends everything else back.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2A166286E859AD3A.title": "Keep the chest monster",
  "quest.2A166286E859AD3A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"ME Storage Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:storage_bus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns the inventory it touches into network storage. Drawers and barrels work well; huge unoptimised chests hurt performance.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6AEA3FE6522F0D9D.title": "Count and signal",
  "quest.6AEA3FE6522F0D9D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"ME Level Emitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:level_emitter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" gives redstone when an item in storage goes above or below the amount you set. It needs no channel: turn a farm off when the stock is full.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.205E9D78FDDFAAD4.title": "Cards up the sleeve",
  "quest.205E9D78FDDFAAD4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Capacity Cards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:capacity_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" add filter slots; \"},{\"text\":\"Acceleration Cards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:speed_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" move more per operation, from 1 item to 8, 32, 64 and 96. Redstone cards add control, fuzzy ones ignore damage and data, inverters flip a filter.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.557D536A014843BA.title": "Cards for cells",
  "quest.557D536A014843BA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two cards go on cells, in the cell workbench. An \"},{\"text\":\"Equal Distribution Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:equal_distribution_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" splits a partitioned cell evenly between its items; an \"},{\"text\":\"Overflow Destruction Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:void_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" deletes what arrives once the cell, or that item's share, is full.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0E90C390A27A9DAA.title": "Place and break",
  "quest.0E90C390A27A9DAA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"ME Formation Plane\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:formation_plane\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" places blocks or drops items whenever the network stores into it. Its twin, the annihilation plane, breaks what's in front and picks up what touches it, but only what its network can store.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3F94A663B87E9DD0.title": "Networkception",
  "quest.3F94A663B87E9DD0.quest_subtitle": "A network looking into a network.",
  "quest.3F94A663B87E9DD0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"You put a \"},{\"text\":\"Storage Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:storage_bus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on an \"},{\"text\":\"Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". An unconfigured interface shows its whole network to the bus: one network reading another through a single channel.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.5DB0CCB1E713BBCF.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.48679B5725498433.title": "Screens on the wall",
  "quest.48679B5725498433.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"ME Storage Monitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:storage_monitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shows one item and its count, no channel needed. The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Conversion Monitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:conversion_monitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" also takes and gives it: a click pulls a stack, or asks for a craft when there's none.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5EA9CC6DAA389B42.title": "Plane tricks",
  "quest.5EA9CC6DAA389B42.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Annihilation planes take pickaxe enchantments: Fortune multiplies ore drops, Silk Touch keeps blocks whole. Face one up at the very top of the world and it gathers sky stone dust from nothing.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7A072CDE16F967DE.title": "Tunnels for everything",
  "quest.7A072CDE16F967DE.quest_desc": [
    "Right-click a placed P2P tunnel to retune it: a chest or hopper for items, a bucket for fluids, redstone for signals, a charged item for energy, which pays a 2.5% toll. ME tunnels can't run through other ME tunnels."
  ],
  "quest.2448DB828D1B6AA2.title": "Switches and fibres",
  "quest.2448DB828D1B6AA2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Quartz Fiber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:quartz_fiber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shares power between two networks without joining them. An \"},{\"text\":\"ME Toggle Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:toggle_bus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" connects or cuts a stretch of cable by redstone; each flip may reboot the network.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.35989E0DF590D59B.title": "Networks inside networks",
  "quest.35989E0DF590D59B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A subnet is just a separate network. An import bus and a storage bus on their own little network make an item pipe the main network can't raid. Quartz fiber powers it without joining the two.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.192520C87BEEA2AC.title": "Cut the cord",
  "quest.192520C87BEEA2AC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"ME Wireless Access Point\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:wireless_access_point\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes one channel and reaches 16 blocks. \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Boosters\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:wireless_booster\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stretch it: sixteen of them reach 80 blocks, at a steeper power cost.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4834765FCCB69F7C.title": "Storage in your pocket",
  "quest.4834765FCCB69F7C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A receiver, a terminal and a dense energy cell: a \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Terminal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:wireless_terminal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Put it in the access point's top-right slot to link it; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ae2.wireless_terminal\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens it from your inventory while in range.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Its bigger siblings wait in \"},{\"text\":\"AE2 · Automation\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"369BBB754F0B5AB0\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0EE122952979DDEA.title": "AE2 armoury",
  "quest.0EE122952979DDEA.quest_subtitle": "Recoil not included.",
  "quest.0EE122952979DDEA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Matter Cannon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:matter_cannon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fires small items for 1600 AE a shot: a gold nugget hits for 10, a matter ball for 2. The \"},{\"text\":\"Charged Staff\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:charged_staff\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hits for 6 on 300 AE. Both recharge in a Charger.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6243BBEF57E88098.title": "Hot and cold",
  "quest.6243BBEF57E88098.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Right-click with an \"},{\"text\":\"Entropy Manipulator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:entropy_manipulator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to heat, sneak-click to cool: water freezes or boils away, lava turns to obsidian, logs to charcoal and cobble to stone, in place. Anything else, it lights like flint and steel.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.14BA0FD3A0D11791.title": "Paint job",
  "quest.14BA0FD3A0D11791.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Color Applicator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:color_applicator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" paints cables, wool, glass and concrete in place, with dyes or paintballs: eight matter balls around a dye. A snowball cleans a cable back to fluix.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.72CD6E51F5D7FF61.title": "Replica",
  "quest.72CD6E51F5D7FF61.quest_subtitle": "The mystery is gone. The cube remains.",
  "quest.72CD6E51F5D7FF61.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"You spent a controller and a full set of presses on four \"},{\"text\":\"Not So Mysterious Cubes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:not_so_mysterious_cube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". They look exactly like the real one. That was the point, apparently.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.6D60642AE728EA53.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.4FC22C336625A9ED.title": "Cut and paste the world",
  "quest.4FC22C336625A9ED.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Spatial pylons outline a box; a \"},{\"text\":\"Spatial IO Port\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:spatial_io_port\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" swaps what's inside with a pocket dimension on a redstone pulse. It moves what no pickaxe can, like a flawless budding block. \"},{\"text\":\"Anyone inside travels too.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.583D0D85AD2ED560.title": "Pocket rooms",
  "quest.583D0D85AD2ED560.quest_desc": [
    "Spatial cells hold 2³, 16³ or 128³ of space, and each size's component takes four of the one before. Once used, a cell keeps that size for good: make a new cell for a new shape."
  ],
  "quest.53D836F6AAEBB9D0.title": "Keep it loaded",
  "quest.53D836F6AAEBB9D0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Spatial Anchor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:spatial_anchor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" forceloads every chunk its network touches, and the load crosses quantum bridges within a dimension. It draws 80 AE/t plus more for each chunk it holds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.08216441231006A2.title": "Inside the box",
  "quest.08216441231006A2.quest_subtitle": "Please keep your arms inside the cell.",
  "quest.08216441231006A2.quest_desc": [
    "You got stored in a spatial cell. It's dark in there, featureless, and the only way out is the way you came in. Hope someone keeps the cell."
  ],
  "reward.304FD3098CE72A16.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.4B78FA1CA4E7379E.title": "The manual is in the item",
  "quest.4B78FA1CA4E7379E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hover any AE2 item and hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.guideme.guide\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\": its guide page opens, with 3D scenes you can turn. The pack's AE2 addons have pages there too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3424E99A540DE013.title": "Certus harvest",
  "quest.3424E99A540DE013.quest_subtitle": "The farm does the lifting.",
  "quest.3424E99A540DE013.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sixty-four \"},{\"text\":\"Certus Quartz Crystals\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:certus_quartz_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day. A flawless bud with accelerators and a plane pays this while you sleep.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.59CE9179920C376A.title": "Creative AE2",
  "quest.59CE9179920C376A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Creative Energy Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:creative_energy_cell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" costs two Logistics and two Engineering Luminosities, two dragon hearts, two singularities and a MEGA superdense cell, from Solsticio in act VI. The creative storage cell can't be crafted.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.31EEBC30436CF305.title": "Scribbled on a press",
  "quest.31EEBC30436CF305.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The sky kept dropping the same four presses. I stopped asking who made them and started printing. —T.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "image.1259721E33EF044F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Certus and fluix\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.34D816A20B0EDDC5.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Circuits\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.119E9875CE9FEBD3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Power and cable\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.2F5A80F260575588.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Storage\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.7A59EA97CB3C9F57.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Controller and tools\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.3F64E1E14529E721.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Buses and interfaces\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.3C4997ABDA3AFD9F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tunnels, subnets, wireless\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.174964B976C97517.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Matter and odd tools\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.2C2A02FF2D875EA7.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Spatial IO\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.76B7E7EB785A42B1.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Applied Energistics 2 · Network\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.20CAE981C267E1C2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"matter · energy\",\"color\":\"#7DA9D2\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.5305435064DDB41F.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.5947353A33AB5F94.title": "On to AE2 · Automation",
  "chapter.1AA464390E4D1204.title": "CC: Tweaked",
  "chapter.1AA464390E4D1204.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Computers, turtles, monitors and modems you program in Lua: they can read and drive half the pack."
  ],
  "quest.37FECE288D04614F.title": "CraftOS boots",
  "quest.37FECE288D04614F.quest_subtitle": "Boots faster than your PC.",
  "quest.37FECE288D04614F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Your first \"},{\"text\":\"Computer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:computer_normal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": right-click it and you're in \"},{\"text\":\"CraftOS\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\", a shell that runs Lua.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Seven stone, a redstone and a glass pane.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"help\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" lists the topics; \"},{\"text\":\"programs\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\", the commands.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"edit hello\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" writes a program; \"},{\"text\":\"hello\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" runs it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A file named \"},{\"text\":\"startup\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" runs by itself at boot.\"}]",
    "",
    "The buttons at its side shut it down or stop a stuck program; hover them to see the key."
  ],
  "quest.799E84461222BBB3.title": "Every computer has a number",
  "quest.799E84461222BBB3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"id\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" prints the computer's number, and its files belong to that ID.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Break it: the item keeps the ID, so the files come along.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"label set Base\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" names it, and the name shows on the item.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.06EF9C34FBAAB920.title": "A prompt that answers",
  "quest.06EF9C34FBAAB920.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"lua\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" opens a live prompt: each line runs as soon as you send it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"1 + 1\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" answers \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\"; \"},{\"text\":\"exit()\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" leaves.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"help apis\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" lists the libraries you can call.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.160BD6F65223664A.title": "Code from outside",
  "quest.160BD6F65223664A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"wget\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"pastebin get\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" download programs; \"},{\"text\":\"pastebin run\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" runs one on the spot.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Drag a file onto an open terminal to upload it, up to \"},{\"text\":\"512 KiB\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "• Private and local network addresses stay blocked.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Read code before you run it\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\": a program controls the computer and everything wired to it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7CC68FC53723A2DB.title": "One thread for everyone",
  "quest.7CC68FC53723A2DB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"By default every computer shares \"},{\"text\":\"one\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" server thread.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• A loop with no \"},{\"text\":\"sleep\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" or \"},{\"text\":\"os.pullEvent\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" slows them all.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Wait for events and timers instead of asking over and over.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Command Computer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:computer_command\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is creative-only: only an operator in creative mode can use it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6D824B2F8096F006.title": "Colour and a mouse",
  "quest.6D824B2F8096F006.quest_subtitle": "Ships with Paint. And a text adventure.",
  "quest.6D824B2F8096F006.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Computer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:computer_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds colour and mouse clicks.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Craft it with gold instead of stone, or ring a Computer with seven gold to keep its ID and files.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"bg\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"fg\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" open programs in tabs.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Clicks arrive as \"},{\"text\":\"mouse_click\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"mouse_drag\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"mouse_scroll\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\": menus and buttons come easy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7FCF6B1DE34533B7.title": "Toys in the ROM",
  "quest.7FCF6B1DE34533B7.quest_subtitle": "Work can wait.",
  "quest.7FCF6B1DE34533B7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"CraftOS ships with toys: \"},{\"text\":\"adventure\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"worm\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" everywhere, \"},{\"text\":\"paint\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"redirection\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" on colour screens.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"falling\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" only runs on pocket computers.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6FB2E290B9EBFF10.title": "Meet the makers",
  "quest.6FB2E290B9EBFF10.quest_subtitle": "Credits roll.",
  "quest.6FB2E290B9EBFF10.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Any mob head and an \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Computer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:computer_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" craft into dan200's head: he created ComputerCraft.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• A \"},{\"text\":\"Monitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:monitor_normal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" instead gives Cloudhunter's.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.6494CB0D821180D9.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.5935F07739DC4924.title": "Floppies still work",
  "quest.5935F07739DC4924.quest_subtitle": "Retro, and it saves the day.",
  "quest.5935F07739DC4924.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Disk Drive\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:disk_drive\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" beside a computer mounts a floppy as the \"},{\"text\":\"disk\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" folder.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Floppy Disk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:disk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": paper, redstone and a dye.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Room: \"},{\"text\":\"1 MB\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" per computer, \"},{\"text\":\"125 KB\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" per floppy.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"startup\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" file on a floppy runs at boot: one disk can set up computer after computer.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Music discs play too: \"},{\"text\":\"dj play\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0587FAAACBDF8D55.title": "It sings, too",
  "quest.0587FAAACBDF8D55.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Speaker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:speaker\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" plays note-block instruments, any game sound or audio files.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"speaker play song.dfpwm\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\": DFPWM, or mono 8-bit WAV at \"},{\"text\":\"48 kHz\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Up to \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" notes per tick.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Turtles and pocket computers take it as an upgrade."
  ],
  "quest.5535489EE629D423.title": "Hard copy",
  "quest.5535489EE629D423.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Printer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:printer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes paper and a dye as ink, and prints from code.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"newPage\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"write\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"endPage\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\": one sheet at a time.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"getInkLevel\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"getPaperLevel\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" warn before it runs dry.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6D30FC0526D62467.title": "Tied with string",
  "quest.6D30FC0526D62467.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two or more printouts and a string make \"},{\"text\":\"Printed Pages\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:printed_pages\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "• Logbooks, base maps, a recipe list by the door."
  ],
  "quest.59D4216D8117691B.title": "Self-published",
  "quest.59D4216D8117691B.quest_subtitle": "No publisher turned you down.",
  "quest.59D4216D8117691B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Leather and string around your printouts: a \"},{\"text\":\"Printed Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:printed_book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• On a \"},{\"text\":\"Lectern\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lectern\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" it becomes the base's manual.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.0BB4CC977D1CACE8.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.4A8970961738327D.title": "Lectern duty",
  "quest.4A8970961738327D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Lectern\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lectern\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds more than books.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Printed pages and books: anyone can read them.",
    "",
    "• A pocket computer: a desk terminal, with a mouse, that uses the peripheral below."
  ],
  "quest.45DC4883921FFA45.title": "Backups for the archive",
  "quest.45DC4883921FFA45.quest_subtitle": "Nobody backs up. You will.",
  "quest.45DC4883921FFA45.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight \"},{\"text\":\"Floppy Disks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:disk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Each is paper, redstone and a dye."
  ],
  "quest.72792D7D894661AF.title": "One screen, many blocks",
  "quest.72792D7D894661AF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Monitors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:monitor_normal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" placed together merge into one big screen.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Up to \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" wide and \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" tall.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"monitor right hello\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" runs a program on the monitor to the right.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In Lua, wrap it with \"},{\"text\":\"peripheral.wrap\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" and write to it, or \"},{\"text\":\"term.redirect\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" everything there.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"setTextScale\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" goes from \"},{\"text\":\"0.5\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\", in halves.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0EDD0B86A59684EF.title": "Touch the wall",
  "quest.0EDD0B86A59684EF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Advanced Monitors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:monitor_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" are touch screens, in colour.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Gold around a glass pane: four per craft.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• A right-click on one fires \"},{\"text\":\"monitor_touch\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" with the X and Y.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Draw buttons, catch the touch, switch a machine."
  ],
  "quest.06E2AB6EF48F3F74.title": "The control room",
  "quest.06E2AB6EF48F3F74.quest_subtitle": "Houston, we have a base.",
  "quest.06E2AB6EF48F3F74.quest_desc": [
    "One Advanced Computer runs the whole base from here.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• A wall of \"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Monitors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:monitor_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with touch buttons.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Tanks, chests and batteries read over the wire.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Turtles and outposts heard through an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Modem\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:wireless_modem_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In act V, this panel is a handy way to watch the buffer in \"},{\"text\":\"Empty, refill, resume\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"612B6CF528DB5881\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.542F669BB6979A73.title": "Everything on the wire",
  "quest.542F669BB6979A73.quest_subtitle": "If it has a modem, it has a name.",
  "quest.542F669BB6979A73.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wired Modems\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:wired_modem\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" joined by \"},{\"text\":\"Networking Cable\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:cable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" put distant blocks on a computer's wire.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Right-click a modem on a machine: the chat gives its peripheral name.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"peripherals\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" lists everything the computer sees.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Any chest answers \"},{\"text\":\"list\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"pushItems\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"pullItems\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\": a sorter is a few lines away.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tanks answer \"},{\"text\":\"tanks\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"pushFluid\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\"; batteries, \"},{\"text\":\"getEnergy\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.534D2F4F50300B46.title": "A modem you can build with",
  "quest.534D2F4F50300B46.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Craft a \"},{\"text\":\"Wired Modem\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:wired_modem_full\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on its own and it becomes a full block.\"}]",
    "",
    "• It links every peripheral touching its six faces.",
    "",
    "• Craft it again for the flat one."
  ],
  "quest.750F233DF2536F5C.title": "Redstone from afar",
  "quest.750F233DF2536F5C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Computers read and send redstone on all \"},{\"text\":\"six\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" sides.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"redstone set left true\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"redstone pulse front 10 1\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• A \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Relay\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:redstone_relay\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds six more sides anywhere on the wire.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Bundled cables work too: Ender IO's redstone conduits read as bundled channels."
  ],
  "task.415854548CC4EB63.title": "A Create block a computer can drive",
  "quest.77AB5A14AB23ED5D.title": "Create and computers",
  "quest.77AB5A14AB23ED5D.quest_subtitle": "The gearbox takes orders now.",
  "quest.77AB5A14AB23ED5D.quest_desc": [
    "A computer beside a Create block drives it as a peripheral.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Speedometer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:speedometer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Stressometer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:stressometer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" report.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Sequenced Gearshift\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:sequenced_gearshift\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Rotation Speed Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:rotation_speed_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" obey.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• A \"},{\"text\":\"Display Link\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:display_link\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" prints what the computer sends.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Stations, signals, track observers, packagers and the stock ticker answer too.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Digital Adapter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"createaddition:digital_adapter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reaches pulleys, pistons and bearings; more in \"},{\"text\":\"Motor on a script\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2376057ED163A454\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A block a computer controls ignores your hands\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" until its computers and modems come off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4D9218F6064FD671.title": "The rest of the pack answers",
  "quest.4D9218F6064FD671.quest_desc": [
    "Most tech mods here talk to computers.",
    "",
    "• Mekanism machines and multiblock ports, Immersive Engineering, PneumaticCraft.",
    "",
    "• Draconic Evolution's pylons, reactor and flow gates; Create: New Age motors.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• The \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Meter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"energymeter:meter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": see \"},{\"text\":\"Read it from a computer\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"336A0FDDE44FA90F\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Also on the list:",
    "",
    "• Supplementaries' cannon and speaker block.",
    "",
    "• Ars Controle's scroll holder and warping prism.",
    "",
    "• Modular Bees hives.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"peripheral.getMethods\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" lists what each one offers. More peripherals may join the pack later.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.227AE57B09C73B93.title": "Rednet",
  "quest.227AE57B09C73B93.quest_subtitle": "Wi-fi, but with ender pearls.",
  "quest.227AE57B09C73B93.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Modem\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:wireless_modem_normal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (stone around an ender pearl) talks without cable.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Range: \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" blocks up to Y 96, growing to \"},{\"text\":\"384\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" at the build limit.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"rednet.open\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" its side, then \"},{\"text\":\"rednet.send\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" to an ID or \"},{\"text\":\"rednet.broadcast\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"rednet.host\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"rednet.lookup\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" let programs find each other by name.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"repeat\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" on a computer with two modems relays messages farther.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.646AABCD481A864F.title": "No range, no borders",
  "quest.646AABCD481A864F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Modem\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:wireless_modem_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has no range limit and crosses dimensions.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Gold around an eye of ender.",
    "",
    "• The base can talk to a mine in the Nether.",
    "",
    "• It fits turtles and pocket computers too."
  ],
  "task.4EF42135BEB4079B.title": "Four computers",
  "task.4CA22EF5D2A4BE47.title": "Four wireless or ender modems",
  "quest.68AA1FD1CEA5B6F0.title": "Four points in the sky",
  "quest.68AA1FD1CEA5B6F0.quest_subtitle": "You are here. Probably.",
  "quest.68AA1FD1CEA5B6F0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four computers with modems, high up and not all in one plane, each running \"},{\"text\":\"gps host x y z\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Then \"},{\"text\":\"gps locate\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" tells anything in range where it is.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"One wrong coordinate spoils every answer.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"}]"
  ],
  "task.78D24CABD21B2F3D.title": "Any Pocket Computer",
  "quest.0C1C4EA1AE54B0F0.title": "The base in your pocket",
  "quest.0C1C4EA1AE54B0F0.quest_subtitle": "The smartphone, 1.21 edition.",
  "quest.0C1C4EA1AE54B0F0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Pocket Computer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:pocket_computer_normal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" goes where you go: right-click to use it.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Stone, a golden apple and a glass pane.",
    "",
    "• One upgrade: a wireless or ender modem, or a speaker.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Craft it with the upgrade, or run \"},{\"text\":\"equip\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\": it takes the first valid item from your inventory.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Its screen is \"},{\"text\":\"26×20\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" characters, about half as wide as a computer's.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6A30A740F2593D69.title": "Colour to go",
  "quest.6A30A740F2593D69.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Pocket Computer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:pocket_computer_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds colour and a mouse.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Seven gold around a Pocket Computer: same ID, same files.",
    "",
    "• Or craft it straight from gold, a golden apple and a glass pane."
  ],
  "quest.0F06B8B1DBCB051F.title": "Remote-control turtles",
  "quest.0F06B8B1DBCB051F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Craft a \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Modem\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:wireless_modem_normal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" onto a turtle and it can \"},{\"text\":\"rednet.open\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" from inside.\"}]",
    "",
    "• A pocket computer sends the orders; the turtle runs them and reports back.",
    "",
    "• Ender Modems on both ends work at any distance."
  ],
  "task.19DBBD90E12B81CD.title": "Any Turtle",
  "quest.73AB617F80FCFB33.title": "A computer that moves",
  "quest.73AB617F80FCFB33.quest_subtitle": "Slow and steady mines the chunk.",
  "quest.73AB617F80FCFB33.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Turtle\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:turtle_normal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" digs, builds and hauls on its own.\"}]",
    "",
    "• A Computer inside seven iron and a chest; it keeps the ID and files.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Fuel first: coal in its slots, then \"},{\"text\":\"refuel\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"go forward 3\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"turn left\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\": moves with no code.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each move burns \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" fuel: coal gives \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\", a lava bucket \"},{\"text\":\"1000\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The tank holds \"},{\"text\":\"20,000\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" on a Turtle and \"},{\"text\":\"100,000\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" on an Advanced Turtle.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.695176041A72F4E5.title": "Diamond Pickaxe for the turtle",
  "quest.610BEE60A4D95BA8.title": "The Mining Turtle",
  "quest.610BEE60A4D95BA8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Craft a Turtle beside a \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Pickaxe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_pickaxe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and it mines for you.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"tunnel 20\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" digs a 3×2 tunnel, 20 blocks long.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"excavate 5\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" mines a 5×5 shaft down to bedrock and climbs back with the loot.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"equip 5 left\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" fits the tool in slot 5 while it runs; a turtle carries \"},{\"text\":\"two\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" upgrades.\"}]",
    "",
    "Only diamond tools work as turtle tools."
  ],
  "task.09B9B3346BAF058C.title": "Another diamond tool",
  "quest.5E1B0AF1C7CD1E34.title": "Four more trades",
  "quest.5E1B0AF1C7CD1E34.quest_desc": [
    "Other diamond tools make other turtles.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Axe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_axe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": fells trees; hits \"},{\"text\":\"twice\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" as hard as a pickaxe.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Shovel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_shovel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": dirt, sand, melons, pumpkins.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Hoe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_hoe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": crops, cactus, melons, pumpkins.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Sword\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_sword\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"three times\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" a pickaxe's damage; cuts wool and cobwebs.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.70EAA66282EB56CB.title": "Crafting Table for the turtle",
  "quest.38ADE6A69AF1BC9D.title": "It crafts, too",
  "quest.38ADE6A69AF1BC9D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:crafting_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on one side makes a Crafty Turtle.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Lay a recipe out in its inventory and run \"},{\"text\":\"craft all\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "• Two sides, two upgrades: a mining crafty turtle works fine."
  ],
  "quest.2608F4EF3098B616.title": "Gold shell",
  "quest.2608F4EF3098B616.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Turtle\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"computercraft:turtle_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds \"},{\"text\":\"100,000\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"},{\"text\":\" fuel, five times more, on a colour screen.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Five gold and a gold block around a Turtle: nothing is lost.",
    "",
    "• Or craft it from an Advanced Computer, gold and a chest."
  ],
  "quest.58F79B6F64F7992A.title": "Paint job",
  "quest.58F79B6F64F7992A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Craft a turtle, a pocket computer or a floppy with dyes to colour it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• A \"},{\"text\":\"Sponge\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sponge\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the grid, or a cauldron, washes a turtle clean.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Dyes and a stick give it a flag to carry."
  ],
  "image.187F95BBE9668474.title": "Turn this computer off",
  "image.4C4101AD6138F545.title": "Stop the running code",
  "image.32461788C6635F52.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"CraftOS 1.9\\n> lua\\nlua> _\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.7B4D60EB7CD5F9D7.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Paper and sound\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"}]",
  "image.7A4696FF9EDF4A22.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Turtle upgrades\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\"}]",
  "image.106CEA7F07F65B73.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"CC: Tweaked\",\"color\":\"#DEDE6C\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.1E28C5810B2C0CED.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "chapter.693B56B9AD358543.title": "Immersive Engineering · Industry",
  "chapter.693B56B9AD358543.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Presses, crushers and a refinery feeding a diesel plant; at the end, an arc furnace that eats electrodes."
  ],
  "task.1481FDEF0BB7041C.title": "Heavy engineering",
  "task.4C2AA15534B0582D.title": "Light engineering",
  "task.4038BA267666AC76.title": "Steel scaffolding",
  "quest.562BC248458CD11F.title": "Machine parts",
  "quest.562BC248458CD11F.quest_subtitle": "Big machines are built, not crafted.",
  "quest.562BC248458CD11F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two kinds of block and a scaffold build most of IE's big machines.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Light Engineering Blocks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:light_engineering\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": iron sheetmetal, iron components, copper\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Heavy Engineering Blocks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:heavy_engineering\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": steel sheetmetal, steel components, electrum\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Steel Scaffolding\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:steel_scaffolding_standard\",\"count\":1}}}]"
  ],
  "quest.65066EE52D0816F2.title": "Shapes for metal",
  "quest.65066EE52D0816F2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An iron plate over three blue dyes and three paper draws the molds blueprint.\"}]",
    "",
    "At the workbench, three steel plates and a nick of the wire cutters make each mold: plate, rod, wire, gear, casing, packing."
  ],
  "task.09405F7BEC0391A9.title": "Form the Metal Press",
  "quest.7DDF67C0A0C4774B.title": "The press",
  "quest.7DDF67C0A0C4774B.quest_subtitle": "Under new management: you.",
  "quest.7DDF67C0A0C4774B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Seven blocks, one mold, and the metal takes any shape.\"}]",
    "",
    "A piston on a heavy engineering block, two steel scaffolds, two conveyors and a redstone engineering block: seven blocks, hammered on the piston.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click it with a mold.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Power goes in the plug on top and items ride the belts through.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.2C5A9F7624460029.title": "Form the Crusher",
  "quest.42E48835149F9A3C.title": "The crusher",
  "quest.42E48835149F9A3C.quest_subtitle": "Hands off. Seriously.",
  "quest.42E48835149F9A3C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ores in, grit out; stone in, gravel out.\"}]",
    "",
    "Ten light engineering blocks, ten steel scaffolds, eight steel fences, nine hoppers and a redstone block, hammered on the centre fence of the long side.",
    "",
    "Faster with more power."
  ],
  "task.3F2E621B47D2E38A.title": "Form the Squeezer",
  "quest.00409D9993FFA0B6.title": "Seed oil",
  "quest.00409D9993FFA0B6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Press hemp, and the yard starts making its own fuel.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four wooden barrels, a piston, steel scaffolding and fences, light engineering and pipes form the \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Squeezer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:squeezer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", hammered on the centre barrel.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each hemp seed gives \"},{\"text\":\"120\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" mB of \"},{\"text\":\"Plant Oil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:plantoil_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", wheat seeds \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.387926D1C7E329E5.title": "Graphite",
  "quest.387926D1C7E329E5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The crusher grinds coke into \"},{\"text\":\"Coke Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:dust_coke\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and the squeezer presses eight of it into one \"},{\"text\":\"HOP Graphite Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:dust_hop_graphite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "That's thirty-two coke per electrode: start a coke line now."
  ],
  "task.5EA285A017AEF669.title": "Look at your Bottling Machine",
  "quest.4DBD3BFE9EDFFFB7.title": "Bottling",
  "quest.4DBD3BFE9EDFFFB7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A belt, a tank and a nozzle: bottling on the line.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three conveyors, two fluid pumps, iron sheetmetal, light engineering, scaffolding and a redstone block: hammer the centre conveyor to form the \"},{\"text\":\"Bottling Machine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:bottling_machine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Fluid goes in its tank, items ride the belt and leave filled."
  ],
  "quest.3D738FF3AE2B8D0E.title": "Electrodes",
  "quest.3D738FF3AE2B8D0E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The arc furnace wants three electrodes at once.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A rod mold, four HOP graphite dust and a bucket of creosote bottle into one \"},{\"text\":\"Graphite Electrode\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:graphite_electrode\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", packed, soaked and baked in the machine.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.37B3A5F2DA0EE76F.title": "Form the Fermenter",
  "quest.48C6734741715F55.title": "Fermentation",
  "quest.48C6734741715F55.quest_subtitle": "Not for drinking. Probably.",
  "quest.48C6734741715F55.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Plants in, ethanol out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four cauldrons, iron sheetmetal, scaffolding, light engineering and pipes form the \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Fermenter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:fermenter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", hammered on the centre cauldron.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Sugar cane, potatoes and apples give \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" mB of \"},{\"text\":\"Ethanol\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:ethanol_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A honey bottle, \"},{\"text\":\"250\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.653124BA8A3C38E9.title": "Form the Refinery",
  "quest.485936812C7CF65C.title": "Refined",
  "quest.485936812C7CF65C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two crops in, one fuel out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Refinery\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:refinery\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" mixes \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" mB of plant oil with \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" of ethanol into \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" of \"},{\"text\":\"Biodiesel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:biodiesel_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", with nitrate dust in its catalyst slot.\"}]",
    "",
    "The catalyst isn't used up.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It only goes in by hand.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.7A6E9F348C98352E.title": "Form the Diesel Generator",
  "quest.6501E1AE152E3230.title": "Diesel power",
  "quest.6501E1AE152E3230.quest_subtitle": "Loud, thirsty, worth it.",
  "quest.6501E1AE152E3230.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The yard finally makes its own power.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"4,096\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t come out of up to three plugs on top.\"}]",
    "",
    "Thirteen heavy engineering blocks, nine radiators, four generator blocks, pipes and scaffolding, hammered on the centre generator.",
    "",
    "Fuel goes in at the bottom corners."
  ],
  "task.356B7280B0D08BA2.title": "Form the Arc Furnace",
  "quest.6E0D8F11804BF736.title": "Lightning in a vat",
  "quest.6E0D8F11804BF736.quest_subtitle": "Three electrodes, one very hot soup.",
  "quest.6E0D8F11804BF736.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It melts twelve inputs at once, and wants a lot of power to do it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"77\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks: reinforced blast bricks, steel blocks and sheetmetal, light and heavy engineering, scaffolding and a cauldron.\"}]",
    "",
    "Hammer the cauldron and load three electrodes.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:immersiveengineering:textures/item/graphite_electrode.png width:32 height:32 align:center}",
    "",
    "Raw ore comes out as an ingot plus a coin-flip for a second.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron with coke dust turns to steel in \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" seconds, ancient debris gives two netherite scrap, and worn tools and armour melt back into metal.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4945A427BDF8D6ED.title": "Look at your Sawmill",
  "quest.43E369905E2BEDE8.title": "The sawmill",
  "quest.43E369905E2BEDE8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Steel ingots and plates make a \"},{\"text\":\"Sawblade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:sawblade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; slot it into the back of the \"},{\"text\":\"Sawmill\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:sawmill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A log comes out as six planks instead of four, stripped first, with \"},{\"text\":\"Sawdust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:dust_wood\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from both steps.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.1B23C76315A9FD01.title": "Look at your Assembler",
  "task.700855EEFB54B6A4.title": "Look at your Automated Workbench",
  "quest.0440A088E121A363.title": "Crafting on autopilot",
  "quest.0440A088E121A363.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Assembler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:assembler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" crafts up to three recipes in a row, using fluid in its tanks in place of buckets.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Automated Engineer's Workbench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:auto_workbench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" builds whatever the blueprint on its drawing table describes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.782CC5CC345F5D8D.title": "The full set",
  "quest.782CC5CC345F5D8D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One mold per shape: the press only makes what you have a mold for.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Rod and wire molds for parts, the casing mold for ammunition, and packing molds that squeeze \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" or \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" items into their block or take them apart again.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1D06185B52FB567C.title": "Double yield",
  "quest.1D06185B52FB567C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One ingot, two wires: the press doubles what the cutters give. A copper ingot makes two casings, and five blaze powder press back into a blaze rod.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2725113511A576AF.title": "Plate order",
  "quest.2725113511A576AF.quest_subtitle": "Thirty-two, flat, by tomorrow.",
  "quest.2725113511A576AF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Thirty-two \"},{\"text\":\"Steel Plates\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:plate_steel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "A press fed by an improved blast furnace does it in its sleep."
  ],
  "quest.3D1E732607196861.title": "What the drums give",
  "quest.3D1E732607196861.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Raw ore gives one grit and a one-in-three chance of a second; an ore block gives two. Blaze rods give four powder, sandstone two sand, each with a chance of sulfur or nitrate. Anything alive that falls in comes out as drops.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.172892216EF58D9A.title": "Nitrate and sulfur",
  "quest.172892216EF58D9A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Crushed sandstone yields \"},{\"text\":\"Nitrate Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:dust_saltpeter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; blaze rods and nether quartz ore yield \"},{\"text\":\"Sulfur Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:dust_sulfur\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Four nitrate, a sulfur and a charcoal make six gunpowder, and nitrate is the refinery's catalyst for biodiesel."
  ],
  "quest.5CE2B7571BAB2E86.title": "The revolver",
  "quest.5CE2B7571BAB2E86.quest_subtitle": "Six chambers, zero patience.",
  "quest.5CE2B7571BAB2E86.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A barrel, a drum and a hammer, all steel, plus a steel component and a wooden grip.\"}]",
    "",
    "Sneak and right-click it to load cartridges. Shots are loud and draw every monster around."
  ],
  "quest.5951B8F9104EA76D.title": "Ammunition",
  "quest.5951B8F9104EA76D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An empty casing between two gunpowder, over blue dye and paper, draws the Common Projectiles blueprint.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:bullet_casull\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"At the workbench, four casings, gunpowder and a lead nugget make four \"},{\"text\":\"Casull Cartridges\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:bullet_casull\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Armour-piercing, buckshot and silver come from the same sheet.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3C25F55EE244428C.title": "Special rounds",
  "quest.3C25F55EE244428C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"This blueprint can't be drawn: buy it or find it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Buy it from a Gunsmith, or find it in the chest of a village engineer's house.",
    "",
    "The Specialized Projectiles blueprint makes explosive, dragon's breath, phial, flare, homing and wolfpack rounds."
  ],
  "task.090E6C67BFE7C811.title": "Max out the revolver",
  "quest.57B46BCE27C06DC1.title": "Fully loaded",
  "quest.57B46BCE27C06DC1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four upgrades, all fitted at the workbench.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Extended Magazine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:toolupgrade_revolver_magazine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": six more shots\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Bayonet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:toolupgrade_revolver_bayonet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": hits like an iron sword\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Precision Scope\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:toolupgrade_railgun_scope\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Amplifier Electron Tubes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:toolupgrade_revolver_electro\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": stun\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With the scope fitted, the Zoom with the Railgun control zooms in and the scroll wheel changes magnification.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.6E8A0CC77A1B4F9A.title": "Win with IE weaponry",
  "quest.7D6F6723556B5F30.title": "Raider trouble",
  "quest.7D6F6723556B5F30.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Kill any raider with a revolver, a railgun or a chemical thrower.\"}]",
    "",
    "From then on, raids near you bring IE's own illagers:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Fusiliers\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Commandos\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Shield-bearing Bulwarks\"}]"
  ],
  "task.296471BA3A54575F.title": "Fusilier",
  "task.3C6E074F3FD59ECD.title": "Commando",
  "task.55A7879F708E073E.title": "Bulwark",
  "quest.3F21F895C99EAD02.title": "The engineers' raid",
  "quest.3F21F895C99EAD02.quest_subtitle": "They brought guns this time.",
  "quest.3F21F895C99EAD02.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Beat one of each of the engineers' illagers.\"}]",
    "",
    "In your raids, pillagers may arrive as Fusiliers, and vindicators, evokers or ravagers as Commandos and Bulwarks.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Commandos drop revolver parts.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Bulwarks, a masterwork shader bag.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4E45AD00A84E6B1C.title": "Look at your Resonanz Observer",
  "quest.380FEF14E73C35D3.title": "Resonanz",
  "quest.380FEF14E73C35D3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A block that keeps machines running while you're away.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An echo shard, lead sheetmetal and advanced components make four \"},{\"text\":\"Resonanz Engineering Blocks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:resonanz_engineering\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", tuned to a \"},{\"text\":\"resonanz\",\"color\":\"#B98CFF\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"},{\"text\":\" few can hear.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two of them, a calibrated sculk sensor, concrete, steel and windows form the \"},{\"text\":\"Resonanz Observer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:chunk_loader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it keeps machines within \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" blocks running, on one paper a minute.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.2698D78115A111C6.title": "Enter trial chambers",
  "quest.3099BF36415B914B.title": "A faded blueprint",
  "quest.3099BF36415B914B.quest_subtitle": "Good boy. Needs oiling.",
  "quest.3099BF36415B914B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A blueprint worth the trip to the trial chambers.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Trial chamber vaults sometimes hold a worn blueprint for an \"},{\"text\":\"Automaton Wolf\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:robot_wolf\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a thermoelectric heart, a steel body, loyal like a tamed wolf.\"}]",
    "",
    "Mend it with the hammer and a metal plate in your other hand."
  ],
  "quest.2071EFCBCCBB474B.title": "Plastic",
  "quest.2071EFCBCCBB474B.quest_subtitle": "Old-school plastic.",
  "quest.2071EFCBCCBB474B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Crops become resin, and resin becomes plastic sheets.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Ethanol over a \"},{\"text\":\"Silver Plate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:plate_silver\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" catalyst becomes acetaldehyde.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"12\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" mB of it with \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" of creosote make \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" of \"},{\"text\":\"Phenolic Resin\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:phenolic_resin_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A bottling machine with a plate mold sets \"},{\"text\":\"250\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" mB into a \"},{\"text\":\"Duroplast Sheet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:plate_duroplast\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.695821508B3DA564.title": "Vacuum tubes",
  "quest.695821508B3DA564.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The components blueprint turns glass, a nickel plate, copper wire and redstone into three \"},{\"text\":\"Vacuum Tubes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:electron_tube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two tubes, a duroplast sheet and aluminium wire make an \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Electronic Component\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:component_electronic_adv\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": railguns, turrets and Tesla coils need it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.46D15DE718E10F0C.title": "Skyhook, upgraded",
  "quest.46D15DE718E10F0C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The zip-line, with three add-ons.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"High Torque Motor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:toolupgrade_skyhook_slope\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" climbs slopes.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The duroplast \"},{\"text\":\"Insulated Grip\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:toolupgrade_skyhook_insulation\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stops wire shocks.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Netherite \"},{\"text\":\"Heavy Impact Hooks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:toolupgrade_skyhook_mace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hit hard on the way down and spare you the landing.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.39D20DD3B06FED6F.title": "The big battery",
  "quest.39D20DD3B06FED6F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four times the MV accumulator.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Aluminium, a \"},{\"text\":\"HOP Graphite Plate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:plate_hop_graphite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from the bottling machine and redstone acid on a basic engineering block: the \"},{\"text\":\"HV Accumulator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:capacitor_hv\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds \"},{\"text\":\"4,000,000\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE at \"},{\"text\":\"4,096\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.2227F72B1703B973.title": "Look at your Lightning Rod",
  "quest.078D6FF6DB4FA984.title": "Catching lightning",
  "quest.078D6FF6DB4FA984.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Catch a storm and keep it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight copper coil blocks, three HV coils, four HV accumulators, light engineering, scaffolding and fences form the \"},{\"text\":\"Lightning Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:lightning_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Stack steel fences on its top port to draw strikes in storms.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Each strike stores \"},{\"text\":\"16,000,000\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1062CC04AB8C6D5C.title": "The railgun",
  "quest.1062CC04AB8C6D5C.quest_subtitle": "Physics, aimed.",
  "quest.1062CC04AB8C6D5C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An HV accumulator, an advanced electronic component, two electrum coil blocks, steel and a grip.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hold use until the charge reads \"},{\"text\":\"99\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", then let go. It drinks power: wear an accumulator backpack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5811BB927D8691B5.title": "Anything rod-shaped",
  "quest.5811BB927D8691B5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Iron, steel or aluminium rods, graphite electrodes, blaze rods that set fire, end and breeze rods, ender pearls for range, sawblades that pierce, even tridents. Sneak and scroll to switch.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.559C604B72FCCA50.title": "Saw through",
  "quest.559C604B72FCCA50.quest_subtitle": "We don't go to that town anymore.",
  "quest.559C604B72FCCA50.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A sawblade from the railgun went through several creatures in one shot.\"}]",
    "",
    "Physics is a tool like any other."
  ],
  "reward.4EF3504E449A7823.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.70D76C7EAD6257AD.title": "Power on your back",
  "quest.70D76C7EAD6257AD.quest_subtitle": "Don't cross the streams.",
  "quest.70D76C7EAD6257AD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Worn, it charges the tools in your hands and your armour.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Leather, steel and treated rods, LV connectors and insulated coils make the frame.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The workbench puts an accumulator inside.\"}]",
    "",
    "Its top mount takes one thing: an antenna or a Tesla coil."
  ],
  "quest.55B3037BF1FF1879.title": "Charging antenna",
  "quest.55B3037BF1FF1879.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Aluminium wire and rod on an LV connector.\"}]",
    "",
    "Walk under a bare power line and the antenna reaches up to it, trickle-charging the pack while you stay close."
  ],
  "quest.4CE4B3BFCDB1720F.title": "Shock armour",
  "quest.4CE4B3BFCDB1720F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Aluminium plates, electrum coils, a treated fence and an advanced component.\"}]",
    "",
    "When something hits you, the miniature coil shocks it back: thorns, the electric kind."
  ],
  "quest.3AED671BFBCD69BA.title": "Top up",
  "quest.3AED671BFBCD69BA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Treated wood, glass, iron, vacuum tubes and a copper coil block make the \"},{\"text\":\"Charging Station\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:charging_station\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Drop in anything that holds FE.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The tubes on its front show the charge, and a comparator reads it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.441C6D618499857B.title": "Home defence",
  "quest.441C6D618499857B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Tesla Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:tesla_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shocks and stuns anything within about six blocks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It draws \"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t idle and \"},{\"text\":\"512\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" per zap, and only runs on a redstone signal.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A suit of aluminium \"},{\"text\":\"Faraday armour\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:armor_faraday_chestplate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shrugs off low-power coils and bare wires.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.582F651D8AB760FC.title": "Mind the electrodes",
  "quest.582F651D8AB760FC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Electrodes wear one point per tick of work: \"},{\"text\":\"96,000 ticks\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\", about four in-game days nonstop. A comparator on the electrodes reads the most worn one, and replacing them is always by hand.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.195DEC4C7A55C77A.title": "Scribbled on the drawing",
  "quest.195DEC4C7A55C77A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every machine on this sheet eats something: coal, seeds, electrodes. The one they asked me for would have eaten the light itself. —T.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "quest.463BE2CA18938AF2.title": "Fuel on the go",
  "quest.463BE2CA18938AF2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" buckets of fuel, in one hand.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four iron plates around four buckets make a \"},{\"text\":\"Jerrycan\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:jerrycan\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": refilled at barrels and tanks, poured into machines.\"}]",
    "",
    "Craft it together with the drill and the drill fills up."
  ],
  "task.1F1A36314111F334.title": "Form the Mixer",
  "quest.50DF0712E9C6C2C9.title": "The mixer",
  "quest.50DF0712E9C6C2C9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It dissolves solids in fluids.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Two sand, gravel and clay in half a bucket of water make liquid \"},{\"text\":\"Concrete\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:concrete_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"One redstone makes \"},{\"text\":\"250\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" mB of redstone acid.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Brewing ingredients make potions by the bucket.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.52DF8B27D6BD089C.title": "High-cetane",
  "quest.52DF8B27D6BD089C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The same fuel with a little strength potion, and the engine runs longer.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The refinery blends \"},{\"text\":\"95\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" mB of biodiesel with \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" of Strength potion from the mixer into \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" of \"},{\"text\":\"High-Cetane Biodiesel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:high_power_biodiesel_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which runs the generator \"},{\"text\":\"10%\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" longer per bucket.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.486DE6FB2C82B679.title": "Cement shoes",
  "quest.486DE6FB2C82B679.quest_subtitle": "The mob sends its regards.",
  "quest.486DE6FB2C82B679.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You stood in wet concrete until it set.\"}]",
    "",
    "The good news: you're very stable now."
  ],
  "reward.18149815B0E1EF1B.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.6AD41D4C61AA8407.title": "Feeding the engine",
  "quest.6AD41D4C61AA8407.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"At full load it drinks \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" mB a tick: a bucket of biodiesel lasts \"},{\"text\":\"12.5\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" seconds, about a million FE. Creosote burns too, one second a bucket. Plan the farms before the engine.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4D458F0ED49A8098.title": "Spray it",
  "quest.4D458F0ED49A8098.quest_subtitle": "Now with a pilot light.",
  "quest.4D458F0ED49A8098.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A pressurized air tank, a heavy engineering block, a pipe, a bucket and two grips make the \"},{\"text\":\"Chemical Thrower\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:chemthrower\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It sprays whatever fluid it holds, and sneak-right-click lights a pilot flame for the flammable ones.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Herbicide strips plants.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Liquid concrete sets into walls.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.25698021BBCCD892.title": "The mining drill",
  "quest.25698021BBCCD892.quest_subtitle": "Diesel-powered tunnel vision.",
  "quest.25698021BBCCD892.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A heavy engineering block, an iron component and two grips make the \"},{\"text\":\"Mining Drill\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:drill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fit a \"},{\"text\":\"Steel Drill Head\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:drillhead_steel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at the workbench and fill it with biodiesel: it digs an area, or one block while sneaking.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.6C88B5AFAD518936.title": "Max out the drill",
  "quest.6D8FF2DBBCAE7B7A.title": "Drill, maxed",
  "quest.6D8FF2DBBCAE7B7A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every slot of the drill takes an upgrade: fill them all.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Up to three \"},{\"text\":\"Additional Augers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:toolupgrade_drill_damage\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": speed and damage\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A lubrication system\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Pressurized Air Tank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:toolupgrade_drill_waterproof\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": dig underwater\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"A large fuel tank\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Rock Softening Acid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:toolupgrade_drill_fortune\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": works like Fortune\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.329172156ECD78B9.title": "Giga drill",
  "quest.329172156ECD78B9.quest_subtitle": "It was meant for rocks.",
  "quest.329172156ECD78B9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You finished off a creature with the mining drill.\"}]",
    "",
    "Technically, it dug."
  ],
  "reward.4B66BC34F32A09F4.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.26B6B5418935FC75.title": "Clear-cutting",
  "quest.26B6B5418935FC75.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One tool for wood, another blade for stone.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Steel rods, a heavy engineering block and two grips make the \"},{\"text\":\"Buzzsaw\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:buzzsaw\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"With a sawblade and biodiesel it fells whole trees.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Swap in a \"},{\"text\":\"Rockcutter Blade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:rockcutter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to cut stone out whole, like Silk Touch.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.38A0FCCAF463848A.title": "Coloured signals",
  "quest.38A0FCCAF463848A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Aluminium wire and redstone make \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Wire Coils\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:wirecoil_redstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": signals travel far without fading.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Wire Connector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:connector_redstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sends or receives on one of \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" colours, set with the screwdriver.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1B4427D5BA855D22.title": "Logic on a board",
  "quest.1B4427D5BA855D22.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Solder it, plug it in, and the machine follows your rules.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Engineer's Circuit Workbench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:circuit_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" solders vacuum tubes onto backplanes as \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Circuits\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:logic_circuit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Unit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:logic_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs up to ten of them with eight registers, through a redstone interface connector.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1FA286CF79856C67.title": "Ask the machine",
  "quest.1FA286CF79856C67.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Turn a machine's mood into a coloured signal.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On a multiblock's redstone panel, the \"},{\"text\":\"Machine Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:machine_interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns conditions into coloured signals: machine active, input empty, tank \"},{\"text\":\"75%\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" full.\"}]",
    "",
    "It can send a signal back to switch the machine, too."
  ],
  "quest.2ADA08C03E175F63.title": "Prospecting",
  "quest.2ADA08C03E175F63.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tools that find what's under your feet.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A writable book, a glass bottle, three tough fabric and an engineer's hammer, which the kit keeps, make \"},{\"text\":\"Mineral Survey Tools\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:survey_tools\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"Used on natural stone or dirt, they point toward nearby mineral veins.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\"More samples, better aim.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.34359A8FE21A59AD.title": "Core samples",
  "quest.34359A8FE21A59AD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Steel scaffolding and fences on light engineering make the \"},{\"text\":\"Core Sample Drill\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:sample_drill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Start it by hand, feed it \"},{\"text\":\"40\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t and pull out a \"},{\"text\":\"Core Sample\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:coresample\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the vein's ores, its saturation and its expected yield.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.53428CBCBCEF2B86.title": "Buy a mineral map",
  "quest.0A6BD6E87C7C7C0A.title": "X marks the vein",
  "quest.0A6BD6E87C7C7C0A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An experienced Structural Engineer sells a \"},{\"text\":\"Mineral Deposit Map\",\"color\":\"#D8C8FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":\"A filled map, marked where a mineral vein lies.\"}},{\"text\":\": the shortcut to a vein, no surveying needed.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.48681408852115BD.title": "Form the Excavator",
  "quest.08C2E03CEB20E7E6.title": "The excavator",
  "quest.08C2E03CEB20E7E6.quest_subtitle": "Dig once, keep digging.",
  "quest.08C2E03CEB20E7E6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It brings up ores that no pickaxe will find.\"}]",
    "",
    "A steel bucket wheel on a sheetmetal engine: hammer the engine's rear heavy engineering block and both form.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Set it over a vein and it runs for \"},{\"text\":\"4,096\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" FE/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2EB4987343115C79.title": "Reading a vein",
  "quest.2EB4987343115C79.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A vein yields at most \"},{\"text\":\"38,400\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" ores and may start up to \"},{\"text\":\"20%\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"},{\"text\":\" spent. Dig near its centre: far from it, more of each bucket is plain rock. The Nether has veins too, ancient debris among them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.484B4D6DA30FA3DF.title": "Sound the shift bell",
  "quest.484B4D6DA30FA3DF.quest_subtitle": "Clocking off.",
  "quest.484B4D6DA30FA3DF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A yard this size needs a bell.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: the stacks smoke and every lamp glows."
  ],
  "image.492D3A86C25A816B.title": "Back to the Workshop",
  "image.027B7237F64A984F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"IMMERSIVE ENGINEERING\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.5308B29035B3CFE8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Industry\",\"color\":\"#F2C14E\"}]",
  "image.6F9085A522C8C0D9.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Workshop\",\"color\":\"#9DBAE0\"}]",
  "image.3FBC2D5B3229E8C3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Industry · sheet 2 of 2 · drawn: T.\",\"color\":\"#B6A67C\"}]",
  "image.08F9F4C73A289177.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"engine\",\"color\":\"#BAC6D2\"}]",
  "image.7300AE0379B80CAE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Press and crusher\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.4ECE60BA0AD01174.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sidearms\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.3FBFCCA6034BDFA6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Weird science\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.6BDB126436ADDC43.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Plastic and batteries\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.76A0A20EF5E81580.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"High-voltage gear\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.6E91B6A23794199D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fuel\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.0762692ACDE6D5F9.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Diesel tools\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.007B43C1B572CC97.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Control\",\"color\":\"#E8DCB5\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "chapter.47025B66BFCD747F.title": "Integrated Dynamics and Tunnels",
  "chapter.47025B66BFCD747F.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Menril, cables and variable cards; readers, operators and writers; Tunnels to move items, fluids and energy by rule."
  ],
  "quest.50FB10FD2141D419.title": "Menril Logs",
  "quest.50FB10FD2141D419.quest_subtitle": "Wood with a head for numbers.",
  "quest.50FB10FD2141D419.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Look for tall blue trees with glowing leaves: rare in the wild, about one chunk in a hundred, thick in the Meneglin forest. One wild log in eleven is Enriched: chopped without Silk Touch, it also drops one or two \"},{\"text\":\"Crystallized Menril Chunks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:crystalized_menril_chunk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5EBF371ED9BA295D.title": "Squeeze and dry",
  "quest.5EBF371ED9BA295D.quest_subtitle": "Jumping counts as work here.",
  "quest.5EBF371ED9BA295D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Put a \"},{\"text\":\"Menril Log\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:menril_log\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the \"},{\"text\":\"Squeezer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:squeezer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and jump on it until it's flat. The resin runs into a \"},{\"text\":\"Drying Basin\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:drying_basin\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on one of its two sides; a redstone pulse lifts the press for the next log.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Any mob that falls on it presses too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3B0829A194600C5D.title": "Crystallized Menril",
  "quest.3B0829A194600C5D.quest_subtitle": "Every network starts as sap.",
  "quest.3B0829A194600C5D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A log gives 1000 mB of resin, and the basin dries it into a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Crystallized Menril\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:crystalized_menril_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in seven and a half seconds. A crafting grid breaks the block into nine chunks: cables, cards and every part are made of them.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Keep lava away: hot fluids set the basin on fire.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Spare blocks go to the stonecutter as bricks, slabs and stairs; menril logs smelt into charcoal.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.50DB3E215BD52AB5.title": "Logic Cable",
  "quest.50DB3E215BD52AB5.quest_subtitle": "Ten in a row and it's a network.",
  "quest.50DB3E215BD52AB5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six chunks, two sticks and a redstone dust make three \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Cables\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:cable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Everything joined by cable is one network, and parts go on any of a cable's six faces.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.21E4444D757181F1.title": "Variable Cards",
  "quest.21E4444D757181F1.quest_subtitle": "Twenty-four per sheet of paper.",
  "quest.21E4444D757181F1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight chunks around a paper make 24 \"},{\"text\":\"Variable Cards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:variable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". A card doesn't carry a value, only where to find it: a reader, a constant, an operator.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Crafted alone, a card is wiped clean; crafted with a blank one, it's copied.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.42729099F3D782C7.title": "Variable Transformers",
  "quest.42729099F3D782C7.quest_subtitle": "Sticky goes in, plain goes out.",
  "quest.42729099F3D782C7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two cards, two chunks and a \"},{\"text\":\"Sticky Piston\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sticky_piston\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make four \"},{\"text\":\"Input Transformers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:variable_transformer_input\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; a plain \"},{\"text\":\"Piston\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:piston\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes four \"},{\"text\":\"Output Transformers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:variable_transformer_output\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Readers are built on the first kind, writers and panels on the second.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.50B0C40DB79A352B.title": "Bind the Redstone aspect to a card",
  "quest.1F508FE56FB71B63.title": "Redstone Reader",
  "quest.1F508FE56FB71B63.quest_subtitle": "The network's first sense.",
  "quest.1F508FE56FB71B63.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Put the reader on a cable facing a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Torch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone_torch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", open it and drop a blank card into its \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" aspect. From then on that card carries the torch's signal anywhere on the network: every reader works like this, one aspect per thing it can read.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4ED59F722EEF5416.title": "Show the Redstone card",
  "quest.792F317751A49E5C.title": "Display Panel",
  "quest.792F317751A49E5C.quest_subtitle": "Show your work.",
  "quest.792F317751A49E5C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Static Light Panels\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_static_light_panel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two menril berries and an Output Transformer. Give it the Redstone card and it shows the value live; the wrench turns it to face you.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A program acting up? Put its cards on panels one by one until one shows the wrong value.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.208A495D4205F1BE.title": "Pass a full signal from reader to writer",
  "quest.4FF178E723970DA5.title": "Redstone Writer",
  "quest.4FF178E723970DA5.quest_subtitle": "A wire you never have to lay.",
  "quest.4FF178E723970DA5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The reader's recipe with an Output Transformer. Give the reader's card to the writer's \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" aspect and it emits that exact level, as far away as the network reaches.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Pulse\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" aspect fires one pulse each time the value changes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5D3AA7B4C9C56A9A.title": "Logic Programmer",
  "quest.5D3AA7B4C9C56A9A.quest_subtitle": "Every operator in one box.",
  "quest.5D3AA7B4C9C56A9A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Crystallized Menril\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:crystalized_menril_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:crafting_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Pick a value type or an operator on the left, fill its inputs with cards and write the result to a blank card: that's how every program here is built.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Crafted alone it becomes the \"},{\"text\":\"Portable Logic Programmer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:portable_logic_programmer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and back.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4AFF0C13E3B6CF5A.title": "Write an Integer constant",
  "quest.6B0B0F7665336FC3.title": "A constant",
  "quest.6B0B0F7665336FC3.quest_subtitle": "Numbers that stay put.",
  "quest.6B0B0F7665336FC3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Type \"},{\"text\":\"Integer\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" in the search box, enter a number and write it to a blank card. That's a static card: its value never changes until you put it back in the programmer and rewrite it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0B51F559EA8EC9E2.title": "Variable Store",
  "quest.0B51F559EA8EC9E2.quest_subtitle": "Lazy by design.",
  "quest.0B51F559EA8EC9E2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The network works a card out only when something asks for its value, so every card another card refers to must be within reach. Keep them in a \"},{\"text\":\"Variable Store\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:variablestore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the same network; use as many stores as you like.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.317E4FD97748B27B.title": "Show a sum on a panel",
  "quest.50F9B3052DA1FAC0.title": "Addition",
  "quest.50F9B3052DA1FAC0.quest_subtitle": "Two plus two, the long way round.",
  "quest.50F9B3052DA1FAC0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Make two Integer cards, pick \"},{\"text\":\"Addition\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\", drop them into its inputs and a blank card into the output. Keep the two inputs in the store and put the result on a Display Panel.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.0AC3F0F4ED5E9DF2.title": "Add by applying twice",
  "task.750C8E0231641E3B.title": "Filter the list down to 10",
  "quest.281FE73BA5B9CBA6.title": "Operators are values",
  "quest.281FE73BA5B9CBA6.quest_subtitle": "Currying, no curry involved.",
  "quest.281FE73BA5B9CBA6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Write \"},{\"text\":\"Addition\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" itself to a card and \"},{\"text\":\"Apply\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" an Integer to it: you get an operator that adds that number to whatever comes next. Then \"},{\"text\":\"Filter\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" a list of 1, 10 and 100 with \"},{\"text\":\"Equals\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" applied to 10.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.00F8B0A1AF2F1CB3.title": "Write a proxied card",
  "quest.526072E0FEE47C21.title": "Proxy",
  "quest.526072E0FEE47C21.quest_subtitle": "Change one card, change the whole program.",
  "quest.526072E0FEE47C21.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Put a card in the \"},{\"text\":\"Proxy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:proxy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and it writes new cards that follow whatever sits in its slot. Build programs on the proxied card and swap the one inside to change a value everywhere, without rewriting a thing; that inner card has to stay put.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.606AF8D639EF0FED.title": "Item Interface",
  "quest.606AF8D639EF0FED.quest_subtitle": "Every chest becomes shared storage.",
  "quest.606AF8D639EF0FED.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five chunks and a chest make four \"},{\"text\":\"Item Interfaces\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integratedtunnels:part_interface_item\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". On a cable, an interface opens the inventory it faces to the whole network: importers put things there and exporters take them from there.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With several interfaces, their priority in the part settings decides which fills first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7F1E6CAD83572C63.title": "Importers and Exporters",
  "quest.7F1E6CAD83572C63.quest_subtitle": "Blue pulls, orange pushes.",
  "quest.7F1E6CAD83572C63.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An interface and an Input Transformer make an \"},{\"text\":\"Item Importer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integratedtunnels:part_importer_item\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which pulls from what it faces into the interfaces; with an Output Transformer, an \"},{\"text\":\"Item Exporter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integratedtunnels:part_exporter_item\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which pushes back out. A card in their aspects decides what moves.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.0DD388C72A270D94.title": "Import everything",
  "task.55B1E0687C7A3743.title": "Import a list",
  "task.59C0FC06AF23C8D6.title": "Export what can be enchanted",
  "quest.7B4C878F7B069A8F.title": "Rules of the tunnel",
  "quest.7B4C878F7B069A8F.quest_subtitle": "Everything, a list, or a question.",
  "quest.7B4C878F7B069A8F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Boolean card set to true in \"},{\"text\":\"Import All Items\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" takes everything; a list from an Inventory Reader in \"},{\"text\":\"Import Items\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" takes exactly that; \"},{\"text\":\"Enchantable\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" in \"},{\"text\":\"Export Items Predicate\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" sends out only what can be enchanted.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An aspect's properties hold the rest: rate, slot, exact amount, Blacklist and Round-Robin.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.5F65FA51A6AAC2D7.title": "A door that knows your name",
  "task.73DC6E935571C54C.title": "Stop at ten",
  "quest.14EEA85DB5C4A668.title": "A network that decides",
  "quest.14EEA85DB5C4A668.quest_subtitle": "Not a speck of redstone dust.",
  "quest.14EEA85DB5C4A668.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two decisions, no hands. A door that opens only for your name: an Entity Reader, \"},{\"text\":\"To String\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Equals\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" with the name first, and a Redstone Writer on the door. And an exporter that stops once the chest holds ten: \"},{\"text\":\"Less Than\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" on an Inventory Reader's count.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Atlas asks for the same trick in \"},{\"text\":\"Stop before overflow\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"758AAF75374D9805\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.650AA067A0C9F9C7.title": "Walk into a Meneglin",
  "quest.0A6ADB1D1AAB5785.title": "Meneglin",
  "quest.0A6ADB1D1AAB5785.quest_subtitle": "A forest that went blue on purpose.",
  "quest.0A6ADB1D1AAB5785.quest_desc": [
    "The resin the trees give off turns this forest blue: one or two menril trees per chunk over blue orchids and white flowers. It takes the place of some forests in the Overworld."
  ],
  "quest.06E82664F98B587E.title": "A grove at home",
  "quest.06E82664F98B587E.quest_subtitle": "Snack, lamp and circuit board.",
  "quest.06E82664F98B587E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Menril leaves drop a sapling one time in forty and berries about one in seven, Fortune helping both. Plant the saplings near the base; the berries go into every panel, and a berry on a stick makes four \"},{\"text\":\"Menril Torches\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:menril_torch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Menril without an axe: a sapling in a Botany Pot yields one to four logs a harvest, three \"},{\"text\":\"Menril Essence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:menril_essence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make sixteen logs, and the Menril Bee's combs spin into resin and chunks (\"},{\"text\":\"Productive Bees\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2911A848841CBA61\"}},{\"text\":\").\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0A65CC3994122798.title": "The Squeezer crushes too",
  "quest.0A65CC3994122798.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Jump on an ore block: iron ore gives two raw iron and, three times in four, a third. Wool gives string, bones white dye, flowers their dye and ice 1000 mB of water.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.405EB0F2C544D3D5.title": "The book pays",
  "quest.405EB0F2C544D3D5.quest_subtitle": "Homework with a bonus.",
  "quest.405EB0F2C544D3D5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A book and two chunks make \"},{\"text\":\"On the Dynamics of Integration\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:on_the_dynamics_of_integration\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": tutorials, a manual of every part, and a reward for each tutorial you finish. The first one alone pays 64 menril logs and 10 blocks of crystallized menril.\"}]",
    "",
    "In this pack it isn't handed out on arrival: craft it."
  ],
  "quest.703F9772D06E2D30.title": "Inventory Sensor",
  "quest.703F9772D06E2D30.quest_subtitle": "Menril goes to the Atlas.",
  "quest.703F9772D06E2D30.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two crystallized menril chunks, two LaserIO \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Chips\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"laserio:logic_chip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Routing Matrix\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:routing_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory Sensor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:inventory_sensor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" that \"},{\"text\":\"When the Shelf is Full\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"27A67154B0D96862\"}},{\"text\":\" asks for in act III, and the Ark's bus again in act V.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4DF9DF457E6F3578.title": "Chunks for the road",
  "quest.4DF9DF457E6F3578.quest_subtitle": "The network's small change.",
  "quest.4DF9DF457E6F3578.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sixty-four \"},{\"text\":\"Crystallized Menril Chunks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:crystalized_menril_chunk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day. A Mechanical Squeezer pays it without a single jump.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.355F05E7E779D518.title": "Batteries and a generator",
  "quest.355F05E7E779D518.quest_subtitle": "Cables run free; machines don't.",
  "quest.355F05E7E779D518.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Networks here run without power; batteries are for the mechanical machines and for moving FE through Tunnels. An \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Battery\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:energy_battery\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds a million FE, and batteries crafted together add up. A battery and a furnace make a \"},{\"text\":\"Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:coal_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": 20 FE per tick.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sneak-right-click with a battery in hand to toggle auto-supply: it charges whatever you're holding.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3CC2D73E620A4BF9.title": "No more jumping",
  "quest.3CC2D73E620A4BF9.quest_subtitle": "Your knees will thank you.",
  "quest.3CC2D73E620A4BF9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Both run on 80 FE per tick. The \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Squeezer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:mechanical_squeezer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns a log into 1000 mB of resin plus two to four chunks in under a second, and an iron ore into three to five raw iron; the \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Drying Basin\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:mechanical_drying_basin\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" dries ten times faster.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.135F1ACE22AEDB23.title": "Wrench",
  "quest.135F1ACE22AEDB23.quest_subtitle": "Parts come off clean.",
  "quest.135F1ACE22AEDB23.quest_desc": [
    "Sneak and right-click a cable or part to pick it up; a plain right-click cuts the cable's link to its neighbor, and on a Display Panel it turns the screen. Sneak and right-click the air to switch modes."
  ],
  "quest.52C23D0EFE05DC3C.title": "Facades and offsets",
  "quest.52C23D0EFE05DC3C.quest_subtitle": "Hide the cable, stretch the reach.",
  "quest.52C23D0EFE05DC3C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A chunk and four slimeballs make 32 \"},{\"text\":\"Facades\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:facade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; crafted with any block, a facade wears its look and hides a cable. Right-click a part with an \"},{\"text\":\"Offset Enhancement\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:enhancement_offset\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and it reaches 4 blocks further, up to 32; aim it in its Offset screen or with the wrench's offset mode.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6941BE0EFBB3E988.title": "Mono-Directional Connector",
  "quest.6941BE0EFBB3E988.quest_subtitle": "A cable made of line of sight.",
  "quest.6941BE0EFBB3E988.quest_desc": [
    "Two of them in a straight line, up to 512 blocks apart, join their networks with no cable in between. They light up once the link holds."
  ],
  "quest.47BE4CD0448F189F.title": "Part settings",
  "quest.47BE4CD0448F189F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The button at the top left of a part's screen opens its settings: \"},{\"text\":\"Ticks/Operation\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" to run it less often, \"},{\"text\":\"Priority\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" to order parts within a tick, and \"},{\"text\":\"Target Side\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" to pick which face of the block it works on.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1870FB7DC1253B21.title": "Network diagnostics",
  "quest.1870FB7DC1253B21.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lag from a network? A server operator can run /integrateddynamics networkdiagnostics: it opens a web page with each network's tick time, a highlight in the world and a button to teleport there.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.62212761D66CEE3C.title": "What's inside",
  "quest.62212761D66CEE3C.quest_subtitle": "Count before you move.",
  "quest.62212761D66CEE3C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory Reader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_inventory_reader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" counts items, slots and fill ratio; the \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Reader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_fluid_reader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" measures tanks; the \"},{\"text\":\"Machine Reader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_machine_reader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" knows whether a machine is working, its stored FE and the recipes it runs.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.37B0C25B6729D929.title": "What's out there",
  "quest.37B0C25B6729D929.quest_subtitle": "Four more eyes.",
  "quest.37B0C25B6729D929.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Block Reader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_block_reader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" names the block in front of it, the \"},{\"text\":\"Entity Reader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_entity_reader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sees who stands there, the \"},{\"text\":\"World Reader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_world_reader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" knows day from night, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Extra-Dimensional Reader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_extradimensional_reader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reads the server: players, TPS, even a random number.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1F17AD2148ECAFB1.title": "Dynamic Light Panel",
  "quest.1F17AD2148ECAFB1.quest_subtitle": "Mood lighting, by the numbers.",
  "quest.1F17AD2148ECAFB1.quest_desc": [
    "Four redstone dust around a Static Light Panel. A Boolean card switches it on and off; an Integer card sets its brightness: a lamp that tells you how full the tank is."
  ],
  "quest.3DCEC9F743591CD9.title": "Sound and sparks",
  "quest.3DCEC9F743591CD9.quest_subtitle": "Your base, now with a voice.",
  "quest.3DCEC9F743591CD9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Audio Writer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_audio_writer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" plays any note of any instrument, any sound by name, and reads text aloud; the \"},{\"text\":\"Audio Reader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_audio_reader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hears note blocks nearby. The \"},{\"text\":\"Effect Writer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_effect_writer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" throws particles on cue.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.202501665D81F47B.title": "Writers with nothing to say",
  "quest.202501665D81F47B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Entity Writer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_entity_writer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Machine Writer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_machine_writer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" have no aspects in this pack, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory Writer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_inventory_writer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" only gets some on a Refined Storage network. The tooltip warns you before you spend the materials.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1F1E836B88767D8B.title": "Autocrafting on command",
  "quest.1F1E836B88767D8B.quest_subtitle": "Refined Storage takes orders.",
  "quest.1F1E836B88767D8B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Aimed at a block of a \"},{\"text\":\"Refined Storage\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"09DFA10FF144C082\"}},{\"text\":\" network, an Inventory Writer's \"},{\"text\":\"RS craft item\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" aspect starts a crafting job for an Item card; its properties set how many and whether to skip what's already stored. An Inventory Reader there lists every stored and craftable item.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.6B08B562E0F89962.title": "Play a wet sponge's step",
  "quest.1097BFC3E34EEB17.title": "Wet footsteps",
  "quest.1097BFC3E34EEB17.quest_subtitle": "Squish.",
  "quest.1097BFC3E34EEB17.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Audio Writer fed the \"},{\"text\":\"Block Step Sound\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" of a Wet Sponge: the network just learned to squelch.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.2F80DF81C8F57A77.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.6F914BAD51E8EE43.title": "Value types",
  "quest.6F914BAD51E8EE43.quest_desc": [
    "Every card has a type: Boolean, Integer, Long, Double, String, List, Operator, NBT, Block, Item, Entity, Fluid, Ingredients or Recipe. Integers stop just past two billion, Longs go much further, and a list holds a single type."
  ],
  "quest.073EB6EEF8A1B0CC.title": "Labeller",
  "quest.073EB6EEF8A1B0CC.quest_subtitle": "Card 47 is a terrible name.",
  "quest.073EB6EEF8A1B0CC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Errors point at cards by ID number; a \"},{\"text\":\"Labeller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:labeller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" gives them names you'll recognize. Carry it and the Logic Programmer's E button, or \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.integrateddynamics.logic_programmer_open_rename\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\", names each card as it's written.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7F4419664F1CA29A.title": "Programmer shortcuts",
  "quest.7F4419664F1CA29A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In the Logic Programmer, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.integrateddynamics.logic_programmer_focus_search\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" jumps to the search box, and a card in a bottom-left slot filters the operators to those taking or giving that type.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.292BBEC0B9BFE58E.title": "If, and, or",
  "quest.292BBEC0B9BFE58E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"And\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Or\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Not\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" combine Boolean cards, and \"},{\"text\":\"Choice\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" is the if: a Boolean first, then the value to use when true and the one when false, both of the same type.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.00B0D67187BD7CBD.title": "Materialize a card",
  "quest.61DAEF084346B4B7.title": "Materializer",
  "quest.61DAEF084346B4B7.quest_subtitle": "Freeze the moment.",
  "quest.61DAEF084346B4B7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A dynamic card on top and a blank one in the slot: the \"},{\"text\":\"Materializer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:materializer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" writes the value of that very moment as a static card. Good for logging a reading, or keeping a result once its source is gone.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.007E2BCB837EF531.title": "Delayer",
  "quest.007E2BCB837EF531.quest_subtitle": "The network grows a memory.",
  "quest.007E2BCB837EF531.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Give the \"},{\"text\":\"Delayer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:delay\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" a card and the cards it writes read that value's history as a list, newest last, up to 1024 entries. Averages, differences and trends are one operator away.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.23A7A414F86B3C23.title": "Show the list 1, 10, 100",
  "task.39DE3B4BAA036320.title": "Name an item's mod",
  "task.5499EDB3903532E4.title": "What is it looking at?",
  "quest.769D10DB3610D9AA.title": "Lists, items, eyes",
  "quest.769D10DB3610D9AA.quest_subtitle": "What is it, and whose?",
  "quest.769D10DB3610D9AA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On a Display Panel: a static List of 1, 10 and 100; the mod behind an Item card, through \"},{\"text\":\"Mod\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\"; and, from an Entity Reader, the block its target is looking at, through \"},{\"text\":\"Target Block\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.1334C88F37DDD948.title": "Read the crafting recipes",
  "task.4F5D0D96AD687954.title": "Build a recipe",
  "task.1D34DCF7C5079547.title": "Look up the chest",
  "quest.14CB2BEA95F441FA.title": "Recipes as values",
  "quest.14CB2BEA95F441FA.quest_subtitle": "The crafting table, read aloud.",
  "quest.14CB2BEA95F441FA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Machine Reader on a Crafting Table reads its \"},{\"text\":\"Recipes\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\"; the Logic Programmer builds a Recipe by hand; and \"},{\"text\":\"Apply\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" on the reader's \"},{\"text\":\"Recipe By Output\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\", with Ingredients holding one Chest, shows how a chest is made.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.34CBE36AEFF877E0.title": "Read the lectern",
  "task.72A6553B8F7AD0B2.title": "Open the Book compound",
  "task.7B429106204D2E5B.title": "Find the book's id",
  "quest.110BF9FFB4CD1F26.title": "NBT, the fallback",
  "quest.110BF9FFB4CD1F26.quest_subtitle": "For when no aspect covers it.",
  "quest.110BF9FFB4CD1F26.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Block Reader on a lectern holding a book reads its \"},{\"text\":\"Tile Entity NBT\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\". Take the Book compound from it, then the book's id with the NBT Path \"},{\"text\":\".Book.id\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\": a path reaches deep fields in one step.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.2C7488506C6EA61F.title": "A Creeper's health",
  "task.5C2FF6AE5274F7BD.title": "Stone against obsidian",
  "quest.4F02807EA82A8C59.title": "Challenges",
  "quest.4F02807EA82A8C59.quest_subtitle": "Spoiler: the pickaxe can't.",
  "quest.4F02807EA82A8C59.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The book's challenges come without hints. Show a Creeper's health on a Display Panel, and ask \"},{\"text\":\"Can Harvest\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" whether a Stone Pickaxe can mine Obsidian.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.0A9D57468E2DFA28.title": "Show an infinite list",
  "quest.55949233ABB05C89.title": "Lists all the way down",
  "quest.55949233ABB05C89.quest_subtitle": "It never ends. Literally.",
  "quest.55949233ABB05C89.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Lazy List Builder\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" takes a start value and an operator that turns each element into the next: a list with no end, on a Display Panel.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.2F7869BBE49B5105.title": "Secret found",
  "task.5E1BF3813B4CA159.title": "Open by day only",
  "task.2D87ADE49661DF85.title": "One mod only",
  "quest.257495E598A9C4A2.title": "Filtering Interface",
  "quest.257495E598A9C4A2.quest_subtitle": "Storage with opening hours.",
  "quest.257495E598A9C4A2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two interfaces and a hopper make a \"},{\"text\":\"Filtering Item Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integratedtunnels:part_interface_filter_item\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which decides what the network may see. Bind \"},{\"text\":\"Is Day\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" and the chest vanishes at night; \"},{\"text\":\"Pipe\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Mod\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" into \"},{\"text\":\"Equals\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" applied to IntegratedDynamics and only that mod's items pass.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6AF012B4D6C7F2F3.title": "Fluid tunnels",
  "quest.6AF012B4D6C7F2F3.quest_subtitle": "Same logic, wetter.",
  "quest.6AF012B4D6C7F2F3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five chunks and a bucket make four \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Interfaces\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integratedtunnels:part_interface_fluid\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and the fluid importer and exporter come from them like the item ones. Their aspects take Fluid cards, amounts in mB per tick, lists and predicates.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0DE53C876E314F3A.title": "Network Reader",
  "quest.0DE53C876E314F3A.quest_subtitle": "The network counts itself.",
  "quest.0DE53C876E314F3A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Aimed at any cable of a Tunnels network, the \"},{\"text\":\"Network Reader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:part_network_reader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reads it whole: \"},{\"text\":\"Network Item Count\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\", every stack as a list, and \"},{\"text\":\"Network Count Of Item\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\", an operator that counts one item across every interface.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.061A000C3BD518DE.title": "Energy tunnels",
  "quest.061A000C3BD518DE.quest_subtitle": "Power rides the logic cable.",
  "quest.061A000C3BD518DE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five chunks and an Energy Battery make four \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Interfaces\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integratedtunnels:part_interface_energy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Put an importer on a generator, interfaces on batteries and exporters on machines: FE rides the same cables as your logic.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.54FC4362CD0A37B1.title": "Channels",
  "quest.54FC4362CD0A37B1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two tunnels on one network? Give their interfaces different \"},{\"text\":\"Interface Channel\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" numbers in the part settings and set the matching \"},{\"text\":\"Channel\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" property on each importer or exporter; channel -1 reaches them all.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4F1A09D988FF7591.title": "Crystallized Chorus",
  "quest.4F1A09D988FF7591.quest_subtitle": "The End, squeezed.",
  "quest.4F1A09D988FF7591.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each \"},{\"text\":\"Popped Chorus Fruit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:popped_chorus_fruit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" squeezes into 125 mB of Liquid Chorus, and 1000 mB dry into a block of nine \"},{\"text\":\"Crystallized Chorus Chunks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:crystalized_chorus_chunk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". No End yet? Two menril berries and two ender pearls make a \"},{\"text\":\"Proto Chorus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:proto_chorus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" that squeezes the same.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4DBC8C1E45EF8C3A.title": "Logic Director",
  "quest.4DBC8C1E45EF8C3A.quest_subtitle": "Menril thinks, chorus points.",
  "quest.4DBC8C1E45EF8C3A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four chorus chunks, two menril chunks and a diamond make four \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Directors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integrateddynamics:logic_director\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Every world part of Tunnels takes one, and the Omni-Directional Connector two.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.287131684A32618B.title": "Items into the world",
  "quest.287131684A32618B.quest_subtitle": "Hoppers only dream of this.",
  "quest.287131684A32618B.quest_desc": [
    "An item importer or exporter plus a Logic Director becomes a world part: it picks up dropped items and throws them back out, with speed, angle and pickup delay as properties. It also reaches entities with an inventory, like a donkey or a dropped shulker box."
  ],
  "quest.6340C4AFAAE246B7.title": "Break and place",
  "quest.6340C4AFAAE246B7.quest_subtitle": "A quarry one block wide.",
  "quest.6340C4AFAAE246B7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Add a \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Pickaxe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_pickaxe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to each: the \"},{\"text\":\"World Block Importer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integratedtunnels:part_importer_world_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" breaks the block it faces, with Silk Touch as a property, and the \"},{\"text\":\"World Block Exporter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"integratedtunnels:part_exporter_world_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" places blocks from the network.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.48C0C9DB04B11312.title": "Swing a Diamond Sword",
  "quest.46EA12AA83949FEF.title": "Player Simulator",
  "quest.46EA12AA83949FEF.quest_subtitle": "Clicking, outsourced.",
  "quest.46EA12AA83949FEF.quest_desc": [
    "All four world parts around an emerald. It clicks with any item from the network: either hand, sneaking or not, once or held down. Give it a Diamond Sword card and it fights on its own."
  ],
  "task.6B4FA84DD7301EFA.title": "Break only stone",
  "task.4626F1B650A95435.title": "Place logs by tag",
  "quest.09C8DA0F31E0FA99.title": "Only stone, only logs",
  "quest.09C8DA0F31E0FA99.quest_subtitle": "Picky on purpose.",
  "quest.09C8DA0F31E0FA99.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Block card of Stone in the importer's \"},{\"text\":\"Pick Up Block\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" breaks nothing else. For the exporter, \"},{\"text\":\"Item Tag Values\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" on the logs tag gives a list for \"},{\"text\":\"Place Item Blocks\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\": any log, and nothing but logs.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5D41544DEAC48D30.title": "Pour, pump and charge",
  "quest.5D41544DEAC48D30.quest_subtitle": "A bucket with ideas of its own.",
  "quest.5D41544DEAC48D30.quest_desc": [
    "With a Logic Director, the fluid and energy importers and exporters work on the world: the fluid ones pick up and place source blocks, and all four fill or drain entities that carry a tank or a battery."
  ],
  "task.75A9DD6F301A416C.title": "Drop everything",
  "quest.647B4537F23D8D45.title": "Everything on the floor",
  "quest.647B4537F23D8D45.quest_subtitle": "You did mean to, right?",
  "quest.647B4537F23D8D45.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Boolean true in \"},{\"text\":\"Place All Item Entities\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"},{\"text\":\" and the network empties itself onto the ground, stack by stack.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.6BD9111BE8182F77.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.7ADCDCDE756D6AA4.title": "Omni-Directional Connector",
  "quest.7ADCDCDE756D6AA4.quest_subtitle": "One network, many dimensions.",
  "quest.7ADCDCDE756D6AA4.quest_desc": [
    "Two Logic Directors, two Mono-Directional Connectors and a cable. Connectors of one group join their networks wherever they are, other dimensions included; a new craft starts a new group, and crafting with a connector you already have adds to its group."
  ],
  "image.56F248737F6C80C8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Menril grove\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"}]",
  "image.780BF968A2CB7697.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Power\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"}]",
  "image.40EC2169C46CAA56.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Cable work\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"}]",
  "image.1453ADD136B701F3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Readers\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"}]",
  "image.7ADF477EA16FDDE7.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Writers\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"}]",
  "image.39D56F2FC98DB8C8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At the programmer\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"}]",
  "image.6CC3D695962FBEA0.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Memory\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"}]",
  "image.50EAD24021512788.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The book's tutorials\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"}]",
  "image.1B53FABF85B10748.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tunnels\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"}]",
  "image.2B85D662C6B9D548.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Into the world\",\"color\":\"#66D9EF\"}]",
  "image.57E0DDFACC4BE794.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Integrated Dynamics\\nand Tunnels\",\"color\":\"#EAFBFF\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.3A9CBBFFF125688A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"read · decide · move\",\"color\":\"#9DDEEC\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.6D592375A9494096.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "chapter.15BF37D12C480327.title": "Just Dire Things · Goo and Gear",
  "chapter.15BF37D12C480327.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Four goos that eat blocks and leave better ones: Ferricore, Blazegold, Celestigem and Eclipse Alloy, with the tools, armor and upgrades each one opens."
  ],
  "task.29B5707A7AA2704F.title": "Wake it up",
  "quest.33971CF3851DF109.title": "Primogel Goo",
  "quest.33971CF3851DF109.quest_subtitle": "It's alive. Mostly.",
  "quest.33971CF3851DF109.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Clay Balls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:clay_ball\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Sugar\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sugar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Rotten Flesh\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:rotten_flesh\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and one \"},{\"text\":\"Dirt\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:dirt\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make \"},{\"text\":\"Primogel Goo\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:gooblock_tier1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It sits dormant when placed: right-click it with sugar or rotten flesh and it wakes, ready to eat the blocks around it.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4EED14B0AB003AA6.title": "Just Dire's Guide",
  "quest.2E126AE3714D3399.title": "The dire manual",
  "quest.2E126AE3714D3399.quest_subtitle": "Dire reading, in the good sense.",
  "quest.2E126AE3714D3399.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a Primogel Goo, shapeless, make Just Dire's Guide: every goo, machine, tool and upgrade with its recipe. The recipe viewer adds Goo Spreading and Fluid Drop tabs for the changes that happen in the world.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.707DFC8016CB1DCF.title": "One goo, six faces",
  "quest.707DFC8016CB1DCF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A goo works on all six faces at once, so surround it with blocks to convert. Blazebloom runs twice as fast as Primogel, VoidShimmer five times and Shadowpulse ten times, and every goo also does the recipes of the tiers below it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each finished block has a 10% chance of putting the goo back to sleep. A sleeping goo finishes what it started but begins nothing new."
  ],
  "task.74F08EA92A727218.title": "Ferricore Honeycomb",
  "quest.3CE879C5E7229F13.title": "Goo-fed bees",
  "quest.3CE879C5E7229F13.quest_subtitle": "The iron bee had it coming.",
  "quest.3CE879C5E7229F13.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"With \"},{\"text\":\"Productive Bees\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1C397532F8FEF781\"}},{\"text\":\", an Iron Bee fed a Primogel Goo turns into a Ferricore Bee, whose combs spin into \"},{\"text\":\"Raw Ferricore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:raw_ferricore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 80% of the time. Gold Bees take Blazebloom, Diamond Bees VoidShimmer and Ancient Bees Shadowpulse.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The odds drop with the tier: 60% for Raw Blazegold, 40% for Celestigem and 20% for Raw Eclipse Alloy."
  ],
  "quest.029C6C63C1D5064D.title": "Ferricore",
  "quest.029C6C63C1D5064D.quest_subtitle": "Iron that went to the gym.",
  "quest.029C6C63C1D5064D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An awake Primogel Goo turns a touching \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Iron\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into \"},{\"text\":\"Raw Ferricore Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:raw_ferricore_ore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in two minutes. Mine it without Silk Touch for three or four \"},{\"text\":\"Raw Ferricore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:raw_ferricore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and smelt them into \"},{\"text\":\"Ferricore Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:ferricore_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5346D080DD8EC0E9.title": "Ferricore for the common store",
  "quest.5346D080DD8EC0E9.quest_subtitle": "About nine blocks of iron, digested.",
  "quest.5346D080DD8EC0E9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Thirty-two \"},{\"text\":\"Ferricore Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:ferricore_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", once a day. Blank Upgrades, the first machines and every template start here, so the store never has enough.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5AC1205779494828.title": "Ferricore tools",
  "quest.5AC1205779494828.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The iron shapes with \"},{\"text\":\"Ferricore Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:ferricore_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": they mine like iron, last 500 uses against iron's 250 and dig a little faster. The extended tooltip of each one lists the upgrades it takes; the hoe tills Primogel Soil.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3C94D3074187F71D.title": "Ferricore armor",
  "quest.3C94D3074187F71D.quest_desc": [
    "Iron's protection and durability in four pieces that learn tricks: each slot has its own list, from Mind Fog on the helmet to Step Assist on the boots, and every trick it learns here still fits the tiers above."
  ],
  "quest.70326800B28E4D69.title": "Blank Upgrade",
  "quest.70326800B28E4D69.quest_subtitle": "Every trick starts blank.",
  "quest.70326800B28E4D69.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Ferricore Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:ferricore_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make an \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade: Blank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:upgrade_blank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the base of every upgrade. Put the tool or armor piece and a finished upgrade in a \"},{\"text\":\"Smithing Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:smithing_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with the template slot empty, and it learns the ability for good.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each piece takes each upgrade once, and only those its tier allows: the extended tooltip lists them."
  ],
  "quest.278068AD8E06B9E6.title": "Two keys and a click",
  "quest.278068AD8E06B9E6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"justdirethings.key.toggle_tool\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" switches every ability of the held tool on or off; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"justdirethings.key.toolUI\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\", or \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click, opens its settings. There a click toggles one ability and a right-click binds it to a key or a mouse button.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The same screen reaches the armor you wear: click a worn piece to edit its abilities. A passive ability's key toggles it; an active one's key fires it."
  ],
  "quest.06DDA5E67EC2D5B0.title": "One pile",
  "quest.06DDA5E67EC2D5B0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"When an ability breaks many blocks at once, like the Hammer, the Ore Miner or the Tree Feller, everything they drop lands in one pile on the block you struck, experience included.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3448417EAD242327.title": "Broken, not lost",
  "quest.3448417EAD242327.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"When a Ferricore or Blazegold piece breaks, its installed upgrades fall back out as items. Celestigem and Eclipse Alloy gear runs on FE instead of durability and never breaks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.232FF7A8F80DDE99.title": "Mind Fog",
  "quest.232FF7A8F80DDE99.quest_subtitle": "You were never here.",
  "quest.232FF7A8F80DDE99.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Fermented Spider Eyes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:fermented_spider_eye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Lapis Lazuli\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lapis_lazuli\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a blank make \"},{\"text\":\"Mind Fog\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:upgrade_mindfog\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for any helmet. Mobs only notice you within half their follow range: a third on Blazegold, a quarter on Celestigem, a fifth on Eclipse Alloy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.21AE589E7437CF89.title": "Invulnerability",
  "quest.21AE589E7437CF89.quest_subtitle": "Ten seconds of nope.",
  "quest.21AE589E7437CF89.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Chestplates\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_chestplate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Shields\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:shield\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a blank. It needs a key of its own: press it for 10 seconds immune to all damage, then wait a minute to use it again, 30 seconds on Celestigem and 20 on Eclipse Alloy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.19EAA5D1EA0A822A.title": "Walk and run",
  "quest.19EAA5D1EA0A822A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sugar\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sugar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with \"},{\"text\":\"Carrots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:carrot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes \"},{\"text\":\"Walk Speed\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:upgrade_walkspeed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; with \"},{\"text\":\"Potatoes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:potato\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Run Speed\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:upgrade_runspeed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Both go on leggings, and a slider sets the push: up to 1 on Ferricore, 2 on Blazegold, 3 on Celestigem and 5 on Eclipse Alloy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.26ACF76C1CE96B9B.title": "Jump Boost",
  "quest.26ACF76C1CE96B9B.quest_subtitle": "Knees sold separately.",
  "quest.26ACF76C1CE96B9B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Piston\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:piston\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on each side of a blank. The boots jump higher, one level on Ferricore and up to five on Eclipse Alloy, and each level takes a block off every fall.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2FE7DB2A2CED2781.title": "Step Assist",
  "quest.2FE7DB2A2CED2781.quest_subtitle": "Stairs are optional now.",
  "quest.2FE7DB2A2CED2781.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Ladders\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ladder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a blank: any tier of boots walks up full blocks without jumping, one extra block of step height.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0181526B9AAF8491.title": "Ore Miner",
  "quest.0181526B9AAF8491.quest_subtitle": "Vein, vidi, vici.",
  "quest.0181526B9AAF8491.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Pickaxe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_pickaxe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on each side of a blank. Mining one ore takes the whole connected vein with it: up to 64 blocks on Ferricore, 128 on Blazegold, 192 on Celestigem and 256 on Eclipse Alloy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.35768B7609460C7B.title": "Ore Scanner",
  "quest.35768B7609460C7B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Amethyst Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:amethyst_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a blank. Activate it on the pickaxe and nearby ores light up through the stone as particles, every kind looking the same.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0EFC535653FBDDA8.title": "Tree Feller",
  "quest.0EFC535653FBDDA8.quest_subtitle": "Timber, in one swing.",
  "quest.0EFC535653FBDDA8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Axe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_axe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on each side of a blank. Cut one log and every connected log of the same wood falls with it, within the same per-tier cap as the Ore Miner.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3BA78629E99A40D4.title": "Leaf Breaker",
  "quest.3BA78629E99A40D4.quest_subtitle": "For packs without fast leaf decay.",
  "quest.3BA78629E99A40D4.quest_desc": [
    "Any two leaves around a blank. Right-click a leaf block with the axe and every connected leaf comes down too, dropping where you clicked."
  ],
  "quest.17245CE2BA543FEE.title": "Lawnmower",
  "quest.17245CE2BA543FEE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Short Grass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:short_grass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on each side of a blank, for the shovel. Activate it and the grass, ferns, flowers and berry bushes within five blocks are cut, up to 64 at a time.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5321067AD2EC7B0B.title": "Sky Sweeper",
  "quest.5321067AD2EC7B0B.quest_subtitle": "Oww, my head, no more.",
  "quest.5321067AD2EC7B0B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Gravel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:gravel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Sand\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sand\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a blank, for the shovel. Break one gravel or sand block and the matching column above it comes down with it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1FA7601E5D3D5DF3.title": "Mob Scanner",
  "quest.1FA7601E5D3D5DF3.quest_subtitle": "What's making THAT noise?",
  "quest.1FA7601E5D3D5DF3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Spider Eyes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:spider_eye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Amethyst Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:amethyst_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a blank, for swords from Ferricore to Celestigem. Activate it and nearby mobs show through the walls as particles.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.319D1497FA3A8C5F.title": "Primogel Soil",
  "quest.319D1497FA3A8C5F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A switched-on Ferricore Hoe tills \"},{\"text\":\"Primogel Soil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:goosoil_tier1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" instead of farmland: it can't be trampled, and every random tick while watered it ages the crop above by one stage. It also grows cactus, sugar cane, bamboo and nether wart.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.36448DFFEDE4B6BD.title": "Ferricore Bow",
  "quest.36448DFFEDE4B6BD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three \"},{\"text\":\"String\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:string\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and three Ferricore make a bow with 250 uses and one Potion Canister slot in its settings. The tiers above draw faster: 17 ticks on Blazegold, 14 on Celestigem, 10 on Eclipse Alloy, against the usual 20.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.478F3C01E963F2AE.title": "Potion Arrows",
  "quest.478F3C01E963F2AE.quest_subtitle": "Like tipped arrows, without the crafting.",
  "quest.478F3C01E963F2AE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Potion Canister\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:potion_canister\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (four Ferricore round a \"},{\"text\":\"Glass Bottle\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:glass_bottle\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\") holds 1,000 mB, 250 per potion. Slot it in the bow's settings, install \"},{\"text\":\"Potion Arrow\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:upgrade_potionarrow\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (nether wart, bottles) and every arrow carries the effect.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1153F5D0877F380F.title": "Blazebloom and Blazegold",
  "quest.1153F5D0877F380F.quest_subtitle": "The goo went to the Nether and came back spicy.",
  "quest.1153F5D0877F380F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Powder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_powder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Wart\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:nether_wart\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a Primogel Goo make \"},{\"text\":\"Blazebloom Goo\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:gooblock_tier2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", fed with blaze powder or nether wart. It turns a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Gold\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:gold_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into Raw Blazegold Ore in a minute.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.00FB4EAA9055EF34.title": "Blazegold tools",
  "quest.00FB4EAA9055EF34.quest_desc": [
    "Diamond-tier mining at 12 speed, faster than diamond's 8, with 1,440 uses. Craft them fresh or carry your Ferricore ones up with a template; the hoe tills Blazebloom Soil."
  ],
  "quest.56DC82006B7F66EF.title": "Blazegold armor",
  "quest.56DC82006B7F66EF.quest_desc": [
    "Iron-level protection that lasts much longer, fire-resistant as items and enchantable like gold. It repairs itself in lava and opens a second round of armor upgrades."
  ],
  "quest.456AD35C5C20C680.title": "Templates",
  "quest.456AD35C5C20C680.quest_subtitle": "Your upgrades move up with you.",
  "quest.456AD35C5C20C680.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five Blazegold round a Blank Upgrade make \"},{\"text\":\"Template: Blazegold\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:template_blazegold\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". In a Smithing Table it turns a Ferricore piece plus one ingot into its Blazegold version, every upgrade kept; the Celestigem and Eclipse Alloy templates work the same.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A template plus two ingots of its material makes two templates."
  ],
  "quest.4AE15EE21BE7D161.title": "Skip the Ferricore template",
  "quest.4AE15EE21BE7D161.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Ferricore template can be crafted, but no recipe in this version uses it: Ferricore gear is made straight from ingots. Save the blank.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7AE0844544E9FB73.title": "Repair it in lava",
  "quest.7AE0844544E9FB73.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blazegold tools, armor, bows and the Blazejet Wand have Lava Repair: drop one into a lava source block and it comes back fully repaired.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7F6D3511430AEDEF.title": "Totem of Death Recall",
  "quest.7F6D3511430AEDEF.quest_subtitle": "Your stuff is where you left it. You too.",
  "quest.7F6D3511430AEDEF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Blazegold, two \"},{\"text\":\"Diamonds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Lapis Lazuli\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lapis_lazuli\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Pearl\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_pearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Carry it when you die: it is spent, and you respawn holding a new one bound to that spot. Hold right-click on it for a second to go back.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2949245C7275A6AA.title": "Stupefy",
  "quest.2949245C7275A6AA.quest_subtitle": "Obliviate, but for zombies.",
  "quest.2949245C7275A6AA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Eyes of Ender\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_eye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Fermented Spider Eyes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:fermented_spider_eye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Poisonous Potatoes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:poisonous_potato\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank, for helmets from Blazegold up. Look at a mob up to 32 blocks away and press its key: it forgets you and can't target you for five seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.10B94E904A008D1B.title": "Extinguish",
  "quest.10B94E904A008D1B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Water Buckets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:water_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and four \"},{\"text\":\"Magma Cream\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:magma_cream\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank. When you catch fire it puts you out, then rests 10 seconds; 5 on Celestigem, 2 on Eclipse Alloy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.29C467A45753ECE5.title": "Swim Speed",
  "quest.29C467A45753ECE5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Sugar\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sugar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Kelp\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:kelp\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank, for leggings from Blazegold up. It pushes you forward underwater, with a slider up to 2, 3 or 5 by tier.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.19BB643A2B5D326A.title": "Ground Stomp",
  "quest.19BB643A2B5D326A.quest_subtitle": "Personal space, enforced.",
  "quest.19BB643A2B5D326A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Pistons\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:piston\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Slime Blocks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:slime_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank, for boots from Blazegold up. Press its key and every mob within three blocks is thrown back; it rests 10 seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3C26844C7C94A086.title": "Hammer",
  "quest.3C26844C7C94A086.quest_subtitle": "Mining, but in bulk.",
  "quest.3C26844C7C94A086.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Pickaxe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_pickaxe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on each side of a blank, for pickaxes, shovels and hoes from Blazegold up. They break, dig or till 3×3; Celestigem cycles up to 5×5 and Eclipse Alloy to 7×7.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4CD0A4674E4DF54F.title": "Smelter",
  "quest.4CD0A4674E4DF54F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Blast Furnaces\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blast_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank, for pickaxes, axes and shovels from Blazegold up. Whatever you break drops already smelted, for a little durability or FE.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7482ABB5E11AC833.title": "Cauterize Wounds",
  "quest.7482ABB5E11AC833.quest_subtitle": "Feel the burn.",
  "quest.7482ABB5E11AC833.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Golden Apples\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:golden_apple\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Magma Cream\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:magma_cream\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank, for swords from Blazegold up. Activate it while hurt and you heal three hearts at once; it rests a minute.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7DD32C806B4D2BBE.title": "Smoker",
  "quest.7DD32C806B4D2BBE.quest_subtitle": "Dinner is served. Aggressively.",
  "quest.7DD32C806B4D2BBE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Smokers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:smoker\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank, for swords from Blazegold up. What you kill drops cooked: beef comes out as steak.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3D8EC13FAB4BAE24.title": "Blazebloom Soil",
  "quest.3D8EC13FAB4BAE24.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Blazegold Hoe tills \"},{\"text\":\"Blazebloom Soil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:goosoil_tier2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two growth stages per random tick, and ripe crops harvest themselves and replant. The drops vanish after two seconds, so park an Item Collector nearby.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7CDFC8D8216E5B67.title": "Blazegold Bow",
  "quest.7CDFC8D8216E5B67.quest_desc": [
    "Three String and three Blazegold: 450 uses, a 17-tick draw, two Potion Canister slots and Lava Repair."
  ],
  "quest.289FDD347F853E82.title": "Splash",
  "quest.289FDD347F853E82.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Gunpowder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:gunpowder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Glass Bottles\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:glass_bottle\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank, for bows from Blazegold up. Potion arrows burst on impact and splash their effect around.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1B71DFF60EA69B17.title": "Blazejet Wand",
  "quest.1B71DFF60EA69B17.quest_subtitle": "Safer than fireworks. Probably.",
  "quest.1B71DFF60EA69B17.quest_desc": [
    "One Blazegold on two Ferricore. Its built-in Air Burst throws you where you look, and while you hold it you take no fall damage at all; the slider sets the push."
  ],
  "quest.4BD7F2283783BCA5.title": "Wand in the off hand",
  "quest.4BD7F2283783BCA5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The no-fall-damage perk works from the off hand too, and on the Voidshift and Eclipsegate wands. Keep one there and dig down without a care.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6171EB6B3198E3EA.title": "Fire it from the inventory",
  "quest.6171EB6B3198E3EA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In an ability's settings, switch «Activate if Equipped» to «Activate from Inventory»: its key then fires even with the tool tucked in your inventory, like an Air Burst with a sword in hand.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3C3DDECD763F0D21.title": "VoidShimmer and Celestigem",
  "quest.3C3DDECD763F0D21.quest_subtitle": "Diamonds, but they learned to hold a charge.",
  "quest.3C3DDECD763F0D21.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Pearls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_pearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"End Stone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:end_stone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Dragon's Breath\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:dragon_breath\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a Blazebloom Goo make \"},{\"text\":\"VoidShimmer Goo\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:gooblock_tier3\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", fed with chorus fruit or ender pearls. It turns a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Diamond\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into Raw Celestigem Ore in 48 seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.531C8848E642FA27.title": "Celestigem tools",
  "quest.531C8848E642FA27.quest_subtitle": "Batteries included, charger sold separately.",
  "quest.531C8848E642FA27.quest_desc": [
    "Diamond-tier tools that run on FE instead of durability: 10,000 FE each, 50 per block. Craft them or carry your Blazegold ones up with a Celestigem template; the hoe tills VoidShimmer Soil."
  ],
  "quest.6A768D0F2EE4B495.title": "Celestigem armor",
  "quest.6A768D0F2EE4B495.quest_desc": [
    "Diamond protection and toughness, powered by 10,000 FE per piece: each point of damage it soaks costs 100 FE. Keep a Pocket Generator on you."
  ],
  "quest.10FB1DD541D51B51.title": "Celestigem Paxel",
  "quest.10FB1DD541D51B51.quest_subtitle": "Three tools walk into a smithing table.",
  "quest.10FB1DD541D51B51.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In a Smithing Table, a Celestigem Pickaxe as the template, the Axe as the base and the Shovel as the addition make one \"},{\"text\":\"Celestigem Paxel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:celestigem_paxel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It keeps every upgrade and enchantment of the three.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.58C445EC82D97FF7.title": "Pocket Generator",
  "quest.58C445EC82D97FF7.quest_subtitle": "A furnace in your pocket, for the gear.",
  "quest.58C445EC82D97FF7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Ferricore, a \"},{\"text\":\"Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Coal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:coal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Blocks of Redstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Switched on, it burns fuel from its slot and charges every FE item you carry, Curios slots included, up to 5,000 FE/t each; the JDT coals burn hotter in it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.12A8373CF8A5E561.title": "Mind the charge",
  "quest.12A8373CF8A5E561.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"FE tools never break, but below 50 FE they lose their attack bonuses. Unbreaking still works on them: each level cuts the FE they spend by 10%.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.34C8323A852A7C44.title": "Night Vision",
  "quest.34C8323A852A7C44.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Eyes of Ender\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_eye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Golden Carrots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:golden_carrot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank, for helmets from Celestigem up: permanent night vision, paid in FE.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.531C53F21016155C.title": "Water Breathing",
  "quest.531C53F21016155C.quest_subtitle": "Just keep swimming.",
  "quest.531C53F21016155C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Prismarine Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:prismarine_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Pufferfish\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:pufferfish\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two Kelp and two Blazegold round a blank. Underwater, whenever your air drops below half, it refills it for 500 FE.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0F1BD1DEA21384C7.title": "Elytra",
  "quest.0F1BD1DEA21384C7.quest_subtitle": "Wings, now in chestplate.",
  "quest.0F1BD1DEA21384C7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Elytra\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:elytra\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a blank, shapeless: chestplates from Celestigem up glide like elytra without taking the slot, and crashing into walls stops hurting.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0441ADC9B761D44D.title": "Decoy",
  "quest.0441ADC9B761D44D.quest_subtitle": "Look, a distraction!",
  "quest.0441ADC9B761D44D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Wither Skeleton Skulls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:wither_skeleton_skull\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Armor Stands\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:armor_stand\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and four \"},{\"text\":\"Phantom Membranes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:phantom_membrane\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank, for leggings from Celestigem up. Its key drops a decoy of you that every nearby mob attacks for 10 seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2F3542F9BC9886C9.title": "Negate Fall Damage",
  "quest.2F3542F9BC9886C9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Leather\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:leather\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two wool round a blank, for boots from Celestigem up. Falls do no damage; each block fallen costs 50 FE, so a long drop on Celestigem boots can empty them.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.38862720C332B434.title": "Look at your decoy",
  "quest.20EFC3647C5AE4AF.title": "Handsome devil",
  "quest.20EFC3647C5AE4AF.quest_subtitle": "It has your good side.",
  "quest.20EFC3647C5AE4AF.quest_desc": [
    "You stared at your own decoy while the mobs took turns punching it. It lasts ten seconds and shares your name."
  ],
  "reward.570FF2F983382484.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.4338EA9F6D6BC84B.title": "Bottomless",
  "quest.4338EA9F6D6BC84B.quest_subtitle": "The ground was mostly a suggestion.",
  "quest.4338EA9F6D6BC84B.quest_desc": [
    "You fell from the top of the world to the bottom and walked away. Negate Fall Damage or a wand in hand turn it into a stroll."
  ],
  "reward.395C4758ADA913EF.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.2D97C4CA5B0F6C52.title": "Drops Teleport",
  "quest.2D97C4CA5B0F6C52.quest_subtitle": "My inventory is a mess. Not anymore.",
  "quest.2D97C4CA5B0F6C52.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Chests\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_chest\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Amethyst Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:amethyst_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and four Ender Pearls round a blank, for Celestigem and Eclipse Alloy tools. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click a chest with the tool to bind it: ore and mob drops go straight there.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0CB8633259DBC9F4.title": "VoidShimmer Soil",
  "quest.0CB8633259DBC9F4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Celestigem Hoe tills \"},{\"text\":\"VoidShimmer Soil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:goosoil_tier3\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": three growth stages per random tick and self-harvesting. Till it with a hoe bound by Drops Teleport and the harvest goes to that chest.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7D2F9A08DC41242B.title": "Voidshift Wand",
  "quest.7D2F9A08DC41242B.quest_subtitle": "Walls are just suggestions.",
  "quest.7D2F9A08DC41242B.quest_desc": [
    "A Celestigem and a Blazegold on a Blazejet Wand. It keeps Air Burst and adds Void Shift: teleport to the spot you look at, up to 15 blocks away, 50 FE per block traveled."
  ],
  "quest.4D88D678B62F684E.title": "Celestigem Bow",
  "quest.4D88D678B62F684E.quest_desc": [
    "Three String and three Celestigem: a 14-tick draw, three Potion Canister slots and FE instead of durability."
  ],
  "quest.35EF6C378D81E1E7.title": "Homing Arrow",
  "quest.35EF6C378D81E1E7.quest_subtitle": "Aim is overrated.",
  "quest.35EF6C378D81E1E7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Eyes of Ender\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_eye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Targets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:target\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank, for bows from Celestigem up. Arrows curve toward the nearest target; 2,000 FE a shot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6EDAE4DB85639ED7.title": "Lingering",
  "quest.6EDAE4DB85639ED7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Dragon's Breath\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:dragon_breath\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two Glass Bottles round a blank, for bows from Celestigem up. Potion arrows leave a lingering cloud where they land.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.698AA53BB5EF5936.title": "Called shot",
  "quest.698AA53BB5EF5936.quest_subtitle": "The arrow did most of the work.",
  "quest.698AA53BB5EF5936.quest_desc": [
    "A skeleton down from fifty meters. With homing arrows the hard part was seeing it."
  ],
  "reward.1157F5CC666E8E3C.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.3C0722B85E6E4444.title": "Shadowpulse and Eclipse Alloy",
  "quest.3C0722B85E6E4444.quest_subtitle": "Bring back something from the Deep Dark. Quietly.",
  "quest.3C0722B85E6E4444.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Sculk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sculk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Sculk Shriekers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sculk_shrieker\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Echo Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:echo_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a VoidShimmer Goo make \"},{\"text\":\"Shadowpulse Goo\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:gooblock_tier4\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", fed with sculk or a sculk catalyst. It turns a \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Netherite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:netherite_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into Raw Eclipse Alloy Ore in 24 seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5E7A12CC4FDD903D.title": "Eclipse Alloy tools",
  "quest.5E7A12CC4FDD903D.quest_desc": [
    "Netherite-tier mining at speed 16, the best damage in the mod and 500,000 FE per tool. The hammer reaches 7×7 here, and the hoe tills Shadowpulse Soil."
  ],
  "quest.21AC425DC3842B2D.title": "Eclipse Alloy armor",
  "quest.21AC425DC3842B2D.quest_desc": [
    "Netherite's toughness and knockback resistance with 500,000 FE per piece. The chestplate alone takes seven upgrades, flight among them."
  ],
  "quest.25F9DEB6CF8AFCFD.title": "Debuff Remover",
  "quest.25F9DEB6CF8AFCFD.quest_subtitle": "Milk not included. Well, four are.",
  "quest.25F9DEB6CF8AFCFD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Milk Buckets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:milk_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Golden Apples\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:golden_apple\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Honey Bottles\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:honey_bottle\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank, for the Eclipse Alloy helmet. Its key clears every harmful effect, 50,000 FE each; it rests 20 seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.68A4C7346E58EA6D.title": "Mental Obliteration",
  "quest.68A4C7346E58EA6D.quest_subtitle": "Nearby mobs completely stop. Forever.",
  "quest.68A4C7346E58EA6D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two Time Crystals, two \"},{\"text\":\"End Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:end_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and four \"},{\"text\":\"Calibrated Sculk Sensors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:calibrated_sculk_sensor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" round a blank, for the Eclipse Alloy helmet. Its key freezes the brain of every mob within five blocks, for good: 100,000 FE each, two minutes of rest.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.02B266D76265D323.title": "Lava Immunity",
  "quest.02B266D76265D323.quest_subtitle": "Fancy a swim?",
  "quest.02B266D76265D323.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Netherite Scrap\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:netherite_scrap\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Lava Buckets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lava_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two Magma Cream round a blank, for the Eclipse Alloy chestplate. Lava and fire stop hurting you; each hit it blocks costs 1,000 FE.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.052A177EC36C86E8.title": "Death Protection",
  "quest.052A177EC36C86E8.quest_subtitle": "Undo, but for dying.",
  "quest.052A177EC36C86E8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Totems of Undying\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:totem_of_undying\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two Emeralds and four Time Crystals round a blank, for the Eclipse Alloy chestplate. A fatal blow leaves you at five hearts instead, once every five minutes, for 450,000 of its 500,000 FE.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.45DD06319979E41D.title": "Time Protection",
  "quest.45DD06319979E41D.quest_subtitle": "Wibbly wobbly, but not on you.",
  "quest.45DD06319979E41D.quest_desc": [
    "Two Time Crystals and two Shields round a blank, for the Eclipse Alloy chestplate. Time Crystals in your inventory now and then give you five seconds of Slowness VI or Speed VI; this upgrade blocks it for 5,000 FE."
  ],
  "quest.08FFBA668B6B01AB.title": "Flight",
  "quest.08FFBA668B6B01AB.quest_subtitle": "The sky's the limit, and the battery.",
  "quest.08FFBA668B6B01AB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Here the recipe swaps an \"},{\"text\":\"End Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:end_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for a \"},{\"text\":\"Horizon Chart\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:horizon_chart\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV), next to four Phantom Membranes, two Feathers and a blank. On the Eclipse Alloy chestplate you fly like in creative for 100 FE a tick, and mine at full speed in the air.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2917BF0EEF9294B4.title": "Phase",
  "quest.2917BF0EEF9294B4.quest_subtitle": "Doors are for other people.",
  "quest.2917BF0EEF9294B4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Shulker Shells\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:shulker_shell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two Phantom Membranes and two Dragon's Breath round a blank. On Eclipse Alloy leggings you walk through walls, never through the floor, bedrock or portals; on the Eclipse Alloy bow, arrows fly through blocks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.17AA6EB84BFAC5CA.title": "Earthquake",
  "quest.17AA6EB84BFAC5CA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Soul Sand\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:soul_sand\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Sticky Pistons\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sticky_piston\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two Fermented Spider Eyes round a blank, for Eclipse Alloy boots. Its key gives every grounded mob within five blocks Slowness IV for ten seconds; not the Wither, the Warden or the dragon.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7C0E824803234797.title": "Instant Break",
  "quest.7C0E824803234797.quest_subtitle": "Mining at the speed of now.",
  "quest.7C0E824803234797.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Netherite Pickaxes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:netherite_pickaxe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Stars\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:nether_star\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and four Time Crystals round a blank, for Eclipse Alloy tools. Blocks break at once, at 250 FE per point of hardness, so obsidian costs 12,500; Efficiency discounts 10% per level.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3403887BDF1C9BE8.title": "Ore X-Ray",
  "quest.3403887BDF1C9BE8.quest_subtitle": "That's overpowered. Yes.",
  "quest.3403887BDF1C9BE8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Eyes of Ender, two \"},{\"text\":\"Sculk Shriekers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sculk_shrieker\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two Calibrated Sculk Sensors round a blank, for the Eclipse Alloy pickaxe and paxel. It replaces the Ore Scanner: ores show through the stone as themselves, for 5,000 FE.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4806F29BF2B1D0DD.title": "Mob X-Ray",
  "quest.4806F29BF2B1D0DD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two Sculk Shriekers, four \"},{\"text\":\"End Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:end_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two Calibrated Sculk Sensors round a blank, for the Eclipse Alloy sword. It replaces the Mob Scanner: every mob within 20 blocks glows for 10 seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.06F04B58EE60930D.title": "Shadowpulse Soil",
  "quest.06F04B58EE60930D.quest_subtitle": "Farming, fast-forwarded.",
  "quest.06F04B58EE60930D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Eclipse Alloy Hoe tills \"},{\"text\":\"Shadowpulse Soil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:goosoil_tier4\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four growth stages per random tick, self-harvest and the same chest binding as VoidShimmer. Most crops ripen in two random ticks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6AC7CA0C4296D78D.title": "Eclipse Alloy Bow",
  "quest.6AC7CA0C4296D78D.quest_desc": [
    "Three String and three Eclipse Alloy: a 10-tick draw, four Potion Canister slots and 500,000 FE. It is the only bow that takes the Yondu Arrow and Phase."
  ],
  "quest.37ED8D173997BF42.title": "Yondu Arrow",
  "quest.37ED8D173997BF42.quest_subtitle": "Whistle optional.",
  "quest.37ED8D173997BF42.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Stars\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:nether_star\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", four Eyes of Ender and two Phantom Membranes round a blank. Its key arms the next arrow, which chains from mob to mob up to ten times; 100,000 FE and two minutes of rest.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.151D3284AC08AEA6.title": "Eclipsegate Wand",
  "quest.151D3284AC08AEA6.quest_subtitle": "The portable hole, on a timer.",
  "quest.151D3284AC08AEA6.quest_desc": [
    "An Eclipse Alloy and a Celestigem on a Voidshift Wand, with 100,000 FE. Right-click a wall and a 3×3 tunnel up to 20 blocks deep opens for five seconds, then the blocks come back; chests and machines stay put."
  ],
  "quest.182D2ECF5D2DE057.title": "Eclipse Alloy Paxel",
  "quest.182D2ECF5D2DE057.quest_subtitle": "One tool to break them all.",
  "quest.182D2ECF5D2DE057.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Upgrade a Celestigem Paxel with an Eclipse Alloy template, or fuse the three Eclipse Alloy tools in a Smithing Table. Either way the \"},{\"text\":\"Eclipse Alloy Paxel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:eclipsealloy_paxel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" keeps every upgrade: 7×7 hammer, Ore Miner, X-Ray, Instant Break, all on 500,000 FE.\"}]"
  ],
  "image.44C387679656D035.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Ferricore armor\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.7C286551B9CBCC04.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Ferricore tools\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.666A9509FF7BEECE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Blazegold armor\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.5B9BBD79C0A7333B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Blazegold tools\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.51A43F71F410D479.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Celestigem armor\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.4AE9EFA8C4D0119D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Celestigem tools\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.5E1A2CEBF1C2E2B8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eclipse Alloy armor\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.69002398E77EEA4F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eclipse Alloy tools\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.3FC38116D057D9C6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Just Dire Things\\nGoo and Gear\",\"color\":\"#EFFFE8\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.08AF0470ACB8B8CD.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.1D01B3F96E59DC38.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"feed it  wait  mine it\",\"color\":\"#9FE88A\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.5466D8A7B06CAEFF.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Machines and Time\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.29DBD69C9013F9A7.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Primogel · Ferricore\",\"color\":\"#9F98B7\"}]",
  "image.4F070C3E41E0AA7F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Blazebloom · Blazegold\",\"color\":\"#FA7400\"}]",
  "image.1B85F197809F801D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"VoidShimmer · Celestigem\",\"color\":\"#1AC9AA\"}]",
  "image.6494D90FD60B7D76.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Shadowpulse · Eclipse Alloy\",\"color\":\"#0A7F8C\"}]",
  "chapter.5E2C299D592BBA4B.title": "Mekanism · Energy and reactors",
  "chapter.5E2C299D592BBA4B.chapter_subtitle": [
    "From a heat generator to antimatter: generators and storage, steam, fission, fusion and the SPS."
  ],
  "quest.770AF573AE4A1192.title": "Heat Generator",
  "quest.770AF573AE4A1192.quest_subtitle": "Warm hands, warm machines.",
  "quest.770AF573AE4A1192.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Iron, osmium, copper, planks and a furnace.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It burns lava or any furnace fuel for \"},{\"text\":\"200\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J/t, and every side touching lava adds \"},{\"text\":\"30\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J/t even with nothing to burn.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sunk in a lava pool it runs on the lava around it alone. In the Nether it gets \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J/t more.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.04FC79C3C770E256.title": "Joules and FE",
  "quest.04FC79C3C770E256.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mekanism counts in joules: \"},{\"text\":\"2.5\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J make \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" FE. Its cables take and give FE to any mod, so the grid can mix generators from the whole pack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.01BB17F4F1378EE0.title": "Reactors in this pack",
  "quest.01BB17F4F1378EE0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Generators, cables, cubes and the matrix are native.\"}]",
    "",
    "Three reactor parts wait on the Atlas: the fission port on a Containment Seal (act IV), the fusion controller on an Ark Connection Bus and the SPS port on a Renewal Engine (act V)."
  ],
  "quest.48EF67E0E00158F4.title": "Solar Generator",
  "quest.48EF67E0E00158F4.quest_subtitle": "Free, as long as the sky is.",
  "quest.48EF67E0E00158F4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Free power, as long as the sky is open.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Three \"},{\"text\":\"Solar Panels\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:solar_panel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on an energy tablet frame make it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Up to \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J/t at noon under open sky.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Nothing at night or under a roof.\"}]",
    "",
    "Cheap enough to line a whole roof with them."
  ],
  "quest.6079E07B7D0A7527.title": "Advanced Solar Generator",
  "quest.6079E07B7D0A7527.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four solar generators, infused alloy and iron: up to \"},{\"text\":\"300\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J/t, where the four apart peak at \"},{\"text\":\"200\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It stands on a pole and takes three blocks of space above."
  ],
  "quest.2753A7DD48C438D3.title": "Wind Generator",
  "quest.2753A7DD48C438D3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The higher it stands, the more it makes.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"From \"},{\"text\":\"60\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J/t at height \"},{\"text\":\"24\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" up to \"},{\"text\":\"480\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J/t at the top of the world.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The block four above its base has to see the sky.\"}]",
    "",
    "Build tall, build on mountains."
  ],
  "quest.59101B3B1D85DE6B.title": "Bio-Generator",
  "quest.59101B3B1D85DE6B.quest_subtitle": "Compost with ambition.",
  "quest.59101B3B1D85DE6B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It burns \"},{\"text\":\"Bio Fuel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:bio_fuel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for \"},{\"text\":\"350\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J/t.\"}]",
    "",
    "A farm feeding a Crusher feeding this is power that grows back."
  ],
  "quest.1AD59FD5A21F356B.title": "Gas-Burning Generator",
  "quest.1AD59FD5A21F356B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Osmium, infused alloy and an electrolytic core.\"}]",
    "",
    "It burns hydrogen, or far better, ethene.",
    "",
    "A separator on water plus this generator is the first power plant that fits in a closet."
  ],
  "quest.29C60AD95FEFC8B8.title": "Ethene",
  "quest.29C60AD95FEFC8B8.quest_subtitle": "Plastic-scented power.",
  "quest.29C60AD95FEFC8B8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ethene is the gas-burning generator's best fuel.\"}]",
    "",
    "In the Pressurized Reaction Chamber:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Two bio fuel, \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" water and \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" hydrogen\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Give \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" ethene and a \"},{\"text\":\"Substrate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:substrate\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "",
    "Pipe the ethene to the generator; keep the substrate for plastic."
  ],
  "quest.22353FA19215A62E.title": "Large generators",
  "quest.22353FA19215A62E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"MoreMachine's large gas-burning, heat and wind generators do the work of a row of small ones in one block.\"}]",
    "",
    "Every recipe has a Robit at its heart and steel blocks around it."
  ],
  "quest.483066BA7A7BDFE7.title": "Cables and cubes",
  "quest.483066BA7A7BDFE7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cables carry power; cubes keep it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Steel and redstone make eight \"},{\"text\":\"Universal Cables\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_universal_cable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"An energy tablet in a steel casing makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Energy Cube\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_energy_cube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" that holds \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" MJ.\"}]",
    "",
    "A cube beside each group of generators evens out day and night."
  ],
  "quest.6D138669D05AF98C.title": "Which side is which",
  "quest.6D138669D05AF98C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A cube takes power on its input faces and pushes it out of the output face, like any machine. The slots on its left and right charge and drain items: park your jetpack and tools there.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0ADD31D31834E3C1.title": "Cables share, they do not store",
  "quest.0ADD31D31834E3C1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Connected cables form one network that splits power between everything plugged in. A basic cable moves \"},{\"text\":\"8,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J/t; when it caps out, upgrade the cable, not the generators.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7C48931B58F60FDB.title": "Thicker cables",
  "quest.7C48931B58F60FDB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Advanced, elite and ultimate cables carry \"},{\"text\":\"128,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"1,024,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"8,192,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J/t.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click a laid cable with the next alloy and it upgrades in place.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Extras adds four tiers more.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7A4342586EC6A4FC.title": "Ultimate Energy Cube",
  "quest.7A4342586EC6A4FC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each tier wraps the last cube in its alloy: \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" MJ, pushing out up to \"},{\"text\":\"256,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J/t at the top.\"}]",
    "",
    "Past that, the Induction Matrix is cheaper per joule."
  ],
  "quest.7AE4606A98611357.title": "Cubes past Ultimate",
  "quest.7AE4606A98611357.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mekanism Extras keeps wrapping cubes past Ultimate.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Absolute Energy Cube\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:absolute_energy_cube\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is an ultimate cube in radiance alloy and emeralds.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Supreme, Cosmic and Infinite follow with the Extras alloys.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.19DD91D523871AD1.title": "Energized Induction Matrix",
  "quest.19DD91D523871AD1.quest_subtitle": "A battery the size of a room.",
  "quest.19DD91D523871AD1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A hollow box, \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"18\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" blocks a side, of \"},{\"text\":\"Induction Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:induction_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and glass with \"},{\"text\":\"Induction Ports\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:induction_port\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Cells inside add capacity, providers add throughput. The ports want elite circuits."
  ],
  "quest.108225E99DB836AD.title": "Plan it in EMI first",
  "quest.108225E99DB836AD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Just Enough Mekanism Multiblocks lists every Mekanism structure in EMI: pick one, set its size and read the block count, the layout and the numbers before you place a block. A turbine the wrong shape will not form at all.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1A9CAB71A2C7FBFE.title": "Ports go both ways",
  "quest.1A9CAB71A2C7FBFE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An induction port starts as input. Shift-right-click it with a Configurator and it switches to output; one of each makes the matrix a pass-through battery.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0BF84588B194D041.title": "Cells and providers",
  "quest.0BF84588B194D041.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cells fill the matrix; providers set how fast it flows.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A basic cube wrapped in lithium dust and energy tablets makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Induction Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_induction_cell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" GJ.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"With circuits instead, a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Induction Provider\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_induction_provider\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Lithium comes from the evaporation tower."
  ],
  "quest.60AE550BDB340688.title": "Ultimate Induction Cell",
  "quest.60AE550BDB340688.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cells climb from \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" GJ to \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"512\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"4,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" GJ; providers from \"},{\"text\":\"256,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J/t to \"},{\"text\":\"131\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" million.\"}]",
    "",
    "One ultimate cell outholds a room of ultimate cubes."
  ],
  "quest.23923C1ED9CF0CE8.title": "A heavier matrix",
  "quest.23923C1ED9CF0CE8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"For when four terajoules start to feel small.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Extras adds \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Induction Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:reinforced_induction_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with its own ports.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Cells and providers go from Absolute to Infinite.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.71C9A91A53A8BE35.title": "Structural Glass",
  "quest.71C9A91A53A8BE35.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Structural Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:structural_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" lets you watch a multiblock work.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It works in the walls of any Mekanism multiblock that accepts glass.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It drops itself when broken.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"You watch the tank inside fill up.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.65572E26D08B01C0.title": "Yellow cake for the common store",
  "quest.65572E26D08B01C0.quest_subtitle": "Look, do not eat.",
  "quest.65572E26D08B01C0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Yellow Cake Uranium\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:yellow_cake_uranium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "Run uranium through the ore ladder first and it comes cheap."
  ],
  "quest.5DEAF9CD61FFA814.title": "Resistive Heater",
  "quest.5DEAF9CD61FFA814.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Resistive Heater\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:resistive_heater\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns energy into heat at a rate you set in its screen.\"}]",
    "",
    "Heat is a resource in Mekanism:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It boils water\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It warms the evaporation tower\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It moves through conductors\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0E30AEE8954C4BE0.title": "Fuelwood Heater",
  "quest.0E30AEE8954C4BE0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Heat without power: the \"},{\"text\":\"Fuelwood Heater\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:fuelwood_heater\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" burns any furnace fuel into heat.\"}]",
    "",
    "Next to the evaporation tower it gets a salt works going before you own a generator."
  ],
  "quest.7B4BB59BBB4574CA.title": "Thermodynamic Conductor",
  "quest.7B4BB59BBB4574CA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copper between steel: eight \"},{\"text\":\"Thermodynamic Conductors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_thermodynamic_conductor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" that carry heat from a heater to whatever needs it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Keep them away from anything that burns.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.23D65931AD41ED7F.title": "Thermoelectric Boiler",
  "quest.23D65931AD41ED7F.quest_subtitle": "A kettle the size of a house.",
  "quest.23D65931AD41ED7F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A kettle you build: a hollow box that boils water into steam.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Boiler Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:boiler_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and glass, up to \"},{\"text\":\"18\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" a side.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Boiler Valves\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:boiler_valve\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for water in and steam out.\"}]",
    "",
    "Heat comes from superheating elements inside or from hot coolant."
  ],
  "quest.17CD7565B955CCAE.title": "Superheating Element",
  "quest.17CD7565B955CCAE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Superheating Elements\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:superheating_element\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" boil the water directly.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Place them inside the boiler's lower half.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Feed them power through a valve.\"}]",
    "",
    "More elements, more steam, more power spent."
  ],
  "quest.1BD33479F347F167.title": "Boiling with sodium",
  "quest.1BD33479F347F167.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A sodium reactor can boil the water for you.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A sodium-cooled fission reactor sends out \"},{\"text\":\"Superheated Sodium\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:superheated_sodium_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Piped into the boiler, it boils the water and comes back as sodium.\"}]",
    "",
    "No elements needed."
  ],
  "quest.4E20B3005A4F18E0.title": "Water below, steam above",
  "quest.4E20B3005A4F18E0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A full, gapless layer of Pressure Dispersers splits the boiler: water and heat below it, steam above. Leave room above for steam, or the boiler stalls with its tank full.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.34046E842925E770.title": "Pressure Disperser",
  "quest.34046E842925E770.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Steel, iron bars and infused alloy.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The boiler and the turbine both need a full horizontal layer of \"},{\"text\":\"Pressure Dispersers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:pressure_disperser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to steer the steam, so make a stack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.29569F80D701AD3D.title": "Industrial Turbine",
  "quest.29569F80D701AD3D.quest_subtitle": "Steam in, lightning out.",
  "quest.29569F80D701AD3D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Steam in, lightning out: the Industrial Turbine.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A box of \"},{\"text\":\"Turbine Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:turbine_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from \"},{\"text\":\"5×3×5\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" up to \"},{\"text\":\"17×18×17\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\", odd width and length.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Valves for steam and power.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Turbine Vents\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:turbine_vent\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at or above the rotor top.\"}]",
    "",
    "Boilers, fission and fusion all feed it steam."
  ],
  "quest.426B8D1FC37ED254.title": "The rotor",
  "quest.426B8D1FC37ED254.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The rotor turns steam into power.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A column of \"},{\"text\":\"Turbine Rotors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:turbine_rotor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" up the middle, two \"},{\"text\":\"Blades\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:turbine_blade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" each.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Rotational Complex\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:rotational_complex\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on top.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Electromagnetic Coils\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:electromagnetic_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" touching it: each carries four blades.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.082B24614DBD6C00.title": "Saturating Condenser",
  "quest.082B24614DBD6C00.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Without condensers, the turbine throws its water away.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Saturating Condensers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:saturating_condenser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" above the rotational complex turn spent steam back into water for the boiler or the reactor.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3D9500F5BC2862AB.title": "Sizing a turbine",
  "quest.3D9500F5BC2862AB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A turbine holds at most \"},{\"text\":\"28\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" blades, and every coil carries four, so a full rotor wants seven coils. Vents limit how fast steam gets in: when the steam tank fills, add vents before rotor.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.01F7BFEAFE162B95.title": "Yellow cake",
  "quest.01F7BFEAFE162B95.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Uranium ore is common and harmless until you refine it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:yellow_cake_uranium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A uranium ingot in the Enrichment Chamber makes two \"},{\"text\":\"Yellow Cake Uranium\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:yellow_cake_uranium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The Chemical Oxidizer turns each into \"},{\"text\":\"250\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" uranium oxide.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.416CD1969C65C35A.title": "Hydrofluoric acid",
  "quest.416CD1969C65C35A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Fluorite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:fluorite_gem\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" gem dissolved in sulfuric acid makes \"},{\"text\":\"1000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" hydrofluoric acid.\"}]",
    "",
    "The Chemical Infuser joins it with uranium oxide into uranium hexafluoride, two for each pair."
  ],
  "quest.6463C8145E0DE9C6.title": "Isotopic Centrifuge",
  "quest.6463C8145E0DE9C6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lead, ultimate circuits and a chemical tank.\"}]",
    "",
    "It spins uranium hexafluoride into fissile fuel one to one.",
    "",
    "Later it also pulls plutonium out of nuclear waste, ten to one."
  ],
  "quest.2C96C2EAAF41B7E4.title": "Fission Reactor",
  "quest.2C96C2EAAF41B7E4.quest_subtitle": "Mostly safe!",
  "quest.2C96C2EAAF41B7E4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fissile fuel in, heat out, and waste to handle.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A hollow box of \"},{\"text\":\"Fission Reactor Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:fission_reactor_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:reactor_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", lead around steel.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Towers of fuel assemblies inside.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Its heat goes into water or sodium.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.44D5F6B2A82B0029.title": "Fission Reactor Port",
  "quest.44D5F6B2A82B0029.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Configurator sets each port to fuel in, coolant or waste out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In this pack the \"},{\"text\":\"Fission Reactor Port\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:fission_reactor_port\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has a \"},{\"text\":\"Containment Seal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:containment_seal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at its heart: act IV.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.01F230EB33555CA5.title": "Fuel towers",
  "quest.01F230EB33555CA5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The reactor's size is its fuel towers.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Stack \"},{\"text\":\"Fission Fuel Assemblies\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:fission_fuel_assembly\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into towers inside it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Cap each with a \"},{\"text\":\"Control Rod Assembly\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:control_rod_assembly\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every assembly adds \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB/t of maximum burn and \"},{\"text\":\"8000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB of fuel space.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4D88D541E8192C7A.title": "Reactor Glass",
  "quest.4D88D541E8192C7A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lead and enriched iron around glass: four \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:reactor_glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It goes in the walls of both reactors, and a window lets you see the fuel glow."
  ],
  "quest.086DE4D66647E1BA.title": "Fission Logic Adapter",
  "quest.086DE4D66647E1BA.quest_subtitle": "The big red button, automated.",
  "quest.086DE4D66647E1BA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The reactor shuts itself off before you have to.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Set the \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Adapter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:fission_reactor_logic_adapter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to fire on high damage, high temperature or too much waste.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Wire it to the activation side.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.79FEDEB8FA6CF012.title": "Start low",
  "quest.79FEDEB8FA6CF012.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The reactor starts at \"},{\"text\":\"0.1\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB/t. Raise the burn rate a little at a time and watch damage: \"},{\"text\":\"past 100% it can melt down\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\", and a meltdown leaves a crater and a radiation cloud. SCRAM is in its screen.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1087BE32E8ABE8C8.title": "Coolant first",
  "quest.1087BE32E8ABE8C8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every mB of fissile fuel is \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" MJ of heat, and all of it must leave through the coolant. If the water or sodium runs out, the temperature climbs and so does the damage.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4B8323EF4B5D05E5.title": "Sodium coolant",
  "quest.4B8323EF4B5D05E5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Brine through the separator leaves sodium beside the chlorine.\"}]",
    "",
    "Pumped into a fission reactor as coolant, it comes out superheated and boils water in a boiler far better than water cooling does in the reactor."
  ],
  "quest.19E055E7E92C386F.title": "Water-cooled fission",
  "quest.19E055E7E92C386F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With water as coolant the reactor boils it into steam itself. Pipe the steam to a turbine and its condensers send the water back: the simplest nuclear plant.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3D74EAF1AE047FEA.title": "Radioactive Waste Barrel",
  "quest.3D74EAF1AE047FEA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Nuclear waste goes into a \"},{\"text\":\"Radioactive Waste Barrel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:radioactive_waste_barrel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Pipe it out of the reactor.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"512,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB that decay slowly on their own.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Breaking a full barrel releases what is inside.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7D7970FC3C9C3E3E.title": "Fuel from waste",
  "quest.7D7970FC3C9C3E3E.quest_subtitle": "Recycling, the dangerous kind.",
  "quest.7D7970FC3C9C3E3E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Waste can go back into the reactor.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:reprocessed_fissile_fragment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A plutonium pellet with hydrogen chloride in the Injection Chamber makes four \"},{\"text\":\"Reprocessed Fissile Fragments\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:reprocessed_fissile_fragment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Oxidized, each one is \"},{\"text\":\"2000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB of fissile fuel.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.5B5710152CF67792.title": "Wear the full hazmat suit",
  "quest.36794BFC7D025A6D.title": "Hazmat Suit",
  "quest.36794BFC7D025A6D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lead and orange dye make the \"},{\"text\":\"Hazmat Mask\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:hazmat_mask\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", gown, pants and boots.\"}]",
    "",
    "The full set keeps radiation out while you work near reactors, waste and spills."
  ],
  "task.7E07100B4A3DBD65.title": "Use a Geiger Counter",
  "quest.2ACE0612C6394779.title": "Geiger Counter",
  "quest.2ACE0612C6394779.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lead around a basic circuit.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Geiger Counter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:geiger_counter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reads the radiation around you.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Radiation spreads from leaks and fades over time.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.5002BE0317897996.title": "Use a Dosimeter",
  "quest.5312F92AC79A1CCC.title": "Dosimeter",
  "quest.5312F92AC79A1CCC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Dosimeter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dosimeter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reads the dose your body already took.\"}]",
    "",
    "Above a small threshold radiation starts to hurt, and it takes time to fall again."
  ],
  "quest.20F72A343D3A46C0.title": "Tastes like metal",
  "quest.20F72A343D3A46C0.quest_subtitle": "Does this taste like metal to you?",
  "quest.20F72A343D3A46C0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Radiation poisoning hurt you.\"}]",
    "",
    "Next time, the hazmat suit goes on before the barrel comes off."
  ],
  "reward.20C1E55727BA4023.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.4FA881875379C776.title": "Not great, not terrible",
  "quest.4FA881875379C776.quest_subtitle": "Three point six. Roentgen.",
  "quest.4FA881875379C776.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Radiation poisoning killed you.\"}]",
    "",
    "The reactor, for the record, is fine."
  ],
  "reward.7459492A26B99762.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.13542F3D308446CB.title": "Bigger waste barrels",
  "quest.13542F3D308446CB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Barrels for reactors that never stop.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Extras wraps a waste barrel in lead blocks and radiance alloy: the \"},{\"text\":\"Absolute Radioactive Waste Barrel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:absolute_radioactive_waste_barrel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Supreme, Cosmic and Infinite come after it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5EAB37617F376017.title": "Plutonium",
  "quest.5EAB37617F376017.quest_subtitle": "Plutonium, not polonium.",
  "quest.5EAB37617F376017.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Isotopic Centrifuge pulls one plutonium from ten nuclear waste.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In the reaction chamber, \"},{\"text\":\"1000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" of it with water and a fluorite dust make a \"},{\"text\":\"Plutonium Pellet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:pellet_plutonium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"1000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" spent waste.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4796BA493CB12C72.title": "Polonium",
  "quest.4796BA493CB12C72.quest_subtitle": "Polonium, not plutonium.",
  "quest.4796BA493CB12C72.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Solar Neutron Activator turns ten nuclear waste into one polonium.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The same reaction as plutonium makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Polonium Pellet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:pellet_polonium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and three things want them:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Fusion frames\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The SPS\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The MekaSuit\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5DBB61A56876C197.title": "Solar Neutron Activator",
  "quest.5DBB61A56876C197.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It needs to see the sun.\"}]",
    "",
    "It turns nuclear waste into polonium and lithium into tritium, faster at noon, slower in rain.",
    "",
    "Built from bronze, HDPE and elite parts."
  ],
  "quest.7680F7D2EE7883E6.title": "Activators like it cold",
  "quest.7680F7D2EE7883E6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Biome matters: hot biomes cut the activator's rate and cold ones raise it; where it rains, a storm cuts it to a fifth. A snowy peak with a clear sky is the best seat.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2B87016BAEC29307.title": "Large Solar Neutron Activator",
  "quest.2B87016BAEC29307.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Many activators' worth of polonium, in one block.\"}]",
    "",
    "MoreMachine's big activator is an advanced solar generator and a laser around a Robit."
  ],
  "quest.2FEBB698F3A23BAD.title": "Supercritical Phase Shifter",
  "quest.2FEBB698F3A23BAD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"SPS Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:sps_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is HDPE around plutonium and polonium pellets.\"}]",
    "",
    "Built into a 7×7×7 shifter with glass and ports, it pushes polonium past what matter should do."
  ],
  "quest.25CCCFDED78B1354.title": "SPS Port",
  "quest.25CCCFDED78B1354.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ports take polonium and power in and let antimatter out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In this pack the \"},{\"text\":\"SPS Port\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:sps_port\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has a \"},{\"text\":\"Renewal Engine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:renewal_engine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at its heart: act V.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.70BD68037A2199CD.title": "Supercharged Coil",
  "quest.70BD68037A2199CD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copper, ultimate circuits and polonium around a laser.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each \"},{\"text\":\"Supercharged Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:supercharged_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sits on an SPS port and feeds the shifter its enormous power.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.733E726F0EF5F9CF.title": "What antimatter costs",
  "quest.733E726F0EF5F9CF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One mB of antimatter takes \"},{\"text\":\"1000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB of polonium and a gigajoule of power. A pellet is \"},{\"text\":\"1000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB: plan the fission plant and the power plant before the shifter.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5ED9780E29AA80B3.title": "Supercharged creeper",
  "quest.5ED9780E29AA80B3.quest_subtitle": "Science has gone too far.",
  "quest.5ED9780E29AA80B3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A creeper wandered into a running SPS and came out charged.\"}]",
    "",
    "Please do not do that again, and please do not do it near the base."
  ],
  "reward.2BAE5ED1373F9A71.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.02ACB717EAAAD56B.title": "A villain origin story",
  "quest.02ACB717EAAAD56B.quest_subtitle": "He had a good job at the library.",
  "quest.02ACB717EAAAD56B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A villager went through the SPS and came out something else.\"}]",
    "",
    "Every villain needs a start."
  ],
  "reward.66D303FB96AD0C9F.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.3E2D8928ADA59A5E.title": "Pig intelligence",
  "quest.3E2D8928ADA59A5E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You tried to make a pig smarter by walking it through a running SPS.\"}]",
    "",
    "It came out angrier, and now it has a sword."
  ],
  "reward.1AA9636C42C907B8.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.5F5A7F10DB9F3BFC.title": "Mooshroom recoloring",
  "quest.5F5A7F10DB9F3BFC.quest_subtitle": "Red or brown? Yes.",
  "quest.5F5A7F10DB9F3BFC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A mooshroom went through the SPS and came out the other color.\"}]",
    "",
    "The only safe use of antimatter physics so far."
  ],
  "reward.0570DB439985503B.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.433F2224AF985485.title": "Impossible material",
  "quest.433F2224AF985485.quest_subtitle": "Matter that should not exist here.",
  "quest.433F2224AF985485.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A thousand mB of antimatter from the SPS, crystallized: an \"},{\"text\":\"Antimatter Pellet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:pellet_antimatter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It feeds the Nucleosynthesizer, the gravitational unit of the MekaSuit, the supermassive QIO drive and the creative tanks."
  ],
  "quest.03771164C730F823.title": "Antiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer",
  "quest.03771164C730F823.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A few mB of antimatter and a lot of power transmute things:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Coal into a diamond\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A diamond into an emerald\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"An egg into a dragon egg\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A skeleton skull into a wither skeleton skull\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.126C5840D859F397.title": "Pellets travel",
  "quest.126C5840D859F397.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Store antimatter as pellets, not gas: the Chemical Oxidizer turns a pellet back into \"},{\"text\":\"1000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB wherever you need it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.22A593034A787258.title": "Large Nucleosynthesizer",
  "quest.22A593034A787258.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"MoreMachine's big transmuter: antimatter pellets and a Robit at the core.\"}]",
    "",
    "It runs several transmutations at once from one antimatter tank."
  ],
  "quest.5F03ED0BD459380A.title": "Heavy water",
  "quest.5F03ED0BD459380A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fusion needs deuterium, and deuterium hides in water.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Electric Pump\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:electric_pump\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with a \"},{\"text\":\"Filter Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pulls \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB of \"},{\"text\":\"Heavy Water\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:heavy_water_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from every water block.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The upgrade is infused alloy and glass around tin dust.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The Electrolytic Separator splits it into deuterium and oxygen at twice the power.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4E357EB1FE93FFB0.title": "Advanced Electric Pump",
  "quest.4E357EB1FE93FFB0.quest_subtitle": "Ten times heavier.",
  "quest.4E357EB1FE93FFB0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ten times the heavy water.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Mekanism Extras' \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Electric Pump\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:advanced_electric_pump\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pulls \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB of heavy water per block with a Filter Upgrade, ten times the basic pump.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6687258309F2892C.title": "Lithium",
  "quest.6687258309F2892C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lithium starts as brine.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The evaporation tower turns ten brine into one lithium.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dust_lithium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"The Chemical Crystallizer makes \"},{\"text\":\"Lithium Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dust_lithium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" of it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Induction cells eat the dust, and the activator turns the gas into tritium."
  ],
  "quest.4045B081AF1B0EEC.title": "Hohlraum",
  "quest.4045B081AF1B0EEC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four gold dust and \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" carbon in the infuser make a \"},{\"text\":\"Hohlraum\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:hohlraum\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Fill it with D-T fuel, deuterium and tritium joined in the Chemical Infuser, and it becomes the reactor's ignition charge."
  ],
  "quest.0BD32FFF3ED3CA05.title": "Laser",
  "quest.0BD32FFF3ED3CA05.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Reinforced alloy, an energy tablet and a diamond in a steel casing: a \"},{\"text\":\"Laser\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:laser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fed power, it fires a beam up to \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" blocks that breaks blocks and hurts whatever stands in it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.20DBC68D3543C6E6.title": "Laser Amplifier",
  "quest.20DBC68D3543C6E6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Laser Amplifier\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:laser_amplifier\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stores the beams of several lasers and fires them together, on redstone or when full.\"}]",
    "",
    "Aim it at the fusion reactor's laser focus matrix."
  ],
  "quest.677C96650C39AD0D.title": "Fusion Reactor Frame",
  "quest.677C96650C39AD0D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Atomic alloy and polonium pellets around a steel casing: four \"},{\"text\":\"Fusion Reactor Frames\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:fusion_reactor_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "The fusion reactor is a 5×5×5 shape of frames, glass, ports and one controller."
  ],
  "quest.00FC1E2FC7343444.title": "Fusion Reactor Controller",
  "quest.00FC1E2FC7343444.quest_subtitle": "A small sun in a box.",
  "quest.00FC1E2FC7343444.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It sits on top of the reactor and holds the hohlraum.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In this pack the \"},{\"text\":\"Fusion Reactor Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:fusion_reactor_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has an \"},{\"text\":\"Ark Connection Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:ark_bus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in place of a frame: act V.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.13FF3C190B4B26C3.title": "Fusion Reactor Ports",
  "quest.13FF3C190B4B26C3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fusion Reactor Ports\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:fusion_reactor_port\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" take deuterium, tritium and water in and send power and steam out.\"}]",
    "",
    "Once burning, the reactor mixes its own D-T fuel from the two gases."
  ],
  "quest.3CA9C31B0DCE2615.title": "Ignition",
  "quest.3CA9C31B0DCE2615.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Light the small sun.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Set a \"},{\"text\":\"Laser Focus Matrix\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:laser_focus_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the reactor wall.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Put a full hohlraum in the controller.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Fire charged amplifiers into the matrix.\"}]",
    "",
    "When the plasma is hot enough the hohlraum burns and the reactor runs on its ports."
  ],
  "quest.7B76EA62B5154097.title": "Fusion Logic Adapter",
  "quest.7B76EA62B5154097.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The fusion \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Adapter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismgenerators:fusion_reactor_logic_adapter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" signals when the reactor is ready to ignite, too hot or out of fuel.\"}]",
    "",
    "Wire \"ready\" to the amplifier and ignition fires itself."
  ],
  "quest.74CB90540FFD6727.title": "Air or water",
  "quest.74CB90540FFD6727.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An air-cooled fusion reactor turns heat straight into power. Pipe water in and it makes steam for a turbine instead, but it needs a higher temperature to ignite.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2EB2459E6FA8C586.title": "Fusion into a turbine",
  "quest.2EB2459E6FA8C586.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Water-cooled fusion sends out so much steam that it wants the biggest turbine you can form.\"}]",
    "",
    "Add rotors and coils until the steam tank stops filling."
  ],
  "quest.5E9F060C3BC14C16.title": "Lead-coated focus matrix",
  "quest.5E9F060C3BC14C16.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The same window, now it also blocks radiation.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Extras infuses a laser focus matrix with \"},{\"text\":\"40\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" lead: the \"},{\"text\":\"Lead Coated Laser Focus Matrix\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:lead_coated_laser_focus_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5DDBB2330BF01EE2.title": "Naquadah Reactor Casing",
  "quest.5DDBB2330BF01EE2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Radiation-proof framing for the Extras reactor.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Nucleosynthesizer turns a lead block and one mB of antimatter into \"},{\"text\":\"Naquadah Reactor Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:naquadah_reactor_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.697731EB08867DF6.title": "Naquadah Reactor",
  "quest.697731EB08867DF6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Its \"},{\"text\":\"controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:naquadah_reactor_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" wants cosmic circuits and an absolute chemical tank, and its ports come four to a casing cross.\"}]",
    "",
    "Plan it in EMI before you commit the antimatter."
  ],
  "quest.38E8C7A7EE6B155D.title": "Naquadah fuel",
  "quest.38E8C7A7EE6B155D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Naquadah fuel takes three steps:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Naquadah ingots dissolved in hydrofluoric acid give naquadah hexafluoride.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Infused with uranium hexafluoride it becomes \"},{\"text\":\"fluorinated naquadah uranium fuel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:fluorinated_naquadah_uranium_fuel_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The reaction chamber finishes it with osmium.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.387FA4747B6C5A5F.title": "Throw the main switch",
  "quest.387FA4747B6C5A5F.quest_subtitle": "Let there be light.",
  "quest.387FA4747B6C5A5F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A power station should show it has power.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: every floor lights up."
  ],
  "image.799C1AE092DEE17B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"GENERATORS\",\"color\":\"#D07A36\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.46F8F3C31DCA46A9.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"STEAM · STORAGE\",\"color\":\"#6FA3C8\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.35D50FF6444B0DE5.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"FISSION\",\"color\":\"#5FBF5F\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.6259EB7AA3CFB815.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"SPS · FUSION\",\"color\":\"#AB5AAF\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.0BD16583C5D736BC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Radiation\",\"color\":\"#9FE39A\"}]",
  "image.483F7B18B7AA336F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Naquadah reactor\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
  "image.7687018B25CB4FCC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MEKANISM\",\"color\":\"#E6EEF2\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.3EEC771402BA76BB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Energy and reactors\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
  "image.3A49A9AD207ED930.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.4B9AE38EE2D173A8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Basics\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
  "image.28EFF1C6B546119C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Logistics and gear\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
  "chapter.5A3F228A4F726C4A.title": "Mekanism · Logistics and gear",
  "chapter.5A3F228A4F726C4A.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Transmitters, storage, quantum machines and mining, and the gear that ends in the MekaSuit."
  ],
  "quest.35CFDD95EF0BEBE4.title": "Logistical Transporter",
  "quest.35CFDD95EF0BEBE4.quest_subtitle": "Conveyor belts are so last era.",
  "quest.35CFDD95EF0BEBE4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A basic circuit between two steel ingots makes eight \"},{\"text\":\"Logistical Transporters\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_logistical_transporter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "They pull from a side set to pull and deliver to the nearest inventory that accepts.",
    "",
    "A Configurator on a connection cycles it through normal, push, pull and none."
  ],
  "task.09371232462FDC98.title": "Upgrade a laid transmitter with an alloy",
  "quest.780288C388B8D535.title": "Upgrade in place",
  "quest.780288C388B8D535.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click a laid transmitter with the next alloy and it upgrades without breaking the line.\"}]",
    "",
    "Ultimate transporters pull a whole stack at a time and move items ten times as fast as basic ones."
  ],
  "quest.628288DF90D37CC6.title": "Past ultimate",
  "quest.628288DF90D37CC6.quest_subtitle": "Numbers go up.",
  "quest.628288DF90D37CC6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mekanism Extras adds four tiers above ultimate to every transmitter.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Eight ultimate transporters around a radiance alloy make eight \"},{\"text\":\"Absolute Logistical Transporters\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:absolute_logistical_transporter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Thermonuclear, shining and spectrum alloys climb on to Supreme, Cosmic and Infinite.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.02B9BA078BA74ED4.title": "Diversion and restriction",
  "quest.02B9BA078BA74ED4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Diversion Transporter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:diversion_transporter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" opens or closes with redstone, side by side with a Configurator.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Restrictive Transporter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:restrictive_transporter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is only used when no other path is left.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.58A15B3DB96171D5.title": "Logistical Sorter",
  "quest.58A15B3DB96171D5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Logistical Sorter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:logistical_sorter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pulls what you name out of an inventory.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Against an inventory, it pulls what matches its filters into the transporter behind it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Filters by item, tag or mod, each with its own color.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"With auto-eject on, unfiltered items go out too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.33085F4FBA3F1C38.title": "Paint the paths",
  "quest.33085F4FBA3F1C38.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Configurator can color a transporter: colored items only ride matching or uncolored paths. A sorter per loot chest, each with its color, keeps a base tidy without digital storage.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.30F0A34B1A356CFF.title": "Oredictionificator",
  "quest.30F0A34B1A356CFF.quest_subtitle": "Yes, that is its real name.",
  "quest.30F0A34B1A356CFF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It turns items into the same-tag item of your choice, say one mod's ingot into another's.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Almost Unified already unifies what recipes make.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"This one cleans up drops and old chests.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7AD100EF8FCD9412.title": "Network Reader",
  "quest.7AD100EF8FCD9412.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Find the bottleneck fast.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Right-click a transmitter with the \"},{\"text\":\"Network Reader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:network_reader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it counts the network's transmitters and acceptors and reports its buffer, capacity and throughput.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4E2B40690CB7E4C8.title": "Security Desk",
  "quest.4E2B40690CB7E4C8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mekanism machines can be public, private or trusted.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A network reader in a steel casing makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Security Desk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:security_desk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which manages all of yours from one screen, including who counts as trusted.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0D7CDFC225E69930.title": "Bins",
  "quest.0D7CDFC225E69930.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Bin\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_bin\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds \"},{\"text\":\"4,096\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" of a single item and keeps them when broken.\"}]",
    "",
    "Transporters feed it and pull from it like any inventory."
  ],
  "quest.3C75BCD391959DC9.title": "Ultimate Bin",
  "quest.3C75BCD391959DC9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each tier wraps the last bin in its alloy and circuit:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Advanced: \"},{\"text\":\"8,192\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" items\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Elite: \"},{\"text\":\"32,768\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Ultimate: \"},{\"text\":\"262,144\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
    "",
    "Extras keeps going from Absolute to Infinite. The Creative Bin has no recipe."
  ],
  "quest.3A0DF20C5DCFA229.title": "Personal storage",
  "quest.3A0DF20C5DCFA229.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Storage that opens from your hand and answers only to you.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Personal Chest\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:personal_chest\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Personal Barrel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:personal_barrel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hold \"},{\"text\":\"54\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" slots each.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"They can be locked to you.\"}]",
    "",
    "The Robit, the QIO array and the tractor beam each eat one."
  ],
  "quest.0F53517556A943BE.title": "Transporters for the common store",
  "quest.0F53517556A943BE.quest_subtitle": "Every base needs one more line.",
  "quest.0F53517556A943BE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Thirty-two \"},{\"text\":\"Logistical Transporters\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_logistical_transporter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.56242D5853E1D788.title": "Mechanical Pipes",
  "quest.56242D5853E1D788.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A bucket between two steel ingots makes eight \"},{\"text\":\"Mechanical Pipes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_mechanical_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "They carry fluids only: chemicals take pressurized tubes, and the two never share a line."
  ],
  "quest.4670629995AFA392.title": "Fluid Tank",
  "quest.4670629995AFA392.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Fluid Tank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:basic_fluid_tank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" carries \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" buckets and keeps them when broken.\"}]",
    "",
    "In bucket mode it picks up and places fluid in the world."
  ],
  "quest.25EA21F990D588C7.title": "Dynamic Tank",
  "quest.25EA21F990D588C7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A hollow box of \"},{\"text\":\"Dynamic Tank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dynamic_tank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" blocks, glass and \"},{\"text\":\"Dynamic Valves\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dynamic_valve\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"18\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" blocks a side.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It holds one fluid or one chemical: \"},{\"text\":\"350\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" buckets of fluid or \"},{\"text\":\"16,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" of a chemical per block of its size, walls included.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2B5CA7ED2918A593.title": "Electric Pump",
  "quest.2B5CA7ED2918A593.quest_subtitle": "Slurp.",
  "quest.2B5CA7ED2918A593.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Electric Pump\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:electric_pump\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" drains source blocks up to \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" blocks away, following the connected fluid.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"With a Filter Upgrade it pulls heavy water out of water instead, \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB per block.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.237E67AEC662E059.title": "Fluidic Plenisher",
  "quest.237E67AEC662E059.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The pump, backwards: the \"},{\"text\":\"Fluidic Plenisher\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:fluidic_plenisher\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" places fluid into the world, up to \"},{\"text\":\"4,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" blocks per run.\"}]",
    "",
    "Fill a ravine, drown a quarry, build a lake."
  ],
  "quest.6BA1E6858BF91DC3.title": "Chemical tanks",
  "quest.6BA1E6858BF91DC3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chemical tanks climb from \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"8,192\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" buckets at Ultimate and keep their contents when broken.\"}]",
    "",
    "MoreMachine's mid and max tanks wrap chemical tanks in dynamic tank blocks for more."
  ],
  "quest.31ADB01522DC9347.title": "Chemicals in AE2",
  "quest.31ADB01522DC9347.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mekanism chemicals can live in an AE2 network.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Applied Mekanistics adds chemical cells, like the \"},{\"text\":\"1k ME Chemical Storage Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"appmek:chemical_storage_cell_1k\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Import and export buses move chemicals like items.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4980D71C2A1CDF30.title": "Chemical P2P and QIO",
  "quest.4980D71C2A1CDF30.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Chemical P2P Tunnel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"appmek:chemical_p2p_tunnel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" carries chemicals through a single AE2 channel.\"}]",
    "",
    "And an ME Storage Bus facing a QIO Dashboard reads that QIO frequency into AE2."
  ],
  "task.3A4D5F12F512D6CF.title": "Put a chemical disk in a disk drive",
  "quest.4C1E738B853DD5DB.title": "Chemicals in Refined Storage",
  "quest.4C1E738B853DD5DB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mekanism gases can live in Refined Storage too.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The bridge adds chemical disks from \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"8,192\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" buckets.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"64B Chemical Storage Disk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage_mekanism_integration:64b_chemical_storage_disk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in a disk drive stores them with the rest of the network.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.72FDB9137F8338F4.title": "Covers",
  "quest.72FDB9137F8338F4.quest_subtitle": "Pipes? What pipes?",
  "quest.72FDB9137F8338F4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Osmium nuggets, sawdust and glass make four Empty Covers; craft one with any block for a cover of it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Use it on a transmitter and the line hides behind your wall while it keeps working.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hold a Configurator in wrench mode to see and click the transmitter under a cover.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.69FAA53443B0B9B7.title": "Mekanistic Routers",
  "quest.69FAA53443B0B9B7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Chemical modules for Modular Routers:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Mk1 moves chemicals to or from the block in front\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Mk2 reaches any nearby block\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The Refill Module tops up jetpacks in your inventory, wirelessly\"}]",
    "",
    "The router needs a chemical container in its buffer."
  ],
  "quest.61D4474E5EBB99EE.title": "Recycler",
  "quest.61D4474E5EBB99EE.quest_subtitle": "A trash can with benefits.",
  "quest.61D4474E5EBB99EE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A crusher wrapped in infused alloy, advanced circuits and osmium makes MoreMachine's \"},{\"text\":\"Recycler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekmm:recycler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It eats stone, dirt and substrate: one in six comes out as \"},{\"text\":\"Scrap\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekmm:scrap\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", three in seven for substrate, and the rest is gone.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Osmium Compressor packs \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" scrap into a \"},{\"text\":\"Scrap Box\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekmm:scrap_box\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2968AFB27FA72DE3.title": "Ambient Gas Collector",
  "quest.2968AFB27FA72DE3.quest_subtitle": "Bottled nothing.",
  "quest.2968AFB27FA72DE3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Ambient Gas Collector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekmm:ambient_gas_collector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" draws Unstable Dimensional Gas out of nothing, slowly.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It needs open air right above it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"About a millibucket a second, faster with speed upgrades.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Two atomic alloys, an ultimate pressurized tube, two ultimate chemical tanks, a steel casing and three osmium blocks make it."
  ],
  "quest.1E88B5E18B0792BA.title": "Empty Crystal",
  "quest.1E88B5E18B0792BA.quest_subtitle": "Patience, crystallised.",
  "quest.1E88B5E18B0792BA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Empty Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekmm:empty_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is patience you can hold.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Pressurized Reaction Chamber turns these into one crystal and \"},{\"text\":\"1,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB of nuclear waste:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" Scrap Boxes\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"10,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB of Unstable Dimensional Gas\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"10,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB of liquid D-T fuel\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Sixty-four crystals and antimatter in the Antiprotonic Nucleosynthesizer make one UU Matter.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"ENTRELUMEN switches MoreMachine's replicators off, so UU Matter only buys two decorative dolls.\"}]",
    "",
    "The crystal is the trophy; the rest is bragging."
  ],
  "quest.55BD3683FBEA0D6D.title": "Teleportation Core",
  "quest.55BD3683FBEA0D6D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ender pearls, atomic alloy, gold and a diamond.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Teleportation Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:teleportation_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is the heart of every quantum machine:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Teleporters\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The entangloporter\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"QIO\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The Digital Miner\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2A86E8FD470FDDCC.title": "Teleporter Frame",
  "quest.2A86E8FD470FDDCC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Refined obsidian around refined glowstone: nine \"},{\"text\":\"Teleporter Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:teleporter_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" blocks.\"}]",
    "",
    "Build them into a doorway around an empty space, with the teleporter block as part of the frame."
  ],
  "task.521C874127FD9BA6.title": "Build a teleporter and go through it",
  "quest.2F8F385F077C7A3E.title": "Teleporter",
  "quest.2F8F385F077C7A3E.quest_subtitle": "Now you see me.",
  "quest.2F8F385F077C7A3E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pick a destination on its frequency and walk through.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"1,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J a trip\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Plus \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" per block\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Plus \"},{\"text\":\"10,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" across dimensions\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In this pack the \"},{\"text\":\"Teleporter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:teleporter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has a \"},{\"text\":\"Routing Matrix\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:routing_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" above its core: act III.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.71CA15B14166184F.title": "Portable Teleporter",
  "quest.71CA15B14166184F.quest_subtitle": "Beam me up.",
  "quest.71CA15B14166184F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A core between energy tablets and basic circuits.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Portable Teleporter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:portable_teleporter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" jumps you to any teleporter on its frequency, from wherever you stand, as long as it is charged.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7734F3CA01E08282.title": "Quantum Entangloporter",
  "quest.7734F3CA01E08282.quest_subtitle": "Spooky action at a distance.",
  "quest.7734F3CA01E08282.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two blocks, one inventory, any distance.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Entangloporters on one frequency share items, fluids, chemicals, energy and heat at once.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"At any distance and across dimensions.\"}]",
    "",
    "Set their sides like a machine: power in here, ore out there."
  ],
  "quest.3F26FE59AD7D310A.title": "Wireless Transmission Station",
  "quest.3F26FE59AD7D310A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An entangloporter, a Robit and a supercharged coil go into MoreMachine's \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Transmission Station\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekmm:wireless_transmission_station\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It sends energy, fluids, chemicals and more to blocks linked with its Connector, no transmitters in between, within one dimension."
  ],
  "quest.66C520DFF400128D.title": "QIO Drive Array",
  "quest.66C520DFF400128D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Storage that needs no cables at all.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Quantum Item Orchestration: the \"},{\"text\":\"QIO Drive Array\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:qio_drive_array\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds the drives and everything else reaches it by frequency.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In this pack an \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory Sensor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:inventory_sensor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes the glass's place: act III.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1979979E1A2C4484.title": "QIO or AE2?",
  "quest.1979979E1A2C4484.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"QIO has no channels and no cables, but its first drive already wants four ultimate circuits. AE2 starts cheaper and autocrafts deeper. Pick one main system; the bridges let the others feed it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.47C4442B0614B5A0.title": "QIO Drive",
  "quest.47C4442B0614B5A0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"QIO Drive\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:qio_drive_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds \"},{\"text\":\"16,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" items of up to \"},{\"text\":\"128\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" kinds.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Four ultimate circuits around an ender pearl, lead in the corners.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"An array takes twelve.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.12E90346DFB48D27.title": "Denser drives",
  "quest.12E90346DFB48D27.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Four drives, plutonium and a teleportation core make a Hyper-Dense one (\"},{\"text\":\"128,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" items).\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four of those with plutonium and polonium make a Time-Dilating one (\"},{\"text\":\"1,048,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"); four of those with polonium and antimatter, the \"},{\"text\":\"Supermassive QIO Drive\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:qio_drive_supermassive\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": sixteen billion.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7C607770F2B53FC1.title": "Drives from Extras",
  "quest.7C607770F2B53FC1.quest_subtitle": "Event horizon storage.",
  "quest.7C607770F2B53FC1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mekanism Extras keeps stacking drives.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Four supermassive drives, lead and an antimatter pellet make a \"},{\"text\":\"Collapse QIO Drive\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:qio_drive_collapse\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The same recipe climbs to Gamma, Black Hole and the \"},{\"text\":\"Singularity QIO Drive\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism_extras:qio_drive_singularity\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0B9671877CD95815.title": "QIO Dashboard",
  "quest.0B9671877CD95815.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"QIO Dashboard\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:qio_dashboard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shows, searches and crafts from the whole frequency.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Lead, ender pearls and a teleportation core make it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Its crafting windows pull straight from storage.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.27D4F630282E2F33.title": "Portable QIO Dashboard",
  "quest.27D4F630282E2F33.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The whole base in your pocket.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A dashboard ringed with polonium, a teleportation core below: the \"},{\"text\":\"Portable QIO Dashboard\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:portable_qio_dashboard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4D91D5E9A9036EE6.title": "Importer and exporter",
  "quest.4D91D5E9A9036EE6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Machines fed straight from storage.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Place a \"},{\"text\":\"QIO Importer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:qio_importer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a chest and its contents move into the frequency.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"QIO Exporter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:qio_exporter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pushes filtered items out into a block.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6D87EB6875CDE3DB.title": "QIO Redstone Adapter",
  "quest.6D87EB6875CDE3DB.quest_subtitle": "Redstone, now with quantum.",
  "quest.6D87EB6875CDE3DB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Switch a farm off when the store is full.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"QIO Redstone Adapter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:qio_redstone_adapter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" watches one item in the frequency and gives a signal past a count.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4154EE7A50A4FAC8.title": "Place a Robit on a Chargepad",
  "quest.2B9C871772346B23.title": "Robit",
  "quest.2B9C871772346B23.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Steel, atomic alloy, refined obsidian and two energy tablets around a personal chest.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Placed on a \"},{\"text\":\"Chargepad\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:chargepad\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the \"},{\"text\":\"Robit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:robit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" follows you, picks up drops, crafts, smelts and repairs, and goes home to charge when it runs dry.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.364ECDE9349AD343.title": "A new coat of paint",
  "quest.364ECDE9349AD343.quest_subtitle": "Fashion before function.",
  "quest.364ECDE9349AD343.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You changed your Robit's skin.\"}]",
    "",
    "It did not ask, but it looks happier."
  ],
  "reward.0287D52F3566A9AA.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.03BFBDEE2B611179.title": "Wireless Charging Station",
  "quest.03BFBDEE2B611179.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It charges what you carry and wear nearby, Curios included.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Robit, an ultimate energy cube and a teleportation core go into MoreMachine's \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Charging Station\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekmm:wireless_charging_station\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.679EE6710CBD36EA.title": "Digital Miner",
  "quest.679EE6710CBD36EA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It mines whatever its filters name, up to \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" blocks out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Robit, two sorters and two teleportation cores make a \"},{\"text\":\"Digital Miner\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:digital_miner\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In this pack a \"},{\"text\":\"Spectral Lens\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:spectral_lens\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes the circuit's place, so it is act IV.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.49C447AD2B59E38E.title": "Filters and upgrades",
  "quest.49C447AD2B59E38E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Tag filters for ores catch every mod's ore at once. The miner takes \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" ticks a block before upgrades, and silk touch costs twelve times the energy: speed and energy upgrades pay off here.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.44EB1E0FBFC15996.title": "Stone Generator Upgrade",
  "quest.44EB1E0FBFC15996.quest_subtitle": "Filling holes since forever.",
  "quest.44EB1E0FBFC15996.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Water, lava and infused alloy make a \"},{\"text\":\"Stone Generator Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_stone_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "In the Digital Miner, filters that replace mined blocks with stone or cobblestone stop using up items: no holes under the base, for free."
  ],
  "task.6EDA72F27463FB1C.title": "Craft a Dimensional Stabilizer and an Anchor Upgrade",
  "quest.021E60BA01115D24.title": "Keeping it loaded",
  "quest.021E60BA01115D24.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Machines only run in loaded chunks.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_anchor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Anchor Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:upgrade_anchor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" keeps its own machine's chunk loaded.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Dimensional Stabilizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:dimensional_stabilizer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" loads the chunks you pick around it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Load only what must run alone."
  ],
  "task.6A2066374F002EBD.title": "Build a Seismic Vibrator and Reader and read the ground",
  "quest.1CB8EC04D9B64321.title": "Seismic survey",
  "quest.1CB8EC04D9B64321.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pick the miner's spot before you pay for it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A powered \"},{\"text\":\"Seismic Vibrator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:seismic_vibrator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shakes the ground.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:seismic_reader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Seismic Reader\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:seismic_reader\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" used beside it lists every layer down to bedrock.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7BC44D289E1C6E3C.title": "Laser Tractor Beam",
  "quest.7BC44D289E1C6E3C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A laser quarry, no miner needed.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"A laser amplifier with a personal chest on top: the \"},{\"text\":\"Laser Tractor Beam\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:laser_tractor_beam\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It merges and redirects beams.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It keeps the drops of what they break.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7E392FDE02536764.title": "Get out of my spectrum",
  "quest.7E392FDE02536764.quest_subtitle": "Shields up.",
  "quest.7E392FDE02536764.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You blocked a laser with a shield.\"}]",
    "",
    "Not the intended use of a shield, not the intended use of a laser."
  ],
  "reward.6DEF77EA7F49997F.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.535746100461D7D7.title": "Crispy",
  "quest.535746100461D7D7.quest_subtitle": "Well done. Very well done.",
  "quest.535746100461D7D7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A laser killed you.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The beam reaches \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" blocks; stand farther than that next time.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.140D99DCF52F9767.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.22BECC4BB3890D57.title": "Paxel",
  "quest.22BECC4BB3890D57.quest_subtitle": "Pickaxe, axe, shovel. One slot.",
  "quest.22BECC4BB3890D57.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An axe, a pickaxe and a shovel of the same material on two sticks: a paxel.\"}]",
    "",
    "Mekanism Tools makes one for every vanilla material and its own osmium, bronze, steel, lapis and refined metals.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Osmium Paxel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanismtools:osmium_paxel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is a fine start.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.63410A90CB09B063.title": "Craft any Mekanism Tools armor piece",
  "quest.6A64E9D3DE5163E4.title": "More armor types",
  "quest.6A64E9D3DE5163E4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mekanism Tools armor, a set per metal:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Osmium, bronze and steel\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Lapis\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Refined glowstone and refined obsidian\"}]",
    "",
    "Each comes with tools and a shield. Bronze and steel sit between iron and diamond."
  ],
  "task.2386E7F26311C284.title": "Wear a piece of refined obsidian armor",
  "quest.75B83911CB666CA7.title": "Better than netherite",
  "quest.75B83911CB666CA7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Refined obsidian armor is the toughest set Mekanism Tools makes, above netherite.\"}]",
    "",
    "Refined obsidian comes from the Osmium Compressor."
  ],
  "quest.60405B00C5DADA2B.title": "Loved by piglins",
  "quest.60405B00C5DADA2B.quest_subtitle": "Brighter than gold, and they know it.",
  "quest.60405B00C5DADA2B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You wore refined glowstone armor.\"}]",
    "",
    "It glows brighter than gold, and piglins are very impressed."
  ],
  "reward.1CAD7D74CFD179DF.title": "Secret found",
  "task.51B45AF4ACC2F588.title": "Craft any Mekanism Tools shield",
  "quest.5CB5EBB88BD36F2B.title": "Not enough shielding",
  "quest.5CB5EBB88BD36F2B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A vanilla shield wrapped in ingots of a Mekanism Tools metal: a tougher shield that still takes banners.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.279A270193972EF0.title": "Atomic Disassembler",
  "quest.279A270193972EF0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A powered tool for every block, and a weapon too.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Atomic and infused alloy, refined obsidian and an energy tablet make it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.mode\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" switches its digging between normal, slow, fast and off.\"}]",
    "",
    "The Meka-Tool starts from one."
  ],
  "quest.5806AB6DDADBB8C8.title": "Jetpack",
  "quest.5806AB6DDADBB8C8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hydrogen on your back, and you fly.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In this pack the \"},{\"text\":\"Jetpack\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:jetpack\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has a \"},{\"text\":\"Power Regulator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:power_regulator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in its nozzle (act III) and burns \"},{\"text\":\"2.5\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB of hydrogen per tick instead of \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\", like every jetpack here: its \"},{\"text\":\"24,000\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB last eight minutes of thrust.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.chest_mode\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" cycles regular, hover and off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4F745D11A483BCB2.title": "Armored Jetpack",
  "quest.4F745D11A483BCB2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The same flight, with a chestplate's armor.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Bronze, a steel block and diamond dust on a jetpack make the \"},{\"text\":\"Armored Jetpack\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:jetpack_armored\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It flies and burns the same.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It protects like a chestplate.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1C956AD8E29B52C3.title": "HDPE Reinforced Elytra",
  "quest.1C956AD8E29B52C3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An elytra with HDPE sheets and atomic alloy: the \"},{\"text\":\"HDPE Reinforced Elytra\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:hdpe_elytra\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" glides like the original.\"}]",
    "",
    "With polonium and antimatter it becomes the MekaSuit's Elytra Unit."
  ],
  "task.6ACBD1D5C4C28017.title": "Craft a Scuba Mask and Tank",
  "quest.105257561073EEA6.title": "Scuba gear",
  "quest.105257561073EEA6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Scuba Mask\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:scuba_mask\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Scuba Tank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:scuba_tank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" of oxygen let you breathe underwater.\"}]",
    "",
    "With your air full, effects that milk would clear wear off ten times as fast, good ones too.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.chest_mode\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens the valve.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.77C0D89C097DA818.title": "Craft a Flamethrower",
  "quest.2ECEE5427C87F580.title": "Flamethrower",
  "quest.2ECEE5427C87F580.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Flamethrower\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:flamethrower\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" burns hydrogen.\"}]",
    "",
    "In heat mode it smelts what it hits: sand turns to glass where it lies, and raw ore left on the floor comes back as ingots.",
    "",
    "Other modes just burn dropped items."
  ],
  "task.001B133EFC0CB720.title": "Craft Free Runners",
  "quest.2B8D6B858A96EABA.title": "Free Runners",
  "quest.2B8D6B858A96EABA.quest_subtitle": "Free falling, minus the falling.",
  "quest.2B8D6B858A96EABA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Charged \"},{\"text\":\"Free Runners\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:free_runners\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" absorb all fall damage at \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J per point and step up half a block more.\"}]",
    "",
    "Armored ones add a steel block, bronze and diamond dust."
  ],
  "quest.0DCAD9D923C5CDCC.title": "Electric Bow",
  "quest.0DCAD9D923C5CDCC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A bow that never wears out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"String, infused alloy and an energy tablet make the \"},{\"text\":\"Electric Bow\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:electric_bow\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"It draws on its charge: \"},{\"text\":\"120\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" J a shot.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Ten times that in flame mode, for burning arrows.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.31B91F6DC3C0DCC5.title": "Liquid lunch",
  "quest.31B91F6DC3C0DCC5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Any food, drunk from your belt.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Nutritional Liquifier\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:nutritional_liquifier\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns any food into nutritional paste, \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB per hunger point.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:canteen\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Canteen\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:canteen\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" carries it and feeds you.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.221194AE890F34AD.title": "Tasty paste",
  "quest.221194AE890F34AD.quest_subtitle": "Chef's kiss. Probably.",
  "quest.221194AE890F34AD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You filled a Canteen to the brim with nutritional paste.\"}]",
    "",
    "Nobody said it tasted good."
  ],
  "reward.51287D1418FA3026.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.2AA764325E9BCC16.title": "Modification Station",
  "quest.2AA764325E9BCC16.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"HDPE, ultimate circuits, polonium and a chest on a steel casing.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Modification Station\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:modification_station\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" installs and removes modules on the MekaSuit and the Meka-Tool.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.315075D52E32C2A3.title": "Suit controls",
  "quest.315075D52E32C2A3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.module_tweaker\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens the module tweaker to toggle modules on the fly. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.head_mode\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.chest_mode\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.legs_mode\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.mekanism.feet_mode\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" cycle each piece's mode.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.38DEB312C5BB3ED8.title": "Meka-Tool",
  "quest.38DEB312C5BB3ED8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Meka-Tool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:meka_tool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" grows with every module you give it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"An atomic disassembler with a configurator, HDPE, ultimate circuits, polonium and an induction cell make it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Modules make it dig faster, vein mine, take silk touch or fortune, and teleport.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3B4B14B5E1EC074D.title": "MekaSuit",
  "quest.3B4B14B5E1EC074D.quest_subtitle": "Netherite, but make it electric.",
  "quest.3B4B14B5E1EC074D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It runs on power and absorbs damage with it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each piece is a netherite piece in HDPE with polonium and an induction cell; in this pack an \"},{\"text\":\"Engineering Luminosity\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:luminosity_engineering\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes the circuit's place, so the suit is act VI.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.2F1AD0A8D6D9AC55.title": "Wear the MekaSuit and hold a Meka-Tool",
  "quest.3DAD731E19FA8CED.title": "Mekanist",
  "quest.3DAD731E19FA8CED.quest_subtitle": "Everything you built, worn at once.",
  "quest.3DAD731E19FA8CED.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The whole MekaSuit on and a Meka-Tool in hand.\"}]",
    "",
    "Every chapter of Mekanism went into it: alloys, reactors, polonium, and antimatter for the Gravitational Modulating Unit."
  ],
  "quest.635123388EFF19BD.title": "True dedication",
  "quest.635123388EFF19BD.quest_subtitle": "Every slot, every module.",
  "quest.635123388EFF19BD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You installed the maximum of every module in the MekaSuit and the Meka-Tool.\"}]",
    "",
    "There is nothing left to add, and it shows."
  ],
  "reward.722CE16547CA06B0.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.69E5BBA8648BAE2A.title": "Module Base",
  "quest.69E5BBA8648BAE2A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Bronze nuggets, tin and an HDPE sheet make two \"},{\"text\":\"Module Bases\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Every module starts from one plus its own parts.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"The suit or the tool, whichever comes first, is enough to begin.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.49C3B132C7143FCC.title": "Movement modules",
  "quest.49C3B132C7143FCC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Locomotive Boosting\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_locomotive_boosting_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" speeds up sprinting and \"},{\"text\":\"Hydraulic Propulsion\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_hydraulic_propulsion_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" jumps higher.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Jetpack Unit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_jetpack_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" eats a whole jetpack and flies on hydrogen (\"},{\"text\":\"2.5\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\" mB/t in this pack).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.40A9FE85A7C68752.title": "Mining modules",
  "quest.40A9FE85A7C68752.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three modules turn the Meka-Tool into a mine.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_excavation_escalation_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Excavation Escalation\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_excavation_escalation_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" digs faster, up to four stacked.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_vein_mining_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Vein Mining\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_vein_mining_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes whole veins and trees.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_fortune_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Ore Refinement Unit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_fortune_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is fortune up to III.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Note: \",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fortune and silk touch cannot share the tool.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0B83F2430051E646.title": "Survival modules",
  "quest.0B83F2430051E646.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three modules that keep you alive:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Radiation Shielding\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_radiation_shielding_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on every piece keeps a meltdown survivable\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Inhalation Purification\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_inhalation_purification_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" blocks the potion effects you pick\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"},{\"text\":\"Nutritional Injection\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:module_nutritional_injection_unit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" feeds you paste\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7E89B71F21D7CF21.title": "Fireworks over the plant",
  "quest.7E89B71F21D7CF21.quest_subtitle": "For no reason at all.",
  "quest.7E89B71F21D7CF21.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You can fly now; the sky deserves a show.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: just the bangs."
  ],
  "image.44C1C07557B048DF.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"QUANTUM\",\"color\":\"#7F6FE0\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.1418181D018662FA.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"LOGISTICS · ARMORY\",\"color\":\"#9FB8C8\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.7095CA94D278E919.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MINING\",\"color\":\"#8C6A44\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.2CECD18AD27BA1EF.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The MekaSuit bay\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
  "image.30EFA728EA2CBF18.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Armory\",\"color\":\"#F3E7C6\"}]",
  "image.3A133C3EE0C3B01D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MEKANISM\",\"color\":\"#E6EEF2\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.07918259A031AAAB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Logistics and gear\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
  "image.5E85D712763A7441.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.4CF49292AB1C3428.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Basics\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
  "image.72CB74D0D5C95964.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Energy and reactors\",\"color\":\"#7FD4F0\"}]",
  "chapter.0F14CDFA7E1FF965.title": "Modern Industrialization · Electricity",
  "chapter.0F14CDFA7E1FF965.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Rubber, cables and circuits, the turbine and the assembler, the electric blast furnace and a refinery that ends in diesel."
  ],
  "quest.347E05CC70B27244.title": "Rubber",
  "quest.347E05CC70B27244.quest_subtitle": "Every machine asks for it. Every one.",
  "quest.347E05CC70B27244.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Coke dust and 100 mB of water in the Mixer make 200 mB of raw synthetic oil; the Steam Blast Furnace cooks it into synthetic oil, and paper with 100 mB of it makes two \"},{\"text\":\"Rubber Sheets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:rubber_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". The Mixer makes two paper from wood pulp and water.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Automate it early: cables, circuits, conveyors and the first hull all want rubber.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5B0213FF43FB35E9.title": "Cables",
  "quest.5B0213FF43FB35E9.quest_desc": [
    "The wiremill turns a plate into two wires. Three wires between six rubber sheets make three cables, by hand or in the Packer. Copper, tin and silver are LV: 32 EU per tick of tier, up to 256 EU/t into one network."
  ],
  "quest.718F567E0B439E0F.title": "R, L and C",
  "quest.718F567E0B439E0F.quest_subtitle": "The C in RLC.",
  "quest.718F567E0B439E0F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Resistors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:resistor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": copper fine wire, coal dust and paper. \"},{\"text\":\"Capacitors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:capacitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": gold plates, copper wire and rubber. \"},{\"text\":\"Inductors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:inductor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": eight copper wires around a steel rod. Every analog circuit takes all three.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.24986923801E5674.title": "Analog Circuit",
  "quest.24986923801E5674.quest_subtitle": "RLC, the whole alphabet.",
  "quest.24986923801E5674.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An inductor, two resistors, two capacitors and three copper wires on an \"},{\"text\":\"Analog Circuit Board\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:analog_circuit_board\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which is a copper plate between two rubber sheets. The Electric Age runs on these.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6CAFC4E978B2318D.title": "Redstone Battery",
  "quest.6CAFC4E978B2318D.quest_desc": [
    "Lead and antimony dust mix into battery alloy; its plates and curved plates, redstone and two tin cables make the battery. Antimony is MI's own ore, below height 64."
  ],
  "quest.7DA382F1EC03A522.title": "Basic Machine Hull",
  "quest.7DA382F1EC03A522.quest_desc": [
    "An analog circuit, three tin cables and two redstone batteries on a steel machine casing. Every LV machine is built around one, and its hull decides which cables it accepts."
  ],
  "quest.5066D5824BDC4EF5.title": "Motors",
  "quest.5066D5824BDC4EF5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A magnetic steel rod, two steel rods, two tin cables and four copper wires. The magnetic rod takes eight redstone around a steel rod by hand; the \"},{\"text\":\"Polarizer\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"4690DCF1D93992F4\"}},{\"text\":\" makes it from the rod alone.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.06A9F570B460CEDF.title": "LV Steam Turbine",
  "quest.06A9F570B460CEDF.quest_subtitle": "Better than solar panels.",
  "quest.06A9F570B460CEDF.quest_desc": [
    "An analog circuit, two motors, a hull, two fluid pipes, two tin rotors and a tin cable. It turns 1 mB of steam into 1 EU, up to 32 per tick, and hands it only to cables on its output side. One EU is worth 10 FE in this pack."
  ],
  "quest.459B5981597ADD6D.title": "Pistons, pumps, belts, arms",
  "quest.459B5981597ADD6D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four parts built on motors: the \"},{\"text\":\"Piston\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:piston\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds steel plates and a gear, the \"},{\"text\":\"Pump\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:pump\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" tin rotors and fluid pipes, the \"},{\"text\":\"Conveyor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:conveyor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" six rubber sheets, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Robot Arm\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:robot_arm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" a piston and a circuit.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.48D47667F4C39134.title": "Assembler",
  "quest.48D47667F4C39134.quest_subtitle": "Avengers, assemble.",
  "quest.48D47667F4C39134.quest_desc": [
    "Four robot arms, two analog circuits, two conveyors and a hull. It automates almost every crafting recipe of the mod, often at a better yield, and holds up to three recipes at once with locked slots. Put hulls, circuits, motors, pistons, robot arms and conveyors on assemblers first."
  ],
  "quest.4690DCF1D93992F4.title": "Polarizer",
  "quest.4690DCF1D93992F4.quest_subtitle": "One recipe (+2) to rule them all.",
  "quest.4690DCF1D93992F4.quest_desc": [
    "Tin wires, two inductors, two tin cables and a hull. It magnetizes steel rods without the eight redstone, and it is the only source of magnetic cupronickel wire, which the blast furnace, the electric furnace and the electrolyzer need."
  ],
  "quest.4CEEEC831ADE613B.title": "Coils and heatproof casings",
  "quest.4CEEEC831ADE613B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Copper and nickel dust mix into cupronickel; eight of its cables ring into a \"},{\"text\":\"Cupronickel Coil\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:cupronickel_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Invar plates around an invar gear make a \"},{\"text\":\"Heatproof Machine Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:heatproof_machine_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3E3A5EE58B8536B4.title": "Electric Blast Furnace",
  "quest.3E3A5EE58B8536B4.quest_subtitle": "Electric best friend.",
  "quest.3E3A5EE58B8536B4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Seven magnetic cupronickel wires, a hull and a blast furnace. A heatproof layer, two hollow layers of coils and another heatproof layer; controller and hatches on the top or bottom layer, and an \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Input Hatch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:lv_energy_input_hatch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to feed it. Cupronickel coils allow recipes up to 32 EU/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.05200862F8FA217A.title": "Aluminum",
  "quest.05200862F8FA217A.quest_desc": [
    "Bauxite dust in the blast furnace gives an aluminum nugget every 10 seconds at 32 EU/t; a block of bauxite gives an ingot. Bauxite is MI's own ore, below height 32. Almost Unified hands out Immersive Engineering's ingot."
  ],
  "quest.7B18F51947A578AF.title": "Silicon",
  "quest.7B18F51947A578AF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Quartz dust and coke dust in the blast furnace make silicon dust at 32 EU/t. Smelt it into ingots and press them into \"},{\"text\":\"Silicon Plates\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:silicon_plate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for diodes and transistors.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5AAC305B1302996A.title": "Diodes and transistors",
  "quest.5AAC305B1302996A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Both are steel plates, silicon and electrum fine wire: a \"},{\"text\":\"Diode\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:diode\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds glass and gives one, three steel over three silicon plates give two \"},{\"text\":\"Transistors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:transistor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Electrum wire comes from the wiremill like copper.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.096E7B421A9F292A.title": "Electronic Circuit",
  "quest.096E7B421A9F292A.quest_subtitle": "The power of silicon.",
  "quest.096E7B421A9F292A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four analog circuits, two diodes and two transistors on an \"},{\"text\":\"Electronic Circuit Board\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:electronic_circuit_board\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": aluminum plates, electrum cables, an analog board and a redstone battery. The centrifuge, the chemical reactor, the distillery and the electrolyzer all need them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.18D7085B81FCC178.title": "Large motor and pump",
  "quest.18D7085B81FCC178.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six motors, two aluminum rods and an electronic circuit make a \"},{\"text\":\"Large Motor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:large_motor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; three pumps, three aluminum rotors, a large motor and two circuits make a \"},{\"text\":\"Large Pump\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:large_pump\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Every aluminum-age machine takes one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1E9963A7B9C3EA10.title": "Distillery",
  "quest.1E9963A7B9C3EA10.quest_subtitle": "Al Capone approves.",
  "quest.1E9963A7B9C3EA10.quest_desc": [
    "Glass, a fluid pipe, two large pumps, a hull, two electronic circuits and an electrum cable. It splits a fluid into one lighter part per recipe: a bucket of crude oil gives 500 mB of sulfuric light fuel, 200 of sulfuric heavy fuel or 300 of sulfuric naphtha."
  ],
  "quest.151D921ED00F5879.title": "Advanced Machine Hull",
  "quest.151D921ED00F5879.quest_desc": [
    "An electronic circuit, two silicon batteries and three electrum cables on an advanced machine casing, aluminum plates around a basic hull. Right-click a machine with it and the machine turns MV: it then connects to MV cables only."
  ],
  "quest.1E682E77776C3BD2.title": "Oil Drilling Rig",
  "quest.1E682E77776C3BD2.quest_subtitle": "Freedom, by the barrel.",
  "quest.1E682E77776C3BD2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four steel large plates, an electronic circuit, two large pumps, an advanced hull and a pipe. Walled in steel casings, steel pipe casings and chains, it eats \"},{\"text\":\"Aluminum Drills\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:aluminum_drill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" under bedrock: 500 mB of crude oil every 10 seconds at 8 EU/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.475D64A24D3E1891.title": "Sweeten the fuel",
  "quest.475D64A24D3E1891.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Electrolyzer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:electrolyzer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" splits 3,000 mB of water into 2,000 of hydrogen and 1,000 of oxygen. The \"},{\"text\":\"Chemical Reactor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:chemical_reactor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" spends 2,000 mB of hydrogen to clean 12,000 of a sulfuric fuel, and gives back sulfuric acid.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.17E89ABAAF3DE720.title": "Diesel",
  "quest.17E89ABAAF3DE720.quest_subtitle": "Black gold, refined.",
  "quest.17E89ABAAF3DE720.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A thousand mB of heavy fuel and 5,000 of light fuel mix into 6,000 of diesel, 400 EU per mB. The \"},{\"text\":\"MV Diesel Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:mv_diesel_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" burns it only when something draws power, up to 256 EU/t, and connects to MV cables only.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A fully heated \"},{\"text\":\"Large Steam Boiler\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5AB3105DF0C1755B\"}},{\"text\":\" gets about twice the energy from the same fuel, if it never idles.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4216F075F5BC7246.title": "MV cables",
  "quest.4216F075F5BC7246.quest_desc": [
    "Electrum and cupronickel cables are MV: up to 1,024 EU/t into a network, four times LV. Single-block LV machines won't connect to them; transformers or an advanced hull bridge the tiers."
  ],
  "quest.78CF4610D3A41AA2.title": "LV to MV Transformer",
  "quest.78CF4610D3A41AA2.quest_desc": [
    "A basic hull, four tin cables and an electrum cable. Five faces take LV in and one gives MV out; its twin, MV to LV, does the reverse."
  ],
  "quest.7927054B7722F1B9.title": "LV Storage Unit",
  "quest.7927054B7722F1B9.quest_desc": [
    "Six redstone batteries, two battery alloy plates and a basic hull. It holds 3.2 million EU and buffers a turbine against machines that all start at once."
  ],
  "quest.1527A2BF0F988F4D.title": "Portable Storage Unit",
  "quest.1527A2BF0F988F4D.quest_desc": [
    "Battery alloy plates, tin cables and an analog circuit. It stores nothing until you load batteries into it; right-click a storage unit to charge it or drain it, and carry the energy wherever you go."
  ],
  "quest.0D7382B6FA622437.title": "LV Diesel Generator",
  "quest.0D7382B6FA622437.quest_desc": [
    "A hull, two pumps, two tin gears, three tin cables and an analog circuit. It burns any fluid fuel up to 64 EU/t: creosote from the coke oven already gives 160 EU per mB."
  ],
  "quest.65B117C8372168A4.title": "MV Steam Turbine",
  "quest.65B117C8372168A4.quest_subtitle": "Better than windmills.",
  "quest.65B117C8372168A4.quest_desc": [
    "An advanced hull, an electronic circuit, two aluminum rotors, two large motors and an electrum cable. The same steam, 128 EU/t, on MV cables."
  ],
  "quest.734C765B94E5D3AE.title": "Electric workshop",
  "quest.734C765B94E5D3AE.quest_desc": [
    "Electric versions of the steam machines, on hulls and motors; the macerator spins an invar rotary blade. They work like the steam ones but overclock their recipes up to 32 EU/t, faster the longer they run."
  ],
  "quest.2A12201D1CB5E042.title": "Configurable Chest",
  "quest.2A12201D1CB5E042.quest_desc": [
    "A steel casing, two motors, two hoppers and four analog circuits make four. Twenty-seven slots you can lock and cap, with auto-eject: the buffer between a line and its storage."
  ],
  "quest.390997195BA43BB0.title": "Configurable Tank",
  "quest.390997195BA43BB0.quest_desc": [
    "Aluminum tanks, pumps, analog circuits and a steel casing make four. Nine slots of 16 buckets each with auto-eject, for lines that juggle several fluids."
  ],
  "quest.17F903BAFABAECE5.title": "Redstone Control Module",
  "quest.17F903BAFABAECE5.quest_desc": [
    "Redstone, a torch, a capacitor, two resistors, two inductors and an analog board. Set it in your hand, then slot it into a machine or a multiblock controller: redstone decides when it runs."
  ],
  "quest.7B98A313BAEA05F1.title": "Basic Upgrade",
  "quest.7B98A313BAEA05F1.quest_subtitle": "Machine speedup.",
  "quest.7B98A313BAEA05F1.quest_desc": [
    "Only the assembler makes them: two conveyors, four motors, two robot arms and an analog board give four. Each one in a machine's upgrade slot raises its overclock cap by 2 EU/t; a stack counts whole."
  ],
  "quest.372085A3966DC0B6.title": "Pipe Config Card",
  "quest.372085A3966DC0B6.quest_desc": [
    "Glass panes, a capacitor, two resistors, two inductors and an analog board. Sneak-use it on an item pipe to copy its filter, use it on another to paste; held in the offhand it configures every item pipe you place."
  ],
  "quest.75246B8BC04859E1.title": "Lubricant",
  "quest.75246B8BC04859E1.quest_subtitle": "Grease is the word.",
  "quest.75246B8BC04859E1.quest_desc": [
    "Redstone and 500 mB of creosote mix into 500 mB of lubricant. Right-click an electric machine with a container of it: each 25 mB is one tick of overclock efficiency, and the cutting machine sips 1 mB per cut."
  ],
  "quest.21B97F891578A2BD.title": "Soldering Alloy",
  "quest.21B97F891578A2BD.quest_desc": [
    "Tin and lead dust mix into soldering alloy; any blast furnace melts a dust into 90 mB at 4 EU/t. The assembler uses it for better parts: two gears from four plates and a ring, a rotor from four blades and a ring, no bolts."
  ],
  "quest.5AB3105DF0C1755B.title": "Large Steam Boiler",
  "quest.5AB3105DF0C1755B.quest_subtitle": "Kiss your fuel goodbye.",
  "quest.5AB3105DF0C1755B.quest_desc": [
    "Bronze plated bricks, two analog circuits, a bronze boiler and curved plates. One heatproof layer, then three of bronze plated bricks with two bronze pipe casings in the middle; controller on the second layer, hatches on the bottom. Fully heated it makes 256 mB of steam per tick."
  ],
  "quest.480D294DD7BEBE4E.title": "Advanced Large Steam Boiler",
  "quest.480D294DD7BEBE4E.quest_desc": [
    "A large steam boiler with four pumps, two large pumps and two electronic circuits. Bigger, and up to 1,024 mB of steam per tick."
  ],
  "quest.48BB2E658CF26A65.title": "Large Tank",
  "quest.48BB2E658CF26A65.quest_desc": [
    "Steel tanks, pumps, tin rotors and a steel casing. Its size is chosen in the controller, and it stores 64 buckets per block of the structure, sides included. Break the controller and the fluid is gone."
  ],
  "quest.53BF48993AB2C569.title": "Electric Quarry",
  "quest.53BF48993AB2C569.quest_subtitle": "Resources go brrr.",
  "quest.53BF48993AB2C569.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Steam Quarry's shape with power instead of steam. In this pack two \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from the Twilight Forest replace two of its large motors, next to a robot arm, electronic circuits, a steam quarry and an advanced hull: act IV.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5AA0D688CBDB6575.title": "Steel and gold drills",
  "quest.5AA0D688CBDB6575.quest_desc": [
    "Two motors, iron gears, item pipes, a tin cable and an analog circuit around a drill head make four. In the Electric Quarry a steel drill brings bauxite, antimony, lead, nickel, salt and gems; a gold drill digs up the Nether, ancient debris included."
  ],
  "quest.40C6B59575168D85.title": "Centrifuge",
  "quest.40C6B59575168D85.quest_subtitle": "Actually, it's centripetal.",
  "quest.40C6B59575168D85.quest_desc": [
    "Four large motors, a large pump, electrum cables, a hull and a circuit. It spins coal dust into carbon dust: in the blast furnace four iron dusts and a carbon dust give five steel, and two quartz dusts and one carbon two silicon."
  ],
  "quest.7E917E0D3F56C2BD.title": "Diesel Jetpack",
  "quest.7E917E0D3F56C2BD.quest_subtitle": "Ely... we meant jetpack.",
  "quest.7E917E0D3F56C2BD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pumps, motors, aluminum rotors, an aluminum tank and a circuit; in this pack a Mekanism \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" too, act III. It burns any fluid fuel, faster with stronger fuel, and turns on with \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.modern_industrialization.toggle_flight\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"This pack makes every jetpack pay 2.5 times its fuel: 2.5 mB per tick in the air and 5 while climbing, so a bucket lasts 20 seconds aloft. Stronger fuel flies faster for the same millibuckets.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5A013FE12BFC14B3.title": "Rubber helmet and boots",
  "quest.5A013FE12BFC14B3.quest_desc": [
    "Five and four rubber sheets. The boots take fall damage and the helmet takes hits from flying into walls, both paid in their own durability: made for the jetpack."
  ],
  "quest.6815B901AAEE21B7.title": "Diesel Mining Drill",
  "quest.6815B901AAEE21B7.quest_subtitle": "Through the walls of Ba Sing Se.",
  "quest.6815B901AAEE21B7.quest_desc": [
    "An aluminum drill head, invar rotary blades, motors, a pump, an aluminum tank and analog circuits. Fill it with any fluid fuel, which also sets its speed; sneak-use swaps Silk Touch and Fortune III."
  ],
  "quest.6A9E672D5673C8DD.title": "Run lines nonstop",
  "quest.6A9E672D5673C8DD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Electric machines speed up the longer they work and lose it when they stop. Run lines all the time into buffers and let storage pull from the buffers; MI's own guide advises against driving it on demand from AE2 or Refined Storage.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.637EECE644D817CC.title": "One-way power",
  "quest.637EECE644D817CC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"MI cables feed blocks of any mod but only draw from MI machines, and only MI cables power MI machines. At 10 FE per EU, MI power can run the rest of your base; the rest of your base cannot run MI.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6874DD30A1018358.title": "Grey tooltip, better yield",
  "quest.6874DD30A1018358.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Parts whose tooltip says 'Has an Assembler recipe with better yield' pay to automate: the assembler makes 12 resistors where the grid makes 3, and 4 capacitors or inductors where it makes 1.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.371BA2A6C08605FD.title": "Big boilers hate idling",
  "quest.371BA2A6C08605FD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Large Steam Boiler burns fuel eight times faster than a furnace, and 80% of the heat it doesn't turn into steam is lost. Size it to run at full output, with a large tank as buffer, or it wastes most of its fuel.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6F5C8C6C82BBC09E.title": "EU per millibucket",
  "quest.6F5C8C6C82BBC09E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Crude oil gives 16 EU per mB, naphtha 80, creosote and light fuel 160, heavy fuel 240, biodiesel 250, diesel 400 and boosted diesel 800. Refining always pays.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.69874F86EFF1BAE5.title": "Which recipe, machine?",
  "quest.69874F86EFF1BAE5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"When the same inputs fit two recipes, lock an output slot to the product you want: the machine then only runs the recipe that makes it. It is also how one assembler keeps three recipes apart.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3A64172454C92C6F.title": "More than meets the eye",
  "quest.3A64172454C92C6F.quest_subtitle": "Transformers, roll out.",
  "quest.3A64172454C92C6F.quest_desc": [
    "You put an LV to MV transformer in a crafting grid and it came out the other way around: MV to LV."
  ],
  "reward.6E8F26075DD79CB9.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.47D52622D301F2E9.title": "Timber",
  "quest.47D52622D301F2E9.quest_subtitle": "A texas-sized lumberjack.",
  "quest.47D52622D301F2E9.quest_desc": [
    "You built the Diesel Chainsaw: rubber, invar rotary blades, motors and an aluminum tank, for felling trees in style."
  ],
  "reward.13B5CD3F47D647A7.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.3836309868494294.title": "Rubber for the common store",
  "quest.3836309868494294.quest_subtitle": "Nobody ever has enough.",
  "quest.3836309868494294.quest_desc": [
    "Sixty-four rubber sheets. Every cable, circuit board and conveyor on the server starts with them."
  ],
  "image.31955F5396CF4BED.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Cables and power\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.4C2599386E8EA3A0.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Workshop\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.6B73A784610A628A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Multiblocks\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.74F57EB16A929816.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MV and diesel gear\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.00C5028979F56EE0.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Modern Industrialization\\nElectricity\",\"color\":\"#FFF1DE\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.32C45D74CB05CBDB.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.6A9C188C5F39900F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Steam\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.4D5D3CD02169B6B6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Digital\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.57B8C59E6BB44272.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Endgame\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.107B0E185100D1C1.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"wire  wind  step up\",\"color\":\"#BFA58A\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.29A3D45608D2C0F0.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"LV  32 EU/t\",\"color\":\"#C87533\"}]",
  "image.35A903C7228FF15E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MV  128 EU/t\",\"color\":\"#E3C75A\"}]",
  "chapter.5A47F14BD415B982.title": "Modern Industrialization · Steam",
  "chapter.5A47F14BD415B982.chapter_subtitle": [
    "From the Forge Hammer to the Steam Quarry: bronze, boilers, the coke oven and the first steel."
  ],
  "quest.0DA5E26857F9CA09.title": "Forge Hammer",
  "quest.0DA5E26857F9CA09.quest_subtitle": "Your first machine has no motor.",
  "quest.0DA5E26857F9CA09.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three heavy weighted pressure plates over four iron ingots. It works by hand: an iron ore block gives 2 raw iron, 3 with a \"},{\"text\":\"Hammer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:iron_hammer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in its tool slot, and ingots become plates, rods, rings and bolts.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copper ore gives 5 raw copper in it, 8 with the Hammer: hammer copper before you smelt it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.469475EF9C03C3A6.title": "Bronze",
  "quest.469475EF9C03C3A6.quest_subtitle": "Nine tiny dusts make one. Always.",
  "quest.469475EF9C03C3A6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hammer copper and tin ingots into dust. Three copper dusts and a tin dust make three bronze dust in the grid; the \"},{\"text\":\"Mixer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:bronze_mixer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes four from the same. Smelt the dust into ingots.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Almost Unified keeps one bronze for the whole pack: Mekanism's ingot is the one you get, and every MI recipe takes it."
  ],
  "quest.5EB016BD740A0784.title": "Casing and pipes",
  "quest.5EB016BD740A0784.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every steam machine stands on a \"},{\"text\":\"Bronze Machine Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:bronze_machine_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", eight bronze plates around a bronze gear, and most take three \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Pipes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:fluid_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Six bronze curved plates, two copper rotors and a glass pane make sixteen pipes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6F0A2292EED3B328.title": "Bronze Compressor",
  "quest.6F0A2292EED3B328.quest_subtitle": "Plates at half price.",
  "quest.6F0A2292EED3B328.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Forge Hammer spends two bronze ingots per plate unless it holds a Hammer; the compressor spends one, and presses a double ingot into two. Build it before the boiler, which alone takes twelve plates, and feed it a \"},{\"text\":\"Steam Bucket\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:steam_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a water bucket smelted in a furnace.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.341EE5658553F72A.title": "Fire Clay Bricks",
  "quest.341EE5658553F72A.quest_subtitle": "Almost steam.",
  "quest.341EE5658553F72A.quest_desc": [
    "Brick dust comes from hammering or macerating bricks. Two of it and two clay balls make three fire clay dust, four in the Mixer; smelt it and put four bricks together. The boiler stands on three of these blocks."
  ],
  "quest.47D69210583ECE20.title": "Bronze Boiler",
  "quest.47D69210583ECE20.quest_subtitle": "Coal in, pressure out.",
  "quest.47D69210583ECE20.quest_desc": [
    "Four bronze plates, a bronze tank, a furnace and three fire clay brick blocks. It burns furnace fuel, heats up, then pushes up to 8 mB of steam per tick into the machines touching it. Bronze machines run recipes of up to 2 EU/t and 1 mB of steam is 1 EU: a hot boiler feeds four."
  ],
  "quest.69C4ED8DF233A0BE.title": "Bronze Macerator",
  "quest.69C4ED8DF233A0BE.quest_subtitle": "Ore hemiquadrupling.",
  "quest.69C4ED8DF233A0BE.quest_desc": [
    "Two diamonds, three copper gears, a casing and three pipes. An ore block gives three raw ores, and each raw ore a dust plus half a dust on average: 4.5 dusts per ore, so mine with Silk Touch. It also grinds scrap, gears and plates back into dust."
  ],
  "quest.0A3FA1CA253AD72E.title": "Bronze Mixer",
  "quest.0A3FA1CA253AD72E.quest_subtitle": "Better ratios, same dust.",
  "quest.0A3FA1CA253AD72E.quest_desc": [
    "Two glass blocks, a copper gear, two copper rotors, a casing and three pipes. It beats the grid: four bronze dust instead of three, four fire clay dust instead of three, nine uncooked steel dust instead of seven. With water it also turns sand into clay."
  ],
  "quest.057F22F8C91B1B17.title": "Coke Oven",
  "quest.057F22F8C91B1B17.quest_subtitle": "Coal, but more so.",
  "quest.057F22F8C91B1B17.quest_desc": [
    "Eight bricks around a furnace make the controller; 21 brick blocks and three hatches finish the oven: items in, items out and steam in. A coal becomes coke in 30 seconds, and coke burns four times longer than coal.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hold a \"},{\"text\":\"Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" near a controller to see which blocks are missing, or a hatch to see where it may go.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.730EDB392EA3EADA.title": "Uncooked Steel",
  "quest.730EDB392EA3EADA.quest_subtitle": "Steel, just add fire.",
  "quest.730EDB392EA3EADA.quest_desc": [
    "Macerate coke into coke dust; an oven fed coal dust gives coke dust directly. Seven iron dusts and two coke dusts make seven uncooked steel dust in the grid, nine in the Mixer."
  ],
  "quest.399A36874AA12E01.title": "Steam Blast Furnace",
  "quest.399A36874AA12E01.quest_desc": [
    "Eight fire clay brick blocks around a blast furnace make the controller. The shape is the coke oven's in fire clay bricks with one more hollow layer on top: 29 fire clay brick blocks and the same three hatches."
  ],
  "quest.045F585D14FC7B1D.title": "Steel",
  "quest.045F585D14FC7B1D.quest_subtitle": "Cooked uncooked steel.",
  "quest.045F585D14FC7B1D.quest_desc": [
    "The Steam Blast Furnace cooks one uncooked steel dust into one ingot every 30 seconds at 2 EU/t. Almost Unified hands out Immersive Engineering's ingot: one steel for the whole pack.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Gunpowder doubles that speed for two minutes: see \"},{\"text\":\"the gunpowder trick\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7E5BB3388091A6E1\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.405B31B11FA83E58.title": "Steel Machine Casing",
  "quest.405B31B11FA83E58.quest_desc": [
    "Eight steel plates around a steel gear. Steel hatches, the packer, the wiremill, the steel upgrade and the Steam Quarry are all built on it."
  ],
  "quest.453C24EF98900FEF.title": "Steel Upgrade",
  "quest.453C24EF98900FEF.quest_subtitle": "Twice the speed, same machine.",
  "quest.453C24EF98900FEF.quest_desc": [
    "A steel casing, a bronze rotor, bronze gears and rods, pipes and a fire clay brick block make two. Sneak and right-click a bronze machine with one: it becomes the steel version, twice as fast up to 4 EU/t, with new recipes. An Unpacker takes the upgrade back out."
  ],
  "quest.34A66340B507C85E.title": "Invar Rotary Blade",
  "quest.34A66340B507C85E.quest_desc": [
    "Two iron dusts and a nickel dust make three invar dust in the Mixer. An invar gear ringed by four diamond dusts makes the blade the Steam Quarry spins, and later the electric macerator."
  ],
  "quest.7DD95D066787D269.title": "Bronze Drills",
  "quest.7DD95D066787D269.quest_desc": [
    "A bronze drill head, two iron gears, an item pipe and a fluid pipe make four. The quarry wears them down: each dig has a 4% chance to eat one."
  ],
  "quest.65B2AF2AA4A5C977.title": "Steam Quarry",
  "quest.65B2AF2AA4A5C977.quest_subtitle": "From Minecraft to Craft.",
  "quest.65B2AF2AA4A5C977.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four steel large plates, an item pipe, two steel gears, the invar blade and a steel casing. Walled in steel casings, with at least one \"},{\"text\":\"steel hatch\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"4DB84A002843BF2E\"}},{\"text\":\", it spends 4 EU/t and now and then a bronze drill to dig below bedrock: iron, coal, lignite, copper, tin, gold, redstone, zinc and osmium ores, every 30 seconds.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A copper drill digs cobblestone, stone variants, dirt and gravel instead: building filler that never runs out.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3CEB894C6180C21D.title": "Steel Wiremill",
  "quest.3CEB894C6180C21D.quest_subtitle": "Neither a wire nor a mill.",
  "quest.3CEB894C6180C21D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Bronze gears and rotors and two fluid pipes around a steel casing. A copper plate becomes two copper wires and a wire four fine wires: every cable starts here, and with cables the \"},{\"text\":\"Electric Age\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0F14CDFA7E1FF965\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4B837C5C7F07818A.title": "Water Pump",
  "quest.4B837C5C7F07818A.quest_desc": [
    "Two copper rotors, two copper gears, a bronze tank, a casing and pipes. Ring it with water source blocks: each gives an eighth of a bucket every 5 seconds, a bucket at most, pushed out of its output side for 1 EU/t of steam. The steel pump doubles it."
  ],
  "quest.48C495AE88C96DFB.title": "Bronze Furnace",
  "quest.48C495AE88C96DFB.quest_subtitle": "Ten times less fuel.",
  "quest.48C495AE88C96DFB.quest_desc": [
    "Five bronze plates over a furnace and three fire clay brick blocks. It smelts at vanilla speed, but the steam behind it costs a tenth of the fuel a furnace would burn."
  ],
  "quest.2C393DAE76BB4BCF.title": "Cutting Machine",
  "quest.2C393DAE76BB4BCF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Glass, a diamond, two copper gears, a casing and pipes. For 1 mB of lubricant per cut, mixed from \"},{\"text\":\"creosote\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1B9EDC3834394AC5\"}},{\"text\":\", it makes two rods per ingot, four per double ingot, two bolts per rod, and six planks per log.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.578FF1A850AD031A.title": "Steel Boiler",
  "quest.578FF1A850AD031A.quest_desc": [
    "A bronze boiler and a steel upgrade, shapeless. It makes up to 16 mB of steam per tick, twice the bronze one."
  ],
  "quest.063D8459D78ADA82.title": "Packer and Unpacker",
  "quest.063D8459D78ADA82.quest_subtitle": "To pack or not to pack.",
  "quest.063D8459D78ADA82.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Steel-only machines. The \"},{\"text\":\"Packer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:steel_packer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" does simple crafts by itself: double ingots with a template it never uses up, large plates, blocks, blades and cables. The \"},{\"text\":\"Unpacker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:steel_unpacker\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" does the reverse.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4DB84A002843BF2E.title": "Steel Hatches",
  "quest.4DB84A002843BF2E.quest_desc": [
    "A hopper or a steel tank on a steel casing. One steel hatch lifts a steam multiblock to steel tier: recipes up to 4 EU/t, twice as fast below that. The quarry asks for exactly 4.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An input hatch crafts into the matching output hatch and back, one for one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3DA37A4FD2C99709.title": "The guidebook",
  "quest.3DA37A4FD2C99709.quest_subtitle": "Technology for newbies.",
  "quest.3DA37A4FD2C99709.quest_desc": [
    "A book ringed by eight copper nuggets. Nobody hands it out here, so craft one: every machine has a page, and each multiblock an interactive view of its shape."
  ],
  "quest.4549DBBCC7B881C1.title": "Iron Hammer",
  "quest.4549DBBCC7B881C1.quest_desc": [
    "Five iron large plates and two sticks. In the Forge Hammer's tool slot it raises yields and unlocks recipes, paying in durability: an ore block becomes 3 raw ores or 4 dusts, three raw ores become 4 dusts."
  ],
  "quest.1739A4C6983DDA8A.title": "Steam Mining Drill",
  "quest.1739A4C6983DDA8A.quest_subtitle": "Getting that 3×3 going.",
  "quest.1739A4C6983DDA8A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three diamonds, two furnaces, two iron large plates, a bucket and a copper drill head. Right-click water to fill it and slip it solid fuel; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.modern_industrialization.toggle_3x3\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" toggles 3×3 and sneak-use Silk Touch.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0036D02B5773F56F.title": "Wrench",
  "quest.0036D02B5773F56F.quest_desc": [
    "Six bronze plates. Right-click turns a machine, sneak-right-click moves its output side; on a pipe it changes the connection, and sneaking pops the pipe off. Break machines with a pickaxe: the wrench won't drop them."
  ],
  "quest.3E83EEDD9694BCA6.title": "Lignite Coal",
  "quest.3E83EEDD9694BCA6.quest_desc": [
    "MI's own coal ore, common from bedrock up to height 256. It burns like coal, 1,600 ticks, but a block of nine burns 16,000: packing it earns a free piece."
  ],
  "quest.1B9EDC3834394AC5.title": "Creosote",
  "quest.1B9EDC3834394AC5.quest_desc": [
    "Add a bronze fluid output hatch to the coke oven: half its batches leave 500 mB of creosote, lost when there is no room. It burns at 160 EU per mB, and redstone mixes it into lubricant."
  ],
  "quest.295CC424254D2956.title": "Item Pipes",
  "quest.295CC424254D2956.quest_subtitle": "Whitelist by default. Yes, really.",
  "quest.295CC424254D2956.quest_desc": [
    "Six bronze curved plates and two steel gears make sixteen. They reach inventories only when told, and both ends start as an empty whitelist: nothing moves until you add the item or switch to blacklist. They carry 16 items every 3 seconds; a motor inside adds more."
  ],
  "quest.70048ADDD1887B1D.title": "Tanks and barrels",
  "quest.70048ADDD1887B1D.quest_desc": [
    "Eight bronze plates around glass make a tank of 4 buckets; around a wooden barrel, a barrel of 32 stacks, one fluid or item each. Both keep their contents when broken and stack when the contents match; the steel tank holds 16 buckets."
  ],
  "quest.6C1CCD02DF65160F.title": "Automatic Trash Can",
  "quest.6C1CCD02DF65160F.quest_subtitle": "Where overflow goes to die.",
  "quest.6C1CCD02DF65160F.quest_desc": [
    "Eight steel plates around a lava bucket. It deletes every item and fluid piped into it, and clicking a machine's fluid slot with it empties the slot."
  ],
  "quest.6161797455ACD079.title": "Locks, caps and eject",
  "quest.6161797455ACD079.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Steam machines take inputs from any side. Click a slot's lock to reserve it for one item or fluid, scroll over a slot to cap it, and switch on auto-eject to push outputs out of the output side.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3250F4E861F3B865.title": "Hammer or macerator?",
  "quest.3250F4E861F3B865.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Per ore block, the Forge Hammer gives 2 raw ores, 3 with a Hammer, or 4 dusts straight; the Macerator gives 3 raw ores that grind into 4.5 dusts. Keep ores whole with Silk Touch and let the machines break them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7E5BB3388091A6E1.title": "The gunpowder trick",
  "quest.7E5BB3388091A6E1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click a steam machine, or a steam multiblock's controller, with gunpowder: it runs twice as fast for two minutes. Best spent on the coke oven and the blast furnace, whose recipes take 30 seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.06B3DBBB8FFE4755.title": "The Industrialist",
  "quest.06B3DBBB8FFE4755.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Forge Hammer is a job site: a villager without a trade near one becomes an Industrialist. He buys lignite and sulfur dust, and sells tin, bronze, steel, rubber sheets, motors, analog circuits, a steel hammer and bronze drills.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.50F652753CF9CFD7.title": "Upgrade like a boss",
  "quest.50F652753CF9CFD7.quest_subtitle": "No crafting table was harmed.",
  "quest.50F652753CF9CFD7.quest_desc": [
    "You upgraded a bronze machine where it stands, without breaking it or opening a crafting grid."
  ],
  "reward.171936D07D6DE26E.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.1FA6DF09BDBDA535.title": "Overkill",
  "quest.1FA6DF09BDBDA535.quest_subtitle": "Every problem looks like a plate.",
  "quest.1FA6DF09BDBDA535.quest_desc": [
    "A diamond hammer, a netherite ingot and an upgrade template, to flatten bronze. It does the iron hammer's job with 2,031 durability instead of 250."
  ],
  "reward.512C2439E2C60611.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.5F1F04498F760B8C.title": "Plates for the common store",
  "quest.5F1F04498F760B8C.quest_subtitle": "Someone always needs twelve more.",
  "quest.5F1F04498F760B8C.quest_desc": [
    "Thirty-two bronze plates: machines, tanks, boilers and wrenches all start with them."
  ],
  "image.7CE375DE39CC160F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Steam machines\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.3591F79F482634D6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Steel tier\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.063C1106BF099EEB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tools and storage\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.5A97337952417C9D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fuel\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.1A94395BEB71D61D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Item pipes\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.4DB25342F77C9AA1.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Modern Industrialization\\nSteam\",\"color\":\"#FFF1DE\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.0B2DF98A4CD954A0.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.144C000F9C55574E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Electricity\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.64FEDE8F2BFB9007.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Digital\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.1E9EB5F5712D241F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Endgame\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.3F6CBAA47C7AC356.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"hammer  mix  cook  quarry\",\"color\":\"#BFA58A\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.1D837511CD3C70B6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"firebox\",\"color\":\"#FFB347\"}]",
  "image.46C8C9E6FF26999A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"smokebox\",\"color\":\"#C98A4B\"}]",
  "image.5D3E46C40FD721CC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» wires lead on\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "chapter.131B1C3AE984A6AC.title": "Oritech",
  "chapter.131B1C3AE984A6AC.chapter_subtitle": [
    "From nickel to prometheum: machines on cores and addons, generators, pipes and poles, the Enderic Laser and the Atomic Forge, bedrock mining, exo suits and jetpacks. The reactor and the accelerator are in Core and Particles."
  ],
  "quest.21C03EBF4DEA19C6.title": "Nickel",
  "quest.21C03EBF4DEA19C6.quest_subtitle": "Pocket change for a factory.",
  "quest.21C03EBF4DEA19C6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Nickel ore runs from Y -65 up to 40. On the surface, boulders of deepslate and ore mark richer ground: under each one, at bedrock, sits a resource node of the same metal. Smelted, nickel comes out as \"},{\"text\":\"Nickel Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:ingot_nickel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in this pack.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Note where you see an amethyst geode: it becomes your fluxite mine.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.146591CC41F80C54.title": "Coils and Motors",
  "quest.146591CC41F80C54.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six nickel and three steel make four \"},{\"text\":\"Magnetic Coils\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:magnetic_coil\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; a nickel, four steel and two coils make a \"},{\"text\":\"Motor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:motor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Motors go into almost every Oritech machine, so keep a stack. Steel from any mod works.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Assembler makes six coils from one steel, two nickel and a copper ingot, and two motors per craft. Build it before mass-producing either.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6D3692B4895FD225.title": "Basic Generator",
  "quest.6D3692B4895FD225.quest_subtitle": "Coal goes in, RF comes out.",
  "quest.6D3692B4895FD225.quest_desc": [
    "Five nickel, a copper ingot, two coils and a furnace. It burns anything a furnace does for 32 RF/t, takes no addons and needs no cores: build two or three rather than wait for a better one.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The first thing worth plugging in is a \"},{\"text\":\"Powered Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:powered_furnace_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": twice a furnace's speed for 32 RF/t, on one core.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.04932A1C97664069.title": "Pulverizer",
  "quest.04932A1C97664069.quest_subtitle": "Coarse in, fine out.",
  "quest.04932A1C97664069.quest_desc": [
    "Five iron, a nickel, two motors and a copper block; no cores. It grinds a raw ore into a dust and three small dusts, a third more metal than the furnace gives, and nine small dusts craft back into one.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each ender pearl comes out as eight \"},{\"text\":\"Enderic Compound\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:enderic_compound\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and seeds, saplings and crops as \"},{\"text\":\"Biomass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:biomass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.13FF438B9DAC8414.title": "Foundry",
  "quest.13FF438B9DAC8414.quest_subtitle": "Alloys at wholesale.",
  "quest.13FF438B9DAC8414.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five copper, a motor, two electrum and a cauldron, standing on three machine cores. Right-click it to see where they go, or click it holding a core to place the next. \"},{\"text\":\"Primitive Machine Cores\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_core_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" are planks around a crafting table.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It alloys at half the grid's price: iron and coal dust make steel, nickel and a diamond make \"},{\"text\":\"Adamant\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:adamant_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", gold and redstone make electrum. The grid wants two of each ingredient per ingot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.17BFEFFD52B91A0C.title": "Assembler",
  "quest.17BFEFFD52B91A0C.quest_desc": [
    "Three copper, two crafters, an adamant ingot, two motors and a blast furnace, on three cores. A 2×2 grid that crafts by itself at 128 RF/t and pays better than your hands: two motors or six coils per craft, and parts the grid can't make at all.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ingredients go in any order, and an AE2 pattern provider feeds it as it is.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1B28C442DA9F58D8.title": "Centrifuge",
  "quest.1B28C442DA9F58D8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The cheap recipe takes two motors, two copper, two iron blocks and three glass bottles, on one core. It spins coal dust into \"},{\"text\":\"Carbon Fibre Strands\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:carbon_fibre_strands\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the thread half the later parts are woven from, and ore clumps into gems.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"For fluids, attach a \"},{\"text\":\"Fluid Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_fluid_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and pipe into the centrifuge itself, not the addon. If a fluid recipe won't start, open the machine once so it notices the addon.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.484443330BE723E2.title": "Processing Units",
  "quest.484443330BE723E2.quest_subtitle": "The brains of the operation.",
  "quest.484443330BE723E2.quest_desc": [
    "Plastic, a carbon fibre strand, electrum and redstone, in the Assembler only. The Target Designator, item filters, chargers and the reactor controller all run on them.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Plastic starts on the farm: packed wheat and water in the centrifuge give raw biopolymer, and a second spin with water gives a sheet. Here Oritech's sheets come out as \"},{\"text\":\"Duroplast Sheets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersiveengineering:plate_duroplast\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and any plastic plate works.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1738C06D92591D44.title": "Enderic Laser",
  "quest.1738C06D92591D44.quest_subtitle": "Point, click, vaporise.",
  "quest.1738C06D92591D44.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two carbon fibre, an \"},{\"text\":\"Enderic Lens\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:enderic_lens\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two motors, electrum and three plating, on one core. Right-click a block with the \"},{\"text\":\"Target Designator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:target_designator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", then sneak (\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\") and right-click the laser: it fires that way, up to 128 blocks.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It mines everything on that line but passes through glass; drops that don't fit its inventory are destroyed, so pipe them out. Aimed at a machine, it charges it past the machine's own input limit.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The lens comes from the Assembler: adamant, a carbon fibre strand and two enderic compound.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4E8B29DF95E47ED3.title": "Fluxite",
  "quest.4E8B29DF95E47ED3.quest_subtitle": "Crystal harvest, no pickaxe.",
  "quest.4E8B29DF95E47ED3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Aim the laser at the amethyst clusters of a geode. Every cluster it breaks drops \"},{\"text\":\"Fluxite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:fluxite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and a \"},{\"text\":\"Budding Amethyst\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:budding_amethyst\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" under the beam isn't broken: it grows new clusters much faster instead.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Platinum clumps in the centrifuge shed a fluxite each, too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3AC5B3B5FEAD6ABC.title": "Flux Gates",
  "quest.3AC5B3B5FEAD6ABC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A processing unit, two fluxite and a platinum ingot in the Assembler make a \"},{\"text\":\"Flux Gate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:flux_gate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; nickel and fluxite in the Foundry make \"},{\"text\":\"Energite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:energite_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Batteries, solar panels, the forge and the fragment forge all wait on these two.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Platinum ore lies between Y -60 and -20 and is common in the End; nickel clumps in the centrifuge also shed small platinum dust.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3BE889B5BCB922B9.title": "Atomic Forge",
  "quest.3BE889B5BCB922B9.quest_subtitle": "No cables. Lasers only.",
  "quest.3BE889B5BCB922B9.quest_desc": [
    "Two flux gates, a duratium ingot, two plastic, enderic compound and three plating, on eight cores. Pipes can't feed it: aim Enderic Lasers at it. A recipe finishes once the forge is charged, so more lasers mean faster work.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The first \"},{\"text\":\"Duratium Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:duratium_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" comes from the Foundry: platinum and a netherite ingot. From then on the forge makes its own out of platinum and two reinforced carbon sheets.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.69E22F2896124E90.title": "Advanced Computing Engine",
  "quest.69E22F2896124E90.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In the forge, a carbon fibre strand and two silicon become a \"},{\"text\":\"Silicon Wafer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:silicon_wafer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and a processing unit with two wafers becomes an \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Computing Engine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:advanced_computing_engine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Any silicon works, AE2's included.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Elite machine cores are eight adamant around one engine.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.19A9E13BBBEC2073.title": "Duratium",
  "quest.19A9E13BBBEC2073.quest_subtitle": "Heavier than it looks.",
  "quest.19A9E13BBBEC2073.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The forge fuses a platinum ingot with two \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Carbon Sheets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reinforced_carbon_sheet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; the Refinery bakes each sheet from carbon fibre and 500 mB of naphtha. The accelerator, the Bedrock Extractor and the reactor's neutron reflectors are all built on duratium.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5A316D5F7D0529F3.title": "Superconductors",
  "quest.5A316D5F7D0529F3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A flux gate, electrum, a \"},{\"text\":\"Dubious Container\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:dubios_container\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and energite in the Assembler make four. As cable they carry 4,194,304 RF/t and won't join ordinary energy pipes; as parts they build the accelerator ring and the drone port.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The container is hand-made: plastic, four enderic compound and two adamant.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2827575517D6305B.title": "Heisenberg Compensator",
  "quest.2827575517D6305B.quest_subtitle": "Certainty, sold separately.",
  "quest.2827575517D6305B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In the forge, a duratium ingot and two computing engines make a \"},{\"text\":\"Super AI Chip\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:super_ai_chip\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; the chip and two adamant make the \"},{\"text\":\"Heisenberg Compensator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:heisenberg_compensator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Prometheum, the Bedrock Extractor and the tachyon absorbers are built on it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Unholy Intelligence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:unholy_intelligence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" can stand in for the chip here, in the drone port and in the arcane catalyst.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4AA9D4ADA3ED7E7A.title": "Overcharged Crystal",
  "quest.4AA9D4ADA3ED7E7A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An amethyst block, four superconductors and two advanced batteries craft one. Once the accelerator runs, fluxite colliding with \"},{\"text\":\"Energite Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:energite_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at 5,000 J makes them too.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An advanced battery is two energite ingots, electrum and four steel; a centrifuge with sulfuric acid turns one Dubious Container into eight.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.723F7BF64568EA59.title": "Prometheum",
  "quest.723F7BF64568EA59.quest_subtitle": "Fire, borrowed from the gods.",
  "quest.723F7BF64568EA59.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Heisenberg Compensator and two overcharged crystals in a charged forge: Oritech's last material. It makes the \"},{\"text\":\"Prometheum Pickaxe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:promethium_pickaxe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Prometheum Battleaxe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:promethium_axe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which never break, and the top machine core.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each tool takes three ingots and two Block Destroyers as a handle. Sneak (\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\") and right-click to switch the pickaxe between a 3×3 area and silk touch; the axe fells a whole tree while you sneak.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1A3370FE9D311FE3.title": "Ultimate Machine Core",
  "quest.1A3370FE9D311FE3.quest_subtitle": "Seven out of seven.",
  "quest.1A3370FE9D311FE3.quest_desc": [
    "Eight prometheum ingots around a superconductor. A machine's quality is the average of its cores, 1 for primitive up to 7 for ultimate: on these a Big Solar Panel makes seven times its base power, and a machine takes the most addon extenders it ever can."
  ],
  "quest.2E2BEDE6BEB55268.title": "Push, Never Pull",
  "quest.2E2BEDE6BEB55268.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Generators and batteries push their energy; \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Pipes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:energy_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" carry 10,000 RF/t and never pull on their own. A \"},{\"text\":\"Pipe Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the end of a pipe turns that connection off or on.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.52A0F427BA59383D.title": "Lava and Bio Generators",
  "quest.52A0F427BA59383D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Both make 64 RF/t on one core and take two addons. The \"},{\"text\":\"Lava Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:lava_generator_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" burns 100 mB of lava in 120 ticks, and the Refinery's Sheol fire in 800; the \"},{\"text\":\"Bio Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:bio_generator_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" eats biomass, packed wheat and solid biofuel.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A pump over a lava lake keeps the first one fed for a long time.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6716AE690B964746.title": "Energy Storage",
  "quest.6716AE690B964746.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Portable Energy Storage\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:small_storage_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds 1,000,000 RF and keeps it when broken. The \"},{\"text\":\"Large Energy Storage\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:large_storage_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds 20,000,000 on three cores, with eight addon slots. Both push power out of the red port alone.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Later, \"},{\"text\":\"Schrödinger's Safe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:unstable_container\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" locks TNT or a nuke inside and stores more the more dangerous its prisoner; Enderic Lasers aimed at it raise the ceiling while they fire.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3D6A7A0D44BFB7EB.title": "Fuel Generator",
  "quest.3D6A7A0D44BFB7EB.quest_subtitle": "Dinosaur juice, refined.",
  "quest.3D6A7A0D44BFB7EB.quest_desc": [
    "Five steel, an enderic lens, two plating and a Basic Generator, on seventeen cores: 256 RF/t, sent out only through the two yellow ports on its front. 100 mB of crude oil lasts 20 ticks; the same of turbofuel, 320."
  ],
  "quest.38B1C2B14AF2303D.title": "Steam Engine",
  "quest.38B1C2B14AF2303D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Steam Boiler Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:steam_boiler_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns any generator but the basic one into a boiler: pipe water into the addon and it makes two steam for every RF it would have produced. The \"},{\"text\":\"Steam Engine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:steam_engine_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", on three cores, turns that steam back into up to 50,000 RF/t.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The fuller its steam tank, the faster it spins, up to ten times; efficiency peaks near 700 %, where each unit of steam gives about 1.4 times its base RF. Up to ten engines in a row share the first one's pipes.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It stops when its own water tank fills: send that water back to the boilers and the loop runs by itself.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.04978122063C0015.title": "Big Solar Panel",
  "quest.04978122063C0015.quest_desc": [
    "Five fluxite, an advanced battery, two flux gates and a Basic Generator, on fifteen cores. It makes 32 RF/t times the average tier of those cores: 32 on primitive ones, 224 on ultimate. It folds away at night and whenever sky light falls below 12."
  ],
  "quest.257FB597393ED681.title": "Speed and Efficiency",
  "quest.257FB597393ED681.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Addons sit on a machine's marked spots and turn from pink to blue once connected. Each \"},{\"text\":\"Speed Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_speed_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds 50 % speed and 20 % energy per tick; each \"},{\"text\":\"Efficiency Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_efficiency_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes 20 % off. They add up rather than multiply.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.35DBF6C8F461BD7E.title": "Cores Set the Ceiling",
  "quest.35DBF6C8F461BD7E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A better core never speeds a machine up. Quality is the average tier of a machine's cores, and it only limits how many addon extenders fit. With no addons planned, primitive cores are enough.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7E3F0EDF9999B0FA.title": "Addon Extenders",
  "quest.7E3F0EDF9999B0FA.quest_desc": [
    "An extender goes on an addon spot and offers new spots of its own, and a machine takes as many extenders as its quality. Each is a duratium ingot and four plating ringed by four basic machine cores."
  ],
  "quest.243FEDFDD8D38564.title": "Capacitor and Acceptor",
  "quest.243FEDFDD8D38564.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Capacitor Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_capacitor_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds 2,000,000 RF of buffer and 2,000 RF/t of intake; an \"},{\"text\":\"Acceptor Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_acceptor_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds 500,000 RF and 5,000 RF/t and takes power through its own faces, for machines with no side free.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A capacitor crafted onto an extender makes a Power Bank Extender: an extender that also adds 2,500,000 RF.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.433F381D89E12DBC.title": "Burst and Parallel",
  "quest.433F381D89E12DBC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Burst Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_burst_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs a machine eight times faster for 240 ticks per addon, then throttles it to 80 % speed at 20 % more energy until it cools. An \"},{\"text\":\"Auxiliary Processing Chamber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_processing_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs one more recipe at a time for 50 % more energy.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Bursts suit machines that work in spurts; for long recipes the chamber wins.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.52C5065D5FC2C2F2.title": "Synergy and the Heart",
  "quest.52C5065D5FC2C2F2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Synergy Matrix Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_ultimate_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" gives 75 % speed for only 10 % more energy. The \"},{\"text\":\"Addon Splicer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:shrinker_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", on four cores, then fuses a machine's stat addons into a single Heart of the Machine, which works only as the machine's one and only addon.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each splice needs its 50,000,000 RF buffer full and eats the addons for good. Steam boilers, control units, inventory proxies and hunter addons can't be spliced."
  ],
  "quest.4BC1353A1C9DC387.title": "Inventory Proxy",
  "quest.4BC1353A1C9DC387.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five carbon fibre, a processing unit, two chests and a motor. An \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory Proxy Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_inventory_proxy_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stands for one slot of its machine, picked in its screen: a pipe on it fills or empties that slot and no other.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2816B723034A03FC.title": "Fragment Forge",
  "quest.2816B723034A03FC.quest_desc": [
    "Five plastic, a flux gate, two motors and plating, on seven cores with five addon slots. An ore block breaks into two raw ores plus one of a sister metal; a raw ore breaks into a clump, three small clumps and a few small clumps of that sister.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Feed it silk-touched ore: an iron ore block gives two raw iron and a raw nickel, and nickel's sister is platinum. One \"},{\"text\":\"Yield Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_yield_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" doubles the side products.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.36F3568E2D4CC001.title": "One Ore, Six Ingots",
  "quest.36F3568E2D4CC001.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Centrifuge spins a clump into one gem dry, two with a bucket of water, three with a bucket of sulfuric acid, which also leaves 250 mB of mineral slurry. The Foundry melts two \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Gems\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:iron_gem\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into three ingots.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One raw ore, a third more in clumps, four gems, six ingots: the acid route turns a vein into six times the metal.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4BC093374936443B.title": "Oil and the Refinery",
  "quest.4BC093374936443B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Oil springs gush from the surface, about three times as often in deserts. A \"},{\"text\":\"Pump\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:pump_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" drains a lake of up to 100,000 blocks at 512 RF each. The \"},{\"text\":\"Refinery\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:refinery_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", on nine cores, splits a bucket of crude into heavy oil, naphtha and sulfuric acid.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Up to two chamber modules stacked on top open its second and third outputs; without them the first output doubles. \"},{\"text\":\"Clay Catalyst Beads\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:clay_catalyst_beads\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turn the same bucket into 500 mB each of diesel, naphtha and acid.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.32312B712CCCD68F.title": "Turbofuel",
  "quest.32312B712CCCD68F.quest_subtitle": "Jetpack juice.",
  "quest.32312B712CCCD68F.quest_desc": [
    "A bucket of diesel and one fluxite in a centrifuge with a Fluid Addon make a bucket of turbofuel. It lasts sixteen times as long as crude oil in the Fuel Generator, and jetpacks fly faster on it than on RF.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Industrial Foregoing's biofuel and PneumaticCraft's oil also become turbofuel with fluxite in the centrifuge.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.15E03921D190A5B6.title": "Pipes",
  "quest.15E03921D190A5B6.quest_desc": [
    "Item pipes hold nothing: right-click the section touching an inventory to make it extract, 8 items every 5 ticks, into the nearest inventory down the line. Fluid pipes pull half a bucket every 3 ticks the same way.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An extracting pipe takes from the first filled slot, and one item with nowhere to go blocks it. Right-click it with a \"},{\"text\":\"Motor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:motor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to make it reach every slot; a \"},{\"text\":\"Pipe Booster\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:pipe_booster_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" against it moves a stack per tick.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1E63BE9D339F76C6.title": "Power Poles",
  "quest.1E63BE9D339F76C6.quest_subtitle": "The scenic route for energy.",
  "quest.1E63BE9D339F76C6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Link two \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Transmission Poles\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:power_pole_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 50 to 1,000 blocks apart by sneak-clicking both with the Target Designator. Every linked pole shares one network of up to 1,000,000 RF/t: energy goes in at a green port and out at a red one.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click the cable with a \"},{\"text\":\"Pipe Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to zipline along it for free.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2A7D24510E3F1ED6.title": "Portable Tank",
  "quest.2A7D24510E3F1ED6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six copper, two fluid pipes and a glass block. A \"},{\"text\":\"Portable Tank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:small_tank_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds 256 buckets and keeps them when broken; stacked tanks pour down into the one below, and a comparator reads how full it is.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.724D2807FFBD0083.title": "Item Filter",
  "quest.724D2807FFBD0083.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Seven planks around a processing unit, on plating. Place the \"},{\"text\":\"Item Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:item_filter_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" against the inventory it should fill: it accepts only what its list allows, from pipes on any side, and passes it straight in. It holds one item at a time and never pulls on its own.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"This pack has FTB Filter System, so a \"},{\"text\":\"Smart Filter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ftbfiltersystem:smart_filter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the list matches whole tags, mods or anything its expression can say.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3A196D95174295A5.title": "Hunter Addon",
  "quest.3A196D95174295A5.quest_subtitle": "Pest control, industrial grade.",
  "quest.3A196D95174295A5.quest_desc": [
    "On the laser's addon spot it turns the beam on mobs: it tracks them along its line and stores their loot, though they drop no experience. Sneak-click the laser with the designator to cycle targets: every non-player, hostile and neutral, or hostile only.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Speed addons raise its damage; a crop filter spares baby animals.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.53A62468ABABA920.title": "Plutonium",
  "quest.53A62468ABABA920.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A laser breaking a \"},{\"text\":\"Uranite Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:uranium_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in a uranium vein gets plutonium dust instead of raw uranium, and crystals never grow back. Pressed like uranium, \"},{\"text\":\"Plutonium Pellets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:plutonium_pellet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" burn ten times longer in a reactor.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Uranium dust colliding with fluxite at 2,500 J makes plutonium too, and the Fragment Forge leaves a pinch of it in every raw uranium.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2C294F1441BCF3BB.title": "Exo Suit",
  "quest.2C294F1441BCF3BB.quest_subtitle": "Armour that does chores.",
  "quest.2C294F1441BCF3BB.quest_desc": [
    "Machine plating and one part per piece: a lens gives the helmet night vision, an advanced battery lets the chestplate charge the powered tools you carry, a motor makes the legs run faster and silicon lets the boots ignore fall damage."
  ],
  "quest.376F76253F21BBB1.title": "Drill, Saw and Charger",
  "quest.376F76253F21BBB1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Hand Drill\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:hand_drill\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" works as pickaxe and shovel for 10 RF times each block's hardness; the \"},{\"text\":\"Chainsaw\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:chainsaw\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fells a whole tree when you sneak. Neither ever breaks: empty, they just crawl. The \"},{\"text\":\"Equipment Charger\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:charger_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" refills them.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Unbreaking on these tools cuts their energy use instead.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.099ED8E4C8962D59.title": "Jetpack",
  "quest.099ED8E4C8962D59.quest_subtitle": "Up is a direction now.",
  "quest.099ED8E4C8962D59.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Leather, two steel, two gunpowder, an advanced battery and, in this pack, a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III). Hold jump to climb; there's no hover. Here it burns 320 RF/t or 25 mB/t of turbofuel, two and a half times the mod's own cost.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Turbofuel only goes in through the Equipment Charger, and it flies faster than RF.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1212F4953B1769ED.title": "Exo Jetpack",
  "quest.1212F4953B1769ED.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Exo Chestplate, the Jetpack, four \"},{\"text\":\"Ion Thrusters\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:ion_thruster\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two portable tanks and, in this pack, a \"},{\"text\":\"Zanite Gemstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"aether:zanite_gemstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV). It holds 5,000,000 RF or 32 buckets, flies at speed 1.5 against the jetpack's 0.4 and charges your tools like the chestplate.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Here it burns 640 RF/t or 38 mB/t of turbofuel. Ion thrusters come from the Assembler: two reinforced carbon sheets, an advanced battery and a flux gate make two."
  ],
  "quest.4921456F4BFBE6C3.title": "Boosted Elytra",
  "quest.4921456F4BFBE6C3.quest_desc": [
    "Elytra, the Jetpack, two processing units and five gunpowder. It thrusts only while you glide, so it replaces fireworks instead of climbing on its own; same tank and cost as the jetpack, speed 0.6. The exo version, at 1.4, is built on the Exo Jetpack."
  ],
  "quest.5C88B4FC3C16FBAD.title": "A Geode at Home",
  "quest.5C88B4FC3C16FBAD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Assembler grows a \"},{\"text\":\"Budding Amethyst\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:budding_amethyst\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from two amethyst shards, enderic compound and an overcharged crystal. Set it beside your laser and the fluxite mine moves home.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.30477B91CE1CF47F.title": "Stand on a resource node",
  "quest.0B0DC87266DB1928.title": "Resource Node",
  "quest.0B0DC87266DB1928.quest_desc": [
    "Dig straight down under an ore boulder: at bedrock waits a node of the same ore, unbreakable and endless. The rarest boulders hide diamond, emerald, uranium and platinum nodes."
  ],
  "quest.4365678511B2C10F.title": "Bedrock Extractor",
  "quest.4365678511B2C10F.quest_subtitle": "The bottom of the world has a tap.",
  "quest.4365678511B2C10F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Twenty-six cores over a node, powered only by Enderic Lasers. It scans three blocks down in the 3×3 under it, picks one node each cycle and spends 20 steps of 1,024 RF per ore; nodes never run dry. Here it also takes an \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV).\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.21C2D98A51480A18.title": "Bottled Spirit",
  "quest.21C2D98A51480A18.quest_subtitle": "It was only a little allay.",
  "quest.21C2D98A51480A18.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Dubious Container given to an allay, or pressed on a vex, now holds an \"},{\"text\":\"Unholy Intelligence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:unholy_intelligence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It replaces a Super AI Chip in the compensator, the drone port and the catalyst, and burns for 60,000 ticks in a Bio Generator.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.123FD1A705CF3C46.title": "Secret found",
  "task.7D75DC6E701E3134.title": "Get a gold gem",
  "quest.0A8B403396666261.title": "Alchemist's Margin",
  "quest.0A8B403396666261.quest_subtitle": "Gold in, more gold out.",
  "quest.0A8B403396666261.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Gold Gem\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:gold_gem\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", spun from a gold clump the same way as iron. Two of them melt into three gold ingots in the Foundry: the only alchemy Oritech needs is a centrifuge.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.1567754323A96031.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.3967AAB382DDAD96.title": "Motors for the Common Store",
  "quest.3967AAB382DDAD96.quest_subtitle": "Everyone's machine wants two.",
  "quest.3967AAB382DDAD96.quest_desc": [
    "Sixteen motors, from the grid or the Assembler. Nearly every Oritech machine on the server starts with a pair of them."
  ],
  "quest.792CA8B0AABC4121.title": "Oritech in This Pack",
  "quest.792CA8B0AABC4121.quest_desc": [
    "Seven Oritech pieces wait on the Atlas: the Jetpack on a reinforced alloy (act III); the Exo Jetpack on zanite; the Bedrock Extractor, the Spawner Controller and both nukes on ironwood (act IV); the accelerator controller on an atomic alloy (act V).",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The Nether Star collision is gone, and the Foundry and Atomic Forge make no Mekanism alloys or circuits. Almost Unified hands out Immersive Engineering's nickel, steel and electrum and turns Oritech plastic into duroplast. The Oracle Index manual isn't installed: use the recipe viewer."
  ],
  "image.13F2483F786A7D03.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pipes, poles and tanks\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.0B61A544BAAD4FC6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Generators\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.25629F95A2B32C22.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Ore processing\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.02814C139FDC484B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Addons\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.0085F4F6EA8454C4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Laser work\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.2A22C0968D2D7CEF.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Exo suit and jetpacks\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.7B0CE1DFDAD3EB2F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Mining the bedrock\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.0452DF7B62FE17DB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Oritech\",\"color\":\"#FFF1DC\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.3AEFB4E070D858BB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"particle accelerator\",\"color\":\"#3A2A18\"}]",
  "image.1B4891375312F96F.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.1AE1096D082CAC7F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"grind · alloy · lase · collide\",\"color\":\"#C9A77A\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.4EB33C0182EAE6D5.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Core and particles\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.6344716DB15690D3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"0 m/s\",\"color\":\"#A9C7CE\"}]",
  "image.6A97BF7B828CA073.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#A9C7CE\"}]",
  "image.4D84EEB0F781BF17.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#A9C7CE\"}]",
  "image.3BE64E15BFAE971B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"250\",\"color\":\"#A9C7CE\"}]",
  "image.7C5B72F835EAD56D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"500\",\"color\":\"#A9C7CE\"}]",
  "image.5E5478AAFB308D90.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"1,000\",\"color\":\"#A9C7CE\"}]",
  "image.1A1489911BF4B78A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"2,500\",\"color\":\"#A9C7CE\"}]",
  "image.270A6711D956052C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"5,000\",\"color\":\"#A9C7CE\"}]",
  "image.00D2F74E09C90E49.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"10,000\",\"color\":\"#A9C7CE\"}]",
  "chapter.724FCB653EBDEDDF.title": "PneumaticCraft · Drones and armor",
  "chapter.724FCB653EBDEDDF.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Drones and their programs, logistics frames, pneumatic armor from helmet to jet boots, and elevators."
  ],
  "quest.6C988EF917A96E05.title": "Harvesting Drone",
  "quest.6C988EF917A96E05.quest_subtitle": "Farmhand, no wages.",
  "quest.6C988EF917A96E05.quest_desc": [
    "Four turbine rotors around any crop. Charge it and place it: it harvests every grown crop and tree in a 17×17×17 cube. Deploy it sneaking against a chest that holds only a hoe and it replants too.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It leaves the harvest on the ground. A Collector Drone next to a chest picks it up.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.21C6CF393CAF57AB.title": "Collector Drone",
  "quest.21C6CF393CAF57AB.quest_desc": [
    "Four rotors around a hopper. Deployed against a chest, it gathers items within its 17-block cube into that chest, only the kinds already inside; placed on the ground beside the chest, it takes everything. Up to 16 Range Upgrades widen the cube."
  ],
  "quest.04F0ED32A093AB35.title": "Guard Drone",
  "quest.04F0ED32A093AB35.quest_subtitle": "Bring your own sword.",
  "quest.04F0ED32A093AB35.quest_desc": [
    "Four rotors around an iron sword. Deploy it on a chest holding a weapon: it takes one and attacks hostile mobs around that spot. When the weapon breaks and none is left, it fights bare-handed, badly."
  ],
  "quest.0E94A6D7B8872266.title": "Pressurized Spawner",
  "quest.0E94A6D7B8872266.quest_desc": [
    "A Spawner Core holds mob essence: fill a crafted one with a Vacuum Trap under vacuum, or rip one out of a dungeon spawner with a Spawner Extractor. The Pressurized Spawner runs it at 10 bar or more, whatever the light or distance to a player."
  ],
  "task.01A125D5F94E655A.title": "Craft a Minigun",
  "quest.49E5A98BAD2810C9.title": "Minigun",
  "quest.49E5A98BAD2810C9.quest_desc": [
    "Air canister, cannon barrel, chest, lever and a little metal. Hold right-click to spin it up; it fires from ammo loaded into its own magazine, never from your pockets. A Minigun Upgrade gives the same gun to a Guard Drone."
  ],
  "quest.517D2F26FD2063C2.title": "Special rounds",
  "quest.517D2F26FD2063C2.quest_desc": [
    "Plain ammo is gunpowder, compressed iron and copper: 2,000 rounds. Wrapped in compressed iron with a pair of extras it specialises: blaze rods set fire, ice freezes, diamonds pierce armor, gold and obsidian hit hard at short range, TNT explodes."
  ],
  "quest.35CB08179E3A4947.title": "Sentry Turret",
  "quest.35CB08179E3A4947.quest_subtitle": "Guards the door. No lunch breaks.",
  "quest.35CB08179E3A4947.quest_desc": [
    "A minigun on plastic and compressed iron legs. It needs no air, only ammo, shoots anything its entity filter matches within 16 blocks, 32 with Range Upgrades, and starts out aimed at mobs only."
  ],
  "quest.7D5B0F96F00FAE14.title": "Drones come home to charge",
  "quest.7D5B0F96F00FAE14.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Low on air, any drone drops its job and flies to a Charging Station within 80 blocks that has a Dispenser Upgrade and at least 1 bar, then goes back to work. Out of air, it falls, and drones take fall damage.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.42B18B892CEA1957.title": "Rotors for the common store",
  "quest.42B18B892CEA1957.quest_subtitle": "Somebody always crashes one.",
  "quest.42B18B892CEA1957.quest_desc": [
    "Eight turbine rotors, blades pressed from gold and redstone. Every drone on the server flies on four of them."
  ],
  "quest.14CC555DEE6D9EF0.title": "Logistics Frames",
  "quest.14CC555DEE6D9EF0.quest_subtitle": "Factorio, in your chests.",
  "quest.14CC555DEE6D9EF0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Seven sticks, a dye and a \"},{\"text\":\"Logistics Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:logistics_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make eight frames. Stick them on chests and tanks: a Passive Provider offers what it holds, a Requester keeps the amounts you set in stock, and something with air moves the goods.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.386454CA91BFE0C8.title": "Deploy a Logistics Drone",
  "quest.5BD58D3051790F97.title": "Logistics Drone",
  "quest.5BD58D3051790F97.quest_desc": [
    "Four rotors around a logistics core. Deployed, it serves every framed inventory and tank in a wide cube around that spot, no tubes needed; Speed and Inventory Upgrades make each trip faster and fuller."
  ],
  "quest.52C982F2BBAC381B.title": "Logistics Configurator",
  "quest.52C982F2BBAC381B.quest_desc": [
    "Compressed iron, an air canister, a lever and red dye. Right-click a placed frame to set its filters, minimum order size or invisibility; sneak-right-click to take the frame off, or a Heat Frame, Transfer Gadget or Crop Support."
  ],
  "quest.2779D5516BA4E596.title": "Three more frames",
  "quest.2779D5516BA4E596.quest_desc": [
    "An Active Provider pushes its contents out to storage and requesters. Storage Frames take what active providers send, Default Storage too but only when no Storage Frame has room, and both feed requesters."
  ],
  "quest.044E8E2FCFD932D2.title": "Logistics Module",
  "quest.044E8E2FCFD932D2.quest_desc": [
    "A logistics core, four redstone and two tubes. Fixed on a tube facing a framed inventory, it joins every module on the same tube network; from 3 bar they move items and fluids, and the receiving end pays more air for bigger loads and longer runs. Dyes pick one of 16 channels."
  ],
  "quest.02AB7C7C49AF3CDC.title": "Tag Filter",
  "quest.02AB7C7C49AF3CDC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A book and quill on a display table make the \"},{\"text\":\"Tag Workbench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:tag_workbench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Put in an item, pick its tags and add paper: out comes a Tag Filter that frames and drone filters read as every item with those tags, every log for instance.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.79FD69E27466B6CB.title": "Drone",
  "quest.79FD69E27466B6CB.quest_subtitle": "Does anything. Once told.",
  "quest.79FD69E27466B6CB.quest_desc": [
    "Four turbine rotors around a PCB. A blank drone does nothing until a Programmer writes a program onto it; then it digs, builds, farms, fetches or fights wherever you point it.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A drone crafted with a dye, or right-clicked with one, changes colour. Nothing else changes, but twelve drones become easy to tell apart.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3BD9D308F28F4E96.title": "Drone upgrades",
  "quest.3BD9D308F28F4E96.quest_subtitle": "Pockets, patience and a swimsuit.",
  "quest.3BD9D308F28F4E96.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drones take upgrades in the Charging Station: each \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:inventory_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds a slot and 16,000 mB of tank, each Speed Upgrade 10%, and a \"},{\"text\":\"Standby Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:standby_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" parks it when idle to save air. A Security Upgrade lets it work in water.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.34E8B4DE6BC8751D.title": "Chunkloader Upgrade",
  "quest.34E8B4DE6BC8751D.quest_desc": [
    "Two PCBs, two eyes of ender and four lapis. In a drone, one upgrade keeps its own chunk loaded, two load a cross of five chunks and three a 3×3 square. It won't let a drone fly into chunks that are unloaded."
  ],
  "quest.2FE8CD0776A4B59E.title": "Programmer",
  "quest.2FE8CD0776A4B59E.quest_subtitle": "No keyboard required.",
  "quest.2FE8CD0776A4B59E.quest_desc": [
    "Two turbine rotors, a PCB, plastic, red dye and a black glass pane. Drag puzzle-piece widgets into a chain, put a drone in its slot and press the arrow to write the program. The Programmer itself runs without air."
  ],
  "quest.030C439820CFB2EC.title": "Puzzle Pieces",
  "quest.030C439820CFB2EC.quest_desc": [
    "Eight plastic around a PCB make eight. Writing a program spends one piece per widget, from your inventory or a chest touching the Programmer; overwrite the drone with a shorter program and the spare pieces come back."
  ],
  "quest.5B4003F96D7A044A.title": "GPS Tools",
  "quest.5B4003F96D7A044A.quest_subtitle": "You are here. Also there.",
  "quest.5B4003F96D7A044A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"GPS Tool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:gps_tool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" remembers the block you right-click. Two crafted together make a \"},{\"text\":\"GPS Area Tool\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:gps_area_tool\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": right-click marks one corner, left-click the other. Click either onto an Area widget in the Programmer to copy it.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.14264C46AB908F04.title": "Program a Drone",
  "quest.50E94211F67F595A.title": "First program",
  "quest.50E94211F67F595A.quest_subtitle": "Hello, world. Now dig.",
  "quest.50E94211F67F595A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Start\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"},{\"text\":\", then \"},{\"text\":\"Import From Inventory\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"},{\"text\":\" with an Area on the chest and an Item Filter for a shovel, then \"},{\"text\":\"Dig\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"},{\"text\":\" with an Area of dirt. Six pieces, no red borders, a charged drone in the slot: write it, place the drone, watch.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.70A24EAFCEE356EE.title": "Program storage",
  "quest.70A24EAFCEE356EE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Plastic, dye and a chest make both. A \"},{\"text\":\"Network API\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:network_api\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds a program built from real puzzle pieces and can run in a Programmable Controller; a \"},{\"text\":\"Network Data Storage\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:network_data_storage\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" only keeps it, free, for a library or a trade.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.61AFBDBE7222527E.title": "Remote and Universal Sensor",
  "quest.61AFBDBE7222527E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sneak-right-click the \"},{\"text\":\"Remote\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:remote\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to draw your own buttons and checkboxes; each one sets a global variable. A \"},{\"text\":\"Universal Sensor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:universal_sensor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with a Dispenser Upgrade can read that variable and emit redstone, and drone programs read it too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.431E1C94CF878EF7.title": "Right means yes, left means no",
  "quest.431E1C94CF878EF7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An Area or filter widget snapped to the right of another widget is a whitelist; snapped to its left, a blacklist. Dig this box but not that corner is one Dig widget with an Area on each side.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5EE478D8E925B48F.title": "Programs travel well",
  "quest.5EE478D8E925B48F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Convert to Relative rewrites every area around one base coordinate, so a farm program works in anyone's world after changing a single widget. The Pastebin button exports and imports programs, or copies them to the clipboard.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.747148527B77FFE1.title": "Programmable Controller",
  "quest.747148527B77FFE1.quest_subtitle": "A drone that stays home.",
  "quest.747148527B77FFE1.quest_desc": [
    "A remote, a drone, a PCB, a network registry and an advanced tube. It runs a drone's or a Network API's program with a minidrone that is not an entity: no pathfinding, straight through walls, kinder to the server, for 10 mL of air per tick against a drone's 1.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It skips the widgets that need a body: Entity Attack, Entity Import and Export, Teleport, Standby, Suicide and Computer Control. Big digs and big builds are its job.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.68025A2B624C85EA.title": "Debugging a drone",
  "quest.68025A2B624C85EA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Pneumatic Helmet with Entity Tracker and Dispenser Upgrades debugs drones: look at one, press the helmet's drone-debugging key, then open the armor options and pick the Drone Debugger page to watch its program run, errors included.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A Security Upgrade in the helmet hacks a stuck drone: it pauses and flies to you, and a second hack resumes it. Right-clicking a drone with a GPS Tool sends it to the stored block."
  ],
  "quest.771CB4D8CC04DD8B.title": "Drones don't travel alone",
  "quest.771CB4D8CC04DD8B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A drone won't go through a portal unless its program holds a Condition: Dimension widget, and each branch of that condition needs its own coordinates, since the far side's blocks sit elsewhere.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6A0E8877EC6D4946.title": "Compressed Iron Armor",
  "quest.6A0E8877EC6D4946.quest_desc": [
    "Each piece is its leather version wrapped in compressed iron: a little tougher than iron, with some knockback resistance, repaired with compressed iron at an anvil. The pneumatic suit is built on top of it."
  ],
  "task.70319D437878F9C5.title": "Wear the full Pneumatic Armor",
  "quest.21F5D15D3C5C324C.title": "Pneumatic Armor",
  "quest.21F5D15D3C5C324C.quest_subtitle": "Suit up. Charge first.",
  "quest.21F5D15D3C5C324C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each compressed iron piece plus a PCB and air canisters: four boards and twenty-two canisters for the set. Plain, it is barely better than iron; charged and upgraded in the Charging Station, it tracks, flies and mends itself. Tune it all from the \"},{\"text\":\"armor options key\",\"color\":\"#D8C8FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":\"Controls, PneumaticCraft: Pneumatic Armor General Options\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/patchouli/pneumatic_armor.png width:96 height:96 align:center}"
  ],
  "quest.73ED07FEAFA9A651.title": "Armor and Item Life",
  "quest.73ED07FEAFA9A651.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A compressed iron ingot ringed with diamonds and lapis makes an \"},{\"text\":\"Armor Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:armor_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two per piece match diamond, four beat it. A clock and apples make an \"},{\"text\":\"Item Life Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:item_life_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which repairs the piece with air, up to five per piece.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.53F1A72ADA8B1B2F.title": "Radiation Shielding",
  "quest.53F1A72ADA8B1B2F.quest_desc": [
    "Mekanism's Radiation Shielding Unit surrounded by compressed iron and lapis. With one in every piece, the suit keeps out Mekanism radiation like the MekaSuit module does; fewer pieces, partial cover."
  ],
  "quest.7CFA74F4DE00C89A.title": "Trackers",
  "quest.7CFA74F4DE00C89A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Entity Tracker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:entity_tracker_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" marks living things within 16 blocks, even behind walls, and warns when a mob targets you. A \"},{\"text\":\"Block Tracker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:block_tracker_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" marks inventories, spawners, silverfish blocks, TNT and more within 30, and hovering shows their contents.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.498BE84A18C87DC9.title": "Item Search Upgrade",
  "quest.498BE84A18C87DC9.quest_subtitle": "Where did I put that?",
  "quest.498BE84A18C87DC9.quest_desc": [
    "A golden carrot ringed with eyes of ender. Pick an item in the helmet's screen and every stack of it within 16 blocks glows green: in chests with the Block Tracker, on the ground with the Entity Tracker."
  ],
  "quest.6A97BCB7BD78C429.title": "Coordinate Tracker",
  "quest.6A97BCB7BD78C429.quest_desc": [
    "A GPS Tool ringed with redstone and lapis. It paths you to a chosen block, and its Navigate to surface option finds the way out of any cave."
  ],
  "quest.63328EDBEFD556B9.title": "Night Vision, SCUBA, Ender Visor",
  "quest.63328EDBEFD556B9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three helmet comforts. \"},{\"text\":\"Night Vision\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:night_vision_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" costs a trickle of air; \"},{\"text\":\"SCUBA\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:scuba_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" breathes underwater from the helmet's tank and clears your view; the \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Visor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:ender_visor_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" lets you look endermen in the eye.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4F2CA991F1066B28.title": "Magnet Upgrade",
  "quest.4F2CA991F1066B28.quest_desc": [
    "Plastic ringed with compressed iron and lapis. In the chestplate it draws nearby items and experience orbs to you for a little air each; more upgrades, more range. It leaves Immersive Engineering conveyor belts alone."
  ],
  "quest.54D3ABB18810ED9B.title": "Charging Upgrade",
  "quest.54D3ABB18810ED9B.quest_desc": [
    "A Charging Module, itself four charging stations around a tube, ringed with tubes and lapis. In the chestplate it charges every other pneumatic item you wear or carry, up to its own pressure; up to six speed it up."
  ],
  "quest.34274EFA664F57F3.title": "Security Upgrade",
  "quest.34274EFA664F57F3.quest_subtitle": "Stop, drop and vent.",
  "quest.34274EFA664F57F3.quest_desc": [
    "A safety module ringed with obsidian and lapis. In the chestplate it dumps air to put out fire and cool you when you are about to burn, slowly turning nearby lava to stone, and it absorbs shocks from bare Immersive Engineering wires."
  ],
  "quest.04D1525DEEE4550A.title": "Speed Upgrades in the leggings",
  "quest.04D1525DEEE4550A.quest_desc": [
    "Speed Upgrades in the leggings make you run faster for a little air, up to four; the armor screen can dial the boost down on the fly. In the other pieces they only shorten the boot-up."
  ],
  "quest.6839C2750CDE0566.title": "Jumping Upgrades I and II",
  "quest.6839C2750CDE0566.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tier I is a cylinder, two vortex cannons, a tube, a piston and lapis; tier II adds slime blocks and pistons around it. Each tier jumps higher for more air, and holding \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" as you jump drops back to a tier-I hop.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4C8C4D72035599CE.title": "Jumping Upgrades III and IV",
  "quest.4C8C4D72035599CE.quest_desc": [
    "Three potions of Leaping around the previous tier, with pistons and a cylinder, make tier III; Leaping II potions make tier IV, the highest jump in the mod."
  ],
  "quest.61713EDE7C93C53C.title": "Vortex Cannon",
  "quest.61713EDE7C93C53C.quest_subtitle": "Also works as a ride.",
  "quest.61713EDE7C93C53C.quest_desc": [
    "Compressed iron, an air canister, a lever and yellow dye. It fires spinning air that pushes mobs back, knocks down leaves and plants and shears sheep; catch your own vortex for a fast trip, with no fall protection. Jumping and Jet Boots Upgrades are built around it."
  ],
  "task.12090DC22C4797F1.title": "Fly with Jet Boots",
  "quest.71A07B3ECDEE2E66.title": "Jet Boots",
  "quest.71A07B3ECDEE2E66.quest_subtitle": "Watch the gauge, not the ground.",
  "quest.71A07B3ECDEE2E66.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Advanced Air Compressor, two advanced tubes, two vortex cannons and lapis make \"},{\"text\":\"Jet Boots Upgrade: Tier I\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:jet_boots_upgrade_1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Hold the Jet Boots thrust key to fly where you look. \"},{\"text\":\"In this pack every tier adds 30 mL of air per tick of thrust, 2.5 times the mod's 12.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Give the boots and chestplate Volume Upgrades, a Charging Upgrade in the chestplate, and an Aerial Interface at home to refill on the move.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6B853541C30214CB.title": "Jet Boots II and III",
  "quest.6B853541C30214CB.quest_desc": [
    "Tier II adds feathers and cylinders around the first; tier III, ghast tears and blaze rods. Each flies faster and thirstier, and from tier III the armor screen offers Builder Mode: slower, creative-style flight with quick digging in the air."
  ],
  "quest.13D89BDD280848AC.title": "Jet Boots IV and V",
  "quest.13D89BDD280848AC.quest_desc": [
    "Tier IV takes a nether star, phantom membranes and slow falling potions and adds Flight Stabilizers, which stop you dead when you let go of thrust. Tier V takes an elytra, end rods and dragon's breath: the fastest flight here, and the thirstiest."
  ],
  "quest.3BCE5AB14670A27E.title": "Kick and Stomp",
  "quest.3BCE5AB14670A27E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Up to four Dispenser Upgrades in the boots add a pneumatic kick with heavy knockback, on the boots' kick key. A \"},{\"text\":\"Stomp Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"pneumaticcraft:stomp_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", TNT ringed with pistons, hurts mobs around you when you land hard enough to take damage.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1942F806BE1A86B5.title": "What the boots do for free",
  "quest.1942F806BE1A86B5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Even without upgrades the Pneumatic Boots cancel fall damage for a little air, and give a free one-block step assist you can switch off in the armor screen.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6910A2EE33386404.title": "Plausible deniability",
  "quest.6910A2EE33386404.quest_subtitle": "It opened itself. Honest.",
  "quest.6910A2EE33386404.quest_desc": [
    "You hacked a block with the helmet: a Security Upgrade and the Block Tracker let you flip levers, open doors and switch off spawners from a distance, with the helmet's hacking key."
  ],
  "reward.00FC980AB9397655.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.3302CBE3E23DA022.title": "They never saw it coming",
  "quest.3302CBE3E23DA022.quest_subtitle": "Reprogrammed, not harmed.",
  "quest.3302CBE3E23DA022.quest_desc": [
    "You hacked a living thing with the helmet. Each creature has its own trick: endermen stop teleporting, villagers reshuffle their trades, sheep change colour, and some animals just become yours."
  ],
  "reward.55D7E26C17245169.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.3DBCC563FDD3BBAB.title": "Who put that there?",
  "quest.3DBCC563FDD3BBAB.quest_subtitle": "Kinetic energy, meet stone.",
  "quest.3DBCC563FDD3BBAB.quest_desc": [
    "You flew into a wall fast enough to hurt. Tier IV stabilizers stop you when you let go of thrust, and Builder Mode flies slower."
  ],
  "reward.66EEC44FCF44841C.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.62E1FA669B0AB790.title": "Security Station",
  "quest.62E1FA669B0AB790.quest_desc": [
    "A PCB, two turbine rotors, plastic and glass. Build a network of Diagnostic Subroutine, IO Port, Registry and Nodes in it, and nobody untrusted can open, place or break anything nearby, up to 16 blocks out with Range Upgrades, until they hack it with a helmet."
  ],
  "quest.6C618483B1F7AE4B.title": "Pneumatic Jackhammer",
  "quest.6C618483B1F7AE4B.quest_desc": [
    "It mines anything at one speed, on air, once a drill bit goes in its screen: iron, compressed iron, diamond or netherite, each better and with more dig modes. Bits are pressed in the processing plant with lubricant; diamond digs 3×3. A Silk Touch or Fortune book goes in its book slot.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Diamond Drill Bit is a block of diamond in 8,000 mB of lubricant at 7.5 bar and 500 °C: plan the heat before the diamonds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.376CB63F6E0EB6BA.title": "Elevator",
  "quest.376CB63F6E0EB6BA.quest_subtitle": "Going up. Going down is free.",
  "quest.376CB63F6E0EB6BA.quest_desc": [
    "Bases of plastic and pneumatic cylinders at the bottom, frames of compressed iron stacked above: it rises as high as the frames, up to six blocks per base. It lifts any entity, with air, and a redstone signal on a base sets the height.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:pneumaticcraft:textures/patchouli/elevator.png width:96 height:96 align:center}"
  ],
  "quest.3776239283570D33.title": "Elevator Callers",
  "quest.3776239283570D33.quest_desc": [
    "Stone buttons, plastic and stone. Placed beside the frames, each caller becomes a floor with buttons for every other floor; name the floors in the base's screen. A caller emits redstone while the car is there, and a pulse calls it."
  ],
  "quest.6431528A4A06CED9.title": "Elevators that pay you back",
  "quest.6431528A4A06CED9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Up to four Charging Upgrades in an Elevator Base reclaim air on the way down: with four, 60% of the climb's cost comes back and the descent runs 40% slower. Bases side by side at the same height act as one wide car.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.102CEF252799D43A.title": "Pneumatic Door",
  "quest.102CEF252799D43A.quest_subtitle": "It saw you coming.",
  "quest.102CEF252799D43A.quest_desc": [
    "The door is six compressed iron; its base, a cylinder, a tube and more compressed iron, set level with the door's upper half. With air it opens for a nearby player, a looking player or like a wooden door, and a Security Station keeps it shut to strangers."
  ],
  "quest.13E6C2640FF1CD4A.title": "Air Cannon",
  "quest.13E6C2640FF1CD4A.quest_desc": [
    "A cannon barrel on a stone base, a tube and reinforced slabs. Aim it with a GPS Tool and a redstone pulse throws its items there; with an Entity Tracker Upgrade it throws the nearest entity instead, you included."
  ],
  "quest.0E52573060604097.title": "Aerial Interface",
  "quest.0E52573060604097.quest_subtitle": "Your pockets, from anywhere.",
  "quest.0E52573060604097.quest_desc": [
    "A nether star, ender pearls and an omnidirectional hopper between chamber walls: your inventory as a block, in any dimension. A Requester Frame on it keeps you stocked, a Charging Module on its armor side charges your suit, and a Dispenser Upgrade feeds you when you're hungry.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With air it also lets you breathe underwater for 80 mL per tick, and it charges any FE item you carry from a 100,000 FE buffer.\"}]"
  ],
  "image.79EFB0DF53E6DEDC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drones that need no program\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.5B5BE0CA4A2AC575.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Firepower\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.622E974C349D9267.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Frames and tubes\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.02C5F5E019AF7FB4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Upgrades\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.72343042BAFACE71.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Programming kit\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.7028F5D27731456F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Programs, stored\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.6B604750A396E24C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Blacklist\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.7F42C20845A5F177.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In hand\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.6A9E41F93EBB9BDB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Helmet\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.7C603EAF62D69633.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Chestplate\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.69AC2D66D79D0AE3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Leggings\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.06A8B49DA8F2E866.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Boots\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.0F3B7A5C44B7621F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Around the base\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.066D4027705C26BC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"PneumaticCraft\\nDrones and armor\",\"color\":\"#FFF3D6\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.7503AE1FC3653FF8.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.120B79E347960237.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Pressure\",\"color\":\"#E3A93F\"}]",
  "image.7907C6D6AFB16260.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"start · go to · dig · repeat\",\"color\":\"#B9A27A\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.07D8CE70554DA59C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Start\",\"color\":\"#F2F2F2\"}]",
  "image.3EA00E386A1D56A6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Logistics\",\"color\":\"#F2F2F2\"}]",
  "image.17985A018B02427E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Go To\",\"color\":\"#F2F2F2\"}]",
  "image.3DB176EF394B1A5C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Import\",\"color\":\"#F2F2F2\"}]",
  "image.2A9BB6BA6E697A8B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Dig\",\"color\":\"#F2F2F2\"}]",
  "image.37E945171C90FE8E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"External\\nProgram\",\"color\":\"#F2F2F2\"}]",
  "image.7F061E005831C429.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"head\",\"color\":\"#B9A27A\"}]",
  "image.43D5A3991285CA6E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"chest\",\"color\":\"#B9A27A\"}]",
  "image.7E3CFA685D18A507.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"legs\",\"color\":\"#B9A27A\"}]",
  "image.710FA3BF3A4D9A38.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"feet\",\"color\":\"#B9A27A\"}]",
  "chapter.4303D6A6B06E5331.title": "RFTools and XNet",
  "chapter.4303D6A6B06E5331.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Machine frames and shards, power, the Builder and its cards, screens and logic, teleporters, and XNet's channel networks."
  ],
  "quest.58B31E223A20F0D6.title": "Machine Frame",
  "quest.58B31E223A20F0D6.quest_subtitle": "The chassis of a whole mod family.",
  "quest.58B31E223A20F0D6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two \"},{\"text\":\"Blue Dye\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blue_dye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Gold Nuggets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:gold_nugget\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Machine Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:machine_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Generators, crafters, teleporters, the Builder and the XNet Controller are all built around one, so keep a stack at hand.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.782A76788891D895.title": "Smart Wrench",
  "quest.782A76788891D895.quest_subtitle": "Blue in, yellow out.",
  "quest.782A76788891D895.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two \"},{\"text\":\"Blue Dye\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blue_dye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Smart Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:smartwrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Right-click turns a machine and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" + right-click picks it up; right-click the air for Select mode, which ties blocks to a master block, like shield sections to their projector.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.05304B06AF7BC363.title": "Technology Guide",
  "quest.05304B06AF7BC363.quest_subtitle": "One book, five mods.",
  "quest.05304B06AF7BC363.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and three \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Nuggets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_nugget\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Technology Guide\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:manual\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", one manual for Base, Power, Utility, Builder and XNet. While an RFTools item's tooltip is on screen, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.openManual\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens its page.\"}]",
    "",
    "RFTools Storage and RFTools Dimensions are left out on purpose: AE2 keeps the items, and the pack already has its worlds."
  ],
  "quest.27604CCE0CDE6DFC.title": "Dimensional Shards",
  "quest.27604CCE0CDE6DFC.quest_subtitle": "Fortune says yes.",
  "quest.27604CCE0CDE6DFC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Dimensional Shard Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:dimensionalshard_overworld\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hides between y -15 and 40 in the Overworld, and in the Nether and the End too. Mine it with an iron pickaxe or better for four or five \"},{\"text\":\"Dimensional Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:dimensionalshard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" per block, more with Fortune.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"No ore nearby? A diamond, an emerald, gold, iron, redstone, glowstone dust, quartz, a prismarine shard and glass craft a single shard. It works; it isn't cheap.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.29E9AAEA105FD7E2.title": "Machine Infuser",
  "quest.29E9AAEA105FD7E2.quest_subtitle": "Feed your machines rocks. They like it.",
  "quest.29E9AAEA105FD7E2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four shards, two \"},{\"text\":\"Diamonds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and two redstone around a \"},{\"text\":\"Machine Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:machine_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Machine Infuser\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:machine_infuser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Put a machine and \"},{\"text\":\"Dimensional Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:dimensionalshard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in, give it 600 FE/t, and every shard stays in the machine for good, up to 256.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Most machines spend less FE when infused, and some gain more: the Coal Generator burns longer and hotter, the Builder quarries faster, the Screen Controller reaches farther, Dimensional Cells lose less over distance. Infusing the Infuser makes it cheaper to run.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Infuse what runs all day first. A fully infused Builder quarries 28 blocks a tick instead of 8.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7FB35717721685F6.title": "Infused gems",
  "quest.7FB35717721685F6.quest_subtitle": "Diamonds, now with an extra dimension.",
  "quest.7FB35717721685F6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight \"},{\"text\":\"Dimensional Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:dimensionalshard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make an \"},{\"text\":\"Infused Diamond\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:infused_diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; around an \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Pearl\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_pearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", an \"},{\"text\":\"Infused Ender Pearl\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:infused_enderpearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". The top recipes ask for them: advanced cells, module templates, the blazing and endergenic generators, the Scanner.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.62856E4D18F31118.title": "Look at Dimensional Shard Ore in end stone",
  "quest.11E68B6573C63E11.title": "Shards in the End",
  "quest.11E68B6573C63E11.quest_subtitle": "The void has sparkles too.",
  "quest.11E68B6573C63E11.quest_desc": [
    "The End grows its own shard veins in end stone: eight tries per chunk between y 2 and 80, against two in the Overworld, and twice the size. Bring a Fortune pickaxe and a way home."
  ],
  "reward.21F2EC995469BACF.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.513F15E4F2902951.title": "Shards for the common store",
  "quest.513F15E4F2902951.quest_subtitle": "Infusers are always hungry.",
  "quest.513F15E4F2902951.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Thirty-two \"},{\"text\":\"Dimensional Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:dimensionalshard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day. A Fortune III pickaxe averages six per ore.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7C066FE9FC7FCF26.title": "Coal Generator",
  "quest.7C066FE9FC7FCF26.quest_subtitle": "Old-school FE.",
  "quest.7C066FE9FC7FCF26.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six coal or charcoal and two \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Torches\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone_torch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a \"},{\"text\":\"Machine Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:machine_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Coal Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:coalgenerator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": 60 FE/t for 600 ticks per coal, nine times as long per \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Coal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:coal_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It pushes FE into its neighbours and charges an item in its slot.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fully infused it doubles its output and makes each coal last half again as long: three times the FE per lump.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.190FED7518F4144F.title": "Powercell",
  "quest.190FED7518F4144F.quest_subtitle": "Stackable, like good ideas.",
  "quest.190FED7518F4144F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a redstone block and three redstone make a \"},{\"text\":\"Power Core (Low)\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:power_core1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; four cores, four redstone and a frame, a \"},{\"text\":\"Powercell (Low)\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:cell1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": 500,000 FE, 250 FE/t per face. With no screen, the \"},{\"text\":\"Smart Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:smartwrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sets each face: blue in, yellow out, blank off.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cells of any tier merge into one bank, up to 729 blocks, and each extra cell adds a quarter of the base rate to every face: five cells move twice as fast.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.51CEF74EF94D6644.title": "Medium and High Powercells",
  "quest.51CEF74EF94D6644.quest_subtitle": "Four million, then twenty.",
  "quest.51CEF74EF94D6644.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Power Cores (Medium)\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:power_core2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (shards, an emerald and redstone) and four redstone around a Low cell make a \"},{\"text\":\"Powercell (Medium)\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:cell2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": 4,000,000 FE, 1,000 FE/t per face. \"},{\"text\":\"High cores\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:power_core3\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around that give a \"},{\"text\":\"Powercell (High)\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:cell3\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": 20,000,000 FE, 4,000 FE/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.45510A06967F9601.title": "Dimensional Cell",
  "quest.45510A06967F9601.quest_subtitle": "Power without wires or borders.",
  "quest.45510A06967F9601.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Cells linked by a \"},{\"text\":\"Powercell Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:powercell_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" share one bank, anywhere and in any dimension: put an unlinked card in a cell, then use it on the others. A \"},{\"text\":\"Dimensional Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:dimensionalcell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds 1,000,000 FE and moves 5,000 FE/t; drawing from far away costs up to a tenth extra.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pack change: the Dimensional Cell takes two \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III) in its bottom corners, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Simple\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:dimensionalcell_simple\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one, with a quarter of the capacity and rate, takes one. Infusing a cell cuts the distance cost and raises its rate.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7F1312A254419439.title": "Advanced Dimensional Cell",
  "quest.7F1312A254419439.quest_subtitle": "Four times the everything.",
  "quest.7F1312A254419439.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Infused Diamonds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:infused_diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and four \"},{\"text\":\"Blocks of Redstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:redstone_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a Dimensional Cell make the \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:dimensionalcell_advanced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one: 4,000,000 FE and 20,000 FE/t. Link it with the same card and it joins the bank like any other.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.217A9A026B9C255E.title": "Reading the charge",
  "quest.217A9A026B9C255E.quest_subtitle": "Is it full yet?",
  "quest.217A9A026B9C255E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Information Screen\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:information_screen\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" placed on a cell shows its charge, and the wrench changes what it displays. On a Machine Base, a \"},{\"text\":\"Power Level\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:power_level\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shows a digit from 0 to 9 and emits it as redstone, and a \"},{\"text\":\"Power Monitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:power_monitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" emits only between the percentages you set.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.751BEB9127DC888E.title": "Blazing Agitator",
  "quest.751BEB9127DC888E.quest_subtitle": "Shaken, not stirred.",
  "quest.751BEB9127DC888E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", glass, iron and a frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Blazing Agitator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:blazing_agitator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which spends 10 FE/t turning blaze rods into \"},{\"text\":\"Blazing Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:blazing_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Good rods in its grid make their neighbours finish faster and better, and the lock buttons keep your best ones in place as boosters.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.708E3B66B75618DD.title": "Blazing Generator",
  "quest.708E3B66B75618DD.quest_subtitle": "Warm-up included.",
  "quest.708E3B66B75618DD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four blaze rods, two \"},{\"text\":\"Infused Diamonds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:infused_diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two redstone blocks and a frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Blazing Generator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:blazing_generator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It burns up to four Blazing Rods at once, each with its own power and duration, and needs to warm up before it gives its all, so keep it running.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Blazing Infuser\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:blazing_infuser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" improves finished rods: redstone adds power, quartz and glowstone add duration, shards add both. An infused rod no longer boosts others in the Agitator, so infuse only fuel.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.23ACEAB7303FB1B9.title": "Endergenic Generator",
  "quest.23ACEAB7303FB1B9.quest_subtitle": "Juggling pearls for a living.",
  "quest.23ACEAB7303FB1B9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Endergenic Generators\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:endergenic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pass an ender pearl back and forth, and every well-timed catch pays FE. A \"},{\"text\":\"Pearl Injector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:pearl_injector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" loads the first on a redstone pulse; pair the two with the wrench, which reports the pearl's flight time in ticks.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Pulse the catcher into Charging so the pearl lands on tick 10 of its 15-tick cycle, then fire it on at once: a held pearl costs 500 FE/t and can slip away. \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Monitors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolspower:ender_monitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" watch the generator's state and handle the timing.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.58DECA7D319F0107.title": "Builder",
  "quest.58DECA7D319F0107.quest_subtitle": "Brick by brick, 500 FE apiece.",
  "quest.58DECA7D319F0107.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Bricks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:bricks\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", an ender pearl, redstone and a \"},{\"text\":\"Machine Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:machine_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Builder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:builder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; the pack sets a \"},{\"text\":\"Handling Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:handling_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III) in its foot. With a card and FE it builds, quarries, pumps, clears, and copies or moves whole rooms.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It takes blocks from a chest on top of it or under it and puts what it digs into the same chests. Building costs 500 FE a block.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" + right-click the Builder with a Shape Card to mark an area: two corner clicks set its size and offset.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5A681A52123D7131.title": "Shape Card",
  "quest.5A681A52123D7131.quest_subtitle": "Box, sphere, torus... and a heart.",
  "quest.5A681A52123D7131.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Paper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:paper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two bricks, redstone and iron make a \"},{\"text\":\"Shape Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:shape_card_def\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Right-click it to choose a shape (box, domes, sphere, cylinder, prism, torus, cone, even a heart), its size, offset and whether it is solid or hollow. In the Builder, it builds that shape from your blocks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6BCC84C1A724B3A7.title": "Quarry Card",
  "quest.6BCC84C1A724B3A7.quest_subtitle": "Eight blocks a tick, before breakfast.",
  "quest.6BCC84C1A724B3A7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Shape Card, a \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Pickaxe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_pickaxe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Shovel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond_shovel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", iron and redstone make the \"},{\"text\":\"Quarry Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:shape_card_quarry\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; the pack adds two \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV) in the top corners. The Builder mines the whole shape, 8 blocks a tick, from 300 FE a block.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The card keeps the shape, size and offset of the Shape Card it came from, and hands them on to every card crafted from it."
  ],
  "quest.095CEC2B71BC1EB2.title": "Where to dig",
  "quest.095CEC2B71BC1EB2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Park the Builder in \"},{\"text\":\"the mining dimension\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"706A01ED65FEE247\"}},{\"text\":\", not under your base: a normal Quarry Card refills every hole with dirt, a Clearing one leaves air. The Builder's chunk must stay loaded; the quarry loads the chunk it is digging, one at a time.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6CFAD0EF97557697.title": "Fortune Quarry Card",
  "quest.6CFAD0EF97557697.quest_subtitle": "More ore, same hole.",
  "quest.6CFAD0EF97557697.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four shards, a \"},{\"text\":\"Ghast Tear\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ghast_tear\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", an \"},{\"text\":\"Emerald\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:emerald\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a redstone around a Quarry Card make the \"},{\"text\":\"Fortune\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:shape_card_quarry_fortune\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" version: ores drop as if mined with Fortune, for twice the FE per block.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.47450443504B71B2.title": "Silk Touch Quarry Card",
  "quest.47450443504B71B2.quest_subtitle": "Ores stay ores.",
  "quest.47450443504B71B2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Star\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:nether_star\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", three \"},{\"text\":\"Diamonds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and four shards around a Quarry Card make the \"},{\"text\":\"Silk Touch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:shape_card_quarry_silk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" version. Blocks come out whole, for three times the FE: ore blocks for a processing line that multiplies them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.29B6F92F9CE9BAA0.title": "Nothing but air",
  "quest.29B6F92F9CE9BAA0.quest_subtitle": "Leave not even the dirt behind.",
  "quest.29B6F92F9CE9BAA0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight \"},{\"text\":\"Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a Fortune Quarry Card make the \"},{\"text\":\"Clearing Fortune\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:shape_card_quarry_clear_fortune\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one: the hole stays empty. Fully infused, the Builder takes 28 blocks a tick; feed it from a linked Dimensional Cell and send the haul home over XNet.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2F760D81906579A3.title": "Void, Pump and Liquid Cards",
  "quest.2F760D81906579A3.quest_subtitle": "Delete, drain, pour.",
  "quest.2F760D81906579A3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Obsidian and black dye around a Shape Card make a \"},{\"text\":\"Void Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:shape_card_void\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the Builder deletes the shape without drops, at half the FE. Buckets and redstone make the \"},{\"text\":\"Pump Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:shape_card_pump\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which drains fluids into a tank by the Builder, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Liquid Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:shape_card_liquid\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which pours them out.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7AEEB06B2B144946.title": "Space Chambers",
  "quest.7AEEB06B2B144946.quest_subtitle": "Copy-paste, but for rooms.",
  "quest.7AEEB06B2B144946.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Put seven \"},{\"text\":\"Space Chambers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:space_chamber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:space_chamber_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the corners of a box up to 128 blocks a side, and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" + right-click the Controller with a \"},{\"text\":\"Space Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:space_chamber_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". In the Builder, that card copies, moves or swaps the room.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Right-click the card in the air to list what the room holds. Moving it costs 500 FE a block, five times that into another dimension, and Collect mode gathers the items and XP inside instead."
  ],
  "quest.079EADD02C8453CE.title": "Scanner and Composer",
  "quest.079EADD02C8453CE.quest_subtitle": "Photocopy a castle.",
  "quest.079EADD02C8453CE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Scanner\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:scanner\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reads the area one Shape Card describes and writes it into another as a Scan shape, which the Builder rebuilds elsewhere from your blocks. The \"},{\"text\":\"Composer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:composer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds, subtracts or intersects shapes into one card, and the \"},{\"text\":\"Projector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:projector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" previews any card in the air.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.273D0DFA045CFC50.title": "Shield Projector",
  "quest.273D0DFA045CFC50.quest_subtitle": "A wall of light and FE.",
  "quest.273D0DFA045CFC50.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Template blocks of one colour touching a \"},{\"text\":\"Shield Projector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:shield_block1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" become a force field, or a Shape Card gives it a form. Filters decide who passes, who is blocked and who takes damage, and the look goes from invisible to solid or mimicking a block. Tier 1 covers 256 blocks.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each tier wraps the last: 1,024 blocks with redstone blocks and obsidian, 4,096 with shards, 32,768 with Nether Stars. Eight \"},{\"text\":\"Shield Templates\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:red_shield_template_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" come from wool, dye and glass.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.0F3C37666D49219E.title": "Look at a shield you raised",
  "quest.26D5680DAE4CFF91.title": "Force field",
  "quest.26D5680DAE4CFF91.quest_subtitle": "Nobody gets through. Probably.",
  "quest.26D5680DAE4CFF91.quest_desc": [
    "A damage filter strikes for 5 per hit at 1,000 FE. Switch it to player damage (2,000 FE) and mobs drop loot and XP as if you had swung; with shards in the projector, each hit spends two of them for Looting III."
  ],
  "reward.66D6C24FF40B6D5F.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.7E9C9385B150C8F3.title": "Movers",
  "quest.7E9C9385B150C8F3.quest_subtitle": "A railway without rails.",
  "quest.7E9C9385B150C8F3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Movers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:mover\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in a straight line, up to 128 blocks apart, are stops on a track, and a \"},{\"text\":\"Mover Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:mover_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" placed against one finds every Mover linked to it. Each trip costs the controller 1,000 FE.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3BFE2836A84398FF.title": "Vehicles",
  "quest.3BFE2836A84398FF.quest_subtitle": "Your base, but it drives.",
  "quest.3BFE2836A84398FF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Build the vehicle inside a Space Chamber; the \"},{\"text\":\"Vehicle Builder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:vehicle_builder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" packs it into a \"},{\"text\":\"Vehicle Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:vehicle_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and the card in a Mover sets it down there. A \"},{\"text\":\"Mover Control\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:mover_control\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" block inside steers it, and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.unmountVehicle\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" gets you off.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"From outside, a \"},{\"text\":\"Vehicle Control Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbuilder:vehicle_control_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a Screen, bound to the Mover Controller, sends it to any stop.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.181E685FFBFE7E7E.title": "Matter Transmitter and Receiver",
  "quest.181E685FFBFE7E7E.quest_subtitle": "Beam me home.",
  "quest.181E685FFBFE7E7E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Step into the beam of a \"},{\"text\":\"Matter Transmitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:matter_transmitter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" dialed to a \"},{\"text\":\"Matter Receiver\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:matter_receiver\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and you arrive there, even in another dimension. Both are ender pearls, iron and redstone around a frame; the pack sets a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III) in the Receiver.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Charge the Receiver before anyone uses it: every arrival draws 5,000 FE from it, and landing on one that can't pay hurts."
  ],
  "quest.76F8456772C49F54.title": "Dialing Device",
  "quest.76F8456772C49F54.quest_subtitle": "Pick a number.",
  "quest.76F8456772C49F54.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six redstone and two torches around a frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Dialing Device\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:dialing_device\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It finds transmitters within 10 blocks around it and 5 up or down, lists every receiver in reach and dials; Dial Once hangs up after the first trip.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Simple Dialer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:simple_dialer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" dials on a redstone signal: \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" + right-click it on a transmitter or a dialed receiver to set the route.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.224660F38550102F.title": "Analyzer and Booster",
  "quest.224660F38550102F.quest_subtitle": "Look before you leap.",
  "quest.224660F38550102F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Destination Analyzer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:destination_analyzer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" next to the transmitter colours it by its destination: green is safe, yellow unknown, red bad. A \"},{\"text\":\"Matter Booster\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:matter_booster\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" next to it spends 20,000 FE to land you even when the receiver has run dry.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.38A860709D10EF92.title": "Charged Porters",
  "quest.38A860709D10EF92.quest_subtitle": "A teleporter that fits in a pocket.",
  "quest.38A860709D10EF92.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" + right-click a Receiver with a \"},{\"text\":\"Charged Porter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:charged_porter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to store it, then right-click to go; it pays half again what a transmitter would. The \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:advanced_charged_porter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one holds eight targets and 1,000,000 FE, and teleports four times faster.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.prevDestination\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.nextDestination\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" step through its targets.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4F1056C9A0388EA8.title": "The teleport bill",
  "quest.4F1056C9A0388EA8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A local trip costs the transmitter 5,000 FE plus 10 per block, never more than 100,000, and any trip to another dimension costs the full 100,000, plus 500 FE/t while the beam charges. The transmitter holds 200,000: fill it before the long jumps.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.425583372E07221F.title": "Machine Base",
  "quest.425583372E07221F.quest_subtitle": "A quarter block of brains.",
  "quest.425583372E07221F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three \"},{\"text\":\"Gold Nuggets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:gold_nugget\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" over three stone make a \"},{\"text\":\"Machine Base\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:machine_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the foot of every screen and logic block. Logic blocks sit a quarter block high on floors, walls or ceilings and face the edge your cursor is nearest when you place them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.612F9FC41120325A.title": "Screens",
  "quest.612F9FC41120325A.quest_subtitle": "A dashboard for your base.",
  "quest.612F9FC41120325A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five glass and three iron on a Machine Base make a \"},{\"text\":\"Screen\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:screen\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It shows nothing until you add modules and runs only near a \"},{\"text\":\"Screen Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:screen_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": press Scan in the controller to power every screen in a 32x32x32 area.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The wrench resizes a screen and toggles its transparency; each module's settings have a full-bright switch.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.56F2460D6599157A.title": "Screen modules",
  "quest.56F2460D6599157A.quest_subtitle": "What's on tonight?",
  "quest.56F2460D6599157A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Modules are the screen's channels: the \"},{\"text\":\"Text Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:text_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is free, the \"},{\"text\":\"Energy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:energy_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:inventory_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" ones cost 4 FE/t each. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" + right-click a module on a machine to aim it, then put it in the screen.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"There are also clock, counter, fluid, redstone, button and machine-information modules. Plain ones read targets up to 64 blocks away on each axis, in the same dimension; the Plus versions, like the \"},{\"text\":\"Energy Plus Screen Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:energyplus_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", read any distance and any dimension.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.21BD0826D9586A7F.title": "Tablet",
  "quest.21BD0826D9586A7F.quest_subtitle": "The whole base, in your pocket.",
  "quest.21BD0826D9586A7F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fit a \"},{\"text\":\"Screen Link\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:screen_link\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" + right-click it on a Screen) or a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:redstone_information\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (right-click a transmitter or receiver to add its channel) in a \"},{\"text\":\"Tablet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:tablet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": right-click then opens it wherever the target's chunk is loaded.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" + right-click the tablet to fit up to six; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.prevDestination\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.nextDestination\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" switch between them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.42ED65A4D4594D90.title": "Wireless redstone",
  "quest.42ED65A4D4594D90.quest_subtitle": "Pull a lever three rooms away.",
  "quest.42ED65A4D4594D90.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Transmitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:redstone_transmitter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" opens a channel when placed; right-click it with a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Receiver\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:redstone_receiver\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in hand to tune the receiver in, and switch the receiver to analog to keep the strength. A \"},{\"text\":\"Button Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:button_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a screen sends on a channel too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.57E52BD2048A1FBC.title": "Logic blocks",
  "quest.57E52BD2048A1FBC.quest_subtitle": "Redstone with a degree.",
  "quest.57E52BD2048A1FBC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On Machine Bases: a \"},{\"text\":\"Timer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:timer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pulses at any delay and restarts on every input, a \"},{\"text\":\"Counter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:counter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fires every N pulses, a \"},{\"text\":\"Sequencer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:sequencer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" plays 64 steps in seven modes, and a \"},{\"text\":\"Logic\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:logic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" block maps three inputs to any truth table.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Timer fed by a working process never fires: wire a machine's output pulses into it and it raises the alarm only when the machine stalls.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.57552BCF69FD6EBB.title": "Analog, Digit and Wire",
  "quest.57552BCF69FD6EBB.quest_subtitle": "Small parts, fewer headaches.",
  "quest.57552BCF69FD6EBB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Analog\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:analog\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" multiplies and offsets a signal depending on how its A and B sides compare, a \"},{\"text\":\"Digit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:digit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shows a strength from 0 to F, and a \"},{\"text\":\"Wire\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:wire\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" carries a signal in a straight line without the lag of redstone dust.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.290BC456094F281E.title": "Sensor and Inventory Checker",
  "quest.290BC456094F281E.quest_subtitle": "Eyes on the farm.",
  "quest.290BC456094F281E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Sensor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:sensor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" looks 1, 3 or 5 blocks ahead for blocks, fluids, crop growth, mobs or players and emits redstone. An \"},{\"text\":\"Inventory Checker\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:invchecker\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" emits when a slot of the inventory behind it holds more than a set number of an item or tag. Slots count from zero.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.36B12A0BD6F53671.title": "Crafter",
  "quest.36B12A0BD6F53671.quest_subtitle": "It crafts while you mine.",
  "quest.36B12A0BD6F53671.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two crafting tables and two redstone torches around a frame make a \"},{\"text\":\"Crafter Tier 1\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:crafter1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Lay a recipe in its grid and apply it; ingredients go in 26 slots, results come out of 4, and each craft costs 100 FE. Tier 1 remembers two recipes.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"R remembers what sits in a slot so only that item goes there; F forgets. In Int mode a result stays inside to feed the next recipe. The Crafting Card from the manual has no reader in this pack: the Crafter keeps its recipes itself.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.50CABE0EA36EF81B.title": "Crafter Tiers 2 and 3",
  "quest.50CABE0EA36EF81B.quest_subtitle": "Two, four, eight.",
  "quest.50CABE0EA36EF81B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two more crafting tables and torches around a Crafter make the next tier, recipes and contents included: \"},{\"text\":\"Tier 2\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:crafter2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" remembers four recipes and \"},{\"text\":\"Tier 3\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:crafter3\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" eight. Fast mode runs five crafts at a time, and infusion cuts the FE.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1C4C957B5C85CA8F.title": "Environmental Controller",
  "quest.1C4C957B5C85CA8F.quest_subtitle": "Buffs by the cubic metre.",
  "quest.1C4C957B5C85CA8F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Diamond, emerald, gold and iron blocks and ender pearls around a frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Environmental Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:environmental_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; the pack swaps one pearl for a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III). Up to seven modules act on everyone inside its radius and height band, and each costs FE per block covered.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every module starts as a \"},{\"text\":\"Module Template\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:module_template\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": four shards and four iron around an Infused Diamond. The filter picks who is affected (everyone, listed players, passive or hostile mobs), and mobs cost double.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.424D4DCD81CCFBEE.title": "Syringe",
  "quest.424D4DCD81CCFBEE.quest_subtitle": "This might sting a little.",
  "quest.424D4DCD81CCFBEE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Glass Bottle\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:glass_bottle\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Syringe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:syringe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Hit a mob with it ten times, always the same kind, and it holds that mob's essence: effect modules and the Spawner both start from a full one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.625D93D2ED91DBFA.title": "Effect modules",
  "quest.625D93D2ED91DBFA.quest_subtitle": "Coffee for the whole room.",
  "quest.625D93D2ED91DBFA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A full syringe, a Module Template and seven matching items make a module: wolf and \"},{\"text\":\"Powered Rails\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:powered_rail\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for \"},{\"text\":\"Speed\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:speed_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", pillager and redstone for \"},{\"text\":\"Haste\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:haste_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", zombie and rotten flesh for \"},{\"text\":\"Saturation\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:saturation_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Each costs 0.001 FE/t per block covered.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Plus versions (Speed, Haste, Regeneration and Saturation III) add a Plus template and infused gems and cost three times as much. Blindness, Poison, Slowness and Weakness only touch mobs here, and No-Teleport pins endermen and shulkers in place."
  ],
  "quest.50CFB8CC0A0BC881.title": "Peaceful Module",
  "quest.50CFB8CC0A0BC881.quest_subtitle": "No monsters, no drama.",
  "quest.50CFB8CC0A0BC881.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An iron golem's syringe, a \"},{\"text\":\"ModulePlus Template\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:moduleplus_template\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", four \"},{\"text\":\"Blocks of Iron\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and three \"},{\"text\":\"Infused Ender Pearls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:infused_enderpearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Peaceful Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:peaceful_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": no hostile mob spawns inside the controller's range, for 0.001 FE/t per block.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.083D065001E084EC.title": "Flight Module",
  "quest.083D065001E084EC.quest_subtitle": "Creative mode, rented by the block.",
  "quest.083D065001E084EC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A ghast's syringe, a ModulePlus Template, six \"},{\"text\":\"Ghast Tears\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ghast_tear\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and an \"},{\"text\":\"Infused Ender Pearl\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:infused_enderpearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Flight Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:flight_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": creative flight for anyone in range, at 0.004 FE/t per block, four times a basic module.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5A1F529EBFEAF725.title": "Spawner",
  "quest.5A1F529EBFEAF725.quest_subtitle": "Mobs to order.",
  "quest.5A1F529EBFEAF725.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A full syringe in the \"},{\"text\":\"Spawner\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:spawner\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" picks the mob. \"},{\"text\":\"Matter Beamers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:matter_beamer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", linked with the wrench and given a redstone signal, feed it the three materials that mob's recipe lists, and FE does the rest: 800 FE for a zombie, 1,000 for a blaze.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Pack change: the Spawner takes an \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV) in a bottom corner, and it has no Wither or Ender Dragon recipe: no boss comes out of a machine here.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Infuse the beamers: they send more per pulse for less FE. Materials the mob doesn't need are ignored.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.0F34816A42DE1D71.title": "A syringe full of Wither",
  "quest.3E97C0EDD20723C8.title": "A sample from the Wither",
  "quest.3E97C0EDD20723C8.quest_subtitle": "Ten jabs. It noticed.",
  "quest.3E97C0EDD20723C8.quest_desc": [
    "The syringe takes bosses like any other mob: ten hits and it's full. In this pack the Spawner makes no bosses, though: a Wither for a tenth of a star would have printed stars."
  ],
  "reward.723B044FC0431D62.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.06141C8077AB2510.title": "XNet Controller",
  "quest.06141C8077AB2510.quest_subtitle": "Eight channels, one brain.",
  "quest.06141C8077AB2510.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two repeaters, a comparator, redstone, iron and a frame make the \"},{\"text\":\"Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"xnet:controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; the pack puts a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III) where its gold went. It runs up to eight channels (items, fluids, energy or logic) for every connector on its cable network.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It draws 1 FE/t per active channel and 2 FE per operation from a 100,000 FE buffer, so wire it to power first."
  ],
  "quest.57B2140EFD756F01.title": "Cables and connectors",
  "quest.57B2140EFD756F01.quest_subtitle": "Red never talks to blue.",
  "quest.57B2140EFD756F01.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"String, redstone, a gold nugget and a dye make sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Network Cables\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"xnet:netcable_red\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; red, green, blue and yellow never join, so four networks can share a wall. A \"},{\"text\":\"Connector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"xnet:connector_red\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (a chest, gold, redstone and dye) goes on the cable beside each block the network should reach.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Name a connector in its screen and the Controller lists it by that name. Any cable or connector can be re-dyed in the crafting grid."
  ],
  "quest.70EA46A774BBF977.title": "Item channels",
  "quest.70EA46A774BBF977.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An item channel shares by priority or round robin, and each connector inserts or extracts. Extractors take from the first slot, a random one or in order; one item, a stack or a set count; every 10 ticks at best, 5 on an advanced connector.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0B100AF4DA0987E5.title": "Fluid channels",
  "quest.0B100AF4DA0987E5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A fluid connector moves up to 1,000 mB per operation, 5,000 when advanced. Its minimum and maximum pause it when the tank on the other side gets too empty or too full.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.766AEE98414EBF0E.title": "Energy channels",
  "quest.766AEE98414EBF0E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Energy connectors carry up to 10,000 FE/t, advanced ones 100,000. Give the machines that must never starve a higher priority and let the rest share what is left.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7CF9EF22817C4CDF.title": "Logic channels",
  "quest.7CF9EF22817C4CDF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A logic connector in Sensor mode reads the items, fluid, energy or redstone of its block and lights a colour when a comparison holds; one in Output mode turns that colour into redstone. Feed a generator's fuel only while its buffer is low.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1ED624C1C43D1356.title": "Filter Module",
  "quest.1ED624C1C43D1356.quest_subtitle": "Only the good stuff.",
  "quest.1ED624C1C43D1356.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A hopper, iron, redstone and paper make a \"},{\"text\":\"Filter Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsbase:filter_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": items, blocks and tags as a whitelist or blacklist, matching NBT and damage if you want. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" + right-click a chest to copy what it holds. The Controller holds four for its item connectors; Crafters and Builders take one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.72F958976F6C18DD.title": "Tank",
  "quest.72F958976F6C18DD.quest_subtitle": "Thirty-two buckets, one flavour.",
  "quest.72F958976F6C18DD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Glass, buckets, iron and a frame make an RFTools \"},{\"text\":\"Tank\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"rftoolsutility:tank\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for 32,000 mB. A filled bucket in its filter slot locks it to that fluid, so a fluid channel can't mix things up.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.655F01B97DD53BD2.title": "Advanced connectors",
  "quest.655F01B97DD53BD2.quest_subtitle": "Same wire, more lanes.",
  "quest.655F01B97DD53BD2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Paper, a \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", an ender pearl and redstone make a \"},{\"text\":\"Connector Upgrade Kit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"xnet:connector_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" + right-click a placed connector to make it advanced. It moves items every 5 ticks, 100,000 FE/t and 5,000 mB, and reaches any side of the block it touches.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.39F2B06F5B6C0B59.title": "Redstone Proxy",
  "quest.39F2B06F5B6C0B59.quest_subtitle": "A stand-in for your redstone.",
  "quest.39F2B06F5B6C0B59.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight redstone around a frame make a \"},{\"text\":\"Redstone Proxy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"xnet:redstone_proxy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a plain block a logic connector can read or drive when the real contraption has no good face. Craft it with a torch for the \"},{\"text\":\"update\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"xnet:redstone_proxy_upd\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" version, which also wakes up its neighbours.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.64E9E38C94BBDB98.title": "Facades",
  "quest.64E9E38C94BBDB98.quest_subtitle": "Cables? What cables?",
  "quest.64E9E38C94BBDB98.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Paper, wool and glass make sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Facades\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"xnet:facade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Right-click a block to copy its look, then right-click a cable or connector to hide it inside; break the facade and the cable is back.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4B7327FBE1FDB730.title": "Router",
  "quest.4B7327FBE1FDB730.quest_subtitle": "Networks, meet networks.",
  "quest.4B7327FBE1FDB730.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Routing cables (black dye) and routing connectors (redstone and gold around any connector) join a \"},{\"text\":\"Router\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"xnet:router\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to several controllers. In it, one network publishes a channel under a name and another consumes it: up to 32 published channels per routing network.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.66117F0122FEB0E2.title": "Wireless Router",
  "quest.66117F0122FEB0E2.quest_subtitle": "Look, no cables.",
  "quest.66117F0122FEB0E2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Router\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"xnet:wireless_router\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" needs an \"},{\"text\":\"Antenna Base\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"xnet:antenna_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on top and an \"},{\"text\":\"Antenna\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"xnet:antenna\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on that: 100 blocks of range, 500 with a second antenna above. Two routers link when each sits within the other's range, in the same dimension; each published channel costs 20 or 50 FE/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.02619F5F1BD9855B.title": "Antenna Dish",
  "quest.02619F5F1BD9855B.quest_subtitle": "Anywhere, any world.",
  "quest.02619F5F1BD9855B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Antenna Dish\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"xnet:antenna_dish\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the Antenna Base, instead of antennas, gives unlimited range, and two routers with dishes link even across dimensions. Each channel they publish costs 200 FE/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "image.1951DEF90E777B81.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Infusion\",\"color\":\"#7FE3DD\"}]",
  "image.5B21CF069E60A25D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Power\",\"color\":\"#7FE3DD\"}]",
  "image.5453752DE8AB28DE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Cards and quarries\",\"color\":\"#7FE3DD\"}]",
  "image.2DAF7B281A049DC4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Scan, move and shield\",\"color\":\"#7FE3DD\"}]",
  "image.7CF639A1591A833E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Teleportation\",\"color\":\"#7FE3DD\"}]",
  "image.3B668BC1BFC4B714.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Screens and logic\",\"color\":\"#7FE3DD\"}]",
  "image.5B34AB64D8D735D6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Environment and spawning\",\"color\":\"#7FE3DD\"}]",
  "image.140F67A6CC69B2FA.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Items\",\"color\":\"#7FE3DD\"}]",
  "image.78B6BC2EB17D6AB1.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fluids\",\"color\":\"#7FE3DD\"}]",
  "image.5613B848BDD8BB2E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Energy\",\"color\":\"#7FE3DD\"}]",
  "image.0A98342320671571.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Logic\",\"color\":\"#7FE3DD\"}]",
  "image.450D26BFF37AFED6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Routing\",\"color\":\"#7FE3DD\"}]",
  "image.0C1630A376B5408F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"RFTools and XNet\",\"color\":\"#EAFBFA\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.60E032750E759347.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"one frame, many machines\",\"color\":\"#9FEDE7\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.5CBE8BE0C3C92460.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "chapter.09DFA10FF144C082.title": "Refined Storage",
  "chapter.09DFA10FF144C082.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Disks, grids and autocrafting on one network: no channels, devices just touch."
  ],
  "quest.092BCE5A62415FEB.title": "Quartz Enriched Iron",
  "quest.092BCE5A62415FEB.quest_subtitle": "Iron that picked up a quartz habit.",
  "quest.092BCE5A62415FEB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three \"},{\"text\":\"Iron Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:quartz\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in a 2×2 grid make four \"},{\"text\":\"Quartz Enriched Iron\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:quartz_enriched_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Casings, disks and almost every device start here.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.54732CCEAF78597A.title": "AE2 or Refined Storage?",
  "quest.54732CCEAF78597A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Here both controllers take a Routing Matrix. Refined Storage has no channels: devices only need to touch the network, and disks count items, not types. AE2 makes you plan channels and brings more addons. Pick one main storage; the other road is \"},{\"text\":\"AE2 · Network\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1E24729503A1C81A\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.025E856BE0A514AA.title": "Enriched by the stack",
  "quest.025E856BE0A514AA.quest_subtitle": "The network pays in metal.",
  "quest.025E856BE0A514AA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sixty-four \"},{\"text\":\"Quartz Enriched Iron\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:quartz_enriched_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day. Write it into a crafting pattern and it keeps coming as long as iron and quartz do.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.768B95CEAB6E83BD.title": "Into the furnace",
  "quest.768B95CEAB6E83BD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Smelt \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:quartz\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" into \"},{\"text\":\"Silicon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:silicon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Each raw processor takes one, each 1k storage part four, and the controller two.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4FB7A47C14F171A1.title": "Quartz on tap",
  "quest.4FB7A47C14F171A1.quest_subtitle": "The Nether is optional. Diorite isn't.",
  "quest.4FB7A47C14F171A1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Refined Storage runs on \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Quartz\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:quartz\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a quarter of each Quartz Enriched Iron, all its silicon, every destruction core. No Nether trip yet? Create's \"},{\"text\":\"Crushing Wheels\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:crushing_wheel\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" get quartz out of \"},{\"text\":\"Diorite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diorite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" one time in four.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.33943ED8452F5D57.title": "Sticky business",
  "quest.33943ED8452F5D57.quest_subtitle": "Slime holds the whole network together.",
  "quest.33943ED8452F5D57.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Slimeball\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:slime_ball\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" between two \"},{\"text\":\"String\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:string\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes eight \"},{\"text\":\"Processor Binding\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:processor_binding\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", one for each raw processor.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.05ADD56B9952F082.title": "Three processors",
  "quest.05ADD56B9952F082.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Binding, silicon and redstone plus iron, gold or a diamond make a raw processor, and the furnace finishes it: \"},{\"text\":\"Basic\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:basic_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Improved\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:improved_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Processor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:advanced_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Save diamonds: the controller and the drive want the last one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.306E7CEC236531EB.title": "Build and break",
  "quest.306E7CEC236531EB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Processor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:basic_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with glowstone dust is a \"},{\"text\":\"Construction Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:construction_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; with Nether Quartz, a \"},{\"text\":\"Destruction Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:destruction_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Devices that put things somewhere take the first, those that take things away the second, and grids take both.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.35C49D84762C46F4.title": "The shell",
  "quest.35C49D84762C46F4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight \"},{\"text\":\"Quartz Enriched Iron\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:quartz_enriched_iron\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a block of stone make a \"},{\"text\":\"Machine Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:machine_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": the body of the controller, the drive, the grid and most blocks after them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.00C3E7E3AAEE0179.title": "Turn and take apart",
  "quest.00C3E7E3AAEE0179.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Quartz Enriched Iron and a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Processor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:basic_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the \"},{\"text\":\"Wrench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:wrench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": use it to rotate a Refined Storage block, and sneak-use it to dismantle one. Carry On won't lift them in this pack.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.10FAA64D2E954C57.title": "Copper, then cable",
  "quest.10FAA64D2E954C57.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three copper and a quartz make four \"},{\"text\":\"Quartz Enriched Copper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:quartz_enriched_copper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; six of it around glass and redstone give twelve \"},{\"text\":\"Cable\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:cable\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Devices also connect just by touching each other.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.427B8236C0805010.title": "A matrix for the heart",
  "quest.427B8236C0805010.quest_subtitle": "Same part, other network.",
  "quest.427B8236C0805010.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Here the \"},{\"text\":\"Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes a \"},{\"text\":\"Routing Matrix\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:routing_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" where one silicon used to go: two \"},{\"text\":\"Logic Processors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2:logic_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a PneumaticCraft circuit board, two Palis crystals and a calibration frame. The first one belongs to \"},{\"text\":\"A Shared Language\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"17BBD680007901AB\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2A2F996E127DE9DE.title": "Colour-coded",
  "quest.2A2F996E127DE9DE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Craft any device or cable with a dye to recolour it. A coloured cable joins only its own colour or plain grey; full blocks join every colour. Two cable colours let two networks run side by side without merging.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.32B9B66B927733C8.title": "Energy budget",
  "quest.32B9B66B927733C8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A controller holds 1,000 FE and every device draws its share each tick: a grid 10, a drive 10 plus 4 per disk, a network transmitter 32. Several controllers can power the same network.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.22CE2389278194D6.title": "Look at a Controller with no power",
  "quest.76979388CABCC684.title": "Lights out",
  "quest.76979388CABCC684.quest_subtitle": "Have you tried plugging it in?",
  "quest.76979388CABCC684.quest_desc": [
    "You met a dark controller: below 1% of its buffer it switches the whole network off. Grids go blank, disks stop answering, and everything comes back the moment FE flows in again."
  ],
  "reward.19408EEE50475B40.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.0C90134B43428CA3.title": "Power to the network",
  "quest.0C90134B43428CA3.quest_subtitle": "The heart, battery included.",
  "quest.0C90134B43428CA3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Quartz Enriched Iron, an \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Processor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:advanced_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two silicon, a casing and the matrix make the \"},{\"text\":\"Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Feed it FE: every device on the network draws from its buffer, and with the buffer empty nothing works.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5382BA302E8991CE.title": "Eight slots",
  "quest.5382BA302E8991CE.quest_subtitle": "Plug in, fill up.",
  "quest.5382BA302E8991CE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A chest, a casing, an \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Processor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:advanced_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and Quartz Enriched Iron make the \"},{\"text\":\"Disk Drive\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:disk_drive\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It holds eight storage disks and lists them all as one storage.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:refinedstorage:textures/block/disk_drive/front.png width:48 height:48 align:center}",
    "",
    "Each disk shows a light on the drive's face. A disk counts items, not types: fill one with a single block or a thousand kinds, it's the same space."
  ],
  "quest.7C60EA6BFACC4923.title": "1k, then 4k",
  "quest.7C60EA6BFACC4923.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A 1k storage part wrapped in glass, redstone and Quartz Enriched Iron is a \"},{\"text\":\"1k Storage Disk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:1k_storage_disk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"1,024 items\",\"color\":\"#D8C8FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":\"Here 1k means 1,024, not 1,000.\"}},{\"text\":\". Three 1k parts and four Basic Processors make a 4k part, and a disk crafted with a bigger part upgrades, contents and all.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5A83D25E27AC434A.title": "Improved tier",
  "quest.5A83D25E27AC434A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Improved Processors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:improved_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and three parts of the tier below make each next part: a \"},{\"text\":\"16k Storage Disk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:16k_storage_disk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds 16,384 items, a \"},{\"text\":\"1024B Fluid Storage Disk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:1024b_fluid_storage_disk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 1,024 buckets.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2CC45B74F48DD2DA.title": "Advanced tier",
  "quest.2CC45B74F48DD2DA.quest_subtitle": "Diamonds, well spent.",
  "quest.2CC45B74F48DD2DA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Advanced Processors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:advanced_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" top the ladder: a \"},{\"text\":\"64k Storage Disk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:64k_storage_disk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds 65,536 items and a \"},{\"text\":\"4096B Fluid Storage Disk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:4096b_fluid_storage_disk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" 4,096 buckets. A drive full of 64k disks passes half a million items.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1390F2BE736126B0.title": "Disks without a drive",
  "quest.1390F2BE736126B0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Any storage part in a casing becomes a storage block that joins the network by itself, no drive needed, like a \"},{\"text\":\"1k Storage Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:1k_storage_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or a \"},{\"text\":\"64B Fluid Storage Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:64b_fluid_storage_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Broken, it keeps what it holds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.487B8630E765B3F8.title": "Nothing is wasted",
  "quest.487B8630E765B3F8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Use an empty disk while holding it and you get its storage part back; an empty storage block returns its part and its Machine Casing. Rebuilding a bigger setup costs \"},{\"text\":\"nothing\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5F24C8E4C696A42A.title": "Chests join the network",
  "quest.5F24C8E4C696A42A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"External Storage\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:external_storage\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a chest, barrel, drawer or tank lists what's inside on the network and stores into it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Aim it at a Functional Storage \"},{\"text\":\"Storage Controller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"functionalstorage:storage_controller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and every linked drawer joins at once.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3E51495A62D760CB.title": "Storage pecking order",
  "quest.3E51495A62D760CB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Drives, storage blocks and External Storage each have a priority: resources go into the highest first and leave from it first. An allowlist filter ties items to one storage, and void excess deletes what no longer fits there.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.245716722C1DD09D.title": "Spare shells",
  "quest.245716722C1DD09D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Glass, redstone and Quartz Enriched Iron make a \"},{\"text\":\"Storage Housing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:storage_housing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Any storage part plus a housing is a finished disk, so a few spare housings turn loose parts into disks in one step.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1741C58E7AABC190.title": "Buckets on disk",
  "quest.1741C58E7AABC190.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Swap redstone for a bucket and the parts hold fluids: a \"},{\"text\":\"64B Fluid Storage Disk\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:64b_fluid_storage_disk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds 64 buckets. Grids list fluids beside items, and a side button shows one kind only.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.25865080017091A2.title": "Chemicals too",
  "quest.25865080017091A2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Mekanism bridge adds chemicals as a third resource: importers, exporters, External Storage, grids, storage monitors and autocrafters handle them like fluids. The chemical disks are in \"},{\"text\":\"Chemicals in Refined Storage\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"4C1E738B853DD5DB\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2DF0680282D23B52.title": "One search box",
  "quest.2DF0680282D23B52.quest_subtitle": "Every chest you own, in one window.",
  "quest.2DF0680282D23B52.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two Improved Processors, both cores, glass and a casing make the \"},{\"text\":\"Grid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:grid\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": every disk, storage block and External Storage in one window, searched as you type.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.119CE532DF85C65F.title": "Search like a librarian",
  "quest.119CE532DF85C65F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In a grid, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.refinedstorage.focus_search_bar\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" jumps to the search box. Start with @ for a mod, # for a tag or $ for tooltip text. Side buttons sort by count, name or last change, and can show only what autocrafting can make.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.02300D001A32355C.title": "A bench on the network",
  "quest.02300D001A32355C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Grid, an Advanced Processor and a crafting table make the \"},{\"text\":\"Crafting Grid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:crafting_grid\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": craft straight out of storage, and its 3×3 refills from the network after every craft. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.refinedstorage.clear_crafting_grid_matrix_to_network\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" sends what's left on it back to the network.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.13DD9E12275A5772.title": "Blank patterns",
  "quest.13DD9E12275A5772.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Glass, redstone and Quartz Enriched Iron make a \"},{\"text\":\"Pattern\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:pattern\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". A written pattern is a recipe the network can repeat; sneak-use it to wipe it clean for reuse.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4DBF19D35FE33780.title": "A window on one item",
  "quest.4DBF19D35FE33780.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Storage Monitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:storage_monitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" shows one resource and its count. Left-click takes a stack out, right-click stores what you hold, and quick right-clicks store every one you carry.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3BF8277D84F5415B.title": "EMI does the typing",
  "quest.3BF8277D84F5415B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In EMI, the + on a recipe fills the Crafting Grid from the network, or writes the recipe into the Pattern Grid. A grid's synchronization button can also mirror its search box into EMI's filter, one way or both.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2B7F4D2A5A49DB38.title": "Four kinds of pattern",
  "quest.2B7F4D2A5A49DB38.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Pattern Grid writes crafting, processing, stonecutter and smithing table patterns. Fuzzy mode lets a crafting pattern take alternatives, like any planks, and processing slots accept the tags you allow.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1369D14F7AADABE3.title": "Storage to go",
  "quest.1369D14F7AADABE3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two grids and a controller in Quartz Enriched Iron make the \"},{\"text\":\"Portable Grid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:portable_grid\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": one disk, its own 1,000 FE battery and no network at all. Open it from your inventory or sneak-place it as a block; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.refinedstorage.open_portable_grid\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens it once you give that key a binding.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.51C3C2B8607DF302.title": "Look at a placed Portable Grid",
  "quest.6BDA3DB195DEC9F3.title": "Portable, but parked",
  "quest.6BDA3DB195DEC9F3.quest_subtitle": "All that portability, to leave it on the floor.",
  "quest.6BDA3DB195DEC9F3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"You set the \"},{\"text\":\"Portable Grid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:portable_grid\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" down as a block. It still reads its one disk, and now any FE cable can charge it like a machine. Break it and it comes along again, disk and charge included.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.6A747B3F6219AE62.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.209B0A1ED546BE7E.title": "Pull it in",
  "quest.209B0A1ED546BE7E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Cable, a \"},{\"text\":\"Destruction Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:destruction_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and an Improved Processor make an \"},{\"text\":\"Importer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:importer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it pulls from the inventory it faces into the network, filtered by an allow or block list.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4AF54AD3486EC50E.title": "Push it out",
  "quest.4AF54AD3486EC50E.quest_subtitle": "The furnace never waits for you again.",
  "quest.4AF54AD3486EC50E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Swap the destruction core for a \"},{\"text\":\"Construction Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:construction_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and you get an \"},{\"text\":\"Exporter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:exporter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it pushes only what its filter names into the inventory it faces. An exporter over a furnace and an importer under it make a smelter that feeds itself, fuel aside.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.748DCAC5DEF7B093.title": "A counter for pipes",
  "quest.748DCAC5DEF7B093.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Importer, an Exporter, a casing and redstone make the \"},{\"text\":\"Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it keeps nine slots stocked with what you set, for pipes and machines to pull from, and whatever they push into it goes to the network.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7EE5A91CD3F6715E.title": "Pour a disk out",
  "quest.7EE5A91CD3F6715E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Disk Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:disk_interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes six disks and moves their contents into the network, or fills them from it. Use it to empty an old disk, or to pack a chosen stock into one and carry it off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4FFB37E757DD93E4.title": "Blank upgrades",
  "quest.4FFB37E757DD93E4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Improved Processor in glass and Quartz Enriched Iron is a blank \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Every speed, stack, regulator, range and autocrafting upgrade starts as one, and so do the enchanted ones.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7F55EF6672E13CAC.title": "Sugar rush",
  "quest.7F55EF6672E13CAC.quest_subtitle": "Four is the limit. Your dentist agrees.",
  "quest.7F55EF6672E13CAC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three sugar and Quartz Enriched Iron around an \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a \"},{\"text\":\"Speed Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:speed_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Importers, exporters, constructors, destructors, disk interfaces and autocrafters take up to four, each adding 4 FE per tick.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.539EE3BACFC773DC.title": "By the stack",
  "quest.539EE3BACFC773DC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Speed Upgrades\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:speed_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and five sugar make a \"},{\"text\":\"Stack Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:stack_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". One fits per importer, exporter, constructor or disk interface, and it moves 64 at a time instead of one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7BAFF1A1552163BB.title": "Keep it at N",
  "quest.7BAFF1A1552163BB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A comparator and redstone on an Upgrade make the \"},{\"text\":\"Regulator Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:regulator_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; use it to set an amount. An Exporter then only exports while the target holds less than that, an Importer only imports while it holds more.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2AD215C33B684DDF.title": "Same settings, next device",
  "quest.2AD215C33B684DDF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sneak-use a \"},{\"text\":\"Configuration Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:configuration_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a device to copy its settings and upgrades, then sneak-use it on another of the same kind to paste them. Sneak-use it in the air to clear it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.330E2F5809DE66F8.title": "Break into storage",
  "quest.330E2F5809DE66F8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Destructor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:destructor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" breaks the block in front of it and stores the drops, filtered by an allow or block list. In pickup mode it gathers the items lying in front of it instead.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.355D5EE6B779EF6B.title": "Place from storage",
  "quest.355D5EE6B779EF6B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Constructor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:constructor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" places the blocks its filter names, from the network into the spot in front of it. In drop mode it throws items instead, and with an autocrafting upgrade it first crafts whatever is missing.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6FF80467B51C056D.title": "Redstone by the count",
  "quest.6FF80467B51C056D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Detector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:detector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" watches one resource and gives a redstone signal when the network holds less than, exactly or more than the amount you set. Wire it to a farm and the farm stops once the stock is full.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.51229A032B9EDC78.title": "Gentle hands",
  "quest.51229A032B9EDC78.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Upgrade, a Silk Touch \"},{\"text\":\"Enchanted Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:enchanted_book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two bookshelves and five Quartz Enriched Iron make the \"},{\"text\":\"Silk Touch Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:silk_touch_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". In a Destructor it breaks blocks whole, like the enchanted pickaxe.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0ECAC65D50BCCE67.title": "Lucky breaks",
  "quest.0ECAC65D50BCCE67.quest_subtitle": "Luck is just maths with a book.",
  "quest.0ECAC65D50BCCE67.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The same recipe with a Fortune book gives the upgrade of that level; the \"},{\"text\":\"Fortune III Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:fortune_3_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" needs a Fortune III book. In a Destructor it multiplies ore drops like the pickaxe enchantment.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.11CF3CA51536FEDB.title": "Endless cobble",
  "quest.11CF3CA51536FEDB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Face a Destructor at a cobblestone generator and cobble flows in on its own. Set its redstone mode and a Detector next to it can cut it off at, say, ten thousand.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.39B92FEDAE94E47B.title": "Write it down",
  "quest.39B92FEDAE94E47B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Grid, an Advanced Processor and a Pattern make the \"},{\"text\":\"Pattern Grid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:pattern_grid\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Lay out a recipe, press create, and a blank pattern comes out written.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1486B24C529A5BCF.title": "Hands for the crafter",
  "quest.1486B24C529A5BCF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Autocrafter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:autocrafter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes a \"},{\"text\":\"Handling Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:handling_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" where its casing used to go: two blank router modules, a \"},{\"text\":\"Precision Mechanism\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:precision_mechanism\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a power regulator. The first one belongs to \"},{\"text\":\"Small Hands, Large Workshops\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6C696AA48D00D512\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.693470EAA0DF5046.title": "It crafts while you don't",
  "quest.693470EAA0DF5046.quest_subtitle": "Nine recipes per box.",
  "quest.693470EAA0DF5046.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Both cores, two Advanced Processors and the handling core make the \"},{\"text\":\"Autocrafter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:autocrafter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", with room for nine patterns. Crafting patterns run inside it; processing patterns go to the machine it faces. Click anything autocraftable in a grid and the network makes it, parts first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.64046813EA62830E.title": "On demand",
  "quest.64046813EA62830E.quest_subtitle": "The chest that refills itself.",
  "quest.64046813EA62830E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A construction core and two crafting tables on an Upgrade make the \"},{\"text\":\"Autocrafting Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:autocrafting_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". In an Exporter, Interface or Constructor it crafts whatever is missing: with a Regulator Upgrade beside it, an exporter keeps any chest at the amount you set.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.199EE20D52999C18.title": "Every pattern, one screen",
  "quest.199EE20D52999C18.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two Autocrafters, two Advanced Processors and a casing make the \"},{\"text\":\"Autocrafter Manager\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:autocrafter_manager\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": every autocrafter on the network and its patterns in one screen, searchable by name, input or output.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6EEE74B2A7DA9CA6.title": "Jobs in progress",
  "quest.6EEE74B2A7DA9CA6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Autocrafting Monitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:autocrafting_monitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" follows every running job step by step, and tells you why one is stuck: no machine found, machine won't take it, autocrafter locked. Cancel one job or all of them from there.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.42632901D609BA0A.title": "Machines on patterns",
  "quest.42632901D609BA0A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A processing pattern lists what goes into the machine and what must come back to the network; an Importer or the machine's own output brings it home. Lock modes stop the autocrafter from flooding a slow machine.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7D94078B4C91C6D8.title": "Chained crafters",
  "quest.7D94078B4C91C6D8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An Autocrafter facing another one joins its chain: up to eight of them feed their patterns through the head into a single machine. Speed Upgrades, up to four, make each one faster.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.27DBD6F23A8605F2.title": "Look before you craft",
  "quest.27DBD6F23A8605F2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every request opens a preview: what's in stock, what gets crafted and what's missing, as a list or a tree. Max fills in the most you can make right now, and Notify pings you when the job is done.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2CD3875062B75B90.title": "Off the cable",
  "quest.2CD3875062B75B90.quest_subtitle": "Freedom, 16 blocks at a time.",
  "quest.2CD3875062B75B90.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An ender pearl, an Advanced Processor and a casing make the \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Transmitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:wireless_transmitter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": wireless items reach the network within 16 blocks of it. Several transmitters cover a wider area.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.513F06F955BF43C6.title": "A grid you carry",
  "quest.513F06F955BF43C6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Grid, an ender pearl and an Advanced Processor make the \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Grid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:wireless_grid\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Use it on any network device to bind it; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.refinedstorage.open_wireless_grid\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens it from your inventory once you give that key a binding in Controls.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1E20DF61CA0A91F3.title": "Longer reach",
  "quest.1E20DF61CA0A91F3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three ender pearls and Quartz Enriched Iron on an Upgrade make a \"},{\"text\":\"Range Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:range_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": each adds 8 blocks, up to four per transmitter, so one covers \"},{\"text\":\"48\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\". Each also costs 8 FE per tick.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4825012E9BEB5EF9.title": "Jobs in your pocket",
  "quest.4825012E9BEB5EF9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Autocrafting Monitor, an ender pearl and an Advanced Processor make the \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Autocrafting Monitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:wireless_autocrafting_monitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": watch and cancel jobs anywhere a transmitter reaches. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.refinedstorage.open_wireless_autocrafting_monitor\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens it too, once bound.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4E12666A1E451997.title": "Creative, and still local",
  "quest.4E12666A1E451997.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"translate\":\"item.refinedstorage.creative_range_upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\"},{\"text\":\" and the other creative parts have no recipe here. Even infinite range stays in its own dimension: other worlds need a Network Transmitter.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7EA9A6C7CCDDCB81.title": "Mind the battery",
  "quest.7EA9A6C7CCDDCB81.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Wireless Grid, the Portable Grid and the wireless monitor carry 1,000 FE each, and every open, insert or extract costs 5. Charge them like any powered tool, for example in a Mekanism Energy Cube's charge slot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.51C6629012600BCD.title": "A card with an address",
  "quest.51C6629012600BCD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Paper, an Advanced Processor and Quartz Enriched Iron make a \"},{\"text\":\"Network Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:network_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Sneak-use it on a Network Receiver and it remembers that spot, dimension included.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.530809CCD5A0308F.title": "Look at a transmitting Network Transmitter",
  "quest.1110515AD1564BE5.title": "A network at a distance",
  "quest.1110515AD1564BE5.quest_subtitle": "Long-distance relationship, zero cables.",
  "quest.1110515AD1564BE5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Network Transmitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:network_transmitter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with the bound card sends the whole network to its \"},{\"text\":\"Network Receiver\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:network_receiver\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", at any distance, even in another dimension. Each end costs a netherite ingot, and the transmitter draws 32 FE per tick.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0CE58F48F1576CBE.title": "Switch a branch",
  "quest.0CE58F48F1576CBE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A casing, cable, an Advanced Processor and a redstone torch make a \"},{\"text\":\"Relay\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:relay\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it joins two parts of a network and cuts the link on redstone. Turn pass-through off to choose what crosses: energy, storage, security or autocrafting.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.061C65230878587F.title": "Hold a Security Manager and a Security Card",
  "quest.74FB21C976711467.title": "House rules",
  "quest.74FB21C976711467.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Security Manager\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:security_manager\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with \"},{\"text\":\"Security Cards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:security_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sets, player by player, who may open, insert, extract, build, autocraft or change security. \"},{\"text\":\"Once active it denies everything to everyone\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\", so bind a card to yourself first.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.613AC5907B05185D.title": "Look at a Network Transmitter in error",
  "quest.271839B3FEE3B3FC.title": "Is anybody out there?",
  "quest.271839B3FEE3B3FC.quest_subtitle": "The far side stopped answering.",
  "quest.271839B3FEE3B3FC.quest_desc": [
    "You found a red Network Transmitter. Either its card is missing or the receiver can't be reached: broken, rebound or sitting in an unloaded chunk. Fix the far side and it goes back to transmitting on its own."
  ],
  "reward.77247A1CB3EC591A.title": "Secret found",
  "task.68EEDCE22AB5F88D.title": "Enter the Nether",
  "task.729A8175D4611BB0.title": "Look at a live Network Receiver",
  "quest.6FE81D1978F22822.title": "A branch office in the Nether",
  "quest.6FE81D1978F22822.quest_subtitle": "The commute is instant. The rent is netherite.",
  "quest.6FE81D1978F22822.quest_desc": [
    "Put a Network Receiver in the Nether, bind the card to it there and slot the card into a transmitter at home. Once the receiver lights up, grids, importers and exporters beside it run on your home network: a quartz mine that ships itself."
  ],
  "quest.2089B6F053D095EA.title": "Keep the far side loaded",
  "quest.2089B6F053D095EA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The link holds only while the receiver's chunk is loaded. Claim it with FTB Chunks and force-load it: it stays up while someone on your team is online. If it unloads, the transmitter turns red until it's back.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2184DCB320F1FED3.title": "A full drive",
  "quest.2184DCB320F1FED3.quest_subtitle": "Half a million items, one search box.",
  "quest.2184DCB320F1FED3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight \"},{\"text\":\"64k Storage Disks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"refinedstorage:64k_storage_disk\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fill a drive: \"},{\"text\":\"524,288 items\",\"color\":\"#56CAFF\"},{\"text\":\" behind one search box, crafted on demand and reachable from other worlds.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:refinedstorage:textures/block/storage_block/64k_storage_block.png width:48 height:48 align:center}",
    "",
    "Full, the drive draws 42 FE per tick: 10 for itself and 4 per disk. The next one is a single block away."
  ],
  "quest.44949B83830DDE36.title": "Label on a drive",
  "quest.44949B83830DDE36.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every item in Heliodor had an address: we could find one screw across three districts. Nobody thought to index the people. —T.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "image.1C9D00EBCE46B649.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Parts and power\",\"color\":\"#56CAFF\"}]",
  "image.5EC8C300CBD5F0F2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Disks and storage\",\"color\":\"#56CAFF\"}]",
  "image.1C753E262B2389C2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In and out\",\"color\":\"#56CAFF\"}]",
  "image.3A5707BA311FDE0A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Grids\",\"color\":\"#56CAFF\"}]",
  "image.2ADAF5A4D6F79C16.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Into the world\",\"color\":\"#56CAFF\"}]",
  "image.419A56D4CF8FFAE6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Autocrafting\",\"color\":\"#56CAFF\"}]",
  "image.34B20F7D48ADAA2F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wireless\",\"color\":\"#56CAFF\"}]",
  "image.7EE36FA5109DAAEC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Across worlds\",\"color\":\"#56CAFF\"}]",
  "image.0CF6BF10954AEF10.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Refined Storage\",\"color\":\"#EAF6FF\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.5B18FA29BB30925F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"no channels · one search box\",\"color\":\"#8FDFFF\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.701C6007754B7270.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.3D1666A731662146.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Nether\",\"color\":\"#C79BFF\"}]",
  "chapter.0209063232CEE2AE.title": "AE2 · Addons",
  "chapter.0209063232CEE2AE.chapter_subtitle": [
    "ExtendedAE, Advanced AE and MEGA Cells make the network bigger, faster and smarter; the ME Requester and the wireless terminals take it with you."
  ],
  "task.03FBF109636C6779.title": "Look at a grown Entro Cluster",
  "quest.5C68DAF813931E9C.title": "Plant a seed in fluix",
  "quest.5C68DAF813931E9C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sand, ender dust, redstone, glowstone and sky stone dust make two \"},{\"text\":\"Entro Seeds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:entro_seed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Right-click a Fluix Block with one: it becomes budding entroized fluix, which grows entro clusters the way certus does.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0F6307C6C7CC3424.title": "Crystals that wear out",
  "quest.0F6307C6C7CC3424.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Grown clusters drop \"},{\"text\":\"Entro Crystals\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:entro_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; young buds drop shards, eight to a crystal. Unlike flawless certus, every entroized block wears down to plain quartz, about ten crystals from a fully entroized one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.55B1293957CF36D1.title": "Gold for backbone",
  "quest.55B1293957CF36D1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Entro dust, a gold ingot and a lapis thrown in water fuse into an \"},{\"text\":\"Entro Infused Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:entro_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". The AE2 inscriber grinds crystals into the dust.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.41A3155BDBAF9F5E.title": "The ExtendedAE frame",
  "quest.41A3155BDBAF9F5E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four entro ingots, copper, iron and quartz glass: an \"},{\"text\":\"Extended Machine Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:machine_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Nearly every ExtendedAE block starts as one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.090ED9DBA874A5D9.title": "Silicon by the stack",
  "quest.090ED9DBA874A5D9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One quartz dust, two coal and six sand make six \"},{\"text\":\"Quartz Blend\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:quartz_blend\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Each smelts into four silicon, or six in an enrichment chamber: up to 36 silicon from a single dust.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.31EE3A93EA52F51E.title": "Second chances",
  "quest.31EE3A93EA52F51E.quest_subtitle": "One in twenty is a miracle.",
  "quest.31EE3A93EA52F51E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Crystal Fixer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:crystal_fixer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fed charged certus upgrades the budding block in front of it: damaged to chipped and chipped to flawed four times in five, flawed to \"},{\"text\":\"flawless\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" one time in twenty. Every crystal is one try.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7A39924BE358AEF1.title": "Too complex for a table",
  "quest.7A39924BE358AEF1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A frame, a crafting terminal, two logic processors and a sky stone tank: the \"},{\"text\":\"Crystal Assembler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:crystal_assembler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It builds ExtendedAE's devices and runs in-world reactions, fluix included, without throwing anything in water. Its screen face takes no cable.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.62F496551155C154.title": "A fourth processor",
  "quest.62F496551155C154.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three eyes of ender, four entro crystals and a Silicon Press become an \"},{\"text\":\"Inscriber Concurrent Press\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:concurrent_processor_press\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the crystal assembler. Print entro with it and press as usual: \"},{\"text\":\"Concurrent Processors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:concurrent_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The recipe eats the Silicon Press: copy one first.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1D9A38C2746E325D.title": "Thirty-six patterns",
  "quest.1D9A38C2746E325D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A pattern provider, three capacity cards, three crafting tables, a concurrent processor and six cables: the \"},{\"text\":\"ME Extended Pattern Provider\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:ex_pattern_provider\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", with \"},{\"text\":\"36 pattern slots\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"},{\"text\":\" instead of 9. A Pattern Provider Upgrade converts one already placed, patterns and all.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.17FD3A8C96B919F9.title": "Double drives",
  "quest.17FD3A8C96B919F9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Extended Drive\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:ex_drive\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds 20 cells instead of 10, and the \"},{\"text\":\"ME Extended IO Port\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:ex_io_port\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" moves cells eight times faster. Each starts from its AE2 original plus upgrades in the crystal assembler.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.74C48BE5415074BD.title": "Bottomless",
  "quest.74C48BE5415074BD.quest_desc": [
    "ExtendedAE's infinity cells hand out endless water or cobblestone and swallow as much as you send: a 16k component, quartz glass, diamonds and the buckets. Each costs 8 AE/t just sitting in a drive."
  ],
  "quest.15A5FC4FA4204A96.title": "A pocket condenser",
  "quest.15A5FC4FA4204A96.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two overflow destruction cards, a matter condenser, a 16k component, quartz glass and amethyst make the \"},{\"text\":\"ME Void Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:void_cell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Partition it in a cell workbench: whatever matches is deleted, or pressed into matter balls and singularities as a condenser would.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2AE78D1C2D9B981F.title": "Fill it, drain it",
  "quest.2AE78D1C2D9B981F.quest_subtitle": "A bottling plant in one block.",
  "quest.2AE78D1C2D9B981F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A frame, an \"},{\"text\":\"ME Ingredient Buffer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:ingredient_buffer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and both cores make the \"},{\"text\":\"ME Canner\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:caner\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the crystal assembler. It fills containers with fluids, and here with Mekanism chemicals too, through Applied Mekanistics; in empty mode it drains them. 80 AE a go.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Its pattern lists only the filling and the container. Power and cable go in through the top or the bottom.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.085841E46AF8285F.title": "Any ExtendedAE device upgrade",
  "quest.5A8D8FE5BE630608.title": "Upgrade in place",
  "quest.5A8D8FE5BE630608.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An extended device crafted with any ingot turns into an upgrade: \"},{\"text\":\"Pattern Provider Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:pattern_provider_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", or the ones for interfaces, buses, drives, the access terminal and the wireless connector. Sneak and use it on the plain device: it turns extended, settings and contents kept.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.41E408BFD860DD24.title": "Bigger pockets",
  "quest.41E408BFD860DD24.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Extended Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:ex_interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has more stocking slots. The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Oversize Interface\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:oversize_interface\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds sixteen stacks' worth in each slot, 1024 items, for providers that push huge batches.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.57076F7961A3C5A8.title": "Eight at once",
  "quest.57076F7961A3C5A8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four molecular assemblers and four \"},{\"text\":\"concurrent processors\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"62F496551155C154\"}},{\"text\":\" make an \"},{\"text\":\"Extended Molecular Assembler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:ex_molecular_assembler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": eight jobs at a time with enough co-processors, twice as fast, but only from a pattern provider.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2532A52AED357D7E.title": "The assembler hall",
  "quest.2532A52AED357D7E.quest_subtitle": "A factory that fits in a room.",
  "quest.2532A52AED357D7E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A solid box: \"},{\"text\":\"Assembler Matrix Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:assembler_matrix_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the edges, walls or glass on the faces, cores filling the inside. Each pattern core holds 36 patterns, each craft core runs 8 jobs, and five speed cores reach full speed.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It needs a pattern core and a craft core inside, so the smallest working hall is 4×3×3.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.639042130B45E06B.title": "Eight times the traffic",
  "quest.639042130B45E06B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Extended Import Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:ex_import_bus_part\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and its export twin move eight times what AE2's buses do and take more cards. A bus upgrade swaps one already placed without losing its filter.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.269292DAF4B3FC91.title": "Picky buses",
  "quest.269292DAF4B3FC91.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"ME Tag Storage Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:tag_storage_bus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" filters by tags like c:ingots/*, a mod bus by mod ID. A \"},{\"text\":\"ME Precise Export Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:precise_export_bus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sends exact amounts, and only if they fit; a threshold bus exports only above or below a set stock.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7CBA4584BFF8E45D.title": "Export by the family",
  "quest.7CBA4584BFF8E45D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Tag Export Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:tag_export_bus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sends out whatever matches a tag rule, written as for the tag storage bus, and the \"},{\"text\":\"ME Mod Export Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:mod_export_bus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" everything from the mods you list. One bus set to c:raw_materials/* feeds a smelter every raw ore there is.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.79FA1DBAE939DB1C.title": "Planes without a subnet",
  "quest.79FA1DBAE939DB1C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Active Formation Plane\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:active_formation_plane\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" places or drops what you filter, like an export bus that builds. The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Smart Annihilation Plane\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:smart_annihilation_plane\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" breaks or picks up only what it's set to, like an import bus. Neither needs a subnet.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each is its AE2 plane with three pistons, two cores and an extended bus, in the crystal assembler."
  ],
  "quest.12A0AD8F2A6E1F25.title": "Only this many",
  "quest.12A0AD8F2A6E1F25.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"ME Precise Storage Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:precise_storage_bus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes a limit and inserts only up to it, so the chest in front of a machine never holds more than you meant. Two calculation processors around a storage bus make one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1998F42030E0C28F.title": "A latch, not a light",
  "quest.1998F42030E0C28F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Threshold Level Emitter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:threshold_level_emitter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has two numbers: it switches on above the upper one and stays on until the stock falls below the lower one. A farm driven by it runs in long batches instead of flickering on and off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3F64799000F9B704.title": "Four at a time",
  "quest.3F64799000F9B704.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Extended Inscriber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:ex_inscriber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs four inscribing jobs at once and the \"},{\"text\":\"Extended Charger\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:ex_charger\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" charges four items. When a provider feeds the inscriber, set its stack size to one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.756DECB49F3EE53A.title": "Slice, don't press",
  "quest.756DECB49F3EE53A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Circuit Slicer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:circuit_cutter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" cuts storage blocks straight into prints: gold into nine logic prints, diamond into nine engineering, silicon into nine printed silicon, a certus block into four calculation.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Building it uses up a full set of presses: copy them first.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.677182A1070AC6A2.title": "Big fish",
  "quest.677182A1070AC6A2.quest_subtitle": "Nobody asked. Here it is anyway.",
  "quest.677182A1070AC6A2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight pufferfish around nothing make a \"},{\"text\":\"Fishbig\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:fishbig\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It does nothing. The circuit slicer turns it back into fish, if you have the heart.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.47827EC6F3BB0EBD.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.5B253F2B8A78DFF5.title": "Find the stuck one",
  "quest.5B253F2B8A78DFF5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ExtendedAE's \"},{\"text\":\"ME Extended Pattern Access Terminal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:ex_pattern_access_part\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" searches patterns by what goes in or comes out and highlights the provider in the world: the fastest way to find the one holding up a big job.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5A0D1C65D84B3717.title": "Tools for tidy people",
  "quest.5A0D1C65D84B3717.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Pattern Modifier\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:pattern_modifier\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" multiplies, divides, swaps ingredients in or clones a whole stack of patterns. \"},{\"text\":\"ME Packing Tape\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:me_packing_tape\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" boxes up a provider, interface or drive with its settings and contents for moving day.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2B6DDA03A6260F64.title": "Bulk edits",
  "quest.2B6DDA03A6260F64.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A blank pattern, an engineering processor and two blue dyes make a \"},{\"text\":\"Config Modifier\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:config_modifier\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Click it on an interface or any device with set amounts to add, multiply, max out or clear every amount at once.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.401FD97051B632E6.title": "Quantum computer",
  "quest.401FD97051B632E6.quest_subtitle": "Every order, at once.",
  "quest.401FD97051B632E6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Quantum Computer Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:quantum_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is a crafting computer on its own: 256M of storage and 8 co-processor threads, running as many jobs at once as its storage holds. Its recipe swallows an accelerator, a unit and a 256M storage.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0E1BDAE616808553.title": "Pick the side",
  "quest.0E1BDAE616808553.quest_subtitle": "For machines with opinions about sides.",
  "quest.0E1BDAE616808553.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Pattern Provider\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:small_adv_pattern_provider\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" can push each ingredient to a chosen face. Run a processing pattern through the \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Pattern Encoder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:adv_pattern_encoder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", pick a face per ingredient, and one block feeds a fussy machine with no pipes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.49A196E8774DD984.title": "Pressure cooker",
  "quest.49A196E8774DD984.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Reaction Chamber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:reaction_chamber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs AE2's in-world reactions in a tank, on a lot of power: 64 certus charge at once, 16 sets of fluix ingredients give 64 crystals, and 64 matter balls with lava make a singularity.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.68782DEC239C573B.title": "Break the unbreakable",
  "quest.68782DEC239C573B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In the chamber, a singularity with two ender dust, two sky stone dust and a little lava shatters into two \"},{\"text\":\"Shattered Singularities\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:shattered_singularity\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Pressed in the inscriber, they become quantum dust.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3CBEB2AA4E0485F4.title": "Quantum alloy",
  "quest.3CBEB2AA4E0485F4.quest_subtitle": "Singularities, sold by the four.",
  "quest.3CBEB2AA4E0485F4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Quantum dust in four buckets of water becomes a bucket of quantum infusion. Four copper, four shattered singularities, four singularities and that bucket make one \"},{\"text\":\"Quantum Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:quantum_alloy\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Every quantum part starts here.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5F5D3066B1F29FED.title": "The quantum chip",
  "quest.5F5D3066B1F29FED.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Logic press below, Engineering press above and a shattered singularity between: the inscriber makes an \"},{\"text\":\"Inscriber Quantum Press\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:quantum_processor_press\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Print alloy with it, press with redstone and printed silicon: a \"},{\"text\":\"Quantum Processor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:quantum_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"That press eats both presses: copy them first.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"}]"
  ],
  "task.00C84D362741C698.title": "Either advanced provider upgrade",
  "quest.0A09FF77F7135589.title": "Keep the patterns",
  "quest.0A09FF77F7135589.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Used on a placed AE2 or ExtendedAE provider, an \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Pattern Provider Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:adv_pattern_provider_upgrade\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes it advanced with the same slot count. The capacity upgrade jumps a plain provider straight to 36 slots. Patterns and cards stay where they are.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5398D0A990BF8702.title": "How fast is it filling?",
  "quest.5398D0A990BF8702.quest_subtitle": "A speedometer for storage.",
  "quest.5398D0A990BF8702.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A storage monitor and a calculation processor make an \"},{\"text\":\"ME Throughput Monitor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:throughput_monitor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": one item's count and how fast it changes, no channel needed. The \"},{\"text\":\"Throughput Monitor Configurator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:throughput_monitor_configurator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" switches it between per tick, per second and per minute.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.16D14DB5ABBF8B2D.title": "One bus for the chest",
  "quest.16D14DB5ABBF8B2D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Import Export Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:import_export_bus_part\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" exports what's in its filter and imports the rest; the stock export bus keeps an exact amount in the target. Fuse both with quantum processors: the \"},{\"text\":\"ME Advanced IO Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:advanced_io_bus_part\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", eight times faster.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.79AE6322C80A6B72.title": "Wear the network",
  "quest.79AE6322C80A6B72.quest_subtitle": "Netherite, but it has a network.",
  "quest.79AE6322C80A6B72.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Here each quantum armor piece takes a netherite piece, quantum processors, alloy plates, a quantum storage component and a \"},{\"text\":\"Logistics Luminosity\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:luminosity_logistics\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from Solsticio, in act VI. Link it in an access point; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.advanced_ae.quantum_armor_config\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens its upgrades.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.237AED38FD83E75C.title": "Build it bigger",
  "quest.237AED38FD83E75C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wrap the core in \"},{\"text\":\"Quantum Computer Structural Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:quantum_structure\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", up to 7×7×7, and fill the inside: accelerators add 8 threads each, storages add memory, one data entangler multiplies storage by 4 and one multi-threader multiplies threads by 4. Plug any gap with quantum units.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5CED5C9952E61C07.title": "Craft forever",
  "quest.5CED5C9952E61C07.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Quantum Crafter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:quantum_crafter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs crafting patterns nonstop, no order needed, keeping each ingredient above a floor and the product under a cap. It handles recipes that feed themselves, and acceleration cards reach 64 crafts a tick per pattern.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.06C849A60F4675D5.title": "Wings from the network",
  "quest.06C849A60F4675D5.quest_subtitle": "An elytra, folded into a card.",
  "quest.06C849A60F4675D5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"You made a \"},{\"text\":\"Flight Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"advanced_ae:flight_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Installed in the quantum armor it grants creative flight, speed on a slider; a drift card decides how fast you stop.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.574DED7C837D000E.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.1662C1571EF019DD.title": "One mega",
  "quest.1662C1571EF019DD.quest_subtitle": "A thousand k, give or take.",
  "quest.1662C1571EF019DD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three 256k components, an accumulation processor, sky stone dust and vibrant quartz glass make a 1M component; in a sky steel housing it becomes a \"},{\"text\":\"1M MEGA Item Storage Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:item_storage_cell_1m\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". The tiers climb to 256M.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.28D2C20801AE4DD9.title": "Small MEGA things",
  "quest.28D2C20801AE4DD9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Cell Dock\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:cell_dock\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is a flat part that holds one cell, several to a cable: a buffer for a tight subnet. The \"},{\"text\":\"Portable Cell Workbench\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:portable_cell_workbench\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" partitions cells from your hand. MEGA portable cells accept only greater energy cards.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1DF60856B095D66C.title": "Steel from the sky",
  "quest.1DF60856B095D66C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drop a charged certus crystal, an iron ingot and a sky stone block into lava: two \"},{\"text\":\"Sky Steel Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:sky_steel_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Copper instead of iron gives sky bronze, for MEGA fluid cells.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.39DDD1DB462F3B21.title": "The MEGA processor",
  "quest.39DDD1DB462F3B21.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Engineering press below, Calculation press above and a singularity between make the \"},{\"text\":\"Inscriber Accumulation Press\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:accumulation_processor_press\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Print sky steel with it, then press with fluix dust and printed silicon: \"},{\"text\":\"Accumulation Processors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:accumulation_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"That press eats both presses: copy them first.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.406FE4042F663117.title": "Superdense",
  "quest.406FE4042F663117.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight dense energy cells around an accumulation processor: a \"},{\"text\":\"Superdense Energy Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:mega_energy_cell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", 12.8M AE. With an advanced card it becomes a \"},{\"text\":\"Greater Energy Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:greater_energy_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the only battery MEGA portable cells take.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2DDD50A125F7AC5A.title": "Double capacity",
  "quest.2DDD50A125F7AC5A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An accumulation processor doubles a provider or an interface. The \"},{\"text\":\"MEGA Pattern Provider\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:mega_pattern_provider\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds 18 patterns, processing ones only, so it can't drive molecular assemblers; the MEGA Interface has twice the slots and throughput.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.14B3509B39589C97.title": "A darker, bigger CPU",
  "quest.14B3509B39589C97.quest_desc": [
    "MEGA crafting units take 1M to 256M crafting storage, and each MEGA co-processor counts as four. They look sleek in black, which is half the point."
  ],
  "quest.64563A581542B04F.title": "Up the M ladder",
  "quest.64563A581542B04F.quest_desc": [
    "Each MEGA component holds four times the last and takes three of it plus an accumulation processor: 4M, 16M, 64M, 256M. The top cell holds over a thousand times what a 256k does."
  ],
  "task.2D7A6782933F15C4.title": "Any MEGA chemical cell",
  "quest.4EE0BCE741AA3671.title": "Chemicals by the million",
  "quest.4EE0BCE741AA3671.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Charged certus, an osmium ingot and sky stone dropped in lava give sky osmium, the metal of the MEGA chemical housing. Add an M component and it becomes a \"},{\"text\":\"1M MEGA Chemical Storage Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:chemical_storage_cell_1m\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for Mekanism chemicals, up to 256M.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3A360B8D8614C956.title": "Hot storage",
  "quest.3A360B8D8614C956.quest_subtitle": "Handle with tongs.",
  "quest.3A360B8D8614C956.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Chemical cells refuse anything radioactive. The \"},{\"text\":\"MEGA Radioactive Chemical Storage Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:radioactive_chemical_cell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds one such chemical, partitioned, up to 2048 buckets: polonium, plutonium or nuclear waste, but not spent waste. It draws 250 AE/t in a drive.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Its component takes radioactive waste barrels and a 256k component; the cell adds reactor glass, HDPE and a \"},{\"text\":\"Polonium Pellet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:pellet_polonium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.77B57C740D36701E.title": "One item, no limit",
  "quest.77B57C740D36701E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"MEGA Bulk Item Storage Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:bulk_item_cell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stores a single item type in practically endless amounts, once partitioned to it. A \"},{\"text\":\"Compression Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:compression_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" folds its nuggets, ingots and blocks into one count.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.494F6D0C06B062B0.title": "Unpack on demand",
  "quest.494F6D0C06B062B0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A compressed bulk cell may show only a few ingots. A \"},{\"text\":\"MEGA Decompression Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:decompression_module\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" anywhere on the network writes hidden patterns that turn blocks back into ingots and nuggets, so autocrafting sees all of it.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.1D90F21A4D952705.title": "Any MEGA Source cell",
  "quest.4E68C28949FA17B6.title": "Source by the million",
  "quest.4E68C28949FA17B6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On the enchanting apparatus, an Ars Énergistique source cell housing with three manipulation essences, two source gem blocks, three sky steel ingots and 2000 Source becomes the MEGA one. With an M component: a \"},{\"text\":\"1M MEGA Source Storage Cell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:source_storage_cell_1m\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4A6BD678C9C562E0.title": "Every cell lit",
  "quest.4A6BD678C9C562E0.quest_subtitle": "The drive is full and humming.",
  "quest.4A6BD678C9C562E0.quest_desc": [
    "Four extended pattern providers and four 1M MEGA cells on the network a quantum computer runs: 144 pattern slots, room for millions of items and every order at once.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:ae2:textures/block/drive/drive_front.png width:48 height:48 align:center}",
    "",
    "ExtendedAE gives the network hands, Advanced AE a mind, MEGA a memory. Requesters and wireless terminals keep you out of the base while the base keeps working."
  ],
  "quest.4CF3951459326881.title": "Every order, one list",
  "quest.4CF3951459326881.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"ME Requester Terminal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"merequester:requester_terminal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" edits every requester on the network from one screen; rename them in an anvil to group them. The wireless version works from the field, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ae2.wireless_requester_terminal\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" included.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1EE79393C2041D02.title": "Standing orders",
  "quest.1EE79393C2041D02.quest_subtitle": "The pantry that restocks itself.",
  "quest.1EE79393C2041D02.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"ME Requester\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"merequester:requester\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" watches a list of items and fluids: when stock drops below your amount, it orders a batch from autocrafting. Each row has its amount and batch size, and a status bar that says what it's waiting for.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7170B24DC402C8AD.title": "See the channels",
  "quest.7170B24DC402C8AD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Click any part of a network with the \"},{\"text\":\"ME Network Analyzer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2netanalyser:network_analyser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": every device and link shows up in the world, coloured by capacity, with the channel count on each link. Offline devices stand out in red.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.286E35060397F0CB.title": "One terminal, every screen",
  "quest.286E35060397F0CB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An engineering processor turns the wireless crafting terminal into a pattern encoding one. Combine AE2WTLib terminals in a crafting grid: the \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Universal Terminal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2wtlib:wireless_universal_terminal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" cycles between them with one button and pools their batteries.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4D342AA969825067.title": "Signal everywhere",
  "quest.4D342AA969825067.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four quantum rings, a link chamber and an advanced card: the \"},{\"text\":\"Quantum Bridge Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2wtlib:quantum_bridge_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". With one entangled singularity inside, the terminal reaches the bridge holding its twin from any distance or dimension, as long as \"},{\"text\":\"that network stays loaded\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"53D836F6AAEBB9D0\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5509EDD87153177B.title": "Hoover",
  "quest.5509EDD87153177B.quest_subtitle": "Tidy by attraction.",
  "quest.5509EDD87153177B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Magnet Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2wtlib:magnet_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the wireless crafting terminal picks up items from 16 blocks away and, if you like, sends them straight to the network. Pickup and insert filters are separate; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ae2.ae2wtlib_magnet\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" toggles it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3088BE356FF8F068.title": "Inventory on autopilot",
  "quest.3088BE356FF8F068.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In a wireless terminal, an \"},{\"text\":\"Import Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2importexportcard:import_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sends the inventory slots you tick to the network, and an \"},{\"text\":\"Export Card\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2importexportcard:export_card\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" keeps chosen slots filled from it. Fuzzy, acceleration and crafting cards tune them.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3E117BE8A918172A.title": "Patterns on the go",
  "quest.3E117BE8A918172A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A receiver, a pattern access terminal and a dense energy cell make the \"},{\"text\":\"Wireless Pattern Access Terminal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ae2wtlib:wireless_pattern_access_terminal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": every provider's patterns from anywhere in range. ExtendedAE builds a wireless version of its extended access terminal the same way.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1CCD5D611FDDE16C.title": "Wireless, the short way",
  "quest.1CCD5D611FDDE16C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two \"},{\"text\":\"ME Wireless Connectors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:wireless_connect\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" paired with the setup kit join two networks like a quantum bridge, no entangled pair needed, up to 1000 blocks apart in one dimension. A hub links eight; energy cards trim the power bill.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3C2A76AB6C29324A.title": "Addon chips",
  "quest.3C2A76AB6C29324A.quest_subtitle": "Eight and eight, every day.",
  "quest.3C2A76AB6C29324A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight \"},{\"text\":\"Concurrent Processors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"extendedae:concurrent_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and eight \"},{\"text\":\"Accumulation Processors\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"megacells:accumulation_processor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day. The circuit slicer cuts an entro block into four concurrent prints and a sky steel block into nine accumulation prints.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.338317E643750F94.title": "Nothing thrown away",
  "quest.338317E643750F94.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Heliodor never threw anything away; we built bigger cells. When the light went out the drives were still full and humming, keeping a city nobody came back for. —T.\",\"italic\":true}]"
  ],
  "image.0C595DF14E1FEEEC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ExtendedAE · entro\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.3054341CB587A4FF.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ExtendedAE · devices\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.3E82B6F2A8E9749E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ExtendedAE · buses and planes\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.22628C186BFCF1E9.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ExtendedAE · assembly\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.29EBD313657EB527.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Advanced AE · quantum line\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.30E304F121A35BEB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Advanced AE · computer\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.3BC1610DB32B031A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MEGA Cells · processor\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.2219E23C2143FA05.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MEGA Cells · cells\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.713AE863650655F4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Requests and analysis\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.27EF918B4DFA327A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wireless terminals\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\"}]",
  "image.6E33298DB7399DEA.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"AE2 · Addons\",\"color\":\"#F6EEFF\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.5C9361FF59A5BA90.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ten cells, one drive\",\"color\":\"#E2A3E3\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.62BD4F8EE6FA6366.title": "Back to AE2 · Automation",
  "chapter.0808DAF1804471FC.title": "Draconic Evolution · Draconium and Wyvern",
  "chapter.0808DAF1804471FC.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Draconium, fusion crafting, dislocators and wireless energy; then the wyvern tier, its modular gear and the Energy Core."
  ],
  "quest.4EB8C042E050A063.title": "Draconium",
  "quest.4EB8C042E050A063.quest_subtitle": "Deep, purple and worth the dig.",
  "quest.4EB8C042E050A063.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Draconium Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:overworld_draconium_ore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hides between Y -64 and -48, in about one chunk of ten. The Nether has rarer, bigger veins at Y 4 to 16; the End, three small veins per chunk in end stone. Each ore drops 2 to 4 \"},{\"text\":\"Draconium Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:draconium_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", more with Fortune.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Skip Silk Touch: a smelted ore block gives one ingot, while its 2 to 4 dust smelt into 2 to 4.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.299B603EE41120B4.title": "Draconium Ingots",
  "quest.299B603EE41120B4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Dust or ore smelts into \"},{\"text\":\"Draconium Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:draconium_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in any furnace, one per item. Nine ingots pack into a \"},{\"text\":\"Draconium Block\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:draconium_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and nine nuggets into an ingot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6FAF1D5F3B08ABED.title": "Draconium Core",
  "quest.6FAF1D5F3B08ABED.quest_subtitle": "Every machine's purple heart.",
  "quest.6FAF1D5F3B08ABED.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four draconium ingots at the corners, four gold ingots at the sides and a diamond in the middle. Nearly every block of the mod has one inside, from the \"},{\"text\":\"Fusion Crafting Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:crafting_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" to the Generator, so make several.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.41FBB0214C9BD641.title": "Fusion Crafting Core",
  "quest.41FBB0214C9BD641.quest_subtitle": "A crafting table that needs a runway.",
  "quest.41FBB0214C9BD641.quest_desc": [
    "Four lapis blocks, four diamonds and a draconium core. The catalyst goes in the core; every other ingredient sits in its own injector, facing the core from 2 to 16 blocks away. When the screen reads Ready to craft, press Craft: it charges, then fuses.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Every fusion recipe has a tier and an energy cost; the core's screen and the recipe viewer show both."
  ],
  "quest.6278042A667B5A83.title": "Fusion injectors",
  "quest.6278042A667B5A83.quest_desc": [
    "Two diamonds, a draconium core, an iron block and five stone. One injector holds one ingredient, so a recipe with eight ingredients needs eight injectors, all facing the core."
  ],
  "quest.38319050D58B029A.title": "Draconium Chest",
  "quest.38319050D58B029A.quest_subtitle": "260 slots and a furnace that never sleeps.",
  "quest.38319050D58B029A.quest_desc": [
    "The first fusion: a chest as catalyst, then five furnaces, two crafting tables, two draconium cores and a draconium block, for 2,000,000 OP. You get 260 slots, a crafting grid, a capacitor slot and a five-slot furnace that runs on OP.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The furnace can smelt everything smeltable, only what it is already smelting, or keep one item so that filter sticks. Shulker boxes, bags, pouches and strongboxes are refused."
  ],
  "quest.360F22819A833356.title": "Wyvern Energy Controller",
  "quest.360F22819A833356.quest_desc": [
    "Four draconium ingots, four redstone blocks and a draconium core. Despite the name it needs no Wyvern Core: energy crystals, the Mob Grinder and every wyvern tool start here, and the Energy Core takes two."
  ],
  "quest.7C622A55EE0714E6.title": "Wyvern Core",
  "quest.7C622A55EE0714E6.quest_subtitle": "A nether star in a purple coat.",
  "quest.7C622A55EE0714E6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four draconium ingots, three draconium cores, a nether star and, in this pack, an \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from act V in place of the fourth core. Wyvern injectors, the Energy Core and the Celestial Manipulator each need one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3908A85F2275DB46.title": "Wyvern injectors",
  "quest.3908A85F2275DB46.quest_desc": [
    "Fuse a draconium injector with a Wyvern Core, two draconium cores, four diamonds and a draconium block, for 32,000 OP. Wyvern recipes want an injector of that tier or better under every ingredient: six for a tool, seven to awaken draconium."
  ],
  "quest.1D1B95FB6A450FED.title": "Slowest injector sets the pace",
  "quest.1D1B95FB6A450FED.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Charging and fusing take 300, 220, 140 or 60 ticks with draconium, wyvern, draconic or chaotic injectors, and the lowest tier in use decides. For automation, switch injectors to single-item mode.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3739ACC5156DB6D2.title": "Power goes to the injectors",
  "quest.3739ACC5156DB6D2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The core itself takes no energy: a craft's cost is split evenly across the injectors in use, and each needs its share piped or beamed in. A 2,000,000 OP recipe with ten ingredients asks 200,000 of each injector.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5D1F8676AE15787F.title": "Energy Core",
  "quest.5D1F8676AE15787F.quest_subtitle": "A battery you build around.",
  "quest.5D1F8676AE15787F.quest_desc": [
    "Six draconium ingots, two wyvern energy controllers and a Wyvern Core. Alone it holds 45.5 million OP; shells of draconium and redstone blocks around it raise the tier, up to 2.14 trillion OP at tier 7. It will not wake up without stabilizers."
  ],
  "quest.1C6E350905F716BD.title": "Core stabilizers",
  "quest.1C6E350905F716BD.quest_desc": [
    "Four diamonds around a particle generator. Set four in a cross around the core, all in one plane and in line with it, no more than 16 blocks out; the core's screen checks the layout before it activates."
  ],
  "quest.369C5D3CB91ACA41.title": "Energy Pylons",
  "quest.369C5D3CB91ACA41.quest_subtitle": "Glass hat, big job.",
  "quest.369C5D3CB91ACA41.quest_desc": [
    "A pylon moves OP in and out of an active core within 18 blocks. Put any glass block on its top or bottom: it turns into the pylon's sphere, and stained glass tints it. Click the sphere to switch between input and output.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sneak-click the pylon to pick another core in range; a comparator beside it reads how full the core is.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.045F40DC45EBA538.title": "Tier 2 core",
  "quest.045F40DC45EBA538.quest_desc": [
    "Six draconium blocks, one on each face of the core: 273 million OP. Raise the tier on the core's screen first; its build guide shows where every block goes."
  ],
  "quest.690B141F0BB53B9B.title": "Tier 3 core",
  "quest.690B141F0BB53B9B.quest_subtitle": "Cubism, but load-bearing.",
  "quest.690B141F0BB53B9B.quest_desc": [
    "A full shell of 26 draconium blocks closes the core in a 3×3×3 cube: 1.64 billion OP."
  ],
  "quest.457378AE7DFE01DB.title": "Tier 4 core",
  "quest.457378AE7DFE01DB.quest_desc": [
    "Redstone moves inside: 26 redstone blocks around the core, wrapped in 54 draconium blocks. 9.88 billion OP."
  ],
  "quest.152F15AA4CDA3A77.title": "Tier 5 core",
  "quest.152F15AA4CDA3A77.quest_desc": [
    "90 draconium and 80 redstone blocks hold 59.3 billion OP. From this tier on each of the four stabilizers becomes an advanced one: a flat 3×3 square of nine, facing the core."
  ],
  "quest.347BC91FA72703B0.title": "Tier 6 core",
  "quest.347BC91FA72703B0.quest_desc": [
    "150 draconium and 178 redstone blocks: 356 billion OP."
  ],
  "quest.4CEE7970AB4B5311.title": "Tier 7 core",
  "quest.4CEE7970AB4B5311.quest_subtitle": "Two trillion. Don't spend it all at once.",
  "quest.4CEE7970AB4B5311.quest_desc": [
    "210 draconium and 328 redstone blocks: 2.14 trillion OP, the largest core that still has a number on it. Tier 8 wants awakened draconium."
  ],
  "quest.36695713834AC30E.title": "Let the core build itself",
  "quest.36695713834AC30E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With the blocks in your inventory, Assemble Core on the core's screen places the whole structure for you. Toggle Build Guide draws it in the world first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2F8D25D890467F1F.title": "Wireless Energy Link",
  "quest.2F8D25D890467F1F.quest_desc": [
    "A module that feeds your gear straight from an active Energy Core: sneak-click the core with it to link them. Switching it on costs 4 million OP and staying on 51 to 512 OP/t; it moves up to 2,048 OP/t, only within the core's dimension."
  ],
  "quest.368A87DE8F18AFCB.title": "Draconic in this pack",
  "quest.368A87DE8F18AFCB.quest_desc": [
    "Draconium, fusion crafting and the draconium-tier machines are native. Three recipes wait on the Atlas: the Dislocator takes a reinforced alloy (act III), the Wyvern and Draconic Cores an atomic alloy (act V). The Creative Capacitor is made with Luminosities in act VI."
  ],
  "quest.4E43ABD196122DD3.title": "Draconium from a farm",
  "quest.4E43ABD196122DD3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mystical Agriculture grows draconium too: its tier 5 draconium seeds give essence, and eight essences craft one ingot. See \"},{\"text\":\"Platinum, iridium and draconium\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"2833DB15EE38A8A5\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6277BB1EA49AD09F.title": "Draconium Blocks",
  "quest.6277BB1EA49AD09F.quest_desc": [
    "Keep a stack of these: the Draconium Chest and every wyvern injector take one, four of them are the catalyst that awakens draconium, and Energy Core shells eat them by the hundred."
  ],
  "quest.4452A916DD598AAF.title": "Draconium for the common store",
  "quest.4452A916DD598AAF.quest_subtitle": "Purple is the new iron.",
  "quest.4452A916DD598AAF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Thirty-two \"},{\"text\":\"Draconium Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:draconium_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day. Drop the dust in a Draconium Chest and its furnace smelts it on OP while you mine.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.5B1AFA613B32BD88.title": "Look at a placed item",
  "quest.46B71AD9BFA1C0F3.title": "Put it down",
  "quest.46B71AD9BFA1C0F3.quest_subtitle": "Museum of things you were holding.",
  "quest.46B71AD9BFA1C0F3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"You set an item on the ground with \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.draconicevolution.place_item\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\". It stays there as a display block, a trophy shelf with no shelf.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.07B92ECCD0565020.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.624AC266DD69B3EF.title": "Dislocator",
  "quest.624AC266DD69B3EF.quest_subtitle": "Home is a sneak-click away.",
  "quest.624AC266DD69B3EF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Blaze powder, draconium dust, an ender eye and, in this pack, a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from act III. Sneak-click to store your position, facing and dimension; click to jump back. Hit a mob with it to send the mob there instead.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each jump wears it down, and its tooltip counts the uses left."
  ],
  "quest.3C4C06D81A2A0DE4.title": "Bound Dislocators",
  "quest.3C4C06D81A2A0DE4.quest_desc": [
    "Two dislocators, a draconium core and a ghast tear make an unbound pair: right click to split it into two linked dislocators. Each takes you to wherever its twin is, even in another player's inventory."
  ],
  "quest.5CDBF87B8A53F84F.title": "Player Dislocator",
  "quest.5CDBF87B8A53F84F.quest_desc": [
    "One dislocator, a draconium core and a ghast tear. Right click to bind it to yourself and hand it to a teammate: using it brings them to you, as long as you are online."
  ],
  "quest.60A22B2D626E2F40.title": "Item Dislocator",
  "quest.60A22B2D626E2F40.quest_subtitle": "A magnet with a doctorate.",
  "quest.60A22B2D626E2F40.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Built around a dislocator with redstone, draconium and iron, it pulls drops within 8 blocks to you. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.draconicevolution.toggle_magnet\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" switches it on and off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.54FC5A43AEF102F7.title": "Normalization Field Projector",
  "quest.54FC5A43AEF102F7.quest_desc": [
    "Six iron ingots, two iron bars and an item dislocator. Items dropped within 5 blocks of it ignore item dislocators: set one beside farms and machines that spit their output onto the floor."
  ],
  "quest.2B0EBB5CB8D7C41A.title": "Dislocator portals",
  "quest.2B0EBB5CB8D7C41A.quest_desc": [
    "Put one half of a bound pair in a Dislocator Receptacle set in a frame of Draconium Infused Obsidian, then give it a redstone signal: the frame fills with a portal to the other half. A frame can span up to 256 by 256.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Click the receptacle with infused obsidian to hide it in the frame.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.22820E1A1808C706.title": "Dislocator Pedestal",
  "quest.22820E1A1808C706.quest_subtitle": "Next stop: wherever you saved.",
  "quest.22820E1A1808C706.quest_desc": [
    "A pressure plate, stone, two slabs and blaze powder. Set a dislocator on it and anyone who clicks the pedestal goes where it points: a bus stop for the whole team."
  ],
  "quest.6ECBE13B33353C78.title": "Advanced Dislocator",
  "quest.6ECBE13B33353C78.quest_subtitle": "Teleport, blink, repeat.",
  "quest.6ECBE13B33353C78.quest_desc": [
    "The dislocator fused with ender pearls, draconium and a Wyvern Core. It keeps a named list of places and burns ender pearls as fuel, up to 1,024: one pearl is one teleport or four blinks of up to 32 blocks where you look.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It has its own keys: \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.draconicevolution.dislocator_teleport\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" teleports, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.draconicevolution.dislocator_blink\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" blinks, and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.draconicevolution.dislocator_up\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.draconicevolution.dislocator_down\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" move through the list.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.410E749CBE021D8F.title": "Mob Grinder",
  "quest.410E749CBE021D8F.quest_subtitle": "Customer service, with swords.",
  "quest.410E749CBE021D8F.quest_desc": [
    "Iron, draconium, two diamond swords, a skull and a wyvern energy controller. It kills mobs in an adjustable area for 80 OP per point of health, can gather their drops into a neighbouring inventory, stores their experience and swings a weapon you give it."
  ],
  "quest.52FF4E101C5D8D6A.title": "Disenchanter",
  "quest.52FF4E101C5D8D6A.quest_desc": [
    "Emeralds, enchanted books, bookshelves, an enchanting table and a draconium core. It lifts one enchantment off an item onto a book, for the level cost shown on its screen."
  ],
  "quest.4148B15B912B7F05.title": "Detectors and sensors",
  "quest.4148B15B912B7F05.quest_desc": [
    "An Entity Detector puts out redstone by how many mobs it sees, up to 16 blocks away, as a steady signal or a pulse per scan; the advanced one reaches 64 blocks and filters what it counts. The Rain Sensor turns on when it rains."
  ],
  "quest.76A2210E3079BEAE.title": "Stabilized Mob Spawner",
  "quest.76A2210E3079BEAE.quest_subtitle": "Adopt a spawner.",
  "quest.76A2210E3079BEAE.quest_desc": [
    "Click a dungeon spawner with a draconium core and it pops out as a Stabilized Mob Spawner for that mob. It spawns 4 at a time with a player near; a wyvern, draconic or chaotic core clicked on it raises the tier.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Wyvern tier spawns 6 and needs no player, draconic 8 and ignores light, chaotic 12 every 25 to 100 ticks. A mob soul or spawn egg changes the mob, and redstone switches it off."
  ],
  "quest.3A406FA50C7C7ADF.title": "Celestial Manipulator",
  "quest.3A406FA50C7C7ADF.quest_subtitle": "Weather, on request.",
  "quest.3A406FA50C7C7ADF.quest_desc": [
    "A Wyvern Core, a dragon egg, a clock, redstone blocks, draconium and iron. For OP it skips to sunrise, noon, sunset, moonrise or midnight, and starts rain or storms or clears the sky. The dragon drops a new egg every time here."
  ],
  "quest.10106938A37E49D1.title": "Particle Generator",
  "quest.10106938A37E49D1.quest_desc": [
    "Redstone blocks, blaze rods and a draconium core. It is a crafting part, not a machine: every core stabilizer and wyvern shield controller takes one, and every wireless crystal two."
  ],
  "quest.3BB338A92B22481C.title": "Generator",
  "quest.3BB338A92B22481C.quest_subtitle": "Five gears, one furnace.",
  "quest.3BB338A92B22481C.quest_desc": [
    "Nether bricks, iron, a furnace and a draconium core make a furnace-fuel generator with five modes: Eco Plus gives 5 OP/t, Eco 20, Normal 40, Performance 80 and Overdrive 300. The slower modes squeeze more out of each piece of fuel."
  ],
  "quest.76C66BEE122035C1.title": "One in a thousand",
  "quest.76C66BEE122035C1.quest_subtitle": "It was looking at you.",
  "quest.76C66BEE122035C1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A mob dropped its \"},{\"text\":\"Soul\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:mob_soul\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". With the Reaper enchantment every kill has a one-in-a-thousand chance, better at higher levels and for animals; a soul sets a stabilized spawner to its mob.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.1FC4EF9F5249AB42.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.44330FBEB7C072BC.title": "Energy crystals",
  "quest.44330FBEB7C072BC.quest_subtitle": "Cables are so last act.",
  "quest.44330FBEB7C072BC.quest_desc": [
    "Four diamonds around a wyvern energy controller make four relay crystals, and a relay splits into two I/O crystals. I/O crystals take OP from the block they sit on or give it to it; relays pass it along, up to 8 links each within 32 blocks.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With the Crystal Binder, sneak-click the first device, then click the second. Links never cross dimensions.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.11A1B95C4B288E81.title": "Wireless crystals",
  "quest.11A1B95C4B288E81.quest_desc": [
    "A relay crystal with ender pearls, ender eyes and two particle generators. It feeds up to 16 machines at 32,000 OP/t each with no crystal on them: sneak-click it with the binder, then click each machine."
  ],
  "quest.115C28EEF4E18E04.title": "Wyvern crystals",
  "quest.115C28EEF4E18E04.quest_desc": [
    "Four basic relays, four wyvern energy controllers and a draconium core make four wyvern relays. Wyvern crystals reach 64 blocks and buffer 16 million OP; relays take 16 links and wireless ones feed 32 machines at 128,000 OP/t."
  ],
  "quest.5D8D55BE51520F91.title": "Energy Transfuser",
  "quest.5D8D55BE51520F91.quest_desc": [
    "Draconium, three draconium cores, a core stabilizer and an enchanting table. Its four slots each charge an item, drain one or buffer, and it balances input between them or fills them left to right."
  ],
  "quest.1812E6F0EAE3F887.title": "Flux and Fluid Gates",
  "quest.1812E6F0EAE3F887.quest_desc": [
    "A potentiometer, a comparator, iron and a draconium core, with redstone blocks for energy or buckets for fluids. Each gate lets through a flow set between two values, picked by the redstone signal it gets."
  ],
  "quest.6469CE9F02D289C5.title": "OP is FE, just bigger",
  "quest.6469CE9F02D289C5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Draconic counts Operational Potential, OP, and every OP storage is also an FE storage: cables and generators from any mod plug straight in. OP only lets the numbers grow past two billion.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6FC734E34DCB6224.title": "Wyvern tools",
  "quest.6FC734E34DCB6224.quest_subtitle": "Modular means empty on day one.",
  "quest.6FC734E34DCB6224.quest_desc": [
    "Fuse a diamond tool with a draconium core, two draconium ingots, two basic relay crystals and a wyvern energy controller, for 8 million OP. They dig at speed 15 but store no energy of their own: fill their 4×4 module grid first.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Enchant the diamond tool before the fusion: enchantments carry over, and so do modules and charge at every later upgrade.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3FAC5D94A9389FDE.title": "Wyvern weapons",
  "quest.3FAC5D94A9389FDE.quest_desc": [
    "The sword and bow fuse like the tools, from a diamond sword and a plain bow. Each sword hit costs 1,024 OP per point of damage and its Attack Radius sweeps a 100-degree arc; each shot costs 1,024 OP per point of its damage, and the bow still uses arrows."
  ],
  "quest.4B4841985E8F8C47.title": "Projectile modules",
  "quest.4B4841985E8F8C47.quest_desc": [
    "Velocity, accuracy, damage, penetration and gravity compensation each start from a module core, two draconium cores and arrows. The Auto Fire module looses the arrow the moment the bow is fully drawn."
  ],
  "quest.596EBD6A3A451C55.title": "Wyvern Chestpiece",
  "quest.596EBD6A3A451C55.quest_subtitle": "Armor with a spreadsheet inside.",
  "quest.596EBD6A3A451C55.quest_desc": [
    "Fused from a diamond chestplate like the tools. Its 6×5 grid takes the armor modules: shields, flight, undying, speed, jump and more. Like every modular item, it needs energy modules to work."
  ],
  "quest.56592C9F369893F4.title": "Wyvern Capacitor",
  "quest.56592C9F369893F4.quest_subtitle": "The battery pack you forget you carry.",
  "quest.56592C9F369893F4.quest_desc": [
    "A Wyvern Core as catalyst with four wyvern energy controllers and four draconium ingots, 8 million OP. It charges your armor, held items, hotbar, inventory and curios, each switchable, from the energy modules in its 4×4 grid."
  ],
  "quest.25EAC6BC8B22C4D5.title": "Two keys for modular gear",
  "quest.25EAC6BC8B22C4D5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.draconicevolution.tool_modules\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens the module grid of what you hold or wear; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.draconicevolution.tool_config\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens its settings: dig speed, area, shield, flight and every other property.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7E68D268279ACFB7.title": "AOE Safe Mode",
  "quest.7E68D268279ACFB7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Area tools have an AOE Safe Mode: switched on, a swing that would reach a block entity breaks nothing at all. Leave it on around your base.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.36CE8B537891F02B.title": "Curios slots",
  "quest.36CE8B537891F02B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Modular chestpieces fit the Curios body slot, which leaves your chestplate slot free; capacitors, item dislocators and the advanced dislocator fit curio slots.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0B9157E507C9C4F2.title": "Module Core",
  "quest.0B9157E507C9C4F2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four iron, two gold, two redstone and a draconium ingot. Every draconium and wyvern module starts from one. A module fits any modular item of its tier or above, in the grid \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.draconicevolution.tool_modules\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.247DF2B44D50E82D.title": "Draconium modules",
  "quest.247DF2B44D50E82D.quest_desc": [
    "The basic set: energy (1 million OP), speed (+10%), damage (+2), area (3×3), jump (+25%) and auto feed (40 hunger points). Iron, gold, redstone, glowstone and potions do most of the work."
  ],
  "quest.00A8EDA141CBB5FA.title": "Wyvern modules",
  "quest.00A8EDA141CBB5FA.quest_desc": [
    "Each folds one or two draconium modules of the same kind into more: 4 million OP, +25% speed, +4 damage, a 5×5 area, +75% jump and 150 hunger points. The area module also wants a Wyvern Core."
  ],
  "quest.1188EA7F609D3521.title": "Selective Incineration",
  "quest.1188EA7F609D3521.quest_subtitle": "Cobblestone goes to a better place.",
  "quest.1188EA7F609D3521.quest_desc": [
    "A lava bucket and redstone in a module. Set its filter slots, by item or by tag like c:stone, and the tool destroys matching drops before they reach your inventory."
  ],
  "quest.597D96ABF4987CEE.title": "Ender Collection",
  "quest.597D96ABF4987CEE.quest_desc": [
    "Drops from your tool go straight to your ender chest instead of your inventory, for 32 OP an item. Sneak-click an Ender Storage chest with the module to send them there instead."
  ],
  "quest.69BD16A1BDC592B5.title": "Tree Harvester",
  "quest.69BD16A1BDC592B5.quest_subtitle": "Lumberjacking, the lazy way.",
  "quest.69BD16A1BDC592B5.quest_desc": [
    "Two diamond axes, two draconium cores and a module core. Hold right click on a tree to fell it whole, with 16 blocks of reach at 5 blocks per second; hold it in the middle of a grove to clear the area."
  ],
  "quest.45F134B49E15D9E3.title": "Presets on a key",
  "quest.45F134B49E15D9E3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In the equipment config screen you can group properties into presets and bind each to a key, even one that works with the screen closed.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0583F603465CFA25.title": "Wyvern flight",
  "quest.0583F603465CFA25.quest_subtitle": "Elytra without the rockets.",
  "quest.0583F603465CFA25.quest_desc": [
    "An elytra, a firework rocket, two draconium cores and a module core. At wyvern tier it grants elytra flight only, at 1,024 OP per tick; hold Forward and Sprint in the air for a boost. Creative flight waits for the draconic tier."
  ],
  "quest.4620906548036F36.title": "Shields",
  "quest.4620906548036F36.quest_subtitle": "Health points, but purple.",
  "quest.4620906548036F36.quest_desc": [
    "The shield controller runs the shield, and it takes a Dragon Heart. Capacity modules add 25 points each, recovery modules speed up the recharge, and the controller sets the cooldown: 20 seconds at wyvern tier.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A shield draws its points squared times 0.0005 OP per tick just to stay up, and 8,192 OP for each point it recharges."
  ],
  "quest.08058AF486EA64DE.title": "Undying",
  "quest.08058AF486EA64DE.quest_subtitle": "A totem that reloads.",
  "quest.08058AF486EA64DE.quest_desc": [
    "A totem of undying in a module. When a hit would kill you it heals 6 health, adds 25 shield points for 15 seconds and grants a moment of invulnerability, then recharges over 2 minutes with 5 million OP."
  ],
  "quest.48E4BDD4C3F0053F.title": "Mining anywhere",
  "quest.48E4BDD4C3F0053F.quest_desc": [
    "Two chestpiece modules against the vanilla slowdowns: the Mining Stabilizer digs at full speed while you fly or float, Aqua Adept at full speed underwater. Sneak to switch Aqua Adept off for a moment."
  ],
  "quest.0CA0C19F37F1945C.title": "Night vision and hill step",
  "quest.0CA0C19F37F1945C.quest_desc": [
    "Night Vision turns on below a light level you choose and drains 20 OP per tick while active. Hill Step walks you up full blocks; hold sneak to turn it off for a moment."
  ],
  "quest.3E099A4E1C49A182.title": "The shield HUD",
  "quest.3E099A4E1C49A182.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The shield HUD shows your shield, energy and undying charge on screen; its settings pick armor energy, capacitor energy or both, as numbers, at any scale.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4B69597ACA16A3DB.title": "Defeat the Ender Dragon",
  "quest.1530700DF8E3E846.title": "The dragon's heart",
  "quest.1530700DF8E3E846.quest_subtitle": "Organ donor, reluctantly.",
  "quest.1530700DF8E3E846.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every time the Ender Dragon dies, a \"},{\"text\":\"Dragon Heart\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:dragon_heart\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" floats above the exit portal and never despawns, and the dragon also drops 57 to 70 draconium dust. Here a new egg appears after every kill, not only the first.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Respawn the dragon with four end crystals on the portal whenever you need another heart."
  ],
  "quest.06697A24187FAC62.title": "More than one job for a heart",
  "quest.06697A24187FAC62.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A heart awakens four draconium blocks, sits in every wyvern shield controller, and two go into the Creative Capacitor. Count them before you stop respawning the dragon.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.16774DB33CC0D7FB.title": "Egg, again",
  "quest.16774DB33CC0D7FB.quest_subtitle": "The dragon has a very full nest.",
  "quest.16774DB33CC0D7FB.quest_desc": [
    "Two dragon eggs in one inventory. Draconic makes the egg return after every kill, and the Celestial Manipulator and the chaotic injectors are glad of it."
  ],
  "reward.4B5B450657B6C22E.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.41B48E165E08F982.title": "Awakened Draconium",
  "quest.41B48E165E08F982.quest_subtitle": "Fifty million OP to wake up a block.",
  "quest.41B48E165E08F982.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four draconium blocks as catalyst, six draconium cores and the Dragon Heart on wyvern injectors: 50 million OP for four \"},{\"text\":\"Awakened Draconium Blocks\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:awakened_draconium_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Everything draconic starts with them.\"}]"
  ],
  "image.5C6F98132FB2CC15.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Dislocators\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.73A6C8E61439CFDA.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Machines\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.4FBCE85C4FD5E8B8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wireless energy\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.56A810938B41EB61.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Modules\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.11029942F789F163.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Chestpiece modules\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.10E415185E06929A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Draconic Evolution\\nDraconium and Wyvern\",\"color\":\"#FFF1DC\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.6BF3191C66F26A16.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.5A674D028264792F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Draconic and Chaotic\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.112C5AB09CD47F24.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"mine  fuse  store  fly\",\"color\":\"#B9A7E0\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.2AA071B9DB08389A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"45.5M\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.7AE1961798CC2560.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"fusion\",\"color\":\"#C9B8F0\"}]",
  "image.2F902F7145EDA123.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"273M\",\"color\":\"#C9B8F0\"}]",
  "image.3D48041A7ECC0B9C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"1.64B\",\"color\":\"#C9B8F0\"}]",
  "image.67C064D704720BB6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"9.88B\",\"color\":\"#C9B8F0\"}]",
  "image.5938E7F60FB990BB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"59.3B\",\"color\":\"#C9B8F0\"}]",
  "image.509266FC641EA4A6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"356B\",\"color\":\"#C9B8F0\"}]",
  "image.60881D6AA70AC9CB.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"2.14T\",\"color\":\"#C9B8F0\"}]",
  "chapter.5CF5488BA6845411.title": "Hostile Neural Networks",
  "chapter.5CF5488BA6845411.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Kill a mob often enough and a machine learns to drop its loot for you."
  ],
  "quest.1C8F40E049E50CFC.title": "A blank mind",
  "quest.1C8F40E049E50CFC.quest_subtitle": "Clay, redstone and a repeater: a brain, of sorts.",
  "quest.1C8F40E049E50CFC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Craft a \"},{\"text\":\"Model Framework\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"hostilenetworks:blank_data_model\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from clay, redstone, a repeater, smooth stone and gold, then right-click a mob with it: it becomes a Data Model of that mob, ready to learn.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.27A442C74D0FCCBC.title": "Any Data Model",
  "quest.43A24CA5AAD219DF.title": "One model per mob",
  "quest.43A24CA5AAD219DF.quest_subtitle": "A zombie model also learns from husks.",
  "quest.43A24CA5AAD219DF.quest_desc": [
    "Each Data Model covers one kind of mob and its variants: the zombie model also learns from husks and zombie villagers, the creeper model from every Creeper Overhaul creeper. It starts Faulty, with no data."
  ],
  "quest.3298A34ED1DAFBCA.title": "Learning by doing",
  "quest.3298A34ED1DAFBCA.quest_subtitle": "You do the killing. It takes the notes.",
  "quest.3298A34ED1DAFBCA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Deep Learner\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"hostilenetworks:deep_learner\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds four models and trains them on every kill credited to you. Wear it in its own Curios slot or keep it in your inventory; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.hostilenetworks.open_deep_learner\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens it, and a HUD counts the kills to the next tier.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6E535926AA1882B7.title": "From Faulty to Self Aware",
  "quest.6E535926AA1882B7.quest_desc": [
    "A standard model reaches Basic, Advanced, Superior and Self Aware at 6, 54, 354 and 1,254 data, and each kill adds 1, 4, 10 or 18, depending on the tier it's at: 98 kills from scratch. A Faulty model can't be simulated.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Accuracy, the chance that a simulation also yields a Prediction of the mob, is 5% at Basic, 22% at Advanced, 65% at Superior and 100% at Self Aware, and it creeps up as the model gains data. The Mimic, the Ender Dragon and the Elder Guardian keep numbers of their own."
  ],
  "quest.744919A3D068C9B6.title": "Fights that never happen",
  "quest.744919A3D068C9B6.quest_subtitle": "No mob was harmed in this simulation.",
  "quest.744919A3D068C9B6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In this pack the chamber's core is an \"},{\"text\":\"Ecosystem Capsule\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:ecosystem_capsule\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from act IV, in place of the obsidian. Feed it FE, a Basic or better model and Prediction Matrices, and every 12 seconds it fights the mob in its head.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The model sets the power bill and the chamber stores 2,000,000 FE. A redstone button picks whether a signal is ignored, stops it or runs it."
  ],
  "quest.69A8A00F6763CA8C.title": "Food for thought",
  "quest.69A8A00F6763CA8C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every simulation eats one \"},{\"text\":\"Prediction Matrix\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"hostilenetworks:prediction_matrix\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and one craft of iron, gold, clay and four glass panes gives sixteen. Keep a stack feeding the chamber.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.7029E97CA06FF0B1.title": "Any Generalized Prediction",
  "quest.123307DB9FCB5A29.title": "Something always comes out",
  "quest.123307DB9FCB5A29.quest_subtitle": "The simulation's small change.",
  "quest.123307DB9FCB5A29.quest_desc": [
    "Every run in Inference mode leaves a Generalized Prediction: Overworld, Nether, Ender or Twilight, depending on the model. The crafting table turns them into living matter, like 8 iron ingots from four Overworld ones and rotten flesh.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Four Overworld predictions around netherrack make a Nether one. Nether ones become blaze rods, ghast tears and gold ingots; Overworld ones gunpowder, bones and arrows."
  ],
  "task.6A2FD3017159C24C.title": "Any mob Prediction",
  "quest.6359D918F0DD8278.title": "The part that matters",
  "quest.6359D918F0DD8278.quest_subtitle": "Accuracy is a die you can train.",
  "quest.6359D918F0DD8278.quest_desc": [
    "Besides the generalized one, each run rolls the model's accuracy for a Prediction of the mob itself. That Prediction is what turns into real loot."
  ],
  "quest.2DAC1FCED44B001F.title": "Loot on demand",
  "quest.2DAC1FCED44B001F.quest_subtitle": "Pick the drop, skip the fight.",
  "quest.2DAC1FCED44B001F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Loot Fabricator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"hostilenetworks:loot_fabricator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns each Prediction into the drop you pick from that mob's list, one every 3 seconds at 256 FE/t. Queue mode takes turns between several picks.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It asks for a netherite ingot, two diamonds, obsidian, gold and a comparator."
  ],
  "quest.4D6563D6CFC66713.title": "Copy, paste, fabricate",
  "quest.4D6563D6CFC66713.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Fabrication Directive\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"hostilenetworks:fab_directive\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (paper, a Prediction Matrix and any Generalized Prediction) copies a Loot Fabricator's picks with a right-click and pastes them into another with sneak and right-click. Ten fabricators, one setup.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.483ABA18411E0745.title": "Predictions from the End",
  "quest.483ABA18411E0745.quest_desc": [
    "Enderman, shulker, Wither, Warden, Mimic and Ender Dragon models all leave Ender predictions, and so do four Nether ones around end stone. They make ender pearls (with an emerald, a snowball and slime), chorus fruit and eight end stone."
  ],
  "quest.4E89E77C43C2662A.title": "Twenty-five minds at once",
  "quest.4E89E77C43C2662A.quest_subtitle": "Seven blocks a side, twenty-five brains inside.",
  "quest.4E89E77C43C2662A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Data Center\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"hostilenetworks:data_center\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs up to 25 Self Aware models at once, each turning one Prediction Matrix into its chosen drop every 15 seconds. It costs a Nether star, two echo shards, a Simulation Chamber, a Loot Fabricator and obsidian.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The controller is one block of a hollow 7×7×7 shell: a floor of 49 obsidian, walls and ceiling of 168 black stained glass, the controller facing out from the lowest wall row, and an empty 5×5×5 inside. Each model draws 1.5 times its FE/t.",
    "",
    "Right-click a model slot to choose its drop."
  ],
  "quest.136ADDAC6C55C8F3.title": "Doors in the glass",
  "quest.136ADDAC6C55C8F3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"IO Port\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"hostilenetworks:data_center_io_port\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stands in for any wall or ceiling block of the Data Center's shell. Right-click cycles it through Energy, Models, Inputs and Outputs, so cables and pipes reach inside.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.762BDAEA28935D6C.title": "32 Generalized Predictions",
  "quest.6DBC91CD8FA63574.title": "Predictions for the common store",
  "quest.6DBC91CD8FA63574.quest_subtitle": "Forecasts nobody asked for.",
  "quest.6DBC91CD8FA63574.quest_desc": [
    "Thirty-two Generalized Predictions for the common store, once a day. A chamber running all night leaves more than you'll ever craft."
  ],
  "quest.263A0D05C060FC98.title": "Training mode",
  "quest.263A0D05C060FC98.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The chamber's mode button switches it to Training: no predictions come out, but each run adds 1 data to the model, takes 15 seconds instead of 12 and costs 20% more power. Good for mobs you can't kill often, once the model is Basic.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.048260E9D56285A0.title": "The model pays the bill",
  "quest.048260E9D56285A0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Power depends on the model, not the chamber: 64 FE/t for farm animals, 128 to 1,024 for most monsters, 2,560 for the Wither, the Warden and the Mimic, 4,096 for the Ender Dragon. The model's tooltip shows its cost.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.6ABFF47276074B69.title": "A Wither Prediction",
  "quest.222FF51FD27752AB.title": "Stars on tap",
  "quest.222FF51FD27752AB.quest_subtitle": "The Wither is still the source. You just stop fighting it.",
  "quest.222FF51FD27752AB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six Wither kills with its model in the Deep Learner make it Basic. From then on the chamber replays the fight at 2,560 FE/t, and each Wither Prediction becomes a \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Star\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:nether_star\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the fabricator: the pack's star farm for act IV.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7BF3D89591F0A10A.title": "A star for every door",
  "quest.7BF3D89591F0A10A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Keep a few spare: Luminous gear, the Data Center and the Envés door all ask for Nether stars, and the door takes one for every descent.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.0ADBC948EEEDA416.title": "A Wither Skeleton Prediction",
  "quest.05CCB8284E1274EB.title": "Skulls in threes",
  "quest.05CCB8284E1274EB.quest_subtitle": "Exactly one Wither per Prediction.",
  "quest.05CCB8284E1274EB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each Wither Skeleton Prediction can become three \"},{\"text\":\"Wither Skeleton Skulls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:wither_skeleton_skull\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", one Wither's worth, so this model feeds the Wither model's training. It runs at 768 FE/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.5E2F88F388E8B4BC.title": "A Blaze Prediction",
  "task.188857F0C5FF958C.title": "An Enderman Prediction",
  "quest.6DEE6B6D13E88AF3.title": "Rods and pearls",
  "quest.6DEE6B6D13E88AF3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Blaze model turns each Prediction into 16 \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Rods\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at 256 FE/t; the Enderman model into 16 \"},{\"text\":\"Ender Pearls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:ender_pearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at 512, and it also learns from every Enderman Overhaul variant.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.630F85CCF845DF81.title": "A Mimic Prediction",
  "quest.27DE9C3EC9C7A30B.title": "Artifacts to order",
  "quest.27DE9C3EC9C7A30B.quest_subtitle": "The chest that bit you, now on the payroll.",
  "quest.27DE9C3EC9C7A30B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Mimic model picks any of 36 artifacts per Prediction, at 2,560 FE/t. It grows slowly: 30 kills to Basic and 2,000 data to Self Aware, so Training mode does most of the work. \"},{\"text\":\"Find one first\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"6C0D53F0E5B344E2\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Not on its list: the Chorus Totem, Warp Drive, Onion Ring, Pickaxe Heater, Withered Bracelet, Charm of Shrinking, the Cowboy and Angler's hats, and the Snowshoes, Rooted Boots and Strider Shoes."
  ],
  "task.6C28E080E6C3823F.title": "An Ender Dragon Prediction",
  "quest.6246EE2EC9A515C3.title": "A spare egg",
  "quest.6246EE2EC9A515C3.quest_subtitle": "One per world is only a suggestion.",
  "quest.6246EE2EC9A515C3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At 4,096 FE/t the Ender Dragon is the priciest vanilla model, but it learns fast, 3 to 45 data a kill, and each Prediction becomes a \"},{\"text\":\"Dragon Egg\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:dragon_egg\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or 16 Dragon's Breath.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.3CAA4FCB22FFF701.title": "An Evoker Prediction",
  "quest.172FA63A7D46EC23.title": "Totems by the pair",
  "quest.172FA63A7D46EC23.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each Evoker Prediction becomes two \"},{\"text\":\"Totems of Undying\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:totem_of_undying\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or 16 emeralds, at 1,024 FE/t. Raids stop being the only way to stock up.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.147E3827DE27CFA7.title": "A Warden Prediction",
  "quest.4A6E7E37C0E8BB17.title": "Echoes on demand",
  "quest.4A6E7E37C0E8BB17.quest_subtitle": "Quieter than the real thing.",
  "quest.4A6E7E37C0E8BB17.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Warden Prediction becomes two \"},{\"text\":\"Echo Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:echo_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the pair the Data Center asks for, or four sculk catalysts, a \"},{\"text\":\"Heart of the Deep\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"deeperdarker:heart_of_the_deep\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a Warden Carapace or a Warden Tendril, at 2,560 FE/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3F0E93D95326CA77.title": "Another sky's forecast",
  "quest.3F0E93D95326CA77.quest_subtitle": "Tomorrow: fog, with a chance of Naga.",
  "quest.3F0E93D95326CA77.quest_desc": [
    "Twenty-five Twilight Forest models, from the deer to the Ur-Ghast, leave Twilight predictions. Four with leaves make 8 steeleaf, four with a stick 8 liveroot, two with a torch 8 fireflies."
  ],
  "reward.38B6FDECD666A509.title": "Secret found",
  "task.4AE48CB62DE8881F.title": "An Ur-Ghast Prediction",
  "quest.107F7910BBAD5DFD.title": "The most expensive dream",
  "quest.107F7910BBAD5DFD.quest_subtitle": "8,192 FE per tick of pure nightmare.",
  "quest.107F7910BBAD5DFD.quest_desc": [
    "You simulated the Ur-Ghast, the priciest model in the pack at 8,192 FE/t. Each Prediction pays back in carminite, fiery tears or a trophy."
  ],
  "reward.11C9423D4923F705.title": "Secret found",
  "image.603CA4433D9180F3.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Models worth training\",\"color\":\"#3FF7DB\"}]",
  "image.355D48BC756F85F8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Hostile Neural Networks\",\"color\":\"#E8FFFB\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.4814A7C01C7A8422.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"kill · learn · simulate · fabricate\",\"color\":\"#3FF7DB\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.625C94B2A15EB8F4.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.77C11B1742A9B27E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Artifacts\",\"color\":\"#3FF7DB\"}]",
  "image.2D40CECF392F403E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"input\",\"color\":\"#3FF7DB\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.39655959DE1A24F6.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"hidden · tiers\",\"color\":\"#3FF7DB\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.7D99F0E55363477B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"simulation\",\"color\":\"#3FF7DB\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.1CB91CEA2E0179F2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"fabrication\",\"color\":\"#3FF7DB\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.03C76118AAED85F7.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"output\",\"color\":\"#3FF7DB\",\"font\":\"minecraft:uniform\"}]",
  "image.5F5630E83D70B250.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Faulty\",\"color\":\"#8A8A8A\"}]",
  "image.2C098F1640F0AD12.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Basic\",\"color\":\"#55FF55\"}]",
  "image.76B78DAE120C4D6A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Advanced\",\"color\":\"#5577FF\"}]",
  "image.041AD77D3E0DF411.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Superior\",\"color\":\"#FF55FF\"}]",
  "image.3F60809035E4E1DD.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Self Aware\",\"color\":\"#FFAA00\"}]",
  "chapter.47DB1CC102DAD5C0.title": "Just Dire Things · Machines and Time",
  "chapter.47DB1CC102DAD5C0.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Breakers, placers and clickers in two tiers, coal and fuel generators, portals, and the time crystals that feed the Time Wand and the Paradox Machine."
  ],
  "quest.6A34D999CCB88294.title": "Simple Block Breaker",
  "quest.6A34D999CCB88294.quest_subtitle": "Mining, minus the miner.",
  "quest.6A34D999CCB88294.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Ferricore, a \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", two Lapis, an \"},{\"text\":\"Observer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:observer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a Redstone. It needs no power: give it a pickaxe or shovel and it breaks the block it faces with it, wearing the tool as you would. Speed and redstone mode are in its screen.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.72C672CE8CFD9554.title": "Simple Block Placer",
  "quest.72C672CE8CFD9554.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The breaker's recipe with a \"},{\"text\":\"Dispenser\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:dispenser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the middle. It places the block in its slot into the space in front; the direction button sets which way it faces, handy for torches.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6E2F7442D8632D66.title": "Simple Clicker",
  "quest.6E2F7442D8632D66.quest_subtitle": "The bot that presses buttons for you.",
  "quest.6E2F7442D8632D66.quest_desc": [
    "An Eye of Ender and a Dispenser in the breaker's frame. It clicks with the item in its slot: right, left or held for a set number of ticks, sneaking or not, at blocks, air, hostile or passive mobs, adults, children or players."
  ],
  "quest.360C206EE7C6A0D5.title": "Simple Sensor",
  "quest.360C206EE7C6A0D5.quest_desc": [
    "An Eye of Ender and an Observer in the frame. It sends a strong or weak redstone signal when what's in front matches its filter: a block, air, a kind of mob, a player, or items lying on the ground."
  ],
  "quest.55DD4FF09383E307.title": "Simple Dropper",
  "quest.55DD4FF09383E307.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two Redstone and a \"},{\"text\":\"Dropper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:dropper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the frame. It drops its items in the direction you pick, from one at a time to a whole stack, with a pickup delay you set: zero means they can be grabbed at once.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7E4FCA08EF3A912A.title": "Simple Fluid Placer",
  "quest.7E4FCA08EF3A912A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Bucket\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a Dropper in the frame. Load it with buckets or a Fluid Canister; with 1,000 mB inside and nothing in front, it places a source block.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.30F89EB3F0378D63.title": "Simple Fluid Collector",
  "quest.30F89EB3F0378D63.quest_desc": [
    "A Bucket and a Dispenser in the frame. It picks up the fluid source in front into its tank, one fluid kind at a time, and fills buckets or canisters put in its slot."
  ],
  "quest.3168476F6DD668E2.title": "Simple Swapper",
  "quest.3168476F6DD668E2.quest_subtitle": "Teleport, but for scenery.",
  "quest.3168476F6DD668E2.quest_desc": [
    "Four Blazegold, an Eye of Ender, two Lapis, an Observer and a Redstone. Link two with the Ferricore Wrench and they trade the blocks in front of them, chests with contents included, or the entities there, even across dimensions."
  ],
  "quest.025801C5908EBD90.title": "Ferricore Wrench",
  "quest.025801C5908EBD90.quest_desc": [
    "Four Ferricore Ingots. It rotates blocks and links Swappers: right-click the first, then the second, and a message confirms the pair."
  ],
  "quest.70DD4EB190444582.title": "Machine Settings Copier",
  "quest.70DD4EB190444582.quest_subtitle": "Configure once, click everywhere.",
  "quest.70DD4EB190444582.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Primal Coal, a \"},{\"text\":\"Paper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:paper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a Ferricore. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click a machine to copy its settings, right-click another to paste them; click the air to pick which ones travel: area, filters, offset, redstone.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4C5BFCC25ADFE7A9.title": "Item Collector",
  "quest.4C5BFCC25ADFE7A9.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Diamond, two \"},{\"text\":\"Hoppers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:hopper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", an Ender Pearl and three Ferricore. No power needed: it vacuums up the items lying in its area, up to five blocks each way, into the inventory it's placed against, filters included.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3D03BDCDC9D0108C.title": "Speed and pulses",
  "quest.3D03BDCDC9D0108C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A machine acts once every 20 ticks by default; the Speed button goes down to every tick, which costs server time. Redstone can be ignored, required low or high, or set to Pulse: one action per pulse.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.25E733A510A100BD.title": "Goo on autopilot",
  "quest.25E733A510A100BD.quest_subtitle": "Three machines and a blob.",
  "quest.25E733A510A100BD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Around a goo: a Block Placer feeds it iron blocks, a Block Breaker with a pickaxe mines the raw ore, and a Clicker holding its food right-clicks it awake whenever it dozes off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.15B0A7051FEC41B4.title": "Just Dire Things in this pack",
  "quest.15B0A7051FEC41B4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five recipes wait on the Atlas: both Portal Guns take a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III), the Flight upgrade a \"},{\"text\":\"Horizon Chart\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:horizon_chart\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV), the Time Wand and the Paradox Machine an \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act V).\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each act material takes the place of one ingredient, a Blazegold, an End Crystal or a Time Crystal. Everything else in the mod is untouched."
  ],
  "quest.534FBB18F0E57992.title": "Advanced Block Breaker",
  "quest.534FBB18F0E57992.quest_subtitle": "Now with an area of effect.",
  "quest.534FBB18F0E57992.quest_desc": [
    "Four Celestigem, three Eyes of Ender, a Redstone and the simple breaker make its advanced form: every block in an area up to 11×11×11, 500 FE each, with filters by block or by the item it drops. The direction button aims hammer tools."
  ],
  "quest.78C36B0045D04DB4.title": "Advanced Block Placer",
  "quest.78C36B0045D04DB4.quest_desc": [
    "Same upgrade recipe around the simple placer. It fills its area, 500 FE a block, and its filter says which blocks it may place on: filter stone with direction down and it only covers the tops of stone."
  ],
  "quest.73625A4D993CC913.title": "Advanced Clicker",
  "quest.73625A4D993CC913.quest_subtitle": "Your farmhand never sleeps.",
  "quest.73625A4D993CC913.quest_desc": [
    "It clicks every match in its area for 250 FE a click, with block and entity filters. Set to left-click hostiles with a sword it's a mob farm; right-clicking adults with wheat, a breeder."
  ],
  "quest.160D4A13E93FA5F7.title": "Advanced Sensor",
  "quest.160D4A13E93FA5F7.quest_desc": [
    "It counts matches in its area and compares them: greater than, less than or equal to a number you set. «Fewer than ten adult cows» can switch on a clicker that feeds them. It spends 2 FE per block it scans."
  ],
  "quest.426BAE3D9F3A6715.title": "Advanced Dropper",
  "quest.426BAE3D9F3A6715.quest_desc": [
    "It holds a 3×3 grid and drops in the order its filter lists, cobblestone then redstone, waiting if one runs out. It moves where it drops with an offset instead of a radius, for 25 FE a drop."
  ],
  "quest.245139A46259D8A5.title": "Advanced Fluid Placer",
  "quest.245139A46259D8A5.quest_desc": [
    "It places fluid across an area for 500 FE a block, and like the advanced placer its filter picks the blocks it may place on."
  ],
  "quest.18E80D13D66E25FA.title": "Advanced Fluid Collector",
  "quest.18E80D13D66E25FA.quest_subtitle": "Lakes are just big buckets.",
  "quest.18E80D13D66E25FA.quest_desc": [
    "It drinks every source in its area for 500 FE each; a filled bucket in a filter slot limits it to that fluid."
  ],
  "quest.79797CC222BC0242.title": "Advanced Swapper",
  "quest.79797CC222BC0242.quest_subtitle": "Moving day, in one tick.",
  "quest.79797CC222BC0242.quest_desc": [
    "Four Eclipse Alloy around the simple swapper. Linked pairs share one radius, so a whole house, contents and all, can trade places with an empty field; 50 FE a block. Entity filters narrow it down to, say, babies or blue sheep."
  ],
  "quest.30AD539C61D7C859.title": "Area and filters",
  "quest.30AD539C61D7C859.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Turn on Render Area before touching RAD and OFF: RAD grows the box up to five blocks each way, OFF moves its center up to nine. Filters take items, buckets, spawn eggs or a Creature Catcher, as an allow or a deny list, with NBT if you need a blue sheep.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0371F41FEBE1DD9F.title": "Read a block's state",
  "quest.0371F41FEBE1DD9F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Right-click a sensor's filter slot with a block in it to pick block states: detect whether a door is open, a lever is on or a crop is ripe.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2C3AB0D2EAD2E915.title": "Creature Catcher",
  "quest.2C3AB0D2EAD2E915.quest_subtitle": "Gotta catch 'em all. One at a time.",
  "quest.2C3AB0D2EAD2E915.quest_desc": [
    "Four Blazegold around an Ender Pearl. Throw it at a mob to catch it, throw it again to let it out. It holds any ordinary mob, not the Ender Dragon, and doubles as an entity filter in advanced machines."
  ],
  "quest.709AED657C035839.title": "Ghast in a jar",
  "quest.709AED657C035839.quest_subtitle": "It trusted you. Mostly.",
  "quest.709AED657C035839.quest_desc": [
    "You brought a ghast home to the Overworld and then betrayed it. A Creature Catcher makes the trip a lot less stressful, for you."
  ],
  "reward.0782B61A0C0DD615.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.6DA306F2EF01A023.title": "Primal Coal",
  "quest.6DA306F2EF01A023.quest_subtitle": "Coal, but it did the reading.",
  "quest.6DA306F2EF01A023.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Coal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:coal_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or a charcoal block next to an awake Primogel Goo turns into Raw Primal Coal in two minutes; mined, it drops three or four \"},{\"text\":\"Primal Coal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:coal_t1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Each burns 4,800 ticks, three times a coal.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.30B3BB63E89B266B.title": "Charcoal Block",
  "quest.30B3BB63E89B266B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Nine \"},{\"text\":\"Charcoal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:charcoal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a charcoal block; in this pack Almost Unified hands out Mekanism's \"},{\"text\":\"Block of Charcoal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:block_charcoal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". The Primogel Goo takes any block tagged as charcoal, so a tree farm becomes a Primal Coal farm.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7538A530292C2C5C.title": "Blaze Ember",
  "quest.7538A530292C2C5C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A block of Primal Coal next to a Blazebloom Goo becomes Raw Blaze Ember in a minute, three or four \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Ember\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:coal_t2\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" mined. Each burns 14,400 ticks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.031F2B6A7D076539.title": "Voidflame Coal",
  "quest.031F2B6A7D076539.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A block of Blaze Ember next to a VoidShimmer Goo becomes Raw Voidflame Coal in 48 seconds. Each \"},{\"text\":\"Voidflame Coal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:coal_t3\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" burns 43,200 ticks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7276769D1634170C.title": "Eclipse Ember",
  "quest.7276769D1634170C.quest_subtitle": "Eighty-one coals in one.",
  "quest.7276769D1634170C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A block of Voidflame Coal next to a Shadowpulse Goo becomes Raw Eclipse Ember in 24 seconds. \"},{\"text\":\"Eclipse Ember\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:coal_t4\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" burns 129,600 ticks, the densest fuel in the mod.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2491EF53E6ED64AE.title": "Simple Coal Generator",
  "quest.2491EF53E6ED64AE.quest_subtitle": "The first watt is the hardest.",
  "quest.2491EF53E6ED64AE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Ferricore, two Redstone, two Coal and a \"},{\"text\":\"Blast Furnace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blast_furnace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It burns any furnace fuel at 60 FE/t, pushes power into the blocks around it and holds 1,000,000 FE; the JDT coals burn two to sixteen times faster in it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1EFBEC9555478138.title": "Hotter, not longer",
  "quest.1EFBEC9555478138.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In the Coal Generator, Primal Coal gives 120 FE/t, Blaze Ember 240, Voidflame 480 and Eclipse Ember 960. Each tier triples the energy per piece, but the goo only returns three or four for nine: climb the ladder for power per tick, not for total energy.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1A198DFAC0298714.title": "Fuel Canister",
  "quest.1A198DFAC0298714.quest_subtitle": "A fuel tank that never wastes a lump.",
  "quest.1A198DFAC0298714.quest_desc": [
    "Four Ferricore around a Coal. Load fuel through its screen and it stores the burn time, up to 10,000,000 ticks, averaging the JDT coal multipliers; no lava and no way to take it back. In a furnace it spends only 200 ticks per item, so one ore no longer eats a whole coal."
  ],
  "quest.286E9DD3A04004DF.title": "Energy Transmitter",
  "quest.286E9DD3A04004DF.quest_subtitle": "Wireless, with a toll.",
  "quest.286E9DD3A04004DF.quest_desc": [
    "A Celestigem, two Redstone, an Ender Pearl and three Blazegold. Wired to a generator, it beams up to 1,000 FE/t to every machine in its area, losing 1% per block of distance; transmitters in range of each other balance for free."
  ],
  "quest.749010CCF4F9F3BC.title": "Primal Coal for the common store",
  "quest.749010CCF4F9F3BC.quest_subtitle": "Keep the home fires burning.",
  "quest.749010CCF4F9F3BC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Thirty-two \"},{\"text\":\"Primal Coal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:coal_t1\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" a day. Furnaces, generators and pocket generators on the server all run hotter on it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5CA0446ED94B38A0.title": "Polymorphic Fluid",
  "quest.5CA0446ED94B38A0.quest_subtitle": "Water, but open-minded.",
  "quest.5CA0446ED94B38A0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Blazegold Ingot and a Nether Wart, shapeless, make four \"},{\"text\":\"Polymorphic Catalysts\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:polymorphic_catalyst\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Toss one into a water source and it becomes \"},{\"text\":\"Polymorphic Fluid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:polymorphic_fluid_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", the base of every other JDT fluid.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7ADC2732447495A1.title": "Blaze Ember Fuel",
  "quest.7ADC2732447495A1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drop a Blaze Ember into Polymorphic Fluid for Unrefined Blaze Ember Fuel, then leave it next to a Blazebloom Goo or higher: a minute later it is \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Ember Fuel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:refined_t2_fluid_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", worth 450,000 FE a bucket in the Fuel Generator.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.693848977EF93CED.title": "Voidflame Fuel",
  "quest.693848977EF93CED.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Voidflame Coal dropped into refined Blaze Ember Fuel makes the unrefined kind; a VoidShimmer Goo or higher refines it into \"},{\"text\":\"Voidflame Fuel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:refined_t3_fluid_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", 1,300 FE per mB.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.122D345169F0AA5E.title": "Eclipse Ember Fuel",
  "quest.122D345169F0AA5E.quest_subtitle": "The top shelf.",
  "quest.122D345169F0AA5E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eclipse Ember into refined Voidflame Fuel, then a Shadowpulse Goo: \"},{\"text\":\"Eclipse Ember Fuel\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:refined_t4_fluid_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs the generator at 4,000 FE/t, four million FE a bucket.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5E691CBFC66B1E73.title": "Simple Fuel Generator",
  "quest.5E691CBFC66B1E73.quest_desc": [
    "Four Blazegold, two Redstone, two Buckets and a Blast Furnace. It drinks 1 mB of refined fuel a tick and turns it into its FE per mB, 450, 1,300 or 4,000 a tick, into a 5,000,000 FE buffer."
  ],
  "quest.1DC2CDB95D4733A4.title": "Refine before you burn",
  "quest.1DC2CDB95D4733A4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Blaze Ember burns for 216,000 FE in the Coal Generator; dropped into Polymorphic Fluid and refined, the same ember is a bucket worth 450,000 FE. The first refinery pays for itself.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7DE44328939DA928.title": "Fluid Canister",
  "quest.7DE44328939DA928.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Ferricore around a \"},{\"text\":\"Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:glass\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" block: a bucket that holds 8,000 mB. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click to set its auto-fill: off, Just Dire Things items only, or every fluid holder you carry.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4C55646122C1DEC9.title": "Polymorphic Wand",
  "quest.4C55646122C1DEC9.quest_subtitle": "Pig in, surprise out.",
  "quest.4C55646122C1DEC9.quest_desc": [
    "A Fluid Canister, a Polymorphic Catalyst and a Blazegold. Fill it from a Polymorphic Fluid source, then use it on a mob within four blocks: for 100 mB a hostile turns into another random hostile, a passive one into another passive."
  ],
  "quest.37236326D0F7C0C7.title": "Advanced Polymorphic Wand",
  "quest.37236326D0F7C0C7.quest_subtitle": "Sheep in, sheep out. By choice.",
  "quest.37236326D0F7C0C7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Eclipse Alloy and a Celestigem on the wand. \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click a mob to save its kind, then Targeted Polymorph turns any mob into it for 250 mB and 50,000 FE; not the Wither, the Warden or the dragon.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.75C696C42634E1FD.title": "Experience Holder",
  "quest.75C696C42634E1FD.quest_subtitle": "A piggy bank for enchanters.",
  "quest.75C696C42634E1FD.quest_desc": [
    "An Emerald, two Books, an Ender Pearl and three Blazegold. Bank your levels with its buttons, let it soak up orbs in its area, and it keeps everything when broken. It is a tank too: 20 mB of XP Fluid per experience point."
  ],
  "quest.7D8E3C5F2388EA70.title": "XP Fluid",
  "quest.7D8E3C5F2388EA70.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Take a bucket of \"},{\"text\":\"XP Fluid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:xp_fluid_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" out of the holder. This pack registers it with Create: Enchantment Industry at the same 20 mB per point, so it feeds \"},{\"text\":\"its machines\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"50EABAD3AA74115B\"}},{\"text\":\" too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7043B03FABC435F6.title": "Always level 30",
  "quest.7043B03FABC435F6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Set the holder's target level to 30 and its redstone to always: each time you enchant nearby, it tops you back up to exactly 30. Owner Only keeps it from feeding anyone else.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.057E6F65BF4275B0.title": "Inventory Holder",
  "quest.057E6F65BF4275B0.quest_subtitle": "Outfit change, one click.",
  "quest.057E6F65BF4275B0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Blazegold around an \"},{\"text\":\"Armor Stand\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:armor_stand\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a stand with a full player inventory, armor and off hand included. Save per-slot filters, then Swap Items trades your whole inventory with its layout in one click.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2357289316AED1EB.title": "Player Accessor",
  "quest.2357289316AED1EB.quest_subtitle": "Your pockets, now with plumbing.",
  "quest.2357289316AED1EB.quest_desc": [
    "Four Blazegold, an Eye of Ender, two Ender Pearls, a Dispenser and a Lapis. It hands your inventory to pipes and hoppers while you're online, wherever you are; each face can reach the main slots, the armor or the off hand."
  ],
  "quest.7C8D885F7153DA80.title": "Portal Gun",
  "quest.7C8D885F7153DA80.quest_subtitle": "Now you're thinking with portals.",
  "quest.7C8D885F7153DA80.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In this pack it takes a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act III), three Blazegold and an Eye of Ender. Left-click fires a blue portal, right-click an orange one; players and items walk through. 1,000 FE a shot; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and right-click closes yours.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.19FBEBBB581E102B.title": "Portal Fluid Catalyst",
  "quest.19FBEBBB581E102B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Chorus Fruit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:chorus_fruit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a Lapis. Toss it into Polymorphic Fluid in the End and you get Unstable Portal Fluid; anywhere else it boils away the moment it forms.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.74F85D1A10809975.title": "Portal Fluid",
  "quest.74F85D1A10809975.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Put a VoidShimmer Goo or higher next to the unstable fluid, still in the End: in 24 seconds it settles into \"},{\"text\":\"Portal Fluid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:portal_fluid_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which keeps anywhere.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.66173EC9CFA5816A.title": "Advanced Portal Gun",
  "quest.66173EC9CFA5816A.quest_subtitle": "Home is one click away.",
  "quest.66173EC9CFA5816A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Celestigem, a Reinforced Alloy (act III), the catalyst, a Fluid Canister and three Blazegold. Save up to twelve spots in its favorites wheel, opened with \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"justdirethings.key.toggle_tool\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\", then fire: a portal pair opens between you and the chosen spot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7C5BEAF96133402D.title": "Five seconds",
  "quest.7C5BEAF96133402D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Advanced portals close after five seconds, so step through. Fill the gun from a Portal Fluid source; a jump costs a quarter mB per block, 100 mB at most, and 100 mB to another dimension. Fire while sneaking to go back to where you last fired from.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6E093861D1A4B0FE.title": "Handle with care",
  "quest.6E093861D1A4B0FE.quest_subtitle": "Do not shake.",
  "quest.6E093861D1A4B0FE.quest_desc": [
    "You scooped a bucket of Unstable Portal Fluid. Pour it anywhere outside the End and it's gone in a puff of dragon's breath."
  ],
  "reward.6C366AE5E8985596.title": "Secret found",
  "task.28B207F32EE93F81.title": "Overworld charge (blue)",
  "task.65A8877273E3BCEE.title": "Nether charge (orange)",
  "task.4BC0DE024273CCB6.title": "End charge (green)",
  "quest.730E2B8E451FDB7C.title": "Budding Time Crystal",
  "quest.730E2B8E451FDB7C.quest_subtitle": "It needs a holiday in three dimensions.",
  "quest.730E2B8E451FDB7C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Put a Shadowpulse Goo against a \"},{\"text\":\"Budding Amethyst\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:budding_amethyst\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in its geode: 24 seconds later it's a \"},{\"text\":\"Budding Time Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:time_crystal_budding_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It must soak up time in the Overworld, then the Nether, then the End, changing color at each step. Look at it after each one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3E6D0D1E871BA257.title": "Move it, don't mine it",
  "quest.3E6D0D1E871BA257.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The budding block shatters when mined, Silk Touch or not. Swap it through dimensions with a pair of linked Swappers, and once buds grow, use an Advanced Swapper with a radius so they travel with it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.730A505CE9A6F44A.title": "Time Crystals",
  "quest.730A505CE9A6F44A.quest_subtitle": "Patience, crystallized.",
  "quest.730A505CE9A6F44A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fully charged, the block grows buds on its faces: small, medium, large, cluster. Only the full cluster drops a \"},{\"text\":\"Time Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:time_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; break a bud early and you get nothing. Each growth has a 5% chance of draining the block back to the start.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3CA0D818C52D7C74.title": "A clock in a rock",
  "quest.3CA0D818C52D7C74.quest_subtitle": "Time well wasted.",
  "quest.3CA0D818C52D7C74.quest_desc": [
    "You took a whole Time Crystal Cluster with Silk Touch. It makes a fine clock for a shelf, and it still gives its one crystal if you break it the normal way later."
  ],
  "reward.017993208A336FB4.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.183BA8E6B5BCCD80.title": "Time Crystal Block",
  "quest.183BA8E6B5BCCD80.quest_desc": [
    "Nine Time Crystals make a block. A Shadowpulse Goo turns it into a fresh Budding Time Crystal, so you never need another amethyst geode; the Paradox Machine takes one too."
  ],
  "quest.7E3C72D8F8E556FE.title": "Timey wimey",
  "quest.7E3C72D8F8E556FE.quest_desc": [
    "Carrying Time Crystals now and then gives you five seconds of Slowness VI or Speed VI, at random. The Time Protection upgrade on an Eclipse Alloy chestplate stops it."
  ],
  "quest.2718EF320FB935A1.title": "Time Fluid",
  "quest.2718EF320FB935A1.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Toss a Time Crystal into a \"},{\"text\":\"Polymorphic Fluid\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"5CA0446ED94B38A0\"}},{\"text\":\" source and it becomes \"},{\"text\":\"Time Fluid\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"justdirethings:time_fluid_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", nearly transparent. Every time-bending tool and machine runs on it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7E14F225C1D98074.title": "Time Wand",
  "quest.7E14F225C1D98074.quest_subtitle": "Fast-forward for furnaces.",
  "quest.7E14F225C1D98074.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Here it takes an \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act V), a Time Crystal, two Ferricore and a Blazegold. Fill it from a Time Fluid source, then right-click any ticking block: twice as fast for 30 seconds, doubling each click up to 256×, for 100 FE and half a mB per unit of speed.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6B7FBBEA308106C7.title": "Hand the wand to a clicker",
  "quest.6B7FBBEA308106C7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fake players may use the Time Wand here, and advanced machines charge the FE items in their slots. An Advanced Clicker right-clicking a furnace with the wand keeps it sped up; just keep the Time Fluid topped up.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7A52BC6A10427B4A.title": "Paradox Machine",
  "quest.7A52BC6A10427B4A.quest_subtitle": "Undo, for a price.",
  "quest.7A52BC6A10427B4A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four Eclipse Alloy, an \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act V), two Time Crystals, a Time Crystal Block and a Time Fluid bucket. Snapshot an area up to 11×11×11: its ore blocks and mobs. Mine or kill them, then run it, and it pulls them back from a parallel timeline.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Each restored block or mob costs 250,000 FE and 50 mB of Time Fluid; it holds 10,000,000 FE and 16,000 mB. Its screen tracks the Paradox Energy each run adds."
  ],
  "quest.79DE68D4DD0FD17C.title": "The Paradox",
  "quest.79DE68D4DD0FD17C.quest_desc": [
    "Every restoration adds a quarter point of Paradox Energy; at 100, four hundred restorations, a Paradox opens. It grows a block of radius a minute up to 12, faster as it feeds, and swallows blocks, items and mobs for good.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Toss a Time Crystal into its center\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" and it collapses. Bedrock, unbreakable blocks and players are safe; your base is not.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2170597F696D55A4.title": "Ore insurance",
  "quest.2170597F696D55A4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The goo's raw ore blocks count as ores to the machine. Snapshot a Raw Eclipse Alloy Ore, mine it, restore it, repeat: an ore farm paid in FE and Time Fluid.\"}]"
  ],
  "image.2F9BCC4CCD64E9A9.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Simple machines · no power\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.46A064602009EE91.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Advanced machines · FE\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.164C6481D0C77F21.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Coal and power\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.05A01EC769AE2697.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Polymorphic fluid and fuel\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.5EE4876158022FED.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Experience and inventories\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.1596BA8ABE969D7F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Portals\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.6A39825C2E8D9AD2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Time\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "image.6C57E8986980F211.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Just Dire Things\\nMachines and Time\",\"color\":\"#EFFFE8\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.288B4877C20BA7C0.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.0165E5C02CB96A47.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"snapshot  undo  regret\",\"color\":\"#9FE88A\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.4BB7B42628F71A85.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"« Goo and Gear\",\"color\":\"#7BEA4F\"}]",
  "chapter.39AA416007D5AA46.title": "Modern Industrialization · Digital",
  "chapter.39AA416007D5AA46.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Stainless steel, titanium and plastics, digital circuits and the processing unit, high pressure steam, and flight."
  ],
  "quest.351FCB2858456867.title": "Vacuum Freezer",
  "quest.351FCB2858456867.quest_subtitle": "Enslaved winter.",
  "quest.351FCB2858456867.quest_desc": [
    "Three large pumps, three electronic circuits, an advanced hull and two aluminum large plates. It cools the hot ingots the blast furnace starts to make from here on, and with an air intake inside, never used up, it turns air into liquid air."
  ],
  "quest.1DF240EEB7B6E217.title": "Chromium",
  "quest.1DF240EEB7B6E217.quest_desc": [
    "Ten redstone in the centrifuge give a ruby dust; six ruby dusts give a chromium crushed dust. It dissolves in 9,000 mB of hydrochloric acid, and each bucket of that solution electrolyzes into three chromium tiny dusts, giving back hydrogen and chlorine."
  ],
  "quest.7F2DB374F68A2C30.title": "Manganese",
  "quest.7F2DB374F68A2C30.quest_desc": [
    "Six raw iron in the centrifuge give eight iron dusts and a manganese crushed dust. Sulfuric acid dissolves it into 9,000 mB of solution; each bucket electrolyzes into three manganese tiny dusts and 900 mB of the acid back."
  ],
  "quest.611AB3FB81F103D7.title": "Stainless Steel",
  "quest.611AB3FB81F103D7.quest_subtitle": "Invar with slot locking.",
  "quest.611AB3FB81F103D7.quest_desc": [
    "Six iron dusts, a chromium, a nickel and a manganese dust make nine stainless steel dust in the Mixer. The blast furnace turns each into a hot ingot at 32 EU/t, and the Vacuum Freezer cools it in 12.5 seconds.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Iron and nickel also match invar in the Mixer: lock an output slot to stainless steel dust.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.061D077F052293CD.title": "Kanthal Coils",
  "quest.061D077F052293CD.quest_subtitle": "Electric better furnace.",
  "quest.061D077F052293CD.quest_desc": [
    "Stainless steel, chromium and aluminum dust mix into kanthal; its cables ring into coils like cupronickel. Swap the blast furnace's sixteen coils for these and it takes recipes up to 128 EU/t: titanium, platinum and annealed copper need it."
  ],
  "quest.185D3CB6FB138BEF.title": "Monazite",
  "quest.185D3CB6FB138BEF.quest_subtitle": "Rare earths, rarely.",
  "quest.185D3CB6FB138BEF.quest_desc": [
    "MI's rarest ore: two small veins per chunk below height 24. Nine of its dusts in the centrifuge give three neodymium, three yttrium and three cadmium dusts, and half the time 300 mB of helium. Neodymium makes advanced motors, cadmium batteries and control rods."
  ],
  "quest.54FB0BAF3FD3D1EC.title": "Annealed Copper",
  "quest.54FB0BAF3FD3D1EC.quest_desc": [
    "Copper dust and 250 mB of oxygen in the blast furnace make a hot ingot at 64 EU/t, cooled like the rest. Its wires go into advanced motors, and its cables are EV: 65,536 EU/t into a network."
  ],
  "quest.7ED3D0E666CBB516.title": "Polyethylene",
  "quest.7ED3D0E666CBB516.quest_desc": [
    "Steam-crack light fuel or naphtha in the chemical reactor, distill it for ethylene, then polymerize: 500 mB of ethylene with four lead tiny dusts give 300 mB of polyethylene, with one chromium tiny dust 700."
  ],
  "quest.36836A1982A8D841.title": "Digital Circuit Board",
  "quest.36836A1982A8D841.quest_desc": [
    "Only the assembler makes it: six aluminum cables, a silicon battery, an electronic board, four stainless steel plates and 750 mB of polyethylene. Aluminum cables are HV, 8,192 EU/t into a network."
  ],
  "quest.5EDEE7569637D27D.title": "Logic gates",
  "quest.5EDEE7569637D27D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Op Amp\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:op_amp\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is four resistors, four transistors and a diode. With aluminum wire it becomes an AND gate with resistors, an OR gate with a diode and a second op amp, and a NOT gate with one resistor.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.71323E5DE10F7F15.title": "Digital Circuit",
  "quest.71323E5DE10F7F15.quest_subtitle": "No need for Sodium anymore.",
  "quest.71323E5DE10F7F15.quest_desc": [
    "Four electronic circuits, an AND gate, an OR gate and two NOT gates on a digital board. The turbo hull, the distillation tower, the pressurizer and every HV machine start here."
  ],
  "quest.27378F0D2B36AE9B.title": "Turbo Machine Hull",
  "quest.27378F0D2B36AE9B.quest_desc": [
    "A digital circuit, two sodium batteries and three aluminum cables on a turbo casing: eight stainless steel plates around an advanced hull. Sodium comes from electrolyzing salt, MI's own ore, which also gives chlorine."
  ],
  "quest.1F654CF0CC18BCC0.title": "Advanced motor and pump",
  "quest.1F654CF0CC18BCC0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Polarizer magnetizes a stainless steel rod with a neodymium dust; with two stainless rods, two aluminum cables and four annealed copper wires it makes an \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Motor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:advanced_motor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Stainless rotors and pipes around one make an \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Pump\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:advanced_pump\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.30D8772C1600CA50.title": "Titanium",
  "quest.30D8772C1600CA50.quest_subtitle": "Steel, but pink.",
  "quest.30D8772C1600CA50.quest_desc": [
    "Nothing generates titanium ore: bauxite electrolysis leaves titanium tiny dust, and the Electric Quarry digs the ore with stainless drills. Three raw titanium and 3,000 mB of manganese solution give four hot ingots at 128 EU/t, with 2,500 mB of the solution back."
  ],
  "quest.68DD9957F287E0FE.title": "Pressurizer",
  "quest.68DD9957F287E0FE.quest_subtitle": "Under pressure.",
  "quest.68DD9957F287E0FE.quest_desc": [
    "Four advanced pumps, a digital circuit, a turbo hull, an aluminum cable and two titanium pipe casings. It squeezes 1,000 mB of water or steam into 125 of high pressure at 64 EU/t, lets it back down for 2, and with an air intake makes liquid air cheaper than the freezer."
  ],
  "quest.7BE181EF3C63334C.title": "Liquid air",
  "quest.7BE181EF3C63334C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Aluminum and stainless plates around a stainless rotor make an \"},{\"text\":\"Air Intake\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:air_intake\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Its liquid air splits in the centrifuge: 3,000 mB give 650 of oxygen, 2,315 of nitrogen and 35 of argon, the rare one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0515B48700D32CDF.title": "Blastproof Alloy",
  "quest.0515B48700D32CDF.quest_subtitle": "Creeper nightmare.",
  "quest.0515B48700D32CDF.quest_desc": [
    "A tungsten, a titanium and a stainless steel ingot in the Packer make a mixed ingot; the compressor squeezes two into one plate at 32 EU/t. Tungsten is MI's own ore, deep below height 20."
  ],
  "quest.045A4467B5C095EB.title": "Implosion Compressor",
  "quest.045A4467B5C095EB.quest_subtitle": "Automated creeper.",
  "quest.045A4467B5C095EB.quest_desc": [
    "Four blastproof large plates, two advanced motors, two titanium large plates and a turbo hull. With one Industrial TNT per job it crushes what nothing else can: a mixed blastproof ingot into three blastproof ingots, a mixed iridium ingot into a plate."
  ],
  "quest.1FE570F659ECF04E.title": "Industrial TNT",
  "quest.1FE570F659ECF04E.quest_subtitle": "Not that kind of explosive.",
  "quest.1FE570F659ECF04E.quest_desc": [
    "Four sand, three flint, 250 mB of toluene and 1,000 mB of nitrogen make four in the Mixer. Place one and it just sits there: it never goes off, it only feeds the implosion compressor."
  ],
  "quest.2A369259B3A151A7.title": "Platinum",
  "quest.2A369259B3A151A7.quest_desc": [
    "Raw platinum dissolves in 9,000 mB of sulfuric acid; the centrifuge purifies the solution, with a 5% chance of an iridium tiny dust per bucket, and the electrolyzer gives three platinum tiny dusts per bucket. The hot ingot takes 128 EU/t."
  ],
  "quest.071C9E85BFE13EAD.title": "Monocrystalline Silicon",
  "quest.071C9E85BFE13EAD.quest_subtitle": "Grown, not crafted.",
  "quest.071C9E85BFE13EAD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Thirty-two silicon dust, an iridium tiny dust and 1,250 mB of argon grow a silicon crystal in the blast furnace at 64 EU/t, on kanthal coils. The cutting machine slices it into 32 \"},{\"text\":\"Silicon Wafers\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:silicon_wafer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with 500 mB of lubricant: RAM takes one, the memory management unit two.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Titanium drills dig iridium ore but need a processing unit, and that needs wafers. Bootstrap with platinum refining's tiny dust, one bucket in twenty, or with an \"},{\"text\":\"Ore Laser Base\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"industrialforegoing:ore_laser_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a white lens, best in the End.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1229B240D7D4D719.title": "PVC and synthetic rubber",
  "quest.1229B240D7D4D719.quest_desc": [
    "Acetylene and hydrochloric acid make vinyl chloride, styrene and butadiene make styrene-butadiene; lead or chromium polymerizes each like ethylene. PVC goes into boards and upgrades, the rubber into RAM, and 200 mB of it freeze into 64 rubber sheets."
  ],
  "quest.726026B86C55218F.title": "Processing Unit",
  "quest.726026B86C55218F.quest_subtitle": "Bitcoin miner.",
  "quest.726026B86C55218F.quest_desc": [
    "Four digital circuits, two RAM, a memory management unit and an arithmetic logic unit on a processing unit board. The board alone asks for annealed copper cables, cadmium batteries, platinum plates and 1,500 mB of PVC. Nuclear power and quantum parts begin here."
  ],
  "quest.177CFD9E5A8B9232.title": "Highly Advanced Upgrade",
  "quest.177CFD9E5A8B9232.quest_subtitle": "I'm speed.",
  "quest.177CFD9E5A8B9232.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight large advanced motors, four large advanced pumps, four \"},{\"text\":\"turbo upgrades\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"022564284418A1AF\"}},{\"text\":\" and a processing unit board, with 2,500 mB of PVC, make four. Each raises a machine's overclock cap by 512 EU/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5D02BD2E83CF3500.title": "Cooling cells",
  "quest.5D02BD2E83CF3500.quest_desc": [
    "Three fluid pipes, two small heat exchangers, six tin plates and 1,000 mB of cryofluid. Cryofluid is 140 mB of argon and 60 of helium in the Vacuum Freezer, a 256 EU/t recipe: give the freezer +128 of upgrades first."
  ],
  "quest.3AC8328C545DAD97.title": "Superconductor",
  "quest.3AC8328C545DAD97.quest_subtitle": "Unlimited power (transfer).",
  "quest.3AC8328C545DAD97.quest_desc": [
    "An iridium dust, three annealed copper, three yttrium and two neodymium dusts mix into nine superconductor dust; its hot ingot takes 128 EU/t. Three wires, two cooling cells and 1,000 mB of PVC make six cables, and eight cables ring into a coil."
  ],
  "quest.3611FAE403FF9A1C.title": "Gravichestplate",
  "quest.3611FAE403FF9A1C.quest_subtitle": "Creative flight, survival paperwork.",
  "quest.3611FAE403FF9A1C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four superconductor plates, a highly advanced upgrade, a superconductor coil and two cooling cells; in this pack a \"},{\"text\":\"Horizon Chart\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:horizon_chart\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from the Atlas too, act IV. It flies like creative, cancels fall damage and nothing else, and runs on EU: charge it on a storage unit or transformer.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It shares the jetpack's \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.modern_industrialization.toggle_flight\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" toggle.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.135380011E79C8C9.title": "Advanced Upgrade",
  "quest.135380011E79C8C9.quest_subtitle": "Machine speedup-speedup.",
  "quest.135380011E79C8C9.quest_desc": [
    "Four basic upgrades, two large motors, a large pump and an electronic board, with 1,000 mB of polyethylene, make four. Each adds 16 EU/t to a machine's overclock cap."
  ],
  "quest.022564284418A1AF.title": "Turbo Upgrade",
  "quest.022564284418A1AF.quest_subtitle": "Gotta go fast.",
  "quest.022564284418A1AF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"advanced motors\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1F654CF0CC18BCC0\"}},{\"text\":\", two advanced pumps, four advanced upgrades and a digital board, with 1,000 mB of PVC, make four. Each adds 64 EU/t.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.45E64BEF467243CD.title": "Overdrive Module",
  "quest.45E64BEF467243CD.quest_desc": [
    "Electrum fine wire, two diodes, two transistors and an electronic board. In a machine it keeps the efficiency from dropping when the work stops, by burning the same EU/t with nothing to do; the recipe stays locked until you remove it or power runs out."
  ],
  "quest.550454BF1A7F3057.title": "Deep drills",
  "quest.550454BF1A7F3057.quest_desc": [
    "In the Electric Quarry a stainless steel drill brings titanium, tungsten, monazite and platinum ores; a titanium drill, which needs a processing unit, brings uranium, fluorite and 5% iridium ore."
  ],
  "quest.0DFFBA122223C041.title": "High Pressure Boiler",
  "quest.0DFFBA122223C041.quest_desc": [
    "An advanced large steam boiler with four advanced pumps, two digital circuits and two clean stainless casings. Fed high pressure water it makes high pressure steam: each mB is worth 8 of regular steam, 8 EU."
  ],
  "quest.5DD7E6CCBA56976B.title": "HV Steam Turbine",
  "quest.5DD7E6CCBA56976B.quest_subtitle": "Better than a water wheel.",
  "quest.5DD7E6CCBA56976B.quest_desc": [
    "A digital circuit, two advanced motors, a turbo hull, two stainless rotors, pipes and an aluminum cable. Regular steam only, up to 512 EU/t."
  ],
  "quest.79A712ACEBDAAC90.title": "Large Steam Turbine",
  "quest.79A712ACEBDAAC90.quest_subtitle": "Enslaved hurricane.",
  "quest.79A712ACEBDAAC90.quest_desc": [
    "Four HV steam turbines, two advanced pumps, two stainless rotors and a turbo hull. It takes regular and high pressure steam, up to 16,384 EU/t, and gives no water back."
  ],
  "quest.332F7CBC4692CD4B.title": "Heat Exchanger",
  "quest.332F7CBC4692CD4B.quest_subtitle": "Lava power, but balanced.",
  "quest.332F7CBC4692CD4B.quest_desc": [
    "Small heat exchangers, a turbo hull, stainless pipe casings, frostproof and heatproof casings. It trades 2,000 mB of high pressure steam and 1,000 of water for 125 of high pressure water and 16,000 of regular steam: the expensive water goes around again."
  ],
  "quest.31BBAFEFC706F63A.title": "HV Diesel Generator",
  "quest.31BBAFEFC706F63A.quest_subtitle": "Fast and Furious 2.",
  "quest.31BBAFEFC706F63A.quest_desc": [
    "A turbo hull, two advanced pumps, stainless gears, aluminum cables and a digital circuit. Any fluid fuel, up to 1,024 EU/t, still only when something asks."
  ],
  "quest.429062C1AA630702.title": "Large Diesel Generator",
  "quest.429062C1AA630702.quest_subtitle": "Fast and Furious 42.",
  "quest.429062C1AA630702.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An HV diesel generator at the core, with large advanced pumps and motors, titanium gears, a \"},{\"text\":\"processing unit\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"726026B86C55218F\"}},{\"text\":\" and a highly advanced hull. Up to 16,384 EU/t from fuel.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.617F994D3B1A960E.title": "MV and HV storage",
  "quest.617F994D3B1A960E.quest_desc": [
    "Six silicon batteries on an advanced hull, or six sodium batteries on a turbo hull. They hold 12.8 and 102.4 million EU, and buffer a generator that sleeps between demands."
  ],
  "quest.2AE30BD79021E9BE.title": "Distillation Tower",
  "quest.2AE30BD79021E9BE.quest_subtitle": "Total distillation.",
  "quest.2AE30BD79021E9BE.quest_desc": [
    "Two distilleries, four advanced pumps, two digital circuits and a turbo hull. Where a distillery gives one product per recipe, the tower gives one per layer: crude oil splits into all three fuels at once."
  ],
  "quest.60E87308277CC3F9.title": "Steam cracking",
  "quest.60E87308277CC3F9.quest_desc": [
    "Fuel plus 100 mB of steam in the chemical reactor cracks it; distilled, cracked naphtha gives methane, acetylene, ethylene, propene, butadiene, benzene, toluene and ethylbenzene. Toluene makes Industrial TNT, acetylene PVC, ethylene polyethylene, butadiene and ethylbenzene rubber."
  ],
  "quest.26D8BD3C0E3ADBB2.title": "Boosted Diesel",
  "quest.26D8BD3C0E3ADBB2.quest_desc": [
    "Ethanol and a splash of acrylic acid make diethyl ether; 250 mB of it and 1,000 of diesel mix into 1,200 of boosted diesel, 800 EU per mB instead of 400."
  ],
  "quest.7BC0785B2E2B7BB8.title": "Biodiesel",
  "quest.7BC0785B2E2B7BB8.quest_desc": [
    "The centrifuge squeezes plant oil out of compostable items. With ethanol and sodium hydroxide it becomes raw biodiesel, and with steam biodiesel: 250 EU per mB, from a farm instead of a well."
  ],
  "quest.323FB06AF7B81911.title": "Upgrade arithmetic",
  "quest.323FB06AF7B81911.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Single-block machines overclock to 32 EU/t, multiblocks to 128. Upgrades add to that cap: basic +2, advanced +16, turbo +64, highly advanced +512, and a stack in the slot counts whole.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.212031F00512B970.title": "Which coils?",
  "quest.212031F00512B970.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The coils decide the blast furnace's ceiling: cupronickel up to 32 EU/t, kanthal up to 128. Titanium, platinum, superconductor and every nuclear metal need kanthal.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.41F26F7BFFBD23DF.title": "Thousands of mB per tick",
  "quest.41F26F7BFFBD23DF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every fluid pipe holds one bucket and connected pipes share it: 25 pipes move up to 25,000 mB per tick. A steel tank joined with an I/O connection adds its 16 buckets to the network.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.44165F5F7DDFE958.title": "Cool it with cryofluid",
  "quest.44165F5F7DDFE958.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Heat Exchanger also cools hot ingots, 20 mB of cryofluid each, and hands back 13 mB of argon and 5 of helium: the cryofluid almost pays for itself.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4C69A597982064B8.title": "Chemistry that copies",
  "quest.4C69A597982064B8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"In the chemical reactor a slime ball that stays put plus 25 mB of acrylic glue gives a new slime ball, and a string plus 20 mB of nylon a new string.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5ED22E99B4A9FB12.title": "Diamond 2.0",
  "quest.5ED22E99B4A9FB12.quest_subtitle": "Electric boogaloo.",
  "quest.5ED22E99B4A9FB12.quest_desc": [
    "You held a piece of raw iridium, worth more than any diamond here: a titanium drill brings up the ore once every twenty digs, and a pickaxe on the placed ore gives the raw piece."
  ],
  "reward.631942742AC8DCE3.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.1A629C77425FE43C.title": "Moonshine",
  "quest.1A629C77425FE43C.quest_subtitle": "The still always wins.",
  "quest.1A629C77425FE43C.quest_desc": [
    "A full bucket of ethanol. Eight sugar and a bucket of water make a bucket of sugar solution, and the distillery gets 10 mB of ethanol out of it: someone was patient, or knew ethylene is quicker."
  ],
  "reward.5828D272E786FD61.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.6C6AB1D2C841C966.title": "Stainless for the common store",
  "quest.6C6AB1D2C841C966.quest_subtitle": "Shiny, and it stays shiny.",
  "quest.6C6AB1D2C841C966.quest_desc": [
    "Thirty-two stainless steel ingots: turbo casings, advanced motors and the digital circuit board all start with them."
  ],
  "image.2EB9C285F5694286.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Upgrades\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.46CF37C7F812415C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Power plant\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.6567B8D71A753667.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Refinery\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.1F4D6373BE28CCE2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Modern Industrialization\\nDigital\",\"color\":\"#FFF1DE\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.1CA40CDAB1F3B4FA.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.24E9B0AFE862BC68.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Steam\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.5FFCEAB0C46AF964.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Electricity\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.12C01551721DC2AE.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Endgame\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.5F41CB39D92AB85E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"etch  solder  compute\",\"color\":\"#BFA58A\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.447A14F3F4D03138.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"U1\",\"color\":\"#E6EFE6\"}]",
  "image.1260B3B205E9316F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"MI-PU  2.5.6\",\"color\":\"#9AA3AD\"}]",
  "image.4E3C52E5D4243CD7.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ENTRELUMEN  REV B\",\"color\":\"#E6EFE6\"}]",
  "chapter.6ABB1358FF6D448A.title": "Draconic Evolution · Draconic and Chaotic",
  "chapter.6ABB1358FF6D448A.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Awakened draconium and the draconic tier, the Chaos Guardian and the chaotic tier, and the Draconic Reactor between them."
  ],
  "quest.698802A16527E485.title": "Awakened Draconium",
  "quest.698802A16527E485.quest_subtitle": "Wide awake, and slightly orange.",
  "quest.698802A16527E485.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"One awakened block splits into nine \"},{\"text\":\"Awakened Draconium Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:awakened_draconium_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and nine nuggets make an ingot. They go into everything draconic: controllers, cores, rotors and the reactor's own fuel.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.73AFDC7DD2D99015.title": "Draconic Core",
  "quest.73AFDC7DD2D99015.quest_subtitle": "Four wyverns walk into a fusion core.",
  "quest.73AFDC7DD2D99015.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A nether star as catalyst, then four Wyvern Cores, three awakened ingots and, in this pack, an \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", on wyvern injectors: 1,000,000 OP. The draconic capacitor and staff build on it, and four of them make a Chaotic Core.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5701AC99EB5D7F3C.title": "Draconic Energy Controller",
  "quest.5701AC99EB5D7F3C.quest_desc": [
    "Four awakened ingots, four wyvern energy controllers and a Wyvern Core. Each draconic tool, bow and chestpiece takes one, and the capacitor three."
  ],
  "quest.768E865FF9DD8FE2.title": "Draconic injectors",
  "quest.768E865FF9DD8FE2.quest_desc": [
    "A wyvern injector as catalyst, two Wyvern Cores, four diamonds and an awakened draconium block, for 256,000 OP. Draconic recipes need one per ingredient: eight for a draconic tool."
  ],
  "quest.4338BEEF620CA369.title": "Draconic tools",
  "quest.4338BEEF620CA369.quest_subtitle": "Netherite goes in. Orange comes out.",
  "quest.4338BEEF620CA369.quest_desc": [
    "Fuse each wyvern tool with four netherite ingots, two awakened ingots, a Wyvern Core and a draconic energy controller: 32 million OP apiece. They dig at speed 25 in a 6×5 grid, and modules, enchantments and charge carry over."
  ],
  "quest.1AF5529C2E6667ED.title": "Draconic Chestpiece",
  "quest.1AF5529C2E6667ED.quest_subtitle": "Now with actual flying.",
  "quest.1AF5529C2E6667ED.quest_desc": [
    "The same fusion, from the wyvern chestpiece. Its 8×6 grid takes draconic modules, and the draconic flight module finally adds creative flight on top of the elytra."
  ],
  "quest.21C7B2E3854277D3.title": "Count your nether stars",
  "quest.21C7B2E3854277D3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every Wyvern Core eats a nether star, so a Draconic Core costs five with its catalyst, and a Chaotic Core twenty. Keep a Wither farm running.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1BDD73107F477142.title": "Awakened Item Dislocator",
  "quest.1BDD73107F477142.quest_desc": [
    "Two awakened ingots, draconium and redstone around the item dislocator stretch its pull from 8 to 32 blocks. It keeps the same toggle key and fits a curio slot."
  ],
  "quest.1DB7070BA01CBCFD.title": "Draconic modules",
  "quest.1DB7070BA01CBCFD.quest_desc": [
    "The same six, one tier up: 16 million OP, +50% speed, +8 damage, a 7×7 area, +125% jump and 400 hunger points. Awakened nuggets turn wyvern modules into these; damage also wants dragon's breath and the area module a Draconic Core."
  ],
  "quest.2168C7C5481E24A4.title": "Awakened draconium for the store",
  "quest.2168C7C5481E24A4.quest_subtitle": "The dragon pays in installments.",
  "quest.2168C7C5481E24A4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Nine \"},{\"text\":\"Awakened Draconium Ingots\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:awakened_draconium_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day. One Dragon Heart awakens four blocks, thirty-six ingots.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.054E5E3645D53554.title": "Defeat the Ender Dragon ten times",
  "quest.4CD241050470D0F0.title": "Serial dragon slayer",
  "quest.4CD241050470D0F0.quest_subtitle": "The End's longest-running show.",
  "quest.4CD241050470D0F0.quest_desc": [
    "Ten dragons, ten hearts, ten eggs. The exit portal must be tired of the fireworks by now."
  ],
  "reward.54BC4C2F41E69EBA.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.73A64B923A0020EA.title": "Draconic Capacitor",
  "quest.73A64B923A0020EA.quest_desc": [
    "The wyvern capacitor as catalyst, a Draconic Core, three draconic energy controllers and four awakened ingots: 32 million OP. Its grid grows to 5×5, room for draconic energy modules of 16 million OP each."
  ],
  "quest.2F7A27B782F6FA7A.title": "Draconic crystals",
  "quest.2F7A27B782F6FA7A.quest_desc": [
    "Four wyvern relays fuse into four draconic ones with wyvern energy controllers, diamonds and a Wyvern Core. Draconic crystals reach 127 blocks and buffer 64 million OP; relays take 32 links, wireless ones feed 64 machines at 512,000 OP/t."
  ],
  "quest.7E833D59C93BCBB0.title": "Draconic weapons",
  "quest.7E833D59C93BCBB0.quest_desc": [
    "The sword and bow fuse from the wyvern ones like the tools, 32 million OP each. Draconic damage modules add 8 each, and the sword's Attack Radius still sweeps a 100-degree arc."
  ],
  "quest.1941728FF791EE5F.title": "Draconic projectile modules",
  "quest.1941728FF791EE5F.quest_desc": [
    "Awakened nuggets and a Wyvern Core fold two wyvern projectile modules into each draconic one: velocity, accuracy, damage, penetration and gravity compensation."
  ],
  "quest.2D8FE4BDB7ADAE81.title": "Projectile Immunity Cancellation",
  "quest.2D8FE4BDB7ADAE81.quest_subtitle": "Endermen hate this one trick.",
  "quest.2D8FE4BDB7ADAE81.quest_desc": [
    "A wither skeleton skull, an ender pearl and two Wyvern Cores in a module. Its arrows ignore the arrow immunity of endermen, withers, the Ender Dragon, Guardian Withers and shulkers."
  ],
  "quest.03875AA4C6C690F5.title": "Draconic Staff of Power",
  "quest.03875AA4C6C690F5.quest_subtitle": "Three tools, one pocket.",
  "quest.03875AA4C6C690F5.quest_desc": [
    "A Draconic Core as catalyst, the draconic pickaxe, sword and shovel, six awakened ingots and a draconic energy controller: 256 million OP. One tool that digs like all three and hits like an axe, with an 8×6 grid."
  ],
  "quest.75E4A59AE1C488FD.title": "Filterable Ender Collection",
  "quest.75E4A59AE1C488FD.quest_desc": [
    "Two comparators, a chest and awakened nuggets turn the wyvern module into a filtered one: choose by item or by tag, like c:ores, which drops go to the ender chest."
  ],
  "quest.42652613F714362E.title": "Forest Reduction Assistant",
  "quest.42652613F714362E.quest_subtitle": "It assists. The forest reduces.",
  "quest.42652613F714362E.quest_desc": [
    "The draconic tree harvester: 48 blocks of reach at 15 blocks per second, from the wyvern module with netherite, awakened ingots and a Wyvern Core."
  ],
  "quest.1B95ECB5DCFE8862.title": "It mines anything",
  "quest.1B95ECB5DCFE8862.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Draconic and chaotic tools skip the tool-tier tags: they mine any block that can be mined, while wyvern tools stop at the netherite tier.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.480EA392BB172842.title": "Creative flight",
  "quest.480EA392BB172842.quest_subtitle": "Finally, no rockets.",
  "quest.480EA392BB172842.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two Wyvern Cores, awakened ingots, a slow falling potion and a firework rocket around the wyvern module. It adds creative flight to the elytra, drawing 4,096 OP per tick while you fly; \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.draconicevolution.toggle_flight\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" switches it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.32EE81388B4A3DFA.title": "Draconic shields",
  "quest.32EE81388B4A3DFA.quest_desc": [
    "Capacity modules hold 50 points each and the large one 250; recovery modules recharge faster. The draconic controller, built from two Draconic Cores, emeralds and netherite, cuts the cooldown to 10 seconds."
  ],
  "quest.1DCC6E5F82119C12.title": "Draconic Undying",
  "quest.1DCC6E5F82119C12.quest_desc": [
    "When a hit would kill you it heals 12 health and adds 50 shield points for 30 seconds, then recharges in 60 seconds with 10 million OP. A strong healing potion and a draconic shield module go into it."
  ],
  "quest.4C9A4F18EFE9C986.title": "Spawners, one tier up",
  "quest.4C9A4F18EFE9C986.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Click a stabilized spawner with a Draconic Core and it spawns 8 mobs at a time, ignoring light; with a Chaotic Core, 12 every 25 to 100 ticks.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.133B1AC7E9466F8F.title": "Look at a Chaos Crystal",
  "quest.2664683DD65474A2.title": "Chaos Islands",
  "quest.2664683DD65474A2.quest_subtitle": "Ten thousand blocks of nothing, then this.",
  "quest.2664683DD65474A2.quest_desc": [
    "Chaos Islands sit on a grid 10,000 blocks apart in the End, each around a Chaos Crystal at Y 80. Walking up to one wakes it: pillars rise with Guardian Crystals, then the Chaos Guardian arrives."
  ],
  "task.6966FAC3B88CD936.title": "Look at a Guardian Crystal",
  "quest.4E665D9DCF8F50B1.title": "Guardian Crystals",
  "quest.4E665D9DCF8F50B1.quest_subtitle": "Friendly fire, weaponized.",
  "quest.4E665D9DCF8F50B1.quest_desc": [
    "Each crystal carries a 512-point shield. The Guardian's own attacks leave it unstable for 10 seconds: stand near a crystal, let the Guardian's fire hit it, then break it before it settles."
  ],
  "task.46E92EDB2C8304DA.title": "Defeat the Chaos Guardian",
  "quest.31E115F8C09BE03F.title": "The Chaos Guardian",
  "quest.31E115F8C09BE03F.quest_subtitle": "It has a frickin laser beam.",
  "quest.31E115F8C09BE03F.quest_desc": [
    "With the crystals down its 16,000-point shield comes next, and only then its 1,000 health. It charges, bombards, fires lasers and sends shockwaves; when it lands it calls Guardian Withers. It drops 57 to 70 draconium dust."
  ],
  "quest.5791246A44136D6D.title": "Chaos Shards",
  "quest.5791246A44136D6D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Break the Chaos Crystal after the fight for five \"},{\"text\":\"Chaos Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"draconicevolution:chaos_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Until a reactor runs, they are the only chaos you get, so spend them on Chaotic Cores first.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.5D21515ABE27BB41.title": "Defeat a Guardian Wither",
  "quest.07067B00110036C1.title": "Wither on the side",
  "quest.07067B00110036C1.quest_subtitle": "Bring a friend, it said.",
  "quest.07067B00110036C1.quest_desc": [
    "You beat one of the withers the Guardian calls when it lands. It had backup. It always has backup."
  ],
  "reward.18F00A7F870D0FF0.title": "Secret found",
  "task.4B78BF19DDB11798.title": "Defeat two Chaos Guardians",
  "quest.6D8EC12CA997A6CA.title": "Island hopper",
  "quest.6D8EC12CA997A6CA.quest_subtitle": "Frequent flyer miles: earned.",
  "quest.6D8EC12CA997A6CA.quest_desc": [
    "A second Chaos Guardian means a second island, at least 10,000 blocks from the first. Nobody said the End was small."
  ],
  "reward.11E793673C78C660.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.21723AE1748B2106.title": "Pack a way home",
  "quest.21723AE1748B2106.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Store your base in an Advanced Dislocator before you sail for an island: islands sit 10,000 blocks apart, and the End has few landmarks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5599B9637FC46B07.title": "Farming guardians",
  "quest.5599B9637FC46B07.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A chaotic weapon destabilizes Guardian Crystal shields by itself, no Guardian needed, which makes every later island fight much quicker.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.34BFF089141ABF9E.title": "Bows melt shields",
  "quest.34BFF089141ABF9E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Guardian's shield has no limit on how fast it takes hits: a strong bow firing quickly strips its 16,000 points far sooner than a sword.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0E32A88DBE8E87AA.title": "Chaos fragments",
  "quest.0E32A88DBE8E87AA.quest_desc": [
    "A shard crafts into nine Large Chaos Fragments, each of those into nine Small ones, and each Small into nine Tiny ones; nine of a size craft back up. Recipes ask for large and small fragments, so split only what you need."
  ],
  "quest.3124B2C57CD54099.title": "Count your fragments",
  "quest.3124B2C57CD54099.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One shard is nine large fragments. A Chaotic Core takes five of them, a chaotic injector four, the reactor core two and each reactor stabilizer one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3D5FC627AD89EF21.title": "Chaotic Core",
  "quest.3D5FC627AD89EF21.quest_subtitle": "Twenty nether stars, one very angry marble.",
  "quest.3D5FC627AD89EF21.quest_desc": [
    "A large chaos fragment as catalyst; four Draconic Cores, four awakened ingots and four more large fragments around it, on draconic injectors: 100 million OP. Every chaotic tool, each reactor stabilizer and the chaotic capacitor take one."
  ],
  "quest.0706045D6A4F3D73.title": "Chaotic injectors",
  "quest.0706045D6A4F3D73.quest_subtitle": "One dragon egg each. Yes, each.",
  "quest.0706045D6A4F3D73.quest_desc": [
    "A draconic injector as catalyst, four diamonds, four large chaos fragments and a dragon egg, for 8,000,000 OP. Chaotic recipes need one per ingredient, eight for a tool, so start collecting eggs."
  ],
  "quest.645AFAAF981ECED2.title": "Chaotic Energy Controller",
  "quest.645AFAAF981ECED2.quest_desc": [
    "Four small chaos fragments, four draconic energy controllers and a Draconic Core. Each chaotic tool takes one, the capacitor three and the Staff of Power up to three."
  ],
  "quest.2747470770A8C4BD.title": "Chaotic tools",
  "quest.2747470770A8C4BD.quest_subtitle": "Speed 50. Blinking not recommended.",
  "quest.2747470770A8C4BD.quest_desc": [
    "Fuse each draconic tool with a Chaotic Core, six awakened ingots and a chaotic energy controller, on chaotic injectors: 128 million OP apiece. They dig at speed 50 and carry an 8×6 grid."
  ],
  "quest.118F626BC2BDFBC0.title": "Chaotic Chestpiece",
  "quest.118F626BC2BDFBC0.quest_desc": [
    "The same fusion from the draconic chestpiece. Its 10×8 grid is the largest armor grid in the mod: room for chaotic shields, undying and the fastest flight."
  ],
  "quest.39C47D3CF0A89A62.title": "Chaotic weapons",
  "quest.39C47D3CF0A89A62.quest_desc": [
    "The chaotic sword and bow, fused from the draconic ones for 128 million OP each. Chaotic damage modules add 16 each, and with one of these the crystal shields on a Chaos Island stop waiting for the Guardian."
  ],
  "quest.03614DC52E5FA259.title": "Chaotic projectile modules",
  "quest.03614DC52E5FA259.quest_desc": [
    "Six small chaos fragments and a Draconic Core fold two draconic projectile modules into each chaotic one: velocity, accuracy, damage, penetration and gravity compensation, each at its best."
  ],
  "quest.16263537DE3E3C87.title": "Chaotic Deforestation Module",
  "quest.16263537DE3E3C87.quest_subtitle": "Pack a sapling or two.",
  "quest.16263537DE3E3C87.quest_desc": [
    "144 blocks of reach at 45 blocks per second: the forest reduction module with large chaos fragments, netherite and a Draconic Core."
  ],
  "quest.5C98E32C32C173B3.title": "Chaotic modules",
  "quest.5C98E32C32C173B3.quest_desc": [
    "64 million OP, +150% speed, +16 damage, an 11×11 area and +400% jump. Small chaos fragments and a Draconic Core fold two draconic modules into each; the area module takes a Chaotic Core instead."
  ],
  "quest.2A4AD39AB148560F.title": "Chaotic flight",
  "quest.2A4AD39AB148560F.quest_desc": [
    "Strong swiftness potions, large chaos fragments and two Draconic Cores around the draconic flight module. The same creative and elytra flight, with the strongest elytra boost in the mod."
  ],
  "quest.4644EC069DBFDB12.title": "Chaotic shields",
  "quest.4644EC069DBFDB12.quest_desc": [
    "100 points per capacity module, 500 for the large one, and a controller with a 5-second cooldown that takes two Chaotic Cores and four nether stars. The chaotic capacity module also goes into the chaotic undying module."
  ],
  "quest.449E2D2B5E71AD83.title": "Chaotic Undying",
  "quest.449E2D2B5E71AD83.quest_desc": [
    "Heals 20, adds 100 shield points for 2 minutes and recharges in 45 seconds with 20 million OP. An enchanted golden apple and chaos fragments go into it."
  ],
  "quest.32D5BD08230CCACC.title": "Chaotic Capacitor",
  "quest.32D5BD08230CCACC.quest_desc": [
    "The draconic capacitor as catalyst, a Chaotic Core, three chaotic energy controllers and four awakened ingots: 128 million OP. Its 8×6 grid holds chaotic energy modules of 64 million OP each."
  ],
  "quest.10A0BE617423F4C2.title": "Creative Capacitor",
  "quest.10A0BE617423F4C2.quest_subtitle": "Infinite, if you ask the light nicely.",
  "quest.10A0BE617423F4C2.quest_desc": [
    "In this pack it has a recipe: a chaotic capacitor, two Dragon Hearts, two awakened ingots and four Luminosities, two of Exploration and two of the Arcane, from act VI. It holds more OP than you will ever spend."
  ],
  "quest.69AB3AE30A4CEF6B.title": "Rotor assembly",
  "quest.69AB3AE30A4CEF6B.quest_desc": [
    "Inner rotors take three awakened ingots, outer rotors three diamonds, each with a draconium core and two draconium ingots. Two of each, two more draconium ingots and a Wyvern Core make a rotor assembly."
  ],
  "quest.64BBF9F67B55698D.title": "Focus ring and frame",
  "quest.64BBF9F67B55698D.quest_desc": [
    "The focus ring is four gold ingots, three diamonds and two Wyvern Cores; the frame, six iron ingots around a Wyvern Core and an awakened ingot. Each reactor stabilizer takes one of each."
  ],
  "quest.3EBE9506A494CA69.title": "Reactor Stabilizers",
  "quest.3EBE9506A494CA69.quest_desc": [
    "Fuse the frame with a rotor assembly, a focus ring, a draconic energy controller, a Chaotic Core, three awakened ingots and a large chaos fragment: 16 million OP each, on chaotic injectors. The reactor needs four."
  ],
  "quest.134DE10F4A3F8B2D.title": "Reactor Energy Injector",
  "quest.134DE10F4A3F8B2D.quest_desc": [
    "A Wyvern Core as catalyst with four inner rotors, four draconium ingots and two iron ingots, 16 million OP. It feeds the containment field; the stabilizers take the power out."
  ],
  "quest.38D5FD5FBCE2625C.title": "Draconic Reactor",
  "quest.38D5FD5FBCE2625C.quest_subtitle": "Handle with oven mitts.",
  "quest.38D5FD5FBCE2625C.quest_desc": [
    "A Chaos Shard as catalyst, four awakened and three draconium ingots and two large chaos fragments: 64 million OP. Build it with four stabilizers in a cross, 4 to 7 blocks from the core and facing it, and the injector on one of the two free sides."
  ],
  "quest.501EAFA581A696FF.title": "Fuel",
  "quest.501EAFA581A696FF.quest_desc": [
    "The core holds up to eight awakened draconium blocks of fuel, and ingots and nuggets count too. As it burns, spent fuel turns to chaos and comes back out of the same screen as chaos fragments."
  ],
  "quest.223852AB4F08EC17.title": "Two flux gates",
  "quest.223852AB4F08EC17.quest_desc": [
    "Run the stabilizers' output through one flux gate and feed the injector through another. Set by redstone, they hold the field input steady while the surplus goes to your Energy Core."
  ],
  "quest.4C459D50DA1779A4.title": "Charge, then activate",
  "quest.4C459D50DA1779A4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fuel it, press Charge and feed the injector. Activate unlocks once the core reaches 2,000°C with its field and saturation at least half full.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4C284AC4C8715B0D.title": "Watch the field",
  "quest.4C284AC4C8715B0D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Field Input Rate is the exact OP/t that holds the containment field where it is, and it grows exponentially as the field gets stronger. An empty field means an overload nothing can stop.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.522EA902EA4030CB.title": "Let SAS shut it down",
  "quest.522EA902EA4030CB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With SAS on, the reactor shuts itself down once the temperature drops below 2,500°C at 99% saturation: the right moment to refuel, or a safety net when something breaks.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2AE7DBDA8E6972DA.title": "Reactors speak redstone",
  "quest.2AE7DBDA8E6972DA.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every stabilizer and injector can drive a comparator: set it on the part's screen to temperature, field, saturation or fuel conversion, or their inverses.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7D2BA62A345567C4.title": "Mind the blast radius",
  "quest.7D2BA62A345567C4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The full-size reactor explosion is on in this pack.\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" Build the reactor far from anything you love and keep an eye on it while it runs.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6CBCCB13367E49CC.title": "Tier 8 core",
  "quest.6CBCCB13367E49CC.quest_subtitle": "The number stops being a number.",
  "quest.6CBCCB13367E49CC.quest_desc": [
    "The last shell trades redstone for awakened draconium: 786 draconium blocks and 378 awakened ones. Tier 8 has no practical ceiling; you will run out of power plants before it fills."
  ],
  "quest.4DA714D09E8C37B2.title": "Hearts for tier 8",
  "quest.4DA714D09E8C37B2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"378 awakened blocks at four per heart is 95 Dragon Hearts. The egg returns with every kill, so respawn the dragon on a schedule.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2BFD14ABA9927DE9.title": "Quantum Energy Tunnel",
  "quest.2BFD14ABA9927DE9.quest_desc": [
    "The draconic energy link: an end crystal, two wyvern wireless crystals, awakened ingots and a Draconic Core around the wyvern link. It crosses dimensions and moves 16,000 OP/t; switching it on costs 16 million OP."
  ],
  "quest.457B61FDD30C5F01.title": "Chaos-Entangled Quantum Energy Tunnel",
  "quest.457B61FDD30C5F01.quest_desc": [
    "The top link: 128,000 OP/t across dimensions, 64 million OP to switch on and up to 8,192 OP/t to keep open. Two draconic wireless crystals, netherite, an end crystal and a Chaotic Core wrap the draconic tunnel."
  ],
  "quest.4A10A9877F78B94B.title": "Chaotic Staff of Power",
  "quest.4A10A9877F78B94B.quest_subtitle": "A billion OP, give or take nothing.",
  "quest.4A10A9877F78B94B.quest_desc": [
    "A Chaotic Core as catalyst; the chaotic pickaxe, sword and shovel, six small chaos fragments and a chaotic energy controller around it: 1,024,000,000 OP in one fusion. It digs, mines and fights as one tool with a 10×8 grid.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A draconic staff can be the catalyst instead, fused with three chaotic energy controllers, two Draconic Cores, a Chaotic Core and chaos fragments."
  ],
  "image.6FA47F591CEC56AD.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Draconic weapons and tools\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.44AD153F32B70064.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Draconic armor\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.27954CB7078F697B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Chaotic weapons and tools\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.3B455EA1E2F5A5B0.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Chaotic armor\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.0FD1974CB3AEC67D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Energy beyond wyvern\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.7ECB3AA53A311FC0.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Draconic Evolution\\nDraconic and Chaotic\",\"color\":\"#FFF1DC\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.3BD90A08BF1AD03F.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.7DF66F68BF76B55C.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Draconium and Wyvern\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "image.7022CBB198B95F20.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"wake  break  burn  contain\",\"color\":\"#B9A7E0\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.799B0D5DA81558D4.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"chaos island\",\"color\":\"#E0473A\"}]",
  "image.31C9FF24EFC1B600.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"reactor\",\"color\":\"#FF9D3B\"}]",
  "chapter.03D298843B4E907C.title": "Modern Industrialization · Endgame",
  "chapter.03D298843B4E907C.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Fission that cannot melt down, fusion that breeds its own fuel, and a pocket black hole for the quantum tier."
  ],
  "quest.50B0F1DC62355C80.title": "Nuclear Alloy",
  "quest.50B0F1DC62355C80.quest_subtitle": "Three metals, one controlled explosion.",
  "quest.50B0F1DC62355C80.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A blastproof alloy plate, a beryllium plate and a cadmium plate pack into one mixed plate; the implosion compressor turns it into three \"},{\"text\":\"Nuclear Alloy Plates\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:nuclear_alloy_plate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Beryllium ingots also come out of that compressor, from electrolyzed emerald dust.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.40D3A83B326757F2.title": "Casings and hatches",
  "quest.40D3A83B326757F2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight nuclear alloy plates around a turbo hull make a \"},{\"text\":\"Nuclear Alloy Casing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:nuclear_casing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; around a highly advanced input hatch, a \"},{\"text\":\"Nuclear Item Hatch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:nuclear_item_hatch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or \"},{\"text\":\"Nuclear Fluid Hatch\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:nuclear_fluid_hatch\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Each hatch has one input and two outputs, and their inputs form the grid in the reactor's screen.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4A6B01F3A0DA0A56.title": "Uranium fuel rods",
  "quest.4A6B01F3A0DA0A56.quest_desc": [
    "Eighteen uranium rods, two blastproof curved plates, a large motor and two robot arms, with 500 mB of soldering alloy and 100 of helium, make one rod in the assembler. Two rods and a nuclear alloy plate pack into a double, two doubles and two plates into a quad."
  ],
  "quest.3D2155E3D6873087.title": "Cadmium control rods",
  "quest.3D2155E3D6873087.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The same frame around eighteen cadmium rods makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Cadmium Control Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"modern_industrialization:cadmium_control_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": it soaks up neutrons instead of making them. The reactor's controller takes two.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3D484AC9377B043F.title": "Nuclear Reactor",
  "quest.3D484AC9377B043F.quest_subtitle": "3.6 roentgen. Not great, not terrible.",
  "quest.3D484AC9377B043F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four nuclear alloy large plates, two control rods, a highly advanced hull and a processing unit; in this pack an \"},{\"text\":\"Ark Connection Bus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:ark_bus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" too, act V. It comes in several sizes: nuclear casings for walls, hatches on top, and water in a fluid hatch boils into steam.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.51944A0A4F67E1A8.title": "Deuterium and tritium",
  "quest.51944A0A4F67E1A8.quest_desc": [
    "Neutrons turn a little of the water in a fluid hatch into deuterium, and heavy water into tritium. The electrolyzer also splits heavy water into deuterium, and the centrifuge gets 20 mB of deuterium and 1 of tritium from a bucket of hydrogen."
  ],
  "quest.358BDFF782F85724.title": "Plutonium",
  "quest.358BDFF782F85724.quest_desc": [
    "Spent fuel isn't waste: in five minutes the centrifuge splits a depleted uranium rod into 53 uranium-238 and 27 plutonium tiny dusts, often with a uranium-235 one. Plutonium melts into ingots at 128 EU/t, for MOX fuel, nukes and batteries."
  ],
  "quest.778354EA50D91E74.title": "MOX fuel",
  "quest.778354EA50D91E74.quest_desc": [
    "Eight uranium-238 dusts and a plutonium dust mix into LE MOX, six and three into HE MOX: new fuel rods from your spent ones. A depleted LE MOX rod still centrifuges into 30 plutonium tiny dusts."
  ],
  "quest.40DE7DB4FA96B619.title": "Enriched uranium",
  "quest.40DE7DB4FA96B619.quest_desc": [
    "Nine uranium dusts in the centrifuge give a uranium-235 tiny dust and eighty uranium-238 ones. Eight U-238 and one U-235 dust make LE uranium, six and three HE uranium: richer fuel for the same rod frame."
  ],
  "quest.6D147773F1EC0EE0.title": "Qubits",
  "quest.6D147773F1EC0EE0.quest_desc": [
    "Two arithmetic logic units, two carbon plates, two glass panes and six superconductor wires, with 250 mB of cryofluid and 50 of tritium, in the assembler."
  ],
  "quest.6F61A86BE1F99619.title": "Quantum Circuit Board",
  "quest.6F61A86BE1F99619.quest_desc": [
    "Twelve superconductor cables, two plutonium batteries, a processing unit board, six iridium plates and 50 mB of helium-3, at 64 EU/t: the assembler needs +32 of upgrades. The centrifuge gets 5 mB of helium-3 from each bucket of helium."
  ],
  "quest.587D363313351442.title": "Quantum Circuit",
  "quest.587D363313351442.quest_subtitle": "Möbius strip eigenvalues.",
  "quest.587D363313351442.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four processing units, two qubits, a cooling cell and a quantum board; in this pack a Mekanism \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" too, act V, and the assembler version is gone. Fusion, the plasma turbine and every quantum item start here.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6BD19C3987AF82FC.title": "Quantum Machine Hull",
  "quest.6BD19C3987AF82FC.quest_desc": [
    "A quantum circuit, two plutonium batteries and three superconductor cables on a quantum casing: eight iridium plates around a highly advanced hull."
  ],
  "quest.0B96AFD2B5BF217D.title": "Fusion chambers",
  "quest.0B96AFD2B5BF217D.quest_desc": [
    "Four superconductor coils, two large heat exchangers and two nuclear alloy large plates around a plasma-handling iridium casing. The fusion reactor's controller takes six."
  ],
  "quest.624F68BE1B3A1661.title": "Fusion Reactor",
  "quest.624F68BE1B3A1661.quest_subtitle": "A star core, on a leash.",
  "quest.624F68BE1B3A1661.quest_desc": [
    "Six fusion chambers, two quantum circuits and a quantum hull. It fuses deuterium, tritium or helium-3 into helium plasma, 16,000 EU/t per reaction: deuterium and tritium give a bucket of plasma in 45 seconds, helium-3 and tritium in 15."
  ],
  "quest.43475F84B3C8A758.title": "Plasma Turbine",
  "quest.43475F84B3C8A758.quest_subtitle": "Better than fission.",
  "quest.43475F84B3C8A758.quest_desc": [
    "Four superconductor coils, two quantum circuits, two titanium rotors and a quantum hull, walled in plasma-handling iridium casings. Helium plasma is worth 100,000 EU per mB, and the turbine turns out about a million EU per tick."
  ],
  "quest.6F553EC59E91D4F4.title": "Superconductor grid",
  "quest.6F553EC59E91D4F4.quest_subtitle": "Unlimited power, transferred.",
  "quest.6F553EC59E91D4F4.quest_desc": [
    "Six plutonium batteries on a quantum hull store 12.8 trillion EU. An EV to SV transformer joins annealed copper cables to superconductor ones, which carry up to 1,024,000,000 EU/t."
  ],
  "quest.07DDBCC0B2B60995.title": "Ultradense Metal Ball",
  "quest.07DDBCC0B2B60995.quest_subtitle": "Heavier than it looks. It looks heavy.",
  "quest.07DDBCC0B2B60995.quest_desc": [
    "Four tungsten large plates, four lead plates and an iridium plate: the only thing hard enough to hold a black hole together."
  ],
  "quest.65D901EA3E3872A0.title": "Singularity",
  "quest.65D901EA3E3872A0.quest_subtitle": "A pocket black hole.",
  "quest.65D901EA3E3872A0.quest_desc": [
    "An ultradense metal ball and sixty-four nukes in the implosion compressor. The assembler makes two nukes per run from six Industrial TNT, four plutonium ingots, two processing units, four nuclear alloy plates, tritium and deuterium."
  ],
  "quest.6007318C5A71DCB1.title": "Quantum Upgrade",
  "quest.6007318C5A71DCB1.quest_subtitle": "Time dilation.",
  "quest.6007318C5A71DCB1.quest_desc": [
    "Thirty-two highly advanced upgrades, eight quantum circuits, a singularity, a quantum board and 50 mB of UU matter. The UU matter drips from a second singularity left in an electrolyzer, never used up: 1 mB every 125 seconds at 40 EU/t. It lifts a machine's cap by 999,999,999 EU/t."
  ],
  "quest.64430FB2641C2CC2.title": "Quantum barrel and tank",
  "quest.64430FB2641C2CC2.quest_subtitle": "Two billion, give or take.",
  "quest.64430FB2641C2CC2.quest_desc": [
    "A quantum hull, a singularity, two quantum circuits, sixteen iridium plates and eight large advanced motors, or pumps for the tank, around a titanium barrel or tank: 2,147,483,647 stacks of one item, or buckets of one fluid."
  ],
  "quest.0557FB3BF06083E3.title": "Quantum armor",
  "quest.0557FB3BF06083E3.quest_subtitle": "Quantum immortality.",
  "quest.0557FB3BF06083E3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Packer fuses a netherite piece with a quantum upgrade at 1,000,000 EU/t, so it needs a quantum upgrade of its own; in this pack each piece also takes a \"},{\"text\":\"Habitation Luminosity\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:luminosity_habitation\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from Solsticio, act VI. Each piece gives a 25% chance to ignore any damage: the full set, immunity and creative flight.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6EDE6FEA6AE1F57E.title": "Nothing melts down",
  "quest.6EDE6FEA6AE1F57E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The reactor cannot explode, emit radiation or harm the map. When a hatch runs too hot it only destroys what sits in it, so experiment freely: MI's guide suggests trying designs in creative first.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.375EA2771D12EC4F.title": "Fast and thermal",
  "quest.375EA2771D12EC4F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fuel emits fast neutrons, which carry the energy; scattered, some slow into thermal neutrons, which fuel absorbs far better. Past a temperature threshold a fuel emits fewer neutrons, so a reactor settles by itself. The recipe viewer lists each component's odds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.36C503EF459A5C6F.title": "Read the grid",
  "quest.36C503EF459A5C6F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The reactor's screen switches between temperature, neutron flux, absorption, generation and fuel views. Watch where heat piles up and where neutrons escape before moving a single rod.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1F7F2D2A6474BFA5.title": "Breed your own tritium",
  "quest.1F7F2D2A6474BFA5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Deuterium with deuterium gives half a bucket of plasma and half a bucket of tritium: a fusion reactor can breed the tritium its faster reactions want.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0BE0CA8DF9D8CF09.title": "What the pack changed",
  "quest.0BE0CA8DF9D8CF09.quest_desc": [
    "Five MI pieces wait on the Atlas: the diesel jetpack (act III), the Electric Quarry and the Gravichestplate (IV), the nuclear reactor and quantum circuits (V), and no assembler recipe skips the gate; each quantum armor piece waits for act VI.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The Replicator can't be crafted, and the implosion compressor makes no Nether Stars: the Wither stays their only source. Almost Unified gives MI the lowest metal priority, so shared metals come out as another mod's item."
  ],
  "quest.170767E6736997F1.title": "Destroyer of worlds",
  "quest.170767E6736997F1.quest_subtitle": "It doesn't even go off.",
  "quest.170767E6736997F1.quest_desc": [
    "You built a Nuke. Place it and nothing happens: it is a plain block, and sixty-four of them are only the price of a singularity."
  ],
  "reward.14DBBF91D550CFF2.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.53B68F03D8CA6913.title": "Annihilation operator",
  "quest.53B68F03D8CA6913.quest_subtitle": "The wandering trader's llamas have been warned.",
  "quest.53B68F03D8CA6913.quest_desc": [
    "A netherite sword and a quantum upgrade, fused in a packer running 1,000,000 EU/t: a blade with infinite damage."
  ],
  "reward.37B967D86EBF0D06.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.4E4D6A6620138701.title": "Alloy for the common store",
  "quest.4E4D6A6620138701.quest_subtitle": "Handle with tongs.",
  "quest.4E4D6A6620138701.quest_desc": [
    "Sixteen nuclear alloy plates: casings, hatches, fuel rod packs and nukes all start with them."
  ],
  "image.5C9895B7EE4B6114.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Fuel cycle\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.0D14301A84FC02A5.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Quantum tier\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.3F1347CBBA544805.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Modern Industrialization\\nEndgame\",\"color\":\"#FFF1DE\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.5E820409ADF24EBF.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.6F923053F79B8444.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Steam\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.155AA9D124B8A111.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Electricity\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.7191C8026370F900.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» Digital\",\"color\":\"#FFA552\"}]",
  "image.35C7F231F979627A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"split  fuse  fold\",\"color\":\"#BFA58A\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.3F1B4ECF25FF3FCA.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"fission\",\"color\":\"#7FB069\"}]",
  "image.5BDFD96957A79190.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"fusion\",\"color\":\"#E07BFF\"}]",
  "chapter.1169BE958A7CDC3C.title": "Oritech · Core and Particles",
  "chapter.1169BE958A7CDC3C.chapter_subtitle": [
    "From a uranium pellet to plutonium bred in the ring: the reactor piece by piece, nuclear explosives, the particle accelerator and its collisions, cybernetic augments, arcane machines, frame heads, drones and building blocks."
  ],
  "quest.08B9DDBC899D2CE0.title": "Uranium Pellets",
  "quest.08B9DDBC899D2CE0.quest_subtitle": "Glows a little. That's normal.",
  "quest.08B9DDBC899D2CE0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Uranium veins cling to cave walls and floors between Y -64 and -24. The forge turns copper dust and two raw uranium into a \"},{\"text\":\"Uranium Gem\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:uranium_gem\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; the Assembler presses two gems and plastic with nickel, adamant or duratium into two, three or four \"},{\"text\":\"Uranium Pellets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:uranium_pellet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Test a new design on small pellets: they burn a tenth as long, so an overheating reactor goes quiet sooner.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.59937063F0B18650.title": "Nuclear Reactor",
  "quest.59937063F0B18650.quest_subtitle": "Safety first. Or second.",
  "quest.59937063F0B18650.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Reactor Walls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reactor_wall\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" frame a box up to 64 per side, with the controller and energy ports set in the walls and a fuel port on the roof above each rod column. Design one layer: a taller reactor repeats it, and its power and fuel use grow with the height.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor Energy Port\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reactor_energy_port\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sends out up to 25,000 RF/t, so a big reactor needs several with superconductors behind them. A rod kept above 2,000 °C for 30 seconds melts down, and sirens sound well before that.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.33DA03D4BC3B6768.title": "Single Rods",
  "quest.33DA03D4BC3B6768.quest_subtitle": "One pulse at a time.",
  "quest.33DA03D4BC3B6768.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Plastic over two energite ingots makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Single Reactor Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reactor_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Each column of rods needs a \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor Fuel Port\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reactor_fuel_port\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the roof above it, and pellets go in there. Alone, a rod pulses once: 64 RF/t per layer and 4 heat a tick.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Every rod burns one unit of fuel per layer each tick. A uranium pellet holds 4,000, a small one 400 and a plutonium pellet 40,000, so a single rod one layer tall runs 200 seconds on one uranium pellet."
  ],
  "quest.3E8F8C5E43AE8117.title": "Heat Pipes and Vents",
  "quest.3E8F8C5E43AE8117.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor Heat Pipe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reactor_heat_pipe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pulls heat from each hotter neighbour, a quarter of the difference plus 10 a tick. A \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor Heat Vent\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reactor_vent\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" throws 4 plus a hundredth of its hottest neighbour's heat out of the reactor. Pipes spread a rod's heat; vents get rid of it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Four gold around an electrum ingot make a pipe; four carbon fibre around a motor, a vent. Vents like it hot: one sheds 14 heat a tick from a part at 1,000 °C and only 5 from one at 100 °C."
  ],
  "quest.61198D825DFF7E02.title": "Quad Rods",
  "quest.61198D825DFF7E02.quest_subtitle": "Twelve pulses, zero chill.",
  "quest.61198D825DFF7E02.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Two single rods and a \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor Neutron Reflector\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reactor_reflector\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make a double; two doubles and another reflector, a \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor Quad Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reactor_quad_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". On its own it pulses 12 times: 768 RF/t per layer for 76 heat a tick, so it wants cooling on every side.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It burns four units of fuel per layer each tick, yet gets three times as much RF out of every pellet as a single rod. Neighbouring rods and reflectors push it further: a quad hemmed in by four reflectors reaches 28 pulses and 396 heat."
  ],
  "quest.26A7F7A273919745.title": "Particle Accelerator",
  "quest.26A7F7A273919745.quest_subtitle": "Round and round, faster and faster.",
  "quest.26A7F7A273919745.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Guide rings lay the track, and right-clicking one bends it 45°. Each pass through a powered linear motor adds 1 m/s and costs the particle's speed times 10 RF. The controller shoots any item into a straight ring set right behind it; here it needs an \"},{\"text\":\"Atomic Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_atomic\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act V).\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Faster particles turn wider: the last full turn must sit at least the square root of the speed over 2.5 blocks back, and guides can stand up to the square root over 2 apart, 2 to 10. A \"},{\"text\":\"Sensor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:accelerator_sensor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a comparator read the speed; a powered bend becomes a switch.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3C968D4017F06584.title": "Plutonium Breeder",
  "quest.3C968D4017F06584.quest_subtitle": "The ring feeds the core, the core feeds the ring.",
  "quest.3C968D4017F06584.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Uranium dust and fluxite colliding at 2,500 J make \"},{\"text\":\"Plutonium Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:plutonium_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Two dusts, plastic and nickel, adamant or duratium press into two, three or four \"},{\"text\":\"Plutonium Pellets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:plutonium_pellet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", and each burns ten times as long as uranium.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Pulverizer grinds a raw uranium into two uranium dust; the Fragment Forge adds a pinch of plutonium on top.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7AD6481EEC866CF2.title": "Double Rods",
  "quest.7AD6481EEC866CF2.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor Double Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reactor_double_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pulses four times alone, 256 RF/t per layer for 12 heat, on two units of fuel a tick: twice the RF per pellet of a single rod. Set two side by side and each hits the other with two more pulses.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7F892B66552A6091.title": "Neutron Reflectors",
  "quest.7F892B66552A6091.quest_desc": [
    "Four adamant, four reactor walls and a duratium ingot. Beside a rod, a reflector sends back as many pulses as that rod holds: one for a single, two for a double, four for a quad. It makes no heat itself, but the rod heats up with every extra pulse."
  ],
  "quest.399B196402E6D8D6.title": "Heat Absorbers",
  "quest.399B196402E6D8D6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor Heat Absorber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reactor_condenser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes 16 heat a tick from every warm neighbour, 64 when all four sides are hot. It needs a \"},{\"text\":\"Reactor Coolant Absorber Port\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:reactor_absorber_port\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the roof above its column, fed with ice, and does nothing once the ice runs out.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Ice, packed ice and blue ice count the same: 1,000 units of coolant each, and a working absorber burns one unit per layer every tick. Steel, two ice and four glass make an absorber; the port is a wall, two ice, a hopper and three item pipes."
  ],
  "quest.19ACD06EE59DE4FF.title": "Industrial Chiller",
  "quest.19ACD06EE59DE4FF.quest_subtitle": "Ice, on tap.",
  "quest.19ACD06EE59DE4FF.quest_desc": [
    "Five iron, a motor, a cauldron and two ice, on one core. It freezes a bucket of water into three ice every 200 ticks for 32 RF/t, twice as fast and on half the energy in a cold biome. Pipe the ice straight into the coolant ports.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A bucket of lava comes out as two obsidian, and a bucket of steam as three snow blocks."
  ],
  "quest.7EA1F6D855C44877.title": "Redstone Port",
  "quest.7EA1F6D855C44877.quest_desc": [
    "A repeater, three processing units, two redstone torches and a wall, set into the reactor's walls. A signal stops the rods from loading new pellets, though what is burning finishes. A comparator reads it: right-click to cycle between hottest part, fuelled rods and stored energy."
  ],
  "quest.54C18F9DB6D1080C.title": "Count the Pulses",
  "quest.54C18F9DB6D1080C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A single rod pulses once, a double four times, a quad twelve; each neighbouring rod or neutron reflector adds more. Every pulse makes 64 RF/t per layer, but heat grows with the square: a lone quad rod gives 768 RF/t and 76 heat.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3DF6FFDA6F86BDD8.title": "Tall, Not Hot",
  "quest.3DF6FFDA6F86BDD8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Height multiplies a reactor's RF, fuel and coolant use, but never its heat, which is counted per column. A layout that stays cool one block tall stays as cool ten blocks tall, with ten times the power. A meltdown still grows with burning rods times height.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.660DAF7C6FE8F21B.title": "Mind the Siren",
  "quest.660DAF7C6FE8F21B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The controller's Warning slider sets when the sirens start: 1,600 °C out of the box. Past 2,000 °C with any rod burning, a 30-second countdown runs; cool the hot part or let the rods burn out before it ends, or the reactor explodes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1BF611CE9E2A9592.title": "Low-Yield Nuke",
  "quest.1BF611CE9E2A9592.quest_subtitle": "The quiet one of the family.",
  "quest.1BF611CE9E2A9592.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four uranium pellets, three Dubious Containers, TNT and, in this pack, an \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV). Redstone, flint and steel, a fire charge, a burning arrow or another blast sets the \"},{\"text\":\"Low-Yield Nuclear Explosion Device\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:low_yield_nuke\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" off at once: no fuse.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It blows out a sphere some 21 blocks in radius, then about ten shock waves carve on past it; around the rim, sand turns to glass and logs to basalt."
  ],
  "quest.3BAE5B4AE3AF4BDF.title": "Manhattan Module",
  "quest.3BAE5B4AE3AF4BDF.quest_subtitle": "Measure twice. Detonate never.",
  "quest.3BAE5B4AE3AF4BDF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The same frame with four plutonium pellets and three Heisenberg Compensators, plus the ironwood. The \"},{\"text\":\"Manhattan Module\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:nuke\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" blows out a sphere some 27 blocks in radius and sends thirteen shock waves on from there. It goes off like the small one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1BCB2D8EADF2C78A.title": "Schrödinger's Safe",
  "quest.1BCB2D8EADF2C78A.quest_subtitle": "Is the nuke in there? Better not check.",
  "quest.1BCB2D8EADF2C78A.quest_desc": [
    "Two Super AI Chips, a flux gate, two duratium, a Large Energy Storage and three fluxite. Right-click it on a dangerous block and that block becomes its core: TNT or a fluxite block hold 6 million RF, a nuke or a dragon egg 20 million, a black hole 100 million.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Enderic Lasers aimed at it don't charge it: while they fire, they stretch its capacity up to 5,000 times. RF leaves from the top and bottom and goes in anywhere else, and it needs clear space around the block to set itself up."
  ],
  "quest.03089564AC1BF337.title": "Pellets for the Common Store",
  "quest.03089564AC1BF337.quest_subtitle": "Some reactor is always hungry.",
  "quest.03089564AC1BF337.quest_desc": [
    "Eight uranium pellets, pressed in the Assembler from gems the forge made. Somebody's reactor on the server is always one pellet short."
  ],
  "quest.5FAF5E3419270BD0.title": "One Fast, One Still",
  "quest.5FAF5E3419270BD0.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Collision energy is the sum of both speeds, whatever the items. Bring one particle up to speed, then drop a still one into the same ring: 5,000 m/s against 0 is 5,000 J, and only one of them cost you power.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.52A22D06CBE96EAF.title": "Small Collisions",
  "quest.52A22D06CBE96EAF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At 500 J two coal dusts fuse into a diamond and two gold dusts into platinum dust; at 1,000 J an ender pearl and an amethyst shard give an \"},{\"text\":\"Echo Shard\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:echo_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; at 2,500 J adamant dust and netherrack give \"},{\"text\":\"Netherite Scrap\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:netherite_scrap\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5F6A465C36624315.title": "Fluxite from the Ring",
  "quest.5F6A465C36624315.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At 1,000 J electrum dust and redstone fuse into \"},{\"text\":\"Fluxite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:fluxite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", no geode or laser needed. At 500 J redstone and rotten flesh make \"},{\"text\":\"Enderic Compound\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:enderic_compound\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which finally gives every zombie's leftovers a job.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.345798BBD94D033C.title": "Big Collisions",
  "quest.345798BBD94D033C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At 8,000 J reinforced deepslate, which the forge makes from deepslate and two duratium, meets duratium dust and becomes a \"},{\"text\":\"Heavy Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:heavy_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". At 10,000 J a feather and a saddle become \"},{\"text\":\"Elytra\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:elytra\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The heavy core becomes the head of an \"},{\"text\":\"Electric Mace\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:electric_mace\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.665121A2D71519A3.title": "Electric Mace",
  "quest.665121A2D71519A3.quest_subtitle": "Thor called. He wants a word.",
  "quest.665121A2D71519A3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Heavy Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:heavy_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", three adamant, carbon fibre and two advanced batteries. It swings like a mace with 3 more blocks of reach, and a hit calls six lightning bolts down on the target over two and a half seconds, for 16,384 RF, once every 2 seconds.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "It holds 500,000 RF and never breaks. In hand it also lets you fall 10 extra blocks unhurt: climb, jump, strike."
  ],
  "quest.759B10C9F5497A15.title": "Tachyon Absorber",
  "quest.759B10C9F5497A15.quest_desc": [
    "Fast collisions throw tachyons out in random directions, more and farther the harder the hit. Absorbers around the impact turn them back into energy, up to four times what the acceleration cost; each one holds 1,000,000 RF.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Set absorbers farther back to spread the load: past about 10,000 J even distant ones overflow.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.540A49F0F6D548EE.title": "Enderic Railgun",
  "quest.540A49F0F6D548EE.quest_desc": [
    "An Enderic Laser, a linear motor, three adamant and two advanced batteries: a handheld laser holding 5,000,000 RF. Mining mode breaks blocks up to 128 away; combat mode only hits mobs, blasts for 100,000 RF a shot and turns creepers charged.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Combat mode explodes\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\": keep it away from your own walls.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5D43F7D63BCE3C94.title": "Release at Speed",
  "quest.5D43F7D63BCE3C94.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Particle Accelerator Sensor\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:accelerator_sensor\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" gives a comparator 1 up to 10 m/s, rising in steps to 15 past 15,000. Wire that into a bent guide ring: powered, the bend runs straight, and the particle leaves the loop at the speed you chose.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A particle that misses a bend flies straight out for about 0.9 times the square root of its speed in blocks, hurting mobs and breaking blocks until its speed is spent. Keep that line clear."
  ],
  "quest.097A60690C3AE668.title": "Portals on Demand",
  "quest.097A60690C3AE668.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two fire charges colliding above 5,000 J raise a Nether portal on the spot, with netherrack and fire splashed around it. Two ender pearls above 10,000 J open an End portal ringed with end stone and chorus. Both land on whatever stood there.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.111742A794190747.title": "Look into a black hole",
  "quest.58103E5EAD266366.title": "Event Horizon",
  "quest.58103E5EAD266366.quest_subtitle": "Don't feed it the base.",
  "quest.58103E5EAD266366.quest_desc": [
    "A particle faster than 15,000 m/s hit a portal and tore a hole in the world. It swallows blocks up to 16 away, one by one, and throws 50,000 RF of tachyons at an absorber in line for each: a generator that eats the scenery.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A black hole is also the best prisoner for \"},{\"text\":\"Schrödinger's Safe\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"1BCB2D8EADF2C78A\"}},{\"text\":\": five times the storage a nuke gives.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.5B59A377503BC4C0.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.3254C4AE398025A8.title": "Cybernetic Augmentation",
  "quest.3254C4AE398025A8.quest_subtitle": "Flesh is optional.",
  "quest.3254C4AE398025A8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Cybernetic Augmentation Center\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:augment_application_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sits on ten cores, and each of its up to three research stations needs three more. Walk into the center to research and install permanent upgrades: health, reach, speed, night vision and, from the arcane station, flight.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.oritech.augment_screen\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" to switch installed augments on and off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3CF872C0C453F40D.title": "Cybernetic Research Station",
  "quest.3CF872C0C453F40D.quest_desc": [
    "Five electrum, a redstone block, a brewing stand and two plating, on three cores in one of the center's station spots. It researches the body basics: health, armor, a steel fist, speed, step assist, reach, mining speed, a magnet, an auto-feeder, water breathing, and shrinking or growing.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Research spends RF from the center's own 500,000,000 RF store and items from its five slots or your pockets, then runs 20 seconds to 3 minutes on a free station of the right kind. What you research stays with that center."
  ],
  "quest.18DF62024D48C77F.title": "Quantum Research Station",
  "quest.18DF62024D48C77F.quest_desc": [
    "Five duratium, a flux gate, a Centrifuge and two plating. It takes the body further: two +10 health upgrades, the Aegis System's 8 armor, Flash Steps, Hyper Mining Speed, Far Reach, Weapon Reach and Night Vision."
  ],
  "quest.730F3C6A6C7D4F37.title": "Arcane Research Station",
  "quest.730F3C6A6C7D4F37.quest_desc": [
    "Five overcharged crystals, an enderic lens, an eye of ender and two plating. It holds the strange ones: Flight, Reduced Gravity, a Portal home, Cloak, Ore Vision, Luck and Psionic Strikes."
  ],
  "quest.0EEC0FAABCF17CA8.title": "Biosteel",
  "quest.0EEC0FAABCF17CA8.quest_subtitle": "Grown, not mined.",
  "quest.0EEC0FAABCF17CA8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Raw biopolymer and an iron ingot in the Foundry make a \"},{\"text\":\"Biosteel Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:biosteel_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Four augments ask for it by name: Steel-Infused Frame, Carbon-Reinforced Lungs, Synthetic Muscles and Water Breathing. Here it stays its own metal instead of turning into steel.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Raw biopolymer comes from a centrifuge with a Fluid Addon: packed wheat and a quarter bucket of water.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5724CB0305FC591C.title": "Body Work",
  "quest.5724CB0305FC591C.quest_subtitle": "Dents out, hearts in.",
  "quest.5724CB0305FC591C.quest_desc": [
    "Health climbs through Steel-Infused Frame (+6), Carbon-Reinforced Lungs (+4), Hyper-Redundancy Matrix (+10) and Living Fortress (+10): fifteen extra hearts. Armor adds 4, 6 and 8. The Matrix, the Aegis System and the Fortress want Nether Stars, and this pack's accelerator doesn't make them."
  ],
  "quest.51A807F75F0BC982.title": "Moving Parts",
  "quest.51A807F75F0BC982.quest_desc": [
    "Synthetic Muscles add 25% speed and Flash Steps far more; Step Assist walks up 0.6 blocks; Mining Speed doubles your digging and Hyper Mining Speed doubles it again. The Magnet, whose research eats two lodestones, pulls loose items from 8 blocks away.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Block Reach adds 30% and Far Reach doubles whatever you have; Weapon Reach adds 30% to melee. The Auto-Feeder eats the best harmless food in your inventory whenever you're two points hungry."
  ],
  "quest.23F5595F01C12F68.title": "Second Sight",
  "quest.23F5595F01C12F68.quest_desc": [
    "Night Vision, from the quantum station, keeps the dark lit for good. Ore Vision, from the arcane one, outlines every ore within 16 blocks through the rock; its research eats a spyglass, a sculk sensor and a prometheum ingot. Cloak makes you invisible."
  ],
  "quest.3CFC165EEB1E3B04.title": "Flight",
  "quest.3CFC165EEB1E3B04.quest_subtitle": "Creative mode, paid in full.",
  "quest.3CFC165EEB1E3B04.quest_desc": [
    "Free flight from the arcane station, once Reactive Plating and Portal are researched. The research takes 64 ion thrusters, 16 wind charges, 16 prometheum, 32 plutonium pellets and 500 million RF; installing it, four more thrusters.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Reduced Gravity follows and halves your weight. Portal, installed at the center, opens a door back to it wherever you switch it on."
  ],
  "quest.168FFC0A8124663A.title": "Catalyst and Enchanter",
  "quest.168FFC0A8124663A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Arcane Catalyst\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:enchantment_catalyst_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" stores the souls of mobs dying within 23 blocks: 50 at most, one more for every 20 RF/t a laser feeds it. The \"},{\"text\":\"Stabilized Enchanter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:enchanter_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" spends souls and power to apply exactly the enchantment you pick, one level at a time.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It needs soul-holding catalysts within 16 blocks, as many as the enchantment's cost plus the level it aims for. \"},{\"text\":\"A catalyst holding more souls than it can take explodes after three seconds\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\", so keep its laser running. A max-level book placed in one pushes an item past the vanilla cap, at an exponential soul bill.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4C36F0D342D15AD3.title": "Spawner Controller",
  "quest.4C36F0D342D15AD3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The first mob to walk over the controller sets its type for good, bosses aside here; build the cage it highlights underneath. Each spawn costs souls, the square root of the mob's health. Here the controller takes an \"},{\"text\":\"Ironwood Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"twilightforest:ironwood_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" (act IV).\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Soul Flowers\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"0FEBBC0EEBC59A59\"}},{\"text\":\" give it souls without killing anything.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0FEBBC0EEBC59A59.title": "Soul Flowers",
  "quest.0FEBBC0EEBC59A59.quest_subtitle": "Nobody died for these.",
  "quest.0FEBBC0EEBC59A59.quest_desc": [
    "Three wither roses and two flowers make one. Plant it on soul soil in light 9 or brighter; broken by hand once fully grown, it lets out a soul for a nearby catalyst or spawner controller. Bone meal speeds it up."
  ],
  "quest.4CF9F7061C7E44ED.title": "Past the Cap",
  "quest.4CF9F7061C7E44ED.quest_subtitle": "Ten is just a number.",
  "quest.4CF9F7061C7E44ED.quest_desc": [
    "An item with an enchantment at level ten. The catalyst's hyper enchanting goes further still, and every extra level costs exponentially more souls."
  ],
  "reward.22F187CE0E28B0F2.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.6FD6C7FAEFE40674.title": "Taint a Refinery",
  "quest.6FD6C7FAEFE40674.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blow up a Refinery while an Arcane Catalyst holding at least one soul sits within 6 blocks: the catalyst goes off too, and a Tainted Refinery stands where the refinery was. It can't be crafted, and breaking it gives back a plain refinery.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "In its line of sight within 16 blocks, sculk, spawners and cages multiply its yield up to three times, and bookshelves, amethyst and soul lights make each RF count up to nine times. Sixteen blocks of four kinds max out either."
  ],
  "task.07387C432BDB1F86.title": "Look at a Tainted Refinery",
  "quest.7FFA2A7B5EBBC2F2.title": "Happy Accident",
  "quest.7FFA2A7B5EBBC2F2.quest_subtitle": "It was like that when I got here.",
  "quest.7FFA2A7B5EBBC2F2.quest_desc": [
    "A Refinery blew up next to a charged Arcane Catalyst and came back tainted. It swallows all the power you feed it, runs faster with arcane blocks in sight, yields more with sculk around, and keeps a single output."
  ],
  "reward.0288F455E7F79756.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.2749BEE5AECFECFB.title": "Machine Frames",
  "quest.2749BEE5AECFECFB.quest_desc": [
    "Nickel and iron bars make sixteen. Lay them as a hollow rectangle up to 64 long: gantry machines clamp onto any edge, even a corner, and work the layer below the frame. Several machines can share one frame."
  ],
  "quest.5F6088ECCC71303A.title": "Block Destroyer",
  "quest.5F6088ECCC71303A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An Enderic Laser, a Pulverizer, four motors and plating. On a frame it breaks the layer below; each \"},{\"text\":\"Quarry Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:quarry_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" multiplies its depth by eight: 8, 64, then 512 blocks. On a laser the same addon widens the beam by one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1B9F4BAE282690A5.title": "Farms on a Frame",
  "quest.1B9F4BAE282690A5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Placer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:placer_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" plants seeds and saplings only where they can grow; the \"},{\"text\":\"Fertilizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:fertilizer_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hydrates the farmland and boosts growth for a quarter bucket per block, far stronger on mineral slurry. A crop filter on the Destroyer leaves unripe crops alone.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Tree Cutter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:treefeller_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" needs no frame: it fells whole trees in front of it, up to 8,000 blocks each, and keeps the saplings and fruit.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4586998E1BEFA974.title": "Heads with Manners",
  "quest.4586998E1BEFA974.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"On a Block Destroyer or an Enderic Laser, a \"},{\"text\":\"Silk Touch Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_silk_touch_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" keeps blocks whole, each \"},{\"text\":\"Yield Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_yield_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds a level of Fortune up to three, and a \"},{\"text\":\"Crop Filter Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:crop_filter_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" leaves unripe crops standing. Silk touch wins over yield.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"On a laser with a Hunter Addon, yield turns into Looting instead.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.386CE7DAA46B48F5.title": "Drone Port",
  "quest.386CE7DAA46B48F5.quest_desc": [
    "Two ports on eleven cores each, at least 50 blocks apart and linked with the designator, fly items between bases in a fixed time; with a Fluid Addon on both, fluids too. The energy grows with the square root of the distance, and both ends must be loaded.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A port sends to one place but receives from many; a busy sender can clog a receiver for the rest.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3BF719F96BE57EE6.title": "Control Unit",
  "quest.3BF719F96BE57EE6.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five redstone, a comparator, two repeaters and plating. On any machine, a \"},{\"text\":\"Control Unit Addon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_redstone_addon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" either stops it while it gets a signal or feeds a comparator its energy, one slot, its progress or whether it's working. Right-click the addon to choose.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "On a Drone Port, working means a drone in the air, so one comparator tells you when a shipment left or landed."
  ],
  "task.41E3E22CD025D166.title": "Any 16 plating blocks",
  "quest.18F4435B93B9BE5F.title": "Reinforced Plating",
  "quest.18F4435B93B9BE5F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four stone, four steel and copper, iron or nickel make two \"},{\"text\":\"Copper Reinforced Plating\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:machine_plating_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or its iron and nickel twins; a reinforced carbon sheet makes the carbon one. Every recipe that asks for plating takes any of the four, and each has a slab, stairs and a pressure plate.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.617F754A77AF1BD7.title": "Glass, Beams and Lights",
  "quest.617F754A77AF1BD7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four glass, four steel and plating make four \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Glass\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:industrial_glass_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", far tougher than glass. Steel and carbon fibre make six \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Support Beams\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:metal_beam_block\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" or six girders, and a machine frame joins onto a beam above or below it.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six steel and three glowstone dust make six \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Lights\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:ceiling_light\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", always on; hang one from a chain for a high ceiling.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.19A932A06F6C851A.title": "Doors and Buttons",
  "quest.19A932A06F6C851A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Six steel make an \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Door\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:tech_door\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; seven steel and two motors, an \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Hangar Door\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:hangar_door\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", 1×3 and moved by redstone alone. Hangar doors that touch open together on one signal, and an \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Button\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"oritech:tech_button\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds its pulse for four seconds.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.402ED6204D3F294F.title": "Any 4 machine paints",
  "quest.0FF93D869BAC6E34.title": "Machine Paints",
  "quest.0FF93D869BAC6E34.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each of the nine paints is two plastic plates, a pair of colourants and one core item, for four. Sneak (\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\") and right-click a machine or any of its cores to repaint the whole multiblock for one paint; the netherite one really takes two netherite ingots.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.59E765E8AAEF364F.title": "Any 4 pipe ducts",
  "task.1C39577724FE9F4D.title": "Any 8 framed pipes",
  "quest.0A3C4C6A1C969C8F.title": "Pipes in the Walls",
  "quest.0A3C4C6A1C969C8F.quest_desc": [
    "Four pipes, four stone and plating make four ducts: full blocks that carry what their pipe carries and join pipes and other ducts, never a machine. Eight pipes around plating make eight framed pipes, and eight item pipes around glass turn see-through."
  ],
  "image.75A1EDEF6A0C38D0.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Nuclear explosives\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.3F187718F602C8F2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Cybernetic augments\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.790ACC0303C721DF.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Arcane machines\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.1F73ECDCA09DC630.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Frame heads\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.3BA65CE01C309F43.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Drones\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.4BDEB965DB169FD9.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Building blocks\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.488D3F4E287A452D.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Oritech\",\"color\":\"#FFF1DC\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.184240CC8D627D86.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"core and particles\",\"color\":\"#3A2A18\"}]",
  "image.7B6B6C2F60F54676.title": "Back to Oritech",
  "image.5C5E989B63AD457E.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"burn · cool · accelerate · collide\",\"color\":\"#C9A77A\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.219439E288CA42D2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Nuclear reactor\",\"color\":\"#F0A24A\"}]",
  "image.4B41EE74FB1FF568.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Particle\\naccelerator\",\"color\":\"#A9C7CE\"}]",
  "chapter.23EBFFCF7DB0326C.title": "Magic in ENTRELUMEN",
  "chapter.23EBFFCF7DB0326C.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Which schools open in each act, and the Atlas components that tie them together."
  ],
  "quest.64B2A5E5963EA9CE.title": "Many schools, no walls",
  "quest.64B2A5E5963EA9CE.quest_desc": [
    "You can play the whole story leaning on a few schools. What ties them together are the Atlas components, story items made from magic materials: every team touches Ars Nouveau, Occultism, Malum, EvilCraft and Nature's Aura at least once.",
    "",
    "Heliodor ran on light. You'll run on whatever works."
  ],
  "quest.37C01E0CCF31B45B.title": "Which school for what",
  "quest.37C01E0CCF31B45B.quest_desc": [
    "Fights: Iron's Spells. Utility and automation: Ars Nouveau. Working spirits: Occultism. Alchemical ores: Theurgy. Growing the world: Nature's Aura. Souls: Malum. Dark forging: Forbidden and Arcanus. Blood and brooms: EvilCraft. Relics: Reliquary. Programmed spells: Psi. Blood circles: Mahou Tsukai. Gear: Apotheosis.",
    "",
    "Master one or two; taste the rest."
  ],
  "quest.3F94947246CE6851.title": "Act I: the first sparks",
  "quest.3F94947246CE6851.quest_desc": [
    "No magic required yet, but doors are open: bookshelves take the table toward 30, Apotheosis starts at Haven, EvilCraft's dark ore shows up around redstone depth, and Artifacts turn up in chests.",
    "",
    "Stock up on books, lapis and gold."
  ],
  "quest.2C0E497095FC1CAA.title": "Act II: the magic act",
  "quest.2C0E497095FC1CAA.quest_desc": [
    "Most schools open: Ars, Occultism, Nature's Aura, Iron's Spells, Forbidden and Arcanus, Theurgy, the first relics and EvilCraft's blood. The table reaches 45. The story asks for Ars: the Living Matrix, delivered to «Living Workshop»."
  ],
  "quest.4051B723D469D474.title": "A Matrix for the Atlas",
  "quest.4051B723D469D474.quest_desc": [
    "Two magebloom fibers and two Source Gems in a cross around a Calibration Frame. Beyond the Act II delivery, Matrices go into the Propagation Core (Act III) and the Ecosystem Capsule (Act IV): a steady Ars workshop pays off for a long time."
  ],
  "quest.16714199FE6F628C.title": "Act III: deeper magic",
  "quest.16714199FE6F628C.quest_desc": [
    "Psi and Mahou Tsukai arrive. Put Occultism's spirits to work and start Malum's soul research: Act IV needs both. The table reaches 60, the first spawner augments appear, and the World Tier rises to Frontier, invaders included.",
    "",
    "Salvage the affix gear you don't use."
  ],
  "quest.3164104B39F3F774.title": "Act IV: voices and seals",
  "quest.3164104B39F3F774.quest_desc": [
    "Magic supplies two key components: the Spectral Lens and the Containment Seal. They unlock Theurgy's transmutation, the Eternal Stella, shelves up to 90, the Act IV augments and, with a Horizon Chart, the Rending Gale. World Tier: Ascent."
  ],
  "quest.157613639B482C59.title": "The Spectral Lens",
  "quest.157613639B482C59.quest_desc": [
    "An Occultism attuned crystal, two Malum arcane spirits, a Create precision mechanism and a Calibration Frame. Deliver one to «Voices in the Glass» and keep making them: the Seal, reinforced machines, shelves and the Arcane Module use it.",
    "",
    "Glass that hears what isn't said."
  ],
  "quest.51EE903C0C24FFF6.title": "Seal of the dark schools",
  "quest.51EE903C0C24FFF6.quest_desc": [
    "Two EvilCraft dark gems, two Malum Soulstained Steel and a Spectral Lens. Delivered to «A Vessel for Restless Memory», it gives your team an Altar of Time. It also gates the Eternal Stella, Theurgy's emitter, the fission reactor, the Burning augment and the Atlas Library."
  ],
  "quest.0690F6AE03FF5F8F.title": "Act V: the Ark",
  "quest.0690F6AE03FF5F8F.quest_desc": [
    "Two Ark pieces are magical: the Renewal Engine (Nature's Aura, farming and bees) and the Arcane Module (every dark school). The table reaches 100, the Atlas Library opens up, and at Summit tier Mythic loot and Godforged Pearls start to drop."
  ],
  "quest.523AB48D42660EA3.title": "An engine that grows gardens",
  "quest.523AB48D42660EA3.quest_desc": [
    "Two Ingots of the Skies, two imperium essences, two Ecosystem Capsules and two Propagation Cores. Deliver one to «Renewable Horizons»; more go into the Nature Module, Mekanism's SPS, the Mega pots and Act V augments.",
    "",
    "The gardens come back, one engine at a time."
  ],
  "quest.112D4E9BD5A29894.title": "The Arcane Module",
  "quest.112D4E9BD5A29894.quest_desc": [
    "Two Spectral Lenses, two Containment Seals, an iesnium ingot and the Wither's nether star. In a complete Ark it resets an item's anvil penalty for books and XP, keeping enchantments, affixes and sockets. Iesnium needs Occultism's infused pickaxe: plan ahead."
  ],
  "quest.318923AC1CC86BDE.title": "Act VI: light made solid",
  "quest.318923AC1CC86BDE.quest_desc": [
    "Solsticio's villagers sell six Luminosities, one per discipline; violet Arcane is magic's. They make the Luminous ingot and the creative items: the Source Jar for Ars, the Blood Drop for EvilCraft, the bookshelf for Create: Enchantment Industry. World Tier: Pinnacle."
  ],
  "quest.2E7C7D0C1E3A8844.title": "Where the magic keys went",
  "quest.2E7C7D0C1E3A8844.quest_desc": [
    "Ars radial: F6. Iron's wheel: the key left of 1, cast: Alt+Q. Psi: Alt+F. Mahou Tsukai's circle: Alt+M. Occultism's satchel: Insert, ender bag: O. Apotheosis: Ctrl+T World Tiers, Ctrl+O radial mining, Shift+T link item. All changeable under Controls."
  ],
  "quest.450143F1ED9D1D09.title": "Shortcuts the pack closed",
  "quest.450143F1ED9D1D09.quest_desc": [
    "Reliquary's Alkahestry Tome (item duplication) and its spawn-egg crafting, Apotheosis's spawner runes (copper augments replace them) and portable spawners. Everything else keeps its native recipe unless its chapter says otherwise.",
    "",
    "Every school keeps its place in line."
  ],
  "quest.5A233C6A570EB457.title": "Every school has a book",
  "quest.5A233C6A570EB457.quest_desc": [
    "Most guides craft from a book: Tattered Tome (Ars), Dictionary of Spirits (Occultism), Encyclopedia Arcana (Malum), Book of Natural Aura, Chronicle of Shadows (Apotheosis), Knowledge Compendium (Mahou Tsukai). EvilCraft's is chest loot, Psi's is cast onto a book, Reliquary uses EMI."
  ],
  "quest.60B4CFB438EA8E87.title": "Magic that belongs to the story",
  "quest.60B4CFB438EA8E87.quest_desc": [
    "Living Matrices from your Ars workshop, lenses and seals from the dark schools, a Renewal Engine that grows the world back and an Arcane Module that listens. Magic is half of what the Atlas asks for, and which half is yours to pick.",
    "",
    "The light came back. Part of it was yours."
  ],
  "chapter.6C4A35CBE27ABDD9.title": "Ars Nouveau",
  "chapter.6C4A35CBE27ABDD9.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Four schools on one circle: spellcraft, Source, rituals and the creatures that do the chores."
  ],
  "quest.15546909CB740D3E.title": "Four tools for one book",
  "quest.15546909CB740D3E.quest_subtitle": "The blacksmith weeps. The scholar shrugs.",
  "quest.15546909CB740D3E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A book plus an iron shovel, pickaxe, axe and sword, all consumed: the \"},{\"text\":\"Novice Spell Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:novice_spell_book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It casts tier \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" glyphs and keeps every glyph you learn through each upgrade.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2C02AB120B59CEC5.title": "The Tattered Tome",
  "quest.2C02AB120B59CEC5.quest_subtitle": "It never says 'I told you so'.",
  "quest.2C02AB120B59CEC5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A book and a lapis: the \"},{\"text\":\"Tattered Tome\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:worn_notebook\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", Ars's own manual.\"}]",
    "",
    "Every glyph, ritual, machine and creature, with its recipe. Nobody hands it to you here: craft it."
  ],
  "quest.0C1577A49BF96193.title": "Write, then cast",
  "quest.0C1577A49BF96193.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With the book in your hotbar, \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.ars_nouveau.open_book\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens spellcrafting: click glyphs into the bottom row, name the spell, save it to a slot, right-click to cast. First spell: Projectile, Break. Aim away from the house.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.379561AE02FBE13A.title": "Archwood",
  "quest.379561AE02FBE13A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Some Overworld forests are Archwood Forests, with trees in four colours; lone ones grow, rarely, in any biome.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Planks and slabs build the scribe's table and the jars.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Each log colour goes into a ritual tablet.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Plant the saplings at home. A grove by the door beats an expedition a week.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4F4C641A8B25C1DF.title": "A stick that finds geodes",
  "quest.4F4C641A8B25C1DF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Archwood planks and a gold ingot make a \"},{\"text\":\"Dowsing Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:dowsing_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Each use briefly shows budding amethyst and magic creatures nearby.",
    "",
    "Geodes are the easy early amethyst for Source Gems."
  ],
  "quest.432DA860F1086112.title": "To die for",
  "quest.432DA860F1086112.quest_subtitle": "Technically, a fruit.",
  "quest.432DA860F1086112.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You ate a \"},{\"text\":\"Bombegranate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:bombegranate_pod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "The name was a warning, and you read it as a menu."
  ],
  "reward.2C3EE13CDDDCF2AC.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.259634AEB1E1C72A.title": "The Scribe's Table",
  "quest.259634AEB1E1C72A.quest_subtitle": "It eats whatever you drop. Don't drop dinner.",
  "quest.259634AEB1E1C72A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Use your book on a \"},{\"text\":\"Scribe's Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:scribes_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", pick a glyph, drop in the items it lists and pay the experience.\"}]",
    "",
    "The glyph item teaches it. It also pulls from inventories next to it."
  ],
  "quest.73E32446AA1C3E4F.title": "Grammar with consequences",
  "quest.73E32446AA1C3E4F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One Form first (Projectile flies, Touch hits close, Self hits you), then Effects. An augment only changes the glyph to its left. The book's tier caps the glyph tier: novice \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\", mage \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\", archmage \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5C48B88C95EB53EF.title": "Amplify eats a diamond pick",
  "quest.5C48B88C95EB53EF.quest_subtitle": "The pick dies so the spell can dig.",
  "quest.5C48B88C95EB53EF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The table consumes a diamond pickaxe for Amplify.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"After Break it raises the harvest tier.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"After Harm, the damage.\"}]",
    "",
    "It stacks, and so does the mana cost."
  ],
  "quest.2EBEB756212DF370.title": "Every glyph pays rent",
  "quest.2EBEB756212DF370.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A spell costs the sum of its glyphs. Every glyph you learn also raises your maximum mana, even the ones you never cast; book tiers, robes and trinkets add more.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.487A0352D4FD90EA.title": "Projectile",
  "quest.487A0352D4FD90EA.quest_subtitle": "Point, click, no regrets.",
  "quest.487A0352D4FD90EA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You know it from the first page.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The bolt flies until it hits something and runs the rest of the spell there, for \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" mana.\"}]",
    "",
    "Accelerate and Decelerate set its speed, each Split adds a bolt, Pierce goes through one more target and Sensitive makes it hit grass and flowers."
  ],
  "quest.71B6DB10E0AA2FFE.title": "Touch",
  "quest.71B6DB10E0AA2FFE.quest_subtitle": "Magic at arm's length.",
  "quest.71B6DB10E0AA2FFE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Also known from the start.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It works on the block or creature you use the book on, for \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" mana, and fizzles in empty air.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Touch, Break is a pickaxe that never wears out.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Sensitive lets it reach air and fluids too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.14319B4522649B40.title": "Self",
  "quest.14319B4522649B40.quest_subtitle": "Self-care, arcane edition.",
  "quest.14319B4522649B40.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The third form you start with.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The spell lands on you, for \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" mana, and takes no augments: Self, Leap throws you where you look; Self, Heal mends you for a little hunger; Self, Conjure Magelight gives night vision.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.350AF559923FE36B.title": "Underfoot",
  "quest.350AF559923FE36B.quest_subtitle": "Dig straight down. Carefully.",
  "quest.350AF559923FE36B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The form that hits the block under your feet.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Iron boots and a wooden pressure plate teach it at the table: tier \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" mana.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Underfoot, Break digs straight down.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Add AOE and the floor opens three by three.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1F038A78334231A5.title": "Pantomime",
  "quest.1F038A78334231A5.quest_subtitle": "Mime a wall until there is one.",
  "quest.1F038A78334231A5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A form that hits the air two blocks out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight glass blocks teach it at the table: tier \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" mana. It hits the spot two blocks past your eyes, air or not; three when you look down.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Amplify pushes it a block out, Dampen pulls it in.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Pantomime, Conjure Mageblock builds on nothing.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1B497A4C308EA5AD.title": "Magelight, not torches",
  "quest.1B497A4C308EA5AD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A lantern and a torch teach Conjure Magelight.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"On a block it leaves a permanent light.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"On yourself, night vision.\"}]",
    "",
    "Projectile plus Magelight lights a cave from across the room."
  ],
  "quest.2413D4FAA7DEC70D.title": "No loot in lava",
  "quest.2413D4FAA7DEC70D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two hoppers teach Item Pickup: it pulls in the drops where the spell lands.\"}]",
    "",
    "After Break, the ore comes to you instead of taking a lava bath."
  ],
  "quest.5CA2AB5806697427.title": "A spell that digs",
  "quest.5CA2AB5806697427.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Projectile, Break, Amplify, AOE, Item Pickup: a \"},{\"text\":\"3×3\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" face at range, drops collected. For ores add Extract or Luck after Break, never both. Three good slots beat ten half-written ones.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4D872E563C2A08FE.title": "The Mage's Spell Book",
  "quest.4D872E563C2A08FE.quest_subtitle": "Blaze rods mean the Nether. Pack a lunch.",
  "quest.4D872E563C2A08FE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Your novice book plus obsidian, diamonds, quartz blocks and blaze rods; every glyph carries over.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It unlocks tier \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" glyphs and more mana.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4A5CA3AB42662843.title": "Think in squares",
  "quest.4A5CA3AB42662843.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A firework star teaches AOE, tier \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each AOE after an effect widens it around the target: one on Break mines \"},{\"text\":\"3×3\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It widens Pickup, Smelt and others too."
  ],
  "quest.43D4ABD3B4D1EAA2.title": "Extract or Luck",
  "quest.43D4ABD3B4D1EAA2.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An emerald teaches Extract: Break acts with silk touch.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Luck, from a rabbit's foot, adds drops instead. Both are tier \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" and refuse to share a spell.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.46E0D864D0E37AEE.title": "Imbuement Chamber",
  "quest.46E0D864D0E37AEE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An item inside an \"},{\"text\":\"Imbuement Chamber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:imbuement_chamber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" soaks up Source until it changes.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Alone it gathers a trickle.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Jars within two blocks make it fast.\"}]",
    "",
    "Side items sit on pedestals and are not consumed."
  ],
  "quest.620B3140D18DC266.title": "Source Gems",
  "quest.620B3140D18DC266.quest_subtitle": "Purple is the colour of 'not enough yet'.",
  "quest.620B3140D18DC266.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Imbue an amethyst shard or a lapis for \"},{\"text\":\"500\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" Source: one \"},{\"text\":\"Source Gem\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:source_gem\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Almost every Ars recipe wants them. A budding amethyst geode is the renewable supply."
  ],
  "quest.7985E5BBF62B2095.title": "A piggy bank that glows",
  "quest.7985E5BBF62B2095.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Archwood slabs top and bottom, glass on the sides: a \"},{\"text\":\"Source Jar\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:source_jar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Machines, rituals and creatures drink from jars nearby.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"A comparator reads the level, and a broken jar keeps its Source.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.63936B61C6CCE928.title": "Making Source",
  "quest.63936B61C6CCE928.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A generator that runs on gardening.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Agronomic Sourcelink\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:agronomic_sourcelink\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns crops and trees growing nearby into \"},{\"text\":\"Source\",\"color\":\"#D8C8FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_text\",\"contents\":\"Ars's power: jars store it, relays move it, the apparatus and some rituals spend it.\"}},{\"text\":\" for jars within five blocks; magic plants count extra, bonemeal doesn't.\"}]",
    "",
    "Its siblings eat food, deaths, fuel or potions."
  ],
  "quest.0E9DF5090BA3B399.title": "The volcanic link melts floors",
  "quest.0E9DF5090BA3B399.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Volcanic Sourcelink burns fuel and pays best for archwood. Its heat turns nearby stone into magma, then lava: build it on a floor you can lose, away from wood.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.009AAD8E3CEA0FAE.title": "Berries for two links",
  "quest.009AAD8E3CEA0FAE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Berries that feed two kinds of generator.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sourceberries\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:sourceberry_bush\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" count as magic plants for an agronomic link, and berries and pie beat plain food in a mycelial one.\"}]",
    "",
    "Eating them restores mana."
  ],
  "quest.748221FDB6430A60.title": "Source tithe",
  "quest.748221FDB6430A60.quest_subtitle": "The circle keeps a ledger.",
  "quest.748221FDB6430A60.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Source Gems\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:source_gem\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "A geode, a golem and a chamber make it painless."
  ],
  "quest.6203913FCF726BDD.title": "Sourcestone and pedestals",
  "quest.6203913FCF726BDD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Where the side ingredients sit.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Eight stone around a Source Gem give eight \"},{\"text\":\"Sourcestone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:sourcestone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"With gold nuggets and a gem it becomes an \"},{\"text\":\"Arcane Pedestal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:arcane_pedestal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Make four for side ingredients."
  ],
  "quest.3D5F2958796F6901.title": "Elemental essences",
  "quest.3D5F2958796F6901.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Source Gem in the chamber plus three items on pedestals, \"},{\"text\":\"2000\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" Source: an essence.\"}]",
    "",
    "Earth takes an iron ingot, seeds and dirt. Only the gem is spent, so leave the pedestals set."
  ],
  "quest.47F1C61D11319558.title": "Arcane Core",
  "quest.47F1C61D11319558.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sourcestone around two gold ingots and a Source Gem.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The apparatus only works with an \"},{\"text\":\"Arcane Core\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:arcane_core\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" right below it: build them as one piece, with room for pedestals around.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.70166A508E203421.title": "Enchanting Apparatus",
  "quest.70166A508E203421.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It sits on the core.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Side ingredients go on pedestals within three blocks, then you use the central item on it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Source comes from jars nearby.\"}]",
    "",
    "Charms, armour, rings and magebloom seeds are born here."
  ],
  "quest.28007D969FECC081.title": "Enchanting without dice",
  "quest.28007D969FECC081.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The apparatus applies vanilla enchantments one level at a time: tool in the centre, items on pedestals, each level after the previous one. From \"},{\"text\":\"2000\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" Source for level I up to \"},{\"text\":\"9000\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\". Exact, no dice.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.40ABFF9AE882714A.title": "Thinking with prisms",
  "quest.40ABFF9AE882714A.quest_subtitle": "The spell went round the houses.",
  "quest.40ABFF9AE882714A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"One spell redirected by four \"},{\"text\":\"Spell Prisms\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:spell_prism\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Nobody asked the spell whether it wanted the scenic route."
  ],
  "reward.4C4A5190A402C7E1.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.4A9AE22AE00B592E.title": "Cable management, magic edition",
  "quest.4A9AE22AE00B592E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A stick with two Source Gems and a gold ingot in the apparatus: the \"},{\"text\":\"Dominion Wand\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:dominion_wand\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Use it on a source, then on a target: jar to relay, creature to chest.",
    "",
    "Sneak-use clears a relay's links."
  ],
  "quest.65604676A34768EC.title": "Source on the move",
  "quest.65604676A34768EC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wand-link jar, \"},{\"text\":\"Source Relay\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:relay\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", distant jar:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Up to \"},{\"text\":\"30\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" blocks a hop\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Redstone stops it\"}]",
    "",
    "Upgraded relays collect from or fill every jar nearby."
  ],
  "quest.61BC93666A3CB4A1.title": "Magebloom",
  "quest.61BC93666A3CB4A1.quest_subtitle": "A flower that pays for itself.",
  "quest.61BC93666A3CB4A1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Ars's cloth grows in a garden.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Any seeds ringed by four Source Gems in the apparatus give a \"},{\"text\":\"Magebloom Seed\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:magebloom_crop\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"next to an agronomic link it adds Source while it grows\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Each bloom crafts into four \"},{\"text\":\"Magebloom Fiber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:magebloom_fiber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", Ars's cloth.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.539A03F5CDA2B0CF.title": "Robes over plate",
  "quest.539A03F5CDA2B0CF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A golden chestplate and four fiber in the apparatus:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Sorcerer's Wrap\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:sorcerer_robes\",\"count\":1}}}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"With mana regen\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Thread slots\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Blank thread becomes a perk thread in the apparatus.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"The alteration table sews it in.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3F84D749D6ADB214.title": "The Living Matrix",
  "quest.3F84D749D6ADB214.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A cross: \"},{\"text\":\"Source Gems\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:source_gem\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" above and below, \"},{\"text\":\"Magebloom Fiber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:magebloom_fiber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at the sides and a \"},{\"text\":\"Calibration Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:calibration_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the middle.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It moves the story only when delivered to \"},{\"text\":\"Living Workshop\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"7A2C3D602817EC20\"}},{\"text\":\" in the Atlas, and later acts ask for more.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2F3E42797FDBC5DD.title": "Ritual Brazier",
  "quest.2F3E42797FDBC5DD.quest_subtitle": "Spells too big for a book.",
  "quest.2F3E42797FDBC5DD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An arcane pedestal, a Source Gem block and three gold ingots: the \"},{\"text\":\"Ritual Brazier\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_brazier\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It casts rituals from tablets, and many drink Source from jars within six blocks. Redstone pauses the one running."
  ],
  "quest.350D28FB512A0937.title": "Tablet, augments, empty hand",
  "quest.350D28FB512A0937.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Use the tablet on the brazier, throw augment items on top, then start it with an empty hand; the tablet is spent. Log colour hints the theme: green grows, red burns, blue is water and sky, purple binds.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.68D703CB2F0A1672.title": "Sunrise, on demand",
  "quest.68D703CB2F0A1672.quest_subtitle": "For once, the sun comes up when you say.",
  "quest.68D703CB2F0A1672.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A red archwood log, three dandelions and a clock make the \"},{\"text\":\"Sunrise\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_sunrise\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" tablet: it makes it day.\"}]",
    "",
    "Cheap and instant, the best way to learn the brazier."
  ],
  "quest.617FC8B4C2F0CBFD.title": "More tablets worth a log",
  "quest.617FC8B4C2F0CBFD.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cloudshaping sets the weather. Fertility breeds animals. Disintegration kills monsters for experience, no drops. Burrowing digs to bedrock. Forestation and Flowering reshape the land.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.671E9DA04BF8532A.title": "A quiet base",
  "quest.671E9DA04BF8532A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The ritual that keeps monsters off your lawn.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_sanctuary\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"While \"},{\"text\":\"Sanctuary\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_sanctuary\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" runs, no hostile mob spawns naturally within \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" blocks.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Rotten flesh thrown in before starting widens it.\"}]",
    "",
    "It only charges Source when it actually blocks a spawn."
  ],
  "quest.6906CC2C09BAA8A8.title": "See through stone",
  "quest.6906CC2C09BAA8A8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"X-ray vision, with a colour code.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Throw in one block of what you're after before starting \"},{\"text\":\"Scrying\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_scrying\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": for a while you see it through everything, white near, green middling, blue far.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.652BE291CD20CB8F.title": "Den of the Wilden",
  "quest.652BE291CD20CB8F.quest_subtitle": "Wipe your feet.",
  "quest.652BE291CD20CB8F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You walked into a Wilden den.\"}]",
    "",
    "Horns, spikes and wings, and the owners, all in one forest clearing."
  ],
  "reward.5ABEF5A1E1482975.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.3E586171800E29F1.title": "Crops, no hands",
  "quest.3E586171800E29F1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The farm that harvests itself.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Harvest\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_harvest\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" reaps ripe crops around the brazier for a bit of Source each, into an inventory next to it if there is one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.225F391735441554.title": "Cheap cures",
  "quest.225F391735441554.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Restoration\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_restoration\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" heals the living nearby and hurts the undead.\"}]",
    "",
    "Zombie villagers are cured at once, and cured villagers trade at a discount."
  ],
  "quest.718037DFEA5B61ED.title": "Mobs in jars",
  "quest.718037DFEA5B61ED.quest_subtitle": "A farm that fits on a shelf.",
  "quest.718037DFEA5B61ED.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Empty \"},{\"text\":\"Containment Jars\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:mob_jar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a creature within three blocks of the brazier: in it goes.\"}]",
    "",
    "Jarred mobs keep living, so eggs, wool, milk and trades keep coming."
  ],
  "quest.75F78A67ECF0E466.title": "What a jar can do",
  "quest.75F78A67ECF0E466.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A jarred villager trades and restocks; a piglin barters thrown gold; an allay stores items into an inventory next to it; a drygmy counts jars as creatures.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.506DBB17A2827156.title": "Time in a bottle",
  "quest.506DBB17A2827156.quest_subtitle": "If words could make wishes come true.",
  "quest.506DBB17A2827156.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A clock in a \"},{\"text\":\"Containment Jar\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:mob_jar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It's still ticking. It's just ticking somewhere smaller."
  ],
  "reward.428B9AD817D7A594.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.7FF171DC9AFB1F3D.title": "Your first familiar",
  "quest.7FF171DC9AFB1F3D.quest_subtitle": "Friendship, with paperwork.",
  "quest.7FF171DC9AFB1F3D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A creature becomes a script, and the script a familiar.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Run \"},{\"text\":\"Binding\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_binding\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" next to a creature, a starbuncle to start: it becomes a bound script that teaches you the familiar.\"}]",
    "",
    "Summon it from the book's familiar tab."
  ],
  "quest.44481184CD68D732.title": "Bookwyrm, the tidy one",
  "quest.44481184CD68D732.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Bind a bookwyrm and, as a familiar, it pulls items and experience within five blocks, but not what you throw.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Take it mining.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Take the starbuncle for speed on the surface.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7143B2456F90D31D.title": "Who does what",
  "quest.7143B2456F90D31D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Starbuncle: speed. Bookwyrm: item magnet. Drygmy: earth spells and looting. Whirlisprig: cheaper earth glyphs. Wixie: longer potions. A familiar reserves part of your mana while it's out.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.2FE29D5739879663.title": "Defeat the Wilden Chimera",
  "quest.50BF33B63B7ECACF.title": "The Wilden Chimera",
  "quest.50BF33B63B7ECACF.quest_subtitle": "Not in the garden.",
  "quest.50BF33B63B7ECACF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A purple archwood log, three Wilden drops and a lapis block make the Summon Wilden tablet.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Throw a \"},{\"text\":\"horn\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:wilden_horn\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", a \"},{\"text\":\"spike\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:wilden_spike\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a \"},{\"text\":\"wing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:wilden_wing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on the brazier before lighting it. The Chimera drops a \"},{\"text\":\"Wilden Tribute\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:wilden_tribute\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.28B2A0E9BE07F7E4.title": "Watch your starbuncle at work",
  "quest.095EDA334AA7BB45.title": "Starbuncle Charm",
  "quest.095EDA334AA7BB45.quest_subtitle": "The only employee paid in advance.",
  "quest.095EDA334AA7BB45.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Bribery works on starbuncles.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Starbuncles flee from players unless you hold a gold nugget: let one take it and it leaves a \"},{\"text\":\"Starbuncle Token\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:starbuncle_shards\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Token and four gold ingots in the apparatus make the \"},{\"text\":\"Starbuncle Charm\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:starbuncle_charm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Use the charm on the ground and it picks up items nearby. Dispel or death returns the charm."
  ],
  "quest.47DCEDEE953B0EDB.title": "Starbuncle routes",
  "quest.47DCEDEE953B0EDB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wand the starbuncle, then a chest: it delivers there. Chest first, then starbuncle: it takes from there. One can serve many chests; a charm used on a starbuncle stacks them into one.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1022D6A130C47354.title": "Thinking with portals",
  "quest.1022D6A130C47354.quest_subtitle": "Wrong game, right idea.",
  "quest.1022D6A130C47354.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Warp Scroll\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:warp_scroll\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" records a spot and takes you there once.\"}]",
    "",
    "Thrown into a sourcestone frame with a full jar nearby, it opens a permanent one-way portal."
  ],
  "quest.4BE4DD0664E13443.title": "Filters on paper",
  "quest.4BE4DD0664E13443.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Write items into an \"},{\"text\":\"Allow scroll\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:allow_scroll\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" at the scribe's table; a starbuncle holding it moves only those.\"}]",
    "",
    "Deny does the opposite. A scroll in an item frame on a chest filters every starbuncle using it."
  ],
  "quest.786B44F172D40CA9.title": "Beds and shades",
  "quest.786B44F172D40CA9.quest_subtitle": "Sunglasses: the uniform of focus.",
  "quest.786B44F172D40CA9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Even a starbuncle wants a day off.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"A wand-bound \"},{\"text\":\"Magebloom Bed\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:orange_sbed\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" gives idle starbuncles a place to rest.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Redstone on it sends them all to sleep.\"}]",
    "",
    "Starbuncle shades stop them picking things up off the ground."
  ],
  "quest.62CD69998B3B9F95.title": "Drops without killing",
  "quest.62CD69998B3B9F95.quest_subtitle": "A farm where nobody dies.",
  "quest.62CD69998B3B9F95.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Loot and experience from creatures nobody hurts.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Throw a Wilden horn near a wild drygmy for its token.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:drygmy_charm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Drygmy Charm\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:drygmy_charm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on mossy cobblestone makes a henge.\"}]",
    "",
    "It yields drops and experience from creatures nearby, unharmed. Jars count."
  ],
  "quest.737CF509DB564035.title": "Honey, I shrunk the starbuncle",
  "quest.737CF509DB564035.quest_subtitle": "It seems fine. Probably.",
  "quest.737CF509DB564035.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A starbuncle in a \"},{\"text\":\"Containment Jar\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:mob_jar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It's still working. It's just working very small."
  ],
  "reward.2BF6AF8A9B5EBA07.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.701527690A16BF87.title": "A garden that pays",
  "quest.701527690A16BF87.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A whirlisprig turns a garden into income.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Grow a tree next to a wild whirlisprig for its token.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:whirlisprig_charm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Whirlisprig Charm\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:whirlisprig_charm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" goes on a flower with a chest beside it.\"}]",
    "",
    "It produces what grows nearby, but only when it's happy with the variety."
  ],
  "quest.5F0C2EE9E724C72B.title": "A rock with feelings",
  "quest.5F0C2EE9E724C72B.quest_subtitle": "Source Gems forever.",
  "quest.5F0C2EE9E724C72B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Wand the \"},{\"text\":\"Amethyst Golem\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:amethyst_golem_charm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", then a block, to set its home.\"}]",
    "",
    "It turns amethyst blocks into budding ones, speeds growth, harvests clusters and stores the shards."
  ],
  "quest.6D214A6A8D2A3D24.title": "A witch, reformed",
  "quest.6D214A6A8D2A3D24.quest_subtitle": "Now in middle management.",
  "quest.6D214A6A8D2A3D24.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Dispel a witch at half health or less for the token; the \"},{\"text\":\"Wixie Charm\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:wixie_charm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a cauldron makes a Wixie Cauldron.\"}]",
    "",
    "Show it an item and it crafts it from inventories nearby, for a little Source."
  ],
  "quest.6E9B8E04BACF9D1C.title": "Potions by the jar",
  "quest.6E9B8E04BACF9D1C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The wixie brews for you.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An empty \"},{\"text\":\"Potion Jar\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:potion_jar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" by the cauldron, an awkward potion used on it, nether wart nearby: the wixie brews three doses per craft and brings the water.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1AF787950B270CE0.title": "Spells on paper",
  "quest.1AF787950B270CE0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blank parchment on the scribe's table, pick a spell slot as if to cast, sneak-use the book on the table.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Spell Parchment\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:spell_parchment\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" holds that spell and programs turrets.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.01C5F3CD9478E555.title": "Spell turrets",
  "quest.01C5F3CD9478E555.quest_subtitle": "One-block farms, polite mob disposal.",
  "quest.01C5F3CD9478E555.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A dispenser that casts.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Load a written parchment into a \"},{\"text\":\"Basic Spell Turret\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:basic_spell_turret\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": on redstone it casts, like a dispenser, paid from nearby jars.\"}]",
    "",
    "With an inventory next to it, Pickup and Place Block work."
  ],
  "quest.3B21E8052927B4E1.title": "A turret with a clock",
  "quest.3B21E8052927B4E1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Timer Spell Turret\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:timer_spell_turret\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fires on its own, every second by default: right-click adds time, punching removes it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Forms and Sensitive are free.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Only effects cost Source.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.496BD651BCA3D872.title": "Storage Lectern",
  "quest.496BD651BCA3D872.quest_subtitle": "A library where the librarians fly.",
  "quest.496BD651BCA3D872.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A lectern ringed by four chests in the apparatus.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wand-link inventories up to \"},{\"text\":\"30\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" blocks away to the \"},{\"text\":\"Storage Lectern\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:storage_lectern\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", then view, sort and craft from all of them on one screen.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4138621CF1D1D61C.title": "Archmage",
  "quest.4138621CF1D1D61C.quest_subtitle": "Four schools, one book.",
  "quest.4138621CF1D1D61C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The book that finishes the book.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Your mage's book, ender pearls, emeralds, a Totem of Undying, a Nether Star and a Wilden Tribute: the \"},{\"text\":\"Archmage Spell Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:archmage_spell_book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tier \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" opens: Blink, Burst, Wall, Lightning.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Nether Star only comes from the Wither here. Plan that fight.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "{image:entrelumen:textures/gui/quests/diagram_glyphs.png width:96 height:48 align:center}",
    "",
    "A good benchmark: one slot to dig, one to light, one to move, one to fight, and one you invented.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Its spine reads \"},{\"text\":\"ars longa\",\"color\":\"#B98CFF\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"},{\"text\":\". Nobody can read it, but it looks important.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.73F873CF3B844D0C.title": "Blink, and you're there",
  "quest.73F873CF3B844D0C.quest_subtitle": "Legs, the magic edition.",
  "quest.73F873CF3B844D0C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Self and Blink throw you forward; Projectile and Blink take you where the bolt lands.\"}]",
    "",
    "With a written warp scroll in the other hand, Blink sends a creature to the scroll's spot."
  ],
  "quest.581AD0E934387194.title": "One diamond pick per team",
  "quest.581AD0E934387194.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Copy your glyphs onto a teammate.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:annotated_codex\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Annotated Codex\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:annotated_codex\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" records every glyph you know, for experience per glyph.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Another player uses it to learn them all.\"}]",
    "",
    "In co-op, one scribes the pricey glyphs and the rest copy."
  ],
  "quest.23F0756ADB690ACD.title": "The tailor's bench",
  "quest.23F0756ADB690ACD.quest_subtitle": "Measure twice, enchant once.",
  "quest.23F0756ADB690ACD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Scribe's Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:scribes_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" with four \"},{\"text\":\"Magebloom Fiber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:magebloom_fiber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around it: the \"},{\"text\":\"Alteration Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:alteration_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Magical armor goes on its stand.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Threads go on its tablet.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.71405CA068B8E5DF.title": "Blank threads",
  "quest.71405CA068B8E5DF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Six \"},{\"text\":\"Magebloom Fiber\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:magebloom_fiber\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a row of three gold nuggets: a \"},{\"text\":\"Blank Thread\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:blank_thread\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"The enchanting apparatus turns it into a perk.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"A bigger armor slot makes the same perk stronger.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.15A4E219C99F91A3.title": "Threads for casters",
  "quest.15A4E219C99F91A3.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Spell Power\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:thread_spellpower\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds spell damage per level; \"},{\"text\":\"Magic Capacity\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:thread_magic_capacity\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds \"},{\"text\":\"10%\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" maximum mana per level.\"}]",
    "",
    "The first takes seven essences and a magebloom, the second sourceberries and magebloom."
  ],
  "quest.034005479D041AB1.title": "Threads that keep you going",
  "quest.034005479D041AB1.quest_subtitle": "A totem that recharges in bed.",
  "quest.034005479D041AB1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Repairing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:thread_repairing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" mends every magical armor and enchanter's item you carry, paid in mana.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Undying\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:thread_undying\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" needs a tier \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" slot and cancels one death per sleep, like a totem.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.014664D114061E9D.title": "Threads for the road",
  "quest.014664D114061E9D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"High Step\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:thread_high_step\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" raises your step by a block per level; \"},{\"text\":\"Feather\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:thread_feather\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" cuts fall damage.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Heights jumps higher, and Gliding flies like an elytra from a level \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" slot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0B32EE7DA07573F6.title": "Three cuts of robe",
  "quest.0B32EE7DA07573F6.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Sorcerer robes have the best thread slots and the least armor.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four fibers on an iron chestplate give \"},{\"text\":\"Arcanist's Robes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:arcanist_robes\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; on a diamond one, the \"},{\"text\":\"Battlemage's Gambeson\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:battlemage_robes\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": more armor, smaller slots.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.406670C2DC5C14DF.title": "Tier by tier",
  "quest.406670C2DC5C14DF.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two blaze rods and \"},{\"text\":\"2500\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" Source at the apparatus take armor to tier \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"; two ender pearls, a chorus fruit and \"},{\"text\":\"5000\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" Source, to tier \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\". Each tier adds mana regeneration and bigger slots.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0E868C267D665E13.title": "Rings and amulets",
  "quest.0E868C267D665E13.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight iron nuggets around a Source Gem make a \"},{\"text\":\"Ring of Potential\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ring_of_potential\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; four, a \"},{\"text\":\"Dull Trinket\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:dull_trinket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The apparatus turns them into a \"},{\"text\":\"Ring of Lesser Discount\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ring_of_lesser_discount\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and an \"},{\"text\":\"Amulet of Mana Regen\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:amulet_of_mana_regen\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.75E5FBC8E128F902.title": "Up, without stairs",
  "quest.75E5FBC8E128F902.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two ways up: a belt and a ring.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Leather and a Source Gem make a \"},{\"text\":\"Mundane Belt\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:mundane_belt\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\"; gold, feathers and air essence turn it into a \"},{\"text\":\"Belt of Levitation\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:belt_of_levitation\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": sneak mid-air to rise.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Three Wilden Wings on a Ring of Potential give the \"},{\"text\":\"Ring of Jumping\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:jump_ring\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.28B30FE07DECA2B8.title": "Two jars for the pocket",
  "quest.28B30FE07DECA2B8.quest_subtitle": "One glows, one eats.",
  "quest.28B30FE07DECA2B8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Jar of Light\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:jar_of_light\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" calls a light that follows you.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Jar of Voiding\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:void_jar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" destroys the items you set as you pick them up and pays a little mana back; sneak-use to switch it on or off.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3AC7B08133F9EAF0.title": "Past the ten-glyph limit",
  "quest.3AC7B08133F9EAF0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An archwood log, four Source Gems, two gold, air and manipulation essence: an \"},{\"text\":\"Enchanter's Wand\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:wand\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"It always fires Projectile → Accelerate.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Inscribe a spell with no form, just Break for instance, and it can outgrow the ten-glyph limit.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7803E74ED7481617.title": "A spell on every hit",
  "quest.7803E74ED7481617.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A diamond sword, a diamond, two gold blocks and two Source blocks: the \"},{\"text\":\"Enchanter's Sword\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:enchanters_sword\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It casts its spell as Touch before each hit, and all your spells gain Spell Damage.",
    "",
    "Inscribe it without a form: Ignite → Extend Time."
  ],
  "quest.07EF60D5B3E6A8E9.title": "Blocking pays",
  "quest.07EF60D5B3E6A8E9.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A defence that pays in mana.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Blocking with the \"},{\"text\":\"Enchanter's Shield\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:enchanters_shield\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" grants a short burst of Mana Regeneration and Spell Damage, and the shield mends itself with your mana.\"}]",
    "",
    "A plain shield, two gold blocks and two Source blocks."
  ],
  "quest.0E326CBB26344ADC.title": "Buffs at a discount",
  "quest.0E326CBB26344ADC.quest_subtitle": "Vanity, but useful.",
  "quest.0E326CBB26344ADC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Enchanter's Mirror\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:enchanters_mirror\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" casts its spell on you, cheaper and longer.\"}]",
    "",
    "Inscribe it with no form, like Heal → Amplify.",
    "",
    "A Source block, glass, gold, archwood and manipulation essence at the apparatus."
  ],
  "quest.690C490506EB8DF4.title": "Arrows that cast",
  "quest.690C490506EB8DF4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"With mana, the \"},{\"text\":\"Enchanter's Bow\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:spell_bow\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns arrows into spell arrows; with none, it fires a harmless one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Imbue arrows with a Source Gem, air essence and a diamond for \"},{\"text\":\"Amplify arrows\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:amplify_arrow\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.27576A9B1958183B.title": "A fist that mines",
  "quest.27576A9B1958183B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A spell multitool for your fist.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Leather, a diamond, two gold blocks and two Source blocks: the \"},{\"text\":\"Enchanter's Gauntlet\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:enchanters_gauntlet\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". It breaks blocks up to diamond hardness.\"}]",
    "",
    "It starts with Touch, takes one formless spell and casts it at a discount."
  ],
  "quest.738C3D981148DA76.title": "Fishing, with intent",
  "quest.738C3D981148DA76.quest_subtitle": "The one that got away got Ignited.",
  "quest.738C3D981148DA76.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A fishing rod with a grudge.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Enchanter's Fishing Rod\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:enchanters_fishing_rod\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fishes like any rod, but a hooked creature keeps taking its spell until the line breaks.\"}]",
    "",
    "A rod, two gold blocks and two Source blocks."
  ],
  "quest.4F85AB62309DC3E5.title": "Throwing the scenery",
  "quest.4F85AB62309DC3E5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Furniture as ammunition.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Focus of Block Shaping\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:shapers_focus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" makes blocks you move hurt what they hit, and copies the rest of your spell onto blocks you create or move.\"}]",
    "",
    "Try Conjure Mageblock → Launch → Delay → Knockback."
  ],
  "quest.1A16226D87118401.title": "Someone else's spell",
  "quest.1A16226D87118401.quest_subtitle": "Previous owner unknown.",
  "quest.1A16226D87118401.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"You found a \"},{\"text\":\"Caster Tome\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:caster_tome\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" in the loot.\"}]",
    "",
    "It casts a mage's finished spell for half its cost, or your whole mana bar, whichever is smaller."
  ],
  "reward.5AD2C7FD0BDA8C69.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.1134B871CB70A5CB.title": "Eight sips per flask",
  "quest.1134B871CB70A5CB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight doses of one potion in one bottle.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A bottle, two abjuration essences, a Source block and a gold block make a \"},{\"text\":\"Potion Flask\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:potion_flask\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Fill it at a Potion Jar or craft it with the potion.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Sneak-use it on a jar to empty it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3C4CDD018D260A4A.title": "Longer or stronger",
  "quest.3C4CDD018D260A4A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight manipulation essences turn a flask into \"},{\"text\":\"Extend Time\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:potion_flask_extend_time\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": effects last \"},{\"text\":\"50%\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" longer.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight abjuration essences make \"},{\"text\":\"Amplify\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:potion_flask_amplify\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": one level more, half the time.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.7C97D0F232283559.title": "Potion Melder",
  "quest.7C97D0F232283559.quest_subtitle": "Two potions walk into a cauldron.",
  "quest.7C97D0F232283559.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two potions in, one with both effects out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Potion Melder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:potion_melder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes three doses from each of two linked Potion Jars and fills a third with one potion carrying both effects.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Link every jar with the dominion wand.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Chain melders for longer recipes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2E840D9EA0A8BFD4.title": "A potion for the whole room",
  "quest.2E840D9EA0A8BFD4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A room that keeps its own buff.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Bind a Potion Jar to a \"},{\"text\":\"Potion Diffuser\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:potion_diffuser\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": every \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\" minutes it drinks one potion and keeps applying it to everyone nearby.\"}]",
    "",
    "A campfire, gold and archwood planks."
  ],
  "quest.5AD6CFBD0F6F7CA1.title": "Flask cannon",
  "quest.5AD6CFBD0F6F7CA1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Throw potions from afar, off a menu.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A dispenser, gold, blaze rods and gunpowder: the \"},{\"text\":\"Splash Flask Cannon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:splash_flask_cannon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" throws the flask or potion you pick in its radial menu as a splash.\"}]",
    "",
    "Dragon's breath and two air essences make the lingering one."
  ],
  "quest.24DCC5AD0088520F.title": "A window anywhere",
  "quest.24DCC5AD0088520F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"An eye of ender and a Source Gem: a \"},{\"text\":\"Scry Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:scryers_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Right-click to look through it.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:scryer_scroll\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Blank parchment on it makes a \"},{\"text\":\"Scryer's Scroll\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:scryer_scroll\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" that remembers the spot.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.59D53C3170DFF6EC.title": "The control room",
  "quest.59D53C3170DFF6EC.quest_subtitle": "Security cameras, arcane edition.",
  "quest.59D53C3170DFF6EC.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Put Scryer's Scrolls on pedestals around a \"},{\"text\":\"Scryer's Oculus\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:scryers_oculus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and choose which crystal to watch.\"}]",
    "",
    "The crystals must be chunk-loaded."
  ],
  "quest.419FFFFE2574E421.title": "Casting by remote",
  "quest.419FFFFE2574E421.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A turret you aim from your chair.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Use an \"},{\"text\":\"Enchanter's Eye\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:enchanters_eye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" on a Scry Crystal to bind it: its inscribed spell is then cast from the crystal.\"}]",
    "",
    "Blaze powder and ender pearls on a Scry Crystal at the apparatus."
  ],
  "quest.6A4ECF55168AC758.title": "Wilden parts",
  "quest.6A4ECF55168AC758.quest_subtitle": "Horns, wings and spikes, some assembly required.",
  "quest.6A4ECF55168AC758.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hunters drop \"},{\"text\":\"horns\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:wilden_horn\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", Stalkers \"},{\"text\":\"wings\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:wilden_wing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", Defenders \"},{\"text\":\"spikes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:wilden_spike\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Hunter and Stalker dens hide in any forest.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#C7A0F5\"},{\"text\":\"Defenders keep to cold biomes.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.13C8EA9106499916.title": "A tablet that calls the pack",
  "quest.13C8EA9106499916.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Purple archwood, three Wilden drops and a lapis block: the \"},{\"text\":\"Summon Wilden\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_wilden_summon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" tablet.\"}]",
    "",
    "Lit bare, it calls a Wilden pack for a while: the farm for wings and spikes.",
    "",
    "With a horn, a wing and a spike thrown in first, the Chimera."
  ],
  "quest.3560C93C587C0594.title": "Dive-bombed",
  "quest.3560C93C587C0594.quest_subtitle": "Turns out they fly.",
  "quest.3560C93C587C0594.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"They commit to the bit.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Stalker climbed, dove and exploded at your feet.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.2C837CE528C8524A.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.1607A6491A418849.title": "Wings for the whole base",
  "quest.1607A6491A418849.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Purple archwood, three Wilden Wings, two diamonds and an ender pearl: \"},{\"text\":\"Flight\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_flight\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Near the brazier, a jump grants creative flight for a while, paid in Source from nearby jars."
  ],
  "quest.4C917EB19C67E227.title": "Grounded",
  "quest.4C917EB19C67E227.quest_subtitle": "Flight's evil twin.",
  "quest.4C917EB19C67E227.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Gravity ritual caught you: no flying and a heavy fall for a while.\"}]",
    "",
    "Somebody in your team has a sense of humor."
  ],
  "reward.75FE27B3DE916336.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.08AEC6B9FC9B87BE.title": "The trees get up",
  "quest.08AEC6B9FC9B87BE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Archwood, four archwood saplings and four Source Gems: \"},{\"text\":\"Awakening\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_awakening\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "It turns nearby archwood trees into Weald Walkers that guard a spot, and budding amethyst into Amethyst Golems.",
    "",
    "Book and quills in the brazier give Bookwyrm charms."
  ],
  "quest.395B1D0782E5F18E.title": "Landscaping by ritual",
  "quest.395B1D0782E5F18E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Forestation\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_forestation\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" plants grown oaks and birches; \"},{\"text\":\"Flowering\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_flowering\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" fills the ground with flowers and grass.\"}]",
    "",
    "Each Source Gem in the brazier widens them by a block.",
    "",
    "The Conjure Island tablets raise a round island of grass or sand."
  ],
  "quest.21F0ABD5BEF8915C.title": "Weather on request",
  "quest.21F0ABD5BEF8915C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Cloudshaping\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_cloudshaping\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" clears the sky; gunpowder in the brazier makes rain, a lapis block a storm.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Moonfall\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_moonfall\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns the day to night, for when Sunrise overdid it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3F3603B858A3C2FE.title": "The ranch and the grinder",
  "quest.3F3603B858A3C2FE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fertility\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_fertility\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" keeps nearby animals breeding, up to twenty of them.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Disintegration\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:ritual_disintegration\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns monsters into Experience Gems worth double, with no item drops. Both run on Source.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0479D6A76E4CE375.title": "Focus of Summoning",
  "quest.0479D6A76E4CE375.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A Source block with a horn, a spike, a wing, the \"},{\"text\":\"Wilden Tribute\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:wilden_tribute\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and gold: the \"},{\"text\":\"Focus of Summoning\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"ars_nouveau:summon_focus\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Summons last longer and hit harder, and Self spells copy onto them."
  ],
  "quest.1C642782C9F81045.title": "Feed the starbuncle",
  "quest.1C642782C9F81045.quest_subtitle": "Off the clock.",
  "quest.1C642782C9F81045.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"It works for gold, but it won't turn down a treat.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: just a happy starbuncle."
  ],
  "quest.353551056421D6D1.title": "Knock over the inkwell",
  "quest.353551056421D6D1.quest_subtitle": "Every scribe's rite of passage.",
  "quest.353551056421D6D1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A page isn't really written until somebody has ruined one.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: just a stain."
  ],
  "image.2866B7F5AD186E56.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "image.607ACE330E8C390B.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"ARS NOUVEAU\",\"color\":\"#2B2148\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.0AE03DEBB0C987AC.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"four schools one circle\",\"color\":\"#6A5A8A\",\"font\":\"minecraft:alt\"}]",
  "image.13FA294BD8027ED0.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Spellcraft\",\"color\":\"#2B2148\"}]",
  "image.4F1F02312AEA49B1.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Tools of the trade\",\"color\":\"#2B2148\"}]",
  "image.72096C887E5ED3A8.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Armor and threads\",\"color\":\"#2B2148\"}]",
  "image.5FFD4878F9FBBEA0.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Source\",\"color\":\"#2B2148\"}]",
  "image.1586E11E8F3D9845.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Rituals and familiars\",\"color\":\"#2B2148\"}]",
  "image.2B65A6B7EE39A668.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The wild and the Wilden\",\"color\":\"#2B2148\"}]",
  "image.671A781A0DBDE550.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Creatures at work\",\"color\":\"#2B2148\"}]",
  "image.43681F736A99C84A.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Potions and scrying\",\"color\":\"#2B2148\"}]",
  "image.0F1CD320D8150A34.title": "Resting Drygmy, a painting from Ars Nouveau",
  "chapter.48BC3B6935A4143B.title": "Apotheosis · Adventure",
  "chapter.48BC3B6935A4143B.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Affix loot from Common to Mythic, gem families and purities, salvaging, reforging and Invaders, up the World Tier mountain that the story climbs for you."
  ],
  "task.1B6CB2AF28738493.title": "Any Apotheosis gem",
  "quest.7904F35EDB118489.title": "Loot with opinions",
  "quest.7904F35EDB118489.quest_subtitle": "The sword you find may beat the one you made.",
  "quest.7904F35EDB118489.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Gear now drops with affixes, and gems drop beside it.\"}]",
    "",
    "Affixes are extra stats named on the item, coloured by rarity.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"25%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" of vanilla chests hold a gem; monsters you kill yourself drop one about \"},{\"text\":\"4%\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" of the time.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3B2622C422A7A223.title": "Read the colour",
  "quest.3B2622C422A7A223.quest_subtitle": "Gray: the colour of humble beginnings.",
  "quest.3B2622C422A7A223.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Gray is \"},{\"text\":\"Common\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": one stat, sometimes two.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Salvaged, it gives \"},{\"text\":\"Mysterious Scrap Metal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:mysterious_scrap_metal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In Haven, \"},{\"text\":\"60%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" of drops are Common: stone tools, leather, chainmail.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2239D43E4DF40534.title": "Uncommon green",
  "quest.2239D43E4DF40534.quest_subtitle": "Not a single tear in it, somehow.",
  "quest.2239D43E4DF40534.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Green is \"},{\"text\":\"Uncommon\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": two stats.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Sometimes an effect and a socket too.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Salvaged, it gives \"},{\"text\":\"Timeworn Fabric\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:timeworn_fabric\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Over a third of Haven's drops, and \"},{\"text\":\"60%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" at Frontier.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.6E5D6CED96A21A2D.title": "Your team completes Act II",
  "quest.7A5070A642F45370.title": "Frontier",
  "quest.7A5070A642F45370.quest_subtitle": "The story sets your tier.",
  "quest.7A5070A642F45370.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Act II done: your whole team rises to Frontier, for good.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"You earn \"},{\"text\":\"+35%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" experience, and the table reaches \"},{\"text\":\"75\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Eterna.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Monsters get \"},{\"text\":\"+4\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" armor, and Invaders start to arrive.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6A1ED011EE674073.title": "Rare blue",
  "quest.6A1ED011EE674073.quest_subtitle": "A shard of the brightest crystal ever. Allegedly.",
  "quest.6A1ED011EE674073.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Blue is \"},{\"text\":\"Rare\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": real effects start here.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Up to two sockets and \"},{\"text\":\"10 to 25%\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" more durability.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Salvaged: \"},{\"text\":\"Luminous Crystal Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:luminous_crystal_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"10%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" of drops at Frontier, and half of them at Ascent.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.6DD1891503C81DE9.title": "Your team completes Act III",
  "quest.5FCB8953E204F939.title": "Ascent",
  "quest.5FCB8953E204F939.quest_subtitle": "The expedition act gets the good loot.",
  "quest.5FCB8953E204F939.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Act III done: Ascent, just as the expeditions begin.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"You earn \"},{\"text\":\"+55%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" experience, and the table reaches \"},{\"text\":\"90\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Eterna.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Diamond gear drops with affixes.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"One item in ten is Epic.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Monsters get \"},{\"text\":\"+8\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" armor and \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" armor pierce.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3DF87C5F1EF35450.title": "Epic purple",
  "quest.3DF87C5F1EF35450.quest_subtitle": "Sand from a realm where magic warps everything.",
  "quest.3DF87C5F1EF35450.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Purple is \"},{\"text\":\"Epic\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": three stats, an effect, an ability.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"One to three sockets, \"},{\"text\":\"25 to 55%\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" more durability.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Salvaged: \"},{\"text\":\"Arcane Sands\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:arcane_sands\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", which the Reforging Table wants.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4F41B361AB6E48F3.title": "Your team completes Act IV",
  "quest.16D7038A67BD9180.title": "Summit",
  "quest.16D7038A67BD9180.quest_subtitle": "The top, but not the end.",
  "quest.16D7038A67BD9180.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Act IV done and the Ark begins: Summit.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"You earn \"},{\"text\":\"+75%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" experience, and the table gets its full \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Epic becomes usual and Mythic appears.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"A gem can drop Perfect.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Monsters get \"},{\"text\":\"+12\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" armor, \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" toughness and more pierce.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3724B9462B19033C.title": "Mythic orange",
  "quest.3724B9462B19033C.quest_subtitle": "Volatile. Handle with gauntlets.",
  "quest.3724B9462B19033C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Orange is \"},{\"text\":\"Mythic\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": four stats, two effects, an ability.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Only salvaging one gives \"},{\"text\":\"Godforged Pearls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:godforged_pearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"The Augmenting Table, its sigils and the \"},{\"text\":\"Luminous Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:luminous_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" want them.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "One Mythic in twenty comes with four sockets.",
    "",
    "One in a hundred comes Unbreakable."
  ],
  "task.37BE31EFF565EE5A.title": "Your team activates the Ark",
  "quest.28DFFCD308929D12.title": "Pinnacle",
  "quest.28DFFCD308929D12.quest_subtitle": "Where the lightning lives.",
  "quest.28DFFCD308929D12.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Ark's activation opens Act VI and Pinnacle.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"You earn \"},{\"text\":\"+125%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" experience.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"A quarter of drops are Mythic.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"One gem in ten is Perfect.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Monsters get \"},{\"text\":\"+16\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" armor, \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" toughness and \"},{\"text\":\"25\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" armor pierce.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.5C3E987406523E63.title": "A Perfect gem",
  "quest.67A024413D93A15C.title": "Perfect",
  "quest.67A024413D93A15C.quest_subtitle": "It can't be improved. It doesn't need to be.",
  "quest.67A024413D93A15C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The top of the purity ladder, one cut above Flawless.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"A second Flawless gem and \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Gem Dust\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"27\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" crystal shards\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Arcane Sands\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Godforged Pearls\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At Pinnacle, \"},{\"text\":\"10%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" of gems drop Perfect anyway.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6CBF0EEB024203B7.title": "Where your stats live",
  "quest.6CBF0EEB024203B7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Your inventory's Show Attributes button lists every attribute you have.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Crit chance, life steal, dodge and the rest, in one place.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.keyboard.left.shift\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" over one to see where each modifier comes from.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.19A3C2824330197A.title": "The tier screen",
  "quest.19A3C2824330197A.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.apotheosis.open_world_tier_select\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" opens the World Tier screen.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Detailed Info: each tier's buffs and the odds of every rarity and purity.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Its Activate button stays off: here the story moves the tier.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.008DCF98C026BD08.title": "Potion charms",
  "quest.008DCF98C026BD08.quest_subtitle": "The potion that never runs dry.",
  "quest.008DCF98C026BD08.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A potion you wear instead of drinking.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_powder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Three potions of one kind between six \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Powder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_powder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a \"},{\"text\":\"Potion Charm\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:potion_charm\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"It outlasts all three potions together.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Right-click to switch it on, in the inventory or the Curios charm slot.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.79E0FA9721B1DCCA.title": "Potion of Ancient Knowledge",
  "quest.7F604552BBE6113B.title": "Ancient knowledge",
  "quest.7F604552BBE6113B.quest_subtitle": "Study hard, hunt harder.",
  "quest.7F604552BBE6113B.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Awkward Potion + a \"},{\"text\":\"Bottle o' Enchanting\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:experience_bottle\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": Ancient Knowledge.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Experience from what you kill, \"},{\"text\":\"×4\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"; \"},{\"text\":\"×8\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" at level II.\"}]",
    "",
    "In a charm, it keeps the table's levels coming."
  ],
  "task.2E2EE4EB43D5F615.title": "Potion of Flying",
  "quest.158B11A1DFC87818.title": "Potion of Flying",
  "quest.158B11A1DFC87818.quest_subtitle": "Creative mode, eight minutes at a time.",
  "quest.158B11A1DFC87818.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Brew flight in two steps.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:fermented_spider_eye\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Slow Falling and a fermented spider eye: Levitation.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:popped_chorus_fruit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Then \"},{\"text\":\"Popped Chorus Fruit\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:popped_chorus_fruit\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Flying\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"8 min\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" of creative flight; in a charm, as long as the charm lasts.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.36928F77AF7F21AF.title": "Secret found",
  "task.5FD66D9C71308395.title": "Potion of Resistance",
  "task.05C0AECF90F898FA.title": "Potion of Haste",
  "task.48CED0122C8041EA.title": "Potion of Absorption",
  "quest.39388F7659238C8A.title": "Brews vanilla never had",
  "quest.39388F7659238C8A.quest_subtitle": "Finally, a use for mushroom stew.",
  "quest.39388F7659238C8A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every one starts from an Awkward Potion.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:shulker_shell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Resistance\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": a \"},{\"text\":\"Shulker Shell\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:shulker_shell\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". With a spider eye, Sundering.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:mushroom_stew\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Haste\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"Mushroom Stew\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:mushroom_stew\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". With a spider eye, Mining Fatigue.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:golden_apple\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Absorption\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": a \"},{\"text\":\"Golden Apple\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:golden_apple\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sweet_berries\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Bursting Vitality\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": sweet berries. With a spider eye, Grievous Wounds.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Wither\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": a wither skeleton skull.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4D4D5A74E00AE18B.title": "An Unbreakable Potion Charm",
  "quest.061ED2B0BE904CF1.title": "A charm that never breaks",
  "quest.061ED2B0BE904CF1.quest_subtitle": "One potion, forever.",
  "quest.061ED2B0BE904CF1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Infuse a charm and it becomes \"},{\"text\":\"Unbreakable\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": the effect, forever.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Exactly \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Eterna\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"8.5 to 13.5\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Quanta\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"32.5 to 37.5\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Arcana\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The narrow Quanta window is the hard part: \"},{\"text\":\"shelves that subtract\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"20E2542625AE6112\"}},{\"text\":\" help.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.7963D4A37B1258EA.title": "Find a tome tower in a forest, plains or hills",
  "quest.6FC97DEE593B0195.title": "Tome towers",
  "quest.6FC97DEE593B0195.quest_subtitle": "A library, with a trap.",
  "quest.6FC97DEE593B0195.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Stone towers full of bookshelves.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"In forests, plains and mountains.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Deserts, jungles and taigas have their own.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"4\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" item frames hold gems.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The chest, with enchanted books, gems and affix gear, is trapped.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6573B89ED7F30C13.title": "The trader got better",
  "quest.6573B89ED7F30C13.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Apotheosis restocks the Wandering Trader.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:emerald\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Beacons, totems, enchanted golden apples, diamonds, skulls for the table.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"He can also turn up underground.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"From Summit he may carry \"},{\"text\":\"named relics\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"50530C7F2CE1224D\"}},{\"text\":\" too.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.50530C7F2CE1224D.title": "Named relics",
  "quest.50530C7F2CE1224D.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"From Summit, the trader may sell a named diamond relic.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Treecapitator\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Stonebreaker\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Bonesplitter\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Captive Dreams\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" and more.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:emerald\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Pay with the matching diamond piece and \"},{\"text\":\"45\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" emeralds.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Ten in all, with enchantments past vanilla, like Sharpness X on Bonesplitter.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eternal Vigilance asks a diamond and \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" phantom membranes instead.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.45FAFFA50C505D1C.title": "Rogue spawners",
  "quest.45FAFFA50C505D1C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Some caves hide a lone spawner over a chest.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Brutal\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": fireproof zombies or pillagers with half again their health, every \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" s.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Swarm\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": sped-up spiders, silverfish or baby zombies.\"}]",
    "",
    "About one chest in nine is the valuable kind."
  ],
  "quest.71BCDEB56D856B4E.title": "Invaders from the sky",
  "quest.71BCDEB56D856B4E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"From Frontier, an Apothic Invader can land nearby.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"A noise, a chat message and a beacon beam, in full enchanted gear.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"It always drops one affix item of its rarity, named after it.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Here at most one comes every \"},{\"text\":\"10 min\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.612CD8086FE74C5B.title": "Size up an invader",
  "quest.612CD8086FE74C5B.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Look at an invader: Jade names its rarity and its boss modifiers.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Name and outline wear that rarity's colour.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"It shows: a Mythic zombie carries \"},{\"text\":\"110 to 180\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" extra health, an Uncommon one \"},{\"text\":\"20\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"60\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.2BBA8EFEA68AF991.title": "Caged Invaders",
  "quest.2BBA8EFEA68AF991.quest_subtitle": "Please do not feed the invader.",
  "quest.2BBA8EFEA68AF991.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Hidden rooms deep in the caves each hold a Caged Invader.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Come within \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" blocks and it breaks free, in any tier.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"In Haven it is the only invader you will meet.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Its trophy follows your tier.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5AB22608149A92E7.title": "Touched by Malice",
  "quest.5AB22608149A92E7.quest_subtitle": "Power has a price: another affix.",
  "quest.5AB22608149A92E7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Invaders often drop a \"},{\"text\":\"Sigil of Malice\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:sigil_of_malice\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At a Smithing Table, on an item with two affixes or more, one affix at random gets \"},{\"text\":\"50%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" stronger. Once per item.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Another one, also at random, is destroyed.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Its cousin, the Sigil of Supremacy, only comes from Gateways to Eternity, which this pack does not include."
  ],
  "quest.7AF5662234017803.title": "Elites",
  "quest.7AF5662234017803.quest_subtitle": "They don't ring the doorbell.",
  "quest.7AF5662234017803.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"From Frontier, some monsters come named and empowered.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"A Honeyed Archer on an angry bee, an Undead Knight on a skeleton horse.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"In the Nether, a Withering Archer in a cloud of wither.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Some carry an affix item.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "At Pinnacle, one goat in two hundred is Craig the Eternal.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four times the size, \"},{\"text\":\"4,096\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" extra health, and a sheep called jeb_ at his side.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.27F610E8727DFFDA.title": "One of the three invader discs",
  "quest.55B825A10C4018FB.title": "Boss music",
  "quest.55B825A10C4018FB.quest_subtitle": "Every fight deserves a soundtrack.",
  "quest.55B825A10C4018FB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Twelve kinds of invader roll a richer bonus.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A gem, a Sigil of Malice or, \"},{\"text\":\"5%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" of the time, a music disc:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Flash, by Renren\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Glimmer, by Caner Crebes\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Shimmer, by Chamberlain Kaifry\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.5841683478ADD8C4.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.21221E9000F809E7.title": "Invaders abroad",
  "quest.21221E9000F809E7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Other worlds send their own invaders.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Nether: six, blazes and piglin brutes among them, anywhere under its roof.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"End: five, only on the outer islands.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Twilight Forest: eight, \"},{\"text\":\"two to three times\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" as often as the Overworld.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.2A5F4A7F6022EF00.title": "Defeat the Wither",
  "quest.1C881E982AEC5E3A.title": "A star for the table",
  "quest.1C881E982AEC5E3A.quest_subtitle": "Three skulls, one bad afternoon.",
  "quest.1C881E982AEC5E3A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Augmenting Table is built around a \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Star\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:nether_star\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "So the Wither comes first.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Careful: \",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Fight it far from anything you want to keep.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The Wither, step by step.\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"617F3D63E49031FA\"}}]"
  ],
  "quest.30179152BFACCA2A.title": "The Augmenting Table",
  "quest.30179152BFACCA2A.quest_subtitle": "Fine-tuning a legend.",
  "quest.30179152BFACCA2A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Augmenting Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:augmenting_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" edits one affix and leaves the rest alone.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Upgrade\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"25%\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" stronger, for \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" sigils and \"},{\"text\":\"225\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" levels.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Reroll\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": another of its type, for \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" sigil and \"},{\"text\":\"175\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" levels. The options show on the left first.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A Nether Star, two Godforged Pearls, an enchanting table and three polished blackstone.",
    "",
    "Meant for Mythic items, maybe Epic ones."
  ],
  "quest.029CF3492455ABAA.title": "Sigils of Enhancement",
  "quest.029CF3492455ABAA.quest_subtitle": "One pearl, four sigils.",
  "quest.029CF3492455ABAA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Augmenting Table's fuel.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Gem Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:gem_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Gem-Fused Slate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:gem_fused_slate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and a Godforged Pearl make \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Sigils of Enhancement\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:sigil_of_enhancement\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Every sigil is a pearl you did not spend on a Perfect gem."
  ],
  "quest.17B029BBFF83450F.title": "God-fused",
  "quest.17B029BBFF83450F.quest_subtitle": "A pearl, only more so.",
  "quest.17B029BBFF83450F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Infuse a Godforged Pearl at exactly \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Eterna.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"About \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Quanta and \"},{\"text\":\"59\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Arcana.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"God-Fused Pearl\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:god_fused_pearl\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": two build \"},{\"text\":\"the Raven's table\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"60EC9EDD56376A7D\"}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.6936553DF77B4F9D.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.1AC33FE41F2CF11A.title": "Drop an anvil on it",
  "quest.1AC33FE41F2CF11A.quest_subtitle": "Crude, loud, effective.",
  "quest.1AC33FE41F2CF11A.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The first gems get crushed the old way.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Drop an anvil on a gem lying on the ground: \"},{\"text\":\"Gem Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:gem_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Dust builds the Salvaging Table, and from then on the table does it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.68AAA05EFC819AB1.title": "Gem-fused slate",
  "quest.68AAA05EFC819AB1.quest_subtitle": "Deepslate, with a secret.",
  "quest.68AAA05EFC819AB1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every sigil and template starts here.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight \"},{\"text\":\"Deepslate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:deepslate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around one \"},{\"text\":\"Gem Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:gem_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Gem-Fused Slate\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:gem_fused_slate\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Socketing, withdrawal, rebirth, unnaming and enhancement sigils all eat it."
  ],
  "quest.01CA501717FC9BB8.title": "Salvage everything",
  "quest.01CA501717FC9BB8.quest_subtitle": "One adventurer's junk is another's pearl.",
  "quest.01CA501717FC9BB8.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Salvaging Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:salvaging_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes apart what you won't wear.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Affix items give \"},{\"text\":\"1 to 4\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" materials of their rarity.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Gems: dust.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Plain vanilla gear: ingots or diamonds.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:copper_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Three copper ingots\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_pickaxe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"An iron pickaxe and axe\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"A smithing table\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:lava_bucket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Two Gem Dust and a lava bucket\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3A7D5B6EDB6F6B3C.title": "Gems back to dust",
  "quest.3A7D5B6EDB6F6B3C.quest_subtitle": "Not every gem gets a ring.",
  "quest.3A7D5B6EDB6F6B3C.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Spare gems go back to dust: the purer, the more.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Cracked \"},{\"text\":\"1-2\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" · Chipped \"},{\"text\":\"1-3\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" · Flawed \"},{\"text\":\"2-4\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Normal \"},{\"text\":\"3-5\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" · Flawless \"},{\"text\":\"4-7\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" · Perfect \"},{\"text\":\"5-10\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Gem Dust\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:gem_dust\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" feeds every cut, sigil and slate.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.07BD64834D15827D.title": "Salvage the plain stuff too",
  "quest.07BD64834D15827D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Vanilla gear salvages too:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:iron_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Iron armor: \"},{\"text\":\"1-3\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" ingots\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:diamond\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond armor: \"},{\"text\":\"1-3\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" diamonds\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:netherite_scrap\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Netherite gear: up to \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" netherite scrap\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Horse armor: \"},{\"text\":\"3-8\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" ingots or diamonds\"}]",
    "",
    "Keep a table by the trash can."
  ],
  "quest.2426B53E96944C95.title": "Two Apotheosis keys",
  "quest.2426B53E96944C95.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.apotheosis.toggle_radial_mining\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" switches radial mining on tools with the Radial affix.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.apotheosis.link_item_to_chat\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" links the item under your cursor to chat.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Its own comparison is off: Equipment Compare already shows it.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4A5FBC9E2F7A3860.title": "Gems and sockets",
  "quest.4A5FBC9E2F7A3860.quest_subtitle": "Some assembly required.",
  "quest.4A5FBC9E2F7A3860.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A gem goes into a socket at a Smithing Table.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Each gem lists the items it fits.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Sigil of Socketing\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:sigil_of_socketing\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds a socket, \"},{\"text\":\"up to two\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Four Gem Dust, three Gem-Fused Slate, gunpowder and an amethyst shard make three sigils."
  ],
  "quest.21CE9709A73B86DB.title": "Take them back",
  "quest.21CE9709A73B86DB.quest_subtitle": "Gems are forever. Sockets aren't.",
  "quest.21CE9709A73B86DB.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Sigil of Withdrawal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:sigil_of_withdrawal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" frees every gem in an item.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"At a Smithing Table you get back the item and all its gems.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Moving to better gear costs nothing.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Four slate, a blaze rod, two ender pearls, a lava bucket and Gem Dust make four."
  ],
  "quest.2B16672990E6A285.title": "Cutting gems",
  "quest.2B16672990E6A285.quest_subtitle": "Two gems in, one better gem out.",
  "quest.2B16672990E6A285.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Gem Cutting Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:gem_cutting_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" raises a gem's purity one step.\"}]",
    "",
    "It eats a second gem of the same kind and purity, plus dust and rarity materials.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"6\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" rungs, from \"},{\"text\":\"Cracked\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"Perfect\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\". \"},{\"text\":\"The reward pays your first cut\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\", Cracked to Chipped.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Two smooth stone, shears, four planks and Gem Dust."
  ],
  "task.630CDE09075B35ED.title": "A Chipped gem",
  "quest.068419A21CA5B010.title": "Chipped",
  "quest.068419A21CA5B010.quest_subtitle": "The first cut is the cheapest.",
  "quest.068419A21CA5B010.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The first cut: two Cracked gems of one kind make a Chipped one.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Gem Dust\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" scrap metal\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" fabric\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In Haven, \"},{\"text\":\"41%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" of gems already drop Chipped.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4F1DA9D3BE36B201.title": "A Flawed gem",
  "quest.2F333AA4F42F3CBD.title": "Flawed",
  "quest.2F333AA4F42F3CBD.quest_subtitle": "Flawed, and proud of it.",
  "quest.2F333AA4F42F3CBD.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The second cut, Chipped to Flawed.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Gem Dust\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" scrap\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" fabric\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" crystal shard\"}]",
    "",
    "From Ascent most gems drop Flawed, and gems from other dimensions never drop worse."
  ],
  "task.3897D4730D42F474.title": "A Normal gem",
  "quest.6097FA90D262EBA1.title": "Normal",
  "quest.6097FA90D262EBA1.quest_subtitle": "Ordinary is a purity too.",
  "quest.6097FA90D262EBA1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The third cut, Flawed to Normal.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Gem Dust\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"27\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" scrap\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" fabric\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" shards\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" sands\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Summit's usual drop: almost \"},{\"text\":\"60%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" of gems.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.6D35A04D42620126.title": "A Flawless gem",
  "quest.2EC669D201EA9C1F.title": "Flawless",
  "quest.2EC669D201EA9C1F.quest_subtitle": "Almost there.",
  "quest.2EC669D201EA9C1F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The fourth cut, Normal to Flawless.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"7\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Gem Dust\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"27\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" fabric\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" shards\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" sands\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Godforged Pearl\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At Ascent \"},{\"text\":\"1%\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" of gems drop Flawless; at Pinnacle, half.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5268C4373B1B787E.title": "The Gem Case",
  "quest.5268C4373B1B787E.quest_subtitle": "For the dragon in all of us.",
  "quest.5268C4373B1B787E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Gem Case\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:gem_case\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is where gems wait for a socket.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It holds \"},{\"text\":\"32,000\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" of each gem and purity.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"It filters by name or by what fits an item.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"It cuts gems itself from six side slots.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Three glass, four basalt, a Gem Cutting Table and an ender chest.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Infused at \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Eterna, \"},{\"text\":\"100\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Quanta, \"},{\"text\":\"45\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Arcana: the \"},{\"text\":\"Gem Case of House Fabergé\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:ender_gem_case\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "Two billion of each, and it keeps what the old case held."
  ],
  "task.568AC4035BD68B1C.title": "Gem of the Frozen Queen",
  "quest.0A917B487A123513.title": "A frozen queen's gem",
  "quest.0A917B487A123513.quest_subtitle": "Cold hands, warm heart.",
  "quest.0A917B487A123513.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A gem found only in the Twilight Forest.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Gem of the Frozen Queen\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", from Summit.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Chest: a chance of Twilight Shields when hit.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Melee kills drop more loot; bows freeze.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.7384D057765473D3.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.540189E6AF8A9257.title": "Reforging",
  "quest.540189E6AF8A9257.quest_subtitle": "Three choices, no guarantees.",
  "quest.540189E6AF8A9257.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Reroll an item's affixes, up to Rare.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Simple Reforging Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:simple_reforging_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" takes any valid item, even one with no affixes yet.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Rarity materials and \"},{\"text\":\"Sigils of Rebirth\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:sigil_of_rebirth\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" pay.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"It offers \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" choices; the second and third cost double and triple.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "An iron ingot, two Gem Dust, an enchanting table and three smooth stone."
  ],
  "quest.79B807A275A900F7.title": "Keep the affixes, upgrade the base",
  "quest.79B807A275A900F7.quest_subtitle": "Stone to diamond, one template at a time.",
  "quest.79B807A275A900F7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Stone to iron, gold and diamond, affixes intact.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Scrap: stone or chain to iron\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Fabric: iron to gold\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Shard: gold to diamond\"}]",
    "",
    "At the Smithing Table, with four ingots or diamonds.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Two slate, four stone and the rarity material make two templates."
  ],
  "quest.4AB8D5D286618E49.title": "Just call it a sword",
  "quest.4AB8D5D286618E49.quest_subtitle": "Of the Earthbreaker, of the Butcher, of the... no.",
  "quest.4AB8D5D286618E49.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Strip the long affix name off an item.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"With a \"},{\"text\":\"Sigil of Unnaming\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:sigil_of_unnaming\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", at a Smithing Table. Every affix stays.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Then an anvil names it whatever you like.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Six slate and three flint make six."
  ],
  "quest.4B5334A4F9F09A92.title": "Epic and beyond",
  "quest.4B5334A4F9F09A92.quest_subtitle": "Netherite, but make it rerollable.",
  "quest.4B5334A4F9F09A92.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Reforging Table\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"apotheosis:reforging_table\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" also reforges \"},{\"text\":\"Epic\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" and \"},{\"text\":\"Mythic\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A Mythic reroll costs \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" levels, \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Godforged Pearls and \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" sigils.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Upgrade the simple table with a netherite ingot, two Arcane Sands and three nether bricks."
  ],
  "quest.06EFE94997A63F4F.title": "What a reroll costs",
  "quest.06EFE94997A63F4F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Base cost of the first choice, by rarity:\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Common: \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" levels, \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" scrap\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Uncommon: \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" levels, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" fabric, \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" sigil\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Rare: \"},{\"text\":\"15\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" levels, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" shards, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" sigils\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Epic: \"},{\"text\":\"30\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" levels, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" sands, \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" sigils\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Mythic: \"},{\"text\":\"50\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" levels, \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" pearls, \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" sigils\"}]",
    "",
    "The second and third choice cost double and triple."
  ],
  "quest.321CB17CC82D127F.title": "Scrap for the common store",
  "quest.321CB17CC82D127F.quest_subtitle": "Somebody's junk drawer.",
  "quest.321CB17CC82D127F.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Salvage what you won't wear: the cheapest way to keep a team's gems climbing.\"}]",
    "",
    "Once a day:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"32\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Mysterious Scrap Metal\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" Timeworn Fabric\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.25EED396131321FF.title": "Which gem fits where",
  "quest.25EED396131321FF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Each gem names the items it fits, by group.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Weapons\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": melee and tridents\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Core armor\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": chest and legs\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Lower armor\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": legs and boots\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Tools\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": mining tools and shears\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Bows, shields, helmets and boots have their own. \"},{\"text\":\"Unique\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" gems go in once per item.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Unique: the ten that drop in only one dimension, plus Breach, Combatant, Samurai, Slipstream and Tyrannical."
  ],
  "task.47030C4DAF722E8E.title": "Ballast Gem",
  "task.3AB351EEA086467D.title": "Brawler's Gem",
  "task.6F6E97E28A51CCC4.title": "Gem of the Warlord",
  "quest.745DC7A5917865C7.title": "Heavier hands",
  "quest.745DC7A5917865C7.quest_subtitle": "Blunt instruments, sharp gems.",
  "quest.745DC7A5917865C7.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three gems for hitting harder, by item.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Ballast\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": weapon +damage · tools durability · chest and legs knockback resistance\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Brawler's\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": weapon +attack speed · chest and legs +health · shield +% health\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Warlord\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": weapon and bow crit damage · chest +health · helmet +damage\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At Perfect, Ballast adds +\"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" damage and Brawler's +\"},{\"text\":\"50%\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" attack speed.\"}]",
    "",
    "On a trident, Warlord lends Strength from Flawless."
  ],
  "task.7DA0577134BFA54A.title": "Solar Gem",
  "task.0B4FEB956B2A5396.title": "Lunar Gem",
  "quest.39EE0E3901E693A5.title": "Sun and moon",
  "quest.39EE0E3901E693A5.quest_subtitle": "One burns, one freezes. Both mess with gravity.",
  "quest.39EE0E3901E693A5.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two opposite gems.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Solar\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": weapon +fire damage · chest and legs heavier · boots +step height\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Lunar\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": weapon +cold damage · chest and legs lighter · boots +swim speed\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"At Perfect each adds \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" elemental damage, and the gravity swing reaches \"},{\"text\":\"104%\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "task.0A901C9B19446B27.title": "Guardian Gem",
  "task.6A5BFE3157D2B72B.title": "Tyrannical Gem",
  "quest.78EE15C4D337816E.title": "Stand your ground",
  "quest.78EE15C4D337816E.quest_subtitle": "Rooted, armored, rude.",
  "quest.78EE15C4D337816E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Two gems for staying up.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Guardian\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": chest and legs +armor · weapon life steal · shield +% armor\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Tyrannical\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", unique: weapon knockback · chest and legs toughness · shield +% toughness\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Tyrannical also swaps life steal for health on boots, and bows bleed their targets from Flawless."
  ],
  "task.45893B3CE5A17695.title": "Gem of the Samurai",
  "task.65E61732A826FA12.title": "Breach Gem",
  "task.0768FA874A42B0F5.title": "Gem of the Combatant",
  "quest.634C4D01B0F963AF.title": "Find the gap",
  "quest.634C4D01B0F963AF.quest_subtitle": "Armor is a suggestion.",
  "quest.634C4D01B0F963AF.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three unique gems for precision.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Samurai\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": weapon and bow crit chance · shield dodge\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Breach\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": weapon armor pierce · tools reach · bow protection pierce\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Combatant\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": bow and trident arrow damage · chest and legs physical damage reduction\"}]"
  ],
  "task.7ABB04E411C113CD.title": "Lightning Gem",
  "task.3B3DA332C541E736.title": "Slipstream Gem",
  "task.2C91DD020B2B997B.title": "Splendor Gem",
  "quest.58EF0E58DFD4879E.title": "Quicker, luckier",
  "quest.58EF0E58DFD4879E.quest_subtitle": "Speed, and a little luck on top.",
  "quest.58EF0E58DFD4879E.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three gems for speed and fortune.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Lightning\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": bow arrow speed · tools mining speed · legs and boots movement\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Slipstream\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", unique: bow draw speed · tools mining speed · boots dodge\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Splendor\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": armor luck · weapons and tools more experience\"}]"
  ],
  "task.7CA39CFEA82B73C8.title": "Gem of the Earth",
  "task.3B8BAF384879F32C.title": "Gem of the Royal Family",
  "task.194446A3B88BFDA3.title": "Gem of the Verdant Ruin",
  "quest.01E0167A624CC8C4.title": "The Overworld's three",
  "quest.01E0167A624CC8C4.quest_subtitle": "Home-grown royalty.",
  "quest.01E0167A624CC8C4.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Three unique gems, only in the Overworld.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Earth\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": more levels of the Sharpness, Protection or Fortune you already have.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Royal Family\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": helmet +% to all stats; pickaxe turns copper ore into raw gold.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Verdant Ruin\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": weapons shred armor; chest resists magic; pickaxe mines an area.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "They drop from Frontier on, Flawed or better, and only in the Overworld."
  ],
  "task.3C06D76067D189E0.title": "Gem of the Incandescent Inferno",
  "task.128191BF10A8D07A.title": "Gem of the Ravenous Blood Lord",
  "task.562570334A526DF3.title": "Gem of the Molten Breach",
  "quest.7A6995FE4EC40640.title": "The Nether's three",
  "quest.7A6995FE4EC40640.quest_subtitle": "Hot, hungry and very large.",
  "quest.7A6995FE4EC40640.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"From Ascent, the Nether drops three unique gems.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Incandescent Inferno\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": chest gains Berserker's Fury; pickaxe, Efficiency.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Ravenous Blood Lord\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": weapon life steal; bow trades health for damage.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Molten Breach\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": weapon protection pierce; leggings make you bigger; tools mine anything.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.10CB77DE953790DA.title": "Endersurge Gem",
  "task.6E2F4063F0790488.title": "Gem of the Mageslayer",
  "quest.5C82E14DD6034756.title": "The End's two",
  "quest.5C82E14DD6034756.quest_subtitle": "Worth the long walk.",
  "quest.5C82E14DD6034756.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"From Summit, the End drops two unique gems.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Endersurge\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", Flawless or better: \"},{\"text\":\"+1 level\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" to every enchantment an item has, +\"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" at Perfect.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Mageslayer\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": helmet ignores magic damage and heals it; shields grant Resistance.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.4F02C7AF08416523.title": "Gem of the Twilight Forest",
  "quest.7150005D14DB5BFA.title": "Treasure goblins",
  "quest.7150005D14DB5BFA.quest_subtitle": "Hit things. Sometimes, a goblin with pockets.",
  "quest.7150005D14DB5BFA.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"The Twilight Forest has its own gem.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_icons\",\"color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Gem of the Twilight Forest\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", from Summit.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"In a weapon, hits may summon a \"},{\"text\":\"Treasure Goblin\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": kill it for potions, gems and affix gear.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"In a pickaxe, it works as an ore magnet.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.49E56FC201CC3367.title": "Four kinds of affix",
  "quest.49E56FC201CC3367.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"What an affix item carries grows with its rarity.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Stats\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": attribute bonuses, on every rarity.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Effects\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\": potions on hit, drops to your feet, radial mining. Rare always has one.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Abilities\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" like Cleaving or Executing, from Epic. \"},{\"text\":\"Sockets\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" and durability too.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.59BC68889C60228B.title": "Reforge an iron sword to Rare",
  "quest.684AF823D59C83A0.title": "Melee affixes",
  "quest.684AF823D59C83A0.quest_subtitle": "Swords with a résumé.",
  "quest.684AF823D59C83A0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"What a melee weapon can roll.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Stats: damage, attack speed, crit, life steal, overheal, fire and cold, armor pierce.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Effects on hit: Bleeding, Sundering, Weakness, Ancient Knowledge.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"From Epic: \"},{\"text\":\"Cleaving\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Executing\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Thunderstruck\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Festive\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Festive turns some kills into a loot piñata.",
    "",
    "Any sword reforged with Rare materials comes out Rare."
  ],
  "task.1688BD78FAEF74FA.title": "Reforge a bow to Rare",
  "quest.33D41A678FE6D0E0.title": "Bow and crossbow affixes",
  "quest.33D41A678FE6D0E0.quest_subtitle": "Arrows with extra steps.",
  "quest.33D41A678FE6D0E0.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"What a bow or crossbow can roll.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Stats: draw speed, arrow damage and speed, movement.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Effects on hit: Slowness, Poison, Wither, Levitation, Grievous Wounds.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"From Epic: \"},{\"text\":\"Spectral\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" shoots a second arrow; \"},{\"text\":\"Magical\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" hits as magic; \"},{\"text\":\"Prosperous\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", Looting VI to X.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.6BE43A7C9F883D58.title": "Reforge an iron chestplate to Rare",
  "quest.55AE4A81A90A4719.title": "Armor affixes",
  "quest.55AE4A81A90A4719.quest_subtitle": "Plate with a personality.",
  "quest.55AE4A81A90A4719.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"What armor can roll.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Stats: armor, toughness, health, luck, knockback resistance, speed, step height.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Less damage by type: physical, blasts, projectiles, falls, lightning, magic.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Chestplates can fly: \"},{\"text\":\"Winged\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" from Epic; \"},{\"text\":\"Unbound\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", creative flight, Mythic only.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A carved pumpkin or a mob skull counts as a helmet, affixes and all."
  ],
  "task.6AD252B0DC244B55.title": "Reforge an iron pickaxe to Rare",
  "quest.11ED8D5725977401.title": "Tool affixes",
  "quest.11ED8D5725977401.quest_subtitle": "The pickaxe that places its own torches.",
  "quest.11ED8D5725977401.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"What mining tools and shears can roll.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Stats: mining speed, reach, underwater mining, experience.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Effects: \"},{\"text\":\"Radial\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" mining up to \"},{\"text\":\"5x5\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\", \"},{\"text\":\"Omnetic\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" (any block), more Fortune, Haste.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"From Rare, \"},{\"text\":\"Enlightened\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" places torches.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Mythic \"},{\"text\":\"Super-Massive\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" mines \"},{\"text\":\"7x7\",\"font\":\"entrelumen:quest_big\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Telepathic, on tools and weapons, sends the drops straight to you.",
    "",
    "Shears can swap flowers and leaves."
  ],
  "task.58983D3E7A2F1271.title": "Reforge a shield to Epic",
  "quest.7328E9C28FC876AE.title": "Shield affixes",
  "quest.7328E9C28FC876AE.quest_subtitle": "The best defence has opinions.",
  "quest.7328E9C28FC876AE.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"What a shield can roll.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"Stats: armor, toughness, knockback resistance.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"On block: Resistance, or Poison, Bleeding and Wither on the attacker.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\"From Epic: \"},{\"text\":\"Catalyzing\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" (blasts give Strength), \"},{\"text\":\"Psychic\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\" (arrows hit back), \"},{\"text\":\"Retreating\",\"color\":\"#FF8A3D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3A021452CACB4FC1.title": "Light the campfire",
  "quest.3A021452CACB4FC1.quest_subtitle": "Every climb starts warm.",
  "quest.3A021452CACB4FC1.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Somebody has to warm up the cabin before the climb.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: only embers."
  ],
  "quest.2AA93D8DDDA71D00.title": "Call the lightning",
  "quest.2AA93D8DDDA71D00.quest_subtitle": "Where the lightning lives.",
  "quest.2AA93D8DDDA71D00.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Up here the storm answers to a copper rod.\"}]",
    "",
    "No reward: a flash."
  ],
