  "chapter.523A3AABA8EB23F1.title": "Mystical Agriculture · Essence",
  "chapter.523A3AABA8EB23F1.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Five furrows, one per tier: inferium in the first, diamonds in the last."
  ],
  "quest.252518C96A668BF4.title": "First essence",
  "quest.252518C96A668BF4.quest_subtitle": "Every mob pays a tithe, sometimes.",
  "quest.252518C96A668BF4.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight \"},{\"text\":\"Inferium Essence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:inferium_essence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" buy your first seeds.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Most mobs drop one in \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" kills.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Inferium Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:inferium_ore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\", from Y \"},{\"text\":\"-32\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\", breaks into \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\", more with Fortune.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1E897EF672669A87.title": "The other half",
  "quest.1E897EF672669A87.quest_desc": [
    "Prosperity turns plain things magical: seed bases, crystals, ingots and gems.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Prosperity Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:prosperity_ore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" sits deeper, from Y \"},{\"text\":\"-60\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"24\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Each ore breaks into \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Prosperity Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:prosperity_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.39DA614DB7567591.title": "Eight pedestals and a wand",
  "quest.39DA614DB7567591.quest_subtitle": "Seed crafting, now in 3D.",
  "quest.39DA614DB7567591.quest_desc": [
    "Every seed is crafted here: eight items around, one in the middle.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Gold, red wool and stone make the \"},{\"text\":\"Infusion Altar\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:infusion_altar\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and its \"},{\"text\":\"Infusion Pedestals\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:infusion_pedestal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "• Placed, the altar shows where the pedestals go.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Load them, set the centre item, tap the altar with a \"},{\"text\":\"Wand\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:wand\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Pedestals stand \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" blocks out on each side and \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" out on each diagonal.\"}]",
    "",
    "• The wand is an inferium essence, a stick and a stone."
  ],
  "quest.054EA259896B2E80.title": "The heart of every seed",
  "quest.054EA259896B2E80.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Every resource seed grows from a \"},{\"text\":\"Prosperity Seed Base\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:prosperity_seed_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Recipe: \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Prosperity Shards\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:prosperity_shard\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" around a wheat seed.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• It goes on the altar; the pedestals take \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" of the material and \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" essences of the seed's tier.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.32EDEE6F83B92F5E.title": "Every seed pays the next",
  "quest.32EDEE6F83B92F5E.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Every seed pays for the heart of the next: a \"},{\"text\":\"Prosperity Seed Base\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:prosperity_seed_base\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "• From tier 2 up, a random seed from the tier below comes along.",
    "",
    "• Plant a whole bed and harvest it: pick a bonus."
  ],
  "quest.6C7A05FE816F93CF.title": "What this pack changes",
  "quest.6C7A05FE816F93CF.quest_desc": [
    "No seed here is gated: every recipe is the mod's own.",
    "",
    "• The Altar of Growth speeds mystical crops up but never multiplies their essence.",
    "",
    "• Mekanism More Machine's planting recipes for these seeds are removed."
  ],
  "quest.3964CD9DEA254664.title": "The manual in the box",
  "quest.3964CD9DEA254664.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Book\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:book\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" and one \"},{\"text\":\"Inferium Essence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:inferium_essence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" make the mod's own guide.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Every block, machine and augment, each with its recipe."
  ],
  "quest.196AA88954C3825D.title": "A wand that never gets lost",
  "quest.196AA88954C3825D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A redstone pulse starts the altar just like the wand.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• The craft finishes \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" seconds later.\"}]",
    "",
    "• A button on a block beside it saves hunting for the wand."
  ],
  "quest.20BEA5C813745DD5.title": "Bees with essence",
  "quest.20BEA5C813745DD5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Productive Bees\",\"color\":\"#9DC3FF\",\"underlined\":true,\"clickEvent\":{\"action\":\"change_page\",\"value\":\"07E7E98882856A70\"}},{\"text\":\" keeps essence bees too.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• An Inferium Bee's combs spin into \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" inferium in a centrifuge.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Every tier above has a bee of its own."
  ],
  "quest.1C930EDE6CE6C782.title": "Essence, gift-wrapped",
  "quest.1C930EDE6CE6C782.quest_subtitle": "Some people open presents very carefully.",
  "quest.1C930EDE6CE6C782.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Silk Touch keeps \"},{\"text\":\"Inferium Ore\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:inferium_ore\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" whole.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• A furnace turns it into \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" essence.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• A pickaxe would have given \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" to \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.68406D1347A52E09.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.7FF967D445354074.title": "Ingots and gems of luck",
  "quest.7FF967D445354074.quest_desc": [
    "Prosperity metal becomes each tier's ingot and gemstone.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Four shards around an iron ingot: a \"},{\"text\":\"Prosperity Ingot\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:prosperity_ingot\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Around a diamond: a \"},{\"text\":\"Prosperity Gemstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:prosperity_gemstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "• Add two essences of a tier: that tier's ingot or gemstone."
  ],
  "quest.375DF0A306B9F117.title": "Growth from below",
  "quest.375DF0A306B9F117.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Inferium Growth Accelerators\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:inferium_growth_accelerator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" push the plant above them.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Stacked under the farmland, each gives a growth tick every \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" seconds.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• An inferium one reaches \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" blocks up.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Recipe: \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" inferium, \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" stone and an inferium gemstone, for \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Each tier reaches \"},{\"text\":\"9\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" blocks further, up to \"},{\"text\":\"54\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" for awakened supremium.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Tiers mix freely while the plant is in range."
  ],
  "quest.1D2D61B587E78473.title": "Rain on demand",
  "quest.1D2D61B587E78473.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Watering Can\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:watering_can\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" waters a \"},{\"text\":\"3×3\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" patch.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Recipe: bone meal, a bowl and iron.",
    "",
    "• Fill it at water and hold use over the crops.",
    "",
    "• About one pass in four gives each plant a growth tick."
  ],
  "quest.23DF24ADBE2C616D.title": "Cans that water themselves",
  "quest.23DF24ADBE2C616D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"An \"},{\"text\":\"Inferium Watering Can\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:inferium_watering_can\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" waters on its own.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Recipe: the can, \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" inferium ingots and \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Mystical Fertilizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:mystical_fertilizer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" and press \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.use\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" at the sky to switch it on.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Each tier adds \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" blocks of reach and \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" points of chance.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Up to \"},{\"text\":\"13×13\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" at \"},{\"text\":\"50%\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" for awakened supremium.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.77B51CA6FFAB161D.title": "Reap, don't uproot",
  "quest.77B51CA6FFAB161D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Scythe\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:diamond_scythe\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" harvests every ripe crop in reach and leaves the plants.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• The \"},{\"text\":\"Diamond Sickle\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:diamond_sickle\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" clears plants in an area.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Both are diamonds and sticks.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "• Essence tiers widen both; the scythe also hits everything around its target."
  ],
  "quest.674A789E0DCB9989.title": "Instant harvest",
  "quest.674A789E0DCB9989.quest_subtitle": "Bone meal with a doctorate.",
  "quest.674A789E0DCB9989.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"One \"},{\"text\":\"Mystical Fertilizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:mystical_fertilizer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" grows any crop to full at once.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Resource crops included, where bone meal fails.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Recipe: bone meal, inferium and a diamond, for \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.50AF43A699D462B3.title": "Leftover magic",
  "quest.50AF43A699D462B3.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Resource crops drop \"},{\"text\":\"Fertilized Essence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:fertilized_essence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"10%\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" of the time; inferium never does.\"}]",
    "",
    "• It is bone meal that mystical crops accept.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Four of it in the fertilizer recipe make \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" instead of \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.54D72FA681247A52.title": "Seeds that grow essence",
  "quest.54D72FA681247A52.quest_subtitle": "Magic, in rows.",
  "quest.54D72FA681247A52.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Inferium Seeds\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:inferium_seeds\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" grow the essence everything else costs.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Recipe: \"},{\"text\":\"8\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" inferium around a wheat seed.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Each harvest gives \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" essence and the seed back.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Bone meal does nothing to them; \"},{\"text\":\"Mystical Fertilizer\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:mystical_fertilizer\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" does.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.5411392CCA652CA0.title": "Seasoned soil",
  "quest.5411392CCA652CA0.quest_desc": [
    "Right-click farmland with an essence and it turns into that tier's farmland.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• First up: \"},{\"text\":\"Inferium Farmland\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:inferium_farmland\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "• A hoe, the essence and dirt in the grid work too.",
    "",
    "• Only essence farmland gives crops a shot at a second seed."
  ],
  "quest.14D697C4BADC2CCB.title": "Twice lucky",
  "quest.14D697C4BADC2CCB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"On any essence farmland a resource crop has \"},{\"text\":\"10%\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" odds of a second seed.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Rolled apart, \"},{\"text\":\"10%\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" of a second essence.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• On the farmland of its own tier, both rise to \"},{\"text\":\"20%\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.1C8DB440E19666FE.title": "Better dirt, bigger harvest",
  "quest.1C8DB440E19666FE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Inferium's essence grows with the soil.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" on plain or inferium farmland, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" on tertium, \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" on supremium.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Prudentium and imperium add a coin flip for one more."
  ],
  "quest.5805DD7AA45FBD28.title": "A crystal that climbs",
  "quest.5805DD7AA45FBD28.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Infusion Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:infusion_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" turns \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" essences of a tier into \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" of the next.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Recipe: a diamond, \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" prosperity shards and \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" inferium.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• It lasts \"},{\"text\":\"1000\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" crafts.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Going down is free: one essence breaks into four of the tier below."
  ],
  "quest.1A7EAFC13E0A2D23.title": "Tier 2: prudentium",
  "quest.1A7EAFC13E0A2D23.quest_subtitle": "Every tier costs four of the last.",
  "quest.1A7EAFC13E0A2D23.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four inferium around the crystal make one \"},{\"text\":\"Prudentium Essence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:prudentium_essence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Right-click farmland with it: \"},{\"text\":\"Prudentium Farmland\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:prudentium_farmland\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Tier-2 seeds take \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" prudentium on the pedestals.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3396B56D9BDA9984.title": "Tier 3: tertium",
  "quest.3396B56D9BDA9984.quest_subtitle": "Where iron starts to grow.",
  "quest.3396B56D9BDA9984.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four prudentium make one \"},{\"text\":\"Tertium Essence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:tertium_essence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" inferium deep.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Tertium Farmland\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:tertium_farmland\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" feeds tier-3 crops.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Inferium planted on it yields \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" essences a harvest.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6C25629BBF18E209.title": "Tier 4: imperium",
  "quest.6C25629BBF18E209.quest_subtitle": "Sixty-four inferium in a trench coat.",
  "quest.6C25629BBF18E209.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four tertium make one \"},{\"text\":\"Imperium Essence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:imperium_essence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" inferium all told.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Imperium Farmland\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:imperium_farmland\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" suits gold, lapis, the End and most mod alloys.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.6FA2E55C53DD1300.title": "Tier 5: supremium",
  "quest.6FA2E55C53DD1300.quest_subtitle": "The top of the ladder. Almost.",
  "quest.6FA2E55C53DD1300.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four imperium make one \"},{\"text\":\"Supremium Essence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:supremium_essence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"256\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" inferium in one orb.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Supremium Farmland\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:supremium_farmland\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is the best soil there is.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Inferium on it yields \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" essences a harvest.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.781B0C1FDB5C0F75.title": "The crystal that never cracks",
  "quest.781B0C1FDB5C0F75.quest_subtitle": "A thousand uses was never enough.",
  "quest.781B0C1FDB5C0F75.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Master Infusion Crystal\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:master_infusion_crystal\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" has no durability at all.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Recipe: \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" supremium, \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" prosperity shards and a \"},{\"text\":\"Supremium Gemstone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:supremium_gemstone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "• It also fuses four essence blocks into one block of the next tier."
  ],
  "quest.63564B04087489E5.title": "Prudentium for the common store",
  "quest.63564B04087489E5.quest_subtitle": "The nursery always wants more.",
  "quest.63564B04087489E5.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sixteen \"},{\"text\":\"Prudentium Essence\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:prudentium_essence\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• A propagation core takes \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"; every tier-2 seed, \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.4D89C1F862E1E19D.title": "Stones for Create",
  "quest.4D89C1F862E1E19D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Eight stone essences around one metal essence make \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" of Create's ore stones.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Iron: \"},{\"text\":\"Crimsite\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:crimsite\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Zinc: \"},{\"text\":\"Asurine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:asurine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Copper: \"},{\"text\":\"Veridium\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:veridium\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\". Gold: \"},{\"text\":\"Ochrum\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"create:ochrum\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.799AA5FC36204439.title": "Catalysts, homegrown",
  "quest.799AA5FC36204439.quest_subtitle": "No Warden was harmed.",
  "quest.799AA5FC36204439.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Eight sculk essences make \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Sculk Catalysts\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:sculk_catalyst\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Seven make \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" sensors or \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" shriekers.\"}]"
  ],
  "reward.0522AC6F7723E0DF.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.086F18090F222536.title": "Stone",
  "quest.086F18090F222536.quest_subtitle": "Quarrying, but seasonal.",
  "quest.086F18090F222536.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"8\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" essences give \"},{\"text\":\"24\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" \"},{\"text\":\"Cobblestone\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:cobblestone\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
