  "chapter.5A4360D7A7F20D68.title": "Immersive Aircraft",
  "chapter.5A4360D7A7F20D68.chapter_subtitle": [
    "Seven aircraft from a handful of parts: airships, biplanes, a copter you pedal; engines, upgrades, weapons and fuel."
  ],
  "quest.3C52109D4DAAB402.title": "Hulls",
  "quest.3C52109D4DAAB402.quest_subtitle": "Logs and iron. The flying comes later.",
  "quest.3C52109D4DAAB402.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Hull\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:hull\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is the frame of almost every aircraft.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Six logs and three iron ingots.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Airship \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\", biplane \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\", warship \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" more.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Everything here is crafted on a crafting table."
  ],
  "quest.72B3D7A1DFB7E1AB.title": "Canvas",
  "quest.72B3D7A1DFB7E1AB.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Sails\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:sail\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" are the airship's envelope: it wants \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "• Six white carpets and three string.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Planes fly on a \"},{\"text\":\"Propeller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:propeller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": five iron ingots bent into shape.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0C9B6B3192A484AE.title": "A copper heart",
  "quest.0C9B6B3192A484AE.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Boiler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:boiler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" goes into every Engine.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Seven copper ingots around a furnace.",
    "",
    "• In flight, the fuel slot is the boiler: it burns what a furnace burns."
  ],
  "quest.19E92EE086F5C840.title": "The engine room",
  "quest.19E92EE086F5C840.quest_subtitle": "One regulator, seven aircraft.",
  "quest.19E92EE086F5C840.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Engine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:engine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" drives the airship, the biplane and the quadrocopter.\"}]",
    "",
    "• A Boiler, two pistons, a blast furnace and cobblestone.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"In this pack\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" a \"},{\"text\":\"Power Regulator\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"entrelumen:power_regulator\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from act III takes the top stone.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The warship takes two, and the bamboo hopper one more on top of its biplanes.",
    "",
    "The gyrodyne needs none."
  ],
  "quest.41571E5944B41C5F.title": "Slow and forgiving",
  "quest.41571E5944B41C5F.quest_subtitle": "The best first flight.",
  "quest.41571E5944B41C5F.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Airship\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:airship\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" rises and sinks straight, and hangs still in the air.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Six sails, two hulls and an Engine.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" cargo slots, \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" upgrades, a weapon, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" seats.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Right-click the ground with the item to set it down; it needs room to unfold."
  ],
  "quest.0527BDAA90FDB0EC.title": "Moving day",
  "quest.0527BDAA90FDB0EC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Cargo Airship\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:cargo_airship\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" carries a whole storage room.\"}]",
    "",
    "• An Airship, four chests and a hull.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Four side crates add \"},{\"text\":\"64\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" slots: \"},{\"text\":\"80\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" in all.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• No weapon, \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" upgrades, and \"},{\"text\":\"25%\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" more fuel.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.0337268EBFD86CD7.title": "Flying fortress",
  "quest.0337268EBFD86CD7.quest_subtitle": "Three boilers, zero subtlety.",
  "quest.0337268EBFD86CD7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Warship\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:warship\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is the biggest thing in the sky.\"}]",
    "",
    "• A Cargo Airship, two engines, three hulls, two sails and industrial gears.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"3×\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" durability, \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" upgrades, \"},{\"text\":\"66\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" cargo slots, \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" seats.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• One weapon slot arms \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" side mounts, the other \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" in front.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Feed all three boilers: it only runs at full power when every one burns.",
    "",
    "Fit a gyroscope and a hull reinforcement before you go looking for trouble."
  ],
  "quest.20D18291E169CAA8.title": "Needs a runway",
  "quest.20D18291E169CAA8.quest_subtitle": "Fast, loud and in a hurry.",
  "quest.20D18291E169CAA8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Biplane\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:biplane\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" is the fast one.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Three hulls, an Engine and a Propeller.",
    "",
    "• Taxi on flat ground until it's fast, then pull back to climb.",
    "",
    "• Land the same way: long, flat and slow.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" upgrades, a weapon, a rocket slot, \"},{\"text\":\"16\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" cargo slots and \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" seat.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"It burns \"},{\"text\":\"25%\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" more fuel than the airship.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3E5E43E5ED1910A7.title": "Seaplane",
  "quest.3E5E43E5ED1910A7.quest_subtitle": "The game says Bamboo Hopper. It's a seaplane.",
  "quest.3E5E43E5ED1910A7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Bamboo Hopper\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:bamboo_hopper\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" lands on water: it has pontoons.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Two Biplanes, a hull, an Engine and five bamboo blocks.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" seats, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" weapon slots, \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" upgrades and a rocket slot.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"50%\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" more fuel than the airship.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.34311711D79C123C.title": "Rocket boost",
  "quest.34311711D79C123C.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Firework Rockets\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:firework_rocket\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" give a push in flight.\"}]",
    "",
    "• They go in the rocket slot of the biplane, the bamboo hopper and the warship.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.immersive_aircraft.boost\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" burns one for a push forward.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Longer-flight rockets push for longer."
  ],
  "quest.4A7E00C064077EA8.title": "Pedal power",
  "quest.4A7E00C064077EA8.quest_subtitle": "Leg day, airborne.",
  "quest.4A7E00C064077EA8.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"No engine: the \"},{\"text\":\"Gyrodyne\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:gyrodyne\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" flies on your hunger.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Hold \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.forward\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" on the ground until the rotor reaches takeoff speed.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Eat before a trip: with too little food it won't fly.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"In this pack\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" a \"},{\"text\":\"Reinforced Alloy\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mekanism:alloy_reinforced\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" from act III takes the lower sail's place.\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.3645241838AF3C28.title": "Builder's drone",
  "quest.3645241838AF3C28.quest_subtitle": "Four rotors and some bamboo.",
  "quest.3645241838AF3C28.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"The \"},{\"text\":\"Quadrocopter\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:quadrocopter\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" hovers still and barely feels the wind.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Four propellers, four bamboo and an Engine.",
    "",
    "• Half an airship's fuel: made for building up high.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"6\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" cargo slots, \"},{\"text\":\"1\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" upgrade, a weapon.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.53FAC36CBE5F2E6D.title": "A power upgrade",
  "quest.0827E6F45D206DF5.title": "More power",
  "quest.0827E6F45D206DF5.quest_desc": [
    "Upgrade slots take parts that change the numbers.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Sturdy Pipes\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:sturdy_pipes\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"+10%\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" power.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Steel Boiler\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:steel_boiler\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"+25%\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" power, \"},{\"text\":\"+50%\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" fuel.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Nether Engine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:nether_engine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"+40%\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" power, \"},{\"text\":\"+30%\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" fuel.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The Nether Engine costs a netherite ingot. Each upgrade's tooltip lists its numbers."
  ],
  "task.3E29734F1EEC784B.title": "A fuel-saving upgrade",
  "quest.465D7CC46CB5773E.title": "Less fuel",
  "quest.465D7CC46CB5773E.quest_desc": [
    "Two parts stretch every load of fuel.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Industrial Gears\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:industrial_gears\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"-20%\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" fuel.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Eco Engine\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:eco_engine\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"-75%\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" fuel, \"},{\"text\":\"-20%\",\"color\":\"#FF8C7A\"},{\"text\":\" power.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "The gears also go into the Warship and the Rotary Cannon."
  ],
  "task.0039D7EB1103FA32.title": "Any gyroscope",
  "quest.3591550FEC33CF17.title": "Steady in the wind",
  "quest.3591550FEC33CF17.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Wind shoves aircraft around, \"},{\"text\":\"3×\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" harder in rain and storms.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• A \"},{\"text\":\"Gyroscope\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:gyroscope\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" cancels the wind and steadies the nose.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• The \"},{\"text\":\"Advanced Gyroscope\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:gyroscope_dials\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds a dial dashboard.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• The \"},{\"text\":\"Electronic Gyroscope\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:gyroscope_hud\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" adds a HUD.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.3B72EDDF9F7A7C16.title": "A frame upgrade",
  "quest.57284F9E1A7AD30B.title": "Tougher, quicker",
  "quest.57284F9E1A7AD30B.quest_desc": [
    "Three parts work on the frame.",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Hull Reinforcement\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:hull_reinforcement\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"+100%\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" durability.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Improved Landing Gear\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:improved_landing_gear\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"+50%\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" takeoff speed.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Enhanced Propeller\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:enhanced_propeller\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": \"},{\"text\":\"-75%\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" air friction.\"}]"
  ],
  "task.6F9D2B222A1E79B0.title": "Any aircraft weapon",
  "quest.5EB8D9EFE4993166.title": "Armament",
  "quest.5EB8D9EFE4993166.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"A weapon slot takes one of four, fired with \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.use\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Rotary Cannon\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:rotary_cannon\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a gunpowder, \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" shots.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Heavy Crossbow\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:heavy_crossbow\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": an arrow, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" bolts.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Bomb Bay\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:bomb_bay\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a TNT, \"},{\"text\":\"5\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" bombs.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"Telescope\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:telescope\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\": a spyglass that rides along.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Ammo comes from the aircraft's own cargo, and by default no weapon breaks blocks."
  ],
  "task.4938DB30A1E028F2.title": "Any banner",
  "quest.0BCE346C918C34C3.title": "Colours and flags",
  "quest.0BCE346C918C34C3.quest_desc": [
    "Airships, cargo airships and biplanes fly a banner from their banner slot.",
    "",
    "• Airships, cargo airships and warships take a dye in their dye slot.",
    "",
    "• Painted or not, it flies the same."
  ],
  "quest.64316D614B1F2430.title": "Stick and throttle",
  "quest.64316D614B1F2430.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Flying uses your movement keys.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.forward\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" / \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.back\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\": nose down or up; on airships, ahead or back.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.jump\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" / \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.sneak\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\": throttle on planes; climb or sink on airships.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.left\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" / \"},{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.right\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\": turn.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"\",\"extra\":[{\"text\":\"[\"},{\"keybind\":\"key.immersive_aircraft.dismount\"},{\"text\":\"]\"}],\"color\":\"#F2D060\"},{\"text\":\" gets you out; in the air, press it twice to jump.\"}]",
    "",
    "Inside, the camera switches to third person by default."
  ],
  "quest.70D6B624DE07D0C7.title": "What the boiler eats",
  "quest.70D6B624DE07D0C7.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Anything a furnace burns is fuel, and \"},{\"text\":\"Blaze Powder\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"minecraft:blaze_powder\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" too.\"}]",
    "",
    "• The gauge over the hotbar shows the engine.",
    "",
    "• Running low cuts power and brings a warning; with none, the engine stops.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Fuel use by aircraft:",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Quadrocopter \"},{\"text\":\"×0.5\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\", warship \"},{\"text\":\"×0.8\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Airship \"},{\"text\":\"×1\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\"; biplane and cargo airship \"},{\"text\":\"×1.25\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Bamboo hopper \"},{\"text\":\"×1.5\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]"
  ],
  "quest.767DAAD2F5180B35.title": "Patch it before you fly",
  "quest.767DAAD2F5180B35.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"A damaged aircraft won't let you in: right-clicks patch it first.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Each click repairs a little and makes you hungry.",
    "",
    "• Crashes explode without breaking blocks or starting fires, and they can't kill you.",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Break an aircraft and it comes back as an item with its upgrades inside; its cargo drops."
  ],
  "quest.7D5EC275B5E31E21.title": "Air taxi",
  "quest.7D5EC275B5E31E21.quest_subtitle": "Mind the villager.",
  "quest.7D5EC275B5E31E21.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"» \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\"},{\"text\":\"Pro tip: \",\"color\":\"#E8B04A\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Mobs climb aboard as they would into a boat; water animals don't.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Seats: airship and gyrodyne \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\", bamboo hopper \"},{\"text\":\"3\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\", warship \"},{\"text\":\"4\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "• Other players board with a right-click."
  ],
  "task.3679AF83F7C463AC.title": "Crash an aircraft",
  "quest.75E0C58838022533.title": "Hard landing",
  "quest.75E0C58838022533.quest_subtitle": "Any landing you walk away from counts.",
  "quest.75E0C58838022533.quest_desc": [
    "Your first wreck, on the record: your statistics count every crash.",
    "",
    "• Here crashes break no blocks and can't kill you."
  ],
  "reward.1B00FB101C474FC3.title": "Secret found",
  "task.2B57B8D29D7CB9E3.title": "Fly 10 km at the controls",
  "quest.09FFA410BF61BB58.title": "Frequent flyer",
  "quest.09FFA410BF61BB58.quest_subtitle": "Ten thousand blocks of sky.",
  "quest.09FFA410BF61BB58.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"10 km\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"},{\"text\":\" flown at the controls: your statistics keep every metre.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Time aboard and fuel burned are counted too."
  ],
  "reward.6E0114AF2F22E451.title": "Secret found",
  "quest.33F7B45027222879.title": "Spare hulls",
  "quest.33F7B45027222879.quest_subtitle": "The hangar always wants more.",
  "quest.33F7B45027222879.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Four \"},{\"text\":\"Hulls\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"immersive_aircraft:hull\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" for the common store, once a day.\"}]",
    "",
    "• Six logs and three iron each."
  ],
  "image.46A212376B6193C4.title": "Airship",
  "image.0EF0C5FA15D17974.title": "Cargo Airship",
  "image.5C3E88E48359C460.title": "Warship",
  "image.7C391BA365645E68.title": "Biplane",
  "image.49D510D9426E7488.title": "Bamboo Hopper",
  "image.515FBD367802D773.title": "Quadrocopter",
  "image.3B13141BD706F9A6.title": "Gyrodyne",
  "image.49F06E1C47332DBA.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Engine room\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"}]",
  "image.01C35E0FF73B4D05.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Handling\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"}]",
  "image.6BA085208A7DD1E2.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Weapons and colours\",\"color\":\"#F29E6D\"}]",
  "image.294EDDA6FF0CCE8F.title": "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Immersive Aircraft\",\"color\":\"#F5E6D3\",\"bold\":true}]",
  "image.5324EBD4B6BE9EAD.title": "Back to the Sun of Heliodor",
  "chapter.57BDDE750ECDEFA3.title": "Mystical Agriculture · Greenhouse",
  "chapter.57BDDE750ECDEFA3.chapter_subtitle": [
    "The other mods' crops in raised beds, and the machines that reap them."
  ],
  "quest.5023171132D78E9D.title": "One frame, five machines",
  "quest.5023171132D78E9D.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Five Mystical Agriculture machines are built on a \"},{\"text\":\"Machine Frame\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:machine_frame\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\".\"}]",
    "",
    "• Recipe: iron, redstone and stone.",
    "",
    "• Furnace, harvester, seed reprocessor, soul extractor and soulium spawner.",
    "",
    "• All five burn solid fuel."
  ],
  "quest.4AF7DF1AD20071DC.title": "A farmhand that never sleeps",
  "quest.4AF7DF1AD20071DC.quest_subtitle": "Replants, too. Unlike some people.",
  "quest.4AF7DF1AD20071DC.quest_desc": [
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"Facing a field, the \"},{\"text\":\"Harvester\",\"color\":\"#8FD6C8\",\"hoverEvent\":{\"action\":\"show_item\",\"contents\":{\"id\":\"mysticalagriculture:harvester\",\"count\":1}}},{\"text\":\" picks ripe crops and replants them.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• Recipe: \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" diamond scythes, \"},{\"text\":\"2\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" soulium ingots, iron and a frame.\"}]",
    "",
    "• It keeps the harvest inside; redstone pauses it.",
