    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• One seed every \"},{\"text\":\"10\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\" seconds, faster with upgrades.\"}]",
    "",
    "• The second seeds from essence farmland finally have a use."
  ],
  "quest.4321C26C27515858.title": "Faster machines",
  "quest.4321C26C27515858.quest_desc": [
    "Machine upgrades speed up all five frame machines.",
