  ],
  "task.0852A417C8EA3F8B.title": "Look at a Neon Cuckoo Bee",
  "quest.36DC5DA8B9A23F35.title": "Neon Cuckoo Bee",
  "quest.36DC5DA8B9A23F35.quest_subtitle": "Squatter in residence.",
  "quest.36DC5DA8B9A23F35.quest_desc": [
    "[{\"text\":\"\",\"bold\":true},{\"text\":\"Lays its eggs in Blue Banded nests: watch those for a second bee coming out.\"}]",
    "",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FFD84A\"},{\"text\":\"Parent of iridium, menril, osmium and Pepto Beesmol.\"}]",
    "[\"\",{\"text\":\"• \",\"color\":\"#FFD84A\"},{\"text\":\"Gift:\",\"color\":\"#9BE08A\"},{\"text\":\" a second one, so you can breed a pair.\"}]",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "A nest gives up two cuckoos at most before it stops."
  ],
  "task.59581865508E8A0D.title": "Look at a Nomad Bee",
